      "key_products": "Directed Energy Systems, F-35 Lightning II, Precision Strike Missile, Aegis Combat System, Hypersonic Solutions",
      "polished_summary": "Lockheed Martin Corporation is a leading aerospace and defense company that provides innovative solutions to address the world's most challenging security needs. Its core products include advanced military aircraft like the F-35 Lightning II, precision missile systems such as the Precision Strike Missile, and naval systems like the Aegis Combat System, all designed for the military forces of the United States and allied nations. With a focus on aerospace, defense, cybersecurity, intelligence, and space, Lockheed Martin is committed to delivering cutting-edge technology and capabilities to enhance national security.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Lockheed Martin Corporation is a leading aerospace and defense company that manufactures advanced military systems, including directed energy systems, which are directly relevant to the high energy laser market. Their focus on innovative defense technologies aligns with the requirements of this market.",
