      "polished_summary": "BAE Systems plc is a global defense, security, and aerospace company that provides advanced technology solutions to government and commercial customers. The company specializes in delivering a wide range of products and services, including military hardware, cybersecurity, and intelligence systems, aimed at enhancing national security and operational effectiveness in various markets. With a commitment to innovation and excellence, BAE Systems plays a crucial role in supporting defense forces and safeguarding critical infrastructure worldwide.",
