        "crawl_text": "California [ Home ][1]\nProducts\n[ Linear UV Laser Marking System ][2]\n[ Class 1 UV Laser Marking System ][3]\n[ PrecisionFLEX Workstation ][4]\n[ Samurai UV Marking System ][5]\n[ Series 3500 UV Laser System ][6]\nApplications\n[ Laser Marking ][7]\n[ Laser Cleaning & Texuring ][8]\n[ Laser Drilling ][9]\n[ STEREOLITHOGRAPHY ][10]\n[ ITO REMOVAL ][11]\n[ Direct Write/Repair ][12]\n[ Molecular Uncaging ][13]\n[ Spectroscopy ][14]\n[ Flow Cytometry ][15]\n[ Gene Tagging ][16]\n[ Application Notes ][17]\n[ Videos ][18]\nSupport\n[ Careers ][19]\n[ FAQ ][20]\n[ Warranty ][21]\n[ Field Service ][22]\n[ Distributors ][23]\n[ Downloads ][24]\nCompany\n[ News ][25]\n[ Our History ][26]\n[ Blog ][27]\n[ Events ][28]\n[ Contact us ][29]\n\n# [[DPSS Lasers, Inc.]][30]\n\n[ Home ][31]\nProducts\n[ Linear UV Laser Marking System ][32]\n[ Class 1 UV Laser Marking System ][33]\n[ PrecisionFLEX Workstation ][34]\n[ Samurai UV Marking System ][35]\n[ Series 3500 UV Laser System ][36]\nApplications\n[ Laser Marking ][37]\n[ Laser Cleaning & Texuring ][38]\n[ Laser Drilling ][39]\n[ STEREOLITHOGRAPHY ][40]\n[ ITO REMOVAL ][41]\n[ Direct Write/Repair ][42]\n[ Molecular Uncaging ][43]\n[ Spectroscopy ][44]\n[ Flow Cytometry ][45]\n[ Gene Tagging ][46]\n[ Application Notes ][47]\n[ Videos ][48]\nSupport\n[ Careers ][49]\n[ FAQ ][50]\n[ Warranty ][51]\n[ Field Service ][52]\n[ Distributors ][53]\n[ Downloads ][54]\nCompany\n[ News ][55]\n[ Our History ][56]\n[ Blog ][57]\n[ Events ][58]\n[ Contact us ][59]\n\n**High-Power UV Lasers for Precision Industrial Manufacturing**\n\n[See Our Products][60]\n\n## **Manufacturer of UV Laser Systems and UV Lasers**\n\nDPSS Lasers, Inc., a Laserax Company, is a leader in high-power UV diode-pumped solid-state laser\nsolutions engineered for precision, speed, and reliability. Based in California, we empower medical,\npackaging, semiconductor and other advanced manufacturing industries with cutting-edge\nmarking/coding, surface