and micromachining technologies.\n\n### Trusted By\n\n[Picture33.jpg]\n[Picture32.png]\n[Picture31.png]\n[Picture30.png]\n[Picture29.png]\n[Picture28.png]\n[Picture27.png]\n[Picture26.gif]\n[Picture25.png]\n[Picture23.jpg]\n[Picture20.png]\n[Picture39.png]\n[Picture38.png]\n[Picture37.png]\n[Picture36.png]\n[Picture34.png]\n[Picture41.png]\n[Picture40.png]\n[Picture43.png]\n[Picture42.png]\n\n## **Our laser Applications**\n\n## [**OUR PRODUCTS**][61]\n\n[\n][62]\n\nFind out about our full range of products.\n\n[View Products \u2192][63]\n\n## [**UPCOMING EVENTS**][64]\n\n[\n][65]\n\nCome meet us and talk to us about our products and offerings.\n\n[View Events \u2192][66]\n\n[\n][67]\n\n2525 Walsh Ave., Santa Clara, CA 95051\n(408) 988-4300\u00a0 \u00a0\n\u00a9 2026 DPSS Lasers Inc.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /linear-uv-laser-marking-system\n[3]: /class-1-uv-laser-marking-system\n[4]: /precisionflex-worksation\n[5]: /products/samurai\n[6]: /series-3500-uv-laser-system\n[7]: /marking\n[8]: /cleaningtexturing\n[9]: /laser-drilling\n[10]: /stereolithography\n[11]: /itoremoval\n[12]: /direct-writerepair\n[13]: /molecular-uncaging\n[14]: /spectroscopy\n[15]: /flow-cytometry\n[16]: /gene-tagging\n[17]: /application-notes\n[18]: /videos\n[19]: /careers\n[20]: /faq\n[21]: /warranty\n[22]: /fieldservice\n[23]: /distributors\n[24]: /downloads\n[25]: /news\n[26]: /our-history\n[27]: /blog\n[28]: /events\n[29]: /contact\n[30]: /\n[31]: /\n[32]: /linear-uv-laser-marking-system\n[33]: /class-1-uv-laser-marking-system\n[34]: /precisionflex-worksation\n[35]: /products/samurai\n[36]: /series-3500-uv-laser-system\n[37]: /marking\n[38]: /cleaningtexturing\n[39]: /laser-drilling\n[40]: /stereolithography\n[41]: /itoremoval\n[42]: /direct-writerepair\n[43]: /molecular-uncaging\n[44]: /spectroscopy\n[45]: /flow-cytometry\n[46]: /gene-tagging\n[47]: /application-notes\n[48]: /videos\n[49]: /careers\n[50]: /faq\n[51]: /warranty\n[52]: /fieldservice\n[53]: /distributors\n[54]: /downloads\n[55]: /news\n