      "company_summary": "Electro Optic Systems specializes in the design, manufacture, and export of advanced technology systems for over 40 years, with a strong focus on defense and space systems. Their core products include counter-drone systems, remote weapon systems, and optical tracking systems, catering primarily to military and defense organizations as well as space agencies and research institutions. With a commitment to protecting critical assets from the battlefield to orbit, EOS leverages cutting-edge technology to meet the evolving needs of its target markets.",
