        "crawl_text": "Electro Optic Systems Holdings Limited Listed company Australia USA Middle East Europe ISO9001:2015 AUS SPACE awards Winner Business of the year AUS SPACE awards Winner Defence Business of the year AUS SPACE awards 2026 Winner Executive of the year High Energy Laser Weapons AI-enabled command-and-control systems Optical tracking systems 40+ years of experience in defense and space technology Strong international presence Innovative product offerings ISO9001:2015 certification 1 Taubman Street, Symonston, ACT 2609, Australia 90 Sheppard Street, Hume, ACT 2620, Australia 69 Gracefield Road, Lower Hutt, Wellington 5010, New Zealand 2865 Wall Triana Hwy SW, Huntsville, Alabama 35824, USA Tawazun Industrial Park, Ajban, Abu Dhabi, U.A.E 54 Pandan Road, #03-00, Singapore 609292 Ulrichsberger Str. 17 94469, Deggendorf, Germany Einsteinlaan 28, 2289 CC Rijswijk, The Netherlands 45 all\u00e9e des Ormes, B\u00e2timent D, E Space Park, Mougins, Provence-Alpes-Cote d'Azur, 06250, France 1 Southampton Street, 8th Floor, London, United Kingdom, WC2R 0LR Australia New Zealand USA UAE Singapore Germany Netherlands France United Kingdom Australia USA Global EOS has secured a US$124m order for its Slinger Counter-Drone Remote Weapon System to be supplied to Generation 5 Holding L.L.C in the UAE. EOS Space Systems has received three awards at the 2026 Australian Space Awards. Completion of MARSS Acquisition New Counter-Drone Order (US$124m) and Middle East JV for Laser Weapons and RWS Expansion in NATO and Middle Eastern markets Development of advanced defense and space technologies Competition in the defense and aerospace sectors Regulatory compliance in international markets Growing demand for defense technology in the Middle East Expansion of space capabilities and services A leading provider of defense and space systems technology with a strong international presence. Increasing defense budgets globally Technological advancements in defense systems World-leading defence and space systems technology | EOS\n\nABOUT US\n\nBoard Of Directors\nExecutive Officers\nAffiliate Companies\nCorporate Governance\nWHAT WE DO\n\nDefence\n\nHigh Energy Laser Weapon\n\nApollo\nCounter-Drone Systems\n\nNiDAR CUAS\nSlinger\nInterceptor-MR\nFirepower Systems\n\nR400\nR500\nR600\nR800\nForce Protection Systems\n\nR150\nUGV Lethality Systems\nMarine Lethality Systems\nSpace\n\nOptical Tracking Systems\n\n1m Telescope\n2m Telescope\nIcestorm II Enclosure\nTempest Enclosure\nTyphoon Enclosure\nSpace Control\nSpace Domain Awareness\nSatellite Laser Ranging\nSpace Sustainability\nPrecision Optics\nWORK WITH US\nNEWS\nEVENTS\nINVESTOR\nCONTACT US Search Contact us\n\nSearch for:\n\nCompletion of MARSS Acquisition\nFind out More\n\nDefence\n\nSpace\n\nProtecting What Matters Most, From Battlefield to Orbit\nEOS has designed, manufactured and exported advanced technology systems for more than 40 years. Our product range covers remote weapon systems, high energy laser weapons, UAS interceptors and AI-enabled command-and-control for layered counter-drone capability, and ground-based space control capabilities for precision tracking, intelligence and deterrence.\n\nNEWS\n\n19 June 2026\n\nNew Counter-Drone Order (US$124m) and Middle East JV for Laser Weapons and RWS\n\nEOS has secured a US$124m (~A$175m) order for its Slinger Counter-Drone Remote Weapon System (\u201cRWS\u201d), to be supplied to Generation 5 Holding L.L.C (\u201cGen5\u201d). Gen5 is a 100% United Arab Emirates (\u201cUAE\u201d) owned provider of defence equipment, technology and services headquartered in Abu Dhabi in the UAE.\n\n18 June 2026\n\nEOS Space Systems recognised at the Australian Space Awards\n\nEOS Space Systems has received three awards at the 2026 Australian Space Awards, recognising the company's growth, leadership and contribution to Australia's space sector.\n\nView More News\n\nINVESTORS\nAccess key financial information and resources for shareholders. Stay updated with our latest financial reports, news releases, and investor presentations. Find out More\n\nQUICK LINKS\n2025 Annual Report\n\n2025 AGM: CEO Presentation\n\n2025 Investor Day Presentation\n\nEOS CUAS strategy and vision\n\nWORK WITH US\nAre you looking for a career that will challenge you, help you grow and give you a chance to work with unique, state-of-the-art technologies? If so, we want to hear from you! Our team come from a diverse range of disciplines and backgrounds and include engineers, scientists, technicians, project managers and administrative staff. Find out More\n\nOur company Investor Work with us News Events Corporate Governance\n\nOur subsidiaries MARSS EOS Defense Systems USA KiwiStar Optics\n\nHead office\n1 Taubman Street Symonston ACT 2609 Australia +61 2 6222 7900 Contact us\n\nFollow us\n\n\u00a9 Electro Optic Systems Privacy Policy Disclaimer [][1]\n[ABOUT US ][2]\n[Board Of Directors][3]\n[Executive Officers][4]\n[Affiliate Companies][5]\n[Corporate Governance][6]\n[WHAT WE DO ][7]\n[Defence][8]\n[High Energy Laser Weapon][9]\n[Apollo][10]\n[Counter-Drone Systems][11]\n[NiDAR CUAS][12]\n[Slinger][13]\n[Interceptor-MR][14]\n[Firepower Systems][15]\n[R400][16]\n[R500][17]\n[R600][18]\n[R800][19]\n[Force Protection Systems][20]\n[R150][21]\n[UGV Lethality Systems][22]\n[Marine Lethality Systems][23]\n[Space][24]\n[Optical Tracking Systems][25]\n[1m Telescope][26]\n[2m Telescope][27]\n[Icestorm II Enclosure][28]\n[Tempest Enclosure][29]\n[Typhoon Enclosure][30]\n[Space Control][31]\n[Space Domain Awareness][32]\n[Satellite Laser Ranging][33]\n[Space Sustainability][34]\n[Precision Optics][35]\n[WORK WITH US ][36]\n[NEWS][37]\n[EVENTS][38]\n[INVESTOR ][39]\n[CONTACT US ][40]\n[Search][41][Contact us][42]\nSearch for:\n\n# Completion of MARSS Acquisition\n\n[Find out More][43]\n\n### Defence\n\n][44][\n\n### Space\n\n][45]\n\n# Protecting What Matters Most, From Battlefield to Orbit\n\nEOS has designed, manufactured and exported advanced technology systems for more than 40 years. Our\nproduct range covers remote weapon systems, high energy laser weapons, UAS interceptors and\nAI-enabled command-and-control for layered counter-drone capability, and ground-based space control\ncapabilities for precision tracking, intelligence and deterrence.\n\n## NEWS\n\n19 June 2026\n\n### [New Counter-Drone Order (US$124m) and Middle East JV for Laser Weapons and RWS][46]\n\nEOS has secured a US$124m (~A$175m) order for its Slinger Counter-Drone Remote Weapon System\n(\u201cRWS\u201d), to be supplied to Generation 5 Holding L.L.C (\u201cGen5\u201d). Gen5 is a 100% United Arab Emirates\n(\u201cUAE\u201d) owned provider of defence equipment, technology and services headquartered in Abu Dhabi in\nthe UAE.\n\n18 June 2026\n\n### [EOS Space Systems recognised at the Australian Space Awards][47]\n\nEOS Space Systems has received three awards at the 2026 Australian Space Awards, recognising the\ncompany's growth, leadership and contribution to Australia's space sector.\n\n[View More News][48]\n\n## INVESTORS\n\nAccess key financial information and resources for shareholders. Stay updated with our latest\nfinancial reports, news releases, and investor presentations.\n[Find out More][49]\n\n## QUICK LINKS\n\n2025 Annual Report\n][50][\n2025 AGM: CEO Presentation\n][51][\n2025 Investor Day Presentation\n][52][\nEOS CUAS strategy and vision\n][53]\n\n## WORK WITH US\n\nAre you looking for a career that will challenge you, help you grow and give you a chance to work\nwith unique, state-of-the-art technologies? If so, we want to hear from you! Our team come from a\ndiverse range of disciplines and backgrounds and include engineers, scientists, technicians, project\nmanagers and administrative staff.\n[Find out More][54]\n[EOS employee looking through binoculars on the Tongo Testing Range]\n\n### Our company\n\n[Investor][55][Work with us][56][News][57][Events][58][Corporate Governance][59]\n\n### Our subsidiaries\n\n[MARSS][60][EOS Defense Systems USA][61][KiwiStar Optics][62]\n\n### Head office\n\n1 Taubman Street Symonston ACT 2609 Australia\n[+61 2 6222 7900][63][Contact us][64]\n\n### Follow us\n\n[][65][][66][][67]\n[AUS SPACE awards Winner Business of the year][AUS SPACE awards Winner Defence Business of the\nyear][AUS SPACE awards 2026 Winner Executive of the year]\n\u00a9 Electro Optic Systems\n[Privacy Policy ][68][Disclaimer ][69]\n\n[1]: https://eos-aus.com\n[2]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/board-of-directors/\n[4]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/executive-officers/\n[5]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/affiliate-companies/\n[6]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/corporate-governance/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/\n[9]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/high-energy-laser-weapon/\n[10]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/high-energy-laser-weapon/apollo/\n[11]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/\n[12]: https://marss.com\n[13]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/slinger/\n[14]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/interceptor-mr/\n[15]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/\n[16]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r400/\n[17]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r500/\n[18]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r600/\n[19]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r800/\n[20]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/force-protection-systems/\n[21]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/force-protection-systems/r150/\n[22]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/ugv-lethality-systems/\n[23]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/marine-lethality-systems/\n[24]: https://eos-aus.com/space/\n[25]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/\n[26]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/1m-telescope/\n[27]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/2m-telescope/\n[28]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/icestorm-ii-enclosure/\n[29]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/tempest-enclosure/\n[30]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/typhoon-enclosure/\n[31]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-control/\n[32]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-domain-awareness/\n[33]: https://eos-aus.com/space/satellite-laser-ranging/\n[34]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-sustainability/\n[35]: https://kiwistaroptics.com/\n[36]: https://eos-aus.com/work-with-us/\n[37]: https://eos-aus.com/news/\n[38]: https://eos-aus.com/events\n[39]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/\n[40]: https://eos-aus.com/contact-us/\n[41]: #\n[42]: #\n[43]: https://eos-aus.com/news/completion-of-marss-acquisition/\n[44]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/\n[45]: https://eos-aus.com/space/\n[46]: https://eos-aus.com/news/new-counter-drone-order-us124m-and-middle-east-jv-for-laser-weapons-a\nnd-rws/\n[47]: https://eos-aus.com/news/eos-space-systems-recognised-at-the-australian-space-awards/\n[48]: https://eos-aus.com/news/\n[49]: https://eos-aus.com/investor/\n[50]: https://res.cloudinary.com/investorhub/raw/upload/v1776387356/leaf-prod/236/documents/EOS_2025\n_Annual_Report_jbkfj5.pdf\n[51]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/announcements/6965065\n[52]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/announcements/6934579\n[53]: https://youtu.be/eZ06MsN4X40?si=F8SMGJe43IpDmLpU\n[54]: https://eos-aus.com/work-with-us/\n[55]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/\n[56]: https://eos-aus.com/work-with-us/\n[57]: https://eos-aus.com/news/\n[58]: https://eos-aus.com/events/\n[59]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/corporate-governance/\n[60]: https://marss.com/\n[61]: https://www.eosdsusa.com/\n[62]: https://kiwistaroptics.com/\n[63]: tel:+61%202%206222%207900\n[64]: https://eos-aus.com/contact-us/\n[65]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/electro-optic-systems-pty-limited/\n[66]: https://www.youtube.com/@Electro-Optic-Systems\n[67]: https://twitter.com/aussie_eos\n[68]: https://eos-aus.com/privacy-policy/\n[69]: https://eos-aus.com/disclaimer/ [][1]\n[ABOUT US ][2]\n[Board Of Directors][3]\n[Executive