            "text": "[][1]\n[ABOUT US ][2]\n[Board Of Directors][3]\n[Executive Officers][4]\n[Affiliate Companies][5]\n[Corporate Governance][6]\n[WHAT WE DO ][7]\n[Defence][8]\n[High Energy Laser Weapon][9]\n[Apollo][10]\n[Counter-Drone Systems][11]\n[NiDAR CUAS][12]\n[Slinger][13]\n[Interceptor-MR][14]\n[Firepower Systems][15]\n[R400][16]\n[R500][17]\n[R600][18]\n[R800][19]\n[Force Protection Systems][20]\n[R150][21]\n[UGV Lethality Systems][22]\n[Marine Lethality Systems][23]\n[Space][24]\n[Optical Tracking Systems][25]\n[1m Telescope][26]\n[2m Telescope][27]\n[Icestorm II Enclosure][28]\n[Tempest Enclosure][29]\n[Typhoon Enclosure][30]\n[Space Control][31]\n[Space Domain Awareness][32]\n[Satellite Laser Ranging][33]\n[Space Sustainability][34]\n[Precision Optics][35]\n[WORK WITH US ][36]\n[NEWS][37]\n[EVENTS][38]\n[INVESTOR ][39]\n[CONTACT US ][40]\n[Search][41][Contact us][42]\nSearch for:\n[Home][43]>[About us][44]>Corporate Governance\n\n# Corporate Governance\n\nElectro Optic Systems Holdings Limited and its board are committed to achieving and demonstrating\nthe highest standards of corporate governance. The board continues to review its corporate\ngovernance framework and practices to ensure they meet the interests of shareholders.\n\n[EOS Corporate Governance Statement][45]\n\n# Corporate governance policies\n\nAnti-Bribery and Anti-Corruption Policy\n][46][\nAudit and Risk Committee Charter\n][47][\nBoard Charter\n][48][\nCode of Conduct\n][49][\nContinuous Disclosure and Communication Policy\n][50][\nData Security and Data Governance Committee Charter\n][51][\nDirect Voting Regulations\n][52][\nDiversity Policy\n][53][\nElectro Optic Systems Holdings Limited Constitution\n][54][\nGlobal Fraud Policy\n][55][\nGlobal Security Policy\n][56]\nJoint Venture Oversight Committee Charter\n][57][\nModern Slavery Policy\n][58][\nModern Slavery Statement\n][59][\nNomination Committee Charter\n][60][\nOmnibus Equity Incentive Plan\n][61][\nPeople and Culture Committee Charter\n][62][\nRisk Management Policy\n][63][\nSecurities Trading Policy\n][64][\nTax Exempt Share Plan\n][65][\nWhistleblower Policy\n][66]\n\n# Health and Safety\n\nThrough leadership and individual commitment, EOS aims to ensure no person will suffer a serious\npreventable work-related injury or illness.\n\nEnsuring our people's safety is paramount. We manage risks by understanding and integrating them\ninto our practices. Identifying hazards, assessing risks, and promoting a secure work environment is\neveryone's responsibility. We support knowledge sharing, expect managers to mentor and develop their\nteams. Systems assess competence, monitor performance, and provide accessible learning opportunities\nfor staff.\n\n# Quality\n\nEOS\u2019 commitment to quality means we will consistently provide products and services that meet our\nclients\u2019 needs.\n\nWe prioritise client success by delivering excellent services and products. Feedback helps us\nmeasure success, while timely delivery, transparent communication, and skilled staffing are our\ncommitments. Our team is engaged in enhancing company performance, meeting objectives, and focusing\non contract adherence, schedules, communication, assurance, safety, and service improvement.\nISO9001:2015 certification demonstrates our commitment to quality.\n\n### Our company\n\n[Investor][67][Work with us][68][News][69][Events][70][Corporate Governance][71]\n\n### Our subsidiaries\n\n[MARSS][72][EOS Defense Systems USA][73][KiwiStar Optics][74]\n\n### Head office\n\n1 Taubman Street Symonston ACT 2609 Australia\n[+61 2 6222 7900][75][Contact us][76]\n\n### Follow us\n\n[][77][][78][][79]\n[AUS SPACE awards Winner Business of the year][AUS SPACE awards Winner Defence Business of the\nyear][AUS SPACE awards 2026 Winner Executive of the year]\n\u00a9 Electro Optic Systems\n[Privacy Policy ][80][Disclaimer ][81]\n\n[1]: https://eos-aus.com\n[2]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/board-of-directors/\n[4]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/executive-officers/\n[5]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/affiliate-companies/\n[6]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/corporate-governance/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/\n[9]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/high-energy-laser-weapon/\n[10]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/high-energy-laser-weapon/apollo/\n[11]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/\n[12]: https://marss.com\n[13]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/slinger/\n[14]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/interceptor-mr/\n[15]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/\n[16]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r400/\n[17]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r500/\n[18]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r600/\n[19]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r800/\n[20]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/force-protection-systems/\n[21]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/force-protection-systems/r150/\n[22]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/ugv-lethality-systems/\n[23]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/marine-lethality-systems/\n[24]: https://eos-aus.com/space/\n[25]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/\n[26]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/1m-telescope/\n[27]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/2m-telescope/\n[28]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/icestorm-ii-enclosure/\n[29]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/tempest-enclosure/\n[30]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/typhoon-enclosure/\n[31]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-control/\n[32]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-domain-awareness/\n[33]: https://eos-aus.com/space/satellite-laser-ranging/\n[34]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-sustainability/\n[35]: https://kiwistaroptics.com/\n[36]: https://eos-aus.com/work-with-us/\n[37]: https://eos-aus.com/news/\n[38]: https://eos-aus.com/events\n[39]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/\n[40]: https://eos-aus.com/contact-us/\n[41]: #\n[42]: #\n[43]: https://eos-aus.com\n[44]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/\n[45]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Corporate-Governance-Statement-2026-vF.pdf\n[46]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/EOS-Anti-Bribery-Anti-Corruption-Policy-v2.0.pd\n[47]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Audit-Risk-Committee-Charter-Approved-Dec-2024.\npdf\n[48]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Board-Charter-Approved-Dec-2024.pdf\n[49]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/EOS-Code-of-Conduct.pdf\n[50]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Continuous-Disclosure-And-Communication-Policy-\nApproved-Mar-2026.pdf\n[51]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Data-Security-Data-Governance-Committee-Charter\n-Approved-Dec-2024.pdf\n[52]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/EOS-Direct-Voting-Regulations_Approved-Dec-2024\n.pdf\n[53]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/EOS-Diversity-Policy.pdf\n[54]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Electro-Optic-Systems-Holdings-Limited-new-cons\ntitution-adopted-29-May-2020.pdf\n[55]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/EOS-Fraud-Policy-v2.0.pdf\n[56]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/EOS-Group-Security-Policy_v3_2024.pdf\n[57]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/EOS-Joint-Venture-Oversight-Committee-Charter_2\n026.pdf\n[58]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/EOS-Modern-Slavery-Policy.pdf\n[59]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/EOS-Modern-Slavery-Statement_2025_signed.pdf\n[60]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Nomination-Committee-Charter-Approved-Dec-24.pd\n[61]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/EOS-Omnibus-Equity-Incentive-Plan-Final.pdf\n[62]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/People-Culture-Committee-Charter-Approved-Dec-2\n024.pdf\n[63]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/EOS-Risk-Management-Policy_v4_2024.pdf\n[64]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/EOS-Securities-Trading-Policy_Sept-2025.pdf\n[65]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/EOS-Tax-Exempt-Share-Plan-2025.pdf\n[66]: https://eos-aus.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/EOS-Whistleblower-Policy-01012020-v2.0.pdf\n[67]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/\n[68]: https://eos-aus.com/work-with-us/\n[69]: https://eos-aus.com/news/\n[70]: https://eos-aus.com/events/\n[71]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/corporate-governance/\n[72]: https://marss.com/\n[73]: https://www.eosdsusa.com/\n[74]: https://kiwistaroptics.com/\n[75]: tel:+61%202%206222%207900\n[76]: https://eos-aus.com/contact-us/\n[77]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/electro-optic-systems-pty-limited/\n[78]: https://www.youtube.com/@Electro-Optic-Systems\n[79]: https://twitter.com/aussie_eos\n[80]: https://eos-aus.com/privacy-policy/\n[81]: https://eos-aus.com/disclaimer/"
