            "url": "https://eos-aus.com/contact-us/",
            "text": "[][1]\n[ABOUT US ][2]\n[Board Of Directors][3]\n[Executive Officers][4]\n[Affiliate Companies][5]\n[Corporate Governance][6]\n[WHAT WE DO ][7]\n[Defence][8]\n[High Energy Laser Weapon][9]\n[Apollo][10]\n[Counter-Drone Systems][11]\n[NiDAR CUAS][12]\n[Slinger][13]\n[Interceptor-MR][14]\n[Firepower Systems][15]\n[R400][16]\n[R500][17]\n[R600][18]\n[R800][19]\n[Force Protection Systems][20]\n[R150][21]\n[UGV Lethality Systems][22]\n[Marine Lethality Systems][23]\n[Space][24]\n[Optical Tracking Systems][25]\n[1m Telescope][26]\n[2m Telescope][27]\n[Icestorm II Enclosure][28]\n[Tempest Enclosure][29]\n[Typhoon Enclosure][30]\n[Space Control][31]\n[Space Domain Awareness][32]\n[Satellite Laser Ranging][33]\n[Space Sustainability][34]\n[Precision Optics][35]\n[WORK WITH US ][36]\n[NEWS][37]\n[EVENTS][38]\n[INVESTOR ][39]\n[CONTACT US ][40]\n[Search][41][Contact us][42]\nSearch for:\n\n# OUR GLOBAL REACH\n\nElectro Optic Systems has offices in Australia, New Zealand, the USA, the UAE, the Netherlands,\nSingapore and Germany. Our military and space sector research and production facilities are located\nin Australia and the USA.\n\n### Australia\n\n**Electro Optic Systems Pty Limited\nEOS Space Systems Pty Limited\nElectro Optic Systems Holdings Limited**\n1 Taubman Street, Symonston, ACT 2609 Australia\n+ 61 2 6222 7900\n**EOS Defence Systems Pty Limited**\n90 Sheppard Street, Hume, ACT 2620 Australia\n+ 61 2 6298 8000\n\n### New Zealand\n\n**KiwiStar Optics**\n69 Gracefield Road, Lower Hutt, Wellington 5010\nNew Zealand\n+64 4 931 3735\n\n### USA\n\n**EOS Defense Systems USA, Inc**\n**EOS Space Technologies Inc**\n2865 Wall Triana Hwy SW, Huntsville, Alabama 35824, USA\n\n### UAE\n\n**EOS Advanced Technologies L.L.C**\nTawazun Industrial Park, Ajban, Abu Dhabi, U.A.E\nP.O.Box 34245\n+971 2 492 7111\n\n### Singapore\n\n**EOS Defence Systems Pte Ltd**\n54 Pandan Road, #03-00, Singapore 609292\n\n**EOS Innovation Singapore Pte Ltd**\n54 Pandan Road, #2M-00, Singapore 609292\n\n### Germany\n\n**EOS Optronics GMBH**\nUlrichsberger Str. 17 94469, Deggendorf, Germany\n\n### The Netherlands\n\n**EOS Defence Systems**\nEinsteinlaan 28, 2289 CC Rijswijk, The Netherlands\n+31 6 579 91 349\n\n### France\n\n**EOS FRANCE SAS**\n45 all\u00e9e des Ormes,\nB\u00e2timent D, E Space Park, Mougins,\nProvence-Alpes-Cote d'Azur, 06250, France\n\n### UK - MARSS\n\n**MARSS SYSTEMS LIMITED**\n1 Southampton Street, 8th Floor,\nLondon, United Kingdom, WC2R 0LR\n\n[Home][43]>Contact Us\n[WordPress Map Plugin][44]\n\n# Contact US\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nYour enquiry relates to *Your enquiry relates toSpaceDefenceInvestorMedia EnquiryOther\nName *\nFirst\nLast\nEmail *\nCompany *\nPhone\nWhich office location can we direct your enquiry to *Which office location can we direct your\nenquiry toAUSTRALIA \u2013 Head officeAUSTRALIA \u2013 Defence systemsAUSTRALIA \u2013 Space systemsNEW ZEALAND \u2013\nKiwi StarUSAUAEGERMANYTHE NETHERLANDSSINGAPORE\nYour message *\nSend[Loading]\n\n### Our company\n\n[Investor][45][Work with us][46][News][47][Events][48][Corporate Governance][49]\n\n### Our subsidiaries\n\n[MARSS][50][EOS Defense Systems USA][51][KiwiStar Optics][52]\n\n### Head office\n\n1 Taubman Street Symonston ACT 2609 Australia\n[+61 2 6222 7900][53][Contact us][54]\n\n### Follow us\n\n[][55][][56][][57]\n[AUS SPACE awards Winner Business of the year][AUS SPACE awards Winner Defence Business of the\nyear][AUS SPACE awards 2026 Winner Executive of the year]\n\u00a9 Electro Optic Systems\n[Privacy Policy ][58][Disclaimer ][59]\n\n[1]: https://eos-aus.com\n[2]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/board-of-directors/\n[4]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/executive-officers/\n[5]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/affiliate-companies/\n[6]: https://eos-aus.com/about-us/corporate-governance/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/\n[9]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/high-energy-laser-weapon/\n[10]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/high-energy-laser-weapon/apollo/\n[11]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/\n[12]: https://marss.com\n[13]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/slinger/\n[14]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/counter-drone-systems/interceptor-mr/\n[15]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/\n[16]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r400/\n[17]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r500/\n[18]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r600/\n[19]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/firepower-systems/r800/\n[20]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/force-protection-systems/\n[21]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/force-protection-systems/r150/\n[22]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/ugv-lethality-systems/\n[23]: https://eos-aus.com/defence/marine-lethality-systems/\n[24]: https://eos-aus.com/space/\n[25]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/\n[26]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/1m-telescope/\n[27]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/2m-telescope/\n[28]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/icestorm-ii-enclosure/\n[29]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/tempest-enclosure/\n[30]: https://eos-aus.com/space/optical-tracking-systems/typhoon-enclosure/\n[31]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-control/\n[32]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-domain-awareness/\n[33]: https://eos-aus.com/space/satellite-laser-ranging/\n[34]: https://eos-aus.com/space/space-sustainability/\n[35]: https://kiwistaroptics.com/\n[36]: https://eos-aus.com/work-with-us/\n[37]: https://eos-aus.com/news/\n[38]: https://eos-aus.com/events\n[39]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/\n[40]: https://eos-aus.com/contact-us/\n[41]: #\n[42]: #\n[43]: https://eos-aus.com\n[44]: https://supsystic.com/plugins/google-maps-plugin/?utm_medium=love_link_hide\n[45]: https://investorhub.eos-aus.com/\n[46]: https://eos-