        "crawl_text": "Reston, Virginia [[General Dynamics Logo]][1]\n* [ About GD ][2]\n  * * [ Ethos ][3]\n    * [ Corporate Responsibility ][4]\n  * * [ Leadership ][5]\n  * * [ History ][6]\n* [ Our Businesses ][7]\n  * * [ Aerospace ][8]\n    * [ Marine ][9]\n  * * [ Combat ][10]\n  * * [ Technologies ][11]\n* [ News ][12]\n  * * [ Press Releases ][13]\n  * * [ Media Gallery ][14]\n  * * [ News Feed ][15]\n* [ Careers ][16]\n  * * [ Job Search ][17]\n    * [ Benefits ][18]\n  * * [ Veterans ][19]\n  * * [ Internships ][20]\nSearch for:\n[GD Corp Homepage Carousel Placeholder]\n\n# Innovation. Delivered.\n\nGeneral Dynamics is a global aerospace and defense company. From Gulfstream business jets and combat\nvehicles to nuclear-powered submarines and communications systems, people around the world depend on\nour products and services for their safety and security.\n\n[About GD][21]\n[Co-workers]\n\n### Want To Join a Winning Team?\n\nWe're looking for talented, motivated individuals who are ready to do innovative work and we offer\nexciting career opportunities worldwide.\n\n[Search GD Careers][22]\n[\n][23]\n[\n\n### Our Businesses\n\n][24]\n\nOur portfolio spans the realm of the world's most technologically advanced business jets, wheeled\ncombat vehicles, command and control systems and nuclear submarines. We offer these through our four\nbusiness groups: Aerospace, Marine Systems, Combat Systems and Technologies.\n* [Aerospace][25]\n* [Marine Systems][26]\n* [Combat Systems][27]\n* [Technologies][28]\n\n[\n][29]\n[\n\n### Responsibility\n\n][30]\n\nThese values inform our commitment to good corporate citizenship, sustainable business practices and\ncommunity support. And we pride ourselves on our responsible and ethical practices, which play an\nimportant role in the communities where we live and work.\n* [Commitment to Ethics][31]\n* [Our People][32]\n* [Supply Chain Excellence][33]\n* [Supporting Communities][34]\n* [Environmental Responsibility][35]\n* [Human Rights][36]\n\n## News\n\n[View More News][37]\n\nCopyright 2026 General Dynamics Corporation\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your website experience. By continuing to visit this site, you agree to\nour use of cookies. [Learn More][38]\n\nAccept Decline\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about-gd\n[3]: /about-gd/our-ethos\n[4]: /responsibility\n[5]: /about-gd/leadership\n[6]: /about-gd/our-history\n[7]: /our-businesses\n[8]: /our-businesses/aerospace\n[9]: /our-businesses/marine-systems\n[10]: /our-businesses/combat-systems\n[11]: /our-businesses/technologies\n[12]: /news\n[13]: /news/news-feed\n[14]: /news/media-gallery\n[15]: /news/news-feed\n[16]: /careers\n[17]: /careers/job-search\n[18]: /careers/benefits\n[19]: /careers/veterans\n[20]: /careers/interns\n[21]: /about-gd\n[22]: /careers\n[23]: /our-businesses\n[24]: /our-businesses\n[25]: /our-businesses/aerospace\n[26]: https://www.gd.com/our-businesses/marine-systems\n[27]: /our-businesses/combat-systems\n[28]: https://www.gd.com/our-businesses/technologies\n[29]: /responsibility\n[30]: /responsibility\n[31]: /responsibility/commitment-to-ethics\n[32]: /responsibility/our-people\n[33]: /responsibility/supply-chain-excellence\n[34]: /responsibility/supporting-communities\n[35]: /responsibility/environmental-responsibility\n[36]: https://www.gd.com/responsibility/human-rights\n[37]: /news\n[38]: /privacy-policy [[General Dynamics Logo]][1]\n* [ About GD ][2]\n  * * [ Ethos ][3]\n    * [ Corporate Responsibility ][4]\n  * * [ Leadership ][5]\n  * * [ History ][6]\n* [ Our Businesses ][7]\n  * * [ Aerospace ][8]\n    * [ Marine ][9]\n  * * [ Combat ][10]\n  * * [ Technologies ][11]\n* [ News ][12]\n  * * [ Press Releases ][13]\n  * * [ Media Gallery ][14]\n  * * [ News Feed ][15]\n* [ Careers ][16]\n  * * [ Job Search ][17]\n    * [ Benefits ][18]\n  * * [ Veterans ][19]\n  * * [ Internships ][20]\nSearch for:\n[GD Corp Homepage Carousel Placeholder]\n\n# Innovation. Delivered.\n\nGeneral Dynamics is a global aerospace and defense company. From Gulfstream business jets and combat\nvehicles to nuclear-powered submarines and communications systems, people around the world depend on\nour products and services for their safety and security.\n\n[About GD][21]\n[Co-workers]\n\n### Want To Join a Winning Team?\n\nWe're looking for talented, motivated individuals who are ready to do innovative work and we offer\nexciting career opportunities worldwide.\n\n[Search GD Careers][22]\n[\n][23]\n[\n\n### Our Businesses\n\n][24]\n\nOur portfolio spans the realm of the world's most technologically advanced business jets, wheeled\ncombat vehicles, command and control systems and nuclear submarines. We offer these through our four\nbusiness groups: Aerospace, Marine Systems, Combat Systems and Technologies.\n* [Aerospace][25]\n* [Marine Systems][26]\n* [Combat Systems][27]\n* [Technologies][28]\n\n[\n][29]\n[\n\n### Responsibility\n\n][30]\n\nThese values inform our commitment to good corporate citizenship, sustainable business practices and\ncommunity support. And we pride ourselves on our responsible and ethical practices, which play an\nimportant role in the communities where we live and work.\n* [Commitment to Ethics][31]\n* [Our People][32]\n* [Supply Chain Excellence][33]\n* [Supporting Communities][34]\n* [Environmental Responsibility][35]\n* [Human Rights][36]\n\n## News\n\n[View More News][37]\n\nCopyright 2026 General Dynamics Corporation\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your website experience. By continuing to visit this site, you agree to\nour use of cookies. [Learn More][38]\n\nAccept Decline\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about-gd\n[3]: /about-gd/our-ethos\n[4]: /responsibility\n[5]: /about-gd/leadership\n[6]: /about-gd/our-history\n[7]: /our-businesses\n[8]: /our-businesses/aerospace\n[9]: /our-businesses/marine-systems\n[10]: /our-businesses/combat-systems\n[11]: /our-businesses/technologies\n[12]: /news\n[13]: /news/news-feed\n[14]: /news/media-gallery\n[15]: /news/news-feed\n[16]: /careers\n[17]: /careers/jo