        "crawl_text": "Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd 002008.SZ Shenzhen Stock Exchange Publicly traded company China Global Asia Europe North America Strong R&D capabilities Over 7,400 patents Global service network Full-scenario solutions for intelligent manufacturing Shenzhen, China China Global Annual revenue of CNY 18.759 billion Over 20,000 global staff members 11.11% R&D investment ratio 6,600+ R&D professionals Revenue topped USD 2.67 billion in 2025, up 27.00% year-on-year. Expanding full-scenario solutions for intelligent manufacturing Enhancing R&D capabilities Growing demand in intelligent manufacturing sectors Expansion into new markets Leading manufacturer in the laser equipment industry Technological innovation Strong global presence Han's Laser\n\nHan's Laser\n\nAbout Us\n\nAbout Han's Laser\n\nOur History\n\nGlobal Footprint\n\nCertificates & Honors\n\nSustainability\n\nJoin Us\n\nProducts\n\nLaser Equipment\n\nLaser Marking Equipment\n\nFiber Laser Marking Equipment\nUV Laser Marking Machine\nFlying Laser Marking Machine\nPCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine\nPicosecond Laser Marking Machine\nCO2 Laser Marking Machine\n\nLaser Welding Equipment\n\nPrecision Laser Welding Equipment\nYAG Laser Welding Equipment\nFiber Laser Welding Equipment\nSemiconductor Laser Welding Equipment\nPlastic Laser Welding Machines\nSoldering and Special Laser Welding Machines\nLaser Welding Machines for Vehicles\n\nLaser Cutting Equipment\n\nWafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment\nCO2 Laser Cutting Equipment\n3D Precision Laser Cutting Euipment\nBrittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment\nOther Precision Laser Cutting\nWire-Stripping\nMedium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment\n\nGeneral Components\n\nOptical Fiber & Pump Source\n\nPump Source\nSpecial Optical Fiber\nPreform\n\nLaser Generator\n\nCO\u2082 Laser\nCW Fiber Laser\nWelding Laser\nPulsed Fiber Laser\nUV & Ultrafast Lasers\nFemtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers\n\nMotion Control and Compo