            "text": "Han's Laser\n\nHan's Laser\n\nAbout Us\n\nAbout Han's Laser\n\nOur History\n\nGlobal Footprint\n\nCertificates & Honors\n\nSustainability\n\nJoin Us\n\nProducts\n\nLaser Equipment\n\nLaser Marking Equipment\n\nFiber Laser Marking Equipment\nUV Laser Marking Machine\nFlying Laser Marking Machine\nPCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine\nPicosecond Laser Marking Machine\nCO2 Laser Marking Machine\n\nLaser Welding Equipment\n\nPrecision Laser Welding Equipment\nYAG Laser Welding Equipment\nFiber Laser Welding Equipment\nSemiconductor Laser Welding Equipment\nPlastic Laser Welding Machines\nSoldering and Special Laser Welding Machines\nLaser Welding Machines for Vehicles\n\nLaser Cutting Equipment\n\nWafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment\nCO2 Laser Cutting Equipment\n3D Precision Laser Cutting Euipment\nBrittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment\nOther Precision Laser Cutting\nWire-Stripping\nMedium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment\n\nGeneral Components\n\nOptical Fiber & Pump Source\n\nPump Source\nSpecial Optical Fiber\nPreform\n\nLaser Generator\n\nCO\u2082 Laser\nCW Fiber Laser\nWelding Laser\nPulsed Fiber Laser\nUV & Ultrafast Lasers\nFemtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers\n\nMotion Control and Components\n\nMotor & Motion Platform\nBall Screw and Linear Guide\nMachine Vision & CNC System\nFiber Laser Head\nControl Card\nChiller\nLeak Tester\n\nSpecial Equipment\n\nElectric Tools\n\nCNC\n\nPlasma Cleaning Machine\n\nLaser Dispensing Equipment\n\nLaser Resistor Trimming Equipment\n\nLaser Cleaning Machine\n\n3D Printing Machine\n\nAutomation\n\nBending Equipment&Automation\n\nContact Us\n\nApplications\n\nHan's Laser Solutions\n\nHan's Laser has long prioritized R&D and technological innovation. We now have world-leading R&D capabilities in the laser industry and over 7,400 patents. Leveraging our unique product strengths, we are continuously expanding full-scenario solutions to empower intelligent manufacturing for various sectors worldwide.\n\nView All\n\nNew Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n\nPhotovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n\nDisplay & Semiconductor\n\nPCB Industry\n\nElectronic Information Industry\n\nMechanical Hardware\n\nHome Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n\nSheet Metal Fabrication\n\nPackaging Industry\n\nTransportation\n\nTextile & Ornament Industry\n\nAutomotive Manufacturing\n\nLearn More\n\nContact Us\n\nServices\n\nResource Center\n\nGlobal Service Network\n\nFAQ\n\nNews\n\nGroup News\n\nVideo News\n\nExhibitions\n\nContact\n\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese\n\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4\n\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4\n\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\n\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22\n\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c\n\nDeutsch\u200c\n\nsupport\n\nAbout Us\n\nAbout Han's Laser\n\nOur History\n\nGlobal Footprint\n\nCertificates & Honors\n\nSustainability\n\nJoin Us\n\nProducts\n\nLaser Equipment\n\nLaser Marking Equipment\n\nFiber Laser Marking Equipment\n\nUV Laser Marking Machine\n\nFlying Laser Marking Machine\n\nPCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine\n\nPicosecond Laser Marking Machine\n\nCO2 Laser Marking Machine\n\nLaser Welding Equipment\n\nPrecision Laser Welding Equipment\n\nYAG Laser Welding Equipment\n\nFiber Laser Welding Equipment\n\nSemiconductor Laser Welding Equipment\n\nPlastic Laser Welding Machines\n\nSoldering and Special Laser Welding Machines\n\nLaser Welding Machines for Vehicles\n\nLaser Cutting Equipment\n\nWafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment\n\nCO2 Laser Cutting Equipment\n\n3D Precision Laser Cutting Euipment\n\nBrittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment\n\nOther Precision Laser Cutting\n\nWire-Stripping\n\nMedium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment\n\nGeneral Components\n\nOptical Fiber & Pump Source\n\nPump Source\n\nSpecial Optical Fiber\n\nPreform\n\nLaser Generator\n\nCO\u2082 Laser\n\nCW Fiber Laser\n\nWelding Laser\n\nPulsed Fiber Laser\n\nUV & Ultrafast Lasers\n\nFemtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers\n\nMotion Control and Components\n\nMotor & Motion Platform\n\nBall Screw and Linear Guide\n\nMachine Vision & CNC System\n\nFiber Laser Head\n\nControl Card\n\nChiller\n\nLeak Tester\n\nSpecial Equipment\n\nElectric Tools\n\nCNC\n\nPlasma Cleaning Machine\n\nLaser Dispensing Equipment\n\nLaser Resistor Trimming Equipment\n\nLaser Cleaning Machine\n\n3D Printing Machine\n\nAutomation\n\nBending Equipment&Automation\n\nApplications\n\nNew Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n\nPhotovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n\nDisplay & Semiconductor\n\nPCB Industry\n\nElectronic Information Industry\n\nMechanical Hardware\n\nHome Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n\nSheet Metal Fabrication\n\nPackaging Industry\n\nTransportation\n\nTextile & Ornament Industry\n\nAutomotive Manufacturing\n\nServices\n\nResource Center\n\nGlobal Service Network\n\nFAQ\n\nNews\n\nGroup News\n\nVideo News\n\nExhibitions\n\nContact\n\nLanguage\n\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese\n\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4\n\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4\n\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\n\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22\n\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c\n\nDeutsch\u200c\n\nLaser Marking Machines\n\nLearn More\n\nLaser Marking Machines\n\nLaser Cutting Machines\n\nLaser Welding Machines\n\nGeneral Components\n\nSpecial Machines\n\nAutomation\n\nApplications\n\nNew Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n\nPhotovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n\nDisplay & Semiconductor\n\nPCB Industry\n\nElectronic Information Industry\n\nMechanical Hardware\n\nHome Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n\nSheet Metal Fabrication\n\nPackaging Industry\n\nTransportation\n\nTextile & Ornament Industry\n\nAutomotive Manufacturing\n\nExplore All Applications\n\nAbout HAN\u2019S LASER\n\nGlobal Footprint\n\nWith a well-established global network of sales and after-sales service centers, Han's Laser delivers laser process analysis and comprehensive application solutions to customers across industries\u2014seamlessly integrating laser technology with modern manufacturing.\n\nCNY 18.759B\n\nAnnual Revenue\n\n100+\n\nCountries & Regions\n\n20,000+\n\nGlobal Staff Members\n\nR&D Innovation\n\nHan's Laser adheres to independent innovation and has established a multi-disciplinary R&D team. Furthermore, we have formed strategic partnerships with several renowned national research institutions to jointly set up laboratories and talent development centers.\n\n6,600+\n\nR&D Professionals\n\n11.11%\n\nR&D Investment Ratio\n\n11,764\n\nEffective IPs\n\nExhibitions\n\nLearn More\n\nJun 17~20 , 2026\n\nInterMold Thailand 2026\n\nBooth number: 2B11 \uff08Hall101-102\uff09\n\nAddress: BITEC/Bangkok\n\nNews\n\nLearn More\n\nApr 29 , 2026\n\nHan's Laser Exhibits Advanced Technological Prowess at Hannover Messe 2026\n\n20\u201324th April 2026 ,Han's Laser made a high-profile appearance at Hannover Messe 2026 with a lineup of advanced intelligent laser manufacturing equipment.\n\nApr 21 , 2026\n\nDriven by Dual Engines of AI and New Energy, Han's Laser Revenue Topped USD 2.67 Billion with Nearly Doubled NPAT (excl. NRGL) \uff01\n\nOn April 17th, Han's Laser (002008.SZ) released 2025 annual report. The report indicates that Han's Laser exceeded annual revenue of USD 2.67 billion, up 27.00% year-on-year, marking a three-year high in revenue scale.\n\nWe Value Your Privacy\n\nWe use cookies and other similar technologies to operate and improve our site, as described in our Privacy Policy. With your consent, our third-party partners also use these technologies to collect information about your activities on our websites for analytics and advertising purposes.\n\nDecline\n\nAccept\n\n+86-400-666-4000\n\nglobal@hanslaser.com\n\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong 518057, China\n\nAbout Us\n\nAbout Han's Laser\n\nOur History\n\nGlobal Footprint\n\nCertificates & Honors\n\nSustainability\n\nJoin Us\n\nProducts\n\nLaser Marking Machines\n\nLaser Cutting Machines\n\nLaser Welding Machines\n\nGeneral Components\n\nSpecial Machines\n\nAutomation\n\nApplications\n\nNew Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n\nPhotovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n\nDisplay & Semiconductor\n\nPCB Industry\n\nElectronic Information Industry\n\nMechanical Hardware\n\nHome Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n\nSheet Metal Fabrication\n\nPackaging Industry\n\nTransportation\n\nTextile & Ornament Industry\n\nAutomotive Manufacturing\n\nServices\n\nResource Center\n\nGlobal Service Network\n\nFAQ\n\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n\nLegal Statement\nPrivacy Policy\nSite Map\n\nContact Us\n\nSales Hotline\n\n+86-400-666-4000"
