\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n[Products][186] [Laser Marking Equipment][187]\n\n## Laser Marking Equipment\n\n][188] [\n\n## Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][189] [\n\n## Laser Cutting Equipment\n\n][190] [\n\n## Optical Fiber & Pump Source\n\n][191] [\n\n## Laser Generator\n\n][192] [\n\n## Motion Control and Components\n\n][193] [\n\n## Electric Tools\n\n][194] [\n\n## CNC\n\n][195] [\n\n## Plasma Cleaning Machine\n\n][196] [\n\n## Laser Dispensing Equipment\n\n][197] [\n\n## Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment\n\n][198] [\n\n## Laser Cleaning Machine\n\n][199] [\n\n## 3D Printing Machine\n\n][200] [\n\n## Automation\n\n][201] [\n\n## Bending Equipment&Automation\n\n][202]\nShow More +\n\n# Laser Marking Equipment\n\nHan's Laser offers over 100 models of laser marking machines, covering laser marking for metals,\nnon-metals, PCBs, ICs, and semiconductor wafers as well as a wide range of other materials. Our\nlaser marking machines can fully satisfy requirements for marking depth, smoothness and precision\nwith the lowest power consumption, fastest processing speed, highest reliability and superior safety\nperformance.We also provide customers with customization services to support laser marking of any\npattern and for nearly any material, along with tailor-made mass production solutions that deliver\nhigh efficiency and cost-effectiveness.\n\n## Fiber Laser Marking Equipment\n\n][203] [\n\n## UV Laser Marking Machine\n\n][204] [\n\n## Flying Laser Marking Machine\n\n][205] [\n\n## PCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine\n\n][206] [\n\n## Picosecond Laser Marking Machine\n\n][207] [\n\n## CO2 Laser Marking Machine\n\n][208]\nShow More +\n\n## Fiber Laser Marking Equipment\n\n#