\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n[Products][186] [Optical Fiber & Pump Source][187]\n\n## Laser Marking Equipment\n\n][188] [\n\n## Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][189] [\n\n## Laser Cutting Equipment\n\n][190] [\n\n## Optical Fiber & Pump Source\n\n][191] [\n\n## Laser Generator\n\n][192] [\n\n## Motion Control and Components\n\n][193] [\n\n## Electric Tools\n\n][194] [\n\n## CNC\n\n][195] [\n\n## Plasma Cleaning Machine\n\n][196] [\n\n## Laser Dispensing Equipment\n\n][197] [\n\n## Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment\n\n][198] [\n\n## Laser Cleaning Machine\n\n][199] [\n\n## 3D Printing Machine\n\n][200] [\n\n## Automation\n\n][201] [\n\n## Bending Equipment&Automation\n\n][202]\nShow More +\n\n# Optical Fiber & Pump Source\n\nPump sources are applied to Fiber Lasers, Solid-state Lasers, Direct Diode Lasers and other laser\ntypes. They optically excite laser working medium, pump active particles from ground state to high\nenergy level to achieve population inversion and realize laser output. Special optical fibers\nsatisfy requirements of low, medium and high-power Fiber Lasers with high beam quality. Special\nOptical Fiber Preform is mainly used to fabricate double-clad single-mode gain fiber, double-clad\nhigh-energy gain fiber, high-power gain fiber and matched transmission fiber for fiber lasers.\n\n## Pump Source\n\n][203] [\n\n## Special Optical Fiber\n\n][204] [\n\n## Preform\n\n][205]\n\n## Pump Source\n\n### C-Series Continuous Fiber Laser Pump Source\n\n][206]\n\n## Special Optical Fiber\n\n### DCF-Yb-20/128\n\n][207]\n\n## Preform\n\n### Special Optical Fiber Preform\n\n][208]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][209]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][210]\n* [Our History][211]\n* [Global Footprint][212]\n* [Certificates & Honors][213]\n* [Sustainability][214]\n* [Join Us][215]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][216]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][217]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][218]\n* [General Components][219]\n* [Special Machines][220]\n* [Automation][221]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][222]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][223]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][224]\n* [PCB Industry][225]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][226]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][227]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][228]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][229]\n* [Packaging Industry][230]\n* [Transportation][231]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][232]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][233]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][234]\n* [Global Service Network][235]\n* [FAQ][236]\n[ [Share Icon] ][237]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][238] [Privacy Policy][239] [Site Map][240]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][241] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][242]\n[ [Top] ][243]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-4\n[15]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-5\n[16]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-6\n[17]: /products/laser-welding/\n[18]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-36\n[19]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-15\n[20]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-16\n[21]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-31\n[22]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-5