Laser Welding Equipment][114]\n[Plastic Laser Welding Machines][115]\n[Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines][116]\n[Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles][117]\n[Laser Cutting Equipment][118]\n[Wafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment][119]\n[CO2 Laser Cutting Equipment][120]\n[3D Precision Laser Cutting Euipment][121]\n[Brittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment][122]\n[Other Precision Laser Cutting][123]\n[Wire-Stripping][124]\n[Medium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment][125]\n[General Components][126]\n[Optical Fiber & Pump Source][127]\n[Pump Source][128]\n[Special Optical Fiber][129]\n[Preform][130]\n[Laser Generator][131]\n[CO\u2082 Laser][132]\n[CW Fiber Laser][133]\n[Welding Laser][134]\n[Pulsed Fiber Laser][135]\n[UV & Ultrafast Lasers][136]\n[Femtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers][137]\n[Motion Control and Components][138]\n[Motor & Motion Platform][139]\n[Ball Screw and Linear Guide][140]\n[Machine Vision & CNC System][141]\n[Fiber Laser Head][142]\n[Control Card][143]\n[Chiller][144]\n[Leak Tester][145]\n[Special Equipment][146]\n[Electric Tools][147]\n[CNC][148]\n[Plasma Cleaning Machine][149]\n[Laser Dispensing Equipment][150]\n[Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment][151]\n[Laser Cleaning Machine][152]\n[3D Printing Machine][153]\n[Automation][154]\n[Bending Equipment&Automation][155]\n[Applications][156]\n[New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][157]\n[Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][158]\n[Display & Semiconductor][159]\n[PCB Industry][160]\n[Electronic Information Industry][161]\n[Mechanical Hardware][162]\n[Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][163]\n[Sheet Metal Fabrication][164]\n[Packaging Industry][165]\n[Transportation][166]\n[Textile & Ornament Industry][167]\n[Automotive Manufacturing][168]\n[Services][169]\n[Resource Center][170]\n[Global Service Network][171]\n[FAQ][172]\n[News][173]\n[Group News][174]\n[Video News][175]\n[Exhibitions][176]\n[Contact][177]\n[Language][178]\n[\u4e2d\u6587Chinese]\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese][179]\n[\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4]\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# New Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n\n# New Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n\n[Applications][186] [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][187]\n\n## Intelligent Manufacturing Solutions for Lithium-ion Batteries\n\nLithium-ion batteries, as eco-friendly and high-efficiency energy storage devices, are seeing\nsurging market demand.\nHan's Laser has completed the product layout of integrated intelligent equipment for the front-end\nprocesses of lithium-ion battery production, with outstanding process innovations and efficiency\nimprovements. Our product portfolio includes integrated machines such as calendering & slitting\nall-in-one machines, laser die-cutting & slitting all-in-one machines, laser die-cutting & winding\nall-in-one machines, and cutting & stacking all-in-one machines.\nWe also offer high-performance standalone equipment for standard front-end production processes,\nincluding slitting machines, winding machines and stacking machines.\nOur solutions have been adopted by numerous well-known enterprises, helping them achieve remarkable\nimprovements in production efficiency and product quality, and have earned wide recognition across\nthe market.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Intelligent Manufacturing Solutions for ESS Lithium-ion Batteries\n\nAs a major development model for new energy storage, lithium-ion battery energy storage is currently\nin a period of rapid expansion.\nHan's Laser delivers comprehensive process solutions for the production of various battery\ncomponents, covering complete power battery production lines, cell sealing (side welding, top\nwelding) and plug sealing, flexible busbar connections, battery module welding, as well as welding\nfor explosion-proof valves, explosion-proof covers, throttle valves, current collectors and terminal\nposts. Our product portfolio also includes plug sealing, cleaning for modules, cells and separators,\ncell marking and tab cutting. We also provide turnkey solutions for complete power battery\nproduction lines.\nTailored to clients' requirements, our solutions seamlessly connect upstream and downstream\nprocesses. Leveraging intelligent manufacturing technologies, we support the efficient, high-quality\nand sustainable development of energy storage lithium-ion batteries.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Intelligent Manufacturing Solutions for Consumer Lithium-ion Batteries\n\nDriven by rising demand for smartphones, wearable devices, drones, service robots and other\nproducts, consumer batteries have become a major growth driver in the consumer lithium battery\nmarket.\nPouch cells are liquid lithium-ion batteries encapsulated with a polymer casing and packaged with\naluminum-plastic composite films, which effectively reduces electrolyte leakage. In the event of\npotential safety hazards, pouch cells only swell and rupture, unlike metal-cased batteries that may\nexplode due to excessive internal pressure. Featuring a stacked internal structure, pouch cells are\nlightweight.\nHan's Laser supplies automated production equipment for pouch cells. Composed of independent modular\nunits, the equipment can be customized to meet customers' process requirements, featuring strong\ncompatibility, high automation and proven process performance.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Intelligent Manufacturing Solutions for Hydrogen Fuel Cells\n\nBattery quality directly determines the performance of new energy vehicles, so extremely high\nprecision is required throughout its manufacturing processes. As an advanced photonic manufacturing\ntool, laser technology features high efficiency, superior precision, great flexibility, reliable\nstability, low material consumption, high automation and safety. It is widely adopted in cutting,\ncleaning, welding, marking and other processes for power lithium-ion battery components.\nLeveraging extensive experience and robust technical expertise in lithium battery manufacturing,\nHan's Laser has launched intelligent manufacturing solutions for hydrogen fuel cells to meet market\ndemands for high-quality, high-efficiency, eco-friendly and sustainable hydrogen fuel cells.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### Standard Process Equipment \u2014 Laser Die-Cutting & Winding Integrated Machine\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][196]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][197]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][198]\n* [General Components][199]\n* [Special Machines][200]\n* [Automation][201]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][202]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][203]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][204]\n* [PCB Industry][205]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][206]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][207]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][208]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][209]\n* [Packaging Industry][210]\n* [Transportation][211]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][212]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][213]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][214]\n* [Global Service Network][215]\n* [FAQ][216]\n[ [Share Icon] ][217]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][218] [Privacy Policy][219] [Site Map][220]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][221] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][222]\n[ [Top] ][223]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-4\n[15]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-5\n[16]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-6\n[17]: /products/laser-welding/\n[18]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-36\n[19]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-15\n[20]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-16\n[21]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-31\n[22]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-51\n[23]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-52\n[24]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-54\n[25]: /products/laser-cutting/\n[26]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-12\n[27]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-11\n[28]"
