\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n\n# Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n\n[Applications][186] [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][187]\n\n## TOPCon Cell Process\n\nContact Us\n\n## High-efficiency Cell Production Equipment\n\nCrystalline Silicon Cell PERC/TOPCon Equipment\nBC Cell Equipment\nPerovskite Cell Equipment\n\nContact Us\n\n## Laser Scribing & Soldering Process for PV Modules\n\nFully automatic laser scribing & breaking machines are applied to automated production of\nhigh-efficiency PV modules. Scribed modules reduce string current and resistance loss, thus boosting\nmodule output power.\nNon-destructive laser scribing & breaking machines serve the scribing process in high-efficiency PV\nmodule production. As an alternative to conventional models, they completely eliminate inevitable\nthermal damage to cells caused by traditional laser scribing & breaking equipment.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### LPCVD Coating Machine\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][196]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][197]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][198]\n* [General Components][199]\n* [Special Machines][200]\n* [Automation][201]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][202]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][203]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][