\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# Mechanical Hardware\n\n# Mechanical Hardware\n\n[Applications][186] [Mechanical Hardware][187]\n\n## Metal Cutting Application Solutions\n\nHan's Laser delivers smart manufacturing solutions for precision machine tools and automation\nsectors. Our product portfolios include high-speed drilling & tapping centers, standard machining\ncenters, gantry machining centers, five-axis series, as well as automation and industry-specific\nsolutions.\nOur products are widely applied in 3C manufacturing, precision mold processing, automotive component\nmachining, medical part fabrication and other fields. Backed by reliable product quality and\ncomprehensive after-sales services, tens of thousands of our machine tools operate steadily across\nthe globe. We have earned wide recognition and trust from clients worldwide, empowering them to\nachieve smart manufacturing and industrial upgrading.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Tool Production & Manufacturing Solutions\n\nThe laser cutting machines manufactured by Han's Laser feature superior cutting quality, high\nprecision and fast cutting speed. They entail low subsequent maintenance costs, helping enterprises\nboost productivity and cut production expenses.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Raw Material and Finished Product Solutions\n\nFiber Laser Cutting Machines have a large customer base in the hardware industry, mainly engaged in\nthe processing of thin metal sheets and pipes. Practice has proven that they deliver distinct\neconomic benefits for both sheet and pipe processing, regardless of production volume. The fiber\nlaser cutting machines manufactured by Han's Laser feature superior cutting quality, high precision\nand fast cutting speed. They entail low subsequent maintenance costs, helping enterprises boost\nproductivity and cut production expenses.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### LB Series Bevel Cutting Machine\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][196]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][197]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][198]\n* [General Components][199]\n* [Special Machines][200]\n* [Automation][201]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][202]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][203]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][204]\n* [PCB Industry][205]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][206]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][207]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][208]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][209]\n* [Packaging Industry][210]\n* [Transportation][211]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][212]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][213]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][214]\n* [Global Service Network][215]\n* [FAQ][216]\n[ [Share Icon] ][217]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][218] [Privacy Policy][219] [Site Map][220]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][221] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][222]\n[ [Top] ][223]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-4\n[15]: /