\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n\n# Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n\n[Applications][186] [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][187]\n\n## Laser Welding & Automation Solutions for Kitchenware and Sanitary Ware\n\nHan's Laser provides professional laser welding and automation solutions for the kitchenware and\nsanitary ware industry, covering the following key areas:\n1. Laser Welding for Kitchen & Sanitary Hardware Parts\nHan's Laser offers a full range of laser welding equipment to deliver high-efficiency and\nhigh-precision welding for hardware parts made of stainless steel, aluminum alloy, copper, iron and\nother materials. Featuring high precision, high productivity and excellent uniformity, our welding\nequipment ensures stable and consistent welding quality.\n\n2. Automated Production Lines for Kitchenware & Sanitary Ware\nWe have developed multiple automated production line solutions tailored for this industry, including\ndigital modules, welding robots, intelligent cutting machines and multi-arm rotary resistance\nwelders. These solutions enable fully automatic production from raw materials to finished products,\nlifting overall productivity and product uniformity.\n\n3. Welding Quality Control for Kitchenware & Sanitary Ware\nWith extensive industry experience, Han's Laser has launched diverse quality control solutions such\nas in-line inspection, manual inspection and machine vision inspection. They monitor key welding\nindicators in real time, including penetration depth, porosity and heat input, to sustain reliable\nand uniform welding performance.\n\n4. Welding for Tableware & Drinkware\nOur laser welding equipment is applicable to tableware and drinkware of stainless steel, aluminum\nalloy, copper and more. The equipment boasts high precision, high efficiency and superior\nconsistency, guaranteeing steady and uniform welding quality.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Laser Welding & Automation Solutions for Home Appliance Hardware\n\nHan's Laser\u2019s laser welding and automation solutions for home appliance hardware supply dedicated\nlaser welding equipment and automated production lines for automated manufacturing of home appliance\nhardware. These solutions help boost productivity, cut production costs and ensure reliable product\nquality.\nOur laser welding machines are capable of processing various metals including stainless steel,\naluminum, copper and iron, suitable for welding a wide range of hardware products. We also deliver\ncustomized automated production lines integrating multiple processes such as CNC shearing, bending,\ndispensing and riveting, enabling high-efficiency, high-quality and highly automated production of\nhome appliance hardware.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### Laser Welding System for Range Hood Housings\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][196]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][197]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][198]\n* [General Components][199]\n* [Special Machines][200]\n* [Automation][201]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][202]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][203]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][204]\n* [PCB Industry][205]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][206]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][207]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][208]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication