            "text": "[ [logo] ][1]\n[ About Us ][2]\n[ About Han's Laser ][3]\n[ Our History ][4]\n[ Global Footprint ][5]\n[ Certificates & Honors ][6]\n[ Sustainability ][7]\n[ Join Us ][8]\n[ Products ][9]\nLaser Equipment\n[ Laser Marking Equipment ][10]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Equipment][11] [UV Laser Marking Machine][12] [Flying Laser Marking\nMachine][13] [PCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine][14] [Picosecond Laser Marking Machine][15]\n[CO2 Laser Marking Machine][16]\n[ Laser Welding Equipment ][17]\n[Precision Laser Welding Equipment][18] [YAG Laser Welding Equipment][19] [Fiber Laser Welding\nEquipment][20] [Semiconductor Laser Welding Equipment][21] [Plastic Laser Welding Machines][22]\n[Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines][23] [Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles][24]\n[ Laser Cutting Equipment ][25]\n[Wafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment][26] [CO2 Laser Cutting Equipment][27] [3D Precision Laser\nCutting Euipment][28] [Brittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment][29] [Other Precision\nLaser Cutting][30] [Wire-Stripping][31] [Medium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment][32]\nGeneral Components\n[ Optical Fiber & Pump Source ][33]\n[Pump Source][34] [Special Optical Fiber][35] [Preform][36]\n[ Laser Generator ][37]\n[CO\u2082 Laser][38] [CW Fiber Laser][39] [Welding Laser][40] [Pulsed Fiber Laser][41] [UV & Ultrafast\nLasers][42] [Femtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers][43]\n[ Motion Control and Components ][44]\n[Motor & Motion Platform][45] [Ball Screw and Linear Guide][46] [Machine Vision & CNC System][47]\n[Fiber Laser Head][48] [Control Card][49] [Chiller][50] [Leak Tester][51]\nSpecial Equipment\n[ Electric Tools ][52]\n[ CNC ][53]\n[ Plasma Cleaning Machine ][54]\n[ Laser Dispensing Equipment ][55]\n[ Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment ][56]\n[ Laser Cleaning Machine ][57]\n[ 3D Printing Machine ][58]\n[ Automation ][59]\n[ Bending Equipment&Automation ][60]\nContact Us\n[ Applications ][61]\n\n## Han's Laser Solutions\n\nHan's Laser has long prioritized R&D and technological innovation. We now have world-leading R&D\ncapabilities in the laser industry and over 7,400 patents. Leveraging our unique product strengths,\nwe are continuously expanding full-scenario solutions to empower intelligent manufacturing for\nvarious sectors worldwide.\n[ View All\n][62]\n[ New Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n][63] [ Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n][64] [ Display & Semiconductor\n][65] [ PCB Industry\n][66] [ Electronic Information Industry\n][67] [ Mechanical Hardware\n][68] [ Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n][69] [ Sheet Metal Fabrication\n][70] [ Packaging Industry\n][71] [ Transportation\n][72] [ Textile & Ornament Industry\n][73] [ Automotive Manufacturing\n][74]\n[ Learn More ][75]\nContact Us\n[ Services ][76]\n[ Resource Center ][77]\n[ Global Service Network ][78]\n[ FAQ ][79]\n[ News ][80]\n[ Group News ][81]\n[ Video News ][82]\n[ Exhibitions ][83]\n[ Contact ][84]\n[\u4e2d\u6587Chinese]\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese ][85] [\n[\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4]\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4 ][86] [\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][87] [\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][88] [\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22 ][89] [\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c ][90] [\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c ][91]\n[VR][92] [support][93]\n[About Us][94]\n[About Han's Laser][95]\n[Our History][96]\n[Global Footprint][97]\n[Certificates & Honors][98]\n[Sustainability][99]\n[Join Us][100]\n[Products][101]\n[Laser Equipment][102]\n[Laser Marking Equipment][103]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Equipment][104]\n[UV Laser Marking Machine][105]\n[Flying Laser Marking Machine][106]\n[PCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine][107]\n[Picosecond Laser Marking Machine][108]\n[CO2 Laser Marking Machine][109]\n[Laser Welding Equipment][110]\n[Precision Laser Welding Equipment][111]\n[YAG Laser Welding Equipment][112]\n[Fiber Laser Welding Equipment][113]\n[Semiconductor Laser Welding Equipment][114]\n[Plastic Laser Welding Machines][115]\n[Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines][116]\n[Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles][117]\n[Laser Cutting Equipment][118]\n[Wafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment][119]\n[CO2 Laser Cutting Equipment][120]\n[3D Precision Laser Cutting Euipment][121]\n[Brittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment][122]\n[Other Precision Laser Cutting][123]\n[Wire-Stripping][124]\n[Medium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment][125]\n[General Components][126]\n[Optical Fiber & Pump Source][127]\n[Pump Source][128]\n[Special Optical Fiber][129]\n[Preform][130]\n[Laser Generator][131]\n[CO\u2082 Laser][132]\n[CW Fiber Laser][133]\n[Welding Laser][134]\n[Pulsed Fiber Laser][135]\n[UV & Ultrafast Lasers][136]\n[Femtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers][137]\n[Motion Control and Components][138]\n[Motor & Motion Platform][139]\n[Ball Screw and Linear Guide][140]\n[Machine Vision & CNC System][141]\n[Fiber Laser Head][142]\n[Control Card][143]\n[Chiller][144]\n[Leak Tester][145]\n[Special Equipment][146]\n[Electric Tools][147]\n[CNC][148]\n[Plasma Cleaning Machine][149]\n[Laser Dispensing Equipment][150]\n[Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment][151]\n[Laser Cleaning Machine][152]\n[3D Printing Machine][153]\n[Automation][154]\n[Bending Equipment&Automation][155]\n[Applications][156]\n[New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][157]\n[Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][158]\n[Display & Semiconductor][159]\n[PCB Industry][160]\n[Electronic Information Industry][161]\n[Mechanical Hardware][162]\n[Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][163]\n[Sheet Metal Fabrication][164]\n[Packaging Industry][165]\n[Transportation][166]\n[Textile & Ornament Industry][167]\n[Automotive Manufacturing][168]\n[Services][169]\n[Resource Center][170]\n[Global Service Network][171]\n[FAQ][172]\n[News][173]\n[Group News][174]\n[Video News][175]\n[Exhibitions][176]\n[Contact][177]\n[Language][178]\n[\u4e2d\u6587Chinese]\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese][179]\n[\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4]\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# Sheet Metal Fabrication\n\n# Sheet Metal Fabrication\n\n[Applications][186] [Sheet Metal Fabrication][187]\n\n## Automated Laser Cutting Production Line\n\nThe automatic loading and unloading system for laser cutting mainly consists of CAD/CAM programming\nsystem, material handling system, automatic loading & unloading unit, two or more flat cutting\nmachine systems and finished product sorting stations. It covers the full workflow from programming,\nraw material feeding and cutting to conveying of finished workpieces and scraps. The system enables\nautomated and scheduled operation, greatly boosting production efficiency, reducing labor intensity\nand cutting production costs. It features high efficiency, high precision, low cost and easy\noperation.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Laser Tube Cutting Machine Series\n\nThe laser tube cutting machine series is professional equipment dedicated to steel tube cutting.\nWidely used in the metalworking industry, it performs cutting and processing for various steel\ntubes.\nMain features:\n1. High efficiency: It saves 50% to 90% of working time compared with traditional mechanical cutting\nmethods.\n2. Superior cutting quality: Equipped with advanced control systems and servo drive systems to\nensure excellent cutting results.\n3. High automation: The whole process including automatic programming, monitoring and parameter\nadjustment is fully controlled by software.\n4. Easy operation: Complex processing procedures can be completed simply by pressing several\nbuttons.\n5. Strong versatility: Capable of machining workpieces with various shapes, such as planar cavities\nand 3D curved surfaces.\n6. No tool wear occurs during operation.\n7. Fully enclosed working environment generates no dust and low noise, effectively improving working\nconditions.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Precision Laser Cutting Solutions\n\nThe advantages of precision laser cutting solutions are as follows:\n1. High Precision & High Efficiency: The dimensional accuracy of steel tubes processed by laser\ncutting can reach within 0.1mm, featuring smooth cutting edges and excellent machining precision.\nSupported by fast cutting speed, the solution delivers high productivity and enables mass production\nof steel tubes in a short cycle time.\n2. High Automation: The solution supports fully automated operation, effectively eliminating errors\ncaused by manual work, and further improving cutting accuracy and overall production efficiency.\n3. Eco-friendly Operation: Adopting advanced laser cutting technology, the process produces low\nnoise and negligible smoke and dust emissions, with minimal impact on the working environment and\necological environment.\n4. Wide Applicability: It is capable of cutting steel tubes of various sizes and complex shapes,\nmeeting diverse application requirements across multiple industries.\n5. Cost-effectiveness: Compared with traditional cutting methods, laser cutting greatly reduces\nproduction costs. It eliminates the need for consumable tools and intensive manual labor, helping\nenterprises save long-term operating expenses.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Universal Laser Cutting Solutions\n\nHan\u2019s Laser universal laser cutting solution utilizes the energy released when a laser beam\nirradiates the surface of steel workpieces to melt and vaporize the material. High-pressure inert\ngas coaxial with the beam blows off the molten metal to create cutting kerfs.\nBoasting high precision, high efficiency and high automation, this solution cuts steel pipes with\ndiameters from 20 mm to 60 mm and handles various special-shaped pipes. Products in custom sizes and\nshapes are available to satisfy client demands.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### MPS C Series Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][196]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][197]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][198]\n* [General Components][199]\n* [Special Machines][200]\n* [Automation][201]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][202]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][203]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][204]\n* [PCB Industry][205]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][206]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][207]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][208]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][209]\n* [Packaging Industry][210]\n* [Transportation][211]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][212]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][213]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][214]\n* [Global Service Network][215]\n* [FAQ][216]\n[ [Share Icon] ][217]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][218] [Privacy Policy][219] [Site Map][220]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][221] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][222]\n[ [Top] ][223]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-4\n[15]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-5\n[16]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-6\n[17]: /products/laser-welding/\n[18]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-36\n[19]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-15\n[20]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-16\n[21]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-31\n[22]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-51\n[23]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-52\n[24]: /products/laser-welding/#Anchor-54\n[25]: /products/laser-cutting/\n[26]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-12\n[27]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-11\n[28]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-13\n[29]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-55\n[30]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-56\n[31]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-14\n[32]: /products/laser-cutting/#Anchor-37\n[33]: /products/optical-fiber-pump-source/\n[34]: /products/optical-fiber-pump-source/#Anchor-58\n[35]: /products/optical-fiber-pump-source/#Anchor-59\n[36]: /products/optical-fiber-pump-source/#Anchor-60\n[37]: /products/laser-generator"
