\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# Transportation\n\n# Transportation\n\n[Applications][186] [Transportation][187]\n\n## Shipbuilding Industry\n\nLaser cutting machines deliver high cutting precision, excellent section perpendicularity and\nsuperior bevel forming performance, along with high efficiency and eco-friendliness. Laser cutting\nmachines made by Han\u2019s Laser can effectively address major drawbacks of conventional cutting\nprocesses such as flame cutting and plasma cutting, including severe thermal deformation and heavy\npollution, facilitating green intelligent manufacturing in the shipbuilding industry.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Logistics Equipment\n\nAdvantages of Laser Intelligent Manufacturing Equipment:\n1. High Precision\nEquipped with high-precision machining capability, it manufactures high-quality logistics equipment.\n2. High Efficiency\nIt delivers efficient machining performance to finish processing tasks rapidly and boost\nproductivity.\n3. High Automation\nHighly automated design minimizes manual intervention and further improves production efficiency.\n4. Customization\nThe equipment can be tailored to produce diverse logistics equipment, meeting personalized\nrequirements.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### LB Series Bevel Cutting Machine\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n