            "text": "[ [logo] ][1]\n[ About Us ][2]\n[ About Han's Laser ][3]\n[ Our History ][4]\n[ Global Footprint ][5]\n[ Certificates & Honors ][6]\n[ Sustainability ][7]\n[ Join Us ][8]\n[ Products ][9]\nLaser Equipment\n[ Laser Marking Equipment ][10]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Equipment][11] [UV Laser Marking Machine][12] [Flying Laser Marking\nMachine][13] [PCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine][14] [Picosecond Laser Marking Machine][15]\n[CO2 Laser Marking Machine][16]\n[ Laser Welding Equipment ][17]\n[Precision Laser Welding Equipment][18] [YAG Laser Welding Equipment][19] [Fiber Laser Welding\nEquipment][20] [Semiconductor Laser Welding Equipment][21] [Plastic Laser Welding Machines][22]\n[Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines][23] [Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles][24]\n[ Laser Cutting Equipment ][25]\n[Wafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment][26] [CO2 Laser Cutting Equipment][27] [3D Precision Laser\nCutting Euipment][28] [Brittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment][29] [Other Precision\nLaser Cutting][30] [Wire-Stripping][31] [Medium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment][32]\nGeneral Components\n[ Optical Fiber & Pump Source ][33]\n[Pump Source][34] [Special Optical Fiber][35] [Preform][36]\n[ Laser Generator ][37]\n[CO\u2082 Laser][38] [CW Fiber Laser][39] [Welding Laser][40] [Pulsed Fiber Laser][41] [UV & Ultrafast\nLasers][42] [Femtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers][43]\n[ Motion Control and Components ][44]\n[Motor & Motion Platform][45] [Ball Screw and Linear Guide][46] [Machine Vision & CNC System][47]\n[Fiber Laser Head][48] [Control Card][49] [Chiller][50] [Leak Tester][51]\nSpecial Equipment\n[ Electric Tools ][52]\n[ CNC ][53]\n[ Plasma Cleaning Machine ][54]\n[ Laser Dispensing Equipment ][55]\n[ Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment ][56]\n[ Laser Cleaning Machine ][57]\n[ 3D Printing Machine ][58]\n[ Automation ][59]\n[ Bending Equipment&Automation ][60]\nContact Us\n[ Applications ][61]\n\n## Han's Laser Solutions\n\nHan's Laser has long prioritized R&D and technological innovation. We now have world-leading R&D\ncapabilities in the laser industry and over 7,400 patents. Leveraging our unique product strengths,\nwe are continuously expanding full-scenario solutions to empower intelligent manufacturing for\nvarious sectors worldwide.\n[ View All\n][62]\n[ New Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n][63] [ Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n][64] [ Display & Semiconductor\n][65] [ PCB Industry\n][66] [ Electronic Information Industry\n][67] [ Mechanical Hardware\n][68] [ Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n][69] [ Sheet Metal Fabrication\n][70] [ Packaging Industry\n][71] [ Transportation\n][72] [ Textile & Ornament Industry\n][73] [ Automotive Manufacturing\n][74]\n[ Learn More ][75]\nContact Us\n[ Services ][76]\n[ Resource Center ][77]\n[ Global Service Network ][78]\n[ FAQ ][79]\n[ News ][80]\n[ Group News ][81]\n[ Video News ][82]\n[ Exhibitions ][83]\n[ Contact ][84]\n[\u4e2d\u6587Chinese]\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese ][85] [\n[\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4]\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4 ][86] [\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][87] [\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][88] [\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22 ][89] [\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c ][90] [\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c ][91]\n[VR][92] [support][93]\n[About Us][94]\n[About Han's Laser][95]\n[Our History][96]\n[Global Footprint][97]\n[Certificates & Honors][98]\n[Sustainability][99]\n[Join Us][100]\n[Products][101]\n[Laser Equipment][102]\n[Laser Marking Equipment][103]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Equipment][104]\n[UV Laser Marking Machine][105]\n[Flying Laser Marking Machine][106]\n[PCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine][107]\n[Picosecond Laser Marking Machine][108]\n[CO2 Laser Marking Machine][109]\n[Laser Welding Equipment][110]\n[Precision Laser Welding Equipment][111]\n[YAG Laser Welding Equipment][112]\n[Fiber Laser Welding Equipment][113]\n[Semiconductor Laser Welding Equipment][114]\n[Plastic Laser Welding Machines][115]\n[Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines][116]\n[Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles][117]\n[Laser Cutting Equipment][118]\n[Wafer & PCBA Laser Cutting Equipment][119]\n[CO2 Laser Cutting Equipment][120]\n[3D Precision Laser Cutting Euipment][121]\n[Brittle Material Precision Laser Cutting Equipment][122]\n[Other Precision Laser Cutting][123]\n[Wire-Stripping][124]\n[Medium/High Power Laser Cutting Equipment][125]\n[General Components][126]\n[Optical Fiber & Pump Source][127]\n[Pump Source][128]\n[Special Optical Fiber][129]\n[Preform][130]\n[Laser Generator][131]\n[CO\u2082 Laser][132]\n[CW Fiber Laser][133]\n[Welding Laser][134]\n[Pulsed Fiber Laser][135]\n[UV & Ultrafast Lasers][136]\n[Femtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers][137]\n[Motion Control and Components][138]\n[Motor & Motion Platform][139]\n[Ball Screw and Linear Guide][140]\n[Machine Vision & CNC System][141]\n[Fiber Laser Head][142]\n[Control Card][143]\n[Chiller][144]\n[Leak Tester][145]\n[Special Equipment][146]\n[Electric Tools][147]\n[CNC][148]\n[Plasma Cleaning Machine][149]\n[Laser Dispensing Equipment][150]\n[Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment][151]\n[Laser Cleaning Machine][152]\n[3D Printing Machine][153]\n[Automation][154]\n[Bending Equipment&Automation][155]\n[Applications][156]\n[New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][157]\n[Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][158]\n[Display & Semiconductor][159]\n[PCB Industry][160]\n[Electronic Information Industry][161]\n[Mechanical Hardware][162]\n[Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][163]\n[Sheet Metal Fabrication][164]\n[Packaging Industry][165]\n[Transportation][166]\n[Textile & Ornament Industry][167]\n[Automotive Manufacturing][168]\n[Services][169]\n[Resource Center][170]\n[Global Service Network][171]\n[FAQ][172]\n[News][173]\n[Group News][174]\n[Video News][175]\n[Exhibitions][176]\n[Contact][177]\n[Language][178]\n[\u4e2d\u6587Chinese]\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese][179]\n[\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4]\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n# Automotive Manufacturing\n\n# Automotive Manufacturing\n\n[Applications][186] [Automotive Manufacturing][187]\n\n## CNC Machining for Battery, Motor and Electronic Control Systems of New Energy Vehicles\n\nThe three core components of new energy vehicles, namely motor, electronic control system and\nbattery, require high-end CNC machine tools to deliver customized and efficient machining with high\nprecision, high speed and high yield rate. Han's Laser CNC machines feature high-precision cutting,\nhigh-efficiency processing, capability for complex-shaped parts machining, high automation and\ncustomizable production, fully meeting the requirements of automotive manufacturing.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Automotive Manufacturing\n\nHan's Laser intelligent connection & automation solutions for automotive industry include:\n1.Dedicated Automotive Laser Welding Machines\nDedicated laser welding machine for automotive body roof, dedicated laser welding machine for\nautomotive seats, dedicated laser welding machine for automotive transmission parts, laser\ntailor-welding machine for variable-thickness plates, dedicated laser welding machine for body\npanels, dedicated laser welding machine for automotive components.\n2. Intelligent Welding Lines for Automotive Body-in-White and Components\nIntelligent welding line for body-in-white floor, intelligent welding line for body-in-white side\nframes, intelligent welding line for body-in-white four doors and two hoods, main welding line for\nbody-in-white, body-in-white trimming line, intelligent welding line for automotive components.\n3. Intelligent Welding Lines for Battery Trays\nIntelligent welding line for aluminum alloy battery trays, intelligent welding line for\nhigh-strength steel battery trays, intelligent laser welding production line for battery trays,\nintelligent welding line for battery tray upper covers.\n4. Automatic Assembly Lines for Motors and Transmission Parts\nAutomatic assembly line for hairpin motors, automatic assembly line for differentials, automatic\nassembly line for flywheels, automatic assembly line for electric drive axles.\n\nContact Us\n\n## Recommended Products\n\n### Laser Welding Machines for Automotive Industry\n\n][188]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][189]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][190]\n* [Our History][191]\n* [Global Footprint][192]\n* [Certificates & Honors][193]\n* [Sustainability][194]\n* [Join Us][195]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][196]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][197]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][198]\n* [General Components][199]\n* [Special Machines][200]\n* [Automation][201]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][202]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][203]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][204]\n* [PCB Industry][205]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][206]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][207]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][208]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][209]\n* [Packaging Industry][210]\n* [Transportation][211]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][212]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][213]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][214]\n* [Global Service Network][215]\n* [FAQ][216]\n[ [Share Icon] ][217]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][218] [Privacy Policy][219] [Site Map][220]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][221] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][222]\n[ [Top] ][223]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: