 long prioritized R&D and technological innovation. We now have world-leading R&D\ncapabilities in the laser industry and over 7,400 patents. Leveraging our unique product strengths,\nwe are continuously expanding full-scenario solutions to empower intelligent manufacturing for\nvarious sectors worldwide.\n[ View All\n][62]\n[ New Energy Lithium-ion Battery\n][63] [ Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy\n][64] [ Display & Semiconductor\n][65] [ PCB Industry\n][66] [ Electronic Information Industry\n][67] [ Mechanical Hardware\n][68] [ Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath\n][69] [ Sheet Metal Fabrication\n][70] [ Packaging Industry\n][71] [ Transportation\n][72] [ Textile & Ornament Industry\n][73] [ Automotive Manufacturing\n][74]\n[ Learn More ][75]\nContact Us\n[ Services ][76]\n[ Resource Center ][77]\n[ Global Service Network ][78]\n[ FAQ ][79]\n[ News ][80]\n[ Group News ][81]\n[ Video News ][82]\n[ Exhibitions ][83]\n[ Contact ][84]\n[\u4e2d\u6587Chinese]\n\u4e2d\u6587Chinese ][85] [\n[\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4]\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4 ][86] [\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][87] [\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][88] [\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22 ][89] [\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c ][90] [\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c ][91]\n[VR][92] [support][93]\n[About Us][94]\n[About Han's Laser][95]\n[Our History][96]\n[Global Footprint][97]\n[Certificates & Honors][98]\n[Sustainability][99]\n[Join Us][100]\n[Products][101]\n[Laser Equipment][102]\n[Laser Marking Equipment][103]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Equipment][104]\n[UV Laser Marking Machine][105]\n[Flying Laser Marking Machine][106]\n[PCBA & IC & Wafer Laser Marking Machine][107]\n[Picosecond Laser Marking Machine][108]\n[CO2 Laser Marking Machine][109]\n[Laser Welding Equipment][110]\n[Precision Laser Welding Equipment][111]\n[YAG Laser Welding Equipment][112]\n[Fiber Laser Welding Equipment][113]\n[Semiconductor 