\n\u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4][180]\n[\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4]\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][181]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e]\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][182]\n[\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22]\n\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22][183]\n[Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c]\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\u200c][184]\n[Deutsch\u200c]\nDeutsch\u200c][185]\n\n[Products][186] [Laser Welding Equipment][187]\n\n## Laser Marking Equipment\n\n][188] [\n\n## Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][189] [\n\n## Laser Cutting Equipment\n\n][190] [\n\n## Optical Fiber & Pump Source\n\n][191] [\n\n## Laser Generator\n\n][192] [\n\n## Motion Control and Components\n\n][193] [\n\n## Electric Tools\n\n][194] [\n\n## CNC\n\n][195] [\n\n## Plasma Cleaning Machine\n\n][196] [\n\n## Laser Dispensing Equipment\n\n][197] [\n\n## Laser Resistor Trimming Equipment\n\n][198] [\n\n## Laser Cleaning Machine\n\n][199] [\n\n## 3D Printing Machine\n\n][200] [\n\n## Automation\n\n][201] [\n\n## Bending Equipment&Automation\n\n][202]\nShow More +\n\n# Laser Welding Equipment\n\nHan\u2019s Laser\u2019s self-developed high-tech laser welding machines adopt advanced optoelectronic control\nsystems, rational heat dissipation layout and optimized optical path output solutions. Featuring\nhigh automation and integration, our laser welding machines support semi-automatic and fully\nautomatic loading and unloading, delivering high welding efficiency and one-step forming with\naesthetic weld seams, superior tightness and minimal deformation.\n\n## Precision Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][203] [\n\n## YAG Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][204] [\n\n## Fiber Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][205] [\n\n## Semiconductor Laser Welding Equipment\n\n][206] [\n\n## Plastic Laser Welding Machines\n\n][207] [\n\n## Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines\n\n][208] [\n\n## Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles\n\n][209]\nShow More +\n\n## Precision Laser Welding Equipment\n\n### MOLD 301\n\n][210] [\n\n### MOLD 302\n\n][211] [\n\n### Laser welding machine for motor stator core\n\n][212] [\n\n### Sensor welding system\n\n][213] [\n\n### High precision five-axis linkage welding system\n\n][214] [\n\n### Fully automatic laser solder ball spray welding system\n\n][215] [\n\n### Integrated Handheld Welding Machine\n\n][216] [\n\n### W150G\n\n][217]\n\n## YAG Laser Welding Equipment\n\n### PB80\n\n][218] [\n\n### PB300CE\n\n][219] [\n\n### WF600\n\n][220] [\n\n### PG3\n\n][221] [\n\n### PB25CE\n\n][222]\n\n## Fiber Laser Welding Equipment\n\n### SFP300\n\n][223] [\n\n### FP300\n\n][224] [\n\n### FP150\n\n][225] [\n\n### SFP150\n\n][226]\n\n## Semiconductor Laser Welding Equipment\n\n### WFD10/25/50/100/1000\n\n][227]\n\n## Plastic Laser Welding Machines\n\n### Quasi-synchronous Laser Welding System (Rotating Double Station)\n\n][228] [\n\n### Quasi-synchronous Laser Welding System (Sliding Table Double Station)\n\n][229] [\n\n### General Single Station Quasi-Synchronous Laser Welding System\n\n][230]\n\n## Soldering and Special Laser Welding Machines\n\n### Dual-Station Constant Temperature Solder Paste Welding System\n\n][231] [\n\n### Single-Station Solder Ball Soldering System\n\n][232] [\n\n### Dual-Station Constant Temperature Solder Ring Welding System\n\n][233] [\n\n### Dual-Station Laser Welding System for Mobile Phone Structural Components\n\n][234] [\n\n### Mobile Stud Laser Welding System\n\n][235] [\n\n### High Power Laser Welding System For Mobile Phone Structural Components\n\n][236] [\n\n### Strip Laser Splicing Welding System\n\n][237]\n\n## Laser Welding Machines for Vehicles\n\n### Remote Laser Welding Workstation for Automotive A/B/D Pillars\n\n][238] [\n\n### Remote Laser Welding System for Car Seat Slides\n\n][239] [\n\n### Remote Laser Welding System for Automotive Radiator Bracket\n\n][240] [\n\n### Laser Welding System for Car Seat Recliners & Height Adjusters\n\n][241] [\n\n### Laser Wire Filling Welding System for Instrument Panel Bracket\n\n][242] [\n\n### Laser Welding Machine for Front & Rear Car Seat Frames\n\n][243] [\n\n### Remote Laser Welding Workstation for Automotive Sunroofs\n\n][244] [\n\n### Laser Hybrid Welding Machine for Non-load-bearing Vehicle Underframe\n\n][245] [\n\n### Remote Laser Welding Workstation for Automotive Sill Plates\n\n][246]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][247]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][248]\n* [Our History][249]\n* [Global Footprint][250]\n* [Certificates & Honors][251]\n* [Sustainability][252]\n* [Join Us][253]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][254]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][255]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][256]\n* [General Components][257]\n* [Special Machines][258]\n* [Automation][259]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][260]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][261]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][262]\n* [PCB Industry][263]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][264]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][265]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][266]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][267]\n* [Packaging Industry][268]\n* [Transportation][269]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][270]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][271]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][272]\n* [Global Service Network][273]\n* [FAQ][274]\n[ [Share Icon] ][275]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][276] [Privacy Policy][277] [Site Map][278]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][279] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][280]\n[ [Top] ][281]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /produ