 Fiber Laser\n\n### HFM-H Series 20\u201350W Pulsed Fiber Laser\n\n][212]\n\n## UV & Ultrafast Lasers\n\n### UV Nanosecond Laser\n\n][213]\n\n## Femtosecond & Sub-Nanosecond Lasers\n\n### HPF-50-IR\n\n][214]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][215]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][216]\n* [Our History][217]\n* [Global Footprint][218]\n* [Certificates & Honors][219]\n* [Sustainability][220]\n* [Join Us][221]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][222]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][223]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][224]\n* [General Components][225]\n* [Special Machines][226]\n* [Automation][227]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][228]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][229]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][230]\n* [PCB Industry][231]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][232]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][233]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][234]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][235]\n* [Packaging Industry][236]\n* [Transportation][237]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][238]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][239]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][240]\n* [Global Service Network][241]\n* [FAQ][242]\n[ [Share Icon] ][243]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][244] [Privacy Policy][245] [Site Map][246]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][247] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][248]\n[ [Top] ][249]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-4\n[15]: /products/laser-