\n\n][210] [\n\n### Watch band edge sealing deep learning automatic welding system\n\n][211] [\n\n### Automotive Glass Laser Marking Automated Production Line\n\n][212]\n[logo]\n[logo]\n[Contact Icon]\n+86-400-666-4000\n[Contact Icon]\n[global@hanslaser.com][213]\n[Contact Icon]\nHan's Laser Technology Center, No. 9988 Shennan Boulevard, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong\n518057, China\nAbout Us\n* [About Han's Laser][214]\n* [Our History][215]\n* [Global Footprint][216]\n* [Certificates & Honors][217]\n* [Sustainability][218]\n* [Join Us][219]\nProducts\n* [Laser Marking Machines][220]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][221]\n* [Laser Welding Machines][222]\n* [General Components][223]\n* [Special Machines][224]\n* [Automation][225]\nApplications\n* [New Energy Lithium-ion Battery][226]\n* [Photovoltaic (PV) & Solar Energy][227]\n* [Display & Semiconductor][228]\n* [PCB Industry][229]\n* [Electronic Information Industry][230]\n* [Mechanical Hardware][231]\n* [Home Appliance & Kitchen-Bath][232]\n* [Sheet Metal Fabrication][233]\n* [Packaging Industry][234]\n* [Transportation][235]\n* [Textile & Ornament Industry][236]\n* [Automotive Manufacturing][237]\nServices\n* [Resource Center][238]\n* [Global Service Network][239]\n* [FAQ][240]\n[ [Share Icon] ][241]\nCopyright \u00a9 Han's Laser Technology Industry Group Co. Ltd,\n[Legal Statement][242] [Privacy Policy][243] [Site Map][244]\n[Contact]\nContact Us\n][245] [\n[Phone]\nSales Hotline\n+86-400-666-4000\n][246]\n[ [Top] ][247]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about.html\n[3]: /about.html#about\n[4]: /about.html#history\n[5]: /about.html#global\n[6]: /about.html#honors\n[7]: /sustainability.html\n[8]: https://app.mokahr.com/social-recruitment/hanslaser/46382#/\n[9]: javascript:;\n[10]: /products/laser-marking/\n[11]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-2\n[12]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-3\n[13]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-29\n[14]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-4\n[15]: /products/laser-marking/#Anchor-5\n[16]: /products/lase