      "company_summary": "IPG Photonics is a global leader in fiber laser technology, offering innovative laser solutions for a wide range of applications including materials processing, medical procedures, and scientific research. The company provides high-power fiber lasers, handheld laser systems, and robotic automation solutions tailored for industries such as automotive, energy, and manufacturing. With a commitment to optimizing processes through custom application development and ongoing technical support, IPG Photonics serves diverse markets including electric vehicle manufacturers and general manufacturing sectors.",
