        "crawl_text": "IPG Photonics Corporation Publicly traded company North America Europe Asia ISO 9001:2015 ISO 50001:2018 ISO 14001:2015 Fiber Laser Technology High-Efficiency Lasers Real-Time Weld Measurement Robotic Automation Laser Processing Solutions Dual-Beam Technology Global leader in fiber laser technology High efficiency and energy savings Comprehensive range of laser solutions High-performance fiber laser technology Strong customer support Global presence High power and reliability Energy efficiency Vertical integration for quality control High efficiency and reliability of fiber lasers Wide range of laser solutions for various applications Strong customer support and service High-performance fiber lasers Innovative laser technology ISO 9001 Laser Safety Standards ISO 9001:2015 ISO 50001:2018 ISO 14001:2015 Environmental regulations Marlborough, Mass. Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India Marlborough, MA Oxford, MA San Jose, CA Huntsville, AL Davenport, IA Oviedo, FL Novi, MI Minneapolis, MN Burlington, ON, Canada Kingston, ON, Canada Monterrey, Mexico Oxford, Massachusetts, USA Germany USA India United States Canada Mexico Germany Italy France China Japan Poland South Korea Taiwan Singapore USA Germany Italy Poland United States China Global North America Europe Asia IPG Photonics is a leader in fiber laser technology, providing high-performance solutions for various industries. The company emphasizes sustainability and energy efficiency in its product offerings. IPG Photonics has built over 7,000 laser systems and deployed over 6,500 robotic solutions. The company serves more than 800 laser system customers globally. IPG Photonics is a leader in fiber laser technology, providing solutions for various industries including automotive and medical devices. The company emphasizes sustainability in its laser cleaning processes, eliminating the need for harmful chemicals. IPG's products are designed to enhance manufacturing efficiency and quality. The company focuses on innovation and sustainability in its manufacturing processes. Introduction of new laser systems for medical device manufacturing and e-mobility applications. Launch of the LaserCell 2000 Automated Laser Cleaning System, enhancing surface processing capabilities. Introduction of the LightWELD Cobot System for collaborative laser welding. Introduction of new high-efficiency laser heating sources for industrial applications. Expansion of manufacturing capabilities in Asia. Expanding product offerings in the medical device sector. Enhancing energy efficiency and sustainability in laser technology. Expanding product offerings in the laser technology sector Enhancing customer support and service capabilities Expanding product offerings in the e-mobility sector, particularly for EV battery manufacturing. Enhancing global presence in key markets such as Asia and Europe. Enhancing product offerings in the e-mobility sector. Investing in research and development for advanced laser technologies. Competition from other laser manufacturers. Regulatory changes affecting manufacturing standards. Competition from other laser manufacturers Market fluctuations affecting demand for laser systems Competition from other laser technology manufacturers. Economic fluctuations affecting manufacturing sectors. Regulatory changes affecting manufacturing processes. Growing demand for laser technology in medical and automotive industries. Expansion into emerging markets. Growing demand for automation in manufacturing Increasing applications of laser technology in various industries Growing demand for laser technology in the automotive and aerospace industries. Expansion into emerging markets with increasing manufacturing capabilities. Growing demand for laser solutions in the automotive and medical sectors. Global leader in fiber laser technology Increasing adoption of laser technology in manufacturing processes. Expansion of applications in medical and automotive sectors. Technological advancements in laser technology Expansion into new markets and applications Expansion of e-mobility and renewable energy sectors. Rising demand for automation and precision in industrial applications. [ [IPG Photonics Corporation] ][1] Toggle Menu\n[search]\n* [ Handheld Lasers ][2] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Handheld Lasers][3]\n* [LightWELD Handheld Laser Welding & Cleaning ][4]\n* [ Lasers + Optics ][5] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Lasers + Optics][6]\n* [Industrial CW Fiber Lasers ][7] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Industrial CW Fiber Lasers][8]\n* [High-Power Fiber Lasers ][9]\n* [High-Efficiency Fiber Lasers ][10]\n* [Ultra-Compact Fiber Lasers ][11]\n* [Multi-Beam Fiber Lasers ][12]\n* [Single-Mode Fiber Lasers ][13]\n* [Dual-Mode Fiber Lasers ][14]\n* [Erbium, Thulium & Raman Fiber Lasers ][15]\n* [Laser Heating Sources ][16]\n* [Quasi-CW Fiber Lasers ][17]\n* [Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][18] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Nanosecond Fiber Lasers][19]\n* [Infrared Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][20]\n* [Green & Visible Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][21]\n* [Ultraviolet Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][22]\n* [Ultrafast Fiber Lasers ][23]\n* [Diode Lasers ][24]\n* [Deep UV Lasers ][25]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Lasers ][26] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Advanced & Scientific Lasers][27]\n* [Linearly Polarized & Single Frequency ][28]\n* [Fiber Amplifiers ][29]\n* [Single-Mode & Low Order Mode CW Lasers ][30]\n* [Mid-IR Hybrid Lasers ][31]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers & Solutions for Science ][32]\n* [Beam Delivery ][33] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Beam Delivery][34]\n* [Laser Processing Heads ][35] Go to child menu\n* Back to Beam Delivery\n* #### [Laser Processing Heads][36]\n* [Laser Scanning Heads ][37]\n* [Laser Welding Heads ][38]\n* [Laser Wobble Welding Heads ][39]\n* [Laser Cutting Heads ][40]\n* [Integrated Scanners & Markers ][41]\n* [Beam Switches, Shutters & Couplers ][42]\n* [Collimators ][43]\n* [Components ][44] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Components][45]\n* [Bragg Gratings ][46]\n* [Packaged Diodes ][47]\n* [ Laser Systems ][48] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Laser Systems][49]\n* [E-Mobility Laser Systems ][50] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [E-Mobility Laser Systems][51]\n* [Battery Welding R&D Workstations ][52]\n* [Battery Welding Systems ][53]\n* [Robotic Welding Systems ][54]\n* [EV Battery Manufacturing Lines ][55]\n* [Custom E-Mobility Laser Systems ][56]\n* [Medical Device Laser Systems ][57] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Medical Device Laser Systems][58]\n* [Multi-Application Laser Workstations ][59]\n* [Tube & Stent Cutting Systems ][60]\n* [Glovebox Systems ][61]\n* [Precision Flatbed Laser Cutting Systems ][62]\n* [Laser Curing Systems ][63]\n* [Laser Systems by Application ][64] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Laser Systems by Application][65]\n* [Laser Systems for Cutting ][66]\n* [Laser Systems for Welding ][67]\n* [Laser Systems for Cleaning ][68]\n* [Laser Systems for Heating & Drying ][69]\n* [Laser Systems for Drilling ][70]\n* [Laser Systems for Marking ][71]\n* [Integrated Sub-Systems ][72] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Integrated Sub-Systems][73]\n* [Laser Sources & Scanners ][74]\n* [Laser Heating Sources ][75]\n* [Laser Overlap Welding ][76]\n* [Tube & Pipe Welding ][77]\n* [Integrated Laser Welding Systems ][78]\n* [Laser Workstations ][79] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Laser Workstations][80]\n* [LaserCube - Cutting ][81]\n* [Tube & Stent Cutting ][82]\n* [Glovebox Welding ][83]\n* [LaserCube - Drilling ][84]\n* [Multi-Application Laser Workstations ][85]\n* [Laser Heating Workstations ][86]\n* [Custom Laser Workstations ][87]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][88] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Robotic Laser Systems][89]\n* [LaserCell 2000 ][90]\n* [LaserCell 4000 ][91]\n* [Welding LaserCell ][92]\n* [Integrated Laser Welding Systems ][93]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][94]\n* [Counter-UAS ][95]\n* [LightWELD Cobot Systems ][96]\n* [Custom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* Products\n[image]\n\n## Products\n\nFrom individual packaged diodes to the industry's widest range of fiber laser sources to beam\ndelivery and turnkey laser systems, IPG designs and manufactures everything needed to implement a\nworld class laser solution for any industry or application. IPG products are highly configurable and\nspecifications can be optimized and adjusted to maximize productivty and simplify integration.\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### IPG Lasers\n\nFrom milliwatts to more than one hundred killowatts, from UV to Mid-IR, and from continuous wave to\nultrafast, IPG lasers address a wide range of applications and industries including industrial,\nautomotive, biomedical, scientific, telecom, and more.\n\n][159]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Laser Systems\n\nPowered by the best fiber lasers in the industry and equipped with high precision components, IPG\nlaser systems are built to meet the needs of both high power laser machining and micro laser\nmaterials processing applications.\n\n][160]\n[IPG Image]\n\n# Beam Delivery\n\nIPG manufactures a complete set of optical beam delivery components, including scanners and process\nheads, beam couplers, beam switches, and collimators, all ready for seamless integration with IPG\nfiber lasers.\n\n][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Components & Accessories\n\nIPG offers a variety of components and accessories including single-emitter fiber-pigtailed diodes\nfor customers looking to integrate fiber-coupled modules and a variety of volume Bragg gratings.\n\n][162]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Robotic Automation\n\nAutomated robotic and cobotic systems\n\n][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n* [ Legal Notice ][165]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][166]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][167]\n* [ Imprint ][168]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /produc"
