ems ][48] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Laser Systems][49]\n* [E-Mobility Laser Systems ][50] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [E-Mobility Laser Systems][51]\n* [Battery Welding R&D Workstations ][52]\n* [Battery Welding Systems ][53]\n* [Robotic Welding Systems ][54]\n* [EV Battery Manufacturing Lines ][55]\n* [Custom E-Mobility Laser Systems ][56]\n* [Medical Device Laser Systems ][57] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Medical Device Laser Systems][58]\n* [Multi-Application Laser Workstations ][59]\n* [Tube & Stent Cutting Systems ][60]\n* [Glovebox Systems ][61]\n* [Precision Flatbed Laser Cutting Systems ][62]\n* [Laser Curing Systems ][63]\n* [Laser Systems by Application ][64] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Laser Systems by Application][65]\n* [Laser Systems for Cutting ][66]\n* [Laser Systems for Welding ][67]\n* [Laser Systems for Cleaning ][68]\n* [Laser Systems for Heating & Drying ][69]\n* [Laser Systems for Drilling ][70]\n* [Laser Systems for Marking ][71]\n* [Integrated Sub-Systems ][72] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Integrated Sub-Systems][73]\n* [Laser Sources & Scanners ][74]\n* [Laser Heating Sources ][75]\n* [Laser Overlap Welding ][76]\n* [Tube & Pipe Welding ][77]\n* [Integrated Laser Welding Systems ][78]\n* [Laser Workstations ][79] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Laser Workstations][80]\n* [LaserCube - Cutting ][81]\n* [Tube & Stent Cutting ][82]\n* [Glovebox Welding ][83]\n* [LaserCube - Drilling ][84]\n* [Multi-Application Laser Workstations ][85]\n* [Laser Heating Workstations ][86]\n* [Custom Laser Workstations ][87]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][88] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Robotic Laser Systems][89]\n* [LaserCell 2000 ][90]\n* [LaserCell 4000 ][91]\n* [Welding LaserCell ][92]\n* [Integrated Laser Welding Systems ][93]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][94]\n* [Counter-UAS ][95]\n* [LightWELD Cobot Systems ][96]\n* [Custom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* Products\n[image]\n\n## Products\n\nFrom individual packaged diodes to the industry's widest range of fiber laser sources to beam\ndelivery and turnkey laser systems, IPG designs and manufactures everything needed to implement a\nworld class laser solution for any industry or application. IPG products are highly configurable and\nspecifications can be optimized and adjusted to maximize productivty and simplify integration.\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### IPG Lasers\n\nFrom milliwatts to more than one hundred killowatts, from UV to Mid-IR, and from continuous wave to\nultrafast, IPG lasers address a wide range of applications and industries including industrial,\nautomotive, biomedical, scientific, telecom, and more.\n\n][159]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Laser Systems\n\nPowered by the best fiber lasers in the industry and equipped with high precision components, IPG\nlaser systems are built to meet the needs of both high power laser machining and micro laser\nmaterials processing applications.\n\n][160]\n[IPG Image]\n\n# Beam Delivery\n\nIPG manufactures a complete set of optical beam delivery components, including scanners and process\nheads, beam couplers, beam switches, and collimators, all ready for seamless integration with IPG\nfiber lasers.\n\n][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Components & Accessories\n\nIPG offers a variety of components and accessories including single-emitter fiber-pigtailed diodes\nfor customers looking to integrate fiber-coupled modules and a variety of volume Bragg gratings.\n\n][162]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Robotic Automation\n\nAutomated robotic and cobotic systems\n\n][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n* [ Legal Notice ][165]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][166]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][167]\n* [ Imprint ][168]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascrip