ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n[IPG Photonics: Applying Light to Transform the World]\n\n## IPG Photonics: Applying Light to Transform the World\n\nThe Global Leader in Fiber Laser Technology\n\n[IPG Photonics: Applying Light to Transform the World]\n\n## IPG Photonics: Applying Light to Transform the World\n\nThe Global Leader in Fiber Laser Technology\n\n[IPG Photonics: Applying Light to Transform the World]\n\n## IPG Photonics: Applying Light to Transform the World\n\nThe Global Leader in Fiber Laser Technology\n\n[image]\n* [Home][158]\n* Company\n\n# Our Mission\n\nAs the global leader in fiber laser technology, our innovative laser solutions are designed to\nexceed the ever-evolving demands across nearly every industry and application for materials\nprocessing, medical applications, and scientific endeavors. At IPG Photonics, we are laser experts\nand pioneers with decades of experience dedicated to revolutionizing production, redefining what\u2019s\npossible, and improving the world around us.\n\nWe envision a future driven by the most reliable and sustainable IPG laser technology that enables\nindustries to increase productivity and decrease costs with cutting-edge laser solutions. Our\ncontinuous innovation and dedication to designing and delivering the highest quality laser solutions\nequips global manufacturers, institutions, and laboratories with technologies that allow them to\naccomplish more and create a sustainable future.\n\n## +\n\nLocations\n\nLocations\n\n## ~\n\nEmployees\n\nEmployees\n\nYear Founded\n\nYear Founded\n\n## 30+ Years of IPG Innovation\n\nSince 1990, IPG has been applying light to transform the world. Today, we offer a broad range of\nhigh-performance lasers and laser systems that are used in material processing, medical procedures,\nand advanced applications.\n\nOur pioneering innovation has consistently shaped the laser industry landscape, driving the\nwidespread adoption of laser solutions across diverse applications and sectors. Renowned for\nproducing the most energy-efficient lasers globally, we empower our customers to reduce costs while\ncontributing to energy savings and reductions in CO2 emissions.\n\nIn tandem with industry growth, IPG has expanded its presence, establishing manufacturing\nfacilities, application laboratories, and service centers in over 30 countries that are supported by\na team of over 4,000 dedicated employees. Every day, customers across numerous industries place\ntheir trust in IPG's laser technology to manufacture billions of products and contribute to a\nsustainable and prosperous future.\n\n[Learn More][159]\n\n[IPG Corporate Leadership]\n\n### Our Leadership\n\nOur management and board of directors play a pivotal role in steering the company towards enduring\ncontinuity. With a collective vision for sustained growth and progress, our leadership plays a key\nrole in charting the course for the company's ongoing success.\n\n[Learn More][160]\n[Social Responsibility]\n\n### Social Responsibility\n\nIPG Photonics is committed to giving back to our communities, funding educational programs and\nimproving our environment for future generations. Read more about our journey towards creating a\nbrighter and more sustainable future for generations to come.\n\n[Learn More][161]\n[IPG Careers]\n\n### Working at IPG\n\nEmbark on a global career journey with IPG Photonics. We're on the lookout for talented individuals\nto join our diverse team. Whether you're an engineer, scientist, finance professional, or have\nexpertise in sales and marketing, there's a place for you at IPG. Explore exciting opportunities and\nbe a part of our innovative and dynamic work culture.\n\n[Learn More][162]\n[IPG News]\n\n### Newsroom\n\nExplore our newsroom to discover the newest insights, product releases, and company announcements.\nStay connected with IPG Photonics as we share stories that highlight our ongoing commitment to\ninnovation and excellence in the field of photonics.\n\n[Read More][163]\n\n## Upcoming Events\n* [High Power Laser Applications Workshop]\n\n##### Jul 02-02, 2026\n\nIPG Photonics GmbH, Burbach, Germany\n\n[Event Details][164]\n* [AMTS 2026]\n\n##### Jul 08-10, 2026\n\nShanghai, China\n\n[Event Details][165]\n* [Laser Korea 2026]\n\n##### Jul 08-10, 2026\n\nSeoul, Korea (South)\n\n[Event Details][166]\n* [Laser & Photonics Taiwan]\n\n##### Aug 19-22, 2026\n\nNangang District, Taipei City, Taiwan\n\n[Event Details][167]\n* [Laser World of Photonics India]\n\n##### Sep 16-18, 2026\n\nBIEC, Bengaluru, India\n\n[Event Details][168]\n* [The Battery Show North America]\n\n##### Oct 12-15, 2026\n\nDetroit, MI, USA\n\n[Event Details][169]\n* [FABTECH Las Vegas 2026]\n\n##### Oct 21-23, 2026\n\nLas Vegas, NV, USA\n\n[Event Details][170]\n\n[View All Events][171]\n\n## Worldwide Locations\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n[View All Locations][172]\n* [ Resources ][173]\n* [ Legal Notice ][174]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][175]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][176]\n* [ Imprint ][177]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lase