8]\n* [Solutions][159]\n* Application Development\n[Laser Application Development]\n\n## Laser Application Development\n\n## We develop solutions that do more than just work \u2014 they excel\n\nLaser solutions are uniquely powerful, but they aren\u2019t always one-size-fits-all. From ideation to\nengineering and integration, we develop and deliver your ideal solution.\n\nCombining decades of laser innovation with thousands of laser system installations, our unique\ncombination of expertise translates directly to customer success. Even if that means redefining\nwhat\u2019s possible in the process.\n\n[Tell Us About Your Application][160]\n\n## Our Core Competencies\n\n### Applications\n* Laser welding\n* Laser micromachining\n* Laser cleaning\n* Laser cutting & drilling\n* Laser heating & drying\n* Laser additive manufacturing\n* Laser marking\n* Laser process monitoring\n* Advanced & scientific\n\n### Industries\n* General manufacturing\n* Automotive & e-mobility\n* Battery & power storage\n* Energy & solar\n* Medical procedures\n* Medical devices\n* Heavy industry\n* Agriculture\n* Consumer goods & appliances\n* Transportation\n* Aerospace\n* Science & analysis\n\n### Engineering\n* Laser automation\n* Virtual system concepting & simulation\n* Process & cycle time estimation\n* Variation Simulation Analysis (VSA)\n* Weld Distortion Analysis (WDA)\n* Prototyping assistance\n* Robotic integration\n* Belt & linear motor motion stages\n* Machine vision & inspection\n* Work cells & production lines\n* Part design optimization\n\n## Learn More About Our Capabilities\n\n[Application Labs]\n\n#### Application Labs\n\nCombining state-of-the-art laser and analysis technology with global laser expertise.\n\n[Learn More][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n#### Custom Systems & Tooling\n\nWork with our laser manufacturing experts to take your operation to the next level.\n\n[Learn More][162]\n[IPG Image]\n\n#### Virtual Engineering\n\nWe bridge the gap between prototype and production with unique virtual engineering and simulation\ncapabilities.\n\n[Learn More][163]\n\n**Talk to a Laser Expert**\n\n## GETTING STARTED IS EASY\n\n[Tell Us About Your Application][164]\n\n### Laser Application Development FAQ\n\n#### [arrow] How do I know if I need laser application development?\n\nNot every application or operation has a perfect turnkey solution. Some common applications, such as\nflat sheet laser cutting, are well served by standard systems like [LaserCube][165]. Other\napplications, such as micro-welding, might require additional development.\n\nWhether you are a small shop, large manufacturer, OEM, or integrator, tell us about your application\nand we will help you identify a solution.\n\n#### [arrow] How much does laser application development cost?\n\nGetting started is free. Whether you just want to talk to a laser expert or send us your parts for\ndevelopment and analysis in our application labs, we\u2019ll provide recommendations and reports free of\ncharge. Then, if you choose to partner with IPG, we will provide a quote for the necessary products\nand services.\n\n#### [arrow] What kind of solutions do you build?\n\nWe are a vertically integrated laser solutions provider that builds everything from individual laser\ncomponents and laser sources to turnkey and custom laser systems. We have deep expertise in building\nboth custom laser sources and fully automated laser solutions.\n\n#### [arrow] I have no laser experience. Is that ok?\n\nThat\u2019s what we are here for. No one at your operation needs to be a laser expert or have previous\nexperience with laser technology (although we\u2019re happy to teach you). We\u2019ll help optimize both the\nresults of the laser-material interaction as well as engineering and production details.\n* [ Resources ][166]\n* [ Legal Notice ][167]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][168]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][169]\n* [ Imprint ][170]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[36]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[37]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-scanning-heads\n[38]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-welding-heads\n[39]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/wobble-welding-heads\n[40]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-cutting-heads\n[41]: /products/beam-de"
