ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Company][159]\n* Careers\n[image]\n\nCareers\n\n## Join us!\n\nApply light in ways that improve life and make the world a better place.\n\n[Search Jobs][160]\n[Background Image]\n\n## Fueling Innovation through a Collaborative Workforce\n\nWe believe that an engaged and focused workforce creates a better future for our company and the\ncommunities in which we live and work.\n\nOur employees are at the heart of our success: the tapestry of their individual skills and\nexperiences weaving together to inspire our finest innovations.\n\nYear founded\n\nYear founded\n\n## +\n\nLocations\n\nLocations\n\n## ~\n\nNumber of Employees\n\nNumber of Employees\n\n[shape-below-events]\n\n## Featured Jobs\n* [US & Canada][161]\n* [Europe][162]\n* [Asia][163]\n* #### Senior Quality Engineer\n\n##### Oxford, MA\n\nEngineering\n\n[Apply Now!][164]\n* #### Inside Sales Representative\n\n##### Marlborough, MA\n\nSales & Marketing\n\n[Apply Now!][165]\n* #### Medical Device Manufacturing Engineer\n\n##### Marlborough, MA\n\nEngineering\n\n[Apply Now!][166]\n* #### Lead FP&A Analyst\n\n##### Marlborough, MA\n\nAccounting & Finance\n\n[Apply Now!][167]\n* #### Mechanical Engineer II- Machine Design\n\n##### Minneapolis, MN\n\nEngineering\n\n[Apply Now!][168]\n* #### Laser Application Engineer\n\n##### Marlborough, MA\n\nEngineering\n\n[Apply Now!][169]\n* #### Technician II- Cleanroom\n\n##### Oxford, MA\n\nManufacturing\n\n[Apply Now!][170]\n* #### Senior Opto Mechanical Engineer\n\n##### Oxford, MA\n\nEngineering\n\n[Apply Now!][171]\n* #### Payroll Specialist-\n#### A/R duties\n\n##### Oxford, MA\n\nAccounting\n\n[Apply Now!][172]\n* #### Sr. Software Engineer- C#\n\n##### Davenport, IA\n\nEngineering\n\n[Apply Now!][173]\n\n[All US & Canada Jobs][174]\n* #### Pracownik Produkcji\n\n##### Gliwice, Poland\n\nIngenieurswesen\n\n[Aplikuj Teraz!][175]\n* #### Pracownik Produkcji\n\n##### Gliwice, Poland\n\n[Aplikuj Teraz!][176]\n[All Europe Jobs][177]\n* #### 3D\u6253\u5370\u552e\u524d\u6280\u672f\u652f\u6301\n\n##### \u4e0a\u6d77/\u534e\u4e1c\n\n[\u9a6c\u4e0a\u5e94\u8058][178]\n* #### \u9500\u552e\u7ecf\u7406/\u4e3b\u7ba1\n\n##### \u4e0a\u6d77/\u534e\u4e1c\n\n[\u9a6c\u4e0a\u5e94\u8058][179]\n* #### \u6fc0\u5149\u9500\u552e\u7ecf\u7406-\u6fc0\u5149\u6e05\u6d17\n\n##### \u4e0a\u6d77/\u534e\u4e1c\n\n[\u9a6c\u4e0a\u5e94\u8058][180]\n* #### \u5e02\u573a\u4e13\u5458\n\n##### \u4e0a\u6d77/\u534e\u4e1c\n\n[\u9a6c\u4e0a\u5e94\u8058][181]\n* #### \u589e\u6750\u5236\u9020\u5e02\u573a\u5f00\u53d1\u7ecf\u7406\n\n##### \u4e0a\u6d77/\u534e\u4e1c\n\n[\u9a6c\u4e0a\u5e94\u8058][182]\n[All Asia Jobs][183]\n\n## Important notice for job seekers\n\nIPG Photonics Corporation has become aware of scammers impersonating IPG\u2019s recruitment team through\nthe posting of fraudulent job openings and by contacting job seekers with fictitious job offers.\nThese scammers have even been using IPG\u2019s name and logo to conduct fraudulent interviews to obtain\npersonal and financial information from job seekers. We are doing all that we can to resolve this\nissue.\n\n[Learn More][184]\n\n## We have opportunities that match your experience\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### Finance\n\nNavigating Financial Excellence\n\nThe Finance team ensures the stability and growth of IPG through strategic financial planning and\nfiscal responsibility.\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### HR\n\nNurturing Talent, Building Futures\n\nWe are dedicated to nurturing talent and fostering a culture of excellence, from recruitment to\nprofessional development, building futures within the organization\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### IT\n\nEmpowering Connectivity, Ensuring Security\n\nFrom network infrastructure to cybersecurity, our IT professionals ensure seamless operations,\nenabling our entire organization to work in a secure and efficient digital environment.\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### Logistics\n\nSeamlessly Connecting the World\n\nOur Logistics team ensures our solutions reach every corner of the globe, connecting technology\nwith customers through efficient supply chain management\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### Marketing\n\nConnecting Innovation to Hearts and Minds\n\nWe highlight the possibilities of fiber laser technology, inspiring connections and possibilities.\nThrough strategic communication, we bring fiber laser innovation and solutions to the world.\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### R&D\n\nInnovating Tomorrow\u2019s Solutions Today\n\nOur R&D team is dedicated to pioneering cutting-edge technologies in fiber laser, pushing\nboundaries and driving innovation that redefines industries globally.\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### Production\n\nPrecision Manufacturing, Global Excellence\n\nThe backbone of our global operations, our Production team manufactures state-of-the-art products\nwith precision engineering and expertise to provide solutions for industries worldwide.\n* [IPG Image]\n\n#### Sales\n\nConnecting Solutions to Needs\n\nOur Sales team connects innovative fiber laser solutions to real-world challenges. Through\ncollaborative relationships, we drive growth and deliver value across diverse industries.\n\n[Total Rewards]\n\n### Total Rewards\n\n**IPG offers competitive benefit and compensation packages designed to support and retain our\nemployees.**\n\n**Our benefits are thoughtfully tailored to local needs, encompassing:**\n* Health and dental insurance coverage\n* Retirement savings plans\n* Bonuses\n* Employee stock purchase plan\n\n## Employee Spotlight\n\n[Alt] [Alt] [Alt] [Alt]\n\n## We Foster a Culture of Dignity, Respect and Caring\n\nWe believe that we are made better and stronger by welcoming new ideas from all employees to help\nshape our business choices, and that we benefit from open dialogue between employees with many\ndifferent backgrounds and experiences.\n\n### We embrace individual experience\n\nAt IPG, we strive to nurture a welcoming environment where each employee\u2019s unique background,\nexperiences and perspectives are valued.\n\nOur employees\u2019 ability to work to their fullest potential is enhanced by creating a culture of\nbelonging. We believe an engaged and focused workforce creates a better future for our company and\nthe communities in which we operate.\n\n### Community is core to who we are\n\nIPG actively contributes to non-profit organizations and programs that focus on education, civic &\nsocial services, arts & culture and health & welfare. We recognize the importance of helping our\nneighborhoods and we strive to meaningfully contribute to our local communities.\n\nBy donating over $4.1 million since 2018, IPG supports multiple charities across the world with the\ngoal of promoting community engagement and advancing economic opportunities.\n\n## Your Values Are Our Values\n\nAt IPG, we have a culture of innovation driven by an entrepreneurial spirit and embraced within an\nenvironment of individual respect, dignity, and caring. Every"
          },
