ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Company][159]\n* Policies & Standards\n[image]\n\nCompany\n\n## Policies & Standards\n\n[Background Image]\n\n## Ensuring Excellence Every Step of the Way\n\nIPG is committed to being accountable and transparent when interacting with our customers,\nemployees, suppliers and stockholders. We are dedicated to supporting local organizations and\nconducting business with the highest integrity.\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Laser Safety\n\nIPG Photonics supplies our unique line of fiber lasers and amplifiers to systems integrators as well\nas directly to end-users. Because IPG provides products to a variety of end users, it is our desire\nto provide basic information on the topic of laser safety.\n\n][160]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Quality Standards\n\nAs a long-time OEM supplier, IPG is intimately familiar with the understandably unforgiving\nstandards expected of component and subsystem vendors. We know our customers depend on our lasers\nand amplifiers to operate without failure in mission-critical and safety-critical applications.\n\n][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Superior Suppliers\n\nIPG relies on best-of-class suppliers for our innovative and advanced fiber devices. We look for\nvendors with a proven record of accomplishment, superior products and services on a performance and\ncost basis and capacity to meet our and our customer needs.\n\n][162]\n* [ Resources ][163]\n* [ Legal Notice ][164]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][165]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][166]\n* [ Imprint ][167]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[36]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[37]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-scanning-heads\n[38]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-welding-heads\n[39]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/wobble-welding-heads\n[40]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-cutting-heads\n[41]: /products/beam-delivery/integrated-laser-scanners\n[42]: /products/beam-delivery/beam-switches-shutters-couplers\n[43]: /products/beam-delivery/collimators\n[44]: /products/components-accessories\n[45]: /products/components-accessories\n[46]: https://www.optigrate.com/\n[47]: /products/components-accessories/packaged-diodes\n[48]: javascript:void(0);\n[49]: /products/laser-systems\n[50]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-for-emobility-applications\n[51]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-for-emobility-applications\n[52]: /products/laser-systems/sys-3000-ev\n[53]: /products/laser-systems/battery-welding-systems\n[54]: /products/laser-systems/welding-lasercell\n[55]: /products/laser-systems/battery-manufacturing-lines\n[56]: /solutions/laser-application-development/custom-laser-systems-tooling\n[57]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-for-medical-device-manufacturing\n[58]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-for-medical-device-manufacturing\n[59]: /products/laser-systems/precision-laser-workstations\n[60]: /products/laser-systems/versa\n[61]: /products/laser-systems/glovebox\n[62]: /products/laser-systems/lasercube-cutting\n[63]: /products/laser-systems/modular-laser-curing-system\n[64]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application\n[65]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application\n[66]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application/laser-systems-for-cutting\n[67]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application/laser-systems-for-welding\n[68]: /en-us/products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application/laser-systems-for-cleaning\n[69]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application/laser-systems-for-heating-and-drying\n[70]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application/laser-systems-for-drilling\n[71]: /products/laser-systems/laser-systems-by-application/laser-systems-for-marking\n[72]: /products/laser-systems/integrated-sub-systems\n[73]: /products/laser-systems/integrated-sub-systems\n[74]: /products/beam-delivery/integrated-laser-scanners\n[7