8]\n* [Company][159]\n* Locations\n\n[image]\n\n## Global Locations\n\n[Background Image]\n\n## Our Offices & Application Centers\n\nIPG Photonics is headquartered in Marlborough, Massachusetts, United States, and has more than 30\nfacilities worldwide.\n\nOffices, field service personnel, and application centers are located in key areas to provide\napplication evaluations, laser demonstrations, and process development from our thousands of laser\nexperts.\n\n#### [arrow] Americas\n\n##### United States of America\n\n**Marlborough, MA**\n\n**IPG Photonics World Headquarters**\n377 Simarano Drive\nMarlborough, MA 01752\n+1.508.373.1100\n+1.877.980.1550\n**Fax: ** +1.508.373.1424\n[Contact Support][160]\n\n**IPG Medical - Cedar Hill Applications Center**\n225 Cedar Hill Street\nMarlborough, MA 01752\n+1.508.506.2800\n**Fax:** +1.508.229.2752\n\n**Oxford, MA**\n\n**IPG Photonics Corporation**\n50 Old Webster Road\nOxford, MA 01540\n+1.508.373.1100 ** **\n\n**San Jose, CA**\n\n**IPG Photonics - Silicon Valley Technology Center - Applications Center**\n2360 Bering Dr\nSan Jose CA 95131\n**Sales, Lasers & Components:** +1.351.322.0159\n**Sales, Integrated Laser Systems:** +1.669.333.4317\n\n**Huntsville, AL**\n\n**IPG Defense**\n9700 Advanced Gateway, Suite 200\nHuntsville, AL 35808\n\n**Davenport, IA**\n\n**Genesis Systems, IPG Photonics Company - Applications Center**\n8900 N Harrison St.\nDavenport, IA 52806\n563.445.5600\n\n**Oviedo, FL**\n\n**OptiGrate - Holographic Optical Components**\n552 South Econ Circle\nOviedo, Florida 32765-4311\n+1.407.542.7704\n+1.855.309.0314\n**Fax:** +1.407.542.7804\n\n**Novi, MI**\n\n**IPG Photonics - Midwest Operation and Applications Center **\n46695 Magellan Drive\nNovi, MI 48377\n+1.248.863.5001\n\n**Minneapolis, MN**\n\n**IPG Photonics - Materials Processing Systems and Applications Center**\n5110 Main Street Northeast\nSuite 1400\nMinneapolis, MN 55421\n+1.715.245.7856\n\n##### Canada\n\n**Burlington, ON**\n\n**IPG Photonics Canada**\n758 Shadeland Avenue\nBurlington, Ontario L7T 2M1** **\n1.905.379.6602\n\n**Kingston, ON**\n\n**IPG Photonics Canada, Laser Depth Dynamics**\n215 Resource Rd\nKingston, Ontario K7P 0K1\n+1 613-887-2331\n\n##### Mexico\n\n**Monterrey, M\u00e9xico**\n\n**IPG Photonics de Mexico - Applications Center**\nParque Industrial Sierra Madre, Av. Cazadores 212,\nSanta Catarina, Nuevo Leon, CP 66359\n(+52) 81-1354-2524\n\n**San Juan del Rio, M\u00e9xico**\n\n**IPG Genesis Mexico**\nTomas Alba Edison\nNum.7 Zona Industrial Valle de Oro\nSan Juan del R\u00edo, Quer\u00e9taro, CP 76803\n\n##### Brazil\n\n**S\u00e3o Paulo , Brazil**\n\n**IPG Fot\u00f4nica do Brasil Com\u00e9rcio Ltda. - Applications Center**\nRua \u00c1rtico, 41\nCotia, SP - 06707-050\n(+55) 11-4380-9932\n\n#### [arrow] Asia\n\n##### China\n\n**Beijing **\n\n**IPG (Beijing) Fiber Laser Technology Co., Ltd**.\nBuilding F28, BDA International Enterprise Avenue\n2 Jingyuan North St, Daxing District\nBeijing 100176, China ** **\n+86.10.5902.5200\n\n**Shanghai **\n\n**IPG (Beijing) Fiber Laser Technology Co., Ltd. Shanghai Branch - Applications Center**\nS/F, Block B, North Area E Link World,\n999 Huaxu Road, Qingpu District\nShanghai, China 201702\n+86.21.5058.6577\n\n**Shenzhen **\n\n**IPG (Beijing) Fiber Laser Technology Co.,Ltd. Shenzhen Branch - Applications Center **\n1/F, Building 3, Geya Technology Building,\nNanhuan Road, Gugangming District\nShenzhen, Guangdong, China 518106\n+86.755.2399.3780\n\n**Wuhan **\n\n**IPG (Beijing) Fiber Laser Technology Co., Ltd. Wuhan Branch**\n401, Block B1, Zhongdian Information Port, Tanhu East Road,\nJiangxia District, Wuhan City, China 430070\n+86.27.8741.5527\n\n##### India\n\n**Bangalore, India **\n\n**IPG Photonics (India) Pvt. Ltd., Headquarters and Applications Center**\nGround Floor G01 & G01A\nUnit - 108 First (1st) Floor\nBrigade Senate 2, Outer Ring Road,\nBhoopendra village, Kasaba Hobli # Hebbal\nBangalore North - 560094\n+91-95.6060.8808\n\n**Greater Noida, India **\n\n**IPG Photonics (India) Pvt. Ltd. Greater Noida Branch - Laser Application and Service Center **\nPlot No- 30/32 Knowledge Park-III\nGreater Noida - 201308, U.P., India\nTel: +91.95.6060.8808\n\n**Gujarat, India **\n\n**IPG Photonics (India) Pvt. Ltd. Ahmedabad Branch**\nInceptum ,B-Block, CH2 , 2nd Floor\nNext to Tranquli, Opposite Hotel Planet Landmark\nBopal Ambli Road, SG Highway, Ambli\nAhmedabad \u2013 380058, Gujarat, India\n[Contact Sales & Service ][161]\n\n##### Japan\n\n**Chubu, Japan **\n\n**IPG Photonics (Japan) Ltd. Chubu Branch - Applications Center**\n1-34-5 Mikawa-Anjo-Honmachi,\nAnjo-shi Aichi 446-0059, Japan\n+81(0)566.73.5101\n\n**Fukuoka, Japan**\n\n**IPG Photonics (Japan) Ltd. - Kyushu Technical Center**\n1-4-25 Yutaka, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka-shi,\nFukuoka 812-0042, Japan\n+81 (0)92-409-8680\n\n**Yokohama, Japan**\n\n**IPG Photonics (Japan) Ltd. - Japan Headquarters**\n920 Nippa-cho, Kohoku-ku,\nYokohama-shi Kanagawa, 223-0057, Japan\n+81 (0)45-716-9831\n\n##### Malaysia\n\n**Malaysia **\n\n**IPG Photonics (Asia) Limited - Malaysia branch**\nG-03-A & 1-03-A, 1, Jalan Orkid 4, Taman Orkid, 43900 Sepang,\nSelangor, Malaysia\n\n**MyCoID:** 995736-H\n** **\n\n##### Singapore\n\n**Singapore **\n\n**IPG Photonics (Asia) Ltd. Singapore Branch**\n1 Paya Lebar Link, Paya Lebar Quarter 1 #04-01,\nSingapore 408533\n+65.695.58381\n\n##### South Korea\n\n**Daejon, South Korea **\n\n**IPG Photonics (Korea) Ltd. - Applications Center**\n80-12, Techno 2-ro,\nYuseong-gu, Daejeon, Republic of Korea\n+82.42.930.2000\n\n##### Taiwan\n\n**Taipei City, Taiwan **\n\n**IPG Photonics (Asia) Ltd. Taiwan Branch**\n5 F., No.91, Xinhu 1st Rd., Neihu Dist.,\nTaipei City 114, Taiwan\n+886 (2) 27.93.3582\n**Fax:** +886 (2) 27.92.3922\n\n##### Thailand\n\n**Ladkrabang, Bangkok **\n\n**IPG Photonics (Asia) Ltd. Thailand Branch**\n118/109 Ladkrabang Road, Ladkrabang Sub-District,\nLadkrabang District, Bangkok 10520\n+66-2-125-7207\n\n#### [arrow] Europe\n\n##### Germany\n\n**Burbach, Germany**\n\n**IPG Photonics GmbH & Co. KG - European Headquarters**\nCarl-Benz-Stra\u00dfe 28,\n57299 Burbach, Germany\n(+49) 2736-44208100\n[Contact Sales][162] **\n\nWEEE Reg. No.: **(DE) 38974393, (AT) 9008391821458, (BE) DE167880868, (CH) 11081, (DK) 167880686,\n(FI) 3551, (NL) 31819, (NO) 771678808, (SE) HRB4466, (HR) 51378103622, (SI) POG-PZ-35/18, (GR) 9237,\n(BG) 2037/18.05.2022, (PT) PT101417, (EE) PRO190568, (LV) DEHRB 4466, (LT) NE-22/43, (SK) EZ_1000504\n\n**Burbach, Germany**\n\n**IPG Photonics GmbH & C"
