ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Products][159]\n* [Robotic Automation][160]\n* Robotic Arc Welding Systems\n[IPG Image]\n\n# ArcCell Welding Systems\n\n## Configurable Robotic Arc Welding Solutions\n* [Overview][161]\n\n[ Overview ][162]\n[Contact Us][163]\n[Cabinets-Racks-Modules-Icon]\n\n#### Three Configurable Platforms\n\n[Drilling-Icon]\n\n#### Small, Medium & Large Parts\n\n[Productive-Icon]\n\n#### High-Throughput Productivity\n\nArcCell robotic arc welding systems are flexible platforms for automated welding of a wide variety\nof industrial assemblies and parts. These highly configurable solutions are purpose-built for common\npractical requirements to support high changeover, large and heavy parts, and integration into high\nthroughput environments.\n\nEvery ArcCell system includes guidance from welding automation and robotics experts to ensure\nsuccessful integration and long-term productivity.\n* [IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n[IPG Image][IPG Image][IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n[IPG Image][IPG Image][IPG Image]\n[Cabinets-Racks-Modules-Icon]\n\n#### Three Configurable Platforms\n\n[Drilling-Icon]\n\n#### Small, Medium & Large Parts\n\n[Productive-Icon]\n\n#### High-Throughput Productivity\n\nArcCell robotic arc welding systems are flexible platforms for automated welding of a wide variety\nof industrial assemblies and parts. These highly configurable solutions are purpose-built for common\npractical requirements to support high changeover, large and heavy parts, and integration into high\nthroughput environments.\n\nEvery ArcCell system includes guidance from welding automation and robotics experts to ensure\nsuccessful integration and long-term productivity.\n\n### Flexible Arc Welding Automation Solutions\n\nFrom standard turnkey to fully customized robotic welding systems, we work with you to help achieve\nyour quality, productivity, and profitability goals.\n\nWhether you need custom tooling or help optimizing your product design for automation, we utilize\ndecades of robotic welding experience to deliver truly powerful solutions.\n\n[Talk to a Welding Automation Expert][164]\n\n## Robotic Welding Platforms\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### ArcCell 1000\n\nFeaturing single or dual load/unload station configurations and flexible system motion options, the\nArcCell 1000 platform is a versatile solution for automated arc welding of small to medium-sized\nparts.\n\nBuilt with an integrated safety enclosure and a compact, single pallet design, this robotic welding\nsystem is quick and easy to integrate into a variety of production environments.\n[View datasheet][165]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### ArcCell 2000\n\nThe ArcCell 2000 platform is built with a dual-station design and independently controlled operator\nzones for high changeover applications.\n\nWith a spacious work envelope and heavy duty weight capacity, the ArcCell 2000 easily supports large\nand heavy industrial parts, including those that require repositioning.\n[View datasheet][166]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### ArcCell 3000\n\nFeaturing a unique indexing turntable design to minimize system footprint and maximize work\nenvelope, the ArcCell 3000 is purpose-built for high-volume production environments.\n\nQuick exchange times and a long tool length, swing diameter, and heavy duty capacity enable\nefficient welding automation for a broad range of industrial parts.\n[View datasheet][167]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### How Can We Help?\n\nWhether you need a robotic system with custom specifications or simply want to learn more about our\nautomation solutions, an IPG welding expert is ready to help you find your solution.\n\n### Resources\n\n#### Datasheets\n* [ ArcCell 1000 ][168]\n* [ ArcCell 2000 ][169]\n* [ ArcCell 3000 ][170]\n\n#### Guides & Brochures\n* [ IPG Systems Guide ][171]\n* [ Resources ][172]\n* [ Legal Notice ][173]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][174]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][175]\n* [ Imprint ][176]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /p