ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Products][159]\n* [Beam Delivery][160]\n* Laser Processing Heads\n[IPG Image]\n\n## Laser Processing Heads\n\nDesigned to address applications including cutting, welding, cladding, drilling, cleaning, and more,\nIPG laser processing heads and scanners offer high power handling and flexible configuration for\neasy integration with IPG laser sources and systems.\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Laser Scanning Heads\n\nBy quickly and precisely directing laser beams across a wide area, IPG laser scanners greatly reduce\nthe system motion required for beam delivery and enable high productivity in applications like\nwelding, cutting, cleaning, marking, and additive manufacturing.\n\n][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Laser Welding Heads\n\nBuilt to complement the industry's broadest range of industrial fiber lasers, IPG laser welding\nprocess heads enable optimal performance across a variety of welding applications.\n\n][162]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Wobble Welding Heads\n\nProviding improved weld quality and better visual finish, IPG wobble welding heads are a flexible\ntool for welding a wide variety of materials, including thick, thin, and dissimilar.\n\n][163]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Laser Cutting Heads\n\nDesigned to maximize reliability and performance, IPG laser cutting process heads complement the\nunmatched beam quality of IPG lasers and can support the highest laser powers.\n\n][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n* [ Legal Notice ][166]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][167]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][168]\n* [ Imprint ][169]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /produ