ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Products][159]\n* [Components & Accessories][160]\n* Packaged Diodes\n[IPG Image]\n\n# Packaged Diodes\n\n## Single-Emitter Fiber-Pigtailed Packaged Diodes\n* [Overview][161]\n\n[ Overview ][162]\n[Contact Us][163]\n[Wall-Plug-Efficiency-Icon]\n\n#### >50%\n\nEnergy Efficiency\n\n[High-Power-Icon]\n\n#### Up to 1.3 kW\n\nOutput Power\n\n[Wavelength-Icon]\n\n#### 878 to 980 nm\n\nWavelength\n\nThe same high-efficiency diodes that power IPG lasers are available as individually packaged units\nfor direct diode and pumping applications. Best-in-class single-emitter diode technology offers a\nunique combination of high power and reliability that sets IPG diodes apart from short-lived diode\nbars and stacks.\n\nThese single-emitter fiber-pigtailed diodes offer state-of-the-art performance to customers looking\nto integrate fiber-coupled modules.\n\n* [IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n\n[Wall-Plug-Efficiency-Icon]\n\n#### >50%\n\nEnergy Efficiency\n\n[High-Power-Icon]\n\n#### Up to 1.3 kW\n\nOutput Power\n\n[Wavelength-Icon]\n\n#### 878 to 980 nm\n\nWavelength\n\nThe same high-efficiency diodes that power IPG lasers are available as individually packaged units\nfor direct diode and pumping applications. Best-in-class single-emitter diode technology offers a\nunique combination of high power and reliability that sets IPG diodes apart from short-lived diode\nbars and stacks.\n\nThese single-emitter fiber-pigtailed diodes offer state-of-the-art performance to customers looking\nto integrate fiber-coupled modules.\n\n## The Industry's Most Reliable Diodes\n\nIPG is among very few industrial laser manufacturers with an internal supply of diode pump lasers.\nAll of our diodes are fully assembled by IPG personnel, enabling the full traceability and quality\ncontrol only possible through vertical integration.\n\nWe demand the highest quality from our world-leading high-volume production line \u2013 every individual\nwafer is qualified to ensure unmatched performance across thousands of installations. By selecting\ndiodes from only the very best MBE-grown wafer material, IPG has achieved an unprecedented standard\nof reliable power.\n\n## Packaged Diode Options\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Fiber Laser Pumps] \u2502[Solid State Laser Pumps]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFiber Laser Pumps \u2502Solid State Laser Pumps\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPLD-9xx Series Packaged Diodes\u2502PLD-878 Series Packaged Diodes\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCharacteristics\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2