ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Solutions][159]\n* [Laser Materials Processing][160]\n* Laser Cutting\n[Laser Cutting]\n\n## Laser Cutting\n\n# What is Laser Cutting?\n\nLaser cutting is a non-contact thermal separation process that uses a focused laser beam to cut\nthrough materials. Laser cutting is one of the largest industrial applications of high-power lasers\n\u2014 lasers can be used to cut everything from several inch thick steels to highly sensitive foils and\nmedical devices. Optimization of laser parameters enables the cutting of flat and complex shapes in\na wide variety of materials including metals, polymers, glasses and crystals, wood, and even fabrics\nand materials.\n\nLaser cutting systems utilize both dedicated cutting process heads to deliver a static beam in a\nsingle direction and scanners that direct the beam over a wider processing area. Both methods of\nbeam delivery can produce a wide variety of cut shapes and sizes rapidly and with high quality\ncutting edges. As a highly consistent non-contact process, laser cutting is flexible and easy to\nautomate for a range of industries and applications.\n\n## Advantages of Laser Cutting\n\n#### **Precise & Repeatable**\n\nLaser cutting is a highly precise and consistent process able to reliably create excellent quality\ncutting edges and complicated part features.\n\n#### **High Process Speed**\n\nFocused laser beams rapidly penetrate thick and thin materials and can be rapidly translated along\nthe intended cutting edge to achieve high cutting speeds.\n\n#### **Minimal Maintenace Required**\n\nLaser cutting is a non-contact process that experiences virtually no degradation in cutting quality,\nminimizing laser cutting systems downtime.\n\n#### **Flexible & Easily Automated**\n\nAs a non-contact process, laser cutting can be easily integrated into a wide variety of systems ways\nand used to cut almost any material or feature.\n\n###\n\n### Flexible Cutting for a Variety of Materials & Features\n\nWhether for thick or thin materials, precision features on complex surfaces, or reflective metals,\nlaser cutting offers high process speeds and edge quality.\n\nLaser cutting productivity and quality can be maximized for nearly any application by customizing\nlaser parameters like wavelength, power, spot size, and pulse duration.\n* [Alt]\n\nSteel & Stainless Steel up to 50 mm\n* [Alt]\n\nCopper up to 6 mm\n* [Alt]\n\nAlumina Cutting (0.4 mm)\n* [Alt]\n\nMild Carbon Steel Cutting\n* [Alt]\n\nAluminum Tube Cutting\n* [Alt]\n\nMild Carbon Steel Cutting (6 mm)\n* [Alt]\n\nHigh-Precision Cutting\n[Alt] [Alt] [Alt] [Alt] [Alt] [Alt] [Alt]\n\n### The Perfect Solution for Automated Cutting\n\nThe power and flexibility of laser cutting makes maximizing productivity with automated solutions\nviable for almost any business.\n\nLaser cutting scan be seamlessly integrated with a variety of supporting systems including optimized\nprocess gas delivery and process monitoring like pierce detection.\n\n## Laser Cutting: The Clear Choice\n\nManufacturers continue to turn to cutting with fiber lasers as their cutting method of choice. There\nare a variety of cutting methods to choose from but manufacturers worldwide prefer laser cutting for\na wide variety of materials and applications for increased uptime and throughput, lower operating\ncosts, and improved edge quality.\n\n### Discover Your Laser Cutting Solution\n\nIPG is a partner for every stage of production from research and development to full-scale\nmanufacturing.\n\nOur laser cutting experts are ready to evaluate your application and offer a solution optimized for\nyour requirements\n\n[Get an Application Evaluation][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### How Can We Help?\n\nWhether you have a project in mind or just want to learn more about laser cutting, an IPG laser\nexpert is ready to help.\n\n### Resources\n\n#### Guides & Brochures\n* [ Laser Cutting Guide ][162]\n* [ Resources ][163]\n* [ Legal Notice ][164]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][165]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][166]\n* [ Imprint ][167]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[36]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[37]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-scanning-heads\n[38]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-welding-heads\n[39]: /products"
