ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Products][159]\n* [LightWELD][160]\n* LightWELD Cobot Systems\n[IPG Image]\n\n# LightWELD^{\u00ae} Cobot System\n\n## Laser Welding & Cleaning with a Collaborative Robot\n\n[ Overview [down-arrow] ][161]\n* [Overview][162]\n* [Capabilities][163]\n* [Safety][164]\n* [Accessories][165]\n* [Support][166]\n* [FAQ][167]\n[Buy Now][168]\n[High-Power-Icon]\n\n#### Up to 2 kW\n\nLaser Power\n\n[Welding-Icon]\n\n#### Up to 0.315\"\n\nWelding Capability\n\n[Configurable-Icon]\n\n#### 100\n\nWelding & Cleaning Presets\n\nCompatible with any LightWELD laser source, the LightWELD Cobot System is a collaborative robot\nlaser welding system that makes automating a variety of welding jobs easy no matter your experience\nlevel.\n\nThe system is purpose-built to maximize your shop's productivity by automating repetitive welds,\noptimizing high-mix low-volume fabrication, and freeing up skilled welders for other projects.\n\nAre you automation ready? We'll test your parts, for free! Get started.\n* [IPG Image]\n* [IPG Image]\n\n[High-Power-Icon]\n\n#### Up to 2 kW\n\nLaser Power\n\n[Welding-Icon]\n\n#### Up to 0.315\"\n\nWelding Capability\n\n[Configurable-Icon]\n\n#### 100\n\nWelding & Cleaning Presets\n\nCompatible with any LightWELD laser source, the LightWELD Cobot System is a collaborative robot\nlaser welding system that makes automating a variety of welding jobs easy no matter your experience\nlevel.\n\nThe system is purpose-built to maximize your shop's productivity by automating repetitive welds,\noptimizing high-mix low-volume fabrication, and freeing up skilled welders for other projects.\n\nAre you automation ready? We'll test your parts, for free! Get started.\n\n## Future-Proof Your Shop by Empowering Skilled Welders\n\n### **AUTOMATE\n### **Repetitive Welds\n\n##### Free up resources by saving the repetitive jobs for your cobot system so skilled welders can\n##### focus on more complex welds.\n\n### **MAXIMIZE\n### **Productivity\n\n##### Tear through repeat welds faster and more consistently, scrap fewer parts, and reduce\n##### time-consuming grinding and rework.\n\n### **ENHANCE\n### **Your Welders\n\n##### Enable your welders to get more done with a system that complements their skills and optimizes\n##### their time.\n\n## As Easy to Learn & Operate as LightWELD\n\n####\n\n#### No Programming Experience Required\n\nTeach your cobot with manual guidance in minutes by moving the robotic arm through the required\nsteps before saving the job with the push of a button.\n\n####\n\n#### Control Everything From One Screen\n\nAn intuitive interface enables operators to select and save welding and cleaning presets, control\nlaser parameters, and control the robotic arm, all from a single place.\n\n### Level Up Your Shop\n\nThe LightWELD Cobot System offers the flexibility and range of motion to tackle a variety of welds\nno matter how you work.\n* Weld any mix of small, large, simple, or complex parts\n* Weld a variety of joints and materials and even upside down\n* Weld on the welding table or on adjacent work surfaces\n\n[Learn More][169]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Powered by LightWELD\n\nThe LightWELD Cobot System is powered by LightWELD, the same laser technology that has\nrevolutionized handheld laser welding and cleaning in shops across America.\n\nLightWELD laser technology enables welders to weld better and weld more with a uniquely productive,\nefficient, and easy-to-learn tool.\n\n[Learn More][170]\n\n## Maximize Productivity in Any Shop\n\n####\n\n#### Compact & Portable\n\nThe LightWELD Cobot System fits easily onto almost any shop floor and is easy to relocate as your\nshop evolves.\n\n####\n\n#### Safe & Secure\n\nIntegrated and modular free-standing safety enclosures make laser safety simple.\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Getting Started is Easy\n\nWhether you have a question about the LightWELD Cobot System or simply want to learn more about how\na welding cobot can maximize your shop's productivity, an IPG laser welding expert is ready to help\nyou get started.\n\n### Resources\n\n#### Guides & Brochures\n* [ Laser Welding Cobots: A Complete Guide ][171]\n* [ LightWELD Cobot System Brochure ][172]\n* [ Resources ][173]\n* [ Legal Notice ][174]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][175]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][176]\n* [ Imprint ][177]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing"
