            "text": "[ [IPG Photonics Corporation] ][1] Toggle Menu\n[search]\n* [ Handheld Lasers ][2] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Handheld Lasers][3]\n* [LightWELD Handheld Laser Welding & Cleaning ][4]\n* [ Lasers + Optics ][5] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Lasers + Optics][6]\n* [Industrial CW Fiber Lasers ][7] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Industrial CW Fiber Lasers][8]\n* [High-Power Fiber Lasers ][9]\n* [High-Efficiency Fiber Lasers ][10]\n* [Ultra-Compact Fiber Lasers ][11]\n* [Multi-Beam Fiber Lasers ][12]\n* [Single-Mode Fiber Lasers ][13]\n* [Dual-Mode Fiber Lasers ][14]\n* [Erbium, Thulium & Raman Fiber Lasers ][15]\n* [Laser Heating Sources ][16]\n* [Quasi-CW Fiber Lasers ][17]\n* [Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][18] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Nanosecond Fiber Lasers][19]\n* [Infrared Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][20]\n* [Green & Visible Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][21]\n* [Ultraviolet Nanosecond Fiber Lasers ][22]\n* [Ultrafast Fiber Lasers ][23]\n* [Diode Lasers ][24]\n* [Deep UV Lasers ][25]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Lasers ][26] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Advanced & Scientific Lasers][27]\n* [Linearly Polarized & Single Frequency ][28]\n* [Fiber Amplifiers ][29]\n* [Single-Mode & Low Order Mode CW Lasers ][30]\n* [Mid-IR Hybrid Lasers ][31]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers & Solutions for Science ][32]\n* [Beam Delivery ][33] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Beam Delivery][34]\n* [Laser Processing Heads ][35] Go to child menu\n* Back to Beam Delivery\n* #### [Laser Processing Heads][36]\n* [Laser Scanning Heads ][37]\n* [Laser Welding Heads ][38]\n* [Laser Wobble Welding Heads ][39]\n* [Laser Cutting Heads ][40]\n* [Integrated Scanners & Markers ][41]\n* [Beam Switches, Shutters & Couplers ][42]\n* [Collimators ][43]\n* [Components ][44] Go to child menu\n* Back to Lasers + Optics\n* #### [Components][45]\n* [Bragg Gratings ][46]\n* [Packaged Diodes ][47]\n* [ Laser Systems ][48] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Laser Systems][49]\n* [E-Mobility Laser Systems ][50] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [E-Mobility Laser Systems][51]\n* [Battery Welding R&D Workstations ][52]\n* [Battery Welding Systems ][53]\n* [Robotic Welding Systems ][54]\n* [EV Battery Manufacturing Lines ][55]\n* [Custom E-Mobility Laser Systems ][56]\n* [Medical Device Laser Systems ][57] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Medical Device Laser Systems][58]\n* [Multi-Application Laser Workstations ][59]\n* [Tube & Stent Cutting Systems ][60]\n* [Glovebox Systems ][61]\n* [Precision Flatbed Laser Cutting Systems ][62]\n* [Laser Curing Systems ][63]\n* [Laser Systems by Application ][64] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Laser Systems by Application][65]\n* [Laser Systems for Cutting ][66]\n* [Laser Systems for Welding ][67]\n* [Laser Systems for Cleaning ][68]\n* [Laser Systems for Heating & Drying ][69]\n* [Laser Systems for Drilling ][70]\n* [Laser Systems for Marking ][71]\n* [Integrated Sub-Systems ][72] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Integrated Sub-Systems][73]\n* [Laser Sources & Scanners ][74]\n* [Laser Heating Sources ][75]\n* [Laser Overlap Welding ][76]\n* [Tube & Pipe Welding ][77]\n* [Integrated Laser Welding Systems ][78]\n* [Laser Workstations ][79] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Laser Workstations][80]\n* [LaserCube - Cutting ][81]\n* [Tube & Stent Cutting ][82]\n* [Glovebox Welding ][83]\n* [LaserCube - Drilling ][84]\n* [Multi-Application Laser Workstations ][85]\n* [Laser Heating Workstations ][86]\n* [Custom Laser Workstations ][87]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][88] Go to child menu\n* Back to Laser Systems\n* #### [Robotic Laser Systems][89]\n* [LaserCell 2000 ][90]\n* [LaserCell 4000 ][91]\n* [Welding LaserCell ][92]\n* [Integrated Laser Welding Systems ][93]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][94]\n* [Counter-UAS ][95]\n* [LightWELD Cobot Systems ][96]\n* [Custom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Solutions][159]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing Solutions][160]\n* Li-Ion Cell Manufacturing\n[EV Battery Manufacturing]\n\n## EV Battery Manufacturing\n\nDespite the variety in designs, the cylindrical, prismatic, and pouch cell manufacturing process\nconsistently leans on laser processing for crucial tasks such as cutting and notching foils, welding\nfoil stacks to tabs, sealing injection holes in cell cases, welding safety valves, and sealing caps\nto cases. Complemented by cutting-edge advancements like laser drying of electrode coatings, these\nprocesses ensure the swift pace and efficiency necessary for high volume production of Li-ion cells.\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Get the Battery Welding Solutions Guide\n\nLearn how we combine laser expertise with battery welding know-how to build laser solutions for\nglobal EV and battery manufacturers.\n\n[Get the Guide][161]\n\n## Laser Processing Provides Unique\n## Benefits for EV Manufacturers\n\n[Copper Foil to tab welding]\n\n### Ultra-Efficient Electrode Foil Drying\n\nWhile traditional foil drying furnaces use fossil fuels and may be up to 100 meters long, laser\ndrying eliminates the fossil fuel consumption carbon footprint and frees up factory floor space and\ninfrastructure. The laser drying process dries over and under the foil surface simultaneously,\nmaking it faster and more power efficient than typical convective drying methods.\n\n### Repeatable, High-Quality Electrode Foil Cutting\n\nLaser cutting, also known as laser slitting, is a non-contact process that has the flexibility to\ncut foils of any shape and is not susceptible to foil edge quality degradations due to die punching\ntool wear. Using the most reliable nanosecond pulsed lasers in the industry, IPG laser solutions\ndeliver the fastest foil cutting with the highest cut quality.\n\n[Copper Foil to tab welding]\n\n### High Yield Foil-to-Tab Welding\n\nCompared to alternate technologies where excess mechanical force can create metal fractures, laser\nwelding is a fast, non-contact joining process with consistently high yields. Dual-beam laser\nwelding technology greatly minimizes copper and aluminum welding defects at significantly higher\nspeeds than green or blue wavelength laser alternatives.\n\n[High Throughput Cap-to-Can Welding]\n\n### High Throughput Cap-to-Can Welding\n\nDual-beam lasers create hermetic cap-to-can welds at the high welding speeds that are necessary for\nlarge-format prismatic or blade batteries. IPG offers the widest selection of dual-beam laser\nconfigurations, enabling real-time dynamic power control of the core and ring beams to perfectly\nmatch cell enclosure seal requirements.\n\n### Faster, More Reliable Injection Hole Sealing\n\nQuasi-Continuous Wave lasers minimize heat input using bursts of high peak power to create\nhigh-quality injection hole seals at high speeds and use a highly reliable, air-cooled solid state\nfiber laser design that greatly increases tool uptime.\n\n### Discover Your Li-ion Cell Manufacturing Solution\n\nIPG partners with E-Mobility manufacturers throughout the entire production process from research\nand development to full-scale manufacturing.\n\nReady to get started? Send us a sample for evaluation or your product specifications and our laser\nexperts will recommend a laser solution that best matches your application.\n\n[Get an Application Evaluation][162]\n\n## Solutions for Other E-Mobility Applications\n\n[Battery Modules & Busbars]\n\n#### Battery Modules & Busbars\n\n[Learn More][163]\n[Battery Packs & Trays]\n\n#### Battery Packs & Trays\n\n[Learn More][164]\n[Electric Motors]\n\n#### Electric Motors\n\n[Learn More][165]\n[Electronic Components]\n\n#### Power Electronics\n\n[Learn More][166]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### How Can We Help?\n\nWhether you have a project in mind or just want to learn more about laser solutions for Li-ion cell\nprocessing, an IPG laser expert is ready to help.\n\n### Resources\n\n#### Guides & Brochures\n* [ AMB Dual-Beam Laser Guide ][167]\n* [ Battery Welding Guide ][168]\n* [ E-Mobility Solutions Guide ][169]\n* [ Resources ][170]\n* [ Legal Notice ][171]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][172]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][173]\n* [ Imprint ][174]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[36]: /products/beam-d"
