ustom Laser Systems ][97]\n* [ Robotic Automation ][98] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Robotic Automation][99]\n* [Robotic Laser Systems ][100]\n* [Robotic Arc Welding Systems ][101]\n* [Robotic Arc/Laser Welding Systems ][102]\n* [Custom Robotic Laser Systems ][103]\n* [LightWELD Cobot System ][104]\n* [ Solutions ][105] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Solutions][106]\n* [E-Mobility Manufacturing ][107] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [E-Mobility Manufacturing][108]\n* [Battery Cells ][109]\n* [Battery Busbars ][110]\n* [Battery Packs ][111]\n* [Electric Motors ][112]\n* [Power Electronics ][113]\n* [Fuel Cells ][114]\n* [Materials Processing ][115] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Materials Processing][116]\n* [Laser Cutting ][117]\n* [Laser Welding ][118]\n* [Laser Cleaning ][119]\n* [Laser Heating & Drying ][120]\n* [Laser Drilling ][121]\n* [Laser Additive Manufacturing ][122]\n* [Laser Marking ][123]\n* [Laser Cladding ][124]\n* [Laser Brazing ][125]\n* [Micromachining ][126]\n* [Advanced & Scientific Applications ][127]\n* [Application Development ][128] Go to child menu\n* Back to Solutions\n* #### [Application Development][129]\n* [Application Labs ][130]\n* [Custom Systems & Tooling ][131]\n* [Virtual Engineering & Simulation ][132]\n* [ Technology ][133] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Technology][134]\n* [IPG Innovation ][135]\n* [Fiber Laser 101 ][136]\n* [Single-Emitter Laser Diodes ][137]\n* [On-The-Fly Welding ][138]\n* [Real-Time Weld Measurement ][139]\n* [Dual-Beam Lasers ][140]\n* [High-Efficiency Lasers ][141]\n* [Deep-UV Lasers ][142]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers ][143]\n* [ Company ][144] Go to child menu\n* Back\n* #### [Company][145]\n* [About Us ][146]\n* [Our Leadership ][147]\n* [Careers ][148]\n* [Investors ][149]\n* [Newsroom ][150]\n* [Events ][151]\n* [Social Responsibility ][152]\n* [Locations ][153]\n* [Policies & Standards ][154]\n* [ Contact Us ][155]\n* [ Support ][156]\n[ India | EN ][157]\n* [Home][158]\n* [Company][159]\n* [Social Responsibility][160]\n* Corporate Governance\n[image]\n\nCompany\n\n## Corporate Governance\n\n[Background Image]\n\n## Governance Highlights\n\n#### Independent Leadership\n#### & Oversight\n\nGoverned by a 10-member board of directors, 7 of whom are independent directors under Nasdaq\nguidelines\n\nSeparate roles of Chairman and CEO; Non-executive Board Chair\n\nBoard approved oversight framework for ESG risks in 2022\n\n#### Continued Focus on\n#### Board Refreshment\n\nContinued refreshment of the Board with a focus on skills, experience and new perspectives, and the\nneeds of our Board\n\nA majority of the Board has a tenure of 5 or fewer years\n\n#### Structured to Empower\n#### Shareholder Rights\n\nAnnually elected directors\n\nDirector majority voting policy\n\nSingle class of voting stock\n\nNo supermajority voting provisions\n\n[Governance Oversight]\n\n### Governance Oversight\n\nSuccessful sustainable operation of a company is impossible without strong oversight on the top\nlevel. At IPG, specific ESG topics are overseen by the Board as a whole, or by the Board committee\ngenerally responsible for the subject matter. The Board supports and regularly inquiries about\nprogress in the Company\u2019s reporting of ESG policies, metrics and related disclosures.\n\nThe Board periodically reviews an enterprise-level ESG risk assessment to identify and address ESG\nrisks that could have a material impact on the Company based on the most recent materiality\nassessment.\n\n[Ethical Operations]\n\n### Ethical Operations\n\nIPG values solid corporate governance with a focus on protecting the safety and fundamental human\nrights of all our employees across the globe. IPG ensures that new employees are trained and\neducated about our values and policies and that they review the policies periodically. Employees\u2019\nquestions on any such policy may be addressed to the proper officers and Human Resources.\n\nIPG provides the channels to report any violations under the policies and encourages all employees,\nsuppliers, and customers to use them as needed and not to be silently complacent.\n\n[Innovations with Integrity]\n\n### Innovations with Integrity\n\n**Hazardous Materials:** IPG carefully manages all materials and chemicals that are used during\nproduction in order to protect the environment and ensure the health and safety of our workers.\n\n**Conflict Materials:** IPG is committed to the responsible sourcing of tin, tantalum, tungsten and\ngold used in our products and IPG conducts annual due diligence of its suppliers to determine the\nsourcing of conflict minerals in its productsand confirms there is no evidence that the conflict\nminerals in IPG\u2019s product funded conflict.\n\n**Compliance & Risk Management:** At IPG, risk management is a priority for our Board of Directors\nand senior management. Effectively monitoring and managing risk are essential to the successful\nexecution of IPG\u2019s business strategy.\n\n## Download and learn more about this topics\n\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Our Environment\n\n][161]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Our People and Communities\n\n][162]\n[IPG Image]\n\n### Our Governance\n\n][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n* [ Legal Notice ][165]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][166]\n* [ Cookie Policy ][167]\n* [ Imprint ][168]\n\n\u00a9 2026 IPG Photonics Corporation All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: javascript:void(0);\n[3]: /en-us/products/handheld-lasers/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[4]: /products/lightweld/lightweld-handheld-laser-welding-and-cleaning\n[5]: javascript:void(0);\n[6]: /products/lasers\n[7]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[8]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers\n[9]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-power-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/high-efficiency-fiber-lasers\n[11]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/ultra-compact-industrial-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/amb-adjustable-mode-beam-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/industrial-single-mode-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/dual-mode-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/industrial-cw-fiber-lasers/erbium-thulium-raman-fiber-lasers\n[16]: /products/lasers/laser-heating-sources\n[17]: /products/lasers/quasi-cw-fiber-lasers\n[18]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[19]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[20]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/infrared-nanosecond-lasers\n[21]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/green-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[22]: /products/lasers/nanosecond-pulsed-fiber-lasers/ultraviolet-nanosecond-fiber-lasers\n[23]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-pulsed-fiber-lasers\n[24]: /products/lasers/diode-lasers\n[25]: /products/lasers/deep-uv-lasers\n[26]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[27]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers\n[28]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/linearly-polarized-and-single-frequency-cw-lasers\n[29]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/cw-amplifiers\n[30]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/single-mode-low-order-mode-lasers\n[31]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/mid-ir-hybrid-lasers\n[32]: /products/lasers/specialized-lasers/ultrafast-lasers-and-solutions-for-science\n[33]: /products/beam-delivery\n[34]: /products/beam-delivery\n[35]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[36]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads\n[37]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-scanning-heads\n[38]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-welding-heads\n[39]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/wobble-welding-heads\n[40]: /products/beam-delivery/laser-processing-heads/laser-cutting-heads\n[41]: /products/beam-delivery/integrated-laser-scanners\n[42]: /products/beam-delivery/beam-switches-shutters-couplers\n[43]: /products/beam-delivery/collimators\n[44]: /products/components-acce