ed in Jena (Germany). JENOPTIK AG is listed on\nthe German Stock Exchange in Frankfurt.\n\n[ Read more ][94]\n\n## Locations worldwide\n\n[][95]\n\n[ Our locations ][96]\n\n## News\n\n[ [Brian Soller]\n11 June 2026\n\n### Brian Soller named President of JENOPTIK Optical Systems, LLC\n\nHe will be responsible for the ef"
