      "company_function": "",
      "company_summary": "Kongsberg Gruppen is a leading technology company that develops innovative solutions for the defence, security, and surveillance markets, as well as for aerospace and marine applications. Their core offerings include advanced missile systems, automated weapon stations, air defence systems, and remote air traffic control solutions, catering primarily to military and defence organizations, civil aviation authorities, and marine and environmental sectors. With a commitment to protecting people and critical infrastructure, Kongsberg Gruppen leverages cutting-edge technology to enhance operational capabilities across various industries.",
