        "crawl_text": "Melbourne, Florida [ Skip to main content ][1]\n\n# India\n\n[Earth with data connection points]\n\n## Indian Innovation\n\nL3Harris is involved with a full range of projects in India, supporting the nation\u2019s civil and\nmilitary goals. From defense and paramilitary to public safety, aviation and space, L3Harris is\nproviding the technologies for a modern, self-reliant India.\n\nOn This Page\n* [ Featured News ][2]\n* [ Our Mission ][3]\n* [ Solutions for India ][4]\n* [ Locations ][5]\n* [ Contact Us ][6]\n\n### What are you looking for?\n\n### What's New\n\nVisit our newsroom and learn how we\u2019re delivering trusted national security solutions at the pace of\na technology disruptor.\n\n[ Visit ][7]\n[L3Harris' concept graphic of the right side, forward view of the AERIS X Bombardier Global 6500\nVariant in flight with sky and cloud background thumbnail image]\n\nEditorial\n\n#### AERIS X Airborne Early Warning & Control: The Right Choice for Allied Homeland Defense\n\nL3Harris\u2019 AERIS X airborne early warning and control (AEW&C) solution represents a shift in how\nallies approach airborne intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance and mission systems\ncapabilities \u2013 proven performance, sustainable economics and operational readiness that matches the\nthreat timeline.\n\n[ Read more ][8]\n[submarine surfacing]\n\nEditorial\n\n#### Maintaining America's Undersea Edge: L3Harris Secures Towed Array Production Through 2029\n\nL3Harris secures critical U.S. Navy contracts to continue delivering cutting-edge towed array\nsystems that strengthen submarine detection and undersea superiority.\n\n[ Read more ][9]\n[Soldier speaks into radio]\n\nPress release\n\n#### L3Harris and KSSL Sign MOU to Collaborate on Advanced Technology in India\n\nL3Harris Technologies and Kalyani Strategic Systems Limited (KSSL), a subsidiary of Bharat Forge\nLimited, signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) for wider collaboration in supporting advanced\ndefense and security equipment in India.\n\n[ Read more ][10]\n[L3Harris assets connect on a network]\n\n## OUR MISSION\n\nAs the Trusted Disruptor, we innovate relentlessly and deliver capability with the speed, passion\nand determination that our customers demand in executing their most challenging missions.\n\n## Solutions for India\n\n[\n[Aircraft Missionization &amp; Avionics Solutions]\n\n### Aircraft Missionization and Avionics\n\nAs a full-service aircraft systems integrator, L3Harris solutions are enabling customers to patrol\nthe seas, launch satellites from the sky, manage information across the battlefield, and bring\nincreased capability to the frontlines.\n\n][11]\n[\n[Autonomous Systems Solutions]\n\n### Autonomous Systems\n\nAutonomous unmanned vehicles perform in both real-time operations and simulations.\n\n][12]\n[\n[c-UxS solutions]\n\n### Counter-Unmanned Systems (C-UxS)\n\nL3Harris leads in unmanned, autonomous systems and offers comprehensive solutions to counter threats\non land, sea, and air.\n\n][13]\n[\n[Integrated Maritime Solutions]\n\n### Maritime Solutions\n\nL3Harris is developing new concepts and technology to enable naval operators to improve readiness\ntoday and in the future.\n\n][14]\n[\n[ISR and SIGINT Solutions]\n\n### ISR and SIGINT\n\nL3Harris provides rapid delivery of integrated intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance.\n\n][15]\n[\n[Public Safety and Critical Communications]\n\n### Public Safety and Critical Communications\n\nThe most flexible and interoperable critical comms solutions custom designed to meet customers'\nunique needs.\n\n][16]\n[\n[L3Harris resilient comms solutions]\n\n### Resilient Communications and Networks\n\nCutting-edge communications, data link and information management technologies critical to the\nnational security of the U.S. and allied defenses.\n\n][17]\n[FTI India airport]\n\n## India's Futuristic Telecommunications Infrastructure (FTI)\n\n[ FTI India ][18]\n\n## Related News\n\n[L3Harris' concept graphic of the right side, forward view of the AERIS X Bombardier Global 6500\nVariant in flight with sky and cloud background thumbnail image]\n\nEditorial | 04. 24. 2026\n\n### AERIS X Airbo [ Skip to main content ][1]\n\n# India\n\n[Earth with data connection points]\n\n## Indian Innovation\n\nL3Harris is involved with a full range of projects in India, supporting the nation\u2019s civil and\nmilitary goals. From defense and paramilitary to public safety, aviation and space, L3Harris is\nproviding the technologies for a modern, self-reliant India.\n\nOn This Page\n* [ Featured News ][2]\n* [ Our Mission ][3]\n* [ Solutions for India ][4]\n* [ Locations ][5]\n* [ Contact Us ][6]\n\n### What are you looking for?\n\n### What's New\n\nVisit our newsroom and learn how we\u2019re delivering trusted national security solutions at the pace of\na technology disruptor.\n\n[ Visit ][7]\n[L3Harris' concept graphic of the right side, forward view of the AERIS X Bombardier Global 6500\nVariant in flight with sky and cloud background thumbnail image]\n\nEditorial\n\n#### AERIS X Airborne Early Warning & Control: The Right Choice for Allied Homeland Defense\n\nL3Harris\u2019 AERIS X airborne early warning and control (AEW&C) solution represents a shift in how\nallies approach airborne intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance and mission systems\ncapabilities \u2013 proven performance, sustainable economics and operational readiness that matches the\nthreat timeline.\n\n[ Read more ][8]\n[submarine surfacing]\n\nEditorial\n\n#### Maintaining America's Undersea Edge: L3Harris Secures Towed Array Production Through 2029\n\nL3Harris secures critical U.S. Navy contracts to continue delivering cutting-edge towed array\nsystems that strengthen submarine detection and undersea superiority.\n\n[ Read more ][9]\n[Soldier speaks into radio]\n\nPress release\n\n#### L3Harris and KSSL Sign MOU to Collaborate on Advanced Technology in India\n\nL3Harris Technologies and Kalyani Strategic Systems Limited (KSSL), a subsidiary of Bharat Forge\nLimited, signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) for wider collaboration in supporting advanced\ndefense and security equipment in India.\n\n[ Read more ][10]\n[L3Harris assets connect on a network]\n\n## OUR MISSION\n\nAs the Trusted Disruptor, we innovate relentlessly and deliver capability with the speed, passion\nand determination that our customers demand in executing their most challenging missions.\n\n## Solutions for India\n\n[\n[Aircraft Missionization &amp; Avionics Solutions]\n\n### Aircraft Missionization and Avionics\n\nAs a full-service aircraft systems integrator, L3Harris solutions are enabling customers to patrol\nthe seas, launch satellites from the sky, manage information across the battlefield, and bring\nincreased capability to the frontlines.\n\n][11]\n[\n[Autonomous Systems Solutions]\n\n### Autonomous Systems\n\nAutonomous unmanned vehicles perform in both real-time operations and simulations.\n\n][12]\n[\n[c-UxS solutions]\n\n### Counter-Unmanned Systems (C-UxS)\n\nL3Harris leads in unmanned, autonomous systems and offers comprehensive solutions to counter threats\non land, sea, and air.\n\n][13]\n[\n[Integrated Maritime Solutions]\n\n### Maritime Solutions\n\nL3Harris is developing new concepts and technology to enable naval operators to improve readiness\ntoday and in the future.\n\n][14]\n[\n[ISR and SIGINT Solutions]\n\n### ISR and SIGINT\n\nL3Harris provides rapid delivery of integrated intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance.\n\n][15]\n[\n[Public Safety and Critical Communications]\n\n### Public Safety and Critical Communications\n\nThe most flexible and interoperable critical comms solutions custom designed to meet customers'\nunique needs.\n\n][16]\n[\n[L3Harris resilient comms solutions]\n\n### Resilient Communications and Networks\n\nCutting-edge communications, data link and information management technologies critical to the\nnational security of the U.S. and allied defenses.\n\n][17]\n[FTI India airport]\n\n## India's Futuristic Telecommunications Infrastructure (FTI)\n\n[ FTI India ][18]\n\n## Related News\n\n[L3Harris' concept graphic of the right side, forward view of the AERIS X Bombardier Global 6500\nVariant in flight with sky and cloud background thumbnail image]\n\nEditorial | 04. 24. 2026\n\n### AERIS X Airborne Early Warning & Control: The Right Choice for Allied Homeland Defense\n\nL3Harris\u2019 AERIS X airborne early warning and control (AEW&C) solution represents a shift in how\nallies approach airborne intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance and mission systems\ncapabilities \u2013 proven performance, sustainable economics and operational readiness that matches the\nthreat timeline.\n\n[L3Harris' concept graphic of the right side, forward view of the AERIS X Bombardier Global 6500\nVariant in flight with sky and cloud background thumbnail image]\n\nEditorial | 04. 24. 2026\n\n#### AERIS X Airborne Early Warning & Control: The Right Choice for Allied Homeland Defense\n\n[Soldier speaks into radio]\n\nPress release | 02. 11. 2025\n\n#### L3Harris and KSSL Sign MOU to Collaborate on Advanced Technology in India\n\n[L3Harris WESCAM Authorized Customer Care Center]\n\nEditorial | 09. 09. 2024\n\n#### Local Presence. Regional Sustainment.\n\n[view from space at earth showing network connections]\n\nEditorial | 04. 29. 2024\n\n#### Supporting Global Air Traffic Modernization through Managed Services Infrastructure\n\n[L3Harris WESCAM Authorized Customer Care Center]\n\nEditorial | 06. 21. 2023\n\n#### Maximizing Operational Availability in the Field with WESCAM Authorized Service Centers\n\n[ Visit the Newsroom ][19]\n\n## L3Harris India Locations\n\n[Locations]\n\n### New Delhi\n\nL3Harris India\n\n6th Floor, Le Meridian Commercial Tower, Windsor Place, Janpath, New Delhi, India 110001\n\n+91-11-43525887 Office\n\n+91-11-43525886 Fax\n* #### Bengaluru\n\n## Contact the L3Harris India Team\n\n[ Find