ty equipment in India.\n\n[ Read more ][10]\n[L3Harris assets connect on a network]\n\n## OUR MISSION\n\nAs the Trusted Disruptor, we innovate relentlessly and deliver capability with the speed, passion\nand determination that our customers demand in executing their most challenging missions.\n\n## Solutions for India\n\n[\n[Aircraft Missionization &amp; Avionics Solutions]\n\n### Aircraft Missionization and Avionics\n\nAs a full-service aircraft systems integrator, L3Harris solutions are enabling customers to patrol\nthe seas, launch satellites from the sky, manage information across the battlefield, and bring\nincreased capability to the frontlines.\n\n][11]\n[\n[Autonomous Systems Solutions]\n\n### Autonomous Systems\n\nAutonomous unmanned vehicles perform in both real-time operations and simulations.\n\n][12]\n[\n[c-UxS solutions]\n\n### Counter-Unmanned Systems (C-UxS)\n\nL3Harris leads in unmanned, autonomous systems and offers comprehensive solutions to counter threats\non land, sea, and air.\n\n][13]\n[\n[Integrated Maritime Solutions]\n\n### Maritime Solutions\n\nL3Harris is developing new concepts and technology to enable naval operators to improve readiness\ntoday and in the future.\n\n][14]\n[\n[ISR and SIGINT Solutions]\n\n### ISR and SIGINT\n\nL3Harris provides rapid delivery of integrated intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance.\n\n][15]\n[\n[Public Safety and Critical Communications]\n\n### Public Safety and Critical Communications\n\nThe most flexible and interoperable critical comms solutions custom designed to meet customers'\nunique needs.\n\n][16]\n[\n[L3Harris resilient comms solutions]\n\n### Resilient Communications and Networks\n\nCutting-edge communications, data link and information management technologies critical to the\nnational security of the U.S. and allied defenses.\n\n][17]\n[FTI India airport]\n\n## India's Futuristic Telecommunications Infrastructure (FTI)\n\n[ FTI India ][18]\n\n## Related News\n\n[L3Harris' concept graphi