        "crawl_text": "# Navigation\n* [Skip to Content][1]\n\n[FTSE-MIB Icon] FTSE-MIB\n46.26\u20ac +0.28%\n26/06/2026 - 05:38 PM\n[FTSE-MIB Icon] FTSE-MIB\n46.26\u20ac +0.28%\n26/06/2026 - 05:38 PM\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS\nCLOSE TAB\n\nFinancial highlights\n\nLast trade 46.26\u20ac\n\nVariation +0.28%\n\n26/06/2026 - 05:38 PM\ndata source: Investis Digital\n\n[ GO TO INVESTOR PAGE ][2]\n\nFinancial Results & Reports\n* [ Archive ][3]\n* [ Financial calendar ][4]\n\nPress releases\n* [ [link icon]\n  23-06-2026 - LEONARDO LAUNCHED THE \u201c2026 TRANSITION PLAN\u201d: BUILDING RESILIENCE ACROSS THE\n  TRANSITION\n  ][5]\n* [ [link icon]\n  18-06-2026 - LEONARDO BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVES NEW ORGANIZATION STRUCTURE\n  ][6]\n* [ All press releases ][7]\n\n* media hub\n  [ [arrow right] media hub ][8]\n  * [ News & Stories [arrow right] ][9]\n  * [ Press releases [arrow right] ][10]\n  * [ Events [arrow right] ][11]\n  * [ Focus [arrow right] ][12]\n  * [ Social Media [arrow right] ][13]\n  * [ Campioni Project [arrow right] ][14]\n  * [ Air Force's 100th-anniversary [arrow right] ][15]\n  * [ Contacts [arrow right] ][16]\n  * [ EMAIL ALERT [arrow right] ][17]\n* [ media library ][18]\n* [ Global ][19]\n\nen Search\n[ [Leonardo logo] ][20]\n[Search icon] MENU\n\n# TECHNOLOGY\n# FOR A SAFER FUTURE\n\n# Aerospace, Defence and Security - Company\n* Aeronautics\n* Automation\n* Cyber & Security\n* Electronics\n* Helicopters\n* HPC\n* Space\n\nLeonardo is a global leader in** Aerospace, Defence and Security, delivering advanced,\ninterconnected technologies** that ensure safety and continuity for people, systems and\ninfrastructure\n\n[ [Banner-InvestorsIMG-DESKTOP]\nShareholders\u2019 Meeting\n\n2026\u00a0SHAREHOLDERS\u2019 MEETING\n\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n][21]\n[ [BANNER immagine Report e Results_535x430_Report e Results]\nFINANCIAL RESULTS\n\n1Q 2026 Results\n\nFinancial report\nPress release\nResults presentation\nWebcast\n\n][22]\n[navigation left]\n[navigation right]\n[Artemis II_Desktop-2]\n\nhighlights\n\nArtemis II, towards the Moon with Leonardo\n\n[ Learn more ][23]\n[Banner AW149_IMG-DESKTOP]\n\nhighlights\n\nLeonardo CEO highlights renewed UK commitment in \u00a31bn AW149 helicopter deal\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][24]\n[BANNER Home page sito web_IMG DESKTOP_880x540]\n\nhighlights\n\nMilano Cortina 2026\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][25]\n\n## Leonardo acquires Iveco\u2019s defence business\n\n[navigation left]\n[navigation right]\n[Centauro]\n\nLeonardo acquires Iveco's defence business\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Veicolo Lince IDV]\n\nFrom vehicle to system\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[DOME-SITOWEB]\n\nSecurity across multiple domains\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Linea di produzione terrestre_people]\n\nExpertise and innovation\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Michelangelo-dome]\n\nA Multi-domain Ecosystem\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Highlights iveco defence]\n\nKey points of the acquisition\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Discover more][26]\nCLOSE\n\n## Leonardo acquires Iveco's defence business\n\n[Centauro]\n\nWith this acquisition, Leonardo is consolidating its position as a leading player in the land\ndefence sector, strengthening its role as an integrated OEM (Original Equipment Manufacturer) and\nshifting from supplying integrated technologies to offering complete platforms, encompassing both\nthe vehicle and payload components.\n\n**[Press Realease][27]**.\n\nNext card\n\n#### From vehicle to system\n\n[ [Next card] ][28]\n\n## From vehicle to system\n\n[Veicolo Lince IDV]\n\nLand defence is one of the cornerstones of integrated security. The sector is undergoing a profound\ntransformation to counter increasingly sophisticated threats that require rapid response and\ntechnological interoperability. In this context, defence vehicles are interconnected systems that\ncollect, process and share information in real time.\n\nNext card\n\n#### Security across multiple domains\n\n[ [Next card] ][29]\n\n## Security across multiple domains\n\n[DOME-SITOWEB]\n\nIn a constantly evolving landscape, the integration of land, air, sea, space and cyber domains\nenables operations in complex scenarios by strengthening the link between observation,\ndecision-making and response. This gives rise to integrated solutions capable of protecting critical\ninfrastructure and ensuring resilienc # Navigation\n* [Skip to Content][1]\n\n[FTSE-MIB Icon] FTSE-MIB\n46.26\u20ac +0.28%\n26/06/2026 - 05:38 PM\n[FTSE-MIB Icon] FTSE-MIB\n46.26\u20ac +0.28%\n26/06/2026 - 05:38 PM\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS\nCLOSE TAB\n\nFinancial highlights\n\nLast trade 46.26\u20ac\n\nVariation +0.28%\n\n26/06/2026 - 05:38 PM\ndata source: Investis Digital\n\n[ GO TO INVESTOR PAGE ][2]\n\nFinancial Results & Reports\n* [ Archive ][3]\n* [ Financial calendar ][4]\n\nPress releases\n* [ [link icon]\n  23-06-2026 - LEONARDO LAUNCHED THE \u201c2026 TRANSITION PLAN\u201d: BUILDING RESILIENCE ACROSS THE\n  TRANSITION\n  ][5]\n* [ [link icon]\n  18-06-2026 - LEONARDO BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVES NEW ORGANIZATION STRUCTURE\n  ][6]\n* [ All press releases ][7]\n\n* media hub\n  [ [arrow right] media hub ][8]\n  * [ News & Stories [arrow right] ][9]\n  * [ Press releases [arrow right] ][10]\n  * [ Events [arrow right] ][11]\n  * [ Focus [arrow right] ][12]\n  * [ Social Media [arrow right] ][13]\n  * [ Campioni Project [arrow right] ][14]\n  * [ Air Force's 100th-anniversary [arrow right] ][15]\n  * [ Contacts [arrow right] ][16]\n  * [ EMAIL ALERT [arrow right] ][17]\n* [ media library ][18]\n* [ Global ][19]\n\nen Search\n[ [Leonardo logo] ][20]\n[Search icon] MENU\n\n# TECHNOLOGY\n# FOR A SAFER FUTURE\n\n# Aerospace, Defence and Security - Company\n* Aeronautics\n* Automation\n* Cyber & Security\n* Electronics\n* Helicopters\n* HPC\n* Space\n\nLeonardo is a global leader in** Aerospace, Defence and Security, delivering advanced,\ninterconnected technologies** that ensure safety and continuity for people, systems and\ninfrastructure\n\n[ [Banner-InvestorsIMG-DESKTOP]\nShareholders\u2019 Meeting\n\n2026\u00a0SHAREHOLDERS\u2019 MEETING\n\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n][21]\n[ [BANNER immagine Report e Results_535x430_Report e Results]\nFINANCIAL RESULTS\n\n1Q 2026 Results\n\nFinancial report\nPress release\nResults presentation\nWebcast\n\n][22]\n[navigation left]\n[navigation right]\n[Artemis II_Desktop-2]\n\nhighlights\n\nArtemis II, towards the Moon with Leonardo\n\n[ Learn more ][23]\n[Banner AW149_IMG-DESKTOP]\n\nhighlights\n\nLeonardo CEO highlights renewed UK commitment in \u00a31bn AW149 helicopter deal\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][24]\n[BANNER Home page sito web_IMG DESKTOP_880x540]\n\nhighlights\n\nMilano Cortina 2026\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][25]\n\n## Leonardo acquires Iveco\u2019s defence business\n\n[navigation left]\n[navigation right]\n[Centauro]\n\nLeonardo acquires Iveco's defence business\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Veicolo Lince IDV]\n\nFrom vehicle to system\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[DOME-SITOWEB]\n\nSecurity across multiple domains\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Linea di produzione terrestre_people]\n\nExpertise and innovation\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Michelangelo-dome]\n\nA Multi-domain Ecosystem\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Highlights iveco defence]\n\nKey points of the acquisition\n\n[plus] [plus]\n[Discover more][26]\nCLOSE\n\n## Leonardo acquires Iveco's defence business\n\n[Centauro]\n\nWith this acquisition, Leonardo is consolidating its position as a leading player in the land\ndefence sector, strengthening its role as an integrated OEM (Original Equipment Manufacturer) and\nshifting from supplying integrated technologies to offering complete platforms, encompassing both\nthe vehicle and payload components.\n\n**[Press Realease][27]**.\n\nNext card\n\n#### From vehicle to system\n\n[ [Next card] ][28]\n\n## From vehicle to system\n\n[Veicolo Lince IDV]\n\nLand defence is one of the cornerstones of integrated security. The sector is undergoing a profound\ntransformation to counter increasingly sophisticated threats that require rapid response and\ntechnological interoperability. In this context, defence vehicles are interconnected systems that\ncollect, process and share information in real time.\n\nNext card\n\n#### Security across multiple domains\n\n[ [Next card] ][29]\n\n## Security across multiple domains\n\n[DOME-SITOWEB]\n\nIn a constantly evolving landscape, the integration of land, air, sea, space and cyber domains\nenables operations in complex scenarios by strengthening the link between observation,\ndecision-making and response. This gives rise to integrated solutions capable of protecting critical\ninfrastructure and ensuring resilience across all essential sectors. Electronics and digital\ntechnologies act as the glue that securely connects all areas of operation in real time.\n\nNext card\n\n#### Expertise and innovation\n\n[ [Next card] ][30]\n\n## Expertise and innovation\n\n[Linea di produzione terrestre_people]\n\nThe acquisition accelerates technological innovation, strengthens our expertise and empowers our\npeople. These are key factors in sustaining long-term competitiveness and ensuring stability,\nstrategic autonomy and the protection of communities.\n\nNext card\n\n#### A Multi-domain Ecosystem\n\n[ [Next card] ][31]\n\n## A Multi-domain Ecosystem\n\n[Michelangelo-dome]\n\nLand defence capabilities are part of a broader strategy in which capabilities and platforms work\ntogether across multi-domains. The **[Michelangelo Dome][32]**\u00a0is the practical application of this\nvision. Not a product, but an open, modular and scalable architecture, designed to integrate\ndifferent technologies and operate as a dynamic 'dome' of protection capable of ensuring security in\ncomplex environments.\n\nNext card\n\n#### Key points of the acquisition\n\n[ [Next card] ][33]\n\n## Key points of the acquisition\n\n[Highlights iveco defence]\n\n**Key points of the acquisition** (*)\n\n## + \u20ac1,368 mln in revenue for Iveco Defence\n\n[+ \u20ac1,368 million in revenue for Iveco Defence]\n\n## > 2,000 employees worldwide\n\n[> 2,000 employees worldwide]\n\n## 6 Manufacturing plants worldwide\n\n[6 plants worldwide]\n\n## 7 R&D centres worldwide\n\n[7 R&D centres worldwide]\n\n## 12 sales offices worldwide\n\n[12 sales offices worldwide]\n\n## > 10 new vehicles in portfolio\n\n[> 10 new vehicles in the fleet]\n\n**2025 numbers*\n\n[BANNER ASSET_INDUSTRIAL PLAN_Banner Desktop_INDUSTRIAL PLAN_1600x426]\n[discover more][34]\n\n\u20ac 0.1 BN\n\nrevenues\n\n\u20ac 0.1 BN\n\norder backlog\n\n1\n\npeople\n\n1\n\nsites worldwide\n\n\u20ac 0.1 BN\n\ninvested in R&D\n\n1 %\n\nof sources of financing linked to ESG parameters\u00a0\n* Aeronautics\n* Automation\n* Cyber & Security\n* Electronics\n* Helicopters\n* HPC\n* Space\n\n## Aeronautics\n\n\u20ac 5 BN\n\nAircaft orders 2025\n\n1,200 Aircraft\n\nmanaged at around 50 sites/bases\n\ncivil & military\n\n[Visit Aeronautics page][35]\n\n## Automation\n\n1 +\n\nyears\u2019 experience\n\nOver 30km\n\nof sorting systems in operation\n\ncivil\n\n[Visit Automation page][36]\n\n## Cyber & Security\n\n\u20ac 1.1 BN\n\nOrders 2025\n\n50 Countries\n\nworldwide using Leonardo\u2019s critical communication systems\n\ncivil & military\n\n[Visit Cyber & Security page][37]\n\n## Electronics\n\n\u20ac 10.7 BN\n\nOrders 2025\n\n1,000 Air defence\n\nand surveillance radars in 58 countries\n\nCivil & Military\n\n[Visit Electronics page][38]\n\n## Helicopters\n\n\u20ac 6.2 BN\n\nOrders 2025\n\nOver 4,500\n\nHelicopters in service across in more than 130 countries\n\nCivil & Military\n\n[VISIT HELICOPTERS PAGE][39]\n\n## HPC\n\n3x\n\ncomputing power in 2026\n\n20 PFlops Rmax\n\nwith 230+ CPU and 120+ GPU nodes with Davinci-2\n\ncivil & military\n\n[Visit HPC page][40]\n\n## Space\n\n\u20ac 1 BN\n\nOrders 2025\n\n100+\n\nsatellites per year planned by the new Space Smart Factory in Rome\n\ncivil & military\n\n[Visit Space page][41]\n[\n[Immagine Careers]\nCareers\n][42] [\n[Immagine sustainability]\nSustainability\n][43]\n[officina leonardo 1320x400]\n\nOFFICINA LEONARDO\n\n[discover more][44]\n[HP Meta 1320x400]\n\