      "polished_summary": "Leonardo S.p.A. is a global leader in Aerospace, Defence, and Security, specializing in advanced, interconnected technologies that ensure safety and continuity for people, systems, and infrastructure. The company offers a wide range of products and services, including aeronautics, automation, cyber security, electronics, helicopters, and space solutions, targeting both military and civilian markets to address complex security challenges across multiple domains.",
