      "company_summary": "Prima Industrie S.p.A. is a global leader in sheet metal working technologies, operating under the Prima Power brand. The company specializes in providing a comprehensive range of high-performance machinery and integrated solutions, including laser processing, punching, bending, and flexible manufacturing systems, aimed at enhancing profitability for businesses across various industries. With a commitment to innovation and automation, Prima Industrie supports its clients in meeting their manufacturing challenges and achieving future growth.",
