by SHEPHARD STUDIO for RAFAEL\n\n30.10.24\n\n## Systems & Solutions\n\nCombat-proven, open architecture-based, and interoperable\n\n[ Discover All ][40]\nSystem\n\n### IRON BEAM\u2122\n\nHigh Energy Laser Weapon System\n\nSystem\n\n### TROPHY\u00ae APS\n\nThe World\u2019s Only Operational Active Protection System\n\nSystem\n\n### IRON DOME\u00ae Family\n\nShort-to-Medium Range Multi-Mission Air Defense Systems\n\nSystem\n\n### SPIKE\u00ae NLOS\n\n6th Gen Non-Line-of-Sight Stand-Off Game Changer (Up to 50 km)\n\nSystem\n\n### ICE BREAKER\u2122\n\nAdvanced, Long-Range Cruise Missile\n\n## Global Footprint\n\n## Global Footprint\n\nRAFAEL is committed to the expansion of its global Industrial Cooperation programs which foster\nstrong, long-term partnerships, technology transfer, manufacturing localization, and highly valued\ncustomer independence.\n\nOur customers, including 20 NATO countries, are supported by 30 subsidiaries and numerous joint\nventures and teaming agreements around the world.\n\n[ Partner with Us ][41] [ RAFAEL Group ][42]\n\n### Israel\n\n### Usa\n\n### Brazil\n\n### Australia\n\n### UK\n\n### Germany\n\n### UAE\n\n### India\n\n### Far East\n\n### Thiland\n\n## Contact Us\n\nFull Name\nOrganization\nEmail\nPhone Number\nYour Message\nI\u2019d like to receive personalized emails about RAFAEL\u2019s products and services.\nSend\n\n## We appreciate you reaching out\n\nWe have received your message and will respond shortly. In the meantime, tune into RAFAEL's latest\nreleases, news, and updates here\n\n[ News ][43]\n\n## Subscribe to Our Newsletter\n\nStay up to date with RAFAEL's latest news, highlights and events\n\nEmail\n\n## Thank you for signing up :)\n\nFor now, get a first look at RAFAEL's latest news, highlights and events\n\n[ Blog ][44]\n[ Rafael ][45]\n* [Technologies][46]\n* [Newsroom][47]\n* [Our Story][48]\n* [Customer Service][49]\n* [RAFAEL USA][50]\n* [RAFAEL UK][51]\n\nAll Rights Reserved (C) RAFAEL Advanced Defense Systems Ltd. 2025\