            "summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ Rafael ][2]\n* Domains\n  Domains\n  * [Air & Missile Defense][3]\n  * [Air & Space][4]\n  * [Land Warfare][5]\n  * [Naval Warfare][6]\n  * [Intelligence & Cyber][7]\n  * [Multi-Domain][8]\n* [Systems & Solutions][9]\n* [Technologies][10]\n* [Global Footprint][11]\n* [Our Story][12]\n* [Newsroom][13]\n* [Global Suppliers][14]\n* [ Contact Us ][15]\nAI Chat\n\n## Close hamburger menu\n* Domains\n  * [Air & Missile Defense][16]\n  * [Air & Space][17]\n  * [Land Warfare][18]\n  * [Naval Warfare][19]\n  * [Intelligence & Cyber][20]\n  * [Multi-Domain][21]\n* [Systems & Solutions][22]\n* [Technologies][23]\n* [Global Footprint][24]\n* [Our Story][25]\n* [Newsroom][26]\n* [Global Suppliers][27]\n* [ Contact Us ][28]\n* AI Chat\n* Search\n* AI Chat\n* Search\n\n##### Are you sure you want to start a new chat?\n\nThe entire chat will be cleared, and a new conversation will begin.\n\nStart new chat cancel\n\n# RAFAEL Makes History\n\n## World\u2019s First Combat Interceptions with High Energy Laser\n\n[ See it in Action ][29]\n\n## Discover Our Domains\n\n[\n\n### Air & Missile Defense\n\n][30]\nMultilayered Air & Missile Defense systems and solutions.\n[ ][31]\n[\n\n### Land Warfare\n\n][32]\nMissile systems, remote-controlled weapons, advanced communications, passive, reactive and active\nprotection systems, maneuvering-force Counter-UAS solutions.\n[ ][33]\n[\n\n### Air & Space\n\n][34]\nSensors, weapons and systems for fighter-jets, advanced communications, UAS and space-based\nplatforms.\n[ ][35]\n[\n\n### Naval Warfare\n\n][36]\nMissile systems, naval gun-mounts, EW, underwater and Air-Defense systems.\n[ ][37]\n[\n\n### Intelligence & Cyber\n\n][38]\nRAFAEL has pioneered the defense Digital Transformation over the past two decades, with technology\nbreakthroughs in cyber, intelligence, computer vision and AI-driven solutions.\n[ ][39]\n\n## Stay Up to Date\n\nDiscover RAFAEL\u2019s latest news, highlights, and events!\n\nNews\n\n## Rafael &\u00a0SpearUAV\u00a0Introduce IRON WASP C-UAS Capability at Eurosatory 2026\n\n17.06.2026\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL\u00a0At Eurosatory 2026\n\nRAFAEL to Showcase Layered Air Defense & Counter-UAS Capabilities at Eurosatory 2026\n\n15.06.2026\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL ADVANCED DEFENSE SYSTEMS TO EXHIBIT AT ILA BERLIN 2026\n\n09.06.2026\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL AT ILA BERLIN 2026\n\nBuilding A Resilient Partnership Together\n\n02.06.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL at Eurosatory 2026\n\nSEE THE FUTURE OF DEFENSE IN ACTION\n\n01.06.26\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL REPORTS ANOTHER RECORD YEAR\n\nRafael Announces its financial results for 2025\n\n29.03.2026\n\nPodcast\n\n## Layered protection: How air defence is adapting to rising drone and missile threats\n\n20.04.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RECCELITE\u00ae Wide Area Aerial Scanning System-of-Systems for Real-Time ISR\n\nExposing the Needles in Your Haystack\n\n22.03.26\n\nBlog\n\n## Ensure Your Airborne Superiority\u00a0with LITENING\n\nA Powerful Force Multiplier for Today\u2019s Most Complex Operational Arenas\n\n16.03.26\n\nPodcast\n\n## Beyond Survivability: How Active Protection Systems Are Empowering Commanders\n\nAs threats diversify and intensify, APS are proving essential not just for vehicle protection but\nalso for enhancing operational freedom, effectiveness and mission success in contested environments.\n\n09.12.25\n\nBlog\n\n## Bending Light Back into Shape: Adaptive Optics for High-Energy Lasers\n\n28.02.26\n\nNews\n\n## DAVID'S SLING Air Defense System Successfully Completes Complex Test Series as Part of Future\n## Threat Readiness Upgrade\n\n11.02.2026\n\nPodcast\n\n## Energy evolution: How laser defense systems are powering the next phase of air defense\n\nLaser-based air defense is moving from promise to deployment as global threats evolve.\n\n12.06.25\n\nNews\n\n## Kratos & RAFAEL USA Establish \u201cPrometheus, Propulsion & Explosive Systems\u201d\n\n19.02.2026\n\nBlog\n\n## Lighting the Future of Defense: The Prac