      "polished_summary": "Rafael Advanced Defense Systems is a leading defense technology company specializing in advanced air and missile defense systems, land warfare solutions, naval warfare capabilities, and intelligence and cyber technologies. The company offers a diverse range of products, including missile systems, remote-controlled weapons, and high-energy laser systems, targeting military and defense sectors globally to enhance operational effectiveness and security. With a commitment to innovation, Rafael is at the forefront of developing cutting-edge solutions that address evolving threats in multi-domain environments.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Rafael Advanced Defense Systems is directly involved in the development and manufacturing of high-energy laser systems, as evidenced by their mention of the world's first combat interceptions with high-energy laser technology. They provide advanced defense solutions specifically targeting military applications, which aligns with the target market.",
