            "text": "Skip to main content\n\n### RTX Businesses\n* [RTX][1]\n* [Collins Aerospace][2]\n* [Pratt & Whitney][3]\n* [Raytheon][4]\n\n[ RTX ][5]\nInternet Explorer is no longer supported by Microsoft. For best results, we recommend you select an\nalternate browser.\n[[RTX logo]][6]\n[ Menu ][7]\n* [Who We Are][8]\n  Who We Are\n  [Person sitting on desk]\n  * [Overview][9]\n  * [Our Leadership][10]\n  * [Our Values][11]\n  * [Our Global Presence][12]\n  * [Our Businesses][13]\n    * [Collins Aerospace][14]\n    * [Pratt & Whitney][15]\n    * [Raytheon][16]\n  * [Corporate Governance][17]\n    * [Corporate Governance][18]\n    * [Contract Vehicles][19]\n    * [Ethics and Compliance][20]\n    * [Public Activities][21]\n  * [Corporate and Business Headquarters][22]\n* [What We Do][23]\n  What We Do\n  [airplace takes off from ship]\n  * [Transformative Technologies][24]\n    * [Transformative Technologies][25]\n    * [Turning scale into speed][26]\n    * [Era-Defining Innovation][27]\n    * [RTX BBN Technologies][28]\n    * [RTX Technology Research Center][29]\n    * [RTX Ventures][30]\n  * [Future of Flight][31]\n  * [Smarter Defense Systems][32]\n    * [F135 Engine Core Upgrade][33]\n* [News][34]\n  News\n  [Office woman reading]\n  * [Newsroom][35]\n  * [Media Resources][36]\n* [Careers][37]\n* [Our Responsibility][38]\n  Our Responsibility\n  [Two girls participating in a STEM event]\n  * [Overview][39]\n  * [Safety and quality][40]\n  * [Data security and privacy][41]\n  * [Environment, Health and Safety (EH&S)][42]\n  * [Corporate Citizenship][43]\n* [Investors][44]\n* [Suppliers][45]\n* [Contacts][46]\n\nYour browser does not support HTML5 video. Here is a[link to the video][47]\n\n[\n\n# Scaling up to deliver with speed\n\n## A wave of capital expansions across RTX will boost production and delivery for customers\n\n][48]\n[\n[Stormbreaker on rail]\n\n### Innovating at the speed of need\n\n][49][\n\n### Delivering for America\n\n][50][\n[VR munitions]\n\n### Composable weapons: A jump-start on production\n\n][51]\n\n## Progress is developed. It is produced. It defines the future, and it defines us.\n\n[Patriot system deployed]\n[ Patriot Missile Defense System ][52]\n[F35]\n[ Smarter defense systems ][53]\n[ We are RTX ][54]\n\n## Tech and talent to transform the world\n\n[\n[Engineers at site looking at a display]\n\n### Fast track: Engineering with speed\n\n][55][\n[Two employees at station]\n\n### RTX recognized as global leader in patents and innovation\n\n][56][\n[ACES ejection seat close up]\n\n### A commitment to lifesaving performance\n\n][57]\n\nRTX\n* [Who We Are][58]\n* [What We Do][59]\n* [News][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Responsibility][62]\n* [Investors][63]\n* [Media Resources][64]\n* [Suppliers][65]\n* [Contacts][66]\n\nRTX Businesses\n* [RTX][67]\n* [Collins Aerospace][68]\n* [Pratt & Whitney][69]\n* [Raytheon][70]\n\nOUR VALUES IN ACTION\n* [Speak Up][71]\n* [Code of Conduct][72]\n\nFollow Us\n* [ RTX on LinkedIn ][73]\n* [ RTX on X ][74]\n* [ RTX on Facebook ][75]\n* [ RTX on YouTube ][76]\n* [ RTX on Instagram ][77]\n* [ RSS ][78]\n* \u00a9 2026 \u00a0RTX\n* [Accessibility][79]\n* [Terms of Use][80]\n* [Privacy][81]\n* [Manage Cookies Settings][82]\n\nOur website uses cookies and other tools to improve the visitor experience. You can read more about\nthese cookies and tools by clicking on the gray button. To visit our site, click on a button to\nchoose your settings.\nAccept recommended settingsAccept necessary cookies only\n[Manage settings][83]\n[RTX.com Privacy Policy][84]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://www.rtx.com/collinsaerospace\n[3]: https://www.rtx.com/prattwhitney\n[4]: https://www.rtx.com/raytheon\n[5]: https://investors.rtx.com/stock-information/\n[6]: /\n[7]: #\n[8]: \n[9]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/overview\n[10]: /who-we-are/our-leadership\n[11]: /who-we-are/our-values\n[12]: /who-we-are/global-presence\n[13]: /who-we-are/our-businesses\n[14]: https://www.rtx.com/collinsaerospace\n[15]: https://www.rtx.com/prattwhitney\n[16]: https://www.rtx.com/raytheon\n[17]: /who-we-are/corporate-governance\n[18]: /who-we-are/corporate-governance\n[19]: /who-we-are/contract-vehicles\n[20]: /who-we-are/ethics-and-compliance\n[21]: /who-we-are/corporate-governance/public-activities\n[22]: /locations\n[23]: \n[24]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/transformative-technologies\n[25]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/transformative-technologies\n[26]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/transformative-technologies/turning-scale-into-speed\n[27]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/transformative-technologies/era-defining-innovation\n[28]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/transformative-technologies/bbn\n[29]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/transformative-technologies/rtrc\n[30]: /who-we-are/ventures\n[31]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/flight\n[32]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/defense\n[33]: https://www.rtx.com/prattwhitney/products/military-engines/f135/engine-core-upgrade\n[34]: \n[35]: /news\n[36]: /news/media-resources\n[37]: https://careers.rtx.com/global/en\n[38]: \n[39]: /our-responsibility/overview\n[40]: /our-responsibility/safety-and-quality\n[41]: /our-responsibility/data-security-and-privacy\n[42]: /our-responsibility/environment-health-safety\n[43]: /our-responsibility/corporate-citizenship\n[44]: https://investors.rtx.com/#Investors\n[45]: /suppliers\n[46]: /contacts\n[47]: https://prd-sc102-cdn.rtx.com/-/media/rtx/news-images/2026/03/cap--improve-sizzle-v3.mp4?rev=a\n84623a6f16242298db5ddaaf52df738&rid=e967f4c04ec241e18cd5f53c9954fc25\n[48]: /news/2026/04/20/scaling-up-to-deliver-with-speed\n[49]: /news/2026/02/16/innovating-at-the-speed-of-need\n[50]: /who-we-are/global-presence/america\n[51]: /news/2026/04/06/composable-weapons-jumpstart-on-production\n[52]: /news/2025/05/29/patriot-proven-in-battle-and-still-setting-standards\n[53]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/defense\n[54]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx\n[55]: /news/2026/02/19/engineers-week-2026\n[56]: /news/news-center/2026/04/29/rtx-recognized-as-global-leader-in-patents-and-innovation\n[57]: /news/2026/05/18/a-commitment-to-lifesaving-performance\n[58]: /who-we-are/our-values\n[59]: /who-we-are/we-are-rtx/overview\n[60]: /news\n[61]: https://careers.rtx.com/global/en\n[62]: /our-responsibility/overview\n[63]: https://investors.rtx.com/\n[64]: /news/media-resources\n[65]: /suppliers\n[66]: /contacts\n[67]: /\n[68]: https://www.rtx.com/collinsaerospace\n[69]: https://www.rtx.com/prattwhitney\n[70]: https://www.rtx.com/raytheon\n[71]: https://www.rtx.com/who-we-are/ethics-and-compliance#speakup\n[72]: https://www.rtx.com/who-we-are/ethics-and-compliance#raytheon-technologies-code-of-conduct\n[73]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/rtx/\n[74]: https://x.com/rtx_news\n[75]: https://www.facebook.com/rtxcorporation/\n[76]: https://www.youtube.com/@RTXCorporation\n[77]: https://www.instagram.com/rtxcorporation/\n[78]: /rss-feeds/news\n[79]: /accessibility-statement\n[80]: /terms-of-use\n[81]: /privacy\n[82]: /rtx-gdpr/rtx-gdpr-overlay\n[83]: /rtx-gdpr/rtx-gdpr-overlay\n[84]: https://www.rtx.com/privacy"
          }
