      "company_summary": "Rheinmetall AG is a leading German company specializing in advanced military technology and automotive components. The company offers a range of products, including armored military vehicles, precision ammunition, and high-performance automotive parts, catering primarily to military organizations and automotive manufacturers. Additionally, Rheinmetall provides consulting services for defense procurement and comprehensive maintenance and repair solutions for military equipment, reinforcing its commitment to innovation and safety in both the defense and automotive sectors.",
