        "crawl_text": "Rheinmetall Aktiengesellschaft Frankfurt Stock Exchange Listed company Europe North America Asia Advanced military technology Automotive engineering Aerospace systems Strong R&D capabilities Established market presence Diverse product portfolio ISO 9001 NATO standards D\u00fcsseldorf, Germany Brussels, Belgium Vienna, Austria Chaba\u0159ovice, Czech Republic \u00dast\u00ed nad Labem, Czech Republic Trmice, Czech Republic Yutz, France Munich, Germany Bremen, Germany Neuss, Germany Kassel, Germany Dusseldorf, Germany Berlin, Germany Koblenz, Germany Neckarsulm, Germany Germany Austria Belgium Czech Republic France D\u00fcsseldorf, Germany Neckarsulm, Germany Bremen, Germany Neuss, Germany Europe America Asia Australia Rheinmetall employs around 34,000 people as of May 2026. The company operates in over 30 countries with 160 offices and production sites worldwide. Expansion in defense technology Sustainability initiatives in automotive sector Global supply chain disruptions Increased competition in defense sector Growing defense budgets in Europe Demand for advanced automotive technologies Rheinmetall is a leading provider of defense and automotive solutions in Europe and globally. Increased military spending Technological advancements in automotive and defense sectors [jumpToMain][1]\n[siteLogo ][2]\n[168928]\nContact\nRheinmetall AG\n\nDusseldorf, Germany\n\n[Route][3]\n[184922]\n\n# Contact\n\nDo you have any questions about Rheinmetall?\n\nprev next\n\n**Guidebook**\n\n### Select your concern here:\n\nCorporate Social Responsibility\nDo you have questions about our responsibility or about sustainability at Rheinmetall?\n[11]\nSabine Becker\n\nHead of Corporate Sustainability\n\n[ Contact us ][4]\n\nGive aways / advertising material / merchandise\n\nWhere can I order Rheinmetall advertising material/merchandise?\n\nThank you for your interest in Rheinmetall promotional merchandise.\nCurrently, we do not operate an online shop, but we are working on a concept.\n\nAs soon as it is possible to order Rheinmetall items via our website, we will publish this.\n\nCareer\n\nHow can I apply for a job at Rheinmetall?\n\nThank you for your interest in Rheinmetall.\n\nPlease send us your application documents via the job gateway on our website. Unfortunately, we\ncannot accept or process applications by email due to data protection regulations.\n\n[ Learn more ][5]\nDo you have questions about your application or the application process?\n[ Contact us ][6]\nI am a student at a university / higher education institution and am interested in Rheinmetall.\n\nAre you interested in Rheinmetall as part of your student research project?\n\nYou can contact us here regarding the following:\n1. Supervision of seminar papers\n2. Company surveys\n3. Expert interviews\n\nPlease do not forward enquiries from the university to the press office, as they can only accept\nenquiries from media representatives.\n\nIf you are interested in the many career opportunities at Rheinmetall, you will find information on\nthe wide range of entry options under \u2018Career\u2019.\n\n[ Contact us ][7]\nI am organising career/job fairs and events, and would like to get in touch with Rheinmetall.\n\nUniversity Marketing\n\n[ Contact us ][8]\n\nWhistleblower system (report violation)\n\nWhistleblower system\n\nThe whistleblower system lets you report any misconduct, especially violations of applicable law and\ninternal instructions and procedures. This service is offered to employees and external persons who\nwish to draw attention to breaches of the rules at Rheinmetall companies and their suppliers and\nbusiness partners.\n\n[ REPORT VIOLATION ][9]\nInvestor Relations\nHow can I register for the Annual General Meeting?\n\nIf you hold Rheinmetall shares, the invitation will be sent to you automatically by the custodian\nbank. The invitation contains information on the time and location of the Annual General Meeting.\nDetails can also be found on our website at Rheinmetall / Investor Relations / Annual General\nMeeting.\n\n[ Learn more ][10]\nHow can I buy Rheinmetall shares?\n\nPlease contact your custodian bank, investment advisor or broker regarding trading in shares.\n\nWhen and where will the next Annual General Meeting take place?\n\nThe Annual General Meeting will be held on the basis of article 15 (3) of the company's statues as a\nvirtual Annual General Meeting in accordance with article 118a (1) sentence 1 of the German Stock\nCorporation Act (AktG), without the physical presence of shareholders or their proxies (with the\nexception of the company's proxies) at the location of the Annual General Meeting. The location of\nthe Annual General Meeting within the meaning of the German Stock Corporation Act is Rheinmetall\nPlatz 1, 40476 D\u00fcsseldorf.\n\n[ Learn more ][11]\nAt what point do you need to hold the share to be entitled to receive a dividend?\n\nThe share must be booked into your portfolio account of your bank on the day of the Annual General\nMeeting.\n\nWhen will the dividend be paid?\n\nPursuant to Section 58 para. 4 sentence 2 AktG, the claim to the dividend will be due on the third\nbusiness day following the resolution of the Annual General Meeting, i.e. on Friday, 15 May 2026.\n\nWhere can I find the invitation to the Annual General Meeting?\n\nPlease find the invitation to the Annual General Meeting on our website.\n\n[ Lean more ][12]\nWhat are the requirements for participating in the virtual AGM and when is the authentic deadline?\n\nShareholders who are entitled to participate in the virtual Annual General Meeting, and in\nparticular to exercise their voting rights, are those who are shareholders of the Company at the\nclose of business on the 22nd day before the Annual General Meeting, i.e. on 20 April 2026 (24:00 =\nend of day CEST) (record date), and register for the Annual General Meeting in good time.\n\n[ REGISTRATION DETAILS CAN BE FOUND IN THE ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING INVITATION ][13]\n\nPress and Public Relations\n\nI am a media representative and would like to contact Rheinmetall with an editorial enquiry.\n\nAre you a representative of the media/press and would like to submit a press enquiry?\n\nPlease use our press portal for this.\n\n[ Lean more ][14]\nAs a media representative, I am interested in a filming date or a visit to one of Rheinmetall's\nsites.\n\nAs much as we appreciate your interest in Rheinmetall, we must point out that we are currently\nreceiving a very high amount of media enquiries regarding the topic of the \u201cboom in defence industry\norders\u201d, particularly those involving requests for site visits.\n\nUnfortunately, due to capacity constraints, we are unable to accommodate the large number of visit\nrequests\u2014especially given the strict security regulations in place at our sites.\n\nWe kindly ask for your understanding.\n\nSite visits\n\nI am interested in visiting Rheinmetall as a private person.\n\nDue to high security restrictions, we are unfortunately unable to offer visits or site tours for\ninterested groups or private persons. Our sites are not open to the public.\n\nContact\n[168928]\nRheinmetall AG\n\nRheinmetall Platz 1\n\n40476 Dusseldorf\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][15]\n\nPO box 10 42 61\n\n40033 D\u00fcsseldorf\n\nRheinmetall AG\n\nRheinmetall Platz 1\n\n40476 Dusseldorf\n\nGermany\n\n[Contact us][16]\n\nQuick Links:\n\n\u00a9 2026 Rheinmetall AG Privacy Settings\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /en\n[3]: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&travelmode=driving&destination=Rheinmetall Platz 1,40476\n,Dusseldorf,DE\n[4]: /en/contact/4000/?referer=en/company/contact\n[5]: /en/career/vacancies\n[6]: /en/career/career-contact\n[7]: /en/career/career-contact\n[8]: /en/contact/743247/?referer=en/company/contact\n[9]: /en/company/compliance/reporting-violations\n[10]: https://ir.rheinmetall.com/investor-relations/annual-general-meeting/\n[11]: https://ir.rheinmetall.com/investor-relations/annual-general-meeting/\n[12]: https://ir.rheinmetall.com/investor-relations/annual-general-meeting/\n[13]: https://ir.rheinmetall.com/investor-relations/annual-general-meeting/\n[14]: /en/meta/emails/contact-form-press\n[15]: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&travelmode=driving&destination=Rheinmetall Platz 1,4047\n6,Dusseldorf,DE\n[16]: /en/company/contact [jumpToMain][1]\n[siteLogo ][2]\n[168928]\nContact\nRheinmetall AG\n\nDusseldorf, Germany\n\n[Route][3]\n[27334]\n\n# Locations worldwide\n\nprev next\n\nA market and customer-oriented approach and the establishment of lasting relationships with\ncustomers form the basis of Rheinmetall\u2019s business activities. The activities are consistently\naligned towards the economic regions of Europe, America, Asia and Australia. Rheinmetall currently\nemploys around 34,000* people, and is represented at 160* offices and production sites worldwide in\nmore than 30 countries.\n\n* status May 2026 (continuing operations)\n\n## Rheinmetall **headquarters**\n\n[272]\nRheinmetall Aktiengesellschaft (Rheinmetall AG) with its head office in D\u00fcsseldorf, Germany, is the\nparent company of the Rheinmetall Group.\n\n#### Rheinmetall AG\n\nRheinmetall Platz\n40476 D\u00fcsseldorf\nP.O. box 10 42 61\n40033 D\u00fcsseldorf\n\n[ Contact us ][4]\n\n## All **sites worldwide**\n\nprev\nEurope\nAfrica\nAmerica\nAsia\nAustralasia\nnext\ntabs\nAustria\nRheinmetall MAN Military Vehicles \u00d6sterreich GesmbH\n\nBrunner Stra\u00dfe 44-50\n\n1230 Wien\n\nAustria\n\n[Route][5]\n\nPhone: [+43 1 866 20-0][6]\n\nFax: +43 1 866 20-1108\n\n[ Contact us ][7]\nRheinmetall Waffe Munition ARGES GmbH\n\nKaufing 31\n\n4690 R\u00fcstorf/Schwanenstadt\n\nAustria\n\n[Route][8]\n\nPhone: [+43 7673 805 10-0][9]\n\nFax: +43 7673 805 10-10\n\n[ Contact us ][10]\nBelgium\nRheinmetall AG\n\nRepresenative Office Brussels\n\nRue du Luxembourg 23\n\n1000 Brussel\n\nBelgium\n\n[Route][11]\n\nPhone: [+32 (0) 2 586 4560][12]\n\n[ Contact us ][13]\nCzech Republic\nKS CZ Motorservice s.r.o.\n\nSmetanova 716\n\n403 17 Chaba\u0159ovice\n\nCzech Republic\n\n[Route][14]\n\nPhone: [+420 (0) 473 030 814][15]\n\n[ Contact us ][16]\nPierburg s.r.o.\n\nK Pierburgu 1\n\n400 01 \u00dast\u00ed nad Labem\n\nCzech Republic\n\n[Route][17]\n\nPhone: [+420-4 75 30 36 77][18]\n\nFax: +420-4 75 30 31 97\n\n[ Contact us ][19]\nRheinmetall \u010cesk\u00e1 Republika s.r.o.\n\nD\u016flni 362/2\n\n400 04 Trmice\n\nCzech Republic\n\n[Route][20]\n\n[ Contact us ][21]\nFrance\nPierburg Pump Technology France S.\u00e0 r.l.\n\nZ.I. de Thionville, Nord-Est.\n\n57974 Yutz C\u00e9dex\n\nFrance\n\n[Route][22]\n\nPO box BP. 10149\n\nBasse Ham\n\nPhone: [+33 382 55 93 93][23]\n\nFax: +33 382 55 93 35\n\n[ Contact us ][24]\nGermany\nARTEC GmbH\n\nAm M\u00fcnchfeld 59\n\n80999 Munich\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][25]\n\nPhone: [+49 (0) 89 43 78 024 0][26]\n\n[website][27]\n\n[ Contact us ][28]\nbenntec Systemtechnik GmbH\n\nKarl-Ferdinand-Braun-Str. 7\n\n28359 Bremen\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][29]\n\nPhone: [+49 421 43849-0][30]\n\nFax: +49 421 43849-90\n\n[www.benntec.de][31]\n\n[ Contact us ][32]\nblackned GmbH\n\nZugspitzstra\u00dfe 1\n\n87751 Heimertingen\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][33]\n\nPhone: [+49 8331 9959 600][34]\n\nFax: +49 8331 9959 609\n\n[ Contact us ][35]\nDynITEC GmbH\n\nKaiserstr. 3\n\n53840 Troisdorf\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][36]\n\nPhone: [+49 2241 208-4200][37]\n\nFax: +49 30 52004-1199\n\n[ Contact us ][38]\nEuroSpike GmbH\n\nFischbachstra\u00dfe 16\n\n90552 R\u00f6thenbach (Pegnitz)\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][39]\n\nPhone: [+49 911 957-2929][40]\n\nFax: +49 911 957-2160\n\n[ Contact us ][41]\nHFTS Helicopter Flight Training Services GmbH\n\nLudwigstr. 49\n\n85399 Hallbergmoos\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][42]\n\nPhone: [+49 811 5555 8-0][43]\n\nFax: +49 811 5555 8-87\n\nHIL Industrie-Holding GmbH\n\nUlrich-von-Hassell-Stra\u00dfe 64\n\n53123 Bonn\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][44]\n\n[ Contact us ][45]\nIndustriepark Neckarsulm Energie GmbH\n\nRheinmetall Energy Services\n\nKarl-Schmidt-Stra\u00dfe 2-8\n\n74172 Neckarsulm\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][46]\n\nPhone: [07132-33-0][47]\n\n[ Contact us ][48]\nKS Gleitlager GmbH\n\nAm Bahnhof 14\n\n68789 St. Leon-Rot\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][49]\n\nPhone: [+49 62 27-5 60][50]\n\nFax: +49 62 27-5 62 40\n\n[ Contact us ][51]\nKS Gleitlager GmbH\n\nBranch Papenburg\n\nFriesenstra\u00dfe 2\n\n26871 Papenburg\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][52]\n\nPhone: [+49 49 61-98 60][53]\n\nFax: +49 49 61-98 61 03\n\n[ Contact us ][54]\nKS HUAYU AluTech GmbH\n\nHafenstra\u00dfe 25\n\n74172 Neckarsulm\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][55]\n\nPhone: [+49 7132 33-0][56]\n\nFax: +49 7132 33-4357\n\n[ Contact us ][57]\nKS HUAYU Bearbeitungs GmbH\n\nDesbrocksriede 3\n\n30855 Langenhagen\n\nGermany\n\n[Route][58]\n\nPhone: [+49 (0) 511 2797"
