r ][168]\n      * [TRUMPF as an employer][169]\n      * [Benefits and opportunities][170]\n      * [Diversity][171]\n    * * [Development opportunities][172]\n      * [International work][173]\n  * [Experienced professionals][174]\n  * [Graduates][175]\n  * [Students][176]\n  * [Apprenticeships][177]\n  * [People at TRUMPF][178]\nSearch\n[ Contact ][179]\n[ India | EN ][180]\n[ To MyTRUMPF ][181]\n[ India | EN ][182]\n[ Contact ][183]\n[ To MyTRUMPF ][184]\n**TruBend**\n\n# Think ahead. Bend better\n\nDiscover TRUMPF\u2019s advanced bending solutions\u2014from die and panel bending to large-format and fully\nautomated systems. TruBend machines combine precision, flexibility, and smart automation with\noperator-friendly design\u2014empowering you to create simple to complex parts efficiently and\ncost-effectively.\n\n[Find out more][185]\n**Semiconductor manufacturing**\n\n## No microchips without TRUMPF\n\nTRUMPF is driving semiconductor manufacturing forward \u2013 with efficient, innovative and sustainable\nEUV, laser and plasma solutions for state-of-the-art microprocessors and AI chips.\n\n[Find out more][186]\n**Bending tools**\n\n## Beyond Bending: Your Entry into the 360\u00b0 World of Bending\n\nWith the 360\u00b0 bending world from TRUMPF, you can think beyond individual products. They combine the\nmachine, bending tools, software and services into one smart entire system.\u00a0\n\n[Find out more][187]\n**3D laser cutting machines**\n\n## Our 3D laser cutting systems: Safe choice. Exciting performance.\n\nFind out all about our solutions for cutting hot-formed components. With TRUMPF as your experienced\npartner, you are making the right choice for minimum downtime and maximum productivity.\n\n[Find out more][188]\n**Laser cutting**\n\n## You cut, we care\n\nThe perfect partnership for 2D laser cutting: We offer more than just machines - with service,\ninnovations and clever functions,\u00a0 your success is always our focus.\ufeff\u00a0Together we can achieve more.\n\n[Find out more][189]\n**Customer magazine**\n\n## TRUe #23\n\nRead the newest issue of TRUe \u2013 our magazine for\u00a0sheet metal experts. Learn more about trends,\nfuture technologies, new solutions and experiences from actual users.\u00a0\n\n[Find out more][190]\n\n## Newsroom\n\nStory\n\n#### Smart fitter rocks tubes: how a young entrepreneur cuts parts in shifts\n\nIn 20 years, Peter G\u00f6tzl has turned his one-man locksmith store i"
