 [Company][112]\n  * [Overview Company][113]\n  * [Profile][114]\n    * * [ Overview Profile ][115]\n      * [About us][116]\n      * [Managing Board][117]\n      * [Supervisory Board][118]\n    * * [Annual report][119]\n      * [Locations][120]\n  * [Principles][121]\n    * * [ Overview Principles ][122]\n      * [Company Principles][123]\n      * [Quality][124]\n    * * [SYNCHRO][125]\n      * [Suppliers][126]\n  * [Events and dates for your calendar][127]\n  * [History][128]\n    * * [ Overview History ][129]\n      * [2020 - today][130]\n      * [The years 2013-2019][131]\n      * [2005-2012][132]\n      * [1996-2004][133]\n    * * [1985-1995][134]\n      * [1978-1984][135]\n      * [1967-1977][136]\n      * [1960-1966][137]\n    * * [1950-1959][138]\n      * [1934-1949][139]\n      * [1923-1933][140]\n  * [Additional fields of activity][141]\n    * * [ Overview Additional fields of activity ][142]\n      * [Affiliated companies and other brands][143]\n      * [Financial Services][144]\n      * [TRUMPF Venture][145]\n* [Sustainability][146]\n  * [Overview Sustainability][147]\n  * [Climate action and environmental protection][148]\n    * * [ Overview Climate action and environmental protection ][149]\n      * [Climate action at our sites][150]\n      * [Sustainable production with TRUMPF][151]\n  * [Social issues and the community][152]\n    * * [ Overview Social issues and the community ][153]\n      * [Employees][154]\n      * [Social engagement][155]\n    * * [Education and research][156]\n      * [Art and culture][157]\n  * [Corporate governance][158]\n    * * [ Overview Corporate governance ][159]\n      * [Compliance][160]\n      * [Data security][161]\n* [Newsroom][162]\n* [Careers][163]\n  * [Overview Careers][164]\n  * [Vacancies][165]\n  * [How to apply][166]\n  * [TRUMPF as an employer][167]\n    * * [ Overview TRUMPF as an employer ][168]\n      * [TRUMPF as an employer][169]\n      * [Benefits and opportunities][170]\n      * [Diversity][171]\n    * * [Development opportunities][172]\n      * [International work][173]\n  * [Experienced professionals][174]\n  * [Graduates][175]\n  * [Students][176]\n  * [Apprenticeships][177]\n  * [People at TRUMPF][178]\nSearch\n[ Contact ][179]\n[ India | EN ][180]\n[ To MyTRUMPF ][181]\n[ India | EN ][182]\n[ Contact ][183]\n[ To MyTRUMPF ][184]\n**TruBend**\n\n# Think ahead. Bend better\n\nDiscover TRUMPF\u2019s advanced bending solutions\u2014from die and panel bending to large-format and fully\nautomated systems. TruBend machines combine precision, flexibility, and smart automation with\noperator-friendly design\u2014empowering you to create simple to complex parts efficiently and\ncost-effectively.\n\n[Find out more][185]\n**Semiconductor manufacturing**\n\n## No microchips without TRUMPF\n\nTRUMPF is driving semiconductor manufacturing forward \u2013 with efficient, innovative and sustainable\nEUV, laser and plasma solutions for state-of-the-art microprocessors and AI chips.\n\n[Find out more][186]\n**Bending tools**\n\n## Beyond Bending: Your Entry into the 360\u00b0 World of Bending\n\nWith the 360\u00b0 bending world from TRUMPF, you can think beyond individual products. They combine the\nmachine, bending tools, software and services into one smart entire system.\u00a0\n\n[Find out more][187]\n**3D laser cutting machines**\n\n## Our 3D laser cutting systems: Safe choice. Exciting performance.\n\nFind out all about our solutions for cutting hot-formed components. With TRUMPF as your experienced\npartner, you are making the right choice for minimum downtime and maximum productivity.\n\n[Find out more][188]\n**Laser cutting**\n\n## You cut, we care\n\nThe perfect partnership for 2D laser cutting: We offer more than just machines - with service,\ninnovations and clever functions,\u00a0 your success is always our focus.\ufeff\u00a0Together we can achieve more.\n\n[Find out more][189]\n**Customer magazine**\n\n## TRUe #23\n\nRead the newest issue of TRUe \u2013 our magazine for\u00a0sheet metal experts. Learn more about trends,\nfuture technologies, new solutions and experiences from actual users.\u00a0\n\n[Find out more][190]\n\n## Newsroom\n\nStory\n\n#### Smart fitter rocks tubes: how a young entrepreneur cuts parts in shifts\n\nIn 20 years, Peter G\u00f6tzl has turned his one-man locksmith store into a leading, fully automated\nhigh-tech center \u2013 thanks to TRUMPF laser tube cutting.\n\n[ Find out more ][191]\nStory\n\n#### World Cup Fever on a Grand Scale: TRUMPF and Daktronics Show Who Will Be The World Champion\n\nWith its displays, Daktronics is turning the 2026 World Cup in the U.S. into a spectacular\nexperience.\n\n[ Find out more ][192]\n[Biegeteile]\nStory\n\n#### \"The part costs are crucial\"\n\nThe price of a machine is often not the only factor to consider when making a purchase. Tobias\nReuther, Head of Product Management at TRUMPF, explains what\n\n[ Find out more ][193]\nStory\n\n#### How TRUMPF Embodies Quality\n\nTRUMPF embodies systematic and preventive quality \u2013 from suppliers to production through to service,\nthus preventing errors before they reach customers.\n\n[ Find out more ][194]\n[Chip_Stage]\nStory\n\n#### How microchips are created thanks to TRUMPF\n\nTRUMPF is involved in many of the production steps of a microchip. A look behind the scenes of one\nof the most complex production facilities in the world.\n\n[ Find out more ][195]\n[ To the Newsroom ][196]\n[ To the product ][197] [ To the product ][198] [ To the product ][199] [ To the product ][200] [ To\nthe product ][201] [ To the product ][202] [ To the product ][203] [ To the product ][204]\n\n## TRUMPF \u2013 committed to innovation since 1923\n\nMillion euros\nResearch and Development expenditure\nDevelopment ratio\nRelative to our sales\nPeople\nWho work on new products\n\n## We provide appropriate manufacturing solutions\n\n[TRUMPF's application variety] [\n\n### Applications\n\nDiscover solutions ][205] [Sectors, TRUMPF SE + Co. KG] [\n\n### Industries\n\nDiscover solutions ][206]\n[To the overview][207]\n\n### Success story of our customer EKPO\n\nArno Bayer, Head of Industrial Engineering Joining at EKPO\n\nWe particularly appreciate the TruFiber's combination of outstanding beam quality and process\nreliability.\n\n[Read story ][208]\n[To the overview][209]\n\n### Success story of our customer S&amp;S Steinhuber GmbH\n\nGerhard Steinhuber, S&amp;S Steinhuber GmbH\n\nFor us, the Flex Cell is an ideal solution in terms of cost-benefit ratio.\n\n[Read story ][210]\n[To the overview][211]\n\n### Success story of our customer ElringKlinger AG\n\nDr. Ing. Daniel Weller, joining technology specialist in the Battery Technology business division at\nElringKlinger AG\n\nThe system works according to the \"what-you-see-is-what-you-get\" principle. This is easy to\nunderstand, even for non-programmers.\n\n[Read story ][212]\n[To the overview][213]\n\n### Success story of our customer GEDIA Gebr\u00fcder Dingerkus GmbH\n\nBj\u00f6rn M\u00fcller, Head of Production Factory 2, GEDIA GmbH\n\nIt was a really good collaborative project. Together, we searched for solutions that perfectly met\nour individual requirements.\n\n[Read story ][214]\n[To the overview][215]\n\n### The success story of our customer hago GmbH\n\nJoseph Gampp, Division Manager of Product Management, Feinwerktechnik hago\n\nThe technology fits perfectly into our strategic alignment.\n\n[Read story ][216]\n[A job interview at TRUMPF in Ditzingen showing the applicant and an employee of the HR Department]\n[\n\n### Careers\n\nFind out more ][217] [\n\n### Company\n\nFind out more ][218] [\n\n### Newsroom\n\nFind out more ][219] [People encircle a metal globe] [\n\n### Responsibility\n\nFind out more ][220]\n\n## Locations\n\n## IN\n\n##### TRUMPF (India) Pvt. Ltd.\n\nRaisoni Industrial Park, S. No. 276, Hissa No.1 Village Mann, Taluka- Mulshi\n411057 Pune - Maharashtra\nIndia\n\n[ Phone +91 20 6675 9800 ][221]\nFax +91 20 6675 9899\n[sales@in.trumpf.com][222]\n[ Search for our locations ][223]\n[ Contact ][224]\n[ Newsroom ][225]\n[ Events and dates for your calendar ][226]\n[ TRUMPF newsletter registration ][227]\nOnline services\n* [ Contact ][228]\n* [ Locations ][229]\n* [ Events and dates for your calendar ][230]\n* [ Registration for newsletter ][231]\n* [ MyTRUMPF ][232]\n* [ Safety data sheets ][233]\nProducts\n* [ Machines & systems ][234]\n* [ Lasers ][235]\n* [ Power electronics ][236]\n* [ Power tools ][237]\n* [ Smart Factory ][238]\n* [ Softwar"
