ion line starts operations in July, CEO says\n\nRead more\n][138]\n[ View all feature stories ][139]\n\n### Featured products\n\nCommercial\n\n#### 787 Dreamliner\n\n[Product Info ][140]\n\nDefense\n\n#### MQ-28 Ghost Bat\n\n[Product Info ][141]\n\nCommercial\n\n#### 777X\n\n[Product Info ][142]\n\nDefense\n\n#### KC-46 Pegasus\n\n[Product Info ][143]\n\nCommercial\n\n#### 737 MAX\n\n[Product Info ][144]\n\nSpace\n\n#### X-37B\n\n[Product Info ][145]\n[Exterior view of airplane] [Exterior view of airplane]\n\n#### Strengthening safety and quality\n\n[ Our Action Plan ][146]\n\n**OUR PURPOSE**\n\n## Innovating aerospace since 1916\n\n##### A leading global aerospace company and top U.S. exporter, Boeing develops, manufactures and\n##### services commercial airplanes, defense products and space systems for customers in more than\n##### 150 countries.\n\n#### Commercial\n\nExpert design, efficiency and value for a superior flying experience.\n\n[Commercial Products ][147]\n\n#### Defense\n\nGame-changing family of systems and solutions that empower warfighters, protect nations and advance\nglobal security.\n\n[Defense Products ][148]\n\n#### Space\n\nExploring what\u2019s possible in the future of space and satellite technology.\n\n[Space Products ][149]\n[Employee working on a product] [Employee working on a product]\n\n#### Boeing Global Services\n\nHelping you achieve new levels of aviation efficiency, reliability and affordability.\n\n[ Global Services Website ][150]\n\n**OUR COMMITMENT**\n\n## Supporting responsible growth\n\n##### We're engineering the future of aerospace by combining smart, sustainable innovation with\n##### safety and quality at every step. Investing in our people and communities fosters environments\n##### where ideas thrive.\n\n#### Safety\n\nDelivering products and services with a focus on safety, quality, integrity and sustainability is\nfundamental to our mission.\n\n[Our Progress ][151]\n\n#### Innovation\n\nThere\u2019s more innovation underway today at Boeing than at any time in our storied history.\n\n[Investing in the Future ][152]\n\n#### Global Presence\n\nWe\u2019re dedicated to connecting cultures and supporting the security needs of our customers around the\nworld.\n\n[International Focus ][153]\n\n#### Explore more\n\n[\n\n##### People and Culture\n\n][154]\n[\n\n##### Sustainability\n\n][155]\n[\n\n##### Community Engagement\n\n][156]\n[\n\n##### Aerospace Safety Timeline\n\n][157]\n[\n\n##### Our History\n\n][158]\n[\n\n##### Tours and Merchandise\n\n][159]\n[Boeing employee working in plane interior] [Boeing emp"
