        "crawl_text": "### Get the latest news\n### **newsletter signup**\n\nEmail Address *\nFirst Name\nLast Name\n[Enews signup][1] Search:\n[Helical][2]\n* [Exhaust Valves][3]\n  * [Exhaust Valves][4]\n  * [Acoustic Exhaust Valves][5]\n  * [EGR Emission Control Exhaust Valves][6]\n* [Actuators][7]\n  * [Actuators][8]\n  * [Electronic][9]\n  * [Pneumatic][10]\n  * [Turbocharger Applications][11]\n* [Valve Rotators][12]\n  * [Valve Rotators][13]\n  * [Valve Rotator Test Centre][14]\n  * [Benefits of Valve Rotators][15]\n  * [Valve Rotator Applications][16]\n  * [Types of Valve Rotators][17]\n  * [Manufacturing][18]\n  * [Castings][19]\n* [Prototype Exhausts][20]\n  * [Prototype Exhausts][21]\n  * [Introduction][22]\n  * [TXR Valvetronic Titanium Exhausts][23]\n* [Technical Centre][24]\n  * [Technical Centre][25]\n  * [Engine and Powertrain Testing][26]\n  * [Vibration Systems][27]\n  * [Natural Gas Burners][28]\n  * [Environmental Chambers][29]\n  * [Additional Facilities][30]\n  * [Services][31]\n* [EGR][32]\n  * [EGR][33]\n  * [EGR Cooler System][34]\n* [R&D][35]\n  * [R&D][36]\n  * [Blue Sky Product Development][37]\n  * [Electronic Actuators][38]\n  * [Prototype Capabilities][39]\n  * [TR Supercar Project][40]\n* [About Us][41]\n  * [About Us][42]\n  * [Contact Us][43]\n  * [Manufacture][44]\n  * [Quality & Environment][45]\n  * [Timeline][46]\n  * [Global Locations][47]\n  * [Helical Auto Technology India][48]\n  * [Vacancies][49]\n  * [Latest News][50]\n  * [Heritage & Inspiration][51]\n\n### Exhaust Valves\n\nHelical develops and manufactures exhaust valves for many of the world\u2019s leading performance and\nluxury car brands. [FIND OUT MORE][52]\n\n### Technical Centre\n\nThe Warton Technical Centre offers a range of test facilities for vehicles, engines and components,\nincluding low and ultra-low emission vehicle technologies such as hybrid and electric. [FIND OUT\nMORE][53]\n\n[Actuators\n\nOur electronic and pneumatic actuators for turbochargers enable fast and precise control, reducing\nvehicle emissions.\n\nFind out more][54]\n[Valve Rotators\n\nHelical valve rotators for large diesel and gas engines help to keep valves cleaner, reducing carbon\nbuild-up and so lowering engine emissions - as well as extending the life of key engine and valve\ngear components.\n\nFind out more][55]\n[R&D\n\nHelical develops innovative concept designs for products and prototypes for premium automotive and\nother clients.\n\nFind out more][56]\n[Prototype Exhausts\n\nDesign and fabrication of branded batch production, development samples and prototypes of bespoke\nexotic exhaust systems for luxury and performance vehicles.\n\nFind out more][57]\n\n## **Innovative technology** for improving performance and reducing emissions\n\nHelical Technology has been established since 1962 and has a global presence with production\nfacilities in the UK, India and China. With a background in the design and manufacture of springs,\nvalve rotators and actuators, the business is now a world leader in the design and manufacture of\nacoustic and EGR exhaust valves and offers world class testing services at its purpose built\nTechnical Centre. [Tell me more][58]\u00a0[Contact the team][59]\n\n### **Contact the Team**\n\nLytham Site: Helical Technology Ltd, Dock Road, Lytham, FY8 5AQ, UK\n[+44(0)3333 444 546][60]\n\nWarton Site: Helical Technical Centre, Hillock Lane, Warton, Lancashire, PR4 1TP, UK\n[+44(0)1253 530 480][61]\n* [Vacancies][62]\n* [Global Locations][63]\n* [Privacy Policy][64]\n* [Terms & Conditions][65]\n* [Copyright][66]\n* [Actuators][67]\n\n[Helical Anti-Slavery and Human Trafficking Statement 2026 signed][68]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2016 Helical Technology | Registered in England and Wales No: 1413643 | VAT No: GB 350\n1031 22 000\n\n\u00a0\n* [Exhaust Valves][69]\n  * [Exhaust Valves][70]\n  * [Acoustic Exhaust Valves][71]\n  * [EGR Emission Control Exhaust Valves][72]\n  * Back\n* [Actuators][73]\n  * [Actuators][74]\n  * [Electronic][75]\n  * [Pneumatic][76]\n  * [Turbocharger Applications][77]\n  * Back\n* [Valve Rotators][78]\n  * [Valve Rotators][79]\n  * [Valve Rotator Test Centre][80]\n  * [Benefits of Valve Rotators][81]\n  * [Valve Rotator Applications][82]\n  * [Types of Valve Rotators][83]\n  * [Manufacturing][84]\n  * [Castings][85]\n  * Back\n* [Prototype Exhausts][86]\n  * [Prototype Exhausts][87]\n  * [Introduction][88]\n  * [TXR Valvetronic Titanium Exhausts][89]\n  * Back\n* [Technical Centre][90]\n  * [Technical Centre][91]\n  * [Engine and Powertrain Testing][92]\n  * [Vibration Systems][93]\n  * [Natural Gas Burners][94]\n  * [Environmental Chambers][95]\n  * [Additional Facilities][96]\n  * [Services][97]\n  * Back\n* [EGR][98]\n  * [EGR][99]\n  * [EGR Cooler System][100]\n  * Back\n* [R&D][101]\n  * [R&D][102]\n  * [Blue Sky Product Development][103]\n  * [Electronic Actuators][104]\n  * [Prototype Capabilities][105]\n  * [TR Supercar Project][106]\n  * Back\n* [About Us][107]\n  * [About Us][108]\n  * [Contact Us][109]\n  * [Manufacture][110]\n  * [Quality & Environment][111]\n  * [Timeline][112]\n  * [Global Locations][113]\n  * [Helical Auto Technology India][114]\n  * [Vacancies][115]\n  * [Latest News ### Get the latest news\n### **newsletter signup**\n\nEmail Address *\nFirst Name\nLast Name\n[Enews signup][1] Search:\n[Helical][2]\n* [Exhaust Valves][3]\n  * [Exhaust Valves][4]\n  * [Acoustic Exhaust Valves][5]\n  * [EGR Emission Control Exhaust Valves][6]\n* [Actuators][7]\n  * [Actuators][8]\n  * [Electronic][9]\n  * [Pneumatic][10]\n  * [Turbocharger Applications][11]\n* [Valve Rotators][12]\n  * [Valve Rotators][13]\n  * [Valve Rotator Test Centre][14]\n  * [Benefits of Valve Rotators][15]\n  * [Valve Rotator Applications][16]\n  * [Types of Valve Rotators][17]\n  * [Manufacturing][18]\n  * [Castings][19]\n* [Prototype Exhausts][20]\n  * [Prototype Exhausts][21]\n  * [Introduction][22]\n  * [TXR Valvetronic Titanium Exhausts][23]\n* [Technical Centre][24]\n  * [Technical Centre][25]\n  * [Engine and Powertrain Testing][26]\n  * [Vibration Systems][27]\n  * [Natural Gas Burners][28]\n  * [Environmental Chambers][29]\n  * [Additional Facilities][30]\n  * [Services][31]\n* [EGR][32]\n  * [EGR][33]\n  * [EGR Cooler System][34]\n* [R&D][35]\n  * [R&D][36]\n  * [Blue Sky Product Development][37]\n  * [Electronic Actuators][38]\n  * [Prototype Capabilities][39]\n  * [TR Supercar Project][40]\n* [About Us][41]\n  * [About Us][42]\n  * [Contact Us][43]\n  * [Manufacture][44]\n  * [Quality & Environment][45]\n  * [Timeline][46]\n  * [Global Locations][47]\n  * [Helical Auto Technology India][48]\n  * [Vacancies][49]\n  * [Latest News][50]\n  * [Heritage & Inspiration][51]\n\n### Exhaust Valves\n\nHelical develops and manufactures exhaust valves for many of the world\u2019s leading performance and\nluxury car brands. [FIND OUT MORE][52]\n\n### Technical Centre\n\nThe Warton Technical Centre offers a range of test facilities for vehicles, engines and components,\nincluding low and ultra-low emission vehicle technologies such as hybrid and electric. [FIND OUT\nMORE][53]\n\n[Actuators\n\nOur electronic and pneumatic actuators for turbochargers enable fast and precise control, reducing\nvehicle emissions.\n\nFind out more][54]\n[Valve Rotators\n\nHelical valve rotators for large diesel and gas engines help to keep valves cleaner, reducing carbon\nbuild-up and so lowering engine emissions - as well as extending the life of key engine and valve\ngear components.\n\nFind out more][55]\n[R&D\n\nHelical develops innovative concept designs for products and prototypes for premium automotive and\nother clients.\n\nFind out more][56]\n[Prototype Exhausts\n\nDesign and fabrication of branded batch production, development samples and prototypes of bespoke\nexotic exhaust systems for luxury and performance vehicles.\n\nFind out more][57]\n\n## **Innovative technology** for improving performance and reducing emissions\n\nHelical Technology has been established since 1962 and has a global presence with production\nfacilities in the UK, India and China. With a background in the design and manufacture of springs,\nvalve rotators and actuators, the business is now a world leader in the design and manufacture of\nacoustic and EGR exhaust valves and offers world class testing services at its purpose built\nTechnical Centre. [Tell me more][58]\u00a0[Contact the team][59]\n\n### **Contact the Team**\n\nLytham Site: Helical Technology Ltd, Dock Road, Lytham, FY8 5AQ, UK\n[+44(0)3333 444 546][60]\n\nWarton Site: Helical Technical Centre, Hillock Lane, Warton, Lancashire, PR4 1TP, UK\n[+44(0)1253 530 480][61]\n* [Vacancies][62]\n* [Global Locations][63]\n* [Privacy Policy][64]\n* [Terms & Conditions][65]\n* [Copyright][66]\n* [Actuators][67]\n\n[Helical Anti-Slavery and Human Trafficking Statement 2026 signed][68]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2016 Helical Technology | Registered in England and Wales No: 1413643 | VAT No: GB 350\n1031 22 000\n\n\u00a0\n* [Exhaust Valves][69]\n  * [Exhaust Valves][70]\n  * [Acoustic Exhaust Valves][71]\n  * [EGR Emission Control Exhaust Valves][72]\n  * Back\n* [Actuators][73]\n  * [Actuators][74]\n  * [Electronic][75]\n  * [Pneumatic][76]\n  * [Turbocharger Applications][77]\n  * Back\n* [Valve Rotators][78]\n  * [Valve Rotators][79]\n  * [Valve Rotator Test Centre][80]\n  * [Benefits of Valve Rotators][81]\n  * [Valve Rotator Applications][82]\n  * [Types of Valve Rotators][83]\n  * [Manufacturing][84]\n  * [Castings][85]\n  * Back\n* [Prototype Exhausts][86]\n  * [Prototype Exhausts][87]\n  * [Introduction][88]\n  * [TXR Valvetronic Titanium Exhausts][89]\n  * Back\n* [Technical Centre][90]\n  * [Technical Centre][91]\n  * [Engine and Powertrain Testing][92]\n  * [Vibration Systems][93]\n  * [Natural Gas Burners][94]\n  * [Environmental Chambers][95]\n  * [Additional Facilities][96]\n  * [Services][97]\n  * Back\n* [EGR][98]\n  * [EGR][99]\n  * [EGR Cooler System][100]\n  * Back\n* [R&D][101]\n