[64]\n[Investors][65]\n[ Contact Us ][66]\n\n## **We lead the world in high-power lasers for mission-critical directed energy, sensing, and\n## advanced manufacturing applications.**\n\n## Our story.\n\nFor over 25 years, nLIGHT has been at the forefront of semiconductor laser innovation, enabling\nnext-generation applications once thought impossible. As a pioneering provider of high-power lasers\nfor mission-critical defense systems and advanced manufacturing, we have built a vertically\nintegrated technology stack\u2014from semiconductor chips to full laser systems\u2014designed to deliver\nunmatched power and performance.\n\nWith a portfolio of over 450 patents, nLIGHT continues to push the boundaries of laser power and\nprecision, ensuring maximum effectiveness across a wide range of evolving threats. Designed,\ndeveloped, and manufactured in the United States, our solutions are engineered to safeguard national\nsecurity with cutting-edge technology that delivers the highest-power laser on target.\n\n[ Contact us ][67]\n\n**nLIGHT Leads Across Technology Stack for High-Power Lasers.**\n\n## Core Values\n\n### Skill\n\nWe look for people who not only are talented, but also who are deeply curious and eager to learn.\n\n### Will\n\nWe look for people who tenaciously strive to do great things and challenge all of us to build an\nenduring, great company.\n\n### Fit\n\nWe look for people who truly embrace working in teams and approach problems with deep personal\nhumility and desire to learn from others.\n\n**To learn more about nLIGHT,\n**[**contact our sales team**][68]**.**\n\n**\u00a92026 nLIGHT, Inc. All Rights Reserved**\n\n[**Directed Energy**][69]** **[**Sensing**][70]** **[**Advanced Manufacturing**][71]\n\n[**Semiconductor Lasers**][72]**\n**[**Fiber Lasers**][73]**\n**[**Optical Fibers**][74]\n\n[**Resources**][75]**\n**[**Investors**][76]**\n**[**Careers**][77]\n\n[**Terms & Conditions**][78]**\n**[**Privacy**][79]**\n**[**Quality**][80]\n\nNo results foun