chnology that delivers the highest-power laser on target.\n\n[ Contact us ][67]\n\n**nLIGHT Leads Across Technology Stack for High-Power Lasers.**\n\n## Core Values\n\n### Skill\n\nWe look for people who not only are talented, but also who are deeply curious and eager to learn.\n\n### Will\n\nWe look for people who tenaciously strive to do great things and challenge all of us to build an\nenduring, great company.\n\n### Fit\n\nWe look for people who truly embrace working in teams and approach problems with deep personal\nhumility and desire to learn from others.\n\n**To learn more about nLIGHT,\n**[**contact our sales team**][68]**.**\n\n**\u00a92026 nLIGHT, Inc. All Rights Reserved**\n\n[**Directed Energy**][69]** **[**Sensing**][70]** **[**Advanced Manufacturing**][71]\n\n[**Semiconductor Lasers**][72]**\n**[**Fiber Lasers**][73]**\n**[**Optical Fibers**][74]\n\n[**Resources**][75]**\n**[**Investors**][76]**\n**[**Careers**][77]\n\n[**Terms & Conditions**][78]**\n**[**Privacy**][79]**\n**[**Quality**][80]\n\nNo results found\n\n[1]: /cart\n[2]: #page\n[3]: /\n[4]: /directed-energy\n[5]: /sensing\n[6]: /advanced-manufacturing\n[7]: /defenselasers\n[8]: /additivefiberlasers\n[9]: /medical-fiber-lasers\n[10]: /semiconductor-lasers\n[11]: /optical-fibers\n[12]: /about\n[13]: /locations\n[14]: /nconnect\n[15]: /careers\n[16]: /patents\n[17]: /sales\n[18]: /service\n[19]: /rma\n[20]: https://investors.nlight.net\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /\n[23]: /directed-energy\n[24]: /sensing\n[25]: /advanced-manufacturing\n[26]: /defenselasers\n[27]: /additivefiberlasers\n[28]: /medical-fiber-lasers\n[29]: /semiconductor-lasers\n[30]: /optical-fibers\n[31]: /about\n[32]: /locations\n[33]: /nconnect\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: /patents\n[36]: /sales\n[37]: /service\n[38]: /rma\n[39]: https://investors.nlight.net\n[40]: /contact-us\n[41]: /markets\n[42]: /\n[43]: /directed-energy\n[44]: /sensing\n[45]: /advanced-manufacturing\n[46]: /products\n[47]: /\n[48]: /defenselasers\n[49]: /additive