      "polished_summary": "nLIGHT, Inc. is a leading provider of high-power laser solutions tailored for mission-critical applications across defense, sensing, and advanced manufacturing sectors. The company offers a diverse range of products, including defense lasers, additive fiber lasers, medical fiber lasers, semiconductor lasers, and optical fibers, serving a variety of target markets such as defense contractors, manufacturers, medical device producers, and telecommunications companies. With a commitment to innovation, nLIGHT is at the forefront of advancing laser technology to meet the evolving needs of its customers.",
