y & Stats[Continue] ][29]\n* [\n  [NSW Blues vs QLD Maroons]\n  ][30]\n  [News & Updates][31]\n  \n  ## [NSW vs QLD Live Stream, kick-off time, Fixtures & TV Channel][32]\n  \n  By[Mitchell McMeckan][33] July 12, 2023April 30, 2026\n  \n  The State of Origin series began on May 31, 2023, in Sydney\u2019s Adelaide Oval Stadium. The tour will\n  continue with stops in Brisbane and Accor Stadium, Sydney on June 21s and 12th of July,\n  respectively. The 42nd State of Origin series between Queensland and New South Wales will take\n  place in 2023. There have been\u2026\n  \n  [ Read More NSW vs QLD Live Stream, kick-off time, Fixtures & TV Channel[Continue] ][34]\n* [\n  [2023 State of Origin Game 2 live]\n  ][35]\n  [News & Updates][36]\n  \n  ## [2023 State of Origin Game 2: Live Stream, Kick-off Time, TV Coverage][37]\n  \n  By[Mitchell McMeckan][38] June 19, 2023June 19, 2023\n  \n  If you\u2019re a rugby enthusiast eagerly waiting to watch State of Origin Game 2 live stream online,\n  you\u2019re at the right spot. We\u2019re here to provide you with all the essential details about the Game\n  2 kick-off time, TV coverage, venue, and more. The excitement is mounting as we approach Game 2,\n  especially after the\u2026\n  \n  [ Read More 2023 State of Origin Game 2: Live Stream, Kick-off Time, TV Coverage[Continue] ][39]\n* [\n  [State of Origin History Last 5 Years]\n  ][40]\n  [News & Updates][41]\n  \n  ## [State of Origin History Last 5 Years][42]\n  \n  By[Mitchell McMeckan][43] June 16, 2022April 30, 2026\n  \n  The first game of State of Origin is fast approaching. As huge fans of the sport, you might want\n  to take a peek at the history of the events. Here is the State of Origin History last 5 years.\n  2021 Queensland and New South Wales meet for the 40th time in a State of Origin\u2026\n  \n  [ Read More State of Origin History Last 5 Years[Continue] ][44]\n* [\n  [2022 State of Origin series]\n  ][45]\n  [News & Updates][46]\n  \n  ## [State of Origin 2022: Everything you need to know][47]\n  \n  By[Mitchell McMeckan][48] June 16, 2022April 30, 2026\n  \n  The Accor Stadium will host Game 1 of the Ampol State of Origin series in 2022, as well as the\n  Brydens Lawyers NSW Blues\u2019 championship defense opener. More than 80,000 people are expected to\n  attend the first State of Origin game at Accor Stadium in Sydney Olympic Park since 2020. This is\n  a must-see game\u2026\n  \n  [ Read More State of Origin 2022: Everything you need to know[Continue] ][49]\n* [\n  [State of Origin Game 3]\n  ][50]\n  [News & Updates][51]\n  \n  ## [State of Origin 2022 Game 3: Live Stream, Kick-off Time, TV Channel][52]\n  \n  By[Mitchell McMeckan][53] May 24, 2022April 30, 2026\n  \n  Here you get the State of Origin Game 3 live stream guide, Kick-off Time, TV Coverage, Studium,\n  Tickets and more. For the second year in a row, the NSW Blues won the Ampol State of Origin trophy\n  in 2021. The Maroons won Game 3 of the series, stopping the Blues from completing the sweep.\n  People\u2026\n  \n  [ Read More State of Origin 2022 Game 3: Live Stream, Kick-off Time, TV Channel[Continue] ][54]\n\n## Page navigation\n\n1 [2][55] [3][56] [Next Page[Next]][57]\n\n\u00a9 2026 - **[State of Origin Updates][58]** | All Rights Reserved\n\n**General Disclaimer:** The phrase \"State of Orign\" is a registered trademark owned and licensed by\nNRL. StateOfOriginUpdates.com is an independent website and is not affiliated with, supported by, or\nendorsed by the NRL, its organizing committee, or any associated entities.\n* [Schedule][59]\n* [News & Updates][60]\n* [Teams][61]\n* [Tickets][62]\n* [Winners][63]\n* [Contact][64]\n\n[Toggle Menu Close]\nSearch for:\n[Search]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://stateoforiginupdates.com/\n[3]: https://stateoforiginupdates.com/schedule/\n[4]: https://stateoforiginupdates.com/news/\n[5]: https://stateoforiginupdates.com/teams/\n[6]: https://stateoforiginupdates.com/tickets/\n[7]: https://stateoforiginupdates.com