ucts]\n][13]\n\n**[Connecting The World][14]**\n\n[Learn how we are enabling the next generation of high-speed optical transmission systems, networks,\nand datacenter solutions.][15]\n\n**[Products][16]**\n\n[\n[products]\n][17]\n\n**[Engineered Materials and High-Precision Laser Solutions][18]**\n\n[Advancing industrial performance with engineered materials and high-precision laser technologies\nthat drive next-generation manufacturing and research applications.][19]\n\n**[Solutions][20]**\n\n[\n[products]\n][21]\n\n**[Solutions Start Here][22]**\n\n[Discover how we power manufacturing and research across the world\u2019s most innovative markets \u2014 from\nsmartphones to EVs, from semiconductor wafers to medical diagnostics.][23]\n\n**[Support][24]**\n\n[\n[products]\n][25]\n\n[**Maximize Performance**][26]\n\n[Coherent Service keeps your laser systems performing at their peak \u2014 safeguarding productivity,\nmaximizing uptime, and protecting your investment.][27]\n\nCompany\n[ About Us ][28] Open\n* [ Leadership ][29]\n* [ Environmental ][30]\n* [ Social ][31]\n* [ Governance ][32]\n[ Newsroom ][33] Open\n* [ Blog ][34]\n* [ Press Releases ][35]\n* [ Success Stories ][36]\n* [ Glossary ][37]\n[ Investor Relations ][38] Open\n* [ Financial Releases ][39]\n* [ Financial Webcasts ][40]\n* [ Investor Presentations ][41]\n* [ Annual Filings ][42]\n* [ SEC Filings ][43]\n* [ ESG ][44]\n[ Company ][45] Open\n* [ Careers ][46]\n* [ Coherent Labs ][47]\n* [ Locations ][48]\n* [ Events ][49]\n* [ Legal ][50]\n* [ ISO Certificates ][51]\n* [ Contact Us ][52]\n\n# DRIVING EVEN FASTER DATACOM\n\nSee why the rapid growth in AI/ML is driving a demand for faster datacom enabled by innovative\nCoherent solutions.\n\n[ Read the Blog ][53]\n\n# 1.6T-DR8 TRANSCEIVER\n\nSilicon photonics-based 1.6T-DR8 transceiver module using a Marvell\u00ae Ara 3 nm optical digital signal\nprocessor (DSP), featuring 200 Gbps electrical and optical interfaces.\n\n[ Learn More ][54]\n\n# OPTICAL CIRCUIT SWITCH\n\nThe OCS optimizes data center networks by minimizing electrical switches and\noptical-electrical-optical (OEO) conversions, resulting in significant cost savings, reduced power\nconsumption, and improved latency for GPU connections.\n\n[ Learn More ][55]\n\n# PRECISION MANUFACTURING\n\nWeld metals and heat thermoplastic composites with efficiency, high throughput, and reduced costs.\n\n[ Learn More ][56]\n\n# SEMI CAP EQUIPMENT\n\nBuild equipment that maximizes throughput and yield using cutting-edge optics, lasers, and composite\nmaterials.\n\n[ Learn More ][57]\n\n# DISPLAY MANUFACTURING\n\nDeliver laser solutions that drive innovations in display manufacturing and performance, especially\nfor mobile devices.\n\n[ Learn More ][58]\n\n# NVIDIA and Coherent\n\nAnnounce Strategic Partnership to Develop Optics Technology to Scale Next-Generation Data Center\nArchitecture\n\n[ Learn More ][59]\n\n# Building the Infrastructure for the AI Era\n\nAnnounced the modernization and expansion of our Sherman facility, supported by a proposed $50\nmillion CHIPS Act award.\n\n[ Learn More ][60]\n\n## WE HARNESS PHOTONS TO DRIVE INNOVATION\n\nThe photon is the fundamental building block of our universe. See how we use it to generate,\nmodulate, amplify, direct, and detect for the datacenter, communications, and industrial markets.\n\n## Markets\n\n### Datacenter and Communications\n\n### Datacenter\n\nEnable ultra-high-speed data transmission and optimized power efficiency for hyperscale and\nenterprise datacenters with our advanced optical transceivers, active optical cables, and\nhigh-performance laser and component solutions.\n\n[ Discover Our Solutions ][61]\n\n### Communications\n\nTransform global communications networks with our comprehensive portfolio of coherent transceivers\nand modules, lasers, amplifiers, and photonic devices. Our innovations support faster, more\nefficient data transport across metro, long-haul, subsea, and space-based networks.\n\n[ Discover Our Solutions ][62]\n\n### Industrial\n\n### Precision Manufacturing\n\nPerform fast, high-precision cutting, welding, marking, and ablation of metals and plastics with\nlaser sources and systems.\n\n[ Discover Our Solutions ][63]\n\n### Semiconductor & Display Capital equipment\n\nInnovative, high-precision equipment and laser solutions for next-gen chips and mobile displays.\n\n[ Discover Our Solutions ][64]\n\n### Automotive & Energy Solutions\n\nMeet EV production challenges with cutting-edge technology that "
