      "company_summary": "Excelitas is a leading provider of innovative photonic solutions, specializing in high-performance cameras, detectors, sensors, and light sources. The company serves a diverse range of markets, including automotive, medical, industrial, and scientific applications, delivering custom solutions that enable advanced imaging, sensing, and illumination technologies. With a commitment to excellence, Excelitas empowers its customers to unlock the full potential of their applications through cutting-edge optical and electronic products.",
