      "key_products": "Skylark 320, Skylark 349, Skylark 780, Skylark 785",
      "polished_summary": "Skylark Lasers is a leading manufacturer of high-performance continuous wave single frequency diode-pumped solid-state lasers, precision-engineered under Class 5 cleanroom conditions in Edinburgh, Scotland. The company specializes in providing spectrally pure laser systems, including the Skylark 320, 349, 780, and 785 models, designed for precision applications across various industries such as research and development, semiconductor, life sciences, and photonics, catering primarily to researchers and original equipment manufacturers (OEMs).",
