d][91]\n    * [AV_Halo\u2122 Cortex][92]\n    * [AVACORE\u2122][93]\n    * [See All Cyber Solutions +][94]\n  * [Air][95]\n    * [P550\u2122][96]\n    * [Switchblade\u00ae][97]\n    * [JUMP\u00ae 20-X][98]\n    * [See All Air Solutions +][99]\n* Capabilities\n  Back\n  Capabilities\n  Close submenu\n  Capabilities\n  \n  AV delivers integrated capabilities that accelerate how forces detect, decide, and act, giving\n  missions the speed, precision, and resilience needed to operate in contested environments.\n  \n  [See All Capabilities][100]\n  [See All Solutions ][101]\n  * [Defense & Precision Strike][102]\n  * [Intelligence, Surveillance and Reconnaissance][103]\n  * [Unmanned Systems][104]\n  * [Counter-UAS][105]\n  * [Directed Energy][106]\n  * [Electronic Warfare][107]\n  * [AI, Autonomy & Decision Support][108]\n  * [Space Systems & Resilient Communications][109]\n  * [Force Protection & Base Defense][110]\n  * [Training & Support Services][111]\n  * [AV_Halo Software][112]\n  * [Emerging Technologies][113]\n  * [Ground Control Solutions][114]\n  * [Cyber & Mission Solutions][115]\n  * [Service Vehicles & Mobile Checkpoints][116]\n* About Us\n  Back\n  About Us\n  Close submenu\n  About Us\n  \n  AV invents advantage by delivering innovative, mission-ready solutions built with precision,\n  scaled with reliability, and driven by the people behind them.\n  * [About Us][117]\n    * [Leadership][118]\n    * [Corporate Social Responsibility][119]\n    * [QMS Certificates][120]\n    * [MacCready Works Advanced Solutions][121]\n  * [Careers][122]\n    * [Open Positions][123]\n    * [Benefits][124]\n    * [Veterans][125]\n    * [Our Culture][126]\n    * [Internships][127]\n  * [Contact][128]\n  * [Authorized Marketplace Partners][129]\n  * [Suppliers][130]\n* News & Insights\n  Back\n  News & Insights\n  Close submenu\n  News & Insights\n  \n  Stay informed with the latest news, insights, and updates shaping the future of defense\n  technology, mission innovation, and operational advantage.\n  \n  [News & Insights ][131]\n  * [News][132]\n  * [Press Releases][133]\n  * [Videos][134]\n  * [Events][135]\n  * [Thought Leadership][136]\n* Investors\n  Back\n  Investors\n  Close submenu\n  Investors\n  \n  Explore financial updates, leadership information, and investor resources from a global defense\n  technology leader.\n  \n  [Explore Investor Portal ][137]\n  * [Board of Directors][138]\n  * [Strategic Advisory Group][139]\n  * [Events & Presentations][140]\n  * [Financial Information][141]\n  * [Stock Information][142]\n* Search\n  Back\n  Search\n  Close submenu\n\n# Proven Solutions Across Every Domain\n\n[ View All Solutions ][143]\nPause\n\nWho We Are\n\nAV delivers integrated, battle-proven defense systems trusted by allied operators worldwide. Our All\nDomain Dominance approach keeps customers ahead of evolving threats, with 50,000+ deployments in 55+\ncountries.\n[ More About Us ][144]\n\nDomains\n\n[Land][145]\n[LOCUST]\nLand\nLaunch Domain\n[Sea][146]\n[sea]\nSea\nLaunch Domain\n[Air][147]\n[air]\nAir\nLaunch Domain\n[Space][148]\n[space]\nSpace\nLaunch Domain\n[Cyber][149]\n[cyber]\nCyber\nLaunch Domain\n\nFeatured Work\n\n## MacCready Works Advanced Solutions\n\nMacCready Works is AV\u2019s advanced development group, turning bold concepts into mission-ready\nautonomous systems at speed. Inspired by the pioneering spirit of Dr. Paul B. MacCready, Jr., our\nengineers, roboticists, and AI researchers design next-generation robotic systems across air, land,\nand sea. Guided by the MacCready Method, build fast, test relentlessly, deploy advantage, our small,\nmultidisciplinary teams transform breakthrough ideas into operational capability in months,\ndelivering decisive results when the mission demands it.\n[ Learn More ][150]\n\nCapabilities\n\n## Unrivaled Multi-Domain Capabilities\n\n[ Learn More ][151]\n1.  [Defense & Precision Strike][152]\n    [\u00a001\u00a0] Defense & Precision Strike\n2.  [Intelligence, Surveillance and Reconnaissance][153]\n    [\u00a002\u00a0] Intelligence, Surveillance and Reconnaissance\n3.  [Unmanned Systems][154]\n    [\u00a003\u00a0] Unmanned Systems\n4.  [Counter-UAS][155]\n    [\u00a004\u00a0] Counter-UAS\n5.  [Directed Energy][156]\n    [\u00a005\u00a0] Directed Energy\n6.  [Electronic Warfare][157]\n    [\u00a006\u00a0] Electronic Warfare\n7.  [AI, Autonomy & Decision Support][158]\n    [\u00a007\u00a0] AI, Autonomy & Decision Support\n8.  [Space Systems & Resilient Communications][159]\n    [\u00a008\u00a0] Space Systems & Resilient Communications\n9.  [Force Protection & Base Defense][160]\n    [\u00a009\u00a0] Force Protection & Base Defense\n10. [Training & Support Services][161]\n    [\u00a010\u00a0] Training & Support Services\n11. [AV_Halo Software][162]\n    [\u00a011\u00a0] AV_Halo Software\n12. [Emerging Technologies][163]\n    [\u00a012\u00a0] Emerging Technologies\n13. [Ground Control Solutions ][164]\n    [\u00a013\u00a0] Ground Control Solutions\n[rocket illustration]\n\nOur Solutions\n* [Titan\u00ae MS C-UAS][165]\n* [TOM 50 RE][166]\n* [Gallium][167]\n* [TEL640 Multi-Domain][168]\n* [Service Vehicles][169]\n* [KxM][170]\n* [Grip S20][171]\n* [MxC-Mini][172]\n* [Grip TA5][173]\n* [TEL620 Multi-Domain][174]\n* [AV_Halo\u2122 DETECT][175]\n* [AV_Halo\u2122 INSTINCT][176]\n* [RAID][177]\n* [Halo_Shield\u2122][178]\n* [Puma\u2122 3 AE][179]\n* [P550\u00ae][180]\n* [JUMP\u00ae 20-X][181]\n* [Switchblade\u00ae 400][182]\n* [Switchblade\u00ae 600 Block 2][183]\n* [VAPOR\u00ae 55 MX][184]\n* [Mayhem 10][185]\n* [Switchblade\u00ae 600][186]\n* [Freedom Eagle (FE-1)][187]\n* [Laser Communications][188]\n* [AV_Halo COMMAND][189]\n* [Command & Data Handling (C&DH)][190]\n* [Wasp][191]\n* [Badger][192]\n* [SPOTR-Edge\u2122][193]\n* [VAPOR\u00ae CLE][194]\n* [Switchblade\u00ae 300 Block 20][195]\n* [LOCUST X3][196]\n* [LOCUST][197]\n* [AV_Halo CORTEX, GeoPoint][198]\n* [ChemiSens][199]\n* [ELMNT\u00ae][200]\n* [ROBO-MET.3D\u00ae][201]\n* [WISARD][202]\n* [SharkCage][203]\n* [Angler Software-Defined Radio][204]\n* [Fast Steering Mirrors (FSMs)][205]\n* [ARS and Dynapak][206]\n* [Spacecraft Attitude Determination and Control (ADC)][207]\n* [Ingenuity Mars Helicopter][208]\n* [SKYFALL][209]\n* [Panther][210]\n* [Wraith][211]\n* [Pro 5][212]\n* [Defender][213]\n* [Ally][214]\n* [Titan C-UAS][215]\n* [Titan SV][216]\n* [Titan 4 RF C-UAS][217]\n* [ARGUS][218]\n* [LOCUST TATS][219]\n* [TEL650][220]\n* [TEL640][221]\n* [TEL620][222]\n* [TEL610][223]\n* [Robo Command Control Station (UGV)][224]\n* [telemax\u2122 EVO Hybrid][225]\n* [telemax\u2122 EVO Plus][226]\n* [tEODor\u2122 EVO][227]\n* [Tomahawk GCS][228]\n* [Solar HAPS \u2013 Sunglider][229]\n* [Wildcat][230]\n* [ACE\u2122][231]\n* [ALEC][232]\n* [Blackwing\u2122][233]\n* [Raven\u00ae B][234]\n* [Puma VTOL][235]\n* [Puma\u2122 LE][236]\n* [Haloswarm][237]\n* [Red Dragon\u00ae][238]\n* [AV_Halo\u2122][239]\n* [T-20\u2122][240]\n* [ARK\u2122][241]\n* [AV_Halo CORTEX, Telesto][242]\n* [nxtHealth\u00ae.Rehab.XR][243]\n* [AV_Halo MENTOR, VST][244]\n* [AVACORE\u2122][245]\n* [AV_Halo CORTEX, Scraawl][246]\n* [AI-TOMS][247]\n* [JUMP^{\u00ae} 20][248]\n* [VigilantHalo][249]\n\nNews & Events\n\n## Some missions stay classified. These headlines don\u2019t.\n\n[ View All News + Events ][250]\n[AV Appoints William J. Lynn III to Board of Directors][251]\nPress Release\n06/25/2026\n\n### AV Appoints William J. Lynn III to Board of Directors\n\nRead More\n[AeroVironment, Inc. to Host Investor Day in New York City, New York on July 8][252]\nNews\nPress Release\n06/18/2026\n\n### AeroVironment, Inc. to Host Investor Day in New York City, New York on July 8\n\nRead More\n[NATO\u2019s Next C-UAS Challenge: Orchestrating the Alliance\u2019s Defense Network][253]\nThought Leadership\n06/15/2026\n\n### NATO\u2019s Next C-UAS Challenge: Orchestrating the Alliance\u2019s Defense Network\n\nRead More\nPrevious\nNext\n[View All News + Events][254]\n[[AV]][255]\nDomains\n* [Land][256