        "crawl_text": "Eagle Lasers USA 3400 W Stonegate Blvd suite 101 Arlington Heights, Illinois 60005, US Eagle Lasers\n\nSkip to content\n\nAbout Us\n\nClient Success Stories\n\nProducts\n\nLaser Cutting Machines\n\nAutomation\n\nSoftware\n\nComponents\n\nOptions\n\nTechnology\n\nPress Room\n\nContact\n\nAbout Us\n\nClient Success Stories\n\nProducts\n\nLaser Cutting Machines\n\nAutomation\n\nSoftware\n\nComponents\n\nOptions\n\nTechnology\n\nPress Room\n\nContact\n\nProducts\n\nOur products take you to a new level by enhancing cutting speed, quality, and process efficiency.\n\nTechnology\n\nA powerful machine can produce more in less time, with less energy consumption.\n\nPress Room\n\nAt Eagle, something note-worthy is always happening, and we want to keep you in the know.\n\nEagle is rewriting success in the metal industry for clients worldwide\n\nClients are at the heart of our mission, fueling our drive for innovation with their success. Eagle customers have harnessed the power of fiber laser technology to transform their operations and set new standards for productivity. Their achievements are a testament to our dedication and shared vision for growth.\n\nWatch our Client Success Stories\n\nDon\u2019t Take It From Us,\nHear It From Our Clients\n\nDiscover how Eagle is redefining success for manufacturers in the U.S.\n\nAbout Eagle Lasers\n\nEagle Lasers is a high-tech R&#038;D company specializing in advanced fiber laser systems and automation solutions for sheet metal processing. Our machines are built to empower manufacturers across the globe through peak-level precision, speed, and reliability with minimal maintenance requirements. With innovation at the core of our DNA, world-class engineering made in Europe and a solid service network in the United States, we&#8217;re here to fuel your productivity.\n\nAbout Us\n\nA Solution For Every Production Need\n\nEagle Fiber Laser Cutting Systems operate at a superior level of precision and performance. Designed to meet the demands of today\u2019s fast-paced manufacturing environment, our advanced fiber laser technology delivers unparalleled cutting speed, accuracy, and efficiency for both thick and thin materials. All our machine series ensure superior edge quality, reduced maintenance and operational costs, and increased productivity.\n\niNspire 2.0\n\nThe iNspire are state-of-the-art fiber laser cutting machines with powers ranging from 4kW to 40kW, acceleration of up to 6G and cutting speeds up to 150 m/min. Their unique construction with linear motors on all axes, the eVa cutting head and carbon fiber traverse, achieve unparalleled performance, making them the fastest laser cutters on the market.\n\nFlowIN\n\nFlowIN is a breakthrough fiber laser system that sorts at the same speed it cuts, freeing the part from the skeleton and managing waste without compromising efficiency. It features Eagle distinctive components such as the eVa cutting head and linear motors, and boasts powers up to 40kW, acceleration up to 6G and 400m/min positioning speed. FlowIN has no limitations regarding sheet length and is coil-cutting ready.\n\nFlowinCO\n\nFlowINCO offers the same functionalities and cutting parameters as FlowIN, but is specifically engineered for coil-fed sheet metal. By enabling continuous cutting with a steady material feed, FlowINCO eliminates the downtime resulting in uninterrupted production, scrap-free parts and reduced material waste.\n\neSmart\n\nThe eSmart series is designed for trouble-free, reliable production, delivering great results in little floor space. These sturdy yet compact machines, offer a power range up to 10kW, acceleration up to 2G and cutting speed up to 100 m/min. They\u2019re the most cost-effective Eagle fiber laser cutting machines, providing you with efficiency and value.\n\neVision\n\nThe eVision series is designed for for all-round versatile efficiency, providing optimum results 24/7 whether you run small or large batches, thick or thin sheets. Offering powers from up to 30kW, acceleration up to 3G, and cutting speeds up to 150 m/min, their great performance and flexibility makes them the ideal choice for those upgrading from older cutting technologies and looking to to take their production to the next level.\n\nBoost Efficiency with Sheet Metal Automation Solutions\n\nLaser cutting automation systems reduce downtime, increase throughput, and optimize your machine\u2019s performance while providing a safer environment for operators. Eagle Automation delivers intelligent solutions that adapt to your production needs\u2014whether you&#8217;re scaling up, cutting costs, aiming for 24/7 productivity or all three.\n\nLearn More\n\nLaser Machines\n\nFor the fastest and most accurate metal cutting\n\nLearn More\n\nAutomation\n\nFor 24/7 uninterrupted manufacturing\n\nLearn More\n\nOptions\n\nNot all companies have the same manufacturing needs\n\nLearn More\n\nSoftware\n\nFor remote monitoring and enhanced efficiency\n\nLearn More\n\nComponents\n\nFor maximum quality and durability\n\nLearn More\n\nSupport\n\nFor technical and financial peace of mind\n\nLearn More\n\neVa cutting head for the highest fiber laser performance\n\nThe cutting head is the most important component of a laser cutting machine since it has to withstand extreme conditions and be able to control ultra-high powers while maintaining top precision. Our patented eVa cutting head was built after thorough research to deliver five times less contamination, with automatic beam centering and minimal service requirements, among other unique features. The eVa is a state-of-the-art piece of engineering capable of unmatched performance.\n\nDiscover our eVa cutting head\n\nThe New Eagle Americas Team and our Global CEO\n\nTalk directly with our Eagle Americas leadership team about products, local network expansion, service, and support:\nChad Jackson \u2013 CEO, Eagle Americas\nDan Cortez \u2013 Executive Vice President &amp; COO\n\nThey\u2019ll be glad to welcome you, answer your questions, and help you discover the right solution to maximize productivity and profitability in your company.\n\nsubscibe to our newsletter\n\nFor the latest sheet metal cutting and fiber laser technology.\n\nsubscribe\n\nNews &amp; Events\n\nStay up to date with the latest developments in the laser cutting industry, our company news, and upcoming events.\n\nMore news\n\nAll rights reserved [Skip to content][1]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Client Success Stories][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][6]\n* [Automation][7]\n* [Software][8]\n* [Components][9]\n* [Options][10]\n* [Technology][11]\n* [Press Room][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n* [Client Success Stories][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][17]\n* [Automation][18]\n* [Software][19]\n* [Components][20]\n* [Options][21]\n* [Technology][22]\n* [Press Room][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n\n# Eagle Laser Products\n\n## Our products take you to a new level\n\nAt Eagle, all our machines, components, automation systems, and software are designed with one\nobjective: to take your productivity to a new level by enhancing cutting speed, quality, and process\nefficiency.\n[ Contact Us ][25]\n\n## A complete solution for your business\n\nEagle laser cutting machines are designed to enhance efficiency, boosting your profits while\nreducing energy consumption and maintenance. We are devoted to developing the most productive\nmachines with the fastest laser cutting speeds, highest acceleration, and fully automated material\nhandling without ever compromising quality and accuracy.\n\n## Our Products\n\nWe offer you a diverse product range for every aspect of metal cutting production. Discover our\nunique and innovative laser cutting technology and machine components specifically designed to meet\nyour every requirement, from automatic loading systems to storage towers and more!\nLaser Cutting Machines\n\nEvery business has its own needs. Therefore, we have designed 3 series of machines to suit each\nproduction type and the possibility to manufacture customized machines in non-standard sizes for\nyour specific requirements.\n\n[ Learn More ][26]\nAutomation\n\nAutomated material handling and storage systems are crucial for your laser cutter to reach its full\npotential. If you\u2019re aiming for 24/7 uninterrupted production, even unsupervised, automation is a\nmust.\n\n[ Learn More ][27]\nSoftware\n\nEagle software is designed to enhance the cutting process of different materials and thicknesses.\nFrom boosting speed and piercing time, to increasing edge quality and remotely monitoring the\nproduction process, these are products worth considering.\n\n[ Learn More ][28]\nComponents\n\nOur laser cutting machines have only best-in-class components. We make no compromises regarding\nmaterials, quality, and construction to provide the highest performance on the market.\n\n[ Learn More ][29]\nOptions\n\nWe have developed additional optional features for laser cutters and automation systems to upgrade\nyour productivity and efficiency further.\n\n[ Learn More ][30]\nSupport\n\nProduction often begins with cutting. Efficient production is not possible without a reliable and\nefficient cutting machine. Our goal is to provide first-class support for your production capacity.\n\n[ Learn More ][31]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][32]\n\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/\n[3]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[4]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[5]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[6]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[7]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[8]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[9]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[10]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[11]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[12]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[13]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[14]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[15]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[16]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[17]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[18]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[19]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[20]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[21]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[22]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[23]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[24]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[25]: /contact/\n[26]: /laser-cutting-machines/\n[27]: /automation/\n[28]: /software/\n[29]: /components/\n[30]: /options/\n[31]: /contact/\n[32]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/ [Skip to content][1]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Client Success Stories][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][6]\n* [Automation][7]\n* [Software][8]\n* [Components][9]\n* [Options][10]\n* [Technology][11]\n* [Press Room][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n* [Client Success Stories][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][17]\n* [Automation][18]\n* [Software][19]\n* [Components][20]\n* [Options][21]\n* [Technology][22]\n* [Press Room][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n\n# Contact Eagle Lasers\n\n## Request Quote\n\nWe will respond to your inquiries\n\n### Contact Info\n\nAddress\n\n3400 W Stonegate Blvd suite 101 Arlington Heights, Illinois 60005, US\n\nPhone\n\n(833) 395-2737\n\nEmail\n\nTeam@eaglelasersusa.com\n\n[[Eagle Lasers]][25]\n\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/\n[3]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[4]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[5]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[6]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[7]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[8]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[9]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[10]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[11]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[12]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[13]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[14]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[15]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[16]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[17]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[18]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[19]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[20]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[21]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[22]: ht"
