            "url": "https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Client Success Stories][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][6]\n* [Automation][7]\n* [Software][8]\n* [Components][9]\n* [Options][10]\n* [Technology][11]\n* [Press Room][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n* [Client Success Stories][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][17]\n* [Automation][18]\n* [Software][19]\n* [Components][20]\n* [Options][21]\n* [Technology][22]\n* [Press Room][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n\n# Contact Eagle Lasers\n\n## Request Quote\n\nWe will respond to your inquiries\n\n### Contact Info\n\nAddress\n\n3400 W Stonegate Blvd suite 101 Arlington Heights, Illinois 60005, US\n\nPhone\n\n(833) 395-2737\n\nEmail\n\nTeam@eaglelasersusa.com\n\n[[Eagle Lasers]][25]\n\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/\n[3]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[4]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[5]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[6]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[7]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[8]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[9]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[10]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[11]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[12]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[13]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[14]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[15]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[16]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[17]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[18]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[19]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[20]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[21]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[22]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[23]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[24]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[25]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://eaglelasersusa.com/about",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Client Success Stories][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][6]\n* [Automation][7]\n* [Software][8]\n* [Components][9]\n* [Options][10]\n* [Technology][11]\n* [Press Room][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n* [Client Success Stories][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Laser Cutting Machines][17]\n* [Automation][18]\n* [Software][19]\n* [Components][20]\n* [Options][21]\n* [Technology][22]\n* [Press Room][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n\n# About Eagle Lasers\n\n## About Eagle Lasers\n\nEagle Lasers is a world-class manufacturer of fiber laser cutting systems. Our effective combination\nof power, dynamic motion, state-of-the-art cutting technology, and automation systems enables\ncompanies across diverse fields to optimize their business lifecycle, boost their productivity and\nincrease their profits.\n\n[ Contact Us ][25]\n\n## Technology Innovation is in our DNA\n\nOur team\u2019s ingenuity, experience, and unstoppable drive for improvement are constantly pushing the\nlimits of technology in favor of efficiency and productivity through state-of-the-art systems.\n\nWith 18 years in the market, one of our key strengths is that we could grasp and exploit the\nadvantages of fiber laser technology right from the start. Unlike most our competitors who had to\nadapt existing technologies to fiber, at Eagle we built every component around it.\n\n[ see more videos ][26]\n\n## Fiber Laser Pioneers\n\nAt Eagle Lasers, we believe in optimizing productivity through effective innovation. We knew that\nfiber laser technology would be an industry game-changer, so we invested in it, aiming all our\nresearch and development to create the ideal fiber laser machine. Our key strength is that we did\nnot need to adapt any existing systems to fiber. Instead, we created an entirely new concept right\nfrom the start.\n\n## Innovation starts from intuition\n\nAt Eagle, we reinvented technology through constant research and innovation, which led us to create\na better work environment with intelligent, ergonomic design. We select only the highest quality\nmaterials for all our components which then work interconnectedly to ensure the best performance.\n\nOur goal is to provide our customers with the highest efficiency, a faster turnaround, lower cost\nper part, and maximum flexibility in processes, materials, and thicknesses. All this through\nstate-of-the-art machines, ready to operate at full accuracy 24/7.\n\n### Learn more about our machine components in the brochure\n\n[ Download ][27]\n\n## History\n\nAfter studying at the Mechanical Engineering Faculty of the University ofTechnology in Poznan,\nMarcin Ejma went on to work in the service and repair fields for well-known laser manufacturers.\nThis led him to accumulate vast knowledge on the construction and manufacturing of several laser\ncutting systems available at the time. In doing so, he noticed considerable differences in their\nconception, construction, and efficiency.\n\nHaving gathered invaluable insight by weighing up the pros and cons of all the highest-performing\nmachines, Ejma combined their best features with his disruptive ideas to create a new,\nground-breaking laser cutting system.\n\nIn 2006, together with some of the most qualified European experts, he founded Eagle to create the\nmost efficient laser cutting machines on the market.\n\nAround the same time, a new technology emerged, which would open a new chapter in sheet metal\ncutting history: fiber laser. Fiber laser technology aligned with Eagle\u2019s mission and philosophy,\nand the company immediately realized its potential.\n\nEagle was one of the first three companies to grasp the advantages of fiber. In 2008 we presented a\nfiber laser cutting system at EuroBLECH when most metal processing manufacturers were still\npromoting CO2 lasers, plasma, and other older technologies.\nHistory proved us right. Today fiber lasers are considered the most efficient metal cutting method,\nwith one fiber laser machine being able to replace from 3 to 5 older systems.\n\nSixteen years later, Eagle continues leading the path of innovation. The iNspire 40kW is the fastest\nfiber laser cutting system available today, with up to 6G acceleration, the patented Eagle eVa\ncutting head, a super-light carbon fiber traverse, linear motors on all axes, and the unmatched\n9-second pallet changer. There is no room for compromise regarding our components\u2019 quality,\nefficiency, and reliability.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nAll our machines, components, automation systems, and software are designed with one objective: to\ntake your productivity to a new level by enhancing cutting speed, quality, and process efficiency.\n[ Contact Us ][28]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][29]\n\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/\n[3]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[4]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[5]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[6]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[7]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[8]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[9]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[10]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[11]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[12]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[13]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[14]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[15]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[16]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[17]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[18]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[19]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[20]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[21]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[22]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/technology/\n[23]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/press-room/\n[24]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/contact/\n[25]: /contact/\n[26]: https://www.youtube.com/@EAGLELASERS\n[27]: https://hubspot-cta-redirect-eu1-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/cta/redirect/25346212/6279c9bf-34d8-4ad\n3-9cae-8ccfce93e978\n[28]: /contact/\n[29]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/"
          }
