      "polished_summary": "Eagle Lasers is a high-tech R&D company specializing in advanced fiber laser systems and automation solutions tailored for the sheet metal processing industry. Their product lineup includes state-of-the-art laser cutting machines, automation systems, and software designed to enhance production efficiency, precision, and reliability for manufacturers in the metal industry. With a commitment to innovation, Eagle Lasers empowers its clients to optimize their manufacturing processes and reduce material waste.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Eagle Lasers specializes in advanced fiber laser systems and automation solutions specifically for the sheet metal processing industry. Their product lineup includes laser cutting machines and automation systems, which are directly relevant to the high energy laser market.",
