      "company_summary": "Epilog Laser is a leading manufacturer of CO2 and fiber laser engraving, cutting, and marking systems, catering primarily to businesses in manufacturing, education, and promotional products. Their product lineup includes advanced laser machines such as the Fusion Pro and Fusion Galvo series, designed for versatility and high performance, making them ideal for a wide range of applications from metal marking to intricate engraving tasks. With a focus on user-friendly interfaces and innovative features, Epilog Laser provides tailored solutions for both small businesses and large enterprises.",
