        "crawl_text": "Epilog Laser, Inc. North America Asia Middle East Africa Caribbean Vietnam Europe High-quality components Durability Low lifetime ownership costs High-quality laser systems Strong customer support Wide range of applications High-quality manufacturing 16371 Table Mountain Parkway, Golden, CO 80403, USA Golden, CO, USA USA USA North America Asia Middle East Africa Caribbean Vietnam Europe Epilog Laser has been designing and manufacturing laser machines since 1988. The company has expanded its facilities to meet increased demand for production. Launch of Fusion Pro 24 and Pro 36 laser machines. Introduction of Fusion Galvo G100 laser system. Expanding product line to meet diverse customer needs. Enhancing customer support and service capabilities. Competition in the laser engraving market. Supply chain disruptions affecting manufacturing. Growing demand for laser engraving in various industries. Expansion into new geographic markets. Epilog Laser is a leading player in the laser engraving and cutting industry, known for high-quality products and customer service. Innovation in laser technology Increasing applications for laser engraving and cutting in various sectors. [Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems logo][Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems\nlogo]][2]\n* Sales\n* [(+1) 303-277-1188][3]\n* [sales@epiloglaser.com][4]\n* [Request Info][5]\n* Support\n* [Submit a Ticket][6]\n[ Request Pricing ][7]\nLaser Machines\n[ Start Your Journey ][8]\n* [ Product Line ][9]\n* [ Fusion Pro Lasers ][10]\n* [ Fusion Ascent Lasers ][11]\n* [ Fusion Galvo Lasers ][12]\nLimited Availability\n* [ Fusion Maker Lasers ][13]\n* [ Fusion Edge Lasers ][14]\n[ Features & More ][15]\n* [ Laser Features ][16]\n* [ Financing Opportunities ][17]\n* [ Find a Distributor ][18]\n* [ Shop Fusion Ascent/Galvo ][19]\n* [ Shop Preowned ][20]\n[ Get an Estimate ][21]\nDiscover\n[ Industry / Applications ][22]\n* [ Awards & Trophies ][23]\