 ][67]\n[ Submit Ticket ][68]\n[ Support Resources ][69]\n* [ Owner's Manuals ][70]\n* [ Software & Firmware Updates ][71]\n* [ Register Your Machine ][72]\n* [ Training ][73]\n* [ Legacy Systems ][74]\nContact\n[ Company ][75]\n* [ An American Company ][76]\n* [ About Epilog Laser ][77]\n* [ Careers ][78]\n* [ Worldwide Distributors ][79]\n* [ US Distributors ][80]\n* [ Education Distributors ][81]\n* [ Government Sales ][82]\n[ Contact ][83]\n* [ Contact Us ][84]\n* [ Schedule a Demo ][85]\n* [ Request Brochure/Pricing ][86]\n[ Locate Your Rep ][87]\n[ [Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems logo][Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems\nlogo]][88]\n* Laser Machines\n* [ Product Line ][89]\n* [ Laser Features ][90]\n* [ Financing Opportunities ][91]\n* [ Shop Preowned ][92]\n[ Get an Estimate ][93]\n[Fusion Pro laser machines]\nFusionPro\nIndustrial Series\nCO2\nDual\n][94]\n[fusion ascent laser machines]\nFusionAscent\nNext Gen Series\nCO2\nFiber\nNew Lasers\n][95]\n[Fusion Galvo laser machine]\nFusionGalvo\nMetal Marking\nFiber\n][96]\n[ [fusion edge 12, fusion edge 24, and fusion edge 36]\nContact your Distributor for More info\n][97]\n[FusionEdge][98]\n**Limited Availability**\n* Discover\n[ Laser Basics ][99]\n* [ Laser Engraving ][100]\n* [ Laser Marking Metal ][101]\n* [ Laser Cutting Machines ][102]\n* [ CO2 Laser Machines ][103]\n* [ Fiber Laser Machines ][104]\n[ Industry / Applications ][105]\n* [ Awards & Trophies ][106]\n* [ Barcodes ][107]\n* [ Education/Schools ][108]\n* [ Promotional Products ][109]\n* [ Signage ][110]\n* [ View More... ][111]\n[ Materials ][112]\n* [ Acrylic ][113]\n* [ Glass ][114]\n* [ Leather ][115]\n* [ Plastic ][116]\n* [ Wood ][117]\n* [ View More... ][118]\n[ Material Guides ][119]\n* [ Applications Testing ][120]\n* [ Material Compatibility ][121]\n[ Why Epilog? ][122]\n* [ Customer Spotlight ][123]\n* [ Testimonials ][124]\n* Resources\n[[America 250 tri-layer hat patch and sign]][125]\n[ Laser Projects ][126]\n* [ Sample Club - Free Files ][127]\n* [ Quick Tips, Tutorials, & More ][128]\n[ Industry Links ][129]\n* [ Material Suppliers ][130]\n* [ Equipment & Software ][131]\n* [ Publications & Forums ][132]\n* [ Custom Laser Services ][133]\n[[James with wine bottle]][134]\n[ Events ][135]\n* [ Trade Shows & Events ][136]\n* [ Laser Master Classes ][137]\n[ Have Questions? ][138]\n* [ FAQ's ][139]\n* [ What Do I Need? ][140]\n* [ Start a Laser Business ][141]\n* [ Blog ][142]\n[ Request Demo ][143]\n* Support\n[Support + Service][144]\nOur dedicated tech support team is here to assist you. Whether you're facing technical issues or\nneed troubleshooting advice, we're just a message away.\n[ Support Process ][145]\nSubmit a Ticket\nStart here to connect with our support team.\n][146]\nParts & Accessories\nAvailable online - shop now!\n][147]\nSupport Center\nFind the answers you need in our extensive Support Center.\n][148]\n[ Support Resources ][149]\n* [ Owner's Manuals ][150]\n* [ Software & Firmware Downloads ][151]\n* [ Register Your Machine ][152]\n* [ Training ][153]\n* [ Legacy Systems ][154]\n[ Support Center ][155]\n* Contact\n[ Contact ][156]\n* [ Sales: (+1) 303-277-1188 ][157]\n* [ Toll Free: (888) 437-4564 ][158]\n* [ sales@epiloglaser.com ][159]\n* [\n16371 Table Mountain Parkway\nGolden, CO 80403, USA\n][160]\n* [ Support + Service ][161]\n[ Contact Us ][162]\n[ Company ][163]\n* [ An American Company ][164]\n* [ About Epilog Laser ][165]\n* [ Careers ][166]\n* [ Worldwide Distributors ][167]\n* [ US Distributors ][168]\n* [ Education Distributors ][169]\n* [ Government Sales ][170]\n* [ Request Information ][171]\n[Request Pricing][172]\n* Sales\n* [(+1) 303-277-1188][173]\n* [sales@epiloglaser.com][174]\n* [Request Info][175]\n* Support\n* [ Submit a Ticket ][176]\nResults Found: 0\n[Fusion Pro laser machines]\n\n# Epilog Adds Fusion Pro 24 and Pro 36 to Product Line\n\nEpilog Laser, the leading producer of CO2 and fiber laser engraving, cutting, and marking systems,\nis excited to add the Pro 24 and Pro 36 to the Fusion Pro Laser Series. The Fusion Pro 24 features a\n24\u201d x 24\u201d (609 x 609 mm) engraving table, and is available with a CO2 laser source, a fiber laser\nsource, or as a dual CO2 and fiber laser configuration. The Fusion Pro 36 features a 36\u201d x 24\u201d (914\nx 609 mm) engraving table and is available with a CO2 laser source or as a CO2 and fiber dual-source\nmachine.\n\nThe new systems also include Epilog\u2019s IRIS\u2122 Camera System, which allows users to position artwork\nand graphics quickly and accurately by providing a real-time image of the engraving bed.\n\n\u201cWhen we first introduced the IRIS\u2122 Camera System on the Fusion Pro Laser Series, it was a game\nchanger,\u201d said Mike Dean, vice president of sales and marketing for Epilog Laser. \u201cThis valuable\ntool helps operators get up and running faster than ever before, and when they know exactly where\ntheir graphics or images will engrave, it saves our customers time and greatly reduces material\nwaste.\u201d\n\n## Additional features of the Fusion Pro 24 and Pro 36 include:\n* Drop Down Front Door:\nEasily access the engraving table from the front of the machine\n* Configurable Table\nUse a vector cutting grid, engraving task plate, or vector cutting slats.\n* 5g Acceleration\nReach top engraving speeds faster and increase your productivity.\n* Touch Screen Control\nSelect between jobs, auto focus the laser, and rerun jobs at the touch of a button from the\neasy-to-use touch screen interface right at the laser.\n* Job Trace\nQuickly see where the engraving/cutting job will appear on your material.\n* SAFEGUARD\u2122 Features\nKeep the mechanics of your laser machine cleaner than ever before with side bellow enclosures, a\nfully covered x-axis assembly, and covered lens assembly.\n\nAs with all of Epilog\u2019s systems, the Fusion Pro 24 and Pro 36 are designed, engineered, and\nmanufactured in the USA, and made with the highest-quality components for durability and low\nlife-time ownership costs.\n\nFor more information, please visit the Fusion Pro [product page][177].\n\n## Other News\n\n][178]\n\n### [Fast-Fix Jewelry & Watch Repairs, Denver][179]\n\nFast-Fix Jewelry in Denver uses an Epilog laser for fast on-site repairs and custom engraving.\n\n][180]\n\n### [5 Reasons Epilog Laser Systems Are Safe for Classrooms][181]\n\nEpilog lasers deliver safe, classroom-ready engraving for students \u2013 no special setup needed.\n\n][182]\n\n### [LoTech Sales][183]\n\nTurning Everyday Kitchenware into Powerful Branding Tools\n\n][184]\n\n### [Maximizing Your Epilog Laser Purchase with Section 179][185]\n\nTake Advantage of Section 179 and Potentially Reduce Your Tax Burden When You Invest in an Epilog\nLaser Machine.\n\n][186]\n\n### [Top 5 Questions to ask your local Epilog Laser Representative][187]\n\nThinking about investing in a laser engraving or cutting machine? Before you commit, make sure\nyou\u2019re asking the right questions.\n\n][188]\n\n### [Choosing the Best Laser Engraver for Wood Engraving Projects][189]\n\nPhotographs are a highly popular choice for laser engraving.\n\n## Have a story you want to see featured?\n\n[Tell us your story!][190]\n[Amy Dallman]\n\n### Press Contact for Epilog Laser:\n\n\u2013 Amy Harris\nMarketing Communications Specialist\n[+1 (303) 277-1188][191]\n[aharris@epiloglaser.com][192]\n\n### About Epilog Laser\n\nSince 1988, Epilog Laser has been designing and manufacturing flying-optics-based CO2 and fiber\nlaser systems that can engrave and cut wood, acrylic, plastic, fabric, rubber and many other\nmaterials. Epilog specializes in developing laser systems that create unprecedented marking and\ncutting quality on all types of products. The company produces versatile and reliable systems that\nare affordable and easy to use.\n\n[ Previous ][193]\n[ Next ][194]\n* [ News ][195]\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\nConnect with an Epilog Laser rep to find the ideal machine for your needs.\n[ Connect with your Rep ][196]\nSales: [303 277 1188][197]\nToll Free: [888 437 4564][198]\n[sales@epiloglaser.com][199]\n[16371 Table Mountain Parkway, Golden, CO 80403, USA][200]\n\n### Product\n* [Product Line][201]\n* [Applications][202]\n* [Start a Laser Business ][203]\n\n### Support\n* [Tech Support][204]\n* [Support Center][205]\n* [Submit a Ticket][206]\n* [Shop Parts & Accessories][207]\n\n### Company\n* [About Us][208]\n* [Careers][209]\n* [Contact Us][210]\n* [Find Your Rep][211]\n\n### Sign up for our Newsletter\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nFacebook\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail*\nInternational Flag\n[Epilog is proud to be an American Company]\n\nEpilog is proud to be an American company. Since 1988 we have been designing, engineering, and\nsupporting our laser machines in Golden, Colorado.\n\n[[Epilog Laser - horizontal logo in white]][212]\n\n\u00a9 Epilog Laser | All Rights Reserved. | [Privacy Policy][213] | [Support][214] | [Sitemap][215]\n\n[1]: #tm-main\n[2]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/\n[3]: tel:+13032771188\n[4]: mailto:sales@epiloglaser.com\n[5]: /contact/request-information/\n[6]: https://support.epiloglaser.com/submit-ticket/\n[7]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/contact/request-pricing/\n[8]: /laser-machines/product-line/\n[9]: /laser-machines/product-line/\n[10]: /laser-machines/fusion-pro-laser-series/\n[11]: /laser-machines/epilog-fusion-ascent-business-laser-engravers-and-cutters/\n[12]: /laser-machines/fusion-galvo-metal-marking-machine/\n[13]: /laser-machines/fusion-maker-laser-cutter-engraver/\n[14]: /laser-machines/fusion-edge-laser-cutter-engraver/\n[15]: /laser-machines/laser-features/\n[16]: /laser-machines/laser-features/\n[17]: /how-it-works/financing/\n[18]: /contact/worldwide/\n[19]: https://shop.epiloglaser.com/collections/epilog-laser-engraving-and-cutting-systems/\n[20]: /laser-machines/preowned-machines/\n[21]: /contact/get-an-estimate/\n[22]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[23]: /how-it-works/applications/award-engraving/\n[24]: /how-it-works/applications/barcode-engraving-system/\n[25]: /how-it-works/applications/education/\n[26]: /how-it-works/applications/promotional-products/\n[27]: /how-it-works/applications/signage-laser/\n[28]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[29]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[30]: /how-it-works/applications/laser-cutting-acrylic/\n[31]: /how-it-works/applications/glass-etching/\n[32]: /how-it-work"
