            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems logo][Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems\nlogo]][2]\n* Sales\n* [(+1) 303-277-1188][3]\n* [sales@epiloglaser.com][4]\n* [Request Info][5]\n* Support\n* [Submit a Ticket][6]\n[ Request Pricing ][7]\nLaser Machines\n[ Start Your Journey ][8]\n* [ Product Line ][9]\n* [ Fusion Pro Lasers ][10]\n* [ Fusion Ascent Lasers ][11]\n* [ Fusion Galvo Lasers ][12]\nLimited Availability\n* [ Fusion Maker Lasers ][13]\n* [ Fusion Edge Lasers ][14]\n[ Features & More ][15]\n* [ Laser Features ][16]\n* [ Financing Opportunities ][17]\n* [ Find a Distributor ][18]\n* [ Shop Fusion Ascent/Galvo ][19]\n* [ Shop Preowned ][20]\n[ Get an Estimate ][21]\nDiscover\n[ Industry / Applications ][22]\n* [ Awards & Trophies ][23]\n* [ Barcodes ][24]\n* [ Education/Schools ][25]\n* [ Promotional Products ][26]\n* [ Signage ][27]\n* [ View More... ][28]\n[ Materials ][29]\n* [ Acrylic ][30]\n* [ Glass ][31]\n* [ Leather ][32]\n* [ Plastic ][33]\n* [ Wood ][34]\n* [ View More... ][35]\n[ Material Guides ][36]\n* [ Applications Testing ][37]\n* [ Material Compatibility ][38]\n[ Why Epilog? ][39]\n* [ Why Epilog? ][40]\n* [ Customer Spotlight ][41]\n* [ Testimonials ][42]\n\n### Laser Projects\n\nSample Club\nView All\n][43]\nResources\n[ Laser Basics ][44]\n* [ Laser Engraving ][45]\n* [ Laser Marking Metal ][46]\n* [ Laser Cutting Machines ][47]\n* [ CO2 Laser Machines ][48]\n* [ Fiber Laser Machines ][49]\n[ Events ][50]\n* [ Trade Shows & Events ][51]\n* [ Master Classes ][52]\n[ Industry Links ][53]\n* [ Material Suppliers ][54]\n* [ Equipment and Software ][55]\n* [ Publications and Forums ][56]\n* [ Custom Laser Services ][57]\n[ Have Questions? ][58]\n* [ FAQs ][59]\n* [ What do I need? ][60]\n* [ How to Start a Laser Business ][61]\n* [ Blog ][62]\n* [ Request a Demo ][63]\nSupport\n[ Support + Service ][64]\n* [ Support Center ][65]\n* [ Shop Parts & Accessories ][66]\n* [ Support Process ][67]\n[ Submit Ticket ][68]\n[ Support Resources ][69]\n* [ Owner's Manuals ][70]\n* [ Software & Firmware Updates ][71]\n* [ Register Your Machine ][72]\n* [ Training ][73]\n* [ Legacy Systems ][74]\nContact\n[ Company ][75]\n* [ An American Company ][76]\n* [ About Epilog Laser ][77]\n* [ Careers ][78]\n* [ Worldwide Distributors ][79]\n* [ US Distributors ][80]\n* [ Education Distributors ][81]\n* [ Government Sales ][82]\n[ Contact ][83]\n* [ Contact Us ][84]\n* [ Schedule a Demo ][85]\n* [ Request Brochure/Pricing ][86]\n[ Locate Your Rep ][87]\n[ [Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems logo][Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems\nlogo]][88]\n* Laser Machines\n* [ Product Line ][89]\n* [ Laser Features ][90]\n* [ Financing Opportunities ][91]\n* [ Shop Preowned ][92]\n[ Get an Estimate ][93]\n[Fusion Pro laser machines]\nFusionPro\nIndustrial Series\nCO2\nDual\n][94]\n[fusion ascent laser machines]\nFusionAscent\nNext Gen Series\nCO2\nFiber\nNew Lasers\n][95]\n[Fusion Galvo laser machine]\nFusionGalvo\nMetal Marking\nFiber\n][96]\n[ [fusion edge 12, fusion edge 24, and fusion edge 36]\nContact your Distributor for More info\n][97]\n[FusionEdge][98]\n**Limited Availability**\n* Discover\n[ Laser Basics ][99]\n* [ Laser Engraving ][100]\n* [ Laser Marking Metal ][101]\n* [ Laser Cutting Machines ][102]\n* [ CO2 Laser Machines ][103]\n* [ Fiber Laser Machines ][104]\n[ Industry / Applications ][105]\n* [ Awards & Trophies ][106]\n* [ Barcodes ][107]\n* [ Education/Schools ][108]\n* [ Promotional Products ][109]\n* [ Signage ][110]\n* [ View More... ][111]\n[ Materials ][112]\n* [ Acrylic ][113]\n* [ Glass ][114]\n* [ Leather ][115]\n* [ Plastic ][116]\n* [ Wood ][117]\n* [ View More... ][118]\n[ Material Guides ][119]\n* [ Applications Testing ][120]\n* [ Material Compatibility ][121]\n[ Why Epilog? ][122]\n* [ Customer Spotlight ][123]\n* [ Testimonials ][124]\n* Resources\n[[America 250 tri-layer hat patch and sign]][125]\n[ Laser Projects ][126]\n* [ Sample Club - Free Files ][127]\n* [ Quick Tips, Tutorials, & More ][128]\n[ Industry Links ][129]\n* [ Material Suppliers ][130]\n* [ Equipment & Software ][131]\n* [ Publications & Forums ][132]\n* [ Custom Laser Services ][133]\n[[James with wine bottle]][134]\n[ Events ][135]\n* [ Trade Shows & Events ][136]\n* [ Laser Master Classes ][137]\n[ Have Questions? ][138]\n* [ FAQ's ][139]\n* [ What Do I Need? ][140]\n* [ Start a Laser Business ][141]\n* [ Blog ][142]\n[ Request Demo ][143]\n* Support\n[Support + Service][144]\nOur dedicated tech support team is here to assist you. Whether you're facing technical issues or\nneed troubleshooting advice, we're just a message away.\n[ Support Process ][145]\nSubmit a Ticket\nStart here to connect with our support team.\n][146]\nParts & Accessories\nAvailable online - shop now!\n][147]\nSupport Center\nFind the answers you need in our extensive Support Center.\n][148]\n[ Support Resources ][149]\n* [ Owner's Manuals ][150]\n* [ Software & Firmware Downloads ][151]\n* [ Register Your Machine ][152]\n* [ Training ][153]\n* [ Legacy Systems ][154]\n[ Support Center ][155]\n* Contact\n[ Contact ][156]\n* [ Sales: (+1) 303-277-1188 ][157]\n* [ Toll Free: (888) 437-4564 ][158]\n* [ sales@epiloglaser.com ][159]\n* [\n16371 Table Mountain Parkway\nGolden, CO 80403, USA\n][160]\n* [ Support + Service ][161]\n[ Contact Us ][162]\n[ Company ][163]\n* [ An American Company ][164]\n* [ About Epilog Laser ][165]\n* [ Careers ][166]\n* [ Worldwide Distributors ][167]\n* [ US Distributors ][168]\n* [ Education Distributors ][169]\n* [ Government Sales ][170]\n* [ Request Information ][171]\n[Request Pricing][172]\n* Sales\n* [(+1) 303-277-1188][173]\n* [sales@epiloglaser.com][174]\n* [Request Info][175]\n* Support\n* [ Submit a Ticket ][176]\nResults Found: 0\n[New Distribution Facility]\n\n# Epilog Laser Opens New Distribution Facility in Golden, Colo.\n\nGolden, Colo. \u2013 Epilog Laser, the leading producer of CO2 and fiber laser engraving, cutting, and\nmarking systems, is excited open a new distribution facility near its main production building in\nGolden, Colo. This is the fourth facility Epilog has secured in the Coors Technology Center, which\nis already home to the company\u2019s primary headquarters, sales and marketing, and technical support\noffices.\n\n\u201cWhen we built our new headquarters in 2005, we thought we\u2019d have plenty of space to cater to all of\nour employees and departments for a long time,\u201d said Mike Dean, vice president of sales and\nmarketing for Epilog Laser. \u201cOf course we\u2019d love to have our entire team in the same facility, but\nit\u2019s exciting that the increased demand for production is requiring us to find additional space.\u201d\n\nEpilog moved into its current corporate headquarters in 2005 and added a 10,000 square foot\nexpansion in 2014. In 2015, the company\u2019s technical support department secured its own building\nnearby. In 2016, the sales and marketing team moved to its own building, also located in the Coors\nTechnology Center. All four buildings are within approximately a one-mile radius.\n\n\u201cWe love the Golden area and we\u2019re always on the lookout for space that can accommodate our entire\nteam,\u201d Dean said, \u201cbut for now we\u2019re thankful we can remain in close proximity even if we\u2019re not all\nunder the same roof.\u201d\n\nThe additional facility is the latest of several exciting developments at Epilog over the last\nseveral months, including the release of the well-received Fusion Edge Laser Series, which launched\nin November 2020.\n\n## Other News\n\n][177]\n\n### [Fast-Fix Jewelry & Watch Repairs, Denver][178]\n\nFast-Fix Jewelry in Denver uses an Epilog laser for fast on-site repairs and custom engraving.\n\n][179]\n\n### [5 Reasons Epilog Laser Systems Are Safe for Classrooms][180]\n\nEpilog lasers deliver safe, classroom-ready engraving for students \u2013 no special setup needed.\n\n][181]\n\n### [LoTech Sales][182]\n\nTurning Everyday Kitchenware into Powerful Branding Tools\n\n][183]\n\n### [Maximizing Your Epilog Laser Purchase with Section 179][184]\n\nTake Advantage of Section 179 and Potentially Reduce Your Tax Burden When You Invest in an Epilog\nLaser Machine.\n\n][185]\n\n### [Top 5 Questions to ask your local Epilog Laser Representative][186]\n\nThinking about investing in a laser engraving or cutting machine? Before you commit, make sure\nyou\u2019re asking the right questions.\n\n][187]\n\n### [Choosing the Best Laser Engraver for Wood Engraving Projects][188]\n\nPhotographs are a highly popular choice for laser engraving.\n\n## Have a story you want to see featured?\n\n[Tell us your story!][189]\n[Amy Dallman]\n\n### Press Contact for Epilog Laser:\n\n\u2013 Amy Harris\nMarketing Communications Specialist\n[+1 (303) 277-1188][190]\n[aharris@epiloglaser.com][191]\n\n### About Epilog Laser\n\nSince 1988, Epilog Laser has been designing and manufacturing flying-optics-based CO2 and fiber\nlaser systems that can engrave and cut wood, acrylic, plastic, fabric, rubber and many other\nmaterials. Epilog specializes in developing laser systems that create unprecedented marking and\ncutting quality on all types of products. The company produces versatile and reliable systems that\nare affordable and easy to use.\n\n[ Next ][192]\n* [ News ][193]\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\nConnect with an Epilog Laser rep to find the ideal machine for your needs.\n[ Connect with your Rep ][194]\nSales: [303 277 1188][195]\nToll Free: [888 437 4564][196]\n[sales@epiloglaser.com][197]\n[16371 Table Mountain Parkway, Golden, CO 80403, USA][198]\n\n### Product\n* [Product Line][199]\n* [Applications][200]\n* [Start a Laser Business ][201]\n\n### Support\n* [Tech Support][202]\n* [Support Center][203]\n* [Submit a Ticket][204]\n* [Shop Parts & Accessories][205]\n\n### Company\n* [About Us][206]\n* [Careers][207]\n* [Contact Us][208]\n* [Find Your Rep][209]\n\n### Sign up for our Newsletter\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nFacebook\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail*\nInternational Flag\n[Epilog is proud to be an American Company]\n\nEpilog is proud to be an American company. Since 1988 we have been designing, engineering, and\nsupporting our laser machines in Golden, Colorado.\n\n[[Epilog Laser - horizontal logo in white]][210]\n\n\u00a9 Epilog Laser | All Rights Reserved. | [Privacy Policy][211] | [Support][212] | [Sitemap][213]\n\n[1]: #tm-main\n[2]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/\n[3]: tel:+13032771188\n[4]: mailto:sales@epiloglaser.com\n[5]: /contact/request-information/\n[6]: https://support.epiloglaser.com/submit-ticket/\n[7]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/contact/request-pricing/\n[8]: /laser-machines/product-line/\n[9]: /laser-machines/product-line/\n[10]: /laser-machines/fusion-pro-laser-series/\n[11]: /laser-machines/epilog-fusion-ascent-business-laser-engravers-and-cutters/\n[12]: /laser-machines/fusion-galvo-metal-marking-machine/\n[13]: /laser-machines/fusion-maker-laser-cutter-engraver/\n[14]: /laser-machines/fusion-edge-laser-cutter-engraver/\n[15]: /laser-machines/laser-features/\n[16]: /laser-machines/laser-features/\n[17]: /how-it-works/financing/\n[18]: /contact/worldwide/\n[19]: https://shop.epiloglaser.com/collections/epilog-laser-engraving-and-cutting-systems/\n[20]: /laser-machines/preowned-machines/\n[21]: /contact/get-an-estimate/\n[22]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[23]: /how-it-works/applications/award-engraving/\n[24]: /how-it-works/applications/barcode-engraving-system/\n[25]: /how-it-works/applications/education/\n[26]: /how-it-works/applications/promotional-products/\n[27]: /how-it-works/applications/signage-laser/\n[28]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[29]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[30]: /how-it-works/applications/laser-cutting-acrylic/\n[31]: /how-it-works/applications/glass-etching/\n[32]: /how-it-works/applications/laser-engraving-leather/\n[33]: /how-it-works/applications/plastic-marking-machine/\n[34]: /how-it-works/applications/wood-engraving/\n[35]: /how-it-works/applications/\n[36]: /how-it-works/applications-lab/\n[37]: /how-it-works/applications-lab/\n[38]: /how-it-works/laser-material-compatibility/\n[39]: /company/why-choose-epilog-laser/\n[40]: /company/why-choose-epilog-laser/\n[41]: /how-it-works/customer-spotlights/\n[42]: /how-it-works/testimonials/\n[43]: /resources/sample-club/\n[44]: /how-it-works/laser-engraving/\n[45]: /how-it-works/la"
