 ][67]\n[ Submit Ticket ][68]\n[ Support Resources ][69]\n* [ Owner's Manuals ][70]\n* [ Software & Firmware Updates ][71]\n* [ Register Your Machine ][72]\n* [ Training ][73]\n* [ Legacy Systems ][74]\nContact\n[ Company ][75]\n* [ An American Company ][76]\n* [ About Epilog Laser ][77]\n* [ Careers ][78]\n* [ Worldwide Distributors ][79]\n* [ US Distributors ][80]\n* [ Education Distributors ][81]\n* [ Government Sales ][82]\n[ Contact ][83]\n* [ Contact Us ][84]\n* [ Schedule a Demo ][85]\n* [ Request Brochure/Pricing ][86]\n[ Locate Your Rep ][87]\n[ [Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems logo][Epilog Laser engraving and cutting systems\nlogo]][88]\n* Laser Machines\n* [ Product Line ][89]\n* [ Laser Features ][90]\n* [ Financing Opportunities ][91]\n* [ Shop Preowned ][92]\n[ Get an Estimate ][93]\n[Fusion Pro laser machines]\nFusionPro\nIndustrial Series\nCO2\nDual\n][94]\n[fusion ascent laser machines]\nFusionAscent\nNext Gen Series\nCO2\nFiber\nNew Lasers\n][95]\n[Fusion Galvo laser machine]\nFusionGalvo\nMetal Marking\nFiber\n][96]\n[ [fusion edge 12, fusion edge 24, and fusion edge 36]\nContact your Distributor for More info\n][97]\n[FusionEdge][98]\n**Limited Availability**\n* Discover\n[ Laser Basics ][99]\n* [ Laser Engraving ][100]\n* [ Laser Marking Metal ][101]\n* [ Laser Cutting Machines ][102]\n* [ CO2 Laser Machines ][103]\n* [ Fiber Laser Machines ][104]\n[ Industry / Applications ][105]\n* [ Awards & Trophies ][106]\n* [ Barcodes ][107]\n* [ Education/Schools ][108]\n* [ Promotional Products ][109]\n* [ Signage ][110]\n* [ View More... ][111]\n[ Materials ][112]\n* [ Acrylic ][113]\n* [ Glass ][114]\n* [ Leather ][115]\n* [ Plastic ][116]\n* [ Wood ][117]\n* [ View More... ][118]\n[ Material Guides ][119]\n* [ Applications Testing ][120]\n* [ Material Compatibility ][121]\n[ Why Epilog? ][122]\n* [ Customer Spotlight ][123]\n* [ Testimonials ][124]\n* Resources\n[[America 250 tri-layer hat patch and sign]][125]\n[ Laser Projects ][126]\n* [ Sample Club - Free Files ][127]\n* [ Quick Tips, Tutorials, & More ][128]\n[ Industry Links ][129]\n* [ Material Suppliers ][130]\n* [ Equipment & Software ][131]\n* [ Publications & Forums ][132]\n* [ Custom Laser Services ][133]\n[[James with wine bottle]][134]\n[ Events ][135]\n* [ Trade Shows & Events ][136]\n* [ Laser Master Classes ][137]\n[ Have Questions? ][138]\n* [ FAQ's ][139]\n* [ What Do I Need? ][140]\n* [ Start a Laser Business ][141]\n* [ Blog ][142]\n[ Request Demo ][143]\n* Support\n[Support + Service][144]\nOur dedicated tech support team is here to assist you. Whether you're facing technical issues or\nneed troubleshooting advice, we're just a message away.\n[ Support Process ][145]\nSubmit a Ticket\nStart here to connect with our support team.\n][146]\nParts & Accessories\nAvailable online - shop now!\n][147]\nSupport Center\nFind the answers you need in our extensive Support Center.\n][148]\n[ Support Resources ][149]\n* [ Owner's Manuals ][150]\n* [ Software & Firmware Downloads ][151]\n* [ Register Your Machine ][152]\n* [ Training ][153]\n* [ Legacy Systems ][154]\n[ Support Center ][155]\n* Contact\n[ Contact ][156]\n* [ Sales: (+1) 303-277-1188 ][157]\n* [ Toll Free: (888) 437-4564 ][158]\n* [ sales@epiloglaser.com ][159]\n* [\n16371 Table Mountain Parkway\nGolden, CO 80403, USA\n][160]\n* [ Support + Service ][161]\n[ Contact Us ][162]\n[ Company ][163]\n* [ An American Company ][164]\n* [ About Epilog Laser ][165]\n* [ Careers ][166]\n* [ Worldwide Distributors ][167]\n* [ US Distributors ][168]\n* [ Education Distributors ][169]\n* [ Government Sales ][170]\n* [ Request Information ][171]\n[Request Pricing][172]\n* Sales\n* [(+1) 303-277-1188][173]\n* [sales@epiloglaser.com][174]\n* [Request Info][175]\n* Support\n* [ Submit a Ticket ][176]\nResults Found: 0\n[epilog laser logo]\n[Epilog Laser Logo]\n\n# Epilog Laser Asia Pacific\n\n[Worldwide Distributors][177]\n\nFor laser engraving and cutting system sales in Asia, contact Mike Dean. While we do not currently\nhave a distributor located in your country, Mike Dean, our Vice President of Sales & Marketing, will\nhelp find the right system for you.\n\nContact Mike Dean at the information below, or [fill out our brochure request form][178], and we\nwill contact you with the latest sales pricing.\n\n#### Epilog Laser\n\nAsia Pacific\n* Mike Dean\n* 16371 Table Mountain Parkway Golden, CO 80403-1826, USA\n* [(+1) 303-277-1188][179]\n\n## Want to receive the latest sales pricing?\n\n#### Interested in setting up a live demonstration?\n\nFill out our brochure form and we\u2019ll contact you:\n[ Contact Epilog Laser Asia Pacific ][180]\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\nConnect with an Epilog Laser rep to find the ideal machine for your needs.\n[ Connect with your Rep ][181]\nSales: [303 277 1188][182]\nToll Free: [888 437 4564][183]\n[sales@epiloglaser.com][184]\n[16371 Table Mountain Parkway, Golden, CO 80403, USA][185]\n\n### Product\n* [Product Line][186]\n* [Applications][187]\n* [Start a Laser Business ][188]\n\n### Support\n* [Tech Support][189]\n* [Support Center][190]\n* [Submit a Ticket][191]\n* [Shop Parts & Accessories][192]\n\n### Company\n* [About Us][193]\n* [Careers][194]\n* [Contact Us][195]\n* [Find Your Rep][196]\n\n### Sign up for our Newsletter\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nURL\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail*\nInternational Flag\n[Epilog is proud to be an American Company]\n\nEpilog is proud to be an American company. Since 1988 we have been designing, engineering, and\nsupporting our laser machines in Golden, Colorado.\n\n[[Epilog Laser - horizontal logo in white]][197]\n\n\u00a9 Epilog Laser | All Rights Reserved. | [Privacy Policy][198] | [Support][199] | [Sitemap][200]\n\n[1]: #tm-main\n[2]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/\n[3]: tel:+13032771188\n[4]: mailto:sales@epiloglaser.com\n[5]: /contact/request-information/\n[6]: https://support.epiloglaser.com/submi