Lab India will help you find the laser system that best meets your needs.\n\n[ Contact Your Distributor ][177]\n\n#### Laser Lab India Pvt Ltd\n\nIndia\n* Mr. Tushar Upadhyaya\n* 351, Vardhman Fortune Mall\nGTK Industrial Area, GTK Road\nDELHI-110033, India\n* [9716054356][178]\n* [91-11-27373689][179]\n\n## Want to receive the latest sales pricing?\n\n#### Interested in setting up a live demonstration?\n\nFill out our brochure form and we\u2019ll have Laser Lab India Pvt Ltd contact you:\n[ Request Pricing and Free Samples ][180]\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\nConnect with an Epilog Laser rep to find the ideal machine for your needs.\n[ Connect with your Rep ][181]\nSales: [303 277 1188][182]\nToll Free: [888 437 4564][183]\n[sales@epiloglaser.com][184]\n[16371 Table Mountain Parkway, Golden, CO 80403, USA][185]\n\n### Product\n* [Product Line][186]\n* [Applications][187]\n* [Start a Laser Business ][188]\n\n### Support\n* [Tech Support][189]\n* [Support Center][190]\n* [Submit a Ticket][191]\n* [Shop Parts & Accessories][192]\n\n### Company\n* [About Us][193]\n* [Careers][194]\n* [Contact Us][195]\n* [Find Your Rep][196]\n\n### Sign up for our Newsletter\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nCompany\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail*\nInternational Flag\n[Epilog is proud to be an American Company]\n\nEpilog is proud to be an American company. Since 1988 we have been designing, engineering, and\nsupporting our laser machines in Golden, Colorado.\n\n[[Epilog Laser - horizontal logo in white]][197]\n\n\u00a9 Epilog Laser | All Rights Reserved. | [Privacy Policy][198] | [Support][199] | [Sitemap][200]\n\n[1]: #tm-main\n[2]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/\n[3]: tel:+13032771188\n[4]: mailto:sales@epiloglaser.com\n[5]: /contact/request-information/\n[6]: https://support.epiloglaser.com/submit-ticket/\n[7]: https://www.epiloglaser.com/contact/request-pricing/\n[8]: /laser-machines/product-line/\n[9]: /laser