      "polished_summary": "Exail is a leading provider of advanced naval and land defense solutions, specializing in navigation, robotics, and mine countermeasures systems. Trusted by over 70 navies and armies worldwide, the company delivers innovative products such as unmanned vehicles, inertial navigation systems, and motion simulation technologies, catering to the defense and maritime sectors. With a commitment to enhancing operational safety and reliability in challenging environments, Exail engineers cutting-edge solutions that support a wide range of applications, including renewable energy and oceanography.",
