        "crawl_text": "Fibertek, Inc. ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system 13605 Dulles Technology Dr., Herndon VA 20171 [Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# Case Studies\n\n[ICESat-2]\n\n### [ICESat-2][29]\n\nFibertek developed and delivered space-qualified laser transmitters to power the Advanced\nTopographic Laser Altimeter System (ATLAS) for NASA\u2019s ICESat-2 mission. Fibertek also provided the\nATLAS instrument\u2019s photon-counting detector electronics.\n\nRead More\n[Europa Landing Lidar]\n\n### [Europa Landing Lidar][30]\n\nFibertek contributed to NASA\u2019s Europa Lander effort by developing a high-performance compact laser\ntransmitter to power the spacecraft\u2019s entry, descent, and landing lidar system.\n\nRead More\n[LISA Laser Amplifier]\n\n### [LISA Laser Amplifier][31]\n\nThe Laser Interferometer Space Antenna (LISA) is a groundbreaking collaboration between NASA and the\nEuropean Space Agency (ESA) to detect gravitational waves in space.\n\nRead More\n[DSOC]\n\n### [DSOC][32]\n\nFibertek\u2019s Uplink Laser Assembly (ULA) is a laser uplink terminal developed to support NASA\u2019s Deep\nSpace Optical Communications (DSOC) technology demonstration.\n\nRead More\n[SALi]\n\n### [SALi][33]\n\nNASA\u2019s Small All-Range Lidar (SALi) represents a leap forward in lidar technology, offering compact,\nlightweight, and power-efficient performance tailored for space missions exploring planets,\nasteroids, and comets.\n\nRead More\n[CALIPSO]\n\n### [CALIPSO][34]\n\nFibertek designed and built the Nd:YAG laser transmitters that formed the core of the Cloud-Aerosol\nLidar and Infrared Pathfinder Satellite Observations (CALIPSO) mission\u2019s lidar instrument.\n\nRead More\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][35]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][36]\n[(703) 471-7671][37]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][38]\n* [Laser Technologies][39]\n* [Engineering Services][40]\n* [About Us][41]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][42]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][43]\n* [Privacy Policy][44]\n* [Accessibility Policy][45]\n* [Sitemap][46]\n* [LinkedIn][47]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/icesat-2/\n[30]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/europa-landing-lidar/\n[31]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/lisa-laser-amplifier/\n[32]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/dsoc/\n[33]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/sali/\n[34]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/calipso/\n[35]: /contact/\n[36]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[37]: tel:7034717671\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[39]: /technologies/\n[40]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[41]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[43]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[44]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[45]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[46]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[47]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek [Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# ICESat-2\n\nFibertek developed and delivered space-qualified laser transmitters to power the Advanced\nTopographic Laser Altimeter System (ATLAS) for NASA\u2019s ICESat-2 mission. Fibertek also provided the\nATLAS instrument\u2019s photon-counting detector electronics.\n\n[Lidar][29] | [R&D][30]\n* [ Share this page on Facebook ][31]\n* [ Share this page on X ][32]\n* [ Share this page on Twitter ][33]\n* [ Send this link in an email message ][34]\n[Satellite Image]\n\n**Customer\n**NASA Goddard Space Flight Center\n\n**Program Webpage\n**[Home | ICESat-2][35]\n\n## Fibertek\u2019s laser transmitters enable the groundbreaking science driving this mission.\n\nFibertek developed and delivered space-qualified laser transmitters to power the Advanced\nTopographic Laser Altimeter System (ATLAS) for NASA\u2019s ICESat-2 mission. Fibertek also provided the\nATLAS instrument\u2019s photon-counting detector electronics.\n\n[Satellite demonstration]\n\n### Precise, reliable laser solution has enabled exceptional accuracy and longevity.\n* Radiation-tolerant electronics, redundancy, and precision beam control\n* Operating at 532 nm with ~1 mJ pulse energy at a 10 kHz repetition rate\n* Continued, consistent performance after 2 trillion laser shots and 7 years of operation in space\n\n[ICESat-2 Demonstration sheet]\n[Satellite image demo]\n\n## Mission and Challenges\n\nThe ICESat-2 mission, led by NASA, aims to advance our understanding of Earth\u2019s changing climate\nthrough precise, space-based measurements of ice sheet elevation, sea ice thickness, and global\nvegetation canopy height. At the heart of the mission is ATLAS, a sophisticated instrument designed\nto deliver transformative data on the dynamics of polar ice and other critical Earth systems. With\nsub-decimeter elevation accuracy, ICESat-2 provides researchers with unprecedented insight into the\nmass balance of ice sheets and the broader implications for sea-level rise and climate change.\nBeyond the cryosphere, ICESat-2 also contributes to monitoring forest biomass, mapping inland water\nbodies, and supporting ecosystem and hydrological research. By generating high-resolution, repeat\nmeasurements over time, the mission plays a vital role in building long-term climate data records\nand informing global environmental policy and decision making.\n\n## Fibertek\u2019s Contribution and Results\n\nFibertek played a critical role in enabling ICESat-2\u2019s scientific mission by developing and\ndelivering three space-qualified laser transmitters to power the ATLAS instrument. Fibertek also\nprovided the ATLAS photon-counting detector electronics for 120 individual detectors with picosecond\nresolution.\n\nOperating at 532 nm with ~1 mJ pulse energy at a 10 kHz repetition rate, one of the system\u2019s two\nlasers has fired trillions of pulses from orbit while maintaining stable, high-performance output.\nThe design features radiation-tolerant electronics, redundancy, and precision beam quality\ncontrol\u2014ensuring reliable operation in the harsh conditions of low Earth orbit. With a short 1 ns\npulse width and high repetition rate, the lasers enable ATLAS to achieve 70 cm footprint\nmeasurements with exceptional sub-decimeter accuracy.\n\nThe laser system has exceeded its expected mission lifetime, continuing to deliver consistent\nperformance after 2 trillion laser shots and more than seven years of operation, well beyond\noriginal projections. This long-lived, precise laser system has been instrumental in delivering the\nmission\u2019s high-resolution elevation data, supporting critical climate science and Earth system\nmonitoring.\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][36]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][37]\n[(703) 471-7671][38]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][39]\n* [Laser Technologies][40]\n* [Engineering Services][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][43]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Accessibility Policy][46]\n* [Sitemap][47]\n* [LinkedIn][48]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://w"
