            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/calipso/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# CALIPSO\n\nFibertek designed and built the Nd:YAG laser transmitters that formed the core of the Cloud-Aerosol\nLidar and Infrared Pathfinder Satellite Observations (CALIPSO) mission\u2019s lidar instrument.\n\n[Lidar][29] | [R&D][30]\n* [ Share this page on Facebook ][31]\n* [ Share this page on X ][32]\n* [ Share this page on Twitter ][33]\n* [ Send this link in an email message ][34]\n[Calipso Satellite]\n\n**Customer\n**NASA Langley Research Center and Centre National D\u2019Etudes Spatiales (CNES)\n\n**Program Webpage**\n[CALIPSO \u2013 Cloud-Aerosol Lidar and Infrared Pathfinder Satellite Observations][35]\n\n## Fibertek\u2019s spaceborne laser transmitters delivered almost 20 years of continuous service.\n\nFibertek designed and built the Nd:YAG laser transmitters that formed the core of the Cloud-Aerosol\nLidar and Infrared Pathfinder Satellite Observations (CALIPSO) mission\u2019s lidar instrument.\n\n[CALIPSO Satellite Demo]\n\n### Hardware performed reliably and consistently for many years beyond the typical lifespan.\n* Dual-laser system\n* Ruggedized diode-pumped architectures\n* Advanced thermal management\n* Continuous, high-performance service well past the initial 3-year mission\n\n## Mission and Challenges\n\nLaunched in 2006 as a joint mission between NASA and CNES, the CALIPSO mission was designed to\nenhance understanding of the role clouds and aerosols play in Earth\u2019s climate system. The mission\u2019s\nprimary objective was to provide long-term, high-resolution data to support the development and\nrefinement of global climate models, particularly in quantifying radiative forcing (the balance\nbetween energy received from the Sun and energy radiated back into space). By characterizing the\nproperties and global distribution of aerosols and clouds, CALIPSO helped scientists better\nunderstand processes influencing climate change, weather prediction, and air quality, including\nphenomena such as volcanic eruptions, dust storms, wildfire smoke, and pollution transport. The\nmission required exceptionally reliable hardware that could survive the harsh conditions of space\nand deliver consistent performance far beyond typical lifespans.\n\n## Fibertek\u2019s contribution and results\n\nFibertek designed and built the Nd:YAG laser transmitters that formed the core of the CALIPSO lidar\ninstrument. Operating at 532 nm and 1064 nm with a combined pulse energy around 200 mJ, the\ndual-laser system featured ruggedized diode-pumped architectures and advanced thermal management for\nextended space operation. Although qualified for only a three-year mission, Fibertek\u2019s laser systems\ndelivered almost 20 years of continuous, high-performance service. This unmatched reliability helped\nsolidify Fibertek\u2019s reputation for durable spaceborne laser technology and played a key role in\nenhancing NASA\u2019s climate modeling capabilities.\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][36]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][37]\n[(703) 471-7671][38]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][39]\n* [Laser Technologies][40]\n* [Engineering Services][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][43]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Accessibility Policy][46]\n* [Sitemap][47]\n* [LinkedIn][48]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: /technologies/lidar/\n[30]: /technologies/\n[31]: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fibertek.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fc\nalipso%2F\n[32]: https://x.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fibertek.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fcalipso%2F&text\n=CALIPSO\n[33]: https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fibertek.com%2Fcase-stud\nies%2Fcalipso%2F&title=CALIPSO&summary=&source=\n[34]: mailto:?subject=Fibertek%2C%20Inc.%3A%20CALIPSO&body=CALIPSO%0D%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.fibertek.c\nom%2Fcase-studies%2Fcalipso%2F\n[35]: https://www-calipso.larc.nasa.gov/\n[36]: /contact/\n[37]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[38]: tel:7034717671\n[39]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[40]: /technologies/\n[41]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[43]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[44]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[45]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[46]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[47]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[48]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/contact/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# Contact\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nComments\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName*\nFirst Last\nEmail*\nPhone*\nAffiliation*\nMessage*\nCAPTCHA\nSubmit\n\n### Fibertek, Inc.\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon, VA 20171][29]\n\n**Telephone:** [(703) 471-7671][30]\n**Fax:** [(703) 471-5806][31]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][32]\n[(703) 471-7671][33]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][34]\n* [Laser Technologies][35]\n* [Engineering Services][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][38]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][39]\n* [Privacy Policy][40]\n* [Accessibility Policy][41]\n* [Sitemap][42]\n* [LinkedIn][43]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/V9ANxYFrv6JPzrNn8\n[30]: tel:7034717671\n[31]: tel:7034715806\n[32]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[33]: tel:7034717671\n[34]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[35]: /technologies/\n[36]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[37]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[39]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[40]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[41]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[42]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[43]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
