            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/services/program-management/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\nProgram Management\n\n# Enabling successful outcomes across complex defense and space programs\n\n[Home][29] > [Engineering Services][30] > Program Management\n\n## Knowledgeable support for acquisition, logistics, and procurement\n\nOur comprehensive program management support leverages our extensive experience in managing\ntechnology development efforts for the DoW and NASA.\n* Acquisition and planning support\n* Program management and logistics support\n* Equipment procurement for Government customers\n* SETA support\n\n[Get Started][31]\n\nTools and Solutions for Efficient Program Management\n\nExperience and Understanding Across Multiple Program Management Disciplines\n\n### Tools and Solutions for Efficient Program Management\n\nWe use Management Information Systems (MIS) solutions that evolve with the Command, Control,\nCommunications, Computers, Cyber, Intelligence, Surveillance and Reconnaissance (C5ISR) requirements\nand priorities. By configuring and managing standard applications such as SharePoint and CRM tools\nfrom Deltek and other vendors to facilitate program management tasks, our approach enables efficient\naccess, tracking, and planning. This cost-effective strategy involves tailoring existing management\ntools to the specific needs of customers, ensuring controlled access, supervisor oversight, and\nrobust notification and collaboration tools within the workspace.\n\n### Experience and Understanding Across Multiple Program Management Disciplines\n\nAt Fibertek, we possess a deep understanding of the interdependencies within contracting, budgetary,\nand technical disciplines. With over 30 years of engineering support services to the Army, Fibertek\nhas been integral in the program support for a wide array of night vision devices, encompassing\nimage intensification, thermal imaging, and lasers. This support spans the entire lifecycle from\ntechnology development to production, fielding, and decommissioning. The business aspects, such as\ncost/benefit analysis, total cost of ownership, and contracting, are also areas where Fibertek has\nprovided invaluable assistance, aligning with the Army\u2019s modernization strategy and digitization of\nbusiness operations.\n* Technology lifecycle management\n* Contracting\n* Budgeting\n* Technical expertise\n\n## Comprehensive program analysis to support strategic goals\n\nIn the realm of program analysis, our personnel are adept at navigating the dynamic nature of\nmilitary needs. They conduct detailed evaluations of program and budget data, ensuring strategic and\noperational objectives are met in alignment with evolving strategic goals.\n\nThe comprehensive review process includes identifying areas for adjustment to improve alignment with\nstrategic goals, ensuring budget estimates and financial documents comply with guidelines set by\nCongress and other authoritative bodies. During the execution phase of the Planning, Programming,\nBudgeting, and Execution (PPBE) process, Fibertek prepares annual spend plans, develops databases\nfor fiscal policy, and ensures that spend plans are loaded into systems like the CCAR and PMRT for\nhigher headquarters reporting, contributing significantly to the Army\u2019s future readiness.\n* Evaluating program and budget data\n* Identifying areas for adjustment\n* Ensuring compliance\n* Preparing annual spend plans\n* Developing databases for fiscal policy\n\nWhy Fibertek\n\n## Why Fibertek for program management?\n\n[Learn More][32]\n\n**More than 30 years of experience providing engineering support services to the Army**\n\n**Profound understanding of the complexity and interdependence of disciplines within the program\nmanagement process.**\n\n**Customer focus and agility informed by technology development experience.**\n\n**An understanding of the dynamics of risk, and risk mitigation and avoidance.**\n\n**Expertise in managing schedules and funding to ensure organizational goals are met in a timely and\nefficient manner.**\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][33]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][34]\n[(703) 471-7671][35]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][36]\n* [Laser Technologies][37]\n* [Engineering Services][38]\n* [About Us][39]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][40]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n* [Accessibility Policy][43]\n* [Sitemap][44]\n* [LinkedIn][45]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[30]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[31]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[32]: /about/\n[33]: /contact/\n[34]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[35]: tel:7034717671\n[36]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[37]: /technologies/\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[39]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[40]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[41]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[43]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[44]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[45]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/services/logistics-field-service/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\nLOGISTICS MANAGEMENT AND FSR SUPPORT\n\n# Supporting a seamless supply chain\n\n[Home][29] > [Engineering Services][30] > Logistics Management and Field Service Representative\nSupport\n\n## Reliable and responsive logistics and field service capabilities\n\nFibertek\u2019s approach to Logistics Management and Field Service Representative (FSR) support is\ncharacterized by a proactive and customer-focused mindset. We understand the importance of\nmaintaining a seamless supply chain and ensuring that equipment is operational and available when\nneeded.\n\nOur logistics personnel work closely with clients to anticipate needs and develop solutions that\nsupport the full spectrum of logistics activities, from initial planning through to execution and\nafter-action reviews. Our FSRs complement this by providing hands-on support and expertise in the\nfield, bridging the gap between equipment manufacturers and end users. Together, these capabilities\nensure that our clients are well-equipped to carry out their missions with the support of a reliable\nand responsive logistics and field service infrastructure.\n* Supporting technology development and operational field evaluations\n* International deployment, training, and shipping support for demining\n\n[Get Started][31]\n\n## Logistics management\n\n____________________________________________________________\n\nLogistics Management capabilities are integral to Fibertek\u2019s comprehensive support services,\nensuring that our clients\u2019 operational needs are met with efficiency and precision. Our logistics\npersonnel specialize in coordinating and managing equipment and materials necessary for mission\nsuccess. This includes the procurement, storage, and distribution of items, as well as the\nmanagement of supply chains to optimize availability and minimize costs. Logistics support extends\nto the management of government-furnished equipment (GFE) and contractor-acquired property (CAP),\nensuring accountability and compliance with government regulations. Our logistics expertise includes\nour experience using Government systems like the Global Combat Support System-Army (GCCS-Army) and\nDefense Property Accountability System (DPAS), which enable effective asset tracking and management.\n\n## Field service representative (FSR) support\n\nIn addition to logistics management, Fibertek provides exceptional FSR support. Highly skilled\nprofessionals offer on-site technical and operational support for a variety of systems and\nequipment. Often former military personnel with extensive experience in their respective fields, our\nFSRs understand the unique challenges faced by users in operational environments. They are adept at\ntroubleshooting, maintenance, and repair tasks, and they play a crucial role in training military\npersonnel on new equipment, ensuring that soldiers are proficient in the use of the latest\ntechnologies. Our FSRs are also instrumental in providing feedback to developers, contributing to\nthe continuous improvement of systems and equipment.\n\nWhy Fibertek\n\n## Why Fibertek for logistics management and FSR support?\n\n[Learn More][32]\n\n**Logistics expertise backed by fluency in GCCS-Army, DPAS, and multiple logistics tracking\nsystems**\n\n**Highly experienced Field Service Representatives **\n\n**Experience conducting support, logistics and repair operations in austere environments OCONUS**\n\n**Proactive, customer-focused mindset**\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][33]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][34]\n[(703) 471-7671][35]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][36]\n* [Laser Technologies][37]\n* [Engineering Services][38]\n* [About Us][39]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][40]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n* [Accessibility Policy][43]\n* [Sitemap][44]\n* [LinkedIn][45]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[30]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[31]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[32]: /about/\n[33]: /contact/\n[34]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[35]: tel:7034717671\n[36]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[37]: /technologies/\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[39]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[40]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[41]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[43]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[44]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[45]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
          },
