            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/services/facilities/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\nFACILITIES AND WAREHOUSE MANAGEMENT\n\n# Ensuring seamless, secure operations\n\n[Home][29] > [Engineering Services][30] > Facilities and Warehouse Operations and Management\n\n## Operational support for mission logistics and program execution\n\nFacilities Maintenance and Management capabilities are a cornerstone of our operational support\nservices, ensuring smooth functioning of day-to-day activities. Expert warehouse support is critical\nto mission logistics and involves extensive interaction with both internal and external\nstakeholders.\n\nOur warehouse personnel are adept at understanding the unique requirements associated with equipment\nthat needs to be shipped from their facilities to both CONUS and OCONUS locations. They are trained\nand certified in critical matters such as classified materials, ammunition, HAZMAT, and long-haul\ntransportation. Warehouse and transportation personnel are proficient in interfacing with government\nagencies such as GSA and DLA to support mission objectives.\n* Warehousing and storage\n* Shipping and receiving\n* Facilities infrastructure management\n\n## Warehouse and transportation support expertise\n\nFibertek\u2019s facilities/warehouse functions include receiving, inventorying, inspecting, processing,\nand delivering incoming equipment and materials to the end user. Likewise, outbound mail, equipment,\nand other items are properly prepared, packaged, and secured for timely delivery in accordance with\ncustomer needs, taking into account special handling requirements for fragile, EMI-sensitive,\nthermal, or hazardous materials.\n\nOur expertise extends to clearing excess equipment, processing property documentation, and managing\noffice moves, as well as picking up and delivering property, equipment, and furniture.\n\n## Inventory control and storage\n\nInventory control and storage are key aspects of our capabilities, with a focus on reconciling\nshipment documentation and addressing discrepancies with shipping companies. This experience is\ndemonstrated by their past performance, which includes managing a vast inventory of property items,\nturning in excess property to the Defense Logistics Agency, and supporting shipping and receiving\nfunctions with precision and accountability.\n\nWhy Fibertek\n\n## Why Fibertek for managing and operating facilities and warehouses?\n\n[Learn More][31]\n\n**Experience in managing vast inventory**\n\n**Personnel trained and certified to handle sensitive materials**\n\n**Adept at interfacing with internal and external stakeholders**\n\n**Expertise in warehousing, storing and tracking equipment within the United States as well as\nOCONUS**\n\n**Commitment to precision and accountability**\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][32]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][33]\n[(703) 471-7671][34]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][35]\n* [Laser Technologies][36]\n* [Engineering Services][37]\n* [About Us][38]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][39]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][40]\n* [Privacy Policy][41]\n* [Accessibility Policy][42]\n* [Sitemap][43]\n* [LinkedIn][44]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[30]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[31]: /about/\n[32]: /contact/\n[33]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[34]: tel:7034717671\n[35]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[36]: /technologies/\n[37]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[39]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[40]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[41]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[43]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[44]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
