          {
            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/services/research/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\nSCIENTIFIC RESEARCH AND ANALYSIS\n\n# Supporting national security through scientific innovation\n\n[Home][29] > [Engineering Services][30] > Scientific Research and Analysis\n\n## Robust capabilities to push the boundaries of technology\n\nFibertek\u2019s capabilities in scientific research and analysis encompass a wide range of disciplines\nand support the advancement of state-of-the-art technologies. Expertise includes basic and applied\nresearch, as well as advanced development efforts in areas such as materials, sensors, devices,\nelectronic warfare threats, human engineering and performance, military information systems\nperformance and resilience, and advanced energy systems and devices. Our scientists and engineers\nare adept at analyzing technical data, performing experimental test planning, and conceiving\nexperimental, analytical, and numerical approaches to solve complex problems.\n\nThis work facilitates the mission of organizations like the U.S. ARMY DEVCOM Army Research\nLaboratory (ARL), supporting the analysis of the state of the art in sensing, energy and\nbiotechnology, signature management, radio frequency, electronic warfare, and directed energy\ntechnologies, as well as advanced electronics and photonics.\n* Electromagnetic spectrum (ES) and electronic warfare (EW) threat defense\n* Electronics and quantum sciences research\n* Energy sciences research\n* Power sources for the warfighter\n* Material science and performance evaluation\n* Biological and biotechnology sciences research\n\n[Get Started][31]\n\n## Scientific engagement and publication\n\nFibertek\u2019s scientific research and analysis capabilities are further enhanced by the ability to\nauthor technical publications and presentations, and to coordinate and participate in conference and\noutreach activities. Personnel actively engage in national and international symposia, contributing\ntechnical papers, oral presentations, and invited talks. This level of involvement ensures that\nFibertek remains at the forefront of technological advancements and can provide informed solutions\nto clients.\n\n## Strategic initiatives support\n\nOur support for strategic initiatives includes developing and recommending technical approaches to\nproblems pertinent to clients\u2019 missions, providing scientific, engineering, and analytical expertise\nthat enables a real-time common operating picture, and preparing documentation required for\nbriefings, management reviews, and program formulation meetings.\n\n## Program support throughout the technology life cycle\n\nWe assist customers in ensuring that programs developed incorporate all aspects of the life cycle of\ntechnologies, from advanced development of emerging technologies through prototype system\nintegration, to installation, test, evaluation, fielding, sustainment, and follow-on support. We\ndeliver objective analysis, experimentation, and data across the entire life cycle to ensure\nreadiness today and a more lethal future force tomorrow.\n\nWhy Fibertek\n\n## Why Fibertek for scientific research and analysis?\n\nOur comprehensive approach to scientific research and analysis ensures that we not only contribute\nto the development of innovative technologies but also support the integration and application of\nthese technologies in real-world scenarios, enhancing the capabilities of our clients and the\neffectiveness of end users.\n\n[Learn More][32]\n\n**Recognized for scientific innovation**\n\n**Doctoral level experts and scientists bring state of the art research development capabilities**\n\n**Committed to transparency and customer focus**\n\n**Staff that bring R&D knowledge from industry and academia**\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][33]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][34]\n[(703) 471-7671][35]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][36]\n* [Laser Technologies][37]\n* [Engineering Services][38]\n* [About Us][39]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][40]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n* [Accessibility Policy][43]\n* [Sitemap][44]\n* [LinkedIn][45]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[30]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[31]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[32]: /about/\n[33]: /contact/\n[34]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[35]: tel:7034717671\n[36]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[37]: /technologies/\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[39]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[40]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[41]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[43]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[44]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[45]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/services/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\nEngineering Services\n\n# Engineering services and program support for government agencies\n\n## Expert engineering services for mission-critical success\n\nA core part of Fibertek\u2019s business since 1996, our Engineering Services Division delivers highly\nspecialized technical expertise to support scientific research, program execution, logistics, and\ntest and evaluation for the Department of War and NASA. We partner with federal agencies to ensure\ntheir most critical initiatives are executed with precision, innovation, and reliability.\n\nFibertek is the leading small businesses in terms of awards on the US Army Responsive Strategic\nSourcing for Services (RS3) contract vehicle and consistently in the top 2% of 196 small business\nvendors out of 261 original contract holders.\n\n### Prime Contract Vehicles:\n* US Army Responsive Strategic Sourcing for Services (RS3)\n* GSA OASIS Plus (SB)\n* MDA Shield\n\n[Get Started][29]\n\n## A trusted partner to multiple government agencies\n\nFibertek has proudly supported the DoW and NASA for many years across diverse engineering and\ntechnology initiatives. We continue to support a wide range of organizations, as represented below.\n\n## A Full Suite of Services\n\n### Program Management\n\n[Learn More][30]\n\n### Scientific Research and Analysis\n\n[Learn More][31]\n\n### Budgetary Support\n\n[Learn More][32]\n\n### Logistics Management and FSR Support\n\n[Learn More][33]\n\n### Test and Evaluation Support\n\n[Learn More][34]\n\n### Artificial Intelligence\n\n[Learn More][35]\n\n### Facilities Management\n\n[Learn More][36]\n\nProgram Management\n\n## Navigating complexity with confidence\n\nOur experienced team enhances program execution by providing full-spectrum support for acquisition\nplanning, logistics coordination, and procurement strategy \u2014 enabling successful outcomes across\ncomplex defense and space programs.\n* Acquisition and planning support\n* Program management and logistics support\n* Procurement of equipment for government customers\n* SETA support\n\n[Program Management][37]\n\nScientific Research and Analysis\n\n## Pushing boundaries in defense and aerospace innovation\n* Electromagnetic spectrum (ES) and electronic warfare (EW) threat defense\n* Electronics and quantum sciences research\n* Energy sciences research\n* Power sources for the warfighter\n* Material science and performance evaluation\n* Biological and biotechnology science research\n\nFibertek contributes to groundbreaking research across key scientific domains, supporting national\nsecurity through innovation in electromagnetics, quantum science, biotechnology, and more.\n\n[Research][38]\n\nArtificial Intelligence\n\n## Providing real AI capability for current and future operations\n\nFibertek delivers a multidisciplinary team in support of the U.S. Army Futures Command\u2019s Artificial\nIntelligence Integration Center (AI2C). Our team advances both research and operational missions by\nperforming data analytics and assessing AI readiness across Army programs. We identify capability\ngaps, align data\u2011driven requirements with system architectures, and integrate AI tools into fielded\nplatforms. Fibertek also supports the testing and validation of AI prototypes and decision\u2011support\ntechnologies to ensure they meet real\u2011world mission needs.\n\nOur personnel contribute across functional domains, including communications, engineering, and\ncreative design, to enhance AI2C\u2019s ability to accelerate the adoption of artificial intelligence\nacross the Army enterprise.\n\n[AI Services][39]\n\nBudgetary Support\n\n## Driving financial accountability and efficiency\n\nFibertek ensures accurate financial tracking and resource planning in line with federal standards,\ngiving program leaders the insight and control they need to stay on budget and on track.\n* Budget tracking and reporting\n* Ensuring execution of funds\n* Tracking customer procurement spending\n* Resource planning and support\n\n[Budgetary Support][40]\n\nTest and Evaluation Support\n\n## Validating mission readiness through rigorous testing\n\nWe support the full lifecycle of test and evaluation efforts \u2014 from resource planning and\nprocurement to analysis and reporting \u2014 ensuring technologies meet mission requirements and perform\nreliably in the field.\n* Test resource planning\n* Test analysis tracking and reporting\n* Test logistics and procurement\n\n[Testing][41]\n\nLogistics Management\n\n## Logistics management and field service representative support\n\nWe support the full lifecycle of test and evaluation efforts \u2014 from resource planning and\nprocurement to analysis and reporting \u2014 ensuring technologies meet mission requirements and perform\nreliably in the field.\n* Supporting technology development and operational field evaluations\n* International deployment, training and shipping support for humanitarian demining\n\n[Logistics][42]\n\nFacilities/Warehouse Operations and Management\n\n## Operational infrastructure to keep missions moving\n\nFrom warehousing and shipping to facility infrastructure oversight, Fibertek ensures seamless,\nsecure operations that support mission logistics and program execution.\n* Warehousing and storage\n* Shipping and receiving\n* Facilities infrastructure management\n\n[Facilities][43]\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][44]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][45]\n[(703) 471-7671][46]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][47]\n* [Laser Technologies][48]\n* [Engineering Services][49]\n* [About Us][50]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][51]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][52]\n* [Privacy Policy][53]\n* [Accessibility Policy][54]\n* [Sitemap][55]\n* [LinkedIn][56]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[30]: /services/program-management/\n[31]: /services/research/\n[32]: /services/budgetary/\n[33]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[34]: /services/testing/\n[35]: /services/ai/\n[36]: /services/facilities/\n[37]: /services/program-management/\n[38]: /services/research/\n[39]: /services/ai/\n[40]: /services/budgetary/\n[41]: /services/testing/\n[42]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[43]: /services/facilities/\n[44]: /contact/\n[45]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[46]: tel:7034717671\n[47]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[48]: /technologies/\n[49]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[50]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[51]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[52]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[53]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[54]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[55]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[56]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
