          {
            "url": "https://www.fibertek.com/about/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n[Lisa lasers]\n\n### Laser Technologies\n\nCutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n\n[View All][13]\n\n[Lidar Systems][14]\n\nWe offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\nand support expertise.\n\n[Optical Communication Systems][15]\n\nFibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\nscalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n\n### Engineering Services\n\nEnd-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\nservices to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n\n[View All][17]\n\n**[Program Management][18]**\n\nComprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n\n**[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n\nCutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\ntechnologies.\n\n**[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n\nMultidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\noperations.\n\n**[Budgetary Support][21]**\n\nReliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\nrequirements.\n\n**[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n\nRigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n\n**[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n\nEnd-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n\n**[Facilities Management][24]**\n\nSecure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\nlogistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# About us\n\nfibertek\n\n## Advancing your mission with laser technologies and engineering services\n\nFibertek, Inc. is a Virginia-based Company formed in 1983 that provides mission-critical Laser\nTechnologies and full-service Engineering Services (ES) solutions for our National Security,\nAerospace and NASA customers.\n\nSince our founding, Fibertek has routinely delivered critical capabilities to missions of national\nimportance. Our state-of-the art technology, subject matter expertise, small business agility, and\ncost competitiveness provide our customers with best-value solutions to meet their mission needs.\n\n### What we do\n\n### **[Laser Technologies][29]**\n\nEnabling your missions in space, airborne, maritime, and ground domains by delivering bespoke laser\nand electro-optic systems.\n\n[Learn More][30]\n\n### **[Engineering Services][31]**\n\nAdvancing DoW and NASA missions through program management services, logistics support, and on-site\nengineering expertise.\n\n[Learn More][32]\n\nOur Mission and Values\n\n## Empowering missions with innovative laser, lidar, and optical communications technologies, and\n## industry-leading engineering expertise\n\nOur Company mission is to enhance our nation\u2019s technological superiority in aerospace, defense, and\nenvironmental sensing through advanced laser and electro-optical solutions and support services.\n\n**Our Values**\n* **Customer Success: **Dedication to the success of our customers, vendors, and partners.\n* **Employee Fulfillment:** Supporting employees with a flexible and stimulating work environment.\n* **Excellence: **Delivering high-quality products and services with the best value.\n* **Integrity: **Conducting business with honesty and respect.\n* **Innovation:** Encouraging creative thinking and solutions to technical challenges.\n\n## Engineering Services Prime Contract Vehicles\n\n**US Army Responsive Strategic Sourcing for Services (RS3)**\n\n**GSA OASIS Plus (SB)**\n\n**MDA Shield**\n\nLocations\n\n## State-of-the-art facilities\n\nOur modern headquarters and R&D facility in Herndon, Virginia includes cutting-edge labs and\ncleanroom space for advanced product development.\n\n### 70,000 sq. ft. facility, including 23,000 sq. ft. of laboratory space\n\n### ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system\n\n### ISO 6 and ISO 7 cleanrooms for integration and low-rate production\n\n### Environmental testing capabilities\n\nFibertek\u2019s commitment to quality ensures that each product we develop address the unique challenges\nof aerospace and defense missions, enabling you to achieve your mission objectives with confidence.\n\nLeadership\n\n## Our leadership team\n\nFor over 40 years, Fibertek\u2019s leadership has shaped our company culture and upheld our commitment to\nsuccess.\n\n### Guy Beaghler\n\n*President and Chief Executive Officer*\n\n### Dr. Garry Spector\n\n*Executive Vice President*\n\n### Dr. Andrew Schober\n\n*Senior Vice President and Chief Technology Officer*\n\n### Nicholas Sawruk\n\n*Senior Vice President and Chief Strategy Officer*\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][33]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][34]\n[(703) 471-7671][35]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][36]\n* [Laser Technologies][37]\n* [Engineering Services][38]\n* [About Us][39]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][40]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n* [Accessibility Policy][43]\n* [Sitemap][44]\n* [LinkedIn][45]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[28]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[29]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[30]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[31]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[32]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[33]: /contact/\n[34]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/6HMzNygC2VRqDh4i9\n[35]: tel:7034717671\n[36]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[37]: /technologies/\n[38]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[39]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[40]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[41]: https://www.windmillstrategy.com/\n[42]: https://www.fibertek.com/privacy-policy/\n[43]: https://www.fibertek.com/accessibility-policy/\n[44]: /sitemap_index.xml\n[45]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fibertek"
          },
