      "key_products": "Lidar Systems, Optical Communication Systems, Laser Transmitters, Laser Amplifiers, Testing Services",
      "polished_summary": "Fibertek is a leading provider of advanced laser technology systems tailored for space and defense applications. The company specializes in cutting-edge products such as Lidar Systems and Optical Communication Systems, offering comprehensive engineering services that include program management, scientific research, and logistics support. With a strong focus on meeting the needs of defense and space customers, Fibertek is dedicated to delivering innovative solutions that enhance mission-critical operations.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Fibertek manufactures advanced laser technology systems specifically for space and defense applications, including Lidar Systems and Optical Communication Systems. Their engineering services further support mission-critical operations in these sectors, making them a key player in the high energy laser market.",
