igh-performance laser solutions in various industries. Expansion into global markets. Growing demand for laser applications in various industries. Expansion into new markets. Leading manufacturer of fiber lasers and optical devices in China. Increasing adoption of laser technology in manufacturing and telecommunications. Expansion of data centers and telecommunications infrastructure. Increasing adoption of laser technology in manufacturing. Expansion of R&D capabilities. JPT Laser | Fiber Laser Manufacturer &amp; Supplier\n\n-->\n\n-->\n\nJPT Laser | Fiber Laser Manufacturer &amp; Supplier\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n\nLASERS\n\nCORE MODULES\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\nOutdoor &amp; Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\nDiode Lasers\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\nModule Tester\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\nSOLUTIONS\n\nIndustries\n\nApplication\n\nOptical Connection\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\nNew Energy\n\nIndustry Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\nLaser Marking\n\nLaser Welding\n\nLaser Cutting\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\nLaser Cladding\n\nLaser Drilling\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\nSERVICES\n\nService &amp; Support\n\nLocations\n\nQ &amp; A\n\nDownloads\n\nSUSTAINABILITY\n\nCOMPANY\n\nAbout Us\n\nNews &amp; Events\n\nInnovation\n\nHonors\n\nJoin Us\n\nEnglish\n\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\n\nContact Us\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\nContact Us\n\n-->\n\n-->\n\nEnglish\n\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\nOutdoor &amp; Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\nLASERS\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\nDiode Lasers\n\nCORE MODULES\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\nModule Tester\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\nSOLUTIONS\n\nIndustries\n\nOptical Connection\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\nNew Energy\n\nApplication\n\nLaser Marking\n\nLaser Welding\n\nLaser Cutting\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\nLaser Cladding\n\nLaser Drilling\n\nSERVICES\n\nService &amp; Support\n\nLocations\n\nQ &amp; A\n\nGeneral\n\nTechnical\n\nPre-sales\n\nAfter-sales\n\nDownloads\n\nProducts\n\nSUSTAINABILITY\n\nCOMPANY\n\nAbout Us\n\nNews &amp; Events\n\nCompany News\n\nIndustry Information\n\nExhibition\n\nTechnical Information\n\nInnovation\n\nHonors\n\nJoin Us\n\n\u63a8\u52a8\u667a\u9020\u8fdb\u6b65 \u5171\u521b\u7f8e\u597d\u672a\u6765\n\nJPT is the first company in China to commercialize tunable pulse-width high-power fiber lasers. Recognized as a national high-tech enterprise, we focus on the R&amp;D, manufacturing, and sales of lasers, intelligent laser/optical equipment, and fiber optic components.\n\n-->\n\nAs far as light reaches, everything is under control\n\nJPT adheres to the positioning of \"laser +\", to develop core laser technologies and focus on the laser core modules.\n\nOur Mission\n\nAdvancing Intelligent Manufacturing for a Common Bright Future.\n\nOur Value\n\nInnovate with Integrity, Dream Big, Pursue Excellence, Collaborate to Succeed\n\nLEADING OPTICAL, TECHNOLOGIES FOR PEOPLE\n\nDrive with Core Technologies of Laser, Continuously Create Value for Customers.\n\n250,000+\n\nCumulative Shipments of MOPA Fiber Laser\n\n330,000+\n\nTTL History Sale for Laser\n\n2,000+\n\nCumulative Shipments of Trimmer & Scriber\n\n8,800+\n\nTTL History Sale for Equipment\n\n\u63a8\u52a8\u667a\u9020\u8fdb\u6b65 \u5171\u521b\u7f8e\u597d\u672a\u6765\n\nJPT is the first company in China to commercialize tunable pulse-width high-power fiber lasers. Recognized as a national high-tech enterprise, we focus on the R&amp;D, manufacturing, and sales of lasers, intelligent laser/optical equipment, and fiber optic components.\n\n250,000+\n\nCumulative Shipments of MOPA Fiber Laser\n\n330,000+\n\nTTL History Sale for Laser\n\n2,000+\n\nCumulative Shipments of Trimmer & Scriber\n\n8,800+\n\nTTL History Sale for Equipment\n\nFind the Product For You\n\nLasers\n\nAs a leading laser manufacturer in China, JPT offers a full range of lasers, including MOPA laser, CW l aser , DPSS laser, and diode lasers. JPT delivers high-performance and flexible industrial laser solutions.\n\nLearn More\n\nOptical Devices\n\nJPT offers high-density optical components and connectivity solutions with ultra-low insertion loss, high return loss, and flexible cabling. Widely deployed in data centers, Base stations and FTTx, they enable high-bandwidth, low-latency networks.\n\nLearn More\n\nCore Modules\n\nJPT develops self-designed laser welding modules. Ensuring stable and consistent processing, these are widely integrated into vision positioning and detection, driving intelligent upgrades and yield improvement.\n\nLearn More\n\nIntelligent Equipment\n\nJPT intelligent equipment includes Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser solutions. Using proprietary lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries, automotive electronics, and semiconductors for higher efficiency and superior yields.\n\nLearn More\n\nLasers\n\nOptical Devices\n\nCore Modules\n\nIntelligent Equipment\n\nThe Strategic Areas Where We Lead the Future\n\nOur strategic presence spans leading customers in consumer electronics, data centers, next-generation telecom infrastructure, precision manufacturing for electric vehicles, new energy lithium battery manufacturing, and advanced information technologies such as AR/VR.\n\nView all industry solutions\n\nOptical Connection\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\nNew Energy\n\nOptical Connection\n\nIn data centers, high-performance computing, and cloud networks, JPT serves as a core enabler of next-generation communication architectures. We deliver optoelectronic solutions for diverse scenarios, from short-range high-speed transmission and board-to-board interconnects to AI server backplane connections\u2014building high-bandwidth, low-latency, and reliable intelligent networks.\n\nData Centers\n\n5G Base Stations\n\nFTTx Cabling Solutions\n\nGeneric Cabling System\n\nLearn More\n\nGet Solution\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\nWith years of expertise and accumulation in laser technology, JPT has developed comprehensive solutions for the consumer electronics sector, centering on optical calibration and inspection equipment. Drawing on our strengths in optical design, vision algorithms, and motion control, and through collaborative innovation with industry partners, we provide high-precision, high-efficiency, and intelligent optoelectronic inspection systems.\n\nOptical Module Performance Testing & Calibration\n\nIntelligent Module Calibration & Functional Verification\n\nCamera Module Precision Testing & Calibration\n\nLearn More\n\nGet Solution\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\nJPT leverages us core laser technologies and automation capabilities to deliver integrated solutions covering wafer resistor trimming, ceramic substrate cutting, glass drilling and windowing, and component laser marking. By combining self-developed high-performance lasers with customized intelligent equipment, we meet the highest standards for precision, yield, and process consistency.\n\nCeramic Substrate Laser Cutting\n\nWafer Laser Resistor Trimming\n\nWafer Laser Processing Equipment\n\nLearn More\n\nGet Solution\n\nNew Energy\n\nJPT has developed a complete, targeted laser processing solution addressing specific customer pain points. Backed by advanced R&D capabilities, our product lineup spans key stages from cell processing to battery module and PACK assembly, delivering a true one-stop solution.\n\nTab Cutting\n\nCell Assembly\n\nBattery Module (PACK) Assembly\n\nPhotovoltaic Cell Manufacturing\n\nLearn More\n\nGet Solution\n\nWorking Hand in Hand with Our Partners\n\ndriving laser technology into broader applications and delivering comprehensive optical solutions for the intelligent era\n\nRelentless in exploration, together we shape the future of lasers\n\n2026-02-26\n\nJPT at Laser World of Photonics China 2026\n\nLearn More\n\n2026-05-29\n\nCreality Ecosystem and JPT Launch Strateg [ [a_img03.png] [a_img03.png] ][1]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n* [PRODUCTS][2]\n* [a-icon04.svg] [a-icon0401.svg]\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n* [aicon05.svg] [aicon0501.svg]\n\nLASERS\n* [aicon03.svg] [aicon0301.svg]\n\nCORE MODULES\n* [a-icon06.svg] [a-icon0601.svg]\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* * [\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\n][3]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\n][4]\n* [\n\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\n][5]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\n][6]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\n][7]\n* [\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\n][8]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\n][9]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][10]\n* * [\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\n][11]\n* [\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\n][12]\n* [\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\n][13]\n* [\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\n][14]\n* [\n\nDiode Lasers\n\n][15]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* * [\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\n][20]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][21]\n* * [\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nModule Tester\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\n][25]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][26]\n* [SOLUTIONS][27]\n* [a-icon07.svg] [a-icon0701.svg]\n\nIndustries\n* [a-icon08.svg] [a-icon0801.svg]\n\nApplication\n* * [\n\nOp"
