nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg] [\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg]\n\n# OPTICAL DEVICES\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [OPTICAL DEVICES][122]\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][123]\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### High Density Fiber Assembly\n\nJPT High Density Fiber Assembly - ranging from MPO/MTP trunks to fiber arrays\u2014power data centers,\ntelecom, and optical modules with ultra-low loss, compact design, and flexible customization. Built\nfor multi-core, high-speed networks, they enable faster, smarter optical interconnects.\n* [\n[MPO/MTP Trunk Cable Assembly.png] [underlay image]\nMPO/MTP Trunk Cable Assembly\n\nData center LAN system | Application of parallel data exchange between PC | 10G/40G/100G/400G\nnetwork transmission | Optical fiber distribution system\n\n][144]\n* [\n[MPO/MTP Harness\u5206\u652f\u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf1.png] [underlay image]\nMPO/MTP Harness Cables\n\nData center interconnect | Telecommunication networks and CATV networks | Link between O/E modules\n| High-density fiber management\n\n][145]\n* [\n[MPO/MTP Hydra \u5206\u652f\u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf1.png] [underlay image]\nMPO/MTP Hydra Cables\n\nData center interconnect | High-density fiber management | Telecommunication networks and CATV\nnetworks | Link between O/E modules\n\n][146]\n* [\n[MT\u77ed\u8df3\u7ebf2.png] [underlay image]\nMT-MT Short Patchcord\n\nOptical module, AOC, Switching equipment | Application of parallel data exchange between PC |\n40G/100G/400G/800G network transmission | Optical fiber distribution system\n\n][147]\n* [\n[1.png] [underlay image]\nMT-Jumper\n\nOptical module, AOC, Switching equipment | Application of parallel data exchange between PC |\n40G/100G/400G/800G network transmission | Optical fiber distribution system\n\n][148]\n* [\n[90-FA.png] [underlay image]\nFiber Array\n\nApply for AWG/WSS/VMUX/OCM/MCS | High speed silicon photonics transceiver modules | QSFP, QSFP+,\nSR, SNAP12 | Parallel optical transmission | HDMI, AOC\n\n][149]\n* [\n[\u4ea7\u54c1\u56fe.png] [underlay image]\nMT-FA\n\nWidely used in used in 40G/100G/200G/400G/800G | QSFPQSFP+, SR, SNAP12 | Parallel optical\ntransmission | HDMI,AOC\n\n][150]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][151]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][152]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][153]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][154]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][155]\n* * [PRODUCTS][156]\n* [Optical Devices][157]\n* [Lasers][158]\n* [Core Modules][159]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][160]