nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg] [\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg]\n\n# OPTICAL DEVICES\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [OPTICAL DEVICES][122]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][123]\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Fiber Optic Patchcord\n\nJPT Fiber Optic Patchcord\u2014spanning LC, SC, ST, FC, MU, MTRJ, and E2000\u2014deliver low loss, high\nstability connectivity for data centers, telecom, CATV, and FTTx networks. With flexible\nsingle/multi-mode and simplex/duplex options, they enable fast, reliable optical interconnects\ntailored to customer needs.\n* [\n[LC \u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf.png] [underlay image]\nLC-LC Fiber Optic Patchcord\n\nTelecommunication System | Testing Facility | CATV System | Long-haul Telecommunication | LAN\nSystem\n\n][144]\n* [\n[LC Uniboot \u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf.png] [underlay image]\nLC Uniboot Fiber Optic Patchcord\n\nTelecommunication System | Testing Facility | CATV System | Long-haul Telecommunication | LAN\nSystem\n\n][145]\n* [\n[SC \u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf.png] [underlay image]\nSC-SC Fiber Optic Patchcord\n\nTelecommunication System | Testing Facility | CATV System | Long-haul Telecommunication | LAN\nSystem\n\n][146]\n* [\n[SC \u5c3e\u7ea4.png] [underlay image]\nSC Fiber Optic Pigtail\n\nTelecommunication System | Testing Facility | CATV System | Long-haul Telecommunication | LAN\nSystem\n\n][147]\n* [\n[FC-LC \u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf.png] [underlay image]\nFC-LC Fiber Optic Patchcord\n\nTelecommunication System | Testing Facility | CATV System | Long-haul Telecommunication | LAN\nSystem\n\n][148]\n* [\n[E2000 \u5149\u7ea4\u8df3\u7ebf.png] [underlay image]\nE2000-E2000 Fiber Optic Patchcord\n\nTelecommunication System | Testing Facility | CATV System | Long-haul Telecommunication | LAN\nSystem\n\n][149]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][150]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][151]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][152]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][153]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][154]\n* * [PRODUCTS][155]\n* [Optical Devices][156]\n* [Lasers][157]\n* [Core Modules][158]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][159]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][160]\n* [Industries][161]\n* [Applications][162]\n* * [SERVICES][163]\n* [Services & Supports][164]\n* [Locations][165]\n* [Q & A][166]\n* [Downloads][167]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][168]\n* [Annual Report][169]\n* [Special Report][170]\n* [Policies & Statements][171]\n* * [COMPANY][172]\n* [About Us][173]\n* [News & Events][174]\n* [Innovation][175]\n* [Honor][176]\n* [Join Us][177]\n* * 