nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg] [\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg]\n\n# OPTICAL DEVICES\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [OPTICAL DEVICES][122]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][123]\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\nJPT Outdoor and Hybrid Cable Assembly\u2014featuring PDLC, CPRI, NSN, and ODVA interfaces with IP67\nprotection\u2014deliver reliable fiber + power integration for wireless stations and FTTx networks.\nCustomizable in connectors, length, and fiber count, they ensure flexible, efficient outdoor\ndeployment.\n* [\n[PDLC \u5ba4\u5916\u5149\u7f06\u7ec4\u4ef6.png] [underlay image]\nPDLC Outdoor Cable Assembly\n\nMultifunctional outdoor patchcord | It is used to connect the distribution box to the RRH |\nApplied to remote wireless base station\n\n][144]\n* [\n[CPRI \u5ba4\u5916\u5149\u7f06\u7ec4\u4ef6.png] [underlay image]\nCPRI Outdoor Cable Assembly\n\nMultifunctional outdoor patchcord | It is used to connect the distribution box to the RRH |\nApplied to remote wireless base station\n\n][145]\n* [\n[NSN\u5c3e\u5957\u5ba4\u5916\u5149\u7f06\u7ec4\u4ef6.png] [underlay image]\nNSN Boot Outdoor Cable Assembly\n\nMultifunctional outdoor patchcord | It is used to connect the distribution box to the RRH |\nApplied to remote wireless base station\n\n][146]\n* [\n[ODVA \u5ba4\u5916\u5149\u7f06\u7ec4\u4ef6.png] [underlay image]\nODVA Outdoor Cable Assembly\n\nMultifunctional outdoor patchcord | It is used to connect the distribution box to the RRH |\nApplied to remote wireless base station\n\n][147]\n* [\n[\u5149\u7535\u6df7\u5408\u7f06\u7ec4\u4ef6.png] [underlay image]\nHybrid Optoelectric Cable Assembly\n\nZone network | 5G small base station | Smart city and industrial scene | FTTA cable distribution\n\n][148]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][149]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][150]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][151]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][152]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][153]\n* * [PRODUCTS][154]\n* [Optical Devices][155]\n* [Lasers][156]\n* [Core Modules][157]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][158]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][159]\n* [Industries][160]\n* [Applications][161]\n* * [SERVICES][162]\n* [Services & Supports][163]\n* [Locations][164]\n* [Q & A][165]\n* [Downloads][166]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][167]\n* [Annual Report][168]\n* [Special Report][169]\n* [Policies & Statements][170]\n* * [COMPANY][171]\n* [About Us][172]\n* [News & Events][173]\n* [Innovation][174]\n* [Honor][175]\n* [Join Us]