nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg] [\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg]\n\n# OPTICAL DEVICES\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [OPTICAL DEVICES][122]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][123]\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Fiber Optic Patch Panels\n\nJPT Fiber Optic Patch Panels\u2014engineered for MPO/MTP modules\u2014offer 19-inch rack compatibility and\nmodular flexibility, empowering data centers and telecom networks with scalable, high-density\ncabling solutions.\n* [\n[\u9ad8\u5bc6\u5ea6MPO/MTP\u5149\u7ea4\u914d\u7ebf\u673a\u7bb119\" 1U.png] [underlay image]\nHigh Density MPO/MTP Module Patch Panel 19\" 1U\n\nData center room | Optical distribution frame | Telecommunication Networks | LAN and CATV networks\n\n][144]\n* [\n[\u9ad8\u5bc6\u5ea6MPO/MTP\u5149\u7ea4\u914d\u7ebf\u673a\u7bb119\" 3U.png] [underlay image]\nHigh Density MPO/MTP Module Patch Panel 19\" 3U\n\nData center room | Optical distribution frame | Telecommunication Networks | LAN and CATV networks\n\n][145]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][146]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][147]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][148]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][149]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][150]\n* * [PRODUCTS][151]\n* [Optical Devices][152]\n* [Lasers][153]\n* [Core Modules][154]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][155]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][156]\n* [Industries][157]\n* [Applications][158]\n* * [SERVICES][159]\n* [Services & Supports][160]\n* [Locations][161]\n* [Q & A][162]\n* [Downloads][163]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][164]\n* [Annual Report][165]\n* [Special Report][166]\n* [Policies & Statements][167]\n* * [COMPANY][168]\n* [About Us][169]\n* [News & Events][170]\n* [Innovation][171]\n* [Honor][172]\n* [Join Us][173]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][174]\n* [HiPA][175]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][176]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][177]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][178]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][179]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][180]\n\n[Legal Notice][181][Privacy Policy][182][Sitemap][183]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable