nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg] [\u5149\u8fde\u63a5.jpg]\n\n# OPTICAL DEVICES\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [OPTICAL DEVICES][122]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][123]\n\nJPT delivers advanced optical connectivity solutions for high-speed networks. From MPO/MTP\nassemblies to indoor/outdoor patch cords, our ultra-low-loss, high-reliability components empower\ndata centers, AI servers, and FTTx with seamless performance.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Fiber Optic Closure\n\nJPT Fiber Optic Closure\u2014horizontal or dome type\u2014deliver robust sealing, waterproofing, and\ndurability. Ideal for telecom, CATV, and LAN networks, they ensure reliable performance and easy\nmaintenance in diverse deployment environments.\n* [\n[\u536