nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg] [\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg]\n\n# LASERS\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [LASERS][122]\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][123]\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n* All\n20-100W\n100-300W\n500-1000W\n1000-2000W\n2000-6000W\n6000-20000W\n* All\nUltraviolet (UV)\nBlue\nGreen\nInfrared (IR)\n\n### MOPA Fiber Lasers\n\nJPT pulsed fiber lasers, built on advanced MOPA architecture, offer tunable pulse width and\nfrequency for unmatched flexibility. From marking and cleaning to precision cutting and thin-sheet\nwelding, our M7, M8, CL, and GR series deliver optimized performance across industries and power\nranges.\n\n* [\n[M7 20-100W.png] [underlay image]\nM7 20-100W\n\n20-100W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-E2-20-M7-S-R\n* YDFLP-E2-30-M7-S-R\n* YDFLP-E2-60-M7-M-R\n* YDFLP-E2-100-M7-M-R\n\nLaser etching; Surface treatment; Precision cleaning; Thin sheet metal cutting & welding; Deep\nlaser engraving; On-the-fly marking\n\n][144]\n* [\n[JPT M7 MOPA Fiber Laser 300W.png] [underlay image]\nM7 200-300W\n\n200-300W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-E3-200-M7-M-R\n* YDFLP-E3-200-M7-L-R\n* YDFLP-E2-200-M7-M-R\n* YDFLP-E2-200-M7-L-R\n* YDFLP-E3-300-M7-M-R\n* YDFLP-E3-300-M7-L-R\n* YDFLP-E-300-M7-M-R\n* YDFLP-E-300-M7-L-R\n\nLaser etching; Surface treatment; Laser cleaning; On-the-fly marking; Deep laser engraving\n\n][145]\n* [\n[100011.png] [underlay image]\nM7 500-1000W\n\n500-1000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-500-M7-M-R-A\n* YDFLP-500-M7-M-R-W\n* YDFLP-1000-M7-L-R-W\n\nLaser etching; Surface treatment; Laser cleaning; On-the-fly marking; Deep laser engraving\n\n][146]\n* [\n[YDFLP11.png] [underlay image]\nM8 20-50W\n\n20-50W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-20-M8-S-R\n* YDFLP-50-M8-M-R\n\nLaser etching; Thin sheet drilling; Anode stripping; Coating removal; Thin sheet cutting\n\n][147]\n* [\n[JPT MOPA Fiber Laser M8 120-300W.png] [underlay image]\nM8 120-300W\n\n120-300W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-120-M8-S-W-V2\n* YDFLP-200-M8-S-W-V2\n* YDFLP-300-M8-S-W-V2\n\nGlass drilling; Thin sheet drilling; Mirror frosting; Anode stripping; Coating removal; Thin sheet\ncutting\n\n][148]\n* [\n[JPT MOPA Fiber Laser CL2 Air Cooled 200-300W.png] [underlay image]\nCL2 Air Cooled 200-300W\n\n200-300W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-CL2-200-1-A\n* YDFLP-CL2-300-1-A\n* YDFLP-CL2-200-5-A\n* YDFLP-CL2-300-5-A\n* YDFLP-CL2-300-10-A\n\nMold surface cleaning; Laser paint removal; Laser rust removal; Pre-weld treatment; Coating\nsurface texturing; Oil/stain removal\n\n][149]\n* [\n[JPT CL3 Air Cooled 200-300W.png] [underlay image]\nHot\nCL3 Air Cooled 200-300W\n\n200-300W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-CL3-200-1-A\n* YDFLP-CL3-300-1-A\n* YDFLP-CL3-200-5-A\n* YDFLP-CL3-300-5-A\n* YDFLP-CL3-300-10-A\n\nMold surface cleaning; Laser paint removal; Laser rust removal; Pre-weld treatment; Coating\nsurface texturing; Oil/stain removal\n\n][150]\n* [\n[CL Air Cooled 500W.png] [underlay image]\nCL Air Cooled 500W\n\n500W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-CL-500-1-A\n* YDFLP-CL-500-5-A\n* YDFLP-CL-500-15-A\n* YDFLP-CL-500-50-A\n\nMold surface cleaning; Laser paint removal; Laser rust removal; Pre-weld treatment; Coating\nsurface texturing; Oil/stain removal\n\n][151]\n* [\n[CL Water Cooled 500\u20131000W.png] [underlay image]\nCL Water Cooled 500\u20131000W\n\n500-1000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-CL-500-1-W\n* YDFLP-CL-500-5-W\n* YDFLP-CL-500-15-W\n* YDFLP-CL-500-50-W\n* YDFLP-CL-1000-5-W\n* YDFLP-CL-1000-15-W\n* YDFLP-CL-1000-50-W\n* YDFLP-CL-1000-100-W\n\nMold surface cleaning; Laser paint removal; Laser rust removal; Pre-weld treatment; Coating\nsurface texturing; Oil/stain removal\n\n][152]\n\nNo Results\n* 1\n* [\n\n][153]\n* [\n][154]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][155]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][156]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][157]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][158]\n* * [PRODUCTS][159]\n* [Optical Devices][160]\n* [Lasers][161]\n* [Core Modules][162]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][163]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][164]\n* [Industries][165]\n* [Applications][166]\n* * [SERVICES][167]\n* [Services & Supports][168]\n* [Locations][169]\n* [Q & A][170]\n* [Downloads][171]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][172]\n* [Annual Report][173]\n* [Special Report][174]\n* [Policies & Statements][175]\n* * [COMPANY][176]\n* [About Us][177]\n* [News & Events][178]\n* [Innovation][179]\n* [Honor][180]\n* [Join Us][181]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][182]\n* [HiPA][183]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][184]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][185]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][186]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][187]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nRese