atment, and even plastic processing.\n* [\n[QCW Fiber Laser.png] [underlay image]\nQCW Fiber Laser\n\n150/1500W-600/6000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* QCW-200/1000-L2-A\n* QCW-300/1500-L2-A\n* QCW-150/1500-L-A\n* QCW-300/3000-L-A\n* QCW-450/4500-L-A\n* QCW-600/6000-L-A\n\nMetal Cutting; Ceramic/Metal Drilling; Precision Welding\n\n][144]\n* [\n[CW Air Cooled 800-2000W.png] [underlay image]\nCW Air Cooled 800-2000W\n\n800-2000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLC-800-L-A\n* YDFLC-1500-L-A\n* YDFLC-2000-L-A\n\nUtilizes air-cooling technology for welding and cleaning of metals.\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Continuous Wave Single-Mode Water-Cooled Laser.png] [underlay image]\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n\n500-6000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLC-500-L2-W\n* YDFLC-1000-L2-W\n* YDFLC-2000-L2-W\n* YDFLC-3000-L-W\n* YDFLC-4000-L-W\n* YDFLC-6000-L2-W\n\nCarbon Steel; Cutting; High-Reflectivity Material Cutting; Lithium Battery Welding\n\n][146]\n* [\n[Continuous Wave Multimode Lasers.png] [underlay image]\nCW Cabinet 6-20kW\n\n6000-20000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLC-6000-X-W\n* YDFLC-8000-X-W\n* YDFLC-8000-L-W\n* YDFLC-12000-X-W\n* YDFLC-12000-L-W\n* YDFLC-20000-L-W\n\nLaser Cladding; Silicon Steel Welding; Carbon Steel Bright Cutting; High-Reflectivity Material\nCutting; Thick Stainless Steel Cutting\n\n][147]\n* [\n[AOB (Adjustable Output Beam) Laser.png] [underlay image]\nAdjustable Output Beam Laser\n\n1000/1000-6000/6000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* AOB-1000/1000-L2-W\n* AOB-1500/1500-L2-W\n* AOB-2000/2000-L2-W\n* AOB-2000/2000-L-W\n* AOB-3000/3000-L-W\n* AOB-4000/2000-L-W\n* AOB-4000/4000-L-W\n* AOB-6000/6000-L-W\n\nCopper Welding; Tab Welding; Cover Plate Welding; Tab Lead Welding\n\n][148]\n* [\n[Diode Fiber Output Lasers.png] [underlay image]\nDirect Semiconductor Laser\n\n2000-3000W\n\nAdd comparison\n* DL-2000-L-W\n* DL-3000-L-W\n\nLaser Die Hardening; Laser Cladding; Laser Heating; Laser Welding\n\n][149]\n* [\n[\u63ba\u94e5\u5149\u7ea4\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.png] [underlay image]\nThulium-Doped Fiber Laser\n\n20-200W\n\nAdd comparison\n* TDFLC-20-L-A\n* TDFLC-50-L-W\n* TDFLC-100-L-W\n* TDFLC-200-L-W\n\nOptical Resin Cutting; ABS Plastic Welding; Plastic Welding; Biomedical Applications\n\n][150]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][151]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][152]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][153]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][154]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][155]\n* * [PRODUCTS][156]\n* [Optical Devices][157]\n* [Lasers][158]\n* [Core Modules][159]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][160]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][161]\n* [Industries][162]\n* [Applications][163]\n* * [SERVICES][164]\n* [Services & Supports][165]\n* [Locations][166]\n* [Q & A][167]\n* [Downloads][168]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][169]\n* [Annual Report][170]\n* [Special Report][171]\n* [Policies & Statements][172]\n* * [COMPANY][173]\n* [About Us][174]\n* [News & Events][175]\n* [Innovation][176]\n* [Honor][177]\n* [Join Us][178]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][179]\n* [HiPA][180]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][181]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][182]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][183]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][184]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][185]\n\n[Legal Notice][186][Privacy Policy][187][Sitemap][188]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n