nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg] [\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg]\n\n# LASERS\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [LASERS][122]\n* [DPSS Lasers][123]\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n* All\n20-100W\n100-300W\n500-1000W\n1000-2000W\n2000-6000W\n6000-20000W\n* All\nUltraviolet (UV)\nBlue\nGreen\nInfrared (IR)\n\n### DPSS Lasers\n\nJPT DPSS lasers offer UV and green options with superior beam quality, stability, and durability.\nDesigned for precision processing of brittle and heat-sensitive materials, they feature a compact\nsealed design built for harsh environments. Our LARK, SEAL, and SPARROW series deliver flexible\nsolutions across multiple wavelengths and power ranges.\n* [\n[Lark-3ASE.png] [underlay image]\nLARK 355-3/5\n\n3-5W\n\nAdd comparison\n* Lark-355-3A\n* Lark-355-3ASE\n* Lark-355-5A\n* Lark-355-5ASE\n\nLaser marking on various plastics (PE, PET, etc.)\uff1bSolar cell scribing/dicing\uff1bCutting of\nflexible/brittle materials\n\n][144]\n* [\n[JPT SEAL 355nm UV DPSS laser Seal-355-3SE.png] [underlay image]\nSEAL 355-3/5\n\n3-5W\n\nAdd comparison\n* Seal-355-3E\n* Seal-355-5E\n* Seal-355-3SE\n* Seal-355-5SE\n\nLaser marking on various plastics (PE, PET, etc.)\uff1bSolar cell scribing/dicing\uff1bCutting of\nflexible/brittle materials\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Seal-355-10S.png] [underlay image]\nSEAL355-10/15/20/30\n\n10-30W\n\nAdd comparison\n* Seal-355-10S\n* Seal-355-15S\n* Seal-355-20S\n* Seal-355-30S\n* Seal-355-10E\n* Seal-355-15E\n\n3D Package Manufacturing, Wafer Scribing, Brittle Materials Drilling, Flex Materials Cutting\n\n][146]\n* [\n[seal-532-20.png] [underlay image]\nSEAL 532-7/10/20/30\n\n7-30W\n\nAdd comparison\n* Seal-532-7\n* Seal-532-10\n* Seal-532-20\n* Seal-532-30\n\nFlex Materials Cutting, IC Package Trimming, Wafer Scribing\n\n][147]\n* [\n[Sparrow-532-2 \u7eff\u5149.png] [underlay image]\nSparrow-355/532\n\n800mW-2W\n\nAdd comparison\n* Sparrow-355-800\n* Sparrow-355-2\n* Sparrow-532-2\n\n3D Package Manufacturing, IC Package Trimming, Wafer Scribing, Solar Cell Scribing\n\n][148]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][149]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][150]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][151]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][152]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][153]\n* * [PRODUCTS][154]\n* [Optical Devices][155]\n* [Lasers][156]\n* [Core Modules][157]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][158]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][159]\n* [Industries][160]\n* [Applications][161]\n* * [SERVICES][162]\n* [Services & Supports][163]\n* [Locations][164]\n* [Q & A][165]\n* [Downloads][166]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][167]\n* [Annual Report][168]\n* [Special Report]