nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg] [\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg]\n\n# LASERS\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [LASERS][122]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][123]\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n* All\n20-100W\n100-300W\n500-1000W\n1000-2000W\n2000-6000W\n6000-20000W\n* All\nUltraviolet (UV)\nBlue\nGreen\nInfrared (IR)\n\n### Ultrafast Lasers\n\nJPT ultrafast lasers feature a compact cavity design combined with an industrial-grade electronic\ncontrol architecture, offering femtosecond and picosecond-level pulse duration and an extremely low\nheat-affected zone. Supporting IR, GR, and UV wavelength outputs, they meet high-precision\napplication requirements ranging from micro-processing to advanced industry.\n* [\n[JPT-LIT femtosecond laser.png] [underlay image]\nNew\nJPT-LIT 20 Femtosecond Laser\n\n3-20W\n\nAdd comparison\n* JPT-LIT 20 IR\n* JPT-LIT 20 SH\n* JPT-LIT 10\n* JPT-LIT 3\n\nSuitable for applications including material processing, battery manufacturing, and semiconductor\nand display production.\n\n][144]\n* [\n[FS-20-T4.png] [underlay image]\nFS Series Infrared Lasers\n\n20-60W\n\nAdd comparison\n* YDFLP-FS-20\n* YDFLP-FS-60\n\nThe FS series lasers feature optional pulse train capability and programmable amplitude\nmodulation, enabling ultra-short pulse output with high pulse energy.\n\n][145]\n* [\n[PS IR/GR/UV.png] [underlay image]\nPS IR/GR/UV\n\n5-80W\n\nAdd comparison\n* JPT-PS-UV-5\n* JPT-PS-UV-10\n* JPT-PS-GR-15\n* JPT-PS-GR-40\n* JPT-PS-IR-20\n* JPT-PS-IR-30\n* JPT-PS-IR-80\n\nSupporting output wavelengths ranging from infrared to ultraviolet, with pulse switching and pulse\ntrain functions, enabling output frequencies ranging from single pulses to 1 MHz.\n\n][146]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][147]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][148]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][149]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][150]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][151]\n* * [PRODUCTS][152]\n* [Optical Devices][153]\n* [Lasers][154]\n* [Core Modules][155]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][156]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][157]\n* [Industries][158]\n* [Applications][159]\n* * [SERVICES][160]\n* [Services & Supports][161]\n* [Locations][162]\n* [Q & A][163]\n* [Downloads][164]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][165]\n* [Annual Report][166]\n* [Special Report][167]\n* [Policies & Statements][168]\n* * [COMPANY][169]\n* [About Us][170]\n* [News & Events][171]\n* [Innovation][172]\n* [Honor][173]\n* [Join Us][174]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][175]\n* [HiPA][176]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][177]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][178]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][179]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][180]\n\n