g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg] [\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.jpg]\n\n# LASERS\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [LASERS][122]\n* [Diode Lasers][123]\n\nJPT is a leading laser manufacturer in the world, offering a full range of MOPA, CW, DPSS, and Diode\nlasers. Our products enable precise welding, cutting, micro/nano marking, and surface processing.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n* All\n20-100W\n100-300W\n500-1000W\n1000-2000W\n2000-6000W\n6000-20000W\n* All\nUltraviolet (UV)\nBlue\nGreen\nInfrared (IR)\n\n### Diode Lasers\n\nJPT diode Lasers span 450nm to 1550nm with customizable power up to hundreds of watts. Offering high\nefficiency, narrow linewidth, and fiber or free-space output, they power applications from medical\ntreatment and industrial heating to laser pumping and photovoltaic inspection. Integrated modules\nensure reliability and easy system integration.\n\n* [\n[COS Encapsulated Semiconductor Laser.png] [underlay image]\nCOS Encapsulated Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 808\n* 880\n* 915\n* 976\n\nCOS Encapsulatedtechnology offers high efficiency, low thermal resistance, and enhanced\nreliability, applicable in industrial processing, medical equipment, and communications fields\n\n][144]\n* [\n[915nm Semiconductor Laser.png] [underlay image]\n915nm Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 915-15\n* 915-45\n* 915-150\n* 915-480\n\nSuitable for fiber laser pumping applications across industrial processing, medical, cosmetic, and\nscientific research sectors\n\n][145]\n* [\n[976nm\u7cfb\u5217\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.png] [underlay image]\n976nm Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 976-150W\n* 976-200W\n* 976-280W\n* 976-450W\n\nNear-infrared laser equipment, used as a pump source for fiber lasers\n\n][146]\n* [\n[808nm\u7cfb\u5217\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u6fc0\u5149\u5668.png] [underlay image]\n808nm Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 808-8W\n* 808-16W\n* 808-25W\n* 808-50W\n\nNear-infrared lasers serving as solid-state laser pumping sources\n\n][147]\n* [\n[880nm Semiconductor Laser.png] [underlay image]\n880nm Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 880-8W\n* 880-30W\n* 880-65W\n* 880-120W\n\nHigh-efficiency laser equipment in the near-infrared band, also serving as a pump source for\nsolid-state lasers\n\n][148]\n* [\n[1060nm Semiconductor Laser.png] [underlay image]\n1060nm Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 1060-15W\n* 1060-70W\n\nUsed for quality inspection of silicon wafers, solar cells, and other semiconductor materials\n\n][149]\n* [\n[1470nm Semiconductor Laser] [underlay image]\n1470nm Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 1470-10W\n\nHigh efficiency and excellent stability, 1470nm widely used in medical, cosmetic, and scientific\nresearch fields\n\n][150]\n* [\n[1550nm Red Light Semiconductor Laser.png] [underlay image]\n1550nm Red Light Semiconductor Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 1550nm-15W-R-200\u03bcm\n* 1550nm-25W-R-200\u03bcm\n\nHigh-power, visible light marking, widely used in material processing, medical equipment, and\nscientific research experiments\n\n][151]\n* [\n[450nm - 100W High Power Diode Laser.png] [underlay image]\n450nm - 100W High Power Diode Laser\nAdd comparison\n* 450nm\u2014100W\n\nUtilizing blue laser wavelengths, it features high output power, excellent stability, and high\nefficiency\n\n][152]\n\nNo Results\n* 1\n* [\n\n][153]\n* [\n][154]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][155]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][156]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][157]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][158]\n* * [PRODUCTS][159]\n* [Optical Devices][160]\n* [Lasers][161]\n* [Core Modules][162]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][163]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][164]\n* [Industries][165]\n* [Applications][166]\n* * [SERVICES][167]\n* [Services & Supports][168]\n* [Locations][169]\n* [Q & A][170]\n* [Downloads][171]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][172]\n* [Annual Report][173]\n* [Special Report][174]\n* [Policies & Statements][175]\n* * [COMPANY][176]\n* [About Us][177]\n* [News & Events][178]\n* [Innovation][179]\n* [Honor][180]\n* [Join Us][181]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][182]\n* [HiPA][183]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][184]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][185]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][186]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][187]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][188]\n\n[Legal Notice][189][Privacy Policy][190][Sitemap][191]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /produc