nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u6838\u5fc3\u6a21\u5757.jpg] [\u6838\u5fc3\u6a21\u5757.jpg]\n\n# CORE MODULES\n\nJPT welding control modules oversee every stage \u2014 before, during, and after welding. With real-time\nmonitoring, adaptive control, and smart diagnostics, they deliver stable quality and illuminate the\nfuture of intelligent manufacturing.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [CORE MODULES][122]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][123]\n\nJPT welding control modules oversee every stage \u2014 before, during, and after welding. With real-time\nmonitoring, adaptive control, and smart diagnostics, they deliver stable quality and illuminate the\nfuture of intelligent manufacturing.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### In-process Welding Modules\n\nJPT In-process Welding Modules provide intelligent, real-time monitoring during laser welding. By\ntracking critical indicators throughout the process, they ensure precision control, optimize\nefficiency, and safeguard weld quality with superior stability and reliability.\n* [\n[OCT Penetration Online Detection System.png] [underlay image]\nOCT Penetration Online Detection System\n\nEnables high-resolution, real-time imaging of weld penetration during the welding process,\neffectively improving welding quality and consistency.\n\n][144]\n* [\n[Welding Process Detection System.png] [underlay image]\nWelding Process Detection System\n\nReal-time analysis for welding defect detection and quality monitoring\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Laser Temperature Feedback Compensation Module.png] [underlay image]\nLaser Temperature Feedback Compensation Module\n\nReal-time monitoring of weld temperature, achieving closed-loop control and significantly\nimproving welding yield.\n\n][146]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][147]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][148]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][149]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][150]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][151]\n* * [PRODUCTS][152]\n* [Optical Devices][153]\n* [Lasers][154]\n* [Core Modules][155]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][156]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][157]\n* [Industries][158]\n* [Applications][159]\n* * [SERVICES][160]\n* [Services & Supports][161]\n* [Locations][162]\n* [Q & A][163]\n* [Downloads][164]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][165]\n* [Annual Report][166]\n* [Special Report][167]\n* [Policies & Statements][168]\n* * [COMPANY][169]\n* [About Us][170]\n* [News & Events][171]\n* [Innovation][172]\n* [Honor][173]\n* [Join Us][174]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][175]\n* [HiPA][176]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][177]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][178]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][179]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][180]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][181]\n\n[Legal Notice][182][Privacy Policy][183][Sitemap][184]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/opt