nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u6838\u5fc3\u6a21\u5757.jpg] [\u6838\u5fc3\u6a21\u5757.jpg]\n\n# CORE MODULES\n\nJPT welding control modules oversee every stage \u2014 before, during, and after welding. With real-time\nmonitoring, adaptive control, and smart diagnostics, they deliver stable quality and illuminate the\nfuture of intelligent manufacturing.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [CORE MODULES][122]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][123]\n\nJPT welding control modules oversee every stage \u2014 before, during, and after welding. With real-time\nmonitoring, adaptive control, and smart diagnostics, they deliver stable quality and illuminate the\nfuture of intelligent manufacturing.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Intelligent Welding Heads\n\nJPT's intelligent welding heads integrate high-power galvanometer systems with precision motors and\noptics, supporting power up to 8 kW. Built-in safety alarms enable real-time monitoring, ensuring\nsecure operation. Fully compatible with JPT's core modules\u2014including power compensation, OCT\npenetration detection, and WPD in-process monitoring\u2014they provide a comprehensive solution for\nstable, high-quality welding performance.\n* [\n[Intelligent Welding Head1.png] [underlay image]\nIntelligent Welding Head\n\nIntegrated with multiple monitoring functions to ensure stable and reliable welding quality\n\n][144]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][145]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][146]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][147]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][148]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][149]\n* * [PRODUCTS][150]\n* [Optical Devices][151]\n* [Lasers][152]\n* [Core Modules][153]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][154]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][155]\n* [Industries][156]\n* [Applications][157]\n* * [SERVICES][158]\n* [Services & Supports][159]\n* [Locations][160]\n* [Q & A][161]\n* [Downloads][162]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][163]\n* [Annual Report][164]\n* [Special Report][165]\n* [Policies & Statements][166]\n* * [COMPANY][167]\n* [About Us][168]\n* [News & Events][169]\n* [Innovation][170]\n* [Honor][171]\n* [Join Us][172]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][173]\n* [HiPA][174]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][175]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][176]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][177]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][178]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][179]\n\n[Legal Notice][180][Privacy Policy][181][Sitemap][182]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-