g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907banner\u56fe.jpg] [--\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907.jpg]\n\n# INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS][122]\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][123]\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Chip Resistor Solution\n\nJPT Chip Resistor Solution Product Line provides core equipment for chip resistor production,\nincluding laser trimming, scribing, and testing systems. With proprietary lasers and measurement\nplatforms, our solutions deliver high speed, precision, and yield across consumer, automotive,\nprecision, and aerospace-grade resistors.\n* [\n[Laser Thin Film Trimmer.png] [underlay image]\nLaser Thin Film Trimmer\n\nMeasurement range 100m\u03a9-500M\u03a9, measurement accuracy \u00b10.01%, supports multiple resistance\nspecifications\n\n][144]\n* [\n[Laser Thick Film Trimmer.png] [underlay image]\nLaser Thick Film Trimmer\n\nResistance adjustment range 100m\u03a9\uff5e20M\u03a9, used for laser resistance adjustment of chip thick film\nresistors/hybrid circuits (thick film) on ceramic substrates\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Ultra-low Resistance Laser Trimmer.png] [underlay image]\nUltra-low ohm Laser Trimmer\n\n0.1m\u03a9\u20131M\u03a9, measurement accuracy: \u00b10.1%, supports multiple resistor specifications\n\n][146]\n* [\n[Laser Scriber.png] [underlay image]\nLaser Scriber\n\nFront and back line repeatability less than \u00b15 \u03bcm, achieving \u00b10.75\u03bcm/70mm straightness and \u00b11\u03bcm\npositioning accuracy\n\n][147]\n* [\n[Single Chip-resistor Tester.png] [underlay image]\nSingle Chip-resistor Tester\n\nUsed for first inspection before laser trimming, re-measurement or final inspection after laser\ntrimming\n\n][148]\n* [\n[High Voltage Resistor Tester.png] [underlay image]\nHigh Voltage Resistor Tester\n\nUsed to test single-chip resistor substrates, with the withstand voltage characteristics of each\nresistor before and after resistance adjustment\n\n][149]\n* [\n[TCR Tester.png] [underlay image]\nTCR Tester\n\nUsed for testing the TCR values of individual resistors on single-chip resistor substrates\n\n][150]\n* [\n[Inductor Laser Peeling Machine.png] [underlay image]\nInductor Laser Peeler\n\nFor laser removal of resin layers/enamel layers on molded inductors and wound inductors\n\n][151]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][152]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][153]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][154]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][155]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][156]\n* * [PRODUCTS][157]\n* [Optical Devices][158]\n* [Lasers][159]\n* [Core Modules][160]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][161]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][162]\n* [Industries][163]\n* [Applications][164]\n* * [SERVICES][165]\n* [Services & Supports][166]\n* [Locations][167]\n* [Q & A][168]\n* [Downloads][169]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][170]\n* [Annual Report][171]\n* [Special Report][172]\n* [Policies & Statements][173]\n* * [COMPANY][174]\n* [About Us][175]\n* [News & Events][176]\n* [Innovation][177]\n* [Honor][178]\n* [Join Us][179]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][180]\n* [HiPA][181]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][182]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][183]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][184]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][185]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][186]\n\n[Legal Notice][187][Privacy Policy][188][Sitemap][189]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/gre