nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907banner\u56fe.jpg] [--\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907.jpg]\n\n# INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS][122]\n* [Module Tester][123]\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Module Tester\n\nFrom R&D to mass production, JPT's Module Tester Solution combine laser modules and advanced AOI\nplatforms, empowering industries from consumer electronics and semiconductors to VR/AR and new\nenergy.\n* [\n[TWE Bench Tester.png] [underlay image]\nTWE Tester\n\nCan be used to evaluate the performance of optical components when monochromatic light of\ndifferent wavelengths passes through them.\n\n][144]\n* [\n[JPT Autocollimator.png] [underlay image]\nAutocollimator\n\nUsed in precision manufacturing, optical component inspection, industrial metrology, and automated\nmeasurement systems\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Non-contact Spectral Colorimeter.png] [underlay image]\nNon-contact Spectral Colorimeter\n\nFor measuring specular reflectance and colour of material surfaces\n\n][146]\n* [\n[D8\u6f2b\u53cd\u5c04\u8272\u5dee\u4eea.png] [underlay image]\nD8 Diffuse Reflectance Colorimeter\n\nSuitable for industrial inspection and colour control applications\n\n][147]\n* [\n[Transmittance Meter.png] [underlay image]\nTransmittance Meter\n\nFor calculating transmittance/reflectance, chromaticity coordinates, and optical film thickness\n\n][148]\n* [\n[Haze Tester.png] [underlay image]\nHaze Tester\n\nAutomatic measurement of optical material transmittance/reflectance and haze\n\n][149]\n* [\n[Multifunctional Automatic Stage.png] [underlay image]\nMultifunctional Automatic Stage\n\nDesigned for high-demand applications such as optical device calibration, semiconductor\nmanufacturing, 3D scanning, and scientific research experiments.\n\n][150]\n* [\n[Electric Six Axis Sliding Table.png] [underlay image]\nElectric Six Axis Sliding Table\n\nSupports six degrees of freedom control in three-dimensional space, including translation (X/Y/Z)\nand rotation (around the X/Y/Z axes)\n\n][151]\n* [\n[UVW Three Axis Sliding Table.png] [underlay image]\nUVW Three Axis Sliding Table\n\nEnables rotation and translation of any point on a plane, suitable for spatial positioning and\nalignment calibration of precision equipment\n\n][152]\n\nNo Results\n* 1\n* [\n\n][153]\n* [\n][154]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][155]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][156]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][157]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][158]