nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907banner\u56fe.jpg] [--\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907.jpg]\n\n# INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS][122]\n* [Green Energy Solution][123]\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Green Energy Solution\n\nJPT Green Energy Solution enables next-generation battery manufacturing with solutions for tab\ncutting, cap welding, motor welding, and laser cleaning. Built on in-house lasers and motion\nsystems, our equipment ensures high precision, speed, and adaptability across EV and energy storage\napplications.\n* [\n[\u7535\u673a\u6fc0\u5149\u710a\u63a5\u6a21\u7ec41.png] [underlay image]\nHairpin Motor Laser Welding Module\n\nBuild for high-precision, high-quality laser welding of hairpin stator windings\n\n][144]\n* [\n[Battery Sealing Welding Module.png] [underlay image]\nBattery Sealing Welding Module\n\nSignificantly reducing spatter and welding defects, ensuring high production yield. It has been\nwidely applied in the power battery industry.\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Multi-mode Laser Cleaning Module.png] [underlay image]\nMulti-mode Laser Cleaning Module\n\nPrimarily used for cleaning blue films in battery cells, cleaning rollers used in electrode sheet\nrolling, and cleaning gravure rollers used in pre-coating processes, etc.\n\n][146]\n* [\n[\u6781\u67f1\u5bc6\u5c01\u9489\u6e05\u6d17\u6a21\u7ec4MOPA1.png] [underlay image]\nSingle-mode Laser Cleaning Module\n\nUsed in cleaning of liquid injection holes in power batteries, cleaning of battery cell terminals,\ncleaning of shell surfaces, etc\n\n][147]\n* [\n[Tab Cutting Module.png] [underlay image]\nTab Cutting Module\n\nPrimarily used in the field of cutting tabs for cathodes and anodes of power batteries\n\n][148]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][149]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][150]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][151]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][152]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][153]\n* * [PRODUCTS][154]\n* [Optical Devices][155]\n* [Lasers][156]\n* [Core Modules][157]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][158]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][159]\n* [Industries][160]\n* [Applications][161]\n* * [SERVICES][162]\n* [Services & Supports][163]\n* [Locations][164]\n* [Q & A][165]\n* [Downloads][166]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][167]\n* [Annual Report][168]\n* [Special Report][169]\n* [Policies & Statements][170]\n* * [COMPANY][171]\n* [About Us][172]\n* [News & Events][173]\n* [Innovation][174]\n* [Honor][175]\n* [Join Us][176]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][177]\n* [HiPA][17