nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907banner\u56fe.jpg] [--\u667a\u80fd\u88c5\u5907.jpg]\n\n# INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* [Home][120]\n* [PRODUCTS][121]\n* [INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS][122]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][123]\n\nJPT intelligent equipment covers Chip Resistor, Module Tester, Green Energy, and Advance Laser\nsolutions. Leveraging lasers and precision control, our systems optimize key processes in batteries,\nautomotive electronics, and other industries.\n* OPTICAL DEVICES\n* [High Density Fiber Assembly][124]\n* [Fiber Optic Patchcord][125]\n* [Outdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly][126]\n* [Fiber Optic Patch Panels][127]\n* [Fiber Optic Closure][128]\n* [Active and High-Speed Cables][129]\n* [Fiber Optic Splitter][130]\n* LASERS\n* [MOPA Fiber Lasers][131]\n* [CW / QCW Fiber Lasers][132]\n* [DPSS Lasers][133]\n* [Ultrafast Lasers][134]\n* [Diode Lasers][135]\n* CORE MODULES\n* [Pre-welding Modules][136]\n* [In-process Welding Modules][137]\n* [Post-welding Modules][138]\n* [Intelligent Welding Heads][139]\n* INTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* [Chip Resistor Solution][140]\n* [Module Tester][141]\n* [Green Energy Solution][142]\n* [Advance Laser Solution][143]\n\n### Advance Laser Solution\n\nFocused on 3C electronics, JPT Advance Laser Solution delivers micro-nano laser systems for\nprecision welding, ultra-thin glass cutting, fine marking, and micron-scale processing, driving\nsmarter, more reliable manufacturing.\n* [\n[Fully Automatic High-Precision Laser Marking Equipment.png] [underlay image]\nFully Automatic High-Precision Laser Marking Equipment\n\nEquipment for marking processing on glass, resin, wafers, etc.\n\n][144]\n* [\n[Dual-Station Five-Axis Galvo Welding System.png] [underlay image]\nDual-Station Five-Axis Galvo Welding System\n\nEquipped with a WPD in-process welding quality monitoring module, the system enables real-time\nclosed-loop control during welding, ensuring a yield rate of 99.9%.\n\n][145]\n* [\n[Glass Ink Drilling Equipment.png] [underlay image]\nGlass Ink Drilling Equipment\n\nDesigned for drilling glass ink layers in displays for smartphones, tablets, and computers.\n\n][146]\n* [\n[Fully Automatic Laser Invisible QR Code Equipment.png] [underlay image]\nFully Automatic Laser Invisible QR Code Equipment\n\nQR codes provide traceability and anti-counterfeiting functionality throughout subsequent\nprocesses\n\n][147]\n* [\n[3C\u4e94\u8f74\u6fc0\u5149\u8054\u52a8\u901a\u7528\u5e73\u53f01.png] [underlay image]\n3C Five-Axis Laser Linkage Universal Platform\n\nIntegrates large-range five-axis precision positioning with localized three-axis high-speed laser\nscanning and tracking.\n\n][148]\n\nNo Results\n* [\n][149]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][150]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][151]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][152]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][153]\n* * [PRODUCTS][154]\n* [Optical Devices][155]\n* [Lasers][156]\n* [Core Modules][157]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][158]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][159]\n* [Industries][160]\n* [Applications][161]\n* * [SERVICES][162]\n* [Services & Supports][163]\n* [Locations][164]\n* [Q & A][165]\n* [Downloads][166]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][167]\n* [Annual Report][168]\n* [Special Report][169]\n* [Policies & Statements][170]\n* * [COMPANY][171]\n* [About Us][172]\n* [News & Events][173]\n* [Innovation][174]\n* [Honor][175]\n* [Join Us][176]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][177]\n* [HiPA][178]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_