g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Industries][122]\n\n# Industry Solutions\n\n[Frame.svg]\n[c1_icon01.svg]\n[c1_icon03.svg]\n[c1_icon02.svg]\n\nJPT's solutions cover consumer electronics, data centers, next-gen communication, EV manufacturing,\nnew energy batteries, and AR/VR. With advanced laser and optical technologies, we boost production\nefficiency and competitiveness.\n* 01\n\n## Optical Connection\n\nLearn More\n\n][123]\n[\u5149\u4e92\u8fde\u5e94\u7528\u9886\u57df.jpg]\n\nIn data centers, HPC, and cloud networks, JPT delivers next-gen optical solutions with laser\nchips, VCSELs, and high-speed coupling. From board interconnects to AI servers, we enable\nhigh-bandwidth, low-latency, and reliable networks.\n\n][124]\n\nLearn More\n\n][125]\n* 02\n\n## Consumer Electronics\n\nLearn More\n\n][126]\n[c1_img03.jpg]\n\nWith deep expertise in lasers, JPT provides advanced optical calibration and inspection systems\nfor electronics. Combining optical design, vision algorithms, and motion control, we deliver\nintelligent, high-precision solutions that empower the industry.\n\n][127]\n\nLearn More\n\n][128]\n* 03\n\n## Pan-Semiconductor\n\nLearn More\n\n][129]\n[\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.png]\n\nJPT integrates core laser and automation technologies for wafer trimming, ceramic cutting, glass\ndrilling, and marking. Our high-performance lasers and intelligent equipment enhance precision,\nyield, and process consistency across MLCC, LTCC, and IC substrates.\n\n][130]\n\nLearn More\n\n][131]\n* 04\n\n## New Energy\n\nLearn More\n\n][132]\n[\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n\nFor batteries, JPT offers one-stop laser solutions from cell processing to PACK assembly. In\nphotovoltaics, our applications span glass drilling, cell cleaving, PERC hole drilling, PL\ninspection, and perovskite patterning\u2014driving efficient green energy manufacturing.\n\n][133]\n\nLearn More\n\n][134]\n* [\n][135]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][136]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][137]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][138]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][139]\n* * [PRODUCTS][140]\n* [Optical Devices][141]\n* [Lasers][142]\n* [Core Modules][143]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][144]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][145]\n* [Industries][146]\n* [Applications][147]\n* * [SERVICES][148]\n* [Services & Supports][149]\n* [Locations][150]\n* [Q & A][151]\n* [Downloads][152]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][153]\n* [Annual Report][154]\n* [Special Report][155]\n* [Policies & Statements][156]\n* * [COMPANY][157]\n* [About Us][158]\n* [News & Events][159]\n* [Innovation][160]\n* [Honor][161]\n* [Join Us][162]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][163]\n* [HiPA][164]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][165]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][166]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][167]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][168]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][169]\n\n[Legal Notice][170][Privacy Policy][171][Sitemap][172]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-