g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Industries][122]\n* [Optical Connection][123]\n\n# Optical Connection\n\nIn data centers, HPC, and cloud networks, JPT delivers next-gen optical solutions with laser chips,\nVCSELs, and high-speed coupling. From board interconnects to AI servers, we enable high-bandwidth,\nlow-latency, and reliable networks.\n\n[\u5149\u4e92\u8fde\u5e94\u7528\u9886\u57df.jpg]\n* Data Centers\n* 5G Base Stations\n* FTTx Cabling Solutions\n* Generic Cabling System\n* [\u6570\u636e\u4e2d\u5fc3\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\nData Centers\n\nHigh-speed, stable, and reliable data transmission is the foundation of their operation\u2014whether it\nis real-time synchronization of large-scale data, low-latency cloud services, or seamless\ncollaboration across multiple devices, all rely on robust underlying transmission links.\n\nTo meet these demands, JPT has developed a comprehensive transmission solution that ensures\noptimal performance from link deployment to signal optimization. This guarantees efficient data\nflow within data centers and across interconnected environments, providing a solid foundation for\nthe stable operation of the digital ecosystem.\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][124]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][125]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panel\n][126]\n\n[Get Solution][127]\n* [5G\u57fa\u7ad9\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n5G Base Stations\n\nJPT optical connectivity solutions address the core requirements of 5G\u2014high bandwidth, low\nlatency, and massive connections\u2014by providing reliable, high-speed optical fiber transmission at\nthe operator network access layer. Widely used in macro base stations, micro base stations, and\ndistributed antenna systems, our products ensure stable fronthaul, backhaul, and transport network\nconnections, delivering robust optical communication support for diverse 5G applications.\n* [\nPDLC Outdoor Cable Assembly\n][128]\n* [\nCPRI Outdoor Cable Assembly\n][129]\n* [\nNSN Boot Outdoor Cable Assembly\n][130]\n* [\nODVA Outdoor Cable Assembly\n][131]\n* [\nHybrid Optoelectric Cable Assembly\n][132]\n\n[Get Solution][133]\n* [FTTX \u5e03\u7ebf\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\nFTTx Cabling Solutions\n\nJPT\u2019s FTTx cabling solutions use optical fiber as the transmission medium, offering large\ncapacity, high quality, long distance, and strong electromagnetic interference resistance.\nCovering both full-optical and hybrid optical-copper access modes, the solutions include\nhigh-density fiber connectors, patch cords, outdoor and hybrid cables, and distribution boxes,\nenabling operators and enterprises to build high-speed, reliable fiber access networks.\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][134]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][135]\n* [\nOutdoor and Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][136]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panel\n][137]\n\n[Get Solution][138]\n* [\u901a\u7528\u5e03\u7ebf\u7cfb\u7edf\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\nGeneric Cabling System\n\nJPT\u2019s structured cabling systems support voice, data, and building automation networks within and\nbetween buildings, enabling LAN and WAN resource sharing. With a clear, modular, and easily\nexpandable design, the system offers high flexibility and is compatible with a range of optical\nand copper cabling, connectors, and distribution hardware for superior transmission performance\nand ease of installation.\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][139]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][140]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panel\n][141]\n\n[Get Solution][142]\n* [\u6570\u636e\u4e2d\u5fc3\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* [5G\u57fa\u7ad9\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* [FTTX \u5e03\u7ebf\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* [\u901a\u7528\u5e03\u7ebf\u7cfb\u7edf\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* [\n][143]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][144]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][145]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][146]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][147]\n* * [PRODUCTS][148]\n* [Optical Devices][149]\n* [Lasers][150]\n* [Core Modules][151]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][152]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][153]\n* [Industries][154]\n* [Applications][155]\n* * [SERVICES][156]\n* [Services & Supports][157]\n* [Locations][158]\n* [Q & A][159]\n* [Downloads][160]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][161]\n* [Annual Report][162]\n* [Special Report][163]\n* [Policies & Statements][164]\n* * [COMPANY][165]\n* [About Us][166]\n* [News & Events][167]\n* [Innovation][168]\n* [Honor][169]\n* [Join Us][170]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][171]\n* [HiPA][172]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][173]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][174]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][175]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][176]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][177]\n\n[Legal Notice][178][Privacy Policy][179][Sitemap][180]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modul