g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Industries][122]\n* [Consumer Electronics][123]\n\n# Consumer Electronics\n\nWith deep expertise in lasers, JPT provides advanced optical calibration and inspection systems for\nelectronics. Combining optical design, vision algorithms, and motion control, we deliver\nintelligent, high-precision solutions that empower the industry.\n\n[c1_img03.jpg]\n* Optical Module Calibration\n* Intelligent Module Verification\n* Camera Module Calibration\n* AR/MR Optical Testing\n* LED/PD Testing\n* Precision Laser Processing\n* [\u5149\u5b66\u6a21\u7ec4\u6027\u80fd\u68c0\u6d4b\u4e0e\u6821\u51c6.jpg]\nOptical Module Calibration\n\nOptical modules are the core components enabling high-definition imaging and recognition in\nconsumer electronics. JPT offers a range of optical testing and calibration equipment, covering\nwavefront error detection, transmittance and reflectance measurement, color and haze analysis, and\nmore\u2014ensuring full-spectrum performance verification before shipment. Equipped with multi-angle\nincident light simulation, dual optical path measurement, and high-stability algorithms, our\nsystems meet the demanding imaging quality standards of high-end lenses and high-resolution\nmodules.\n* [\nHaze Tester\n][124]\n\n[Get Solution][125]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - \u667a\u80fd\u6a21\u7ec4\u6821\u51c6\u4e0e\u529f\u80fd\u9a8c\u8bc1.jpg]\nIntelligent Module Verification\n\nDuring the assembly and testing of consumer electronic modules such as facial recognition units,\ncameras, and AR/MR devices, JPT provides high-precision active alignment (AA) equipment and\nfunctional test platforms. Integrated with advanced vision algorithms and precision motion\ncontrol, our systems deliver consistent optical axis calibration, distortion detection, and\nfunctional verification\u2014significantly improving product consistency and end-user experience.\n\n[Get Solution][126]\n* [\u6444\u50cf\u5934\u6a21\u7ec4\u7cbe\u5bc6\u68c0\u6d4b\u4e0e\u6821\u51c6.jpg]\nCamera Module Calibration\n\nFocusing on full-process inspection of camera modules, JPT offers multi-dimensional calibration\nand vision inspection solutions widely applied in smartphones, laptops, and smart home devices.\nOur systems support AA calibration, transmittance/reflectance/haze/color consistency testing, and\nguarantee image clarity and accurate color reproduction. Combined with proprietary vision\nalgorithms and stable motion platforms, these solutions enable automated, high-yield, and\nintelligent quality control.\n* [\nHaze Tester\n][127]\n\n[Get Solution][128]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - AR/MR\u5149\u5b66\u6821\u51c6\u4e0e\u7578\u53d8\u68c0\u6d4b.jpg]\nAR/MR Optical Testing\n\nIn the rapidly growing AR/MR market, visual systems demand exceptional optical calibration and\ndistortion control. JPT\u2019s dual-eye module calibration systems feature sub-pixel accuracy to detect\nmisalignment and distortion with high efficiency. These automated solutions are widely used in\nAR/MR glasses, headsets, and other high-end wearable production lines, ensuring premium visual\nexperiences.\n\n[Get Solution][129]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - LED/PD\u6027\u80fd\u68c0\u6d4b\u4e0e\u667a\u80fd\u8bc6\u522b.jpg]\nLED/PD Testing\n\nFor LED and PD devices, performance stability is critical. JPT\u2019s dedicated testing platforms\nmeasure key parameters such as response time, linearity, and signal-to-noise ratio. These systems\nensure full-chain quality assurance from chip to module, serving applications in facial\nrecognition, under-display optical sensing, and Mini/Micro LED displays.\n\n[Get Solution][130]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - \u667a\u80fd\u7535\u5b50\u4ea7\u54c1\u6fc0\u5149\u7cbe\u5bc6\u52a0\u5de5.jpg]\nPrecision Laser Processing\n\nJPT integrates intelligent laser systems into smartphones, computers, and wearables for\nhigh-precision cutting, drilling, material removal, and marking. Applications include panel\ncutting, camera cover shaping, precision drilling, display glass ink removal, complex metal\nwelding, inner-glass engraving, and VR frame marking\u2014enabling advanced manufacturing for the next\ngeneration of smart devices.\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Laser\n][131]\n\n[Get Solution][132]\n* [\u5149\u5b66\u6a21\u7ec4\u6027\u80fd\u68c0\u6d4b\u4e0e\u6821\u51c6.jpg]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - \u667a\u80fd\u6a21\u7ec4\u6821\u51c6\u4e0e\u529f\u80fd\u9a8c\u8bc1.jpg]\n* [\u6444\u50cf\u5934\u6a21\u7ec4\u7cbe\u5bc6\u68c0\u6d4b\u4e0e\u6821\u51c6.jpg]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - AR/MR\u5149\u5b66\u6821\u51c6\u4e0e\u7578\u53d8\u68c0\u6d4b.jpg]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - LED/PD\u6027\u80fd\u68c0\u6d4b\u4e0e\u667a\u80fd\u8bc6\u522b.jpg]\n* [\u6d88\u8d39\u7535\u5b50\u9886\u57df - \u667a\u80fd\u7535\u5b50\u4ea7\u54c1\u6fc0\u5149\u7cbe\u5bc6\u52a0\u5de5.jpg]\n* [\n][133]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][134]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][135]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][136]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][137]\n* * [PRODUCTS][138]\n* [Optical Devices][139]\n* [Lasers][140]\n* [Core Modules][141]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][142]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][143]\n* [Industries][144]\n* [Applications][145]\n* * [SERVICES][146]\n* [Services & Supports][147]\n* [Locations][148]\n* [Q & A][149]\n* [Downloads][150]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][151]\n* [Annual Report][152]\n* [Special Report][153]\n* [Policies & Statements][154]\n* * [COMPANY][155]\n* [About Us][156]\n* [News & Events][157]\n* [Innovation][158]\n* [Honor][159]\n* [Join Us][160]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][161]\n* [HiPA][162]\n\nFollow U