g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Industries][122]\n* [Pan-Semiconductor][123]\n\n# Pan-Semiconductor\n\nJPT integrates core laser and automation technologies for wafer trimming, ceramic cutting, glass\ndrilling, and marking. Our high-performance lasers and intelligent equipment enhance precision,\nyield, and process consistency across MLCC, LTCC, and IC substrates.\n\n[\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.png]\n* Wafer Resistor Trimming\n* Ceramic Substrate Cutting\n* Wafer Laser Processing\n* Module Testing Applications\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u6676\u5706\u6fc0\u5149\u8c03\u963b.jpg]\nWafer Resistor Trimming\n\nIn semiconductor wafer testing and passive component tuning, precision resistor trimming is vital\nto product consistency and yield. JPT\u2019s proprietary wafer trimming systems integrate\nhigh-precision UV lasers, motion platforms, and measurement systems, supporting a broad resistance\nrange (100 m\u03a9 to 1 G\u03a9) with \u00b10.01% trimming accuracy. Featuring automatic wafer recognition, probe\npositioning, and pattern detection, these systems support multiple blade path types and wafer\nsizes (4\" to 8\"), ideal for ADC chips, power management ICs, RF chips, and resistor networks.\n* [\nLARK 355-3/5\n][124]\n* [\nSEAL 355-3/5\n][125]\n\n[Get Solution][126]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u9676\u74f7\u57fa\u677f\u6fc0\u5149\u5207\u5272.jpg]\nCeramic Substrate Cutting\n\nFor MLCC, LTCC, and other passive components, efficient and damage-free ceramic cutting is key to\nproduct performance and yield. JPT offers precision green- and UV-laser cutting solutions with\nminimal heat-affected zones and smooth, crack-free edges\u2014ideal for high-frequency, high-speed\ncircuit boards and 5G ceramic filters. Fully automated loading/unloading and vision positioning\nmodules enable high-volume, high-yield, cost-effective production.\n* [\nLaser Scriber\n][127]\n* [\nSEAL 532-7/10/20/30\n][128]\n* [\nSparrow-355/532\n][129]\n\n[Get Solution][130]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u6676\u5706\u6fc0\u5149\u52a0\u5de5\u8bbe\u5907.jpg]\nWafer Laser Processing\n\nJPT's wafer processing systems integrate self-developed lasers, galvanometers, and optical\nfocusing units, with flexible automation options to handle various incoming material formats and\nproduct sizes. High-precision vision positioning and multi-surface processing capabilities ensure\noptimal quality and consistency. Automated sorting and NG product recovery further improve\nproduction efficiency, making laser processing an essential step in modern wafer manufacturing.\n* [\nLaser Marking Equipment\n][131]\n\n[Get Solution][132]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u6a21\u7ec4\u68c0\u6d4b\u5e94\u7528.jpg]\nModule Testing Applications\n\nOur advanced module testing solutions cover silicon photonics, VCSEL inspection, and LED/PD\nperformance screening. Capable of high-throughput wafer-level scanning, these systems enable\nsimultaneous optical and electrical testing for silicon photonics chips and LiDAR modules. LED/PD\nplatforms support Mini/Micro LED uniformity checks and receiver linearity/SNR tests, while VCSEL\ntesters focus on optical parameters, thermal stability, and 3D sensing calibration\u2014serving\nconsumer electronics, automotive LiDAR, and industrial VCSEL applications.\n\n[Get Solution][133]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u6676\u5706\u6fc0\u5149\u8c03\u963b.jpg]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u9676\u74f7\u57fa\u677f\u6fc0\u5149\u5207\u5272.jpg]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u6676\u5706\u6fc0\u5149\u52a0\u5de5\u8bbe\u5907.jpg]\n* [\u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u9886\u57df - \u6cdb\u534a\u5bfc\u4f53\u6a21\u7ec4\u68c0\u6d4b\u5e94\u7528.jpg]\n* [\n][134]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][135]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][136]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][137]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][138]\n* * [PRODUCTS][139]\n* [Optical Devices][140]\n* [Lasers][141]\n* [Core Modules][142]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][143]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][144]\n* [Industries][145]\n* [Applications][146]\n* * [SERVICES][147]\n* [Services & Supports][148]\n* [Locations][149]\n* [Q & A][150]\n* [Downloads][151]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][152]\n* [Annual Report][153]\n* [Special Report][154]\n* [Policies & Statements][155]\n* * [COMPANY][156]\n* [About Us][157]\n* [News & Events][158]\n* [Innovation][159]\n* [Honor][160]\n* [Join Us][161]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][162]\n* [HiPA][163]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][164]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][165]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][166]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][167]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][168]\n\n[Legal Notice][169][Privacy Policy][170][Sitemap][171]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /solutions/industry\n[28]: /solutions/industry/optical-connection\n[29]: /solutions/industry/consumer-electronics\n[30]: /solutions/industry/pan-semiconductor\n[31]: /solutions/industry/new-energy-industry\n[32]: /solutions/industry\n[33]: /solutions/applications/laser-marking\n[34]: /solutions/applications/laser-welding\n[35]: /solutions/applications/laser-cutting\n[36]: /solutions/applications/laser-cleaning\n[37]: /solutions/applications/laser-cladding\n[38]: /solutions/applications/laser-drilling\n[39]: /solutions/applications\n[40]: /service/after-sales-service\n[41]: /service/after-sales-service\n[42]: /service/service-network\n[43]: /service/qa/general\n[44]: /service/download/product/lasers-downloads/mopa-fiber-lasers-downloads\n[45]: /sustainability\n[46]: /about/about-us\n[47]: /about/about-us\n[48]: /about/newsroom/company-news\n[49]: /about/innovation-and-technology\n[50]: /about/honor-and-news\n[51]: /about/join-us\n[52]: /\n[53]: https://www.jptoe.com\n[54]: https://jptjp.jp\n[55]: /contact-us\n[56]: /\n[57]: /contact-us\n[58]: /\n[59]: https://www.jptoe.com\n[60]: https://jptjp.jp\n[61]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[62]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[63]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[64]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[65]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[66]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[67]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[68]: /prod