            "text": "[ [a_img03.png] [a_img03.png] ][1]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n* [PRODUCTS][2]\n* [a-icon04.svg] [a-icon0401.svg]\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n* [aicon05.svg] [aicon0501.svg]\n\nLASERS\n* [aicon03.svg] [aicon0301.svg]\n\nCORE MODULES\n* [a-icon06.svg] [a-icon0601.svg]\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* * [\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\n][3]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\n][4]\n* [\n\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\n][5]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\n][6]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\n][7]\n* [\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\n][8]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\n][9]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][10]\n* * [\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\n][11]\n* [\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\n][12]\n* [\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\n][13]\n* [\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\n][14]\n* [\n\nDiode Lasers\n\n][15]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* * [\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\n][20]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][21]\n* * [\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nModule Tester\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\n][25]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][26]\n* [SOLUTIONS][27]\n* [a-icon07.svg] [a-icon0701.svg]\n\nIndustries\n* [a-icon08.svg] [a-icon0801.svg]\n\nApplication\n* * [\n\nOptical Connection\n\n][28]\n* [\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\n][29]\n* [\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\n][30]\n* [\n\nNew Energy\n\n][31]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nIndustry Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][32]\n* * [\n\nLaser Marking\n\n][33]\n* [\n\nLaser Welding\n\n][34]\n* [\n\nLaser Cutting\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Industries][122]\n* [New Energy][123]\n\n# New Energy\n\nFor batteries, JPT offers one-stop laser solutions from cell processing to PACK assembly. In\nphotovoltaics, our applications span glass drilling, cell cleaving, PERC hole drilling, PL\ninspection, and perovskite patterning\u2014driving efficient green energy manufacturing.\n\n[\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* Tab Cutting\n* Cell Assembly\n* PACK Assembly\n* Photovoltaic Cell Manufacturing\n* EV Motor Welding\n* [\u7535\u6c60\u6781\u8033\u5207\u5272.jpg]\nTab Cutting\n\nIn the early stages of battery manufacturing, the precision of tab cutting directly impacts\nwelding quality and cell performance. JPT's MOPA pulsed fiber laser-based tab cutting solutions\ndeliver high energy density, adjustable pulse widths, and burr-free cutting of both positive and\nnegative electrode materials. This fine, low-damage process improves welding consistency and\nbattery reliability, meeting high-safety, high-uniformity production standards.\n* [\nM7 Series\n][124]\n* [\nM8 Series\n][125]\n* [\nTab Cutting Module\n][126]\n\n[Get Solution][127]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a-\u5bc6\u5c01\u9489\u710a\u63a5.png]\nCell Assembly\n\nJPT provides stable, high-performance laser processing solutions for cell assembly processes,\nincluding tab welding, flexible connector welding, top cover sealing, and cleaning/welding of\nsealing pins. MOPA pulsed lasers are used for precision surface cleaning and structural\nstrengthening, while continuous fiber lasers enable deep penetration welding with high connection\nstrength. Integrated with intelligent automation modules, our solutions ensure high first-pass\nyield for both cylindrical and prismatic cells.\n* [\nBattery Sealing Welding Module\n][128]\n* [\nTab Cutting Module\n][129]\n* [\nM7 200-300W\n][130]\n* [\nCW Air Cooled 800-2000W\n][131]\n* [\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n][132]\n* [\nAOB Laser\n][133]\n\n[Get Solution][134]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a-\u7535\u6c60\u6a21\u7ec4.jpg]\nPACK Assembly\n\nFor PACK-level assembly, JPT offers faster, safer, and more reliable laser processing solutions.\nDifferent power-class lasers are applied for welding, cleaning, and texturing processes in module\nassembly, such as terminal welding, busbar welding, and enclosure seam welding. The resulting\nwelds are flat, splash-free, and highly consistent\u2014supporting large-scale, high-precision\nproduction while reducing costs and improving efficiency.\n* [\nMulti-mode Laser Cleaning Module\n][135]\n* [\nSingle-mode Laser Cleaning Module\n][136]\n* [\nCW Air Cooled 800-2000W\n][137]\n* [\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n][138]\n* [\nCL Water Cooled 500\u20131000W\n][139]\n* [\nAOB Laser\n][140]\n\n[Get Solution][141]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u9886\u57df-\u5149\u4f0f\u7535\u6c60\u5236\u5907.jpg]\nPhotovoltaic Cell Manufacturing\n\nIn the solar industry, JPT covers a wide range of applications, including photovoltaic glass\ndrilling, cell chip non-destructive cleaving, PERC laser hole drilling, PL inspection,\nphotovoltaic glass coding, wafer processing, and perovskite patterning.\n\nFor perovskite manufacturing, we offer complete solutions for P1 to P4 laser scribing and edge\ndeletion, enabling high-precision cutting and edge treatment to support large-scale production.\n* [\nM7 Series\n][142]\n* [\nM8 Series\n][143]\n* [\nCL Series\n][144]\n* [\nGR Series\n][145]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][146]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][147]\n\n[Get Solution][148]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a-\u7535\u673a\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\nEV Motor Welding\n\nFor electric drive systems, motor welding demands exceptional reliability and efficiency. JPT\u2019s\ncustom-developed laser welding solutions\u2014integrating continuous fiber lasers and MOPA pulsed\nlasers\u2014deliver splash-free, high-seal-strength welds with strong mechanical bonding. Featuring CCD\nvisual monitoring, three-axis motion control, and intelligent parameter adjustment, our motor\nwelding modules significantly enhance assembly efficiency, safety, and yield for hairpin and other\nEV motor types.\n* [\nHairpin Motor Laser Welding Module\n][149]\n* [\nOCT Penetration Online Detection System\n][150]\n* [\nCW Air Cooled 800-2000W\n][151]\n* [\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n][152]\n* [\nAOB Laser\n][153]\n\n[Get Solution][154]\n* [\u7535\u6c60\u6781\u8033\u5207\u5272.jpg]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a-\u5bc6\u5c01\u9489\u710a\u63a5.png]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a-\u7535\u6c60\u6a21\u7ec4.jpg]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u9886\u57df-\u5149\u4f0f\u7535\u6c60\u5236\u5907.jpg]\n* [\u65b0\u80fd\u6e90\u884c\u4e1a-\u7535\u673a\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* [\n][155]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][156]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][157]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][158]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][159]\n* * [PRODUCTS][160]\n* [Optical Devices][161]\n* [Lasers][162]\n* [Core Modules][163]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][164]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][165]\n* [Industries][166]\n* [Applications][167]\n* * [SERVICES][168]\n* [Services & Supports][169]\n* [Locations][170]\n* [Q & A][171]\n* [Downloads][172]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][173]\n* [Annual Report][174]\n* [Special Report][175]\n* [Policies & Statements][176]\n* * [COMPANY][177]\n* [About Us][178]\n* [News & Events][179]\n* [Innovation][180]\n* [Honor][181]\n* [Join Us][182]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][183]\n* [HiPA][184]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][185]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][186]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][187]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][188]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][189]\n\n[Legal Notice][190][Privacy Policy][191][Sitemap][192]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /solutions/industry\n[28]: /solutions/industry/optical-connection\n[29]: /solutions/industry/consumer-electronics\n[30]: /solutions/industry/pan-semiconductor\n[31]: /solutions/industry/new-energy-industry\n[32]: /solutions/industry\n[33]: /solutions/applications/laser-marking\n[34]: /solutions/applications/laser-welding\n[35]: /solutions/applications/laser-cutting\n[36]: /solutions/applications/laser-cleaning\n[37]: /solutions/applications/laser-cladding\n[38]: /solutions/applications/laser-drilling\n[39]: /solutions/applications\n[40]: /service/after-sales-service\n[41]: /service/after-sales-service\n[42]: /service/service-network\n[43]: /service/qa/general\n[44]: