            "text": "[ [a_img03.png] [a_img03.png] ][1]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n* [PRODUCTS][2]\n* [a-icon04.svg] [a-icon0401.svg]\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n* [aicon05.svg] [aicon0501.svg]\n\nLASERS\n* [aicon03.svg] [aicon0301.svg]\n\nCORE MODULES\n* [a-icon06.svg] [a-icon0601.svg]\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* * [\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\n][3]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\n][4]\n* [\n\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\n][5]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\n][6]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\n][7]\n* [\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\n][8]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\n][9]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][10]\n* * [\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\n][11]\n* [\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\n][12]\n* [\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\n][13]\n* [\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\n][14]\n* [\n\nDiode Lasers\n\n][15]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* * [\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\n][20]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][21]\n* * [\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nModule Tester\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\n][25]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][26]\n* [SOLUTIONS][27]\n* [a-icon07.svg] [a-icon0701.svg]\n\nIndustries\n* [a-icon08.svg] [a-icon0801.svg]\n\nApplication\n* * [\n\nOptical Connection\n\n][28]\n* [\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\n][29]\n* [\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\n][30]\n* [\n\nNew Energy\n\n][31]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nIndustry Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][32]\n* * [\n\nLaser Marking\n\n][33]\n* [\n\nLaser Welding\n\n][34]\n* [\n\nLaser Cutting\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n* [Laser Marking][123]\n\n# Laser Marking\n\nJPT's laser marking solutions, powered by our self-developed high-performance MOPA pulsed fiber\nlasers and proprietary optical technologies, deliver non-contact processing with exceptional\nprecision, ultra-high speed, and permanent marking capability. Widely adopted across global high-end\nmanufacturing sectors\u2014including 3C electronics, automotive components, and medical device\nproduction\u2014our systems support a wide range of materials such as metals, plastics, and ceramics,\nenabling efficient marking of QR codes, logos, serial numbers, and more.\n\n[\u6770\u666e\u7279\u6fc0\u5149\u6253\u6807.jpg]\n* Anodized Aluminum Black Marking\n* Plastic Marking\n* Stainless Steel Color Marking\n* Anodized Aluminum Bright Finishing\n* Deep Engraving on Frame Steel\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u6c27\u5316\u94dd\u6253\u9ed1.png]\nAnodized Aluminum Black Marking\n\nJPT\u2019s anodized aluminum black marking solution is built on advanced laser technology and the\nnanosecond effect, using high-energy-density laser irradiation to induce physical changes on the\naluminum oxide surface, creating high-contrast, permanent black markings. This technology is\nwidely applied to high-end marking in sectors such as 3C electronics housings, precision machinery\nnameplates, medical device serial numbers, and anti-counterfeiting QR codes\u2014offering permanent\nidentification, strong anti-forgery capability, high precision, and efficient production for brand\nprotection and product traceability.\n* [\nM7 20-100W\n][124]\n* [\nM7 200-300W\n][125]\n* [\nM7 500-1000W\n][126]\n\n[Get Solution][127]\n* [\u5851\u6599\u6807\u8bc6.png]\nPlastic Marking\n\nJPT\u2019s plastic marking solutions leverage the high energy and precise control of laser technology\nto quickly ablate or discolor the surface of plastic materials, forming clear, high-quality\nmarkings. Using short-pulse, high-peak-power lasers, the process targets only the top layer of the\nplastic, preventing excessive heat damage and ensuring sharp, well-defined edges.\n\nJPT\u2019s plastic marking is widely used for branding logos and product parameter markings on plastic\nitems. It delivers vivid colors, strong adhesion, and high processing efficiency, meeting diverse\nand customized plastic marking requirements.\n* [\nM7 20-100W\n][128]\n* [\nM7 200-300W\n][129]\n* [\nM7 500-1000W\n][130]\n* [\nLARK 355-3/5\n][131]\n* [\nSEAL 355-3/5\n][132]\n* [\nSEAL355-10/15/20/30\n][133]\n\n[Get Solution][134]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u4e0d\u9508\u94a2\u6253\u5f69.png]\nStainless Steel Color Marking\n\nJPT\u2019s stainless steel color marking technology is based on the interaction between laser beams and\nstainless steel surfaces. By precisely controlling laser energy density, pulse frequency, and\nscanning speed, the process induces oxidation reactions on the stainless steel surface, forming\noxide films of varying thickness to produce vibrant, multi-colored effects.\n\nThe equipment is equipped with high-stability fiber lasers and high-precision galvanometer\nscanning systems, ensuring uniform and long-lasting color marking results. Commonly used in\nhigh-end decoration, kitchenware, and crafts, this technology adds distinctive aesthetic appeal\nand high added value to stainless steel products.\n* [\nM7 20-100W\n][135]\n* [\nM7 200-300W\n][136]\n* [\nM7 500-1000W\n][137]\n\n[Get Solution][138]\n* [\u6c27\u5316\u94dd\u6fc0\u5149\u6253\u4eae.png]\nAnodized Aluminum Bright Finishing\n\nJPT\u2019s anodized aluminum bright finishing technology leverages the precision of laser\nmicroprocessing to perform high-accuracy surface treatment on anodized aluminum. By optimizing\nlaser parameters, the process removes minor defects and uneven areas while inducing\nmicrostructural changes in the surface layer, enhancing reflectivity and achieving a high-gloss\nmirror finish.\n\nEquipped with high-performance lasers and advanced optical focusing systems, this solution ensures\nhigh processing efficiency and superior surface quality. It is ideal for applications requiring\nexceptional surface smoothness, such as 3C product housings and decorative materials, enhancing\nboth the visual appeal and perceived value of the final product.\n* [\nM7 20-100W\n][139]\n* [\nM7 200-300W\n][140]\n* [\nM7 500-1000W\n][141]\n\n[Get Solution][142]\n* [\u8f66\u67b6\u53f7\u6df1\u96d5.png]\nDeep Engraving on Frame Steel\n\nJPT\u2019s deep engraving technology for frame steel utilizes high-power laser systems to precisely and\ndeeply etch patterns, text, or identification marks into steel frame materials. With superior beam\nquality and stable energy output, combined with advanced engraving path algorithms, the process\nensures controlled depth, smooth edges, and minimal thermal deformation.\n\nThis solution is widely applied to branding and customization for bicycle, motorcycle, and\nautomotive frames, delivering durable, high-precision engravings that enhance both product\nidentity and aesthetic value.\n* [\nM7 20-100W\n][143]\n* [\nM7 200-300W\n][144]\n* [\nM7 500-1000W\n][145]\n\n[Get Solution][146]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u6c27\u5316\u94dd\u6253\u9ed1.png]\n* [\u5851\u6599\u6807\u8bc6.png]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u4e0d\u9508\u94a2\u6253\u5f69.png]\n* [\u6c27\u5316\u94dd\u6fc0\u5149\u6253\u4eae.png]\n* [\u8f66\u67b6\u53f7\u6df1\u96d5.png]\n* [\n][147]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][148]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][149]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][150]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][151]\n* * [PRODUCTS][152]\n* [Optical Devices][153]\n* [Lasers][154]\n* [Core Modules][155]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][156]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][157]\n* [Industries][158]\n* [Applications][159]\n* * [SERVICES][160]\n* [Services & Supports][161]\n* [Locations][162]\n* [Q & A][163]\n* [Downloads][164]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][165]\n* [Annual Report][166]\n* [Special Report][167]\n* [Policies & Statements][168]\n* * [COMPANY][169]\n* [About Us][170]\n* [News & Events][171]\n* [Innovation][172]\n* [Honor][173]\n* [Join Us][174]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][175]\n* [HiPA][176]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][177]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][178]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][179]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][180]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][181]\n\n[Legal Notice][182][Privacy Policy][183][Sitemap][184]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solut