            "text": "[ [a_img03.png] [a_img03.png] ][1]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n* [PRODUCTS][2]\n* [a-icon04.svg] [a-icon0401.svg]\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n* [aicon05.svg] [aicon0501.svg]\n\nLASERS\n* [aicon03.svg] [aicon0301.svg]\n\nCORE MODULES\n* [a-icon06.svg] [a-icon0601.svg]\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* * [\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\n][3]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\n][4]\n* [\n\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\n][5]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\n][6]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\n][7]\n* [\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\n][8]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\n][9]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][10]\n* * [\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\n][11]\n* [\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\n][12]\n* [\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\n][13]\n* [\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\n][14]\n* [\n\nDiode Lasers\n\n][15]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* * [\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\n][20]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][21]\n* * [\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nModule Tester\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\n][25]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][26]\n* [SOLUTIONS][27]\n* [a-icon07.svg] [a-icon0701.svg]\n\nIndustries\n* [a-icon08.svg] [a-icon0801.svg]\n\nApplication\n* * [\n\nOptical Connection\n\n][28]\n* [\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\n][29]\n* [\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\n][30]\n* [\n\nNew Energy\n\n][31]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nIndustry Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][32]\n* * [\n\nLaser Marking\n\n][33]\n* [\n\nLaser Welding\n\n][34]\n* [\n\nLaser Cutting\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n* [Laser Welding][123]\n\n# Laser Welding\n\nJPT's laser welding solutions, powered by our self-developed high-power continuous fiber lasers and\nprecision optical control technologies, offer deep penetration, narrow weld seams, low heat input,\nand minimal distortion\u2014making them ideal for high-precision, high-speed welding applications such as\nnew energy manufacturing, automotive components, and precision electronics, covering applications\nincluding power battery casing welding, copper tab welding, cover sealing, and modular metal\nstructure welding.\n\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u710a\u63a5\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n* Metal Welding\n* Lithium Battery Welding\n* Silicon Steel Welding\n* Copper Welding\n* Cap Plate, Busbar, and Tab Welding\n* Plastic Welding\n* [\u91d1\u5c5e\u710a\u63a5.jpg]\nMetal Welding\n\nJPT\u2019s metal welding technology uses heat, pressure, or both to create strong atomic or molecular\nbonds at the joint, delivering high-strength, permanent structural connections. It is widely\napplied in manufacturing, construction, automotive, and aerospace industries\u2014particularly for\nbridge steel structures, high-speed train carriages, and aircraft engine components where weld\nquality and structural safety are critical. With advanced laser welding processes and equipment,\nJPT ensures consistent strength, improved efficiency, and reduced manufacturing costs.\n* [\nM7 Series\n][124]\n* [\nAOB (Adjustable Output Beam) Laser\n][125]\n\n[Get Solution][126]\n* [\u9502\u7535\u6c60\u710a\u63a5.png]\nLithium Battery Welding\n\nJPT\u2019s lithium battery welding technology uses high-energy laser beams to deliver efficient,\nprecise, and non-contact connections, serving as a critical process in cell manufacturing and\nassembly. It directly impacts battery performance, safety, and lifespan. Widely applied in tab\nwelding, casing sealing, and module/PACK assembly, the process produces smooth welds with minimal\nheat-affected zones and high joint strength\u2014improving production efficiency and product\nconsistency to meet the demanding standards of new energy battery manufacturing.\n* [\nCW Air Cooled 800-2000W\n][127]\n* [\nAOB Laser\n][128]\n\n[Get Solution][129]\n* [\u7845\u94a2\u7247\u710a\u63a5.png]\nSilicon Steel Welding\n\nJPT\u2019s silicon steel laser welding technology uses high-energy laser beams as a heat source to\nachieve efficient, precise, and low-deformation joining of silicon steel sheets. It is widely\napplied in the core manufacturing of motors, transformers, and other electromagnetic equipment.\nThe process is designed to maintain mechanical strength while optimizing electromagnetic\nperformance and minimizing thermal impact. With stable beam quality and precise heat input\ncontrol, JPT\u2019s welding solutions deliver exceptional consistency and efficiency, meeting the\nstringent requirements of high-end electromagnetic equipment manufacturing.\n* [\nCW Cabinet 6-20kW\n][130]\n* [\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n][131]\n\n[Get Solution][132]\n* [\u7d2b\u94dc\u710a\u63a5.png]\nCopper Welding\n\nJPT's copper laser welding technology addresses the material\u2019s exceptional electrical\nconductivity, thermal conductivity, and ductility to deliver high-quality joints for applications\nin electronics, power, and refrigeration. Due to copper\u2019s high reflectivity\u2014especially to infrared\nlasers\u2014and high thermal conductivity, it is one of the most challenging materials to weld with\nlasers. By optimizing beam profiles, energy coupling, and welding parameters, JPT achieves uniform\nweld formation, high joint strength, and minimal thermal impact, making it ideal for high-end\nmanufacturing in new energy batteries, power equipment, electronic packaging, and cooling systems.\n* [\nAOB Laser\n][133]\n\n[Get Solution][134]\n* [\u76d6\u677f\u710a\u63a5.png]\nCap Plate, Busbar, and Tab Welding\n\nJPT offers high-precision laser welding solutions for cap plates, busbars, and tabs to meet the\ndemanding requirements of power battery assembly. The cap plate is the top seal of prismatic or\ncylindrical cells, typically made of aluminum, stainless steel, or composite materials. The busbar\nconnects internal electrodes to external circuits and requires ultrasonic welding to the coated\narea, while tab welding firmly joins the cell\u2019s metal lead to the cap plate or busbar. By\noptimizing beam control and heat input, JPT ensures smooth weld seams, minimal thermal impact, and\nhigh joint strength\u2014improving battery safety and production consistency.\n* [\nAOB Laser\n][135]\n\n[Get Solution][136]\n* [\u5851\u6599\u710a\u63a5.png]\nPlastic Welding\n\nJPT\u2019s plastic welding technology uses heat, pressure, or both to melt and solidify the joint\nbetween plastic components, creating strong, permanent bonds without adhesives. Suitable for a\nwide range of thermoplastics, the process ensures secure sealing, uniform weld seams, and a clean\nfinish. With precise heat input control and stable processing performance, JPT\u2019s solutions\nminimize heat damage and deformation. Plastic welding is widely applied in automotive interiors,\nelectronic housings, medical devices, and packaging containers, providing efficient and reliable\nnon-metallic joining solutions.\n* [\nLARK 355-3/5\n][137]\n* [\nSEAL 355-3/5\n][138]\n* [\nSEAL355-10/15/20/30\n][139]\n* [\nThulium-Doped Fiber Laser\n][140]\n* [\nSparrow-355/532\n][141]\n\n[Get Solution][142]\n* [\u91d1\u5c5e\u710a\u63a5.jpg]\n* [\u9502\u7535\u6c60\u710a\u63a5.png]\n* [\u7845\u94a2\u7247\u710a\u63a5.png]\n* [\u7d2b\u94dc\u710a\u63a5.png]\n* [\u76d6\u677f\u710a\u63a5.png]\n* [\u5851\u6599\u710a\u63a5.png]\n* [\n][143]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][144]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][145]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][146]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][147]\n* * [PRODUCTS][148]\n* [Optical Devices][149]\n* [Lasers][150]\n* [Core Modules][151]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][152]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][153]\n* [Industries][154]\n* [Applications][155]\n* * [SERVICES][156]\n* [Services & Supports][157]\n* [Locations][158]\n* [Q & A][159]\n* [Downloads][160]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][161]\n* [Annual Report][162]\n* [Special Report][163]\n* [Policies & Statements][164]\n* * [COMPANY][165]\n* [About Us][166]\n* [News & Events][167]\n* [Innovation][168]\n* [Honor][169]\n* [Join Us][170]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][171]\n* [HiPA][172]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][173]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][174]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][175]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][176]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][177]\n\n[Legal Notice][178][Privacy Policy][179][Sitemap][180]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /solutions/industry\n[28]: /solutions/industry/optical-connection\n[29]: /solutions/industry/consumer-electronics\n[30]: /solutions/industry/pan-semiconductor\n[31]: /solutions/industry/new-energy-industry\n[32]: /solutions/industry\n[33]: /solutions/applications/laser-marking\n[34]: /solutions/applications/laser-welding\n[35]: /solutions/applications/laser-cutting\n[36]: /solutions/applications/laser-cleaning\n[37]: /solutions/applications/laser-cladding\n[38]: /solutions/applications/laser-drilling\n[39]: /solutions/applications\n[40]: /service/after-sales-service\n[41]: /service/after-sales-service\n[42]: /service/service-network\n[43]: /service/qa/general\n[44]: /service/download/product/lasers-downloads/mopa-fiber-lasers-downloads\n[45]: /sustainability\n[46]: /about/abou"
