g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n* [Laser Cutting][123]\n\n# Laser Cutting\n\nJPT\u2019s laser cutting solutions, powered by our self-developed high-energy-density lasers and\nprecision optical control systems, enable high-accuracy thermal cutting across a variety of\nmaterials. Delivering narrow kerfs, clean edges, and minimal heat-affected zones, these solutions\nensure superior quality in every cut. Applicable to metals, power battery materials, flexible\nprinted circuits (FPC), ceramics, and more, JPT laser cutting technology delivers outstanding\nefficiency and consistency in sectors such as new energy manufacturing, precision electronics, and\nsemiconductor device production.\n\n[\u603bJPT\u5207\u5272(1)(1).jpg]\n* Optical Resin Cutting\n* Carbon Steel Cutting\n* High-Reflective Material Cutting\n* Thick Stainless Steel Cutting\n* Flexible Material Cutting\n* Metal Resistor Cutting\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u5207\u5272.jpg]\nOptical Resin Cutting\n\nJPT\u2019s optical resin cutting technology uses a high-power-density laser beam to instantly vaporize\nresin lens gate material, producing precise and smooth kerfs. Unlike traditional mechanical or\nmanual cutting, this process eliminates burrs and chipping, ensuring flawless lens surfaces and\nsignificantly enhancing both appearance and optical performance. It is especially suited for\nmanufacturing 3C products such as smartphone camera lenses, delivering exceptional cutting\naccuracy, edge quality, and production efficiency while ensuring consistent quality\u2014meeting the\nstringent requirements of high-end optical component manufacturing.\n* [\nSEAL 355 Series\n][124]\n* [\nSEAL 532-7/10/20/30\n][125]\n* [\nThulium-Doped Fiber Laser\n][126]\n\n[Get Solution][127]\n* [\u78b3\u94a2\u5207\u5272.png]\nCarbon Steel Cutting\n\nJPT\u2019s carbon steel cutting technology uses high-power laser beams as a heat source to melt,\nvaporize, or ablate carbon steel plates, while high-pressure assist gas (typically oxygen or\nnitrogen) removes molten material to achieve precise separation and shaping. Offering high peak\npower, excellent efficiency, and strong reliability, this process is ideal for thick plate\ncutting, complex contour processing, and other high-power applications. With stable beam quality\nand flexible parameter configurations, JPT\u2019s carbon steel cutting is widely applied in industrial\nmanufacturing, metalworking, and additive manufacturing, delivering high-quality and consistent\ncutting results.\n* [\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n][128]\n* [\nCW Cabinet 6-20kW\n][129]\n\n[Get Solution][130]\n* [\u9ad8\u53cd\u6750\u6599\u5207\u5272.jpg]\nHigh-Reflective Material Cutting\n\nJPT's high-reflective material cutting technology is specifically engineered for metals such as\ncopper, aluminum, and gold with high reflectivity. By optimizing laser design and process\nparameters, it effectively addresses challenges such as high laser energy reflection and potential\nequipment damage, achieving stable, efficient, and precise cutting performance. This process\novercomes traditional cutting limitations, delivering high accuracy, high productivity, and\nexceptional stability, making it ideal for applications requiring strict quality and consistency.\nWith advanced beam control and cooling systems, JPT\u2019s high-reflective material cutting is widely\nused in new energy, precision manufacturing, and electronics processing, providing high-quality\nand reliable cutting solutions.\n* [\nCW Rack 500-6000W\n][131]\n* [\nCW Cabinet 6-20kW\n][132]\n* [\nFL-GR Series\n][133]\n\n[Get Solution][134]\n* [Thick Stainless Steel Cutting.png]\nThick Stainless Steel Cutting\n\nJPT\u2019s thick stainless steel cutting technology leverages multi-kilowatt high-power lasers (6 kW\nand above, typically 12\u201330 kW) to deliver efficient fusion cutting for stainless steel plates with\nthicknesses of 12 mm or more. The process utilizes an ultra-high energy density laser beam to\nrapidly melt the material, combined with high-pressure assist gases (nitrogen/oxygen) to\neffectively remove molten metal, achieving smooth kerfs and precise separation. Compared to\ntraditional cutting methods, this technology offers narrower cuts, minimal heat-affected zones,\nand superior surface finish, significantly improving production efficiency and product quality. It\nis widely used in heavy equipment manufacturing, structural steel fabrication, shipbuilding, and\nhigh-end stainless steel product processing.\n* [\nCW Cabinet 6-20kW\n][135]\n\n[Get Solution][136]\n* [Flexible Material Cutting.png]\nFlexible Material Cutting\n\nJPT flexible material cutting utilizes high-energy-density laser beams (UV, green, or fiber) for\nnon-contact precision machining of flexible, easily deformed non-metal and thin-metal materials.\nUsing thermal effects or photochemical decomposition, it achieves clean separation, ideal for\ncomplex contour cutting of FPC boards, films, and rubber. The UV laser spot can be focused to 20\n\u03bcm, with edge verticality error under 0.5\u00b0, ensuring burr-free, residue-free cuts that prevent\ncircuit shorting. This technology combines high precision, low thermal impact, and processing\nflexibility, serving electronics manufacturing, flexible displays, and more.\n* [\nLARK 355-3/5\n][137]\n* [\nSEAL 355-3/5\n][138]\n* [\nSEAL355-10/15/20/30\n][139]\n* [\nSEAL 532-7/10/20/30\n][140]\n* [\nSparrow-355/532\n][141]\n\n[Get Solution][142]\n* [\u91d1\u5c5e\u7535\u963b\u5207\u5272.jpg]\nMetal Resistor Cutting\n\nJPT metal resistor cutting uses a non-contact, ultra-precise, and minimal heat-affected process to\naccurately set and fine-tune resistance values while preserving the material\u2019s conductivity and\nstability. This technique delivers ultra-high precision, ultra-low temperature coefficients, and\nexcellent long-term stability and reliability, making it ideal for producing high-performance\nresistors used in aerospace, medical devices, precision instruments, and test and measurement\nequipment, ensuring consistent performance and quality.\n* [\nLARK 355-3/5\n][143]\n* [\nSEAL 355-3/5\n][144]\n\n[Get Solution][145]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u5207\u5272.jpg]\n* [\u78b3\u94a2\u5207\u5272.png]\n* [\u9ad8\u53cd\u6750\u6599\u5207\u5272.jpg]\n* [Thick Stainless Steel Cutting.png]\n* [Flexible Material Cutting.png]\n* [\u91d1\u5c5e\u7535\u963b\u5207\u5272.jpg]\n* [\n][146]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][147]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][148]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][149]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][150]\n* * [PRODUCTS][151]\n* [Optical Devices][152]\n* [Lasers][153]\n* [Core Modules][154]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][155]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][156]\n* [Industries][157]\n* [Applications][158]\n* * [SERVICES][159]\n* [Services & Supports][160]\n* [Locations][161]\n* [Q & A][162]\n* [Downloads][163]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][164]\n* [Annual Report][165]\n* [Special Report][166]\n* [Policies & Statements][167]\n* * [COMPANY][168]\n* [About Us][169]\n* [News & Events][170]\n* [Innovation][171]\n* [Honor][172]\n* [Join Us][173]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][174]\n* [HiPA][175]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][176]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][177]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][178]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][179]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][180]\n\n[Legal Notice][181][Privacy Policy][182][Sitemap][183]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27"
