g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n* [Laser Cleaning][123]\n\n# Laser Cleaning\n\nJPT's laser cleaning solutions precisely target workpiece surfaces to instantly vaporize or remove\noil, rust, coatings, and oxides\u2014delivering high-efficiency, eco-friendly, non-contact cleaning.\nIdeal for applications such as metal component refurbishment, mold maintenance, and coating\npretreatment, this technology not only removes contaminants effectively but also preserves the\nstructural integrity of the base material, extending the service life of both equipment and\nworkpieces. With flexible process configurations and stable performance, JPT laser cleaning provides\ngreen, efficient surface treatment solutions for industries including new energy, automotive\nmanufacturing, and precision engineering.\n\n[\u6770\u666e\u7279\u6fc0\u5149\u6e05\u6d17\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.png]\n* Laser Rust Removal\n* Mold Surface Cleaning\n* Laser Paint Removal\n* Laser Surface Texturing\n* Oil Stain Removal\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u9664\u9508.png]\nLaser Rust Removal\n\nJPT\u2019s laser rust removal technology uses high-energy-density pulsed lasers to instantly strip\noxide scales and rust from metal surfaces without chemicals or abrasives, ensuring zero substrate\ndamage. Compared with traditional pickling or sandblasting, this solution offers eco-friendliness,\nhigh efficiency, and low maintenance. It is especially suitable for corrosion protection and\nrefurbishment of large metal structures such as ships, bridges, and pipelines, significantly\nextending service life and reducing secondary processing costs.\n\n[Get Solution][124]\n* [\u8f6e\u80ce\u6e05\u6d17.png]\nMold Surface Cleaning\n\nJPT\u2019s mold surface cleaning solution uses non-contact, high-precision laser cleaning to\nefficiently remove release agent residues, carbon deposits, and fine particles from mold surfaces,\navoiding dimensional accuracy loss caused by traditional grinding. This technology supports\ncomplex curves and intricate structures, significantly improving product yield, reducing downtime,\nand extending mold service life. It is widely applied in the maintenance and refurbishment of\nplastic, die-casting, and rubber molds.\n\n[Get Solution][125]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u9664\u6f06.jpg]\nLaser Paint Removal\n\nJPT\u2019s laser paint removal technology uses a high-energy-density laser beam to achieve selective\nlayer stripping, precisely removing coatings such as paint and plating from metal or composite\nsurfaces while controlling depth to the micron level, ensuring zero damage to the substrate. With\nits high precision, efficiency, and eco-friendly non-contact process, it is widely used in\naircraft skin maintenance, automotive part refurbishment, and high-end equipment surface\ntreatment, significantly improving repair quality and productivity.\n\n[Get Solution][126]\n* [\u58f3\u4f53\u6bdb\u5316.png]\nLaser Surface Texturing\n\nJPT\u2019s laser surface texturing technology uses a high-energy-density laser beam to create\ncontrolled micro-pore structures on the workpiece surface, significantly enhancing adhesion for\ncoatings and bonding processes. Compared to traditional sandblasting or phosphating, it is\ndust-free, eco-friendly, and offers high precision with excellent controllability. It is ideal for\nindustries such as automotive and aerospace where superior coating adhesion and surface treatment\nquality are essential, making it an advanced alternative to conventional roughening methods.\n\n[Get Solution][127]\n* [\u9664\u6cb9\u819c.png]\nOil Stain Removal\n\nJPT\u2019s oil stain removal technology employs a high-energy-density laser beam to instantly vaporize\noils, lubricants, and residues, achieving industrial-grade cleanliness through non-contact surface\ntreatment. This eco-friendly process avoids chemical solvent pollution and prevents secondary\ndamage to precision components. It is widely used for the maintenance and manufacturing of engine\nparts, bearings, gears, and other high-precision mechanical components, ensuring long-term\noperational stability.\n\n[Get Solution][128]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u9664\u9508.png]\n* [\u8f6e\u80ce\u6e05\u6d17.png]\n* [\u6fc0\u5149\u9664\u6f06.jpg]\n* [\u58f3\u4f53\u6bdb\u5316.png]\n* [\u9664\u6cb9\u819c.png]\n* [\n][129]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][130]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][131]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][132]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][133]\n* * [PRODUCTS][134]\n* [Optical Devices][135]\n* [Lasers][136]\n* [Core Modules][137]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][138]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][139]\n* [Industries][140]\n* [Applications][141]\n* * [SERVICES][142]\n* [Services & Supports][143]\n* [Locations][144]\n* [Q & A][145]\n* [Downloads][146]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][147]\n* [Annual Report][148]\n* [Special Report][149]\n* [Policies & Statements][150]\n* * [COMPANY][151]\n* [About Us][152]\n* [News & Events][153]\n* [Innovation][154]\n* [Honor][155]\n* [Join Us][156]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][157]\n* [HiPA][158]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][159]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][160]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][161]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][162]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][163]\n\n[Legal Notice][164][Privacy Policy][165][Sitemap][166]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-se