g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n* [Laser Cladding][123]\n\n# Laser Cladding\n\nJPT\u2019s laser cladding technology is a high-performance surface modification process that uses\nhigh-energy lasers to fuse alloy powders onto metal substrates, forming dense, high-adhesion\ncoatings. This process significantly improves wear resistance, corrosion resistance, and fatigue\nstrength, extending component lifespan. It is widely applied in mold repair, automotive parts\nremanufacturing, and industrial equipment maintenance. With precise process control and stable\nperformance, JPT laser cladding delivers high-quality, cost-effective surface enhancement and repair\nsolutions.\n\n[11.jpg]\n* Brake Disc Laser Cladding\n* [\u5239\u8f66\u76d8\u6fc0\u5149\u7194\u8986.jpg]\nBrake Disc Laser Cladding\n\nJPT\u2019s brake disc laser cladding is an efficient surface repair and strengthening technology. It\nuses a high-energy-density laser beam to clad wear- and heat-resistant alloy materials onto the\ndisc surface, forming a dense metallurgically bonded coating. This process significantly improves\nwear resistance, thermal stability, and crack resistance, extending service life and restoring\nsurfaces damaged by friction. It is widely used in rail transit, high-end automobiles, and heavy\nmachinery braking systems, ensuring both performance enhancement and cost efficiency.\n* [\nCW Cabinet 6-20kW\n][124]\n* [\nDirect Semiconductor Laser\n][125]\n\n[Get Solution][126]\n* [\u5239\u8f66\u76d8\u6fc0\u5149\u7194\u8986.jpg]\n* [\n][127]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][128]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][129]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][130]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][131]\n* * [PRODUCTS][132]\n* [Optical Devices][133]\n* [Lasers][134]\n* [Core Modules][135]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][136]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][137]\n* [Industries][138]\n* [Applications][139]\n* * [SERVICES][140]\n* [Services & Supports][141]\n* [Locations][142]\n* [Q & A][143]\n* [Downloads][144]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][145]\n* [Annual Report][146]\n* [Special Report][147]\n* [Policies & Statements][148]\n* * [COMPANY][149]\n* [About Us][150]\n* [News & Events][151]\n* [Innovation][152]\n* [Honor][153]\n* [Join Us][154]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][155]\n* [HiPA][156]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][157]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][158]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][159]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][160]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][161]\n\n[Legal Notice][162][Privacy Policy][163][Sitemap][164]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelli