g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n* [Laser Drilling][123]\n\n# Laser Drilling\n\nJPT's laser drilling technology is an advanced non-contact microfabrication process that uses\nhigh-energy laser beams to precisely create micro-holes, through-holes, or custom-shaped holes on or\nwithin material surfaces. By leveraging the interaction between the laser and the material\u2014such as\nmelting, vaporization, or photochemical decomposition\u2014this process achieves highly efficient\nmaterial removal. Offering high precision, high efficiency, and zero mechanical stress, it is\nsuitable for processing metals, ceramics, glass, films, and more, with wide applications in\nelectronics manufacturing, aerospace, medical devices, and new energy industries.\n\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u6253\u5b54\u9875\u9762\u56fe.jpg]\n* Foil Perforation\n* Glass Drilling\n* Metal Drilling\n* Ceramic Drilling\n* [\u9521\u7b94\u5207\u5b54.png]\nFoil Perforation\n\nJPT foil perforation technology uses a high-energy-density laser to interact with foil materials\nthrough melting, vaporization, or plasma ablation, achieving highly precise micro-holes without\ndeformation. This process is especially suited for flexible, ultra-thin, and fragile foils,\noffering non-contact, high-efficiency, and stable performance, with broad applications in\nelectronics packaging, precision sensors, and new energy battery manufacturing.\n* [\nM7 Series\n][124]\n* [\nM8 Series\n][125]\n\n[Get Solution][126]\n* [\u73bb\u7483\u6253\u5b54.png]\nGlass Drilling\n\nJPT glass drilling technology uses non-contact laser melting, vaporization, or photothermal\nmodification to achieve high-precision micro-holes without cracks or chipping. Unlike traditional\nmechanical drilling, this process prevents brittle amorphous glass (such as quartz, borosilicate,\nand sapphire glass) from fracturing due to stress. It delivers high efficiency, stability, and\ncompatibility with various thicknesses, making it ideal for optical components, electronic\ndisplays, and precision instrument manufacturing.\n* [\nM8 Series\n][127]\n* [\nGR Series\n][128]\n\n[Get Solution][129]\n* [\u91d1\u5c5e\u6253\u5b54.png]\nMetal Drilling\n\nJPT metal drilling uses high-energy laser beams to perform non-contact precision drilling of\nthrough holes, blind holes, and micro-holes in metals such as steel, aluminum, copper, and\ntitanium alloys. The laser\u2013metal interaction enables micro, deep, and complex hole machining that\nis difficult with traditional methods, delivering high precision, efficiency, and repeatability\nfor aerospace, precision manufacturing, and electronics.\n* [\nQCW Fiber Laser\n][130]\n\n[Get Solution][131]\n* [\u9676\u74f7\u6253\u5b54.png]\nCeramic Drilling\n\nJPT ceramic drilling employs high-energy laser beams to machine micro-holes, through holes, and\nspecial-shaped holes in ceramic materials with high hardness, brittleness, and heat resistance.\nUnlike conventional drilling, which can cause chipping and cracks, laser processing achieves high\nprecision and low damage, ideal for electronic packaging, precision devices, and specialized\nindustrial components.\n* [\nQCW Fiber Laser\n][132]\n\n[Get Solution][133]\n* [\u9521\u7b94\u5207\u5b54.png]\n* [\u73bb\u7483\u6253\u5b54.png]\n* [\u91d1\u5c5e\u6253\u5b54.png]\n* [\u9676\u74f7\u6253\u5b54.png]\n* [\n][134]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][135]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][136]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][137]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][138]\n* * [PRODUCTS][139]\n* [Optical Devices][140]\n* [Lasers][141]\n* [Core Modules][142]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][143]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][144]\n* [Industries][145]\n* [Applications][146]\n* * [SERVICES][147]\n* [Services & Supports][148]\n* [Locations][149]\n* [Q & A][150]\n* [Downloads][151]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][152]\n* [Annual Report][153]\n* [Special Report][154]\n* [Policies & Statements][155]\n* * [COMPANY][156]\n* [About Us][157]\n* [News & Events][158]\n* [Innovation][159]\n* [Honor][160]\n* [Join Us][161]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][162]\n* [HiPA][163]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][164]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][165]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][166]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][167]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][168]\n\n[Legal Notice][169][Privacy Policy][170][Sitemap][171]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /solutions/industry\n[