nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [SOLUTIONS][121]\n* [Application][122]\n\n# Material Applications\n\n[c1_icon01.svg]\n[c1_icon03.svg]\n[c1_icon05.svg]\n[c1_icon06.svg]\n[c1_icon02.svg]\n[c1_icon04.svg]\n\nCentered on core laser technologies, JPT has developed a comprehensive application ecosystem\ncovering marking, welding, cutting, cleaning, cladding, and drilling processes. By combining\nproprietary laser sources with intelligent control platforms, we address diverse materials and\ncomplex processing requirements, continuously enhancing precision, efficiency, and stability in\nlaser manufacturing.\n* 01\n\n## Laser Marking\n\nLearn More\n\n][123]\n[\u6770\u666e\u7279\u6fc0\u5149\u6253\u6807.jpg]\n\nJPT's laser marking solutions, powered by our self-developed high-performance MOPA pulsed fiber\nlasers and proprietary optical technologies, deliver non-contact processing with exceptional\nprecision, ultra-high speed, and permanent marking capability. Widely adopted across global\nhigh-end manufacturing sectors\u2014including 3C electronics, automotive components, and medical device\nproduction\u2014our systems support a wide range of materials such as metals, plastics, and ceramics,\nenabling efficient marking of QR codes, logos, serial numbers, and more.\n\n][124]\n\nLearn More\n\n][125]\n* 02\n\n## Laser Welding\n\nLearn More\n\n][126]\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u710a\u63a5\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.jpg]\n\nJPT's laser welding solutions, powered by our self-developed high-power continuous fiber lasers\nand precision optical control technologies, offer deep penetration, narrow weld seams, low heat\ninput, and minimal distortion\u2014making them ideal for high-precision, high-speed welding\napplications such as new energy manufacturing, automotive components, and precision electronics,\ncovering applications including power battery casing welding, copper tab welding, cover sealing,\nand modular metal structure welding.\n\n][127]\n\nLearn More\n\n][128]\n* 03\n\n## Laser Cutting\n\nLearn More\n\n][129]\n[\u603bJPT\u5207\u5272(1)(1).jpg]\n\nJPT\u2019s laser cutting solutions, powered by our self-developed high-energy-density lasers and\nprecision optical control systems, enable high-accuracy thermal cutting across a variety of\nmaterials. Delivering narrow kerfs, clean edges, and minimal heat-affected zones, these solutions\nensure superior quality in every cut. Applicable to metals, power battery materials, flexible\nprinted circuits (FPC), ceramics, and more, JPT laser cutting technology delivers outstanding\nefficiency and consistency in sectors such as new energy manufacturing, precision electronics, and\nsemiconductor device production.\n\n][130]\n\nLearn More\n\n][131]\n* 04\n\n## Laser Cleaning\n\nLearn More\n\n][132]\n[\u6770\u666e\u7279\u6fc0\u5149\u6e05\u6d17\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848.png]\n\nJPT's laser cleaning solutions precisely target workpiece surfaces to instantly vaporize or remove\noil, rust, coatings, and oxides\u2014delivering high-efficiency, eco-friendly, non-contact cleaning.\nIdeal for applications such as metal component refurbishment, mold maintenance, and coating\npretreatment, this technology not only removes contaminants effectively but also preserves the\nstructural integrity of the base material, extending the service life of both equipment and\nworkpieces. With flexible process configurations and stable performance, JPT laser cleaning\nprovides green, efficient surface treatment solutions for industries including new energy,\nautomotive manufacturing, and precision engineering.\n\n][133]\n\nLearn More\n\n][134]\n* 05\n\n## Laser Cladding\n\nLearn More\n\n][135]\n[11.jpg]\n\nJPT\u2019s laser cladding technology is a high-performance surface modification process that uses\nhigh-energy lasers to fuse alloy powders onto metal substrates, forming dense, high-adhesion\ncoatings. This process significantly improves wear resistance, corrosion resistance, and fatigue\nstrength, extending component lifespan. It is widely applied in mold repair, automotive parts\nremanufacturing, and industrial equipment maintenance. With precise process control and stable\nperformance, JPT laser cladding delivers high-quality, cost-effective surface enhancement and\nrepair solutions.\n\n][136]\n\nLearn More\n\n][137]\n* 06\n\n## Laser Drilling\n\nLearn More\n\n][138]\n[\u6fc0\u5149\u6253\u5b54\u9875\u9762\u56fe.jpg]\n\nJPT's laser drilling technology is an advanced non-contact microfabrication process that uses\nhigh-energy laser beams to precisely create micro-holes, through-holes, or custom-shaped holes on\nor within material surfaces. By leveraging the interaction between the laser and the material\u2014such\nas melting, vaporization, or photochemical decomposition\u2014this process achieves highly efficient\nmaterial removal. Offering high precision, high efficiency, and zero mechanical stress, it is\nsuitable for processing metals, ceramics, glass, films, and more, with wide applications in\nelectronics manufacturing, aerospace, medical devices, and new energy industries.\n\n][139]\n\nLearn More\n\n][140]\n* [\n][141]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][142]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][143]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][144]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][145]\n* * [PRODUCTS][146]\n* [Optical Devices][147]\n* [Lasers][148]\n* [Core Modules][149]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][150]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][151]\n* [Industries][152]\n* [Applications][153]\n* * [SERVICES][154]\n* [Services & Supports][155]\n* [Locations][156]\n* [Q & A][157]\n* [Downloads][158]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][159]\n* [Annual Report][160]\n* [Special Report][161]\n* [Policies & Statements][162]\n* * [COMPANY][163]\n* [About Us][164]\n* [News & Events][165]\n* [Innovation][166]\n* [Honor][167]\n* [Join Us][168]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][169]\n* [HiPA][170]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][171]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][172]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][173]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][174]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][175]\n\n[Legal Notice][176][Privacy Policy][177][Sitemap][178]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /solutions/industry\n[28]: /solutions/industry/optical-connection\n[29]: /solutions/industry/consumer-electronics\n[30]: /solutions/industry/pan-semiconductor\n[31]: /solutions/industry/new-energy-industry\n[32]: /solutions/industry\n[33]: /solutions/applications/laser-marking\n[34]: /solutions/applications/laser-welding\n[35]: /solutions/applications/laser-cutting\n[36]: /solutions/applications/laser-cleaning\n[37]: /solutions/applications/laser-cladding\n[38]: /solutions/applications/laser-drilling\n[39]: /solutions/applications\n[40]: /service/after-sales-service\n[41]: /service/after-sales-service\n[42]: /service/service-network\n[43]: /service/qa/general\n[44]: /service/download/product/lasers-downloads/mopa-fiber-lasers-downloads\n[45]: /sustainability\n[46]: /about/about-us\n[47]: /about/about-us\n[48]: /about/newsroom/company-news\n[49]: /about/innovation-and-technology\n[50]: /about/honor-and-news\n[51]: /about/join-us\n[52]: /\n[53]: https://www.jptoe.com\n[54]: https://jptjp.jp\n[55]: /contact-us\n[56]: /\n[57]: /contact-us\n[58]: /\n[59]: https://www.jptoe.com\n[60]: https://jptjp.jp\n[61]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[62]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[63]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[64]: /"
