g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[29\u5173\u4e8e\u6211\u4eecPC.jpg] [29\u5173\u4e8e\u6211\u4eecPH.jpg]\n\n# Drive with Core Technologies of Laser, Continuously Create Value for Customers\n* [Home][120]\n* [COMPANY][121]\n* [About Us][122]\n\nShenzhen JPT Opto-Electronics Co., Ltd. (Stock Code: 688025) is a national high-tech enterprise\nspecializing in the R&D, production, and sales of lasers, laser/optical intelligent equipment, and\nfiber optic components. Adhering to the \"Laser+\" strategic positioning, the company is dedicated to\nadvancing core laser technologies, deeply integrating AI to build intelligent driving engines, and\nfocusing on laser core modules and future optical connectivity solutions, aiming to create an\n\"Optics + AI\" integrated innovation ecosystem.\n\nLeveraging a self-developed technology matrix, JPT strategically covers key sectors including\nconsumer electronics (serving top-tier clients), data centers, next-gen communication\ninfrastructure, precision EV manufacturing, new energy lithium battery production, and IT (AR/VR).\nThrough groundbreaking innovations in foundational technologies, JPT is reshaping the optoelectronic\nindustry value chain and delivering comprehensive optical solutions across diverse application\nscenarios for the intelligent era.\n* 900+\nPatents & Software\nCopyrights\n* 90+\nStrategic Deployments\nWorldwide\n* 300+\nProfessional R&D\nTeam Members\n* 20+\nYears of Industry\nExperience\n\n[JPT Promotional Video.jpg]\n\n## Empowering Intelligent Manufacturing, Creating Lasting Value, Inspiring a Shared Future\n\n[JPT Mission.jpg]\nMission\nAdvancing Intelligent Manufacturing for a Common Bright Future\n[JPT Vision.jpg]\nVision\nDrive with Core Technologies of Laser, Continuously Create Value for Customers\n[JPT Values.jpg]\nValues\nInnovate with Integrity, Dream Big, Pursue Excellence, Collaborate to Succeed\n[g1_img06.jpg] [g1_img06.jpg]\n\n## Our Global Footprints Aim to Best Serve Customers\n\nThe company has a strong team of consultants, management, R&D, and sales professionals, led by over\n30 PhDs and 80 master's degree holders, and is equipped with advanced production and comprehensive\nR&D testing facilities.\n* 4Major R&D Centers\nShenzhen, Huizhou, USA, Singapore\n* 3Major Production Centers\nShenzhen, Huizhou, Thailand\n* 10Service Centers\nAcross the globe\n* 30Business Offices\nin Worldwide\n\n## Milestones\n* 2024\n* Laser Trimming Machine recognized as an 8th Batch National Single Champion Enterprise\n* 2023\n* Held the Groundbreaking Ceremony of JPT Headquarter Base\n* Established JPT USA Laboratory\n* 2022\n* Won Second Class Award of Guangdong Science and Technology Progress Award\n* \u201cMOPA Pulse Fiber Laser\u201d awarded National Manufacturing Industry Individual Champion Product\n* 2021\n* Successfully delivered first flexible perovskite film cutting equipment\n* Listed among the National \u201cLittle Giant\u201d Specialized and Innovative Enterprises\n* 2020\n* Official production launch of Huizhou JPT Fiber Laser Industrial Park\n* Official production launch of Huizhou JPT Fiber Laser Industrial Park\n* Named Guangdong Intellectual Property Demonstration Enterprise\n* 2019\n* Went public in STAR Market of Shanghai Stock Exchange\n* Awarded as \"Shenzhen Backbone Enterprise with Quality lmproving City\"\n* 2018\n* Developed automated VCSEL module inspection system\n* Developed new-generation optoelectronic module automated testing equipment\n* 2017\n* Developed 10W UV and 10W green lasers\n* Ranked among Shenzhen's Top 100 Independent Innovation Enterprises\n* Ranked in Longhua District\u2019s 2016 Top 100 Independent Innovation Enterprises\n* Named a Shenzhen Well-Known Brand\n* 2016\n* Developed 60\u2013120W MOPA Pulse Fiber Laser\n* Awarded Shenzhen Technology Innovation Program \u2013 Key R&D Project for \u201cNew Nanosecond Green Fiber\nLaser\u201d\n* 2015\n* Developed first-generation laser trimmer\n* Established Postdoctoral Innovation Practice Base\n* Received 2015 Major Project Certificate\n* Ranked in Longhua District's 2014 Top 100 Independent Innovation Enterprises\n* Won Longhua District 2014 Science & Technology Innovation Award\n* 2014\n* Developed first-generation of manual light transmittance tester\n* Won Shenzhen Science & Technology Patent Award\n* Became a member of ARTC (Advanced Remanufacturing Technology Center)\n* 2013\n* Won Shenzhen Science & Technology Patent Award\n* Recognized as Guangdong Fiber Laser Engineering Technology Research Center\n* \"MOPA-Structured All-Fiber Optical Communication System Light Source\" won First Prize for Most\nCompetitive Product at Shenzhen-HK-Macao ICT Award\n* 2012\n* Received funding from Shenzhen Peacock Plan Overseas High-Level Talent Achievement\nTransformation Project\n* Developed 200W High-Power CW Fiber Laser\n* 2010\n* Developed first commercial MOPA Pulse Fiber Laser\n* Recognized as a National High-Tech Enterprise\n* 2009\n* \"Aircraft Structure Strain Sensing Technology\" supported by \"863\" National Defense Program for\n* \"High Power Fiber Lasers Project\" won Innovation Award in China (Shenzhen) Innovation and\nEntrepreneurship Competition\n* 2006\n* Company founded\n* Developed 2W prototype of high-power EDFA\n\n## Our Honors\n* [\uff082025.3\uff0911.png]\nGlorious Laser Award\n* [\u5e7f\u4e1c\u7701\u94fe\u4e3b\u4f01\u4e1a(1).jpg]\nGuangdong Provincial Chain Leader Enterprise\n* [\u8bc1\u4e663.png]\nGuangdong Provincial Key Laboratory of Precision Industrial Laser Equipment\n* [\u8bc1\u4e664.png]\nNational High-tech Enterprise\n\n[Learn More][123]\n* [\nSustainability\n\nWe believe technology should drive sustainability. JPT is dedicated to green manufacturing,\nlow-carbon operations, and responsible governance to create shared value.\n\nLearn More\n][124]\n[Sustainability.jpg]\n* [\nJoin Us\n\nAt JPT, every employee is a driver of innovation. We foster diversity, growth, and ethics,\ninviting you to shape a brighter future with us.\n\nLearn More\n][125]\n[Join Us.jpg]\n[Sustainability.jpg]\n[Join Us.jpg]\n* [\n][126]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][127]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][128]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][129]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][130]\n* * [PRODUCTS][131]\n* [Optical Devices][132]\n* [Lasers][133]\n* [Core Modules][134]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][135]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][136]\n* [Industries][137]\n* [Applications][138]\n* * [SERVICES][139]\n* [Services & Supports][140]\n* [Locations][141]\n* [Q & A][142]\n* [Downloads][143]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][144]\n* [Annual Report][145]\n* [Special Report][146]\n* [Policies & Statements][147]\n* * [COMPANY][148]\n* [About Us][149]\n* [News & Events][150]\n* [Innovation][151]\n* [Honor][152]\n* [Join Us][153]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][154]\n* [HiPA][155]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][156]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][157]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][158]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][159]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][160]\n\n[Legal Notice][161][Privacy Policy][162][Sitemap][163]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patch-panel-series\n[7]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-closure-series\n[8]: /products/optical-devices/active-and-high-speed-cable-series\n[9]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-splitter-series\n[10]: /contact-us\n[11]: /products/lasers/mopa-fiber-lasers\n[12]: /products/lasers/cw-qcw-fiber-lasers\n[13]: /products/lasers/dpss-lasers\n[14]: /products/lasers/ultrafast-lasers\n[15]: /products/lasers/diode-laser\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: /products/core-modules/pre-welding-modules\n[18]: /products/core-modules/in-process-welding-modules\n[19]: /products/core-modules/post-welding-modules\n[20]: /products/core-modules/intelligent-welding-head\n[21]: /contact-us\n[22]: /products/intelligent-equipments/chip-resistor-solution\n[23]: /products/intelligent-equipments/module-tester\n[24]: /products/intelligent-equipments/green-energy-solution\n[25]: /products/intelligent-equipments/advance-laser-solution\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: /solutions/industry\n[28]: /solutions/industry/optical-connection\n[29]: /solutions/industry/consumer-electronics\n[30]: /solutions/industry/pan-semiconductor\n[31]: /solutions/industry/new-energy-industry\n[32]: /solutions/industry\n[33]: /solutions/applicati"
