nloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n* [Home][120]\n* [COMPANY][121]\n* [News & Events][122]\n* [Company News][123]\n\n# Newsroom\n\nExplore expert insights, practical guides and the latest news about JPT.\n* [\n\nCompany News\n\n][124]\n* [\n\nIndustry Information\n\n][125]\n* [\n\nExhibition\n\n][126]\n* [\n\nTechnical Information\n\n][127]\n* [\nCreality Ecosystem and JPT Launch Strategic Partnership to Establish Consumer Precision Laser\nJoint Lab\n2026-05-29\n\nCreality Ecosystem and JPT (SSE: 688025) have announced a strategic partnership to establish the\nConsumer Precision Laser Joint Lab, combining advanced laser technology with consumer digital\nmanufacturing expertise to accelerate innovation and commercialization worldwide.\n\n[underlay image] [Creality Ecosystem and JPT Launch Consumer Precision Laser Joint Lab Through\nStrategic Partnership.jpg]\n][128]\n* [\nJPT Releases 2025 Annual Results: Revenue Reaches RMB 2.074 Billion, Net Profit Surges 110.11% YoY\n2026-03-31\n\nJPT announced its 2025 annual results, achieving revenue of RMB 2.074 billion (+42.66% YoY) and\nnet profit of RMB 279 million (+110.11% YoY), reflecting strong growth and improved profitability.\n\nIndustry Information\n\nCompany News\n\n[underlay image] [JPT 2025 Annual Results Revenue - Reaches RMB 2.074 Billion, Net Profit Surges\n110.11% YoY(1).jpg]\n][129]\n* [\nHonoring 20 Years of Pursuing Light: JPT's Bay Area Laser Valley Headquarters Reaches Topping-Out\nMilestone\n2025-12-12\n\n[underlay image] [JPT's Bay Area Laser Valley Headquarters Reaches Topping-Out Milestone.png]\n][130]\n* [\n[underlay image] [\u9080\u8bf7\u51fd-en(12)(1)(1).jpg]\n2026-02-26\nJPT at Laser World of Photonics China 2026\n\nExhibition\n\nCompany News\n\n][131]\n* [\n[underlay image] [\u56fe\u72475(1).png]\n2026-01-22\nNew Product Launch | JPT Attends NEPCON JAPAN 2026!\n\nExhibition\n\nCompany News\n\n][132]\n* [\n[underlay image] [wecom-temp-961092-cd490e24d4c433061f9e40ad767ec5d6_heic_100(1)(1).jpg]\n2026-01-22\nNew Product Launch | JPT attended SPIE Photonics West 2026\n\nExhibition\n\nCompany News\n\n][133]\n* [\n[underlay image] [1.jpg]\n2025-04-03\nJPT 2024 Annual Report: Revenue Reaches a Historic High\n\nCompany News\n\n][134]\n* [\n[underlay image] [1751274566916207.jpg]\n2024-11-13\nJPT Skills Competition 2024 comes to a successful conclusion\n\nCompany News\n\n][135]\n* [\n[underlay image] [1751275026880721.jpg]\n2024-08-30\n\"The Unseen Champion\" Chronicle: JPT Strives to be the Leader in the Laser Technology Subdivision\n\nCompany News\n\n][136]\n* [\n[underlay image] [1751275267522513.jpg]\n2024-08-29\nGood news | JPT won another industry award\n\nCompany News\n\n][137]\n* [\n[underlay image] [20240712.png]\n2024-07-12\nDeepening Core Technology! JPT Laser Attends the 15th National Laser Processing Industry Forum and\ndelivers a keynote speech\n\nCompany News\n\n][138]\n* [\n[underlay image] [1751280462452250.png]\n2024-07-12\nJPT Laser M8 Series High Peak Power Lasers: Effortlessly Handling Complex Materials for\nHigh-Quality Processing\n\nIndustry Information\n\nCompany News\n\n][139]\n* 1\n* [\n\n][140]\n* [\n\n][141]\n* [\n\n][142]\n* [\n][143]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][144]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][145]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][146]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][147]\n* * [PRODUCTS][148]\n* [Optical Devices][149]\n* [Lasers][150]\n* [Core Modules][151]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][152]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][153]\n* [Industries][154]\n* [Applications][155]\n* * [SERVICES][156]\n* [Services & Supports][157]\n* [Locations][158]\n* [Q & A][159]\n* [Downloads][160]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][161]\n* [Annual Report][162]\n* [