g\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[g4_banner.jpg] [g4_bannerph.jpg]\n\n# Continuous Innovation, Expanding Infinite Possibilities\n\nWe own the core technologies and intellectual property of our proprietary products, focusing on\nindustry-leading innovations to efficiently meet the diverse needs of customers worldwide. Through\ncontinuous innovation, we help clients achieve their greates\n* 905\nIntellectual Properties\n* 323\nInvention Patents\n* 314\nUtility Model Patents\n* 48\nDesign Patents\n* 191\nSoftware Copyrights\n* [Home][120]\n* [COMPANY][121]\n* [Innovation][122]\n\n[g4_img01.jpg]\n\n## R&D and Innovation\n\nAdhering to the \"Laser+\" strategic positioning, the company is dedicated to advancing core laser\ntechnologies, deeply integrating AI to build intelligent driving engines, and focusing on laser core\nmodules and future optical connectivity solutions, aiming to create an \"Optics + AI\" integrated\ninnovation ecosystem.\n* Laser Technology\n\nLaser processing technology utilizes the interaction between laser beams and materials (including\nmetals and non-metals) for advanced processes such as cutting, welding, surface treatment,\ndrilling, and micro-machining.\n\nLaser Technology\n\nLaser processing technology utilizes the interaction between laser beams and materials (including\nmetals and non-metals) for advanced processes such as cutting, welding, surface treatment,\ndrilling, and micro-machining.\n\n[36\u6fc0\u5149\u6280\u672f.jpg]\n* Pulse Master Oscillator Power Amplifier (MOPA) Fiber Laser Systems\n\nNanosecond MOPA fiber lasers with multi-stage amplification offer high efficiency, low\nthreshold, simple structure, ease of use, and excellent beam quality, serving industrial, 3C,\nand precision welding applications.\n* High-Power Continuous-Wave Fiber Laser Systems\n\nSupport multi- and single-mode outputs with broad power coverage, ideal for thick-plate cutting,\nlarge-scale welding, and laser cleaning, featuring high stability for continuous operation.\n* Ultrafast Laser Precision Micromachining\n\nPicosecond/femtosecond platforms deliver ultra-precise processing for dental, semiconductor, new\nenergy, and display industries, meeting extreme accuracy and thermal control needs in high-end\nmanufacturing.\n* Precision Measurement Technology\n\nWith expertise in high-precision optics, sensors, and algorithm integration, JPT has built a\nmicron-to-nanometer measurement platform for semiconductor, 3C electronics, and laser\nmanufacturing, enabling intelligent upgrades from inspection to closed-loop control.\n\nPrecision Measurement Technology\n\nWith expertise in high-precision optics, sensors, and algorithm integration, JPT has built a\nmicron-to-nanometer measurement platform for semiconductor, 3C electronics, and laser\nmanufacturing, enabling intelligent upgrades from inspection to closed-loop control.\n\n[37\u7cbe\u5bc6\u91cf\u6d4b.jpg]\n* Laser Interferometry Measurement Systems\n\nHigh-stability multi-axis laser interferometers achieve sub-micron accuracy for laser alignment,\noptical calibration, and precision motion control.\n* White-Light Interferometry & Confocal Microscopy\n\nDelivers high-resolution 3D profiling for non-destructive inspection of wafers, MEMS, and\nmicrolens arrays.\n* High-Speed 2D/3D Measurement Systems\n\nHigh-frame-rate cameras with proprietary algorithms provide sub-micron 2D/3D measurement for\nonline inspection and automated sorting.\n* Temperature Drift Compensation\n\nMulti-physics modeling with bandgap references and gradient temperature control keeps drift\nwithin \u53640.5 ppm/\u63b3C for long-term ADC stability.\n* High-Precision Electrical Measurement\n\nVolt-ampere and four-wire methods with guard-ring shielding achieve \u6e2dV-level accuracy for\nvoltage, current, and resistance in semiconductor and PV testing.\n* EMI Shielding & Interference Suppression\n\n\u03bc-metal shielding, active coils, and optical isolation suppress 50/60 Hz and common-mode noise\nfor sensitive signal and high-voltage measurements.\n* Machine Vision & AI Technology\n\nBy integrating machine vision with AI algorithms, JPT builds \u201cperception\u2013recognition\u2013control\u201d\nclosed-loop systems for high-demand manufacturing tasks such as auto-alignment, defect detection,\nappearance inspection, and intelligent focusing\u2014enhancing flexibility, stability, and automation.\n\nMachine Vision & AI Technology\n\nBy integrating machine vision with AI algorithms, JPT builds \u201cperception\u2013recognition\u2013control\u201d\nclosed-loop systems for high-demand manufacturing tasks such as auto-alignment, defect detection,\nappearance inspection, and intelligent focusing\u2014enhancing flexibility, stability, and automation.\n\n[g4_img04.jpg]\n* Automated Optical Inspection (AOI)\n\nUses vision and optics to detect surface defects, contamination, or pattern anomalies, and to\nmeasure or locate key parameters\u2014non-contact and non-destructive.\n* Precision Vision Alignment Systems\n\nAnalyzes positional deviations with vision and optics for sub-micron to nanometer-level\nmeasurement and alignment, ensuring high-precision, non-contact inspection.\n* Multi-Station & Multi-Channel Image Processing\n\nSupports concurrent multi-camera capture and accelerated processing, improving real-time\nresponsiveness for fully automated laser production lines.\n* Module Inspection Solutions\n\nJPT is one of the few global suppliers offering fully automated module inspection, meeting needs\nfor high-speed, full-function, and accurate testing.\n* Motion Control Technology\n\nAs a core enabler for high-end manufacturing, JPT focuses on high-precision positioning, rapid\ndynamic control, and complex trajectory programming. Our solutions are widely used in laser\nprocessing platforms, vision alignment, and automated production lines, covering the entire chain\nfrom control algorithms to motion modules.\n\nMotion Control Technology\n\nAs a core enabler for high-end manufacturing, JPT focuses on high-precision positioning, rapid\ndynamic control, and complex trajectory programming. Our solutions are widely used in laser\nprocessing platforms, vision alignment, and automated production lines, covering the entire chain\nfrom control algorithms to motion modules.\n\n[39\u8fd0\u52a8\u63a7\u5236.jpg]\n* High-Precision Motion Controllers\n\nIn-house multi-axis controllers supporting EtherCAT and CANopen protocols, delivering\nmicron-level interpolation and millisecond synchronization\u2014ideal for high-speed marking and\nprecision welding.\n* Gantry Platforms & Linear Motor Modules\n\nRigid gantry systems with self-developed linear motor drives enable large-travel, high-stability\nmotion, suitable for FPC coverlay cutting, LED board processing, and other large-format\napplications.\n* Intelligent Trajectory Planning\n\nProprietary algorithms ensure smooth speed transitions, dynamic compensation, and seamless\nmulti-curve connection\u2014applied in various welding and scribing systems.\n* Integrated Control Platforms\n\nCombining laser control, vision, and motion in unified platforms to enhance process stability\nand integration. Representative products include the \u201cPrecision Laser Marking AOI Platform\u201d and\n\u201cHigh-Speed CCD Alignment Welding System.\u201d\n\n## Cooperative project\n* [\n[underlay image] [Creality Ecosystem and JPT Launch Consumer Precision Laser Joint Lab Through\nStrategic Partnership.jpg]\n2026-05-29\nCreality Ecosystem and JPT Launch Strategic Partnership to Establish Consumer Precision Laser\nJoint Lab\n][123]\n* [\n[underlay image] [20240712.png]\n2024-07-12\nDeepening Core Technology! JPT Laser Attends the 15th National Laser Processing Industry Forum and\ndelivers a keynote speech\n\nCompany News\n\n][124]\n* [\n[underlay image] [1754463889732101.jpeg]\n2024-05-17\nGood News | JPT Once Again Awarded National Manufacturing Industry Champion, Laser Resistor\nTechnology Attracts Global Attention\n\nCompany News\n\n][125]\n* [\n[underlay image] [4.jpg]\n2022-08-16\nInnovation China\u4e28JPT: The heart of research and development comes from sharpening\n\nCompany News\n\n][126]\n* [\n][127]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][128]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][129]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][130]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][131]\n* * [PRODUCTS][132]\n* [Optical Devices][133]\n* [Lasers][134]\n* [Core Modules][135]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][136]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][137]\n* [Industries][138]\n* [Applications][139]\n* * [SERVICES][140]\n* [Services & Supports][141]\n"
