            "text": "[ [a_img03.png] [a_img03.png] ][1]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n* [PRODUCTS][2]\n* [a-icon04.svg] [a-icon0401.svg]\n\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n* [aicon05.svg] [aicon0501.svg]\n\nLASERS\n* [aicon03.svg] [aicon0301.svg]\n\nCORE MODULES\n* [a-icon06.svg] [a-icon0601.svg]\n\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n* * [\n\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n\n][3]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n\n][4]\n* [\n\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n\n][5]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n\n][6]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Closure\n\n][7]\n* [\n\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n\n][8]\n* [\n\nFiber Optic Splitter\n\n][9]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][10]\n* * [\n\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n\n][11]\n* [\n\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n\n][12]\n* [\n\nDPSS Lasers\n\n][13]\n* [\n\nUltrafast Lasers\n\n][14]\n* [\n\nDiode Lasers\n\n][15]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* * [\n\nPre-welding Modules\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nIn-process Welding Modules\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nPost-welding Modules\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n\n][20]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][21]\n* * [\n\nChip Resistor Solution\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nModule Tester\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nGreen Energy Solution\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nAdvance Laser Solution\n\n][25]\n[a_img01.jpg]\n\nCan't find the right product?\n\nContact us - JPT will help you find a reliable solution\n\nContact Us\n\n][26]\n* [SOLUTIONS][27]\n* [a-icon07.svg] [a-icon0701.svg]\n\nIndustries\n* [a-icon08.svg] [a-icon0801.svg]\n\nApplication\n* * [\n\nOptical Connection\n\n][28]\n* [\n\nConsumer Electronics\n\n][29]\n* [\n\nPan-Semiconductor\n\n][30]\n* [\n\nNew Energy\n\n][31]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nIndustry Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][32]\n* * [\n\nLaser Marking\n\n][33]\n* [\n\nLaser Welding\n\n][34]\n* [\n\nLaser Cutting\n\n][35]\n* [\n\nLaser Cleaning\n\n][36]\n* [\n\nLaser Cladding\n\n][37]\n* [\n\nLaser Drilling\n\n][38]\n[a_img02.jpg]\n\nApplication Solutions\n\nLearn More\n\n][39]\n* [SERVICES][40]\n* [Service & Support][41]\n* [Locations][42]\n* [Q & A][43]\n* [Downloads][44]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][45]\n* [COMPANY][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [News & Events][48]\n* [Innovation][49]\n* [Honors][50]\n* [Join Us][51]\n\n[English][52]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][53]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][54]\n[Contact Us][55]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][56]\n\nStock Code\n\n688025\n\n[Contact Us][57]\n[English][58]\n[\u4e2d\u6587][59]\n[\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][60]\n* [\nPRODUCTS\n][61]\n* [\nOPTICAL DEVICES\n][62]\n* [\nHigh Density Fiber Assembly\n][63]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patchcord\n][64]\n* [\nOutdoor & Hybrid Cable Assembly\n][65]\n* [\nFiber Optic Patch Panels\n][66]\n* [\nFiber Optic Closure\n][67]\n* [\nActive and High-Speed Cables\n][68]\n* [\nFiber Optic Splitter\n][69]\n* [\nLASERS\n][70]\n* [\nMOPA Fiber Lasers\n][71]\n* [\nCW / QCW Fiber Lasers\n][72]\n* [\nDPSS Lasers\n][73]\n* [\nUltrafast Lasers\n][74]\n* [\nDiode Lasers\n][75]\n* [\nCORE MODULES\n][76]\n* [\nPre-welding Modules\n][77]\n* [\nIn-process Welding Modules\n][78]\n* [\nPost-welding Modules\n][79]\n* [\nIntelligent Welding Heads\n][80]\n* [\nINTELLIGENT SOLUTIONS\n][81]\n* [\nChip Resistor Solution\n][82]\n* [\nModule Tester\n][83]\n* [\nGreen Energy Solution\n][84]\n* [\nAdvance Laser Solution\n][85]\n* [\nSOLUTIONS\n][86]\n* [\nIndustries\n][87]\n* [\nOptical Connection\n][88]\n* [\nConsumer Electronics\n][89]\n* [\nPan-Semiconductor\n][90]\n* [\nNew Energy\n][91]\n* [\nApplication\n][92]\n* [\nLaser Marking\n][93]\n* [\nLaser Welding\n][94]\n* [\nLaser Cutting\n][95]\n* [\nLaser Cleaning\n][96]\n* [\nLaser Cladding\n][97]\n* [\nLaser Drilling\n][98]\n* [\nSERVICES\n][99]\n* [\nService & Support\n][100]\n* [\nLocations\n][101]\n* [\nQ & A\n][102]\n* [\nGeneral\n][103]\n* [\nTechnical\n][104]\n* [\nPre-sales\n][105]\n* [\nAfter-sales\n][106]\n* [\nDownloads\n][107]\n* [\nProducts\n][108]\n* [\nSUSTAINABILITY\n][109]\n* [\nCOMPANY\n][110]\n* [\nAbout Us\n][111]\n* [\nNews & Events\n][112]\n* [\nCompany News\n][113]\n* [\nIndustry Information\n][114]\n* [\nExhibition\n][115]\n* [\nTechnical Information\n][116]\n* [\nInnovation\n][117]\n* [\nHonors\n][118]\n* [\nJoin Us\n][119]\n[g6_banner.jpg] [g6_bannerph.jpg]\n\n# Join Us\n\n## Join JPT and embark on a journey of growth\n* [underlay image] [43\u804c\u4e1a\u6210\u957f1.jpg]\nJoin JPT and embark on a journey of growth\n\nWe value the professional growth and skill enhancement of every employee, offering a dual-channel\nadvancement system covering technical expertise, management capability, and global perspective.\nJPT fosters a learning-oriented culture, enabling employees to progress from role proficiency to\nvalue creation.\n* [underlay image] [44\u4eba\u624d\u57f9\u517b.jpg]\nTalent Development\n\nCentering on \u201cself-cultivation + platform empowerment,\u201d JPT has built a comprehensive talent\ndevelopment system that spans new hire onboarding, key talent growth, technical advancement, and\nleadership development. Through project-based training, cross-team collaboration, and\nmulti-scenario enablement, we unlock potential and drive organizational evolution.\n* [underlay image] [45\u85aa\u916c\u798f\u52291.jpg]\nCompensation & Benefits\n\nOur performance-driven reward system offers competitive pay and incentives. Employees enjoy full\nsocial insurance, holiday benefits, health check-ups, team-building activities, equity incentives,\nand more\u2014creating a secure and caring work environment.\n* [underlay image] [46\u591a\u5143\u6587\u5316.jpg]\nDiversity & Inclusion\n\nWe champion a culture of inclusivity and mutual respect, welcoming people from all backgrounds and\nexperiences. JPT is committed to gender equality, cultural integration, and fair development,\nensuring every employee thrives in an open, trusted, and co-creative environment.\n\n## Employee Activities | Building a Warm Workplace\n\nWe foster a workplace filled with warmth and connection through diverse activities, where work and\npassion go hand in hand.\n* [underlay image] [g6_img05.jpg]\nStaff Assembly\n\nJPT regularly holds staff assemblies to share strategic directions, recognize outstanding\nemployees, and strengthen organizational cohesion and cultural identity\u2014painting a shared\nblueprint for growth.\n\n[underlay image] [48\u516c\u53f8\u5e74\u4f1a.jpg]\nAnnual Gala\n\nAt year-end, we host themed annual celebrations to honor achievements, with raffles, performances,\nand festivities that allow employees to welcome the new year in a lively, relaxed atmosphere.\n* [underlay image] [50\u6625\u6e38\u56e2\u5efa.jpg]\nSpring Outing & Team Building\n\nEach year, JPT organizes charity walks for employees and their families, promoting health,\nstrengthening family bonds, and spreading love and social responsibility.\n\n[underlay image] [\u54c1\u8d28\u6708\u66ff\u6362(1).png]\nQuality Month\n\nThrough activities such as \u201cQuality Open Day,\u201d \u201cQuality Training Week,\u201d and \u201cQuality Improvement\nCompetition,\u201d we build a culture where everyone values and practices quality, advancing lean\nproduction as a norm.\n* [underlay image] [\u5bb6\u5ead\u65e5(1).jpg]\nFamily Day\n\nWe care for employees\u2019 family support systems by hosting Family Day events, inviting loved ones to\nexplore our facilities and enjoy nature together\u2014bringing love and companionship into both work\nand life.\n\n[underlay image] [52\u6587\u5a31\u6d3b\u52a8.jpg]\nRecreational Activities\n\nWe encourage diverse interests through sports clubs for football, badminton, table tennis,\nbasketball, and more, as well as regular gym sessions, yoga, billiards, hiking, and mental\nwellness programs\u2014energizing our teams and enriching workplace life.\n\n## Grow with JPT\n\nJoin our team and unlock limitless growth and innovation opportunities in the laser industry.\n* [underlay image] [53\u52a0\u5165\u6211\u4eec.jpg]\nJoin Us\n\nPassionate about technology? Ready for challenges?\n\nAt JPT, your talent will shine on the front lines of industry.\n\nApply now\n\n][120]\n* [underlay image] [54\u535a\u58eb\u540e\u62db\u8058.jpg]\nPostdoctoral Recruitment\n\nPursue truth and explore the frontiers.\n\nJoin JPT and drive industrial transformation through cutting-edge research.\n\nApply now\n\n][121]\n* [underlay image] [55\u6210\u4e3a\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546.jpg]\nBecome a Supplier\n\nWork hand in hand for mutual success and shared value.\n\nJoin JPT to embark on a new journey of collaboration and long-term growth.\n\nApply now\n\n][122]\n* [\n][123]\n* [\u672a\u6807\u9898-2.jpg]\n* [ 0755-29528182 ][124]\n* [ sales@jptoe.com ][125]\n\nLeading Laser Technologies Create Future\n\n[Contact Us][126]\n[ [a_img03.png] ][127]\n* * [PRODUCTS][128]\n* [Optical Devices][129]\n* [Lasers][130]\n* [Core Modules][131]\n* [Intelligent Equipment][132]\n* * [SOLUTIONS][133]\n* [Industries][134]\n* [Applications][135]\n* * [SERVICES][136]\n* [Services & Supports][137]\n* [Locations][138]\n* [Q & A][139]\n* [Downloads][140]\n* * [SUSTAINABILITY][141]\n* [Annual Report][142]\n* [Special Report][143]\n* [Policies & Statements][144]\n* * [COMPANY][145]\n* [About Us][146]\n* [News & Events][147]\n* [Innovation][148]\n* [Honor][149]\n* [Join Us][150]\n* * [FRIENDLY LINK][151]\n* [HiPA][152]\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ [foot_icon02(1).svg] ][153]\n[ [foot_icon01(1).svg] ][154]\n[ [foot_icon03(1).svg] ][155]\n[ [foot_icon04.svg] ][156]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Shenzhen JPT Opto-electronics Co., Ltd. All Rights\nReserved. [\u7ca4ICP\u59072021072159\u53f7][157]\n\n[Legal Notice][158][Privacy Policy][159][Sitemap][160]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[3]: /products/optical-devices/high-density-fiber-assembly\n[4]: /products/optical-devices/fiber-optic-patchcord\n[5]: /products/optical-devices/outdoor-and-hybrid-cable-assembly\n[6]: /pro