            "text": "[CONTACT SALES][1]\n\n+44(0)1788 574444\n* [Home][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Product Range][4]\n* [Compact Lasers][5]\n* [High Energy Compact Lasers][6]\n* [High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J][7]\n* [Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J][8]\n* [DPSS Pulsed Lasers][9]\n* [CW High Repetition Rate Lasers][10]\n* [Lasers For PIV][11]\n* [Tunable Pulsed Lasers][12]\n* [Custom Laser Systems][13]\n* [Applications][14]\n* [Application Areas][15]\n* [PIV & Visualisation][16]\n* [Spectroscopy & LIBS][17]\n* [Remote Sensing & LiDAR][18]\n* [Scientific Research][19]\n* [LCD & Semiconductor][20]\n* [Laser Pump Source][21]\n* [Photoacoustic Imaging][22]\n* [Surface Processing & Ablation][23]\n* [Technical Notes][24]\n* [Company][25]\n* [About][26]\n* [Distributors][27]\n* [Events][28]\n* [Careers][29]\n* [Customer Login][30]\n* [Find Us][31]\n* [Service][32]\n* [Service Centers][33]\n* [Spares & Consumables][34]\n* [RMA Form][35]\n* [RMA & Shipping Policy][36]\n* [News][37]\n* [Contact][38]\n\n# Find Us\n\n## By Car:\n\nLeave the M6 Motorway at junction 1 then take the A426 toward Rugby\nPlease follow this link for road maps. [MULTIMAP.COM][39]\n\n## By Air:\n\nLitron can be reached via 3 main airports.\n\n**[Birmingham International Airport][40]:** 30 minutes drive or 30 mins by train.\n**[London Stansted Airport][41]:** 2 hours drive \u2013 no direct train.\n**[London Heathrow][42]:** 1.5 Hours drive \u2013 no direct train.\n\n## By Train:\n\nRugby can be reached from either London Euston station or Birmingham International station. Trains\ntake approximately 1 hour and 45 minutes and 45 minutes respectively.\n\nPlease visit the [National Rail website][43] for more information and departure times.\n\n[LEGAL NOTICE][44]\n\n[PRIVACY NOTICE][45]\n\n[COOKIE NOTICE][46]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright Litron Lasers 2026 All Rights Reserved | ISO 9001:2015 Certified Web Site by [ Mulberry\nDesign][47]\nLitron Lasers only uses anonymous analytical/performance cookies on thi