            "text": "[CONTACT SALES][1]\n\n+44(0)1788 574444\n* [Home][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Product Range][4]\n* [Compact Lasers][5]\n* [High Energy Compact Lasers][6]\n* [High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J][7]\n* [Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J][8]\n* [DPSS Pulsed Lasers][9]\n* [CW High Repetition Rate Lasers][10]\n* [Lasers For PIV][11]\n* [Tunable Pulsed Lasers][12]\n* [Custom Laser Systems][13]\n* [Applications][14]\n* [Application Areas][15]\n* [PIV & Visualisation][16]\n* [Spectroscopy & LIBS][17]\n* [Remote Sensing & LiDAR][18]\n* [Scientific Research][19]\n* [LCD & Semiconductor][20]\n* [Laser Pump Source][21]\n* [Photoacoustic Imaging][22]\n* [Surface Processing & Ablation][23]\n* [Technical Notes][24]\n* [Company][25]\n* [About][26]\n* [Distributors][27]\n* [Events][28]\n* [Careers][29]\n* [Customer Login][30]\n* [Find Us][31]\n* [Service][32]\n* [Service Centers][33]\n* [Spares & Consumables][34]\n* [RMA Form][35]\n* [RMA & Shipping Policy][36]\n* [News][37]\n* [Contact][38]\n\n# Return to Manufacturer Authorisation (RMA) Form\n\n**Service Form**\n\nWe will respond to your request by email. If you have not received a response within 2 working days\ndays please call +44(0)1788 574444\n\nNOTE: Advance shipment of parts require the immediate return of the original parts. All replacement\nparts or systems not received within 30 days of shipment will be billed.\n\nIf you experience difficulty using this form please contact our Service Department on +44 (0)1788\n574444 or via e-mail at [service@litron.co.uk][39].\n\nNature of Enquiry *Please Choose One Spare PartsNon Warranty Repair / Investigation RMAWarranty\nRepair / Investigation RMASevice / Calibration RMA\nName *\nCompany *\nPhone Number *\nEmail Address *\nAdrdess Line 1\nAddress Line 2\nTown / City\nPost Code\nCountryAfghanistanAlbaniaAlgeriaAmerican SamoaAndorraAngolaAnguillaAntarcticaAntigua and\nBarbudaArgentinaArmeniaArubaAustraliaAustriaAzerbaijanBahamasBahrainBangladeshBarbadosBelarusBelgium\nBelizeBeninBermudaBhutanBoliviaBosnia and HerzegovinaBotswanaBouvet IslandBrazilBritish Indian Ocean\nTerritoryBruneiBulgariaBurkina FasoBurundiCabo VerdeCambodiaCameroonCanadaCayman IslandsCentral\nAfrican RepublicChadChileChina, People's Republic ofChristmas IslandCocos\nIslandsColombiaComorosCongo, Democratic Republic of theCongo, Republic of theCook IslandsCosta\nRicaCroatiaCubaCura\u00e7aoCyprusCzech RepublicC\u00f4te d'IvoireDenmarkDjiboutiDominicaDominican RepublicEast\nTimorEcuadorEgyptEl SalvadorEquatorial GuineaEritreaEstoniaEthiopiaFalkland IslandsFaroe\nIslandsFijiFinlandFranceFrance, MetropolitanFrench GuianaFrench PolynesiaFrench South\nTerritoriesGabonGambiaGeorgiaGermanyGhanaGibraltarGreeceGreenlandGrenadaGuadeloupeGuamGuatemalaGuern\nseyGuineaGuinea-BissauGuyanaHaitiHeard Island And Mcdonald IslandHondurasHong\nKongHungaryIcelandIndiaIndonesiaIranIraqIrelandIsraelItalyJamaicaJapanJerseyJohnston\nIslandJordanKazakhstanKenyaKiribatiKorea, Democratic People's Republic ofKorea, Republic\nofKosovoKuwaitKyrgyzstanLao People's Democratic\nRepublicLatviaLebanonLesothoLiberiaLibyaLiechtensteinLithuaniaLuxembourgMacauMadagascarMalawiMalaysi\naMaldivesMaliMaltaMarshall\nIslandsMartiniqueMauritaniaMauritiusMayotteMexicoMicronesiaMoldovaMonacoMongoliaMontenegroMontserrat\nMoroccoMozambiqueMyanmarNamibiaNauruNepalNetherlandsNetherlands AntillesNew CaledoniaNew\nZealandNicaraguaNigerNigeriaNiueNorfolk IslandNorth MacedoniaNorthern Mariana\nIslandsNorwayOmanPakistanPalauPalestine, State ofPanamaPapua New\nGuineaParaguayPeruPhilippinesPitcairn IslandsPolandPortugalPuerto RicoQatarReunion\nIslandRomaniaRussiaRwandaSaint HelenaSaint Kitts and NevisSaint LuciaSaint Pierre & MiquelonSaint\nVincent and the GrenadinesSamoaSan MarinoSao Tome and PrincipeSaudi\nArabiaSenegalSerbiaSeychellesSierra LeoneSingaporeSint MaartenSlovakiaSloveniaSolomon\nIslandsSomaliaSouth AfricaSouth Georgia and South SandwichSpainSri LankaStateless PersonsSudanSudan,\nSouthSurinameSvalbard and Jan MayenSwazilandSwedenSwitzerlandSyriaTaiwan, Republic of\nChinaTajikistanTanzaniaThailandTogoTokelauTongaTrinidad and TobagoTunisiaTurkeyTurkmenistanTurks And\nCaicos IslandsTuvaluUS Minor Outlying IslandsUgandaUkraineUnited Arab EmiratesUnited KingdomUnited\nStates of America (USA)UruguayUzbekistanVanuatuVatican CityVenezuelaVietnamVirgin Islands,\nBritishVirgin Islands, U.S.Wallis And Futuna IslandsWestern SaharaYemenZambiaZimbabwe\nDescription of Action Required *\nPurchase Order No.\nLaser Head Serial Number *Where is my laser serial number? The product Serial No. can be found\neither on the laser head (LM****) or on the Laser Specification Page in your Operators Manual.\nPlease ensure you use the laser head Serial No. not the power supply unit Serial No. even if you are\nreporting a problem with a power supply.\nConsent *\n\nSubmission of this form is your agreement to the terms and conditions laid out in our [RMA Shipping\nPolicy][40].\n\nSubmit\n\n#### Service Menu\n* [Service Centres][41]\n* [RMA & Shipping Policy][42]\n* [Spares & Consumables][43]\n* [Return to Manufacturer Authorisation Form][44]\n* [Customer Login][45]\n\n[LEGAL NOTICE][46]\n\n[PRIVACY NOTICE][47]\n\n[COOKIE NOTICE][48]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright Litron Lasers 2026 All Rights Reserved | ISO 9001:2015 Certified Web Site by [ Mulberry\nDesign][49]\nLitron Lasers only uses anonymous analytical/performance cookies on this site. If you are unhappy\nwith this use of cookies, you can disable their use in your browser settings. See our cookie policy\nfor more information.OkPrivacy policy\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@litron.co.uk\n[2]: https://www.litronlasers.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/\n[5]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/compact-lasers/\n[6]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-compact-lasers/\n[7]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-lasers/\n[8]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/ultra-high-energy-lasers/\n[9]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/dpss-pulsed-lasers/\n[10]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/q-switched-high-repetition-rate-dpss-lasers/\n[11]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/lasers-for-piv/\n[12]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/tunable-pulsed-lasers/\n[13]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/custom-laser-systems/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/\n[16]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/piv-visualisation/\n[17]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/spectroscopy-libs/\n[18]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/remote-sensing-lidar/\n[19]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/scientific-research/\n[20]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/lcd-semiconductor/\n[21]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/laser-pump-source/\n[22]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/photoacoustic-imaging/\n[23]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/surface-processing-ablation/\n[24]: https://www.litronlasers.com/technical-notes/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/about/\n[27]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/distributors/\n[28]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/upcoming-events/\n[29]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/careers/\n[30]: https://litronlasers.egnyte.com/subDomainLogin.do#username\n[31]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/find-us/\n[32]: #\n[33]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/service-centers/\n[34]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/spares-consumables/\n[35]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-form/\n[36]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-shipping-policy/\n[37]: https://www.litronlasers.com/news/\n[38]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/contact/\n[39]: mailto:service@litron.co.uk\n[40]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-shipping-policy/\n[41]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/service-centers/\n[42]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-shipping-policy/\n[43]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/spares-consumables/\n[44]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-form/\n[45]: https://litronlasers.egnyte.com/#username\n[46]: /legal\n[47]: /privacy\n[48]: /cookie\n[49]: http://mulberry-design.co.uk"
