            "text": "[CONTACT SALES][1]\n\n+44(0)1788 574444\n* [Home][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Product Range][4]\n* [Compact Lasers][5]\n* [High Energy Compact Lasers][6]\n* [High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J][7]\n* [Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J][8]\n* [DPSS Pulsed Lasers][9]\n* [CW High Repetition Rate Lasers][10]\n* [Lasers For PIV][11]\n* [Tunable Pulsed Lasers][12]\n* [Custom Laser Systems][13]\n* [Applications][14]\n* [Application Areas][15]\n* [PIV & Visualisation][16]\n* [Spectroscopy & LIBS][17]\n* [Remote Sensing & LiDAR][18]\n* [Scientific Research][19]\n* [LCD & Semiconductor][20]\n* [Laser Pump Source][21]\n* [Photoacoustic Imaging][22]\n* [Surface Processing & Ablation][23]\n* [Technical Notes][24]\n* [Company][25]\n* [About][26]\n* [Distributors][27]\n* [Events][28]\n* [Careers][29]\n* [Customer Login][30]\n* [Find Us][31]\n* [Service][32]\n* [Service Centers][33]\n* [Spares & Consumables][34]\n* [RMA Form][35]\n* [RMA & Shipping Policy][36]\n* [News][37]\n* [Contact][38]\n\n# Upcoming Events\n\nWe will be exhibiting a selection of the wide range of Litron products at the following events.\nFor further information please follow the links below or contact us directly at [sales@litron.co.uk\n][39].\n\nWe are delighted to announce we will be attending the 21st International Conference on Plasma\nPhysics and Applications and the 10th Central European Symposium on Plasma Chemistry. Being held\nthis year in Bucharest, we will be alongside our exclusive Distributor in Romania, Apel Laser.\n\n[Learn More][40]\n\n[LEGAL NOTICE][41]\n\n[PRIVACY NOTICE][42]\n\n[COOKIE NOTICE][43]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright Litron Lasers 2026 All Rights Reserved | ISO 9001:2015 Certified Web Site by [ Mulberry\nDesign][44]\nLitron Lasers only uses anonymous analytical/performance cookies on this site. If you are unhappy\nwith this use of cookies, you can disable their use in your browser settings. See our cookie policy\nfor more information.OkPrivacy policy\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@litron.co.uk\n[2]: https://www.litronlasers.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/\n[5]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/compact-lasers/\n[6]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-compact-lasers/\n[7]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-lasers/\n[8]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/ultra-high-energy-lasers/\n[9]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/dpss-pulsed-lasers/\n[10]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/q-switched-high-repetition-rate-dpss-lasers/\n[11]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/lasers-for-piv/\n[12]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/tunable-pulsed-lasers/\n[13]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/custom-laser-systems/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/\n[16]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/piv-visualisation/\n[17]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/spectroscopy-libs/\n[18]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/remote-sensing-lidar/\n[19]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/scientific-research/\n[20]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/lcd-semiconductor/\n[21]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/laser-pump-source/\n[22]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/photoacoustic-imaging/\n[23]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/surface-processing-ablation/\n[24]: https://www.litronlasers.com/technical-notes/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/about/\n[27]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/distributors/\n[28]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/upcoming-events/\n[29]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/careers/\n[30]: https://litronlasers.egnyte.com/subDomainLogin.do#username\n[31]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/find-us/\n[32]: #\n[33]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/service-centers/\n[34]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/spares-consumables/\n[35]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-form/\n[36]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-shipping-policy/\n[37]: https://www.litronlasers.com/news/\n[38]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/contact/\n[39]: mailto:sales@litron.co.uk\n[40]: https://cespc.inflpr.ro/21st-cppa/\n[41]: /legal\n[42]: /privacy\n[43]: /cookie\n[44]: http://mulberry-design.co.uk"
