            "url": "https://www.litronlasers.com/company/careers/",
            "text": "[CONTACT SALES][1]\n\n+44(0)1788 574444\n* [Home][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Product Range][4]\n* [Compact Lasers][5]\n* [High Energy Compact Lasers][6]\n* [High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J][7]\n* [Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J][8]\n* [DPSS Pulsed Lasers][9]\n* [CW High Repetition Rate Lasers][10]\n* [Lasers For PIV][11]\n* [Tunable Pulsed Lasers][12]\n* [Custom Laser Systems][13]\n* [Applications][14]\n* [Application Areas][15]\n* [PIV & Visualisation][16]\n* [Spectroscopy & LIBS][17]\n* [Remote Sensing & LiDAR][18]\n* [Scientific Research][19]\n* [LCD & Semiconductor][20]\n* [Laser Pump Source][21]\n* [Photoacoustic Imaging][22]\n* [Surface Processing & Ablation][23]\n* [Technical Notes][24]\n* [Company][25]\n* [About][26]\n* [Distributors][27]\n* [Events][28]\n* [Careers][29]\n* [Customer Login][30]\n* [Find Us][31]\n* [Service][32]\n* [Service Centers][33]\n* [Spares & Consumables][34]\n* [RMA Form][35]\n* [RMA & Shipping Policy][36]\n* [News][37]\n* [Contact][38]\n\n# Careers\n\n# Careers at Litron Lasers\n\nLitron is all about its people; our great people make us a great company. We are a vibrant company\nseeking motivated people looking to develop their careers in the fast-growing international laser\nindustry. We encourage an open and flexible team atmosphere that promotes innovation and continuous\nimprovement. Our success is built on the outstanding abilities of our people right across the\nbusiness from Research & Development and manufacturing to support and sales.\n\nIf you are looking for a career that will really challenge and empower you, whilst providing rewards\nfor success, then Litron could just be the perfect choice.\n\n# Opportunities and careers at Litron Lasers\n\nLitron Lasers is one of the world\u2019s leading solid state laser manufacturers. Our lasers find\nwidespread use in a multitude of scientific and industrial applications worldwide.\n\nBased in Rugby, England, we are a vibrant company seeking motivated people looking to develop their\ncareers in the fast growing international laser industry.\n\nAs part of Litron\u2019s continued expansion and growth we are looking for exceptional individuals to\njoin our established research & development, laser test, electrical & mechanical engineering and\nsales teams.\n\nLitron designs and manufacturers all aspects of its products in-house and with an expanding product\nrange there are a number of exciting vacancies available to the right candidates.\n\n*Litron Lasers operates an equal opportunity policy and welcomes applications from people of all\ndiverse backgrounds.*\n\n[Careers for experienced professionals]\n\n### Fresh Graduates / PhD\n\nLooking for your first step into industry that can lead to a rewarding and satisfying career?\nCheck out our job opportunities and discover what it\u2019s like to work for a dynamic technology company\nlike Litron Lasers.\n\n[Careers for graduates]\n\n### Experienced Professionals\n\nRegardless of your previous industry, for talented, value-giving professionals we offer a\nchallenging, free flowing, innovative and empowering environment conducive to continuous personal\nand professional growth.\n\nOur Vacancies\n\nBefore you apply for a vacancy with us, please take some time to review our [Job Applicant Privacy\nNotice][39], which gives important information about how we store and use candidate data.\n\n**Additional Information relating to all Litron Lasers\u2019 vacancies.**\n\nAll candidates must be eligible to work and live in the UK.\n\nCopies of Visa and Passport will be requested, as well as, evidence of a current valid driving\nlicence if required.\n\nLitron Lasers operates an equal opportunity policy and welcomes applications from people of all\ndiverse backgrounds.\n\n**All these positions are site based in Rugby.**\n\n## [NEW Electrical & Mechanical Fitters][40]\n\nLitron Lasers is one of the world\u2019s leading solid-state laser manufacturers. Our lasers find\nwidespread use in a multitude of scientific and industrial applications worldwide. The company\nrequires experienced and competent Electrical & Mechanical Fitters with the...\n\n[read more][41]\n\n## [NEW Quality Assurance Inspector][42]\n\nPermanent Full-Time position, office based in Rugby. Litron Lasers is one of the world\u2019s leading\nsolid-state laser manufacturers. Our lasers find widespread use in a multitude of scientific and\nindustrial applications worldwide. About the Role We are seeking a...\n\n[read more][43]\n\n## [NEW Laser Test Engineer][44]\n\nFull Time Permanent Position \u2013 Rugby Based The Laser Test Engineer will be required to test laser\nsystems in a laboratory production environment, and will be primarily responsible for execution,\ndevelopment, calibration and documentation of a range of high power diode...\n\n[read more][45]\n\n## [NEW Manufacturing & Production Manager][46]\n\nPermanent Full-Time position, office based in Rugby. Litron Lasers is one of the world\u2019s leading\nsolid-state laser manufacturers. Our lasers find widespread use in a multitude of scientific and\nindustrial applications worldwide. About the Role We are seeking an...\n\n[read more][47]\n\n## [NEW Semiconductor Packaging Technical Manager][48]\n\nSemiconductor Packaging Technical Manager Rugby, Warwickshire Litron Lasers is one of the world\u2019s\nleading solid-state laser manufacturers. Our lasers find widespread use in a multitude of scientific\nand industrial applications worldwide. The company is looking to...\n\n[read more][49]\n\n## [NEW Semiconductor Assembly & Test Technician][50]\n\nSemiconductor Assembly & Test Technician Rugby, Warwickshire Litron Lasers is one of the world\u2019s\nleading solid-state laser manufacturers. Our lasers find widespread use in a multitude of scientific\nand industrial applications worldwide. The company requires a...\n\n[read more][51]\n\n### If you are interested in any vacancies, please get in touch with us using the form below.\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nPlease Indicate Which Vacancy You Are Applying For *\nUpload CV *Please upload your CV in PDF format\nChoose FileNo file chosenDelete uploaded file\nMessage / Comments\nSubmit\n\n[LEGAL NOTICE][52]\n\n[PRIVACY NOTICE][53]\n\n[COOKIE NOTICE][54]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright Litron Lasers 2026 All Rights Reserved | ISO 9001:2015 Certified Web Site by [ Mulberry\nDesign][55]\nLitron Lasers only uses anonymous analytical/performance cookies on this site. If you are unhappy\nwith this use of cookies, you can disable their use in your browser settings. See our cookie policy\nfor more information.OkPrivacy policy\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@litron.co.uk\n[2]: https://www.litronlasers.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/\n[5]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/compact-lasers/\n[6]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-compact-lasers/\n[7]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-lasers/\n[8]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/ultra-high-energy-lasers/\n[9]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/dpss-pulsed-lasers/\n[10]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/q-switched-high-repetition-rate-dpss-lasers/\n[11]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/lasers-for-piv/\n[12]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/tunable-pulsed-lasers/\n[13]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/custom-laser-systems/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/\n[16]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/piv-visualisation/\n[17]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/spectroscopy-libs/\n[18]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/remote-sensing-lidar/\n[19]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/scientific-research/\n[20]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/lcd-semiconductor/\n[21]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/laser-pump-source/\n[22]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/photoacoustic-imaging/\n[23]: https://www.litronlasers.com/laser-applications/surface-processing-ablation/\n[24]: https://www.litronlasers.com/technical-notes/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/about/\n[27]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/distributors/\n[28]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/upcoming-events/\n[29]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/careers/\n[30]: https://litronlasers.egnyte.com/subDomainLogin.do#username\n[31]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/find-us/\n[32]: #\n[33]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/service-centers/\n[34]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/spares-consumables/\n[35]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-form/\n[36]: https://www.litronlasers.com/services/rma-shipping-policy/\n[37]: https://www.litronlasers.com/news/\n[38]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/contact/\n[39]: https://www.litronlasers.com/company/careers/job-applicant-privacy-notice/\n[40]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-electrical-mechanical-fitters/\n[41]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-electrical-mechanical-fitters/\n[42]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-quality-assurance-inspector/\n[43]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-quality-assurance-inspector/\n[44]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-laser-test-engineer/\n[45]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-laser-test-engineer/\n[46]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-manufacturing-production-manager/\n[47]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-manufacturing-production-manager/\n[48]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-semiconductor-packaging-technical-manager-2/\n[49]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-semiconductor-packaging-technical-manager-2/\n[50]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-semiconductor-packaging-technical-manager/\n[51]: https://www.litronlasers.com/new-semiconductor-packaging-technical-manager/\n[52]: /legal\n[53]: /privacy\n[54]: /cookie\n[55]: http://mulberry-design.co.uk"
