      "key_products": "High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J, Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J, Custom Laser Systems",
      "polished_summary": "Litron Lasers specializes in the design and manufacture of high-performance laser systems tailored for a wide range of applications, including scientific research, industrial manufacturing, and semiconductor production. Their product offerings include compact lasers, high-energy lasers, and custom laser systems, supported by authorized service centers and original spare parts. With a focus on precision and innovation, Litron serves diverse industries such as remote sensing, surface processing, and photoacoustic imaging.",
