      "company_summary": "NP Photonics specializes in the development and manufacturing of advanced specialty fiber lasers, fiber amplifiers, and transport fibers tailored for the near- and mid-infrared wavelength bands. Their product offerings include robust single frequency lasers, high-power continuous wave lasers, and customizable fiber amplifier modules, designed to meet the needs of industrial applications. With a focus on stability and reliability, NP Photonics serves a diverse range of markets requiring cutting-edge laser and fiber solutions.",
