ASER SYSTEMS][7]\n* [SHORT-LENGTH FIBER AMPLIFIERS][8]\n* [INJECTION SEEDERS][9]\n* [ASE SOURCES][10]\n* [MID-IR FIBERS & SOURCES][11]\n* [\n\nAPPLICATIONS\n\n][12]\n* [ACOUSTIC SENSING][13]\n* [OPTICAL TRAPPING][14]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL SENSING][15]\n* [LIDAR][16]\n* [COHERENT COMMUNICATIONS][17]\n* [\n\nCAPABILITIES\n\n][18]\n* [ITAR][19]\n* [CORE TECHNOLOGIES][20]\n* [INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY][21]\n* [PUBLICATIONS][22]\n* [\n\nABOUT US\n\n][23]\n* [LEADERSHIP][24]\n* [CAREERS][25]\n* [CORONAVIRUS RESPONSE][26]\n* CONTACT US\n* [REQUEST A QUOTE][27]\n* [TECHNICAL SUPPORT][28]\n* [DISTRIBUTORS][29]\n* More\n\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n#### The Team\n\nThe highly accomplished members of our management team bring many decades of leadership\nand industry experience to the organization, and share in our goal of supplying NP Photonics\ncustomers with advanced, high-performance optical products and subsystems.\n\n###### NP Photonics Leadership\n\n###### Arturo\n\n###### Chavez-Pirson\n\n[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.08.50 PM.png]\n\nT. 123-456-7890\n* [[White LinkedIn Icon]][30]\n* [[White Google+ Icon]][31]\n* [[White Twitter Icon]][32]\n\n[Chief Technology Officer][33]\n\n[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.08.50 PM.png]\n[[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.04.43 PM.png]][34]\n\n[VP of Engineering][35]\n\n[[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.04.43 PM.png]][36]\n\n###### Jie\n###### Zong\n\n[Chief Executive Officer][37]\n\n[Naser_Partovi_edited.jpg]\n\n###### Naser\n###### Partovi\n\n###### NP Photonics Board of Directors\n\n[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.06.31 PM.png]\n\n###### Nasser Peyghambarian\n\nT. 123-456-7890\n* [[White LinkedIn Icon]][38]\n* [[White Google+ Icon]][39]\n* [[White Twitter Icon]][40]\n\n[Chairman of the Board][41]\n\n[[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.06.31 PM.png]][42]\n\n###### Nasser\n###### Peyghambarian\n\n## Naser\n## Partovi\n\n## Chief Executive Officer\n\n## Arturo\n## Chavez-Pirson\n\n## Chief Technology Officer\n* [[LinkedIn - White Circle]][43]\n\