          {
            "url": "https://npphotonics.com/leadership",
            "text": "top of page\n[[NP-Photonics-Logo-C5.png]][1]\n\n## Designed for Industrial operation\n* [HOME][2]\n* [PRODUCTS][3]\n* [SINGLE FREQUENCY LASERS][4]\n* [HIGH POWER CW LASERS][5]\n* [HIGH ENERGY LASERS][6]\n* [MULTI-CHANNEL LASER SYSTEMS][7]\n* [SHORT-LENGTH FIBER AMPLIFIERS][8]\n* [INJECTION SEEDERS][9]\n* [ASE SOURCES][10]\n* [MID-IR FIBERS & SOURCES][11]\n* [APPLICATIONS][12]\n* [ACOUSTIC SENSING][13]\n* [OPTICAL TRAPPING][14]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL SENSING][15]\n* [LIDAR][16]\n* [COHERENT COMMUNICATIONS][17]\n* [CAPABILITIES][18]\n* [ITAR][19]\n* [CORE TECHNOLOGIES][20]\n* [INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY][21]\n* [PUBLICATIONS][22]\n* [ABOUT US][23]\n* [LEADERSHIP][24]\n* [CAREERS][25]\n* [CORONAVIRUS RESPONSE][26]\n* CONTACT US\n* [REQUEST A QUOTE][27]\n* [TECHNICAL SUPPORT][28]\n* [DISTRIBUTORS][29]\n\n#### The Team\n\nThe highly accomplished members of our management team bring many decades of leadership\nand industry experience to the organization, and share in our goal of supplying NP Photonics\ncustomers with advanced, high-performance optical products and subsystems.\n\n###### NP Photonics Leadership\n\n###### Arturo\n\n###### Chavez-Pirson\n\n[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.08.50 PM.png]\n\n[Chief Technology Officer][30]\n\n###### Jie\n###### Zong\n\n[[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.04.43 PM.png]][31]\n\n[VP of Engineering][32]\n\n[Naser_Partovi_edited.jpg]\n\n###### Naser\n###### Partovi\n\n[Chief Executive Officer][33]\n\n###### NP Photonics Board of Directors\n\n[Chairman of the Board][34]\n\n[[Screen Shot 2018-08-28 at 9.06.31 PM.png]][35]\n\n###### Nasser\n###### Peyghambarian\n\n## Naser\n## Partovi\n\n## Chief Executive Officer\n\n## Arturo\n## Chavez-Pirson\n\n## Chief Technology Officer\n\n[[NP-Photonics-Logo-C5.png]][36]\n* [[LinkedIn - White Circle]][37]\n][38]\n][39]\n\n9030 S Rita Ranch Rd #120\n\nTucson, AZ 85747\n\n[520-799-7400][40]\n\n[info@npphotonics.com][41]\n\n][42]\nContact Us\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.npphotonics.com\n[2]: h