      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Oem Laser, operating under Elite Optoelectronics Co., Ltd., is a leading global manufacturer and provider of laser solutions, specializing in high-stability lasers, uniform line lasers, and industrial laser modules. Their products are widely utilized across various sectors, including biomedical equipment, machine vision, 3D scanning, and industrial applications, ensuring precision and efficiency in diverse technological environments. With a strong focus on customization and innovation, Oem Laser is committed to delivering tailored solutions that meet the specific needs of its clients.",
