      "key_products": "QCW DPSS Laser Module; CW DPSS Laser Module; Diode Lasers; CW/QCW Laser Power Supply; DPSS Laser Repair & Refurbishment; Crystal Metallization & Welding Services; Beauty Machines",
      "polished_summary": "Oriental Laser specializes in the development and manufacturing of advanced laser equipment and beauty machines, catering to both aesthetic applications and industrial solutions. The company offers a range of products, including high-performance laser modules, power supplies, and repair services, targeting industrial and commercial users as well as beauty clinics and professionals. With a commitment to innovation, Oriental Laser provides cutting-edge technology designed to meet the diverse needs of its clients.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Oriental Laser primarily focuses on aesthetic applications and beauty machines rather than high energy laser systems for industrial or military applications. Their products, while involving lasers, are not directly aligned with the high energy laser market.",
