      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "distributor",
      "company_summary": "Radiance Technologies is a leading provider of innovative solutions that enhance mission effectiveness for the Intelligence Community and Department of Defense. Specializing in areas such as intelligence analysis, cyber operations, directed energy systems, artificial intelligence, hypersonics, and space technologies, the company is dedicated to delivering technological advantages and operational superiority in an evolving defense landscape. With a commitment to employee ownership and a culture of trust, Radiance Technologies prioritizes partnerships that address complex challenges faced by its customers.",
      "operational_presence": "[Learn More][37] ## RADIANCE IN THE NEWS ## [Radiance Technologies Acquires Verus Research to Enhance Capabilities and Grow Customer ## Base][38] [Read More]...; We are singularly focused on providing our customers with game-changing solutions to\\ntheir most challenging requirements.\\n\\n[Learn Mo...",
      "data_sources": "discovery=ddgs_bing | enrichment=smart_crawl | fetch=ddgs_extract_fallback | page=https://radiancetech.com/",
