        "crawl_text": "* [Employees][1]\n* [Contact][2]\n[ [Radiance Technologies] ][3]\n* [Who We Are][4]\n  * [About Us][5]\n  * [Employee-Ownership][6]\n  * [Locations][7]\n* [What We Do][8]\n  * [Capabilities][9]\n    * [Intelligence][10]\n    * [Cyber][11]\n    * [Directed Energy][12]\n    * [AI/ML][13]\n    * [Hypersonics][14]\n    * [Space][15]\n  * [Radiance University][16]\n    * [AFSIM Training][17]\n  * [Radiance Gives][18]\n  * [Innovation Bowl][19]\n* [Contracts][20]\n  * [Vehicles][21]\n  * [PO Terms & Conditions][22]\n  * [Quality][23]\n* [News][24]\n* [Careers][25]\n* [Our Partners][26]\n  * [Phased n Research][27]\n  * [Verus Research][28]\n  * [Radiance Ignite Technologies][29]\n  * [Bright Path Research][30]\nSelect Page\n\n# CONCEPTS TO CAPABILITIES\n\n## OUR PROMISES\n\n\ue033\n\n###### Priority\n\nWe will always prioritize partnering with you to enhance your mission over enhancing our bottom line\n\ue0a1\n\n###### People\n\nOur employee-owners can be trusted and they trust their teammates to do the \u201cright thing\u201d\n\ue0fd\n\n###### Culture\n\nWe will always endeavor to provide solutions to what others call impossible\n\n## OUR SOLUTIONS\n\nWe provide innovative solutions to our customers' greatest challenges. Our customers operate in an\nenvironment where adversaries are constantly evolving and rapidly advancing. Radiance solutions\nprovide technological advantage and operational superiority for our nation.\n\n### Intelligence\n\n\nWe provide Intelligence analysis and warfighter support to the Intelligence Community and Department\nof Defense to enable effective military operations and protect our troops from harm. We specialize\nin Intelligence analysis of threat systems across the land, sea, air, space and cyberspace domains.\nWe use our expertise in engineering, technical data analysis, and exploitation, to help our\ncustomers assess the operational capabilities, performance, effectiveness, and vulnerabilities of\nforeign weapon systems and activities.\n\n[Learn more][31]\n\n### Cyber\n\n\nRadiance applies our cyber capabilities in novel and unique ways to support the Intelligence\nCommunity, armed services, research laboratories, and test ranges. At our founding, we focused on\nperforming vulnerability and capability assessments of complex weapon systems and their unique\nsoftware and hardware. Over the last 20 years, we\u2019ve expanded to include all aspects of cyber\noperations with a specialty in systems not covered by traditional cyber methods, tools, and\ntechniques.\n\n[Learn more][32]\n\n### Directed Energy\n\n\u00a0\n\nDirected Energy, including both high energy lasers (HEL) and high power microwave (HPM), has become\none of the U.S. military\u2019s key modernization weapons strategies. Radiance Technologies has been at\nthe forefront of this directed energy push with our role as developer and integrator of key,\ncritical technical components, system analytics, propagation, lethality, and live fire operations\nand tests.\u00a0\n\n[Learn more][33]\n\n### Artificial Intelligence / Machine Learning\n\nExtensive background in applying AI/ML techniques to large scale, high throughput sensor data to\nextract real time targeting information for the warfighter.\u00a0 Extensions into deep learning and novel\narchitectures to address both analysis of big data repositories and time critical information.\n\n[Learn more][34]\n\n### Hypersonics\n\n\nSince the early 2000s, the\u00a0DoD\u00a0has pursued hypersonic weapons development as a part of the\nconventional Prompt Global Strike Program. These efforts are accelerating in response to advances of\nglobal peer capabilities. Radiance is proud to be part of the accelerated effort to field both U.S.\ncapability and counter threat hypersonic systems. We are part of the Army\u2019s effort to field a\nland-based hypersonic missile. We also support efforts to understand and counter adversary\ncapabilities.\n\n[Learn more][35]\n\n### Space\n\n\nWe provide\u00a0Space solutions and warfighter support to\u00a0DoD and NASA customers. We use our expertise\nin\u00a0space-based communication,\u00a0space-based technologies,\u00a0ISR, and\u00a0assured PNT\u00a0to help our customers\ndeliver solutions * [Employees][1]\n* [Contact][2]\n[ [Radiance Technologies] ][3]\n* [Who We Are][4]\n  * [About Us][5]\n  * [Employee-Ownership][6]\n  * [Locations][7]\n* [What We Do][8]\n  * [Capabilities][9]\n    * [Intelligence][10]\n    * [Cyber][11]\n    * [Directed Energy][12]\n    * [AI/ML][13]\n    * [Hypersonics][14]\n    * [Space][15]\n  * [Radiance University][16]\n    * [AFSIM Training][17]\n  * [Radiance Gives][18]\n  * [Innovation Bowl][19]\n* [Contracts][20]\n  * [Vehicles][21]\n  * [PO Terms & Conditions][22]\n  * [Quality][23]\n* [News][24]\n* [Careers][25]\n* [Our Partners][26]\n  * [Phased n Research][27]\n  * [Verus Research][28]\n  * [Radiance Ignite Technologies][29]\n  * [Bright Path Research][30]\nSelect Page\n\n# CONCEPTS TO CAPABILITIES\n\n## OUR PROMISES\n\n\ue033\n\n###### Priority\n\nWe will always prioritize partnering with you to enhance your mission over enhancing our bottom line\n\ue0a1\n\n###### People\n\nOur employee-owners can be trusted and they trust their teammates to do the \u201cright thing\u201d\n\ue0fd\n\n###### Culture\n\nWe will always endeavor to provide solutions to what others call impossible\n\n## OUR SOLUTIONS\n\nWe provide innovative solutions to our customers' greatest challenges. Our customers operate in an\nenvironment where adversaries are constantly evolving and rapidly advancing. Radiance solutions\nprovide technological advantage and operational superiority for our nation.\n\n### Intelligence\n\n\nWe provide Intelligence analysis and warfighter support to the Intelligence Community and Department\nof Defense to enable effective military operations and protect our troops from harm. We specialize\nin Intelligence analysis of threat systems across the land, sea, air, space and cyberspace domains.\nWe use our expertise in engineering, technical data analysis, and exploitation, to help our\ncustomers assess the operational capabilities, performance, effectiveness, and vulnerabilities of\nforeign weapon systems and activities.\n\n[Learn more][31]\n\n### Cyber\n\n\nRadiance applies our cyber capabilities in novel and unique ways to support the Intelligence\nCommunity, armed services, research laboratories, and test ranges. At our founding, we focused on\nperforming vulnerability and capability assessments of complex weapon systems and their unique\nsoftware and hardware. Over the last 20 years, we\u2019ve expanded to include all aspects of cyber\noperations with a specialty in systems not covered by traditional cyber methods, tools, and\ntechniques.\n\n[Learn more][32]\n\n### Directed Energy\n\n\u00a0\n\nDirected Energy, including both high energy lasers (HEL) and high power microwave (HPM), has become\none of the U.S. military\u2019s key modernization weapons strategies. Radiance Technologies has been at\nthe forefront of this directed energy push with our role as developer and integrator of key,\ncritical technical components, system analytics, propagation, lethality, and live fire operations\nand tests.\u00a0\n\n[Learn more][33]\n\n### Artificial Intelligence / Machine Learning\n\nExtensive background in applying AI/ML techniques to large scale, high throughput sensor data to\nextract real time targeting information for the warfighter.\u00a0 Extensions into deep learning and novel\narchitectures to address both analysis of big data repositories and time critical information.\n\n[Learn more][34]\n\n### Hypersonics\n\n\nSince the early 2000s, the\u00a0DoD\u00a0has pursued hypersonic weapons development as a part of the\nconventional Prompt Global Strike Program. These efforts are accelerating in response to advances of\nglobal peer capabilities. Radiance is proud to be part of the accelerated effort to field both U.S.\ncapability and counter threat hypersonic systems. We are part of the Army\u2019s effort to field a\nland-based hypersonic missile. We also support efforts to understand and counter adversary\ncapabilities.\n\n[Learn more][35]\n\n### Space\n\n\nWe provide\u00a0Space solutions and warfighter support to\u00a0DoD and NASA customers. We use our expertise\nin\u00a0space-based communication,\u00a0space-based technologies,\u00a0ISR, and\u00a0assured PNT\u00a0to help our customers\ndeliver solutions and sustaining technologies that give our\u00a0nation\u00a0the decisive edge.\u00a0\n\n[Learn more][36]\n\n## Employee-Ownership\n\nRadiance is a proud employee-owned company! Employee-ownership has benefits to our customers and\nworkforce. We are singularly focused on providing our customers with game-changing solutions to\ntheir most challenging requirements.\n\n[Learn More][37]\n\n## RADIANCE IN THE NEWS\n\n## [Radiance Technologies Acquires Verus Research to Enhance Capabilities and Grow Customer\n## Base][38]\n\n[Read More][39]\n\n## [Radiance Technologies Strengthens Innovation Capability with Strategic Acquisition of Phased n\n## Research][40]\n\n[Read More][41]\n\n## Radiance Breaks Ground on Phase II Facility in Huntsville\n\nFrom WAAY TV news\n\n## Radiance Announces Independence Bowl Sponsorship\n\nFrom NBC 6 KTAL news\n\n## CEO Bill Bailey Announces Independence Bowl Sponsorship\n\nFrom NBC KTAL 6 news\n\n## Radiance Technologies New Title Sponsor for Independence Bowl\n\nFrom ABC KTBS 3 news\n\n## Radiance Partners with Auburn University for Engineering Program\n\nFrom ABC WAAY 31 news\n\n## Classes Begin At Radiance University\n\nFrom ABC WAAY 31 news\n\n## CUSTOMER TESTIMONIALS\n\n###### **\u201cRadiance has continuously provided INSCOM with a team of highly skilled analysts who\n###### perform critical wartime missions.\u201d**\n\n\u00a0\n\n*\u2013 116th MI BDE Commander*\n\n###### **\u201cRadiance has assembled a world class caliber of scientists and engineers\u00a0supporting my\n###### high energy laser science\u00a0and technology development, maturation,\u00a0and demonstration\n###### activities.\u201d**\n\n\u00a0\n\n*\u2013 Chief, High Energy Laser\u00a0Division, U.S. Army SMDC Technical Center*\n\n###### **\u201cRadiance has been instrumental in the successful management of aviation assets during the\n###### past several years and critical to wartime mission.\u201d**\n\n****\n\n*\u2013 INSCOM G3 AISR Division Director*\n\n## Join the Radiance Team\n\nWe believe that our employees drive the success of the company. We strive to create and provide an\nenvironment that offers challenging, stimulating and financially rewarding opportunities.\n\n[Apply Now][42]\n\n## OUR CUSTOMERS AND PARTNERS\n\n### Contact Us\n* Name\n  This field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\n  First Last\n* Email*\n  Enter Email Confirm Email\n* Subject*\n  GeneralCapabilitiesContractsHuman ResourcesMarketingAFSIM\n  Please select from the dropdown list the subject of your inquiry. This will ensure that the\n  correct personnel responds to you.\n* Which Capability?*\n  IntelligenceCyberDirected EnergyArtificial Intelligence / Machine\n  LearningMicroelectronicsHypersonicsSpace\n* Which Contract?*\n  ReMOTe Table & J-CableGSA Multiple Award SchedulesGSA Information Technology ServicesOASISAMCOM\n  EXPRESSOther Contract\n* Message*\n* CAPTCHA\n\n#### Who We Are\n* [Employee-Ownership][43]\n* [Our Culture][44]\n* [Our Values][45]\n* [Our Promises][46]\n* [Our Locations][47]\n* [Our History][48]\n\n#### What We Do\n* [Intelligence][49]\n* [Cyber][50]\n* [Directed Energy][51]\n* [Artificial Intelligence / Machine Learning][52]\n* [Hypersonics][53]\n* [Space][54]\n\n#### Stay Connected\n* [Careers][55]\n* [News][56]\n* [Contact][57]\n* [ Facebook ][58]\n* [ Twitter ][59]\n* [ Linkedin ][60]\n* [ Instagram ][61]\n\n\u00a9 2026 \u2013 Radiance Technologies, Inc. \u2013 All Rights Reserved - EOE/Disabled\n[The owner of this website has made a commitment to accessibility and inclusion, please report any\nproblems that you encounter using the contact form on this website. This site uses the WP ADA\nCompliance Check plugin to enhance accessibility.][62]\n\n[1]: https://www.radiancetech.com/employee-quick-links/\n[2]: https://www.radiancetech.com/contact/\n[3]: https://www.radiancetech.com/\n[4]: https://www.radiancetech.com/who-we-are/\n[5]: https://www.radiancetech.com/who-we-are/\n[6]: https://www.radiancetech.com/employee-ownership/\n[7]: https://www.radiancetech.com/locations/\n[8]: https://www.radiancetech.com/radiance-capabilities/\n[9]: https://www.radiancetech.com/radiance-capabilities/\n[10]: https://www.radiancetech.com/intel/\n[11]: https://www.ra"
