      "company_summary": "RPMC Lasers is a leading OEM laser partner specializing in high-quality laser solutions, offering a diverse range of products including diode-pumped solid-state lasers, fiber lasers, and customized laser diodes. The company caters to OEM integrators, researchers, and industrial applications, providing innovative and reliable laser technologies designed for various sectors such as medical, aerospace, and defense. With a commitment to precision and efficiency, RPMC Lasers delivers both off-the-shelf and fully customized laser systems to meet the unique needs of its clients.",
