        "crawl_text": "RPMC Lasers, Inc. Compliant with industry standards LFW Innovator\u2019s Gold Awards: 2018, 2019, 2020 2024 Review of Spectroscopic Instrumentation Highlighted Product 8495 Veterans Memorial Pkwy, O'Fallon, MO 63366 [ [Solid State Lasers and Laser Diodes from RPMC Lasers Inc] ][1]\n* [ Contact Us][2]\n* [636-272-7227][3]\n[ ][4] [ BUY NOW ][5]\nMENUMENU\nMENUMENU\nMENUMENU\n* [Products][6]\n* * * [Laser Diodes][7]\n* [Free-Space - Multimode][8]\n* [Free-Space - Single Mode][9]\n* [Free-Space - Stabilized][10]\n* [Fiber-Coupled - Multimode][11]\n* [Fiber-Coupled - Single Mode][12]\n* [Fiber-Coupled - Stabilized][13]\n* [Custom Laser Diodes][14]\n* * [CW Lasers][15]\n* [Multimode Modules][16]\n* [Single Mode Modules][17]\n* [Stabilized Modules][18]\n* [Multi-Wavelength Combiners][19]\n* [Custom CW Lasers][20]\n* * [Pulsed Lasers][21]\n* [DPSS Lasers][22]\n* [Fiber Lasers][23]\n* [Nanosecond Lasers][24]\n* [Picosecond Lasers][25]\n* [Femtosecond Lasers][26]\n* [Micromachining Systems][27]\n* [Custom Pulsed Lasers][28]\n* * [Optical Amplifiers][29]\n* [DPSS Amplifiers][30]\n* [Fiber Amplifiers][31]\n* [Semiconductor Optical Amplifier][32]\n* [Custom Amplifiers][33]\n* [Applications][34]\n* * * [Defense & Aerospace][35]\n* [Space-Based Applications][36]\n* [Remote Sensing & Imaging][37]\n* [Targeting & Ranging][38]\n* [Laser Illuminators][39]\n* * [Industrial & Manufacturing][40]\n* [Material Processing & Surface Modification][41]\n* [Joining Processes][42]\n* [Display & Electronics Manufacturing][43]\n* [Communication & Data Transmission][44]\n* [Sensing, Measurement & Characterization][45]\n* * [Medical & Healthcare][46]\n* [Aesthetics][47]\n* [Dental][48]\n* [Photodynamic Therapy (PDT)][49]\n* * [Research & Biophotonics][50]\n* [Imaging & Analysis][51]\n* [Measurement & Analysis][52]\n* [Molecular Manipulation & Analysis][53]\n* [Spectroscopy & Analysis][54]\n* [Pump Lasers][55]\n* [Seed Lasers][56]\n* [Optical Amplifiers][57]\n* [About][58]\n* [RPMC Lasers][59]\n* [Our Manufacturers][60]\n* [Custom Services][61]\n* [Distributors][62]\n* [FAQs][63]\n* [Knowledge Center][64]\n* [Solution Examples][65]\n* [White Papers][66]\n* [Blog][67]\n* [FAQs][68]\n* [Lasers 101][69]\n* [Press Releases][70]\n\n# About RPMC\n\n### As your trusted OEM laser partner, RPMC Lasers simplifies your journey by reducing stress,\n### saving time, and guiding you to the ideal laser solution for your next project.\n\n**Our skilled team of product and account managers are dedicated to helping you find the perfect\nlaser for any application \u2013 backed by nearly three decades of experience and strong ties with\ntop-tier manufacturers.**\n\n### Our Expertise:\n* 29+ years of industry knowledge, providing expert advice and reliable support\n* In-depth knowledge of diode lasers, CW and pulsed lasers, and laser amplifiers\n* Long-term partnerships with industry-leading laser manufacturers\n* Custom application-driven solutions tailored to your specific needs\n* Extensive experience with Medical and Defense industry certifications\n\n#### Let Us Help Find Your Solution Today!\n\n[ Get Started Now!][71]\n\nRPMC Lasers is your strategic partner and trusted source for high-quality laser solutions. Whether\nyou require off-the-shelf lasers, fully customized designs, or expert technical guidance, we offer\nthe expertise, reliability, and support necessary to ensure you find the right laser at the right\nprice.\n\n### What We Offer:\n* A small-team approach, delivering personalized attention, fast & honest answers\n* A single point of contact for a streamlined experience\n* Access to 10,000+ standard laser diodes and solid-state lasers\n* 100+ laser options in stock and ready to ship\n* U.S.-made solutions for many applications, avoiding tariffs & international shipping issues\n* Just-in-time delivery options and buffer stock management\n* High-Capacity Manufacturing for large-scale projects\n* Direct collaboration with the manufacturer\u2019s engineering team to tackle your toughest challenges\n* Ensures alignment, efficiency, and a focus on your success\n* Access to the manufacturer\u2019s application lab and demo units, when available\n\n### RPMC Lasers \u2013 The Lasers You Need from the People You Trust\n\nThe following [standard terms and conditions][72] shall govern the sale by RPMC of all products to\nall buyers. Terms set forth in separate documents such as quotations shall supersede these. Buyer\naccepts that his contract is contingent upon acceptance of the terms of this contract. Nothing the\nbuyer submits will be binding upon RPMC unless it is specifically accepted in writing.\n\n[RPMC Standard Terms and Conditions][73]\n\n[RPMC Refund & Return Policy][74]\n\n[RPMC Privacy Policy][75]\n\n[[Solid State Lasers and Laser Diodes from RPMC Lasers Inc]][76]\n[Contact us][77]\n636-272-7227\n[[email protected]][78]\nRPMC Lasers, Inc.\n8495 Veterans Memorial Pkwy, O`Fallon, MO 63366\nProducts\n* [Pulsed Lasers][79]\n* [CW Lasers][80]\n* [Laser Diodes][81]\n* [Optical Amplifiers][82]\nCompany\n* [About RPMC][83]\n* [Laser Products][84]\n* [Custom Services][85]\n* [Distributors][86]\n* [Careers][87]\n* [Privacy Policy][88]\nKnowledge Center\n* [Lasers 101][89]\n* [White papers][90]\n* [Blog][91]\n* [FAQs][92]\n* [Laser Series][93]\n* [Markets & Applications][94]\nNewsletter\nSubscribe to our news\nTerms & Conditions | Privacy\n\u00a9 2026 RPMC Lasers\n* [Products][95]\n* [Laser Diodes][96]\n* [Free-Space \u2013 Multimode][97]\n* [Free-Space \u2013 Single Mode][98]\n* [Free-Space \u2013 Stabilized][99]\n* [Fiber-Coupled \u2013 Multimode][100]\n* [Fiber-Coupled \u2013 Single Mode][101]\n* [Fiber-Coupled \u2013 Stabilized][102]\n* [Custom Laser Diodes][103]\n* [CW Lasers][104]\n* [Multimode Modules][105]\n* [Single Mode Modules][106]\n* [Stabilized Modules][107]\n* [Multi-Wavelength Combiners][108]\n* [Custom CW Lasers][109]\n* [Pulsed Lasers][110]\n* [DPSS Lasers][111]\n* [Fiber Lasers][112]\n* [Nanoseco