            "text": "[ [Solid State Lasers and Laser Diodes from RPMC Lasers Inc] ][1]\n* [ Contact Us][2]\n* [636-272-7227][3]\n[ ][4] [ BUY NOW ][5]\nMENUMENU\nMENUMENU\nMENUMENU\n* [Products][6]\n* * * [Laser Diodes][7]\n* [Free-Space - Multimode][8]\n* [Free-Space - Single Mode][9]\n* [Free-Space - Stabilized][10]\n* [Fiber-Coupled - Multimode][11]\n* [Fiber-Coupled - Single Mode][12]\n* [Fiber-Coupled - Stabilized][13]\n* [Custom Laser Diodes][14]\n* * [CW Lasers][15]\n* [Multimode Modules][16]\n* [Single Mode Modules][17]\n* [Stabilized Modules][18]\n* [Multi-Wavelength Combiners][19]\n* [Custom CW Lasers][20]\n* * [Pulsed Lasers][21]\n* [DPSS Lasers][22]\n* [Fiber Lasers][23]\n* [Nanosecond Lasers][24]\n* [Picosecond Lasers][25]\n* [Femtosecond Lasers][26]\n* [Micromachining Systems][27]\n* [Custom Pulsed Lasers][28]\n* * [Optical Amplifiers][29]\n* [DPSS Amplifiers][30]\n* [Fiber Amplifiers][31]\n* [Semiconductor Optical Amplifier][32]\n* [Custom Amplifiers][33]\n* [Applications][34]\n* * * [Defense & Aerospace][35]\n* [Space-Based Applications][36]\n* [Remote Sensing & Imaging][37]\n* [Targeting & Ranging][38]\n* [Laser Illuminators][39]\n* * [Industrial & Manufacturing][40]\n* [Material Processing & Surface Modification][41]\n* [Joining Processes][42]\n* [Display & Electronics Manufacturing][43]\n* [Communication & Data Transmission][44]\n* [Sensing, Measurement & Characterization][45]\n* * [Medical & Healthcare][46]\n* [Aesthetics][47]\n* [Dental][48]\n* [Photodynamic Therapy (PDT)][49]\n* * [Research & Biophotonics][50]\n* [Imaging & Analysis][51]\n* [Measurement & Analysis][52]\n* [Molecular Manipulation & Analysis][53]\n* [Spectroscopy & Analysis][54]\n* [Pump Lasers][55]\n* [Seed Lasers][56]\n* [Optical Amplifiers][57]\n* [About][58]\n* [RPMC Lasers][59]\n* [Our Manufacturers][60]\n* [Custom Services][61]\n* [Distributors][62]\n* [FAQs][63]\n* [Knowledge Center][64]\n* [Solution Examples][65]\n* [White Papers][66]\n* [Blog][67]\n* [FAQs][68]\n* [Lasers 101][69]\n* [Press Releases][70]\n[Solid State Lasers and Laser Diodes from RPMC Lasers Inc][71]\u00bb[Laser Products][72]\u00bbJasper X1:\nHigh-Power Femtosecond Fiber Laser\n* [Printable Page][73]\n* [Email this page][74]\n* [Save to Favorites][75]\n\n# Jasper X1\n\nFiber Laser, fs/ps pulsed, 1030nm, up to 60W, up to 200\u00b5J, <270fs-20ps, Single Shot \u2013 20MHz\n\n### Key Features:\n* Rugged high-power industrial design with scientific performance & precision\n* Truly All-Fiber: SESAM-free\n* Long life & unrivaled stability\n* Extreme shock/vibe resilience\n* Tunable pulse width & rep. rate\n* 5-Year Oscillator Warranty | 2-Year Complete Laser Warranty\n\n**Have a question? Want to try a Demo?**\n\n[ Advice][76]\n[ Quote][77]\n\n[ Datasheet][78]\n\n[ Request a Demo][79]\n[[sleek modern gray colored Jasper X1 high-power all-fiber femtosecond & picosecond laser\noscillator]][80]\n\n### POPULAR CONFIGURATIONS:\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPicture \u2502Par\u2502Part Description \u2502Datas\u2502\n\u2502t \u2502 \u2502heet \u2502\n\u2502Num\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502ber\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25