      "key_products": "Diode-Pumped Solid-State Lasers, Fiber Lasers, Customized Laser Diodes, Nanosecond Lasers, Picosecond Lasers",
      "polished_summary": "RPMC Lasers is a leading OEM laser partner specializing in high-quality laser solutions, offering a diverse range of products including diode-pumped solid-state lasers, fiber lasers, and customized laser diodes. The company caters to OEM integrators, researchers, and industrial applications, providing innovative and reliable laser technologies designed for various sectors such as medical, aerospace, and defense. With a commitment to precision and efficiency, RPMC Lasers delivers both off-the-shelf and fully customized laser systems to meet the unique needs of its clients.",
      "audit_reasoning": "RPMC Lasers specializes in high-quality laser solutions, including diode-pumped solid-state lasers and fiber lasers, which are directly applicable to the high energy laser market. They provide both off-the-shelf and customized laser systems for various sectors, including defense and aerospace, making them a key player in this field.",
