      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "Singlefrequencylaser is a high-tech enterprise specializing in the research, development, and production of advanced solid-state and high-performance fiber laser systems. Their core product offerings include a range of lasers such as Micro-Pulse Lasers, Sub-Nanosecond Lasers, and Single-Frequency Continuous Fiber Lasers, catering to diverse applications in research institutions, industrial sectors, and scientific research. With a commitment to innovation, the company serves markets such as atmospheric lidar, biomedical applications, and precision spectroscopy.",
