            "text": "[ [Techwin Logo] ][1]\n[Home][2] [About][3]\n[Products ][4]\nProduct Categories\n[All Solid-State Laser Series][5] [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][6] [Fiber Laser Series][7]\n[View All Products][8]\n[Applications][9] [Support][10] [Contact][11] Search\n[Home][12] [About][13] [Products][14] [Applications][15] [Support][16] [Contact][17] Search Products\n\n### Search Products\n\n\ud83d\udd0d **Quick search tips:**\n* \u2022 Try \"AOML\" for All Solid-State Lasers\n* \u2022 Search by model number like \"150\" or \"500\"\n* \u2022 Use keywords like \"fiber\", \"single-frequency\", \"nanosecond\"\n\n### Request a Quote\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nMessage (Optional)\nSubmit Request\n\n# About Techwin\n\nLeading provider of advanced solid-state and fiber laser technologies for scientific, industrial,\nand defense applications worldwide.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nTechwin is committed to providing stable, reliable, and cost-effective laser sources for atmospheric\nlidar, biomedical applications, laser spectroscopy, cold atom physics, and quantum physics fields.\n\nWe have deep cooperation with well-known research institutions and industry users both domestically\nand internationally, conducting custom development of laser-related technologies and systems as well\nas batch production of products.\n\n[Techwin Technology]\n\n## R&D Focus Areas\n\nOur key research and development directions\n\n### Advanced Solid-State Laser Technologies\n\nSeed injection, MOPA amplification, fiber+solid hybrid amplification, side-pumped amplification,\nslab amplification, etc.\n\n### High-Power Single-Frequency Fiber Lasers\n\nNarrow linewidth seed source + high-power fiber amplification technology for exceptional\nperformance.\n\n### Efficient Nonlinear Frequency Conversion\n\nPPLN single-pass frequency doubling, LBO/KTP double/triple frequency doubling, Raman, OPO/OPA\ntechnologies.\n\n### Laser Electronics & Opto-Mechanical Integration\n\nTemperature control, driving, timing, optical power monitoring electronics modules and optical\ncommunication systems.\n\n### Optoelectronic Engineering & Process Optimization\n\nLong lifespan, small size, good environmental adaptability, and advanced process research.\n\n### Global Collaboration\n\nCollaborating with international institutions and industry leaders to drive innovation and solve\ncomplex challenges.\n\n[Logo]\n\nAdvanced Solid-State and Fiber Laser Technology Center dedicated to providing stable, reliable, and\ncost-effective laser solutions for scientific, industrial, and defense applications worldwide.\n\nTechnological Innovation \u00b7 Industry Serving the Nation\n\n#### Product Lines\n* [All Solid-State Laser Series][18]\n* [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][19]\n* [Fiber Laser Series][20]\n* [View All Products][21]\n\n#### Company\n* [About Us][22]\n* [R&D][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n* [Support][25]\n\n\u00a9 2025 Techwin Industry Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com\n[2]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com\n[3]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/about\n[4]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products\n[5]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/all-solid-state-laser-series\n[6]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/single-frequency-high-energy-series\n[7]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/fiber-laser-series\n[8]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products\n[9]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/applications\n[10]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/support\n[11]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/contact\n[12]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com\n[13]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/about\n[14]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products\n[15]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/applications\n[16]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/support\n[17]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/contact\n[18]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/all-solid-state-laser-series\n[19]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/single-frequency-high-energy-series\n[20]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/fiber-laser-series\n[21]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products\n[22]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/about\n[23]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/about#technology\n[24]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/contact\n[25]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/support"
