            "url": "https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products/sefl-t-tunable-narrow-linewidth-semiconductor-laser",
            "text": "[ [Techwin Logo] ][1]\n[Home][2] [About][3]\n[Products ][4]\nProduct Categories\n[All Solid-State Laser Series][5] [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][6] [Fiber Laser Series][7]\n[View All Products][8]\n[Applications][9] [Support][10] [Contact][11] Search\n[Home][12] [About][13] [Products][14] [Applications][15] [Support][16] [Contact][17] Search Products\n\n### Search Products\n\n\ud83d\udd0d **Quick search tips:**\n* \u2022 Try \"AOML\" for All Solid-State Lasers\n* \u2022 Search by model number like \"150\" or \"500\"\n* \u2022 Use keywords like \"fiber\", \"single-frequency\", \"nanosecond\"\n\n### Request a Quote\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nMessage (Optional)\nSubmit Request\n1. [Home][18]\n2. /\n3. [Products][19]\n4. /\n5. [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][20]\n6. /\n7. SEFL-T Tunable Narrow-Linewidth Semiconductor Laser\n[NPFL-1550 Nanosecond Fiber Laser]\nSingle-Frequency High-Energy Series\n\n# SEFL-T Tunable Narrow-Linewidth Semiconductor Laser\n\nSEFL-T is a tunable narrow-linewidth semiconductor laser designed for single-frequency,\nhigh-spectral-purity output. It features compact construction, stable performance, and precise\nwavelength control via temperature and current tuning, making it ideal for applications requiring\nhigh energy, low noise, and excellent frequency stability.\n\nGet Quote Now\n\n### Key Features\n* High spectral performance\n* Narrow linewidth\n* Compact and easy to integrate\n* Temperature / current tuning\n\n### Applications\n* LIDAR & Ranging Systems\n* Scientific Research & Laboratories\n* Coherent Detection & Interferometry\n* Fiber Optic Sensing\n\n## Technical Parameters\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2