            "url": "https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products/shsl-uv-series-ultraviolet-raman-all-solid-state-lasers",
            "text": "[ [Techwin Logo] ][1]\n[Home][2] [About][3]\n[Products ][4]\nProduct Categories\n[All Solid-State Laser Series][5] [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][6] [Fiber Laser Series][7]\n[View All Products][8]\n[Applications][9] [Support][10] [Contact][11] Search\n[Home][12] [About][13] [Products][14] [Applications][15] [Support][16] [Contact][17] Search Products\n\n### Search Products\n\n\ud83d\udd0d **Quick search tips:**\n* \u2022 Try \"AOML\" for All Solid-State Lasers\n* \u2022 Search by model number like \"150\" or \"500\"\n* \u2022 Use keywords like \"fiber\", \"single-frequency\", \"nanosecond\"\n\n### Request a Quote\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nMessage (Optional)\nSubmit Request\n1. [Home][18]\n2. /\n3. [Products][19]\n4. /\n5. [All Solid-State Laser Series][20]\n6. /\n7. SHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers\n[SHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers]\nAll Solid-State Laser Series\n\n# SHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers\n\nSHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers The SHSL-UV series ultraviolet Raman\nall-solid-state lasers support multi-wavelength output, including 280 nm, 295 nm, 532 nm, 560 nm,\nand 590 nm. They utilize a Raman crystal\u2013based design, offering a compact structure, high Raman\nconversion efficiency, maintenance-free operation, and long service life. These lasers are designed\nto meet the requirements of complex operating conditions, featuring a stable and reliable structure\nand enabling 24/7 continuous, fault-free operation.\n\nGet Quote Now\n\n### Key Features\n* Semiconductor pumping for long service life\n* Multiwavelength output\n* Continuous 7\u00d724hour operation\n\n### Applications\n* Atmospheric lidar\n* Photoacoustic imaging\n* OCA adhesive processing\n\n## Technical Parameters\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\