500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Structural Dimensions\n\n[SHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers - Structural Diagram 1]\nSHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers - Diagram 1\n[SHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers - Structural Diagram 2]\nSHSL-UV Series Ultraviolet Raman All-Solid-State Lasers - Diagram 2\n\n## Need More Information?\n\nOur technical team is ready to help you find the perfect laser solution for your specific\nrequirements. Get detailed specifications, custom configurations, and expert consultation.\n\nRequest a Quote [ Browse All Products ][21]\n[Logo]\n\nAdvanced Solid-State and Fiber Laser Technology Center dedicated to providing stable, reliable, and\ncost-effective laser solutions for scientific, industrial, and defense applications worldwide.\n\nTechnological Innovation \u00b7 Industry Serving the Nation\n\n#### Product Lines\n* [All Solid-State Laser Series][22]\n* [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][23]\n* [Fiber Laser Series][24]\n* [View All Products][25]\n\n#### Company\n* [About Us][26]\n* [R&D][27]\n* [Contact][28]\n* [Support][29]\n\n\u00a9 2025 Techwin Industry Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com\n[2]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com\n[3]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/about\n[4]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products\n[5]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/all-solid-state-laser-series\n[6]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/single-frequency-high-energy-series\n[7]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/fiber-laser-series\n[8]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/products\n[9]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/applications\n[10]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/support\n[11]: https://singlefrequencylaser.com/contact\n[12]: https://sing