            "text": "[ [Techwin Logo] ][1]\n[Home][2] [About][3]\n[Products ][4]\nProduct Categories\n[All Solid-State Laser Series][5] [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][6] [Fiber Laser Series][7]\n[View All Products][8]\n[Applications][9] [Support][10] [Contact][11] Search\n[Home][12] [About][13] [Products][14] [Applications][15] [Support][16] [Contact][17] Search Products\n\n### Search Products\n\n\ud83d\udd0d **Quick search tips:**\n* \u2022 Try \"AOML\" for All Solid-State Lasers\n* \u2022 Search by model number like \"150\" or \"500\"\n* \u2022 Use keywords like \"fiber\", \"single-frequency\", \"nanosecond\"\n\n### Request a Quote\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nMessage (Optional)\nSubmit Request\n1. [Home][18]\n2. /\n3. [Products][19]\n4. /\n5. [Fiber Laser Series][20]\n6. /\n7. SPFL Series 1550 nm Single-Frequency Pulsed Fiber Lasers\n[SPFL Series 1550 nm Single-Frequency Pulsed Fiber Lasers]\nFiber Laser Series\n\n# SPFL Series 1550 nm Single-Frequency Pulsed Fiber Lasers\n\nThe SPFL series lasers are divided into two models based on single-pulse energy (10 \u03bcJ and 300 \u03bcJ):\nSPFL-10 and SPFL-300. This series is specifically developed for coherent Doppler wind lidar\napplications, operating in an eye-safe laser wavelength band with a near Fourier-transform-limited\nspectrum. The laser repetition rate, pulse width, and waveform are adjustable, meeting system\nrequirements such as different range resolutions and wind-speed measurement accuracies.\nHigh-precision low-noise current driving and temperature control, high-speed pulse waveform\npre-shaping, suppression of fiber nonlinear optical effects, and spectral noise suppression ensure\nhigh output spectral signal-to-noise ratio, smooth and editable waveforms, and high single-pulse\nenergy. The low-power-consumption design supports long-term outdoor operation under harsh\nenvironmental conditions.\n\nGet Quote Now\n\n### Key Features\n* Singlepulse energy: 10 / 300 \u03bcJ\n* Adjustable pulse width\n* Linewidth as low as 1 kHz\n* High polarization extinction ratio, high spectral signaltonoise ratio, and excellent beam quality\n\n### Applications\n* Coherent Doppler wind lidar\n* Atmospheric environmental laser remote sensing\n* Wind resource assessment and surveying\n* Aerodynamics and environmental science research\n\n## Technical Parameters\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nParameter \u2502Unit \u2502SPFL-10 \u2502SPFL-300\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLinewidth \u2502kHz \u2502\u2264300 \u2502\u22643\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCentral Wavelength \u2502nm \u25021545 / 1550