            "text": "[ [Techwin Logo] ][1]\n[Home][2] [About][3]\n[Products ][4]\nProduct Categories\n[All Solid-State Laser Series][5] [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][6] [Fiber Laser Series][7]\n[View All Products][8]\n[Applications][9] [Support][10] [Contact][11] Search\n[Home][12] [About][13] [Products][14] [Applications][15] [Support][16] [Contact][17] Search Products\n\n### Search Products\n\n\ud83d\udd0d **Quick search tips:**\n* \u2022 Try \"AOML\" for All Solid-State Lasers\n* \u2022 Search by model number like \"150\" or \"500\"\n* \u2022 Use keywords like \"fiber\", \"single-frequency\", \"nanosecond\"\n\n### Request a Quote\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nMessage (Optional)\nSubmit Request\n1. [Home][18]\n2. /\n3. [Products][19]\n4. /\n5. [Fiber Laser Series][20]\n6. /\n7. 780 nm Single-Frequency Continuous-Wave Fiber Lasers / Amplifiers\n[780 nm Single-Frequency Continuous-Wave Fiber Lasers / Amplifiers]\nFiber Laser Series\n\n# 780 nm Single-Frequency Continuous-Wave Fiber Lasers / Amplifiers\n\nThe 780 nm single-frequency continuous-wave fiber laser uses an ultra-narrow linewidth DFB laser as\nthe seed source and achieves power amplification through an all-fiber amplifier. High-power\nfrequency-doubled laser output is obtained using a single-pass periodically poled crystal scheme.\nThis product covers a wavelength range of 765.5\u2013782.5 nm and features narrow linewidth,\nmode-hop-free operation over a wide temperature range and under strong vibration, excellent beam\nquality (M\u00b2 1.5\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25