            "text": "[ [Techwin Logo] ][1]\n[Home][2] [About][3]\n[Products ][4]\nProduct Categories\n[All Solid-State Laser Series][5] [Single-Frequency High-Energy Series][6] [Fiber Laser Series][7]\n[View All Products][8]\n[Applications][9] [Support][10] [Contact][11] Search\n[Home][12] [About][13] [Products][14] [Applications][15] [Support][16] [Contact][17] Search Products\n\n### Search Products\n\n\ud83d\udd0d **Quick search tips:**\n* \u2022 Try \"AOML\" for All Solid-State Lasers\n* \u2022 Search by model number like \"150\" or \"500\"\n* \u2022 Use keywords like \"fiber\", \"single-frequency\", \"nanosecond\"\n\n### Request a Quote\n\nFirst Name *\nLast Name *\nEmail Address *\nContact Number *\nMessage (Optional)\nSubmit Request\n1. [Home][18]\n2. /\n3. [Products][19]\n4. /\n5. [All Solid-State Laser Series][20]\n6. /\n7. AOML Series Micropulse Laser\n[AOML-150 Micro-pulse Laser]\nAll Solid-State Laser Series AOML\n\n# AOML Series Micropulse Laser\n\nAOML series micropulse lasers have the characteristics of high peak power, repetition frequency\nabove kHz and pulse width of 10ns. It adopts an optical solution of end-pumping + acousto-optic\nQ-switching and a fully air-cooled design, which can meet complex working conditions under wide\ntemperatures (-20~60\u2103). The structure is stable and reliable. After long-term customer verification,\nit can achieve 7\u00d724h trouble-free operation.\n\nGet Quote Now\n\n### Key Features\n* Compact structure and high compatibility\n* Wide temperature use, working temperature 20~60\u2103\n* Fully aircooled, industrial grade 7*24 hours design\n* Mature technology, stable and reliable\n\n### Applications\n* Atmospheric particulate matter detection\n* Laser remote sensing and imaging\n* Photoacoustic imaging\n* Laser ultrasound\n\n## Technical Parameters\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250