                "category": "All Solid-State Laser Series",
                "description": "The SHSL-UV series ultraviolet Raman all-solid-state lasers support multi-wavelength output, including 280 nm, 295 nm, 532 nm, 560 nm, and 590 nm. They utilize a Raman crystal\u2013based design, offering a compact structure, high Raman conversion efficiency, maintenance-free operation, and long service life.",
