                "category": "All Solid-State Laser Series",
                "description": "The SMSL series high-energy, low-repetition-rate all-solid-state lasers deliver output energy up to 100 mJ, with wavelengths expandable to 532 nm, 355 nm, and other spectral bands. They adopt an integrated opto-mechatronic design, featuring a compact structure, low power consumption, and a fully air-cooled configuration.",
