                "category": "All Solid-State Laser Series",
                "description": "The SHSL series high-energy, high-repetition-rate all-solid-state lasers operate at a repetition rate of \u2265100 Hz, with maximum output energy exceeding 300 mJ. The wavelength can be extended to 532 nm, 355 nm, and other spectral bands.",
