                "category": "Fiber Laser Series",
                "description": "The SPFL series lasers are divided into two models based on single-pulse energy (10 \u03bcJ and 300 \u03bcJ): SPFL-10 and SPFL-300. This series is specifically developed for coherent Doppler wind lidar applications, operating in an eye-safe laser wavelength band with a near Fourier-transform-limited spectrum.",
