                "category": "Single-Frequency High-Energy Series",
                "description": "The SCSL-type Non-Planar Ring Oscillator (NPRO) lasers use a single laser crystal combined with an external magnetic field to form a unidirectional non-planar ring cavity (Non-Planar Ring Oscillator, NPRO). This design enables narrow linewidth (kHz level), low noise, and high frequency stability, delivering continuous-wave single-frequency laser output.",
