ser: 450ps pulses, 0.7GW peak power and dual-pulse mode for fast,\naccurate tattoo and pigmentation removal. Compatible with Beamtech picosecond accessories and\nmatched power supplies.\n[Peak-Q]\nPeak-Q\nPicosecond Laser\n[Peak-Q II]\nPeak-Q II\nPicosecond Laser\n[Peak-Q III]\nPeak-Q III\nPicosecond-Nanosecond Dual Laser\n[Nimma-LVI]\nNimma-LVI\nNanosecond Pulse Laser\n[Alex-Q]\nAlex-Q\nQ-switched Alexandrite Laser\n[More ][90]\n[Vlite Plus]\nVlite Plus\nHigh repetition rate&high energy Burst mode Nd:YAG solid-state laser\n[Melar]\nMelar\nCustomized High energy Nd: glass pulsed laser\n[Vlite-1000]\nVlite-1000\nHigh-Energy Dual-Pulse Laser System\n[More ][91]\n[$vo['name']]\nWavelength 1064nm532nm355nm266nm527nm755nm\n[$vo['name']]\nPulse Width <1ns1-3ns4-20ns100-1000ns>1us\n[$vo['name']]\nEnergy Range <1mJ1mJ-10mJ10mJ-300mJ400mJ-2J>2J\n[$vo['name']]\nRepetition Rate <1Hz1-10Hz1-20Hz1-100Hz100Hz-1kHz>1kHz>10kHz\nSearch\nReset\n\n## Application Fields\n\nFrontier Scientific Research\n[Frontier Scientific Research][92][Analysis & Testing Instruments][93][Advanced Industrial\nManufacturing][94][Medical & Aesthetic][95]\n[Frontier Scientific Research]\n[Frontier Scientific Research]\nFrontier Scientific Research\n[PLD][96][LIBS][97][OPO Pumping][98][PIV][99]\n[More ][100]\n[Analysis & Testing Instruments]\n[Analysis & Testing Instruments]\nAnalysis & Testing Instruments\n[PIV][101][LIBS][102][Mass Spectrometry][103][LiDAR][104]\n[More ][105]\n[Advanced Industrial Manufacturing]\n[Advanced Industrial Manufacturing]\nAdvanced Industrial Manufacturing\n[LCD/OLED Repair][106][Wafer Annealing][107][Laser Shock Peening][108]\n[More ][109]\n[Medical & Aesthetic]\n[Medical & Aesthetic]\nMedical & Aesthetic\n[Treatment of Pigmentary Skin Disorders][110][Skin Rejuvenation][111][Laser Hair Removal][112][Laser\nVascular Intervention Treatment][113]\n[More ][114]\n\n## News Center\n\nNews & Announcements\n[News & Announcements][115][Product Launch News][116]\n[Beamtech to Exhibit at