      "key_products": "Phoenix, Athena",
      "polished_summary": "Xcimer is at the forefront of laser fusion technology, developing the world's largest and most powerful lasers to commercialize validated fusion energy solutions. Its flagship products, the Phoenix laser fusion system and the Athena laser fusion power plant, aim to provide safe, clean, and affordable energy to industrial energy sectors and energy-intensive industries. By leveraging innovative technologies, Xcimer is poised to revolutionize the energy landscape with cost-competitive alternatives to fossil fuels and renewables.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Xcimer is directly involved in the development and manufacturing of high-energy laser systems specifically for laser fusion technology, including their flagship products, the Phoenix laser fusion system and the Athena laser fusion power plant. Their focus on commercializing laser fusion energy solutions positions them as a key player in the high energy laser market.",
      "audit_score": 5,
