      "company_summary": "Zygo is a leading provider of advanced optical metrology solutions, specializing in high-precision 3D optical profilers and laser interferometers. The company offers a diverse range of products, including the ZeGage\u2122 Pro, NewView\u2122 9000, and Nexview\u2122 systems, catering to industries such as aerospace, automotive, semiconductor, and medical devices. With a focus on innovative technologies like SmartSetup\u2122 and SureScan\u2122, Zygo is dedicated to delivering exceptional measurement capabilities and services to its global clientele.",
