            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Vibrantz Technologies]][2]\n* [Our company][3]\n* [Expertise & solutions][4]\n* [Markets][5]\n* [News & events][6]\n* [Careers][7]\n* [Contact][8]\n\nOur company\n\n[Vibrantz village]\n\nWe\u2019re experts and innovators focused on solving challenges, embracing change and growing.\n\n[Overview][9]\n\nWithin this section\n* [Everyday technologies][10]\n* [Culture][11]\n* [Responsible corporate citizen][12]\n* [Leadership team][13]\n* [Board of managers][14]\n* [History][15]\n* [Global locations][16]\n\nExpertise & solutions\n\n[Woman in white coat with safety glasses holding white pot]\n\nOur strong history of innovation and technical expertise allow us to be a trusted advisor for our\ncustomers.\n\n[Overview][17]\n\nCore products & technologies\n* [Abrasive technologies][18]\n* [Ceramic d\u00e9cor colors and materials][19]\n* [Chemical dispersions][20]\n* [Cool colors][21]\n* [Digital inks][22]\n* [Drilling fluid additives][23]\n* [Electronic materials][24]\n* [Engineered and other mineral additives][25]\n* [Engobes and glazes][26]\n* [Glass colors and materials][27]\n* [Industrial specialty materials and glasses][28]\n* [Innovatint software solutions][29]\n* [Iron and chromite][30]\n* [Laser marking materials][31]\n* [Liquid colorants and performance additives][32]\n* [Manganese chemicals][33]\n* [Pearls technology][34]\n* [Porcelain enamels][35]\n* [Organic and inorganic pigments][36]\n* [Organic inks and coatings][37]\n* [Silicon carbide slurries][38]\n\nMarkets\n\n[Man smiling with safety helmet and glasses win Vibrantz workwear]\n\nVibrantz technologies and processes help our customers excel across several industries.\n\n[Overview][39]\n\nWithin this section\n* [Agriculture][40]\n* [Automotive and transportation][41]\n* [Batteries][42]\n* [Construction][43]\n* [Electronics][44]\n* [Energy and utilities][45]\n* [Fabrics][46]\n* [Friction and abrasives][47]\n* [Glass][48]\n* [Health and personal care][49]\n* [Home furnishing and appliances][50]\n* [Metallurgy][51]\n* [Packaging][52]\n* [Paints and coatings][53]\n* [Plastics][54]\n* [Thermosets][55]\n\nNews & events\n\nStay up to date with our journey as we bring color, performance and vibrancy to life.\n\n[Overview][56]\n\nWithin this section\n* [Press releases][57]\n* [Vibrantz Edge blog][58]\n* [Events][59]\n* [Our company][60]\n  * [Culture][61]\n  * [Responsible corporate citizen][62]\n  * [Leadership team][63]\n  * [Board of managers][64]\n  * [History][65]\n  * [Global locations][66]\n* [Expertise and solutions][67]\n  * [Ceramic d\u00e9cor colors and materials][68]\n  * [Chemical dispersions][69]\n  * [Cool Colors][70]\n  * [Digital inks][71]\n  * [Drilling fluid additives][72]\n  * [Electronic materials][73]\n  * [Engineered and other mineral additives][74]\n  * [Engobes and glazes][75]\n  * [Glass colors and materials][76]\n  * [Industrial specialty materials and glasses][77]\n  * [Iron and chromite][78]\n  * [Laser marking materials][79]\n  * [Manganese chemicals][80]\n  * [Organic and inorganic pigments][81]\n  * [Organic inks and coatings][82]\n  * [Liquid colorants and performance additives][83]\n  * [Pearls technology][84]\n  * [Porcelain enamels][85]\n  * [Silicon carbide slurries][86]\n  * [Abrasive technologies][87]\n* [Markets][88]\n  * [Agriculture][89]\n  * [Automotive and transportation][90]\n  * [Batteries][91]\n  * [Construction][92]\n  * [Electronics][93]\n  * [Energy and utilities][94]\n  * [Fabrics][95]\n  * [Frictions and abrasives][96]\n  * [Glass][97]\n  * [Health and personal\u00a0care][98]\n  * [Home furnishings and appliances][99]\n  * [Metallurgy][100]\n  * [Packaging][101]\n  * [Paints and coatings][102]\n  * [Plastics][103]\n  * [Thermosets][104]\n* [News & events][105]\n  * [Press releases][106]\n  * [Vibrantz Edge blog][107]\n  * [Events][108]\n* [Careers][109]\n* [Contact][110]\n* [Board of managers][111]\n\nEnter search term to search all content\n\nSearch for:\n\n# We bring color, performance and vibrancy to life.\n\nOur specialty chemicals and materials solutions are used in small amounts to make a huge impact on\neveryday life.\n\nPlay Full Video\n\nPlay Full Video\n\nVibrantz products are used in countless applications to make the world more colorful and improve\nproduct safety, durability and sustainability.\n\n[About Vibrantz][112]\nAerospace Animal & crop nutrition Industrial coatings Brick & roof tiles Electronic components\nHealth & personal care Showers & bathtubs Decorative bottles Automotive interiors Appliance enamels\n& coatings Auto exterior abrasives & coatings Digital inks Energy efficient materials Plastic\npackaging pigments Eco-friendly tinting system EV battery and charging materials\n\n## Aerospace\n\nOur dielectric powders are used in ceramic components for airplane turbine blades to help moderate\ntemperature exposure and frequency control\n\n[Learn More][113]\n\n## Animal & crop nutrition\n\nOur manganese minerals and colorants maximize crop production and animal nutrition and meet\nregulations to minimize environmental impacts\n\n[Learn More][114]\n\n## Industrial coatings\n\nOur dry pigments and liquid colorants are used in demanding applications where compatibility,\nconsistency and performance are key\n\n[Learn More][115]\n\n## Brick & roof tiles\n\nFrom natural ceramic colorants to engineered solutions and digital inks, our products enhance brick\nand roof tile surfaces\n\n[Learn More][116]\n\n## Electronic components\n\nOur electronic components enable high-yield processes for electronic devices, offering benefits like\nbetter polishing, low defects, excellent stability and longer shelf life\n\n[Learn More][117]\n\n## Health & personal care\n\nOur colorants and coatings for cosmetic, dental, pharmaceutical and medical industries enhance\nconsumer products and meet strict regulatory requirements\n\n[Learn More][118]\n\n## Showers & bathtubs\n\nOur porcelain enamels and glass materials meet the fashionable and functional requirements of shower\nand bathtub manufacturers\n\n[Learn More][119]\n\n## Decorative bottles\n\nWith more than 100 years of expertise, our enamels, glazes, colors, coatings and minerals add\nvibrancy and functionality to glass products\n\n[Learn More][120]\n\n## Automotive interiors\n\nOur inks and colorants make comfort and functionality possible for automotive plastics, ultraviolet-\nand heat-curing paints and coatings, and water-based, laser-etchable paints\n\n[Learn More][121]\n\n## Appliance enamels & coatings\n\nOur genuine porcelain enamel ceramic coatings resist wear from daily use and are made without lead\nand \u201cforever chemicals\u201d\n\n[Learn More][122]\n\n## Auto exterior abrasives & coatings\n\n### UVSolutions^{\u00ae}\n\nOur pigment dispersions and auto abrasives are lightweight materials for fiber-reinforced plastics\nto provide better weather and color resistance in truck beds\n\n[Learn More][123]\n\n## Digital inks\n\nOur digitally engineered inks for printing enable precise application, streamlined production and\nunlimited image reproduction on glass for automotive and transportation, appliance, furniture,\narchitectural and dinnerware markets\n\n[Learn More][124]\n\n## Energy efficient materials\n\nOur \u201ccool\u201d pigments and dispersions for building exteriors decrease air conditioning use and energy\ncosts, and improve exterior coating durability\n\n[Learn More][125]\n\n## Plastic packaging pigments\n\nOur near-infrared (NIR) pigments make black and dark plastics easily detectable in recycling\noperations to promote more accurate recycling\n\n[Learn More][126]\n\n## Pearls\u2122 technology\n\nPearls is the first volumetrically dosed tinting system of solid colorants for water-based\narchitectural and industrial applications. Pearls is biocide free, made with 100% recyclable\npackaging and produces less waste\n\n[Learn More][127]\n\n## EV battery materials\n\n### High-purity manganese sulfate monohydrate (HPMSM)\n\nOur manganese-based materials are a sustainable, cost-effective way to improve the safety, longevity\nand thermal stability of EV batteries\n\n[Learn More][128]\n\n## EV charging materials\n\n### Silicon carbide (SIC) slurries\n\nOur polishing products enable high-yield processes for slurries that minimize defects in microchips\nand sensors to enable more efficient semiconductor manufacturing\n\n[Learn More][129]\n\n## Aerospace\n\nOur dielectric powders are used in ceramic components for airplane turbine blades to help moderate\ntemperature exposure and frequency control\n\n[Learn More][130]\n\n## Animal & crop nutrition\n\nOur manganese minerals and colorants maximize crop production and animal nutrition and meet\nregulations to minimize environmental impacts\n\n[Learn More][131]\n\n## Industrial coatings\n\nOur dry pigments and liquid colorants are used in demanding applications where compatibility,\nconsistency and performance are key\n\n[Learn More][132]\n\n## Brick & roof tiles\n\nFrom natural ceramic colorants to engineered solutions and digital inks, our products enhance brick\nand roof tile surfaces\n\n[Learn More][133]\n\n## Electronic components\n\nOur electronic components enable high-yield processes for electronic devices, offering benefits like\nbetter polishing, low defects, excellent stability and longer shelf life\n\n[Learn More][134]\n\n## Health & personal care\n\nOur colorants and coatings for cosmetic, dental, pharmaceutical and medical industries enhance\nconsumer products and meet strict regulatory requirements\n\n[Learn More][135]\n\n## Showers & bathtubs\n\nOur porcelain enamels and glass materials meet the fashionable and functional requirements of shower\nand bathtub manufacturers\n\n[Learn More][136]\n\n## Decorative bottles\n\nWith more than 100 years of expertise, our enamels, glazes, colors, coatings and minerals add\nvibrancy and functionality to glass products\n\n[Learn More][137]\n\n## Automotive interiors\n\nOur inks and colorants make comfort and functionality possible for automotive plastics, ultraviolet-\nand heat-curing paints and coatings, and water-based, laser-etchable paints\n\n[Learn More][138]\n\n## Appliance enamels & coatings\n\nOur genuine porcelain enamel ceramic coatings resist wear from daily use and are made without lead\nand \u201cforever chemicals\u201d\n\n[Learn More][139]\n\n## Auto exterior abrasives & coatings\n\n### UVSolutions^{\u00ae}\n\nOur pigment dispersions and auto abrasives are lightweight materials for fiber-reinforced plastics\nto provide better weather and color resistance in truck beds\n\n[Learn More][140]\n\n## Digital inks\n\nOur digitally engineered inks for printing enable precise application, streamlined production and\nunlimited image reproduction on glass for automotive and transportation, appliance, furniture,\narchitectural and dinnerware markets\n\n[Learn More][141]\n\n## Energy efficient materials\n\nOur \u201ccool\u201d pigments and dispersions for building exteriors decrease air conditioning use and energy\ncosts, and improve exterior coating durability\n\n[Learn More][142]\n\n## Plastic packaging pigments\n\nOur near-infrared (NIR) pigments make black and dark plastics easily detectable in recycling\noperations to promote more accurate recycling\n\n[Learn More][143]\n\n## Pearls\u2122 technology\n\nPearls is the first volumetrically dosed tinting system of solid colorants for water-based\narchitectural and industrial applications. Pearls is biocide free, made with 100% recyclable\npackaging and produces less waste\n\n[Learn More][144]\n\n## EV battery materials\n\n### High-purity manganese sulfate monohydrate (HPMSM)\n\nOur manganese-based materials are a sustainable, cost-effective way to improve the safety, longevity\nand thermal stability of EV batteries\n\n[Learn More][145]\n\n## EV charging materials\n\n### Silicon carbide (SIC) slurries\n\nOur polishing products enable high-yield processes for slurries that minimize defects in microchips\nand sensors to enable more efficient semiconductor manufacturing\n\n[Learn More][146]\n~4,500\nemployees\n55\nmanufacturing sites worldwide\n13,000+\ncustomers served\n\n# What we do\n\n[Woman with blue rubber gloves marking a label in a pharmaceutical environment]\n\nWe understand customer and market challenges and value chains. Our legacy includes centuries of\nexpertise in particle engineering, glass and ceramic science and color technology, which fuels how\nwe think, engineer and create. All in service of our customers, who are experts in the"
