Forensic Risk Score\n\nVery High Risk\n\n86/100\n\nAs of Mar 05, 2026\n\n\u25b3 +10\n2025 Risk Score76\n\nCategory breakdown\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCategory \u2502Rating\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nEarnings and Accounting \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLiquidity, Credit & Financing\u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated Parties & Conflict \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nResignations & Dismissals \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal Controls \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLegal & Regulatory \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGovernance \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStrategic Complexity \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\nAutomations\n\n## Turn manual tasks into alpha with Co-Analyst Agents\n\nCreate your own agent to automate earnings, research and portfolio monitoring. Set up custom\nworkflows that run on your schedule and deliver results directly to you.\n\nTry it free\n\nTrigger\n\nNew Earnings Call\n\nAAPL \u00b7 Q1 2026 Earnings \u00b7 Just filed\n\nCo-Analyst Query\n\nRunning query\u2026\n\n\"Summarize earnings and compare to consensus estimates\"\n\nProcessing\n\nDeliver\n\nStructured Report Sent\n\nDelivered to your inbox\n\nAAPL Q1 2026 Earnings Summary\n\nRevenue$124.3B \u25b2 Beat +2.1%\nEPS$2.42 \u25b2 Beat +$0.08\nGross Margin46.9% \u25b2 +80bps\nGuidanceAbove consensus\n\nCoverage Universe & Content Library\n\n## Comprehensive coverage across all U.S. issuers\n\nThe Co-Analyst covers all U.S. issuers and ADRs, accessing SEC filings, conference/earnings call\ntranscripts, investor decks, press releases and more. The Co-Analyst can optionally access web\nsources.\n\nSEC Filings\n\n10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, proxy, S-1\n\nTranscripts\n\nEarnings and conference calls\n\nInvestor Decks\n\nPresentations and slides\n\nPress Releases\n\nMaterial announcements\n\nFundamental Metrics & Consensus Estimates\n\nSourced from S&P Market Intelligence\n\nWeb Sources\n\nOptional web access\n\nTestimonials\n\n## Trusted by the\n## best in the industry\n\nI use Hudson Labs to take what was a two or three hour process down to a 20-minute process.\n\n[Brett Caughran]\n\nBrett Caughran\n\nFounder at Fundamental Edge\n\nIt\u2019s easy to see the efficiency gains. Hudson Labs handles high-precision financial tasks where\nerrors can be very costly.\n\n[Buyside AI Reviews]\n\nBuyside AI Reviews\n\nIndependent Reviewer at Buyside AI Reviews\n\nIt\u2019s the best I\u2019ve seen.\n\n[Tripp Blumm]\n\nTripp Blumm\n\nPartner at Princeton Value Partners\n\nI\u2019m blown away by what you\u2019ve built.\n\n[Ken Taylor]\n\nKen Taylor\n\nFounder at Telos Research\n\nI use Hudson Labs to take what was a two or three hour process down to a 20-minute process.\n\n[Brett Caughran]\n\nBrett Caughran\n\nFounder at Fundamental Edge\n\nIt\u2019s easy to see the efficiency gains. Hudson Labs handles high-precision financial tasks where\nerrors can be very costly.\n\n[Buyside AI Reviews]\n\nBuyside AI Reviews\n\nIndependent Reviewer at Buyside AI Reviews\n\nIt\u2019s the best I\u2019ve seen.\n\n[Tripp Blumm]\n\nTripp Blumm\n\nPartner at Princeton Value Partners\n\nI\u2019m blown away by what you\u2019ve built.\n\n[Ken Taylor]\n\nKen Taylor\n\nFounder at Telos Research\n\nThese tools are spot on. They quickly get me up to speed and make me sound very smart.\n\n[Will Henderson]\n\nWill Henderson\n\nAnalyst at Wolfpack Research\n\nThanks for building such an excellent tool for investors.\n\n[Adam Parmer]\n\nAdam Parmer\n\nManaging Partner at Enhancing Capital\n\nA significant process improvement for identifying securities fraud.\n\n[Tom Elrod]\n\nTom Elrod\n\nPartner at Kirby McInerney LLP\n\nThese tools are spot on. They quickly get me up to speed and make me sound very smart.\n\n[Will Henderson]\n\nWill Henderson\n\nAnalyst at Wolfpack Research\n\nThanks for building such an excellent tool for investors.\n\n[Adam Parmer]\n\nAdam Parmer\n\nManaging Partner at Enhancing Capital\n\nA significant process improvement for identifying securities fraud.\n\n[Tom Elrod]\n\nTom Elrod\n\nPartner at Kirby McInerney LLP\n\nGet started\n\n##