            "text": "No Hallucination Guarantee now live\u2014[Learn more][1]\n[Skip to main content][2]\n[[Hudson Labs]][3]\n[Product][4]\n[Solutions][5]\n[Pricing][6]\n[Company][7]\n[Blog][8]\n[Sign In][9]\nStart Free Trial\n\nAbout\n\n# State-of-the-Art Financial AI R&D\n\nFounded in 2019 as an AI research team during the early LLM era. Hudson Labs was the first\nfinance-specific software to be completely powered by language models.\n\nOur Story\n\n## First in finance-specific LLM software\n\nFounded in 2019 as an AI research team during the early LLM era, Hudson Labs was the first\nfinance-specific software to be completely powered by language models.\n\nHudson Labs' unique contributions to financial AI research include proprietary relevance ranking\ntechniques, noise suppression, boilerplate removal and mathematical reasoning.\n\nToday, we serve institutional investors managing over $1 trillion in assets, providing them with\nresearch tools that combine the precision of a financial terminal with the adaptability of\nartificial intelligence.\n\n## Anyone can say they're an expert.\n\nBut only one of us wrote the textbook.\n\n*Designing Large Language Model Applications*by Suhas Pai, Co-founder & CTO, Hudson Labs. Published\nby O'Reilly Media.\n\n[Designing Large Language Model Applications - O'Reilly book by Suhas Pai]\n\nLeadership\n\n## Founded by domain experts\n\n[Kris Bennatti, CEO & Co-Founder at Hudson Labs]\n\n### Kris Bennatti\n\nCEO & Co-Founder\n\nPrior to founding Hudson Labs, Kris worked as the lead data scientist at corporate governance\nadvisory firm, Hansell McLaughlin and taught Python programming at an AI boot camp. Kris is CPA, CA\n(inactive) and has a masters degree in data analytics from the Schulich School of Business and an\nundergraduate degree in Accounting and Economics from McGill University.\n\n[Suhas Pai, CTO & Co-Founder at Hudson Labs]\n\n### Suhas Pai\n\nCTO & Co-Founder\n\nSuhas is a well-known applied AI, natural language processing and machine learning researcher. He is\nthe author of the popular textbook, Designing Large Language Model Applications published by\nO'Reilly Media. He was the Privacy co-chair at Big Science for the BLOOM LLM, which at the time of\nits release was the world's largest open-source multilingual LLM, along with contributions to\nvarious other LLMs and their training datasets. He has been the chair of the Toronto Machine\nLearning Summit for the last four years. Suhas has a Masters degree in Computer Science from\nEindhoven University of Technology in The Netherlands, and spent over five years at IBM where he\nheld the position of Staff Software Engineer.\n\nInvestors\n\n## Backed by the best\n\n[Y Combinator logo]\n\n### Y Combinator\n\nAccelerator\n\n[Good News Ventures logo]\n\n### Good News Ventures\n\nVenture Capital\n\n[FoundersX Ventures logo]\n\n### FoundersX Ventures\n\nVenture Capital\n\nIn the Media\n\n## Featured in leading publications\n\nBloomberg\n\n6x features\n\nWall Street Journal\n\n8x features\n\nForbes\n\n4x features\n\nCNBC\n\nFinancial Times\n\nCFO Brew\n\n[View all coverage][10]\n\nGet started today\n\n## The only AI with a\n## no hallucination guarantee\n\nJoin hundreds of institutional investors who trust Hudson Labs for research and risk assessment.\n\nStart Free TrialContact us\nPrecisionScaleFrontier AIVelocityRigorAlphaPrecisionScaleFrontier AIVelocityRigorAlpha\n[[Hudson Labs]][11]\n\nInstitutional-grade intelligence for public markets. Find what matters.\n\nProduct\n* [The Co-Analyst][12]\n* [Market Intelligence][13]\n* [Forensic Risk Assessment][14]\n* [Agents][15]\n* [Coverage Universe][16]\n* [Pricing][17]\n\nSolutions\n* [Institutional Investing][18]\n* [Corporate Strategy][19]\n* [Securities Law][20]\n* [Brokerage & Banking][21]\n* [Public D&O Insurance][22]\n* [Investor Relations][23]\n\nCompany\n* [About][24]\n* [Technology][25]\n* [Research][26]\n* [In the Media][27]\n* [Blog][28]\n* [Careers][29]\n* [Security][30]\n\nLegal\n* [Terms of Service][31]\n* [Privacy Policy][32]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Hudson Labs. All rights reserved.\n\n[Terms of Service][33][Privacy Policy][34]\n\n[1]: /blog/no-hallucination-guarantee\n[2]: #main-content\n[3]: /\n[4]: /products\n[5]: /institutional-investing\n[6]: /pricing\n[7]: /about\n[8]: /blog\n[9]: https://platform.hudson-labs.com/\n[10]: /in-the-media\n[11]: /\n[12]: /products#co-analyst\n[13]: /products#market-intelligence\n[14]: /products#forensic\n[15]: /products#agents\n[16]: /products#coverage\n[17]: /pricing\n[18]: /institutional-investing\n[19]: /corporate-strategy\n[20]: /securities-law\n[21]: /brokerage-banking\n[22]: /insurance\n[23]: /investor-relations\n[24]: /about\n[25]: /technology\n[26]: /research\n[27]: /in-the-media\n[28]: /blog\n[29]: /careers\n[30]: /security\n[31]: /terms-of-service\n[32]: /privacy\n[33]: /terms-of-service\n[34]: /privacy"
