      "polished_summary": "Hudson Labs is a financial AI research and development company that specializes in providing institutional investors with advanced research tools powered by language models. Its core products include The Co-Analyst, Market Intelligence, Forensic Risk Assessment, and Agents, all designed to enhance financial analysis, risk management, and automation. By combining high-precision AI capabilities with tailored solutions, Hudson Labs aims to empower institutional investors across various sectors, including financial services and corporate strategy.",
