      "company_summary": "Hzdr, or Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf, is a leading research center focused on cutting-edge studies in energy, health, and matter. It aims to address significant global challenges by providing innovative knowledge and technology solutions, supported by a diverse range of user facilities and strategic partnerships. The center is committed to conducting sustainable research that benefits future generations.",
