      "company_summary": "Laser Weapon Systems is a leading defense and diversified technologies company specializing in unmanned aircraft systems, electromagnetic systems, and nuclear technologies. Their core products include advanced systems for aircraft launch and recovery, nuclear research reactors, and innovative energy solutions, primarily targeting military, defense organizations, and educational institutions. With a commitment to safety, efficiency, and cutting-edge research, the company serves a global market focused on enhancing defense capabilities and sustainable energy generation.",
