            "url": "https://www.ga.com/about/affiliated-companies",
            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\n1. [Home][39]\n2. [About][40]\n3. Affiliated Companies\n\n# Affiliated Companies\n\n[Cryotech Deicing Technology]\n\n#### Cryotech Deicing Technology\n\nCryotech Deicing Technology in Fort Madison, Iowa, manufactures and markets acetate-based highway,\ncommercial, and glycol-based aircraft deicers.\n\nVisit cryotech.com\n\n][41] [\n[General Atomics Europe and Subsidiaries]\n\n#### General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)\n\nGeneral Atomics Europe, headquartered in Dresden, owns and operates subsidiaries in Saxony,\nBrandenberg and Bavaria. The companies include aircraft component manufacturing, maintenance\nservices, additive manufacturing, environmental remediation, water process engineering, uranium and\nrare earths processing and refining and railroad maintenance and repair equipment.\n\nVisit ga-europe.com\n\n][42] [\n[CCRi]\n\n#### General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.\n\nGA-Intelligence provides global situational awareness from multisource data processing to deliver\nactionable intelligence to support national security and commercially available OPTIX data\nanalytics.\n\nVisit ga-intelligence.com\n\n][43] [\n[General Atomics Synopta GmbH]\n\n#### General Atomics Synopta GmbH\n\nGeneral Atomics Synopta based in Switzerland, produces laser systems for space and ground-based\ncommunications, including beam pointing and adaptive optics.\n\nVisit ga-synopta.ch\n\n][44] [\n[General Atomics Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)]\n\n#### General Atomics Systems Integration (GA-SI)\n\nGeneral Atomics Systems Integration, is comprised of two divisions providing best value defense\nservices for U.S. and International customers. The Aero Services Division specializes as a full\nservice solution to meet the persistent intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (ISR)\nchallenges facing domestic and allied nation security missions. The Engineering Services Division is\na leading edge expert in reliability, maintainability and sustainability improvement for U.S. aging\naircraft systems.\n\nVisit ga-si.com\n\n][45] [\n[Grants Energy]\n\n#### General Atomics Uranium Resources\n\nGeneral Atomics Uranium Resources (GAUR) contributes to the front-end nuclear fuel cycle with active\nuranium ISR production, exploration, future uranium ISR development, and uranium conversion\nservices.\n\nAbout General Atomics Uranium Resources\n\n][46]\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][47]\n* [Careers][48]\n* [Contact Us][49]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][50]\n* [Newsroom][51]\n* [Visitor Information][52]\n\n### [Popular Links][53]\n* [About Us][54]\n* [Careers][55]\n* [Contact Us][56]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][57]\n* [Newsroom][58]\n* [Visitor Information][59]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][60]\n* [Defense][61]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][62]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][63]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][64]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][65]\n\n### [Categories][66]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][67]\n* [Defense][68]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][69]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][70]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][71]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][72]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][73]\n* [Supplier Information][74]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][75]\n\n### [Procurement][76]\n* [Small Business Program][77]\n* [Supplier Information][78]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][79]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][80]\n\n### [Education][81]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][82]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][83]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][84]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][85]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][86]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][87]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][88]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][89]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][90]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][91]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][92]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][93]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][94]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][95]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][96]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][97]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][98]\n* [Terms and Conditions][99]\n* [Cookie Notice][100]\n* [Privacy Notice][101]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][102]\n* [Accessibility][103]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: /\n[40]: /about/\n[41]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[42]: http://www.ga-europe.com\n[43]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com/\n[44]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[45]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[46]: /gaur/\n[47]: /about\n[48]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[49]: /contact\n[50]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[51]: /press-releases\n[52]: /visitor-information\n[53]: #collapseOne\n[54]: /about\n[55]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[56]: /contact\n[57]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[58]: /press-releases\n[59]: /visitor-information\n[60]: /commercial-products\n[61]: /defense/\n[62]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[63]: /magnetic-fusion\n[64]: /space-systems/\n[65]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[66]: #collapseTwo\n[67]: /commercial-products\n[68]: /defense/\n[69]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[70]: /magnetic-fusion\n[71]: /space-systems/\n[72]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[73]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[74]: /procurement\n[75]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[76]: #collapseThree\n[77]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[78]: /procurement\n[79]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[80]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[81]: #collapseFour\n[82]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[83]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[84]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[85]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[86]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[87]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[88]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[89]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[90]: #collapseFive\n[91]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[92]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[93]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[94]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[95]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[96]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[97]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[98]: /legal/privacy-policy\n[99]: /legal/website-terms-and-conditions\n[100]: /legal/cookie-notice\n[101]: /legal/privacy-notice\n[102]: /legal/cpra-request\n[103]: /legal/accessibility"
