            "url": "https://www.ga.com/about/ems",
            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\n[Space Systems and Technologies] [Space Systems and Technologies]\n\n#### Space Systems and Technologies\n\nGA-EMS offers concept to on-orbit engineering services for the design, prototype, test, and\ndeployment of advanced small satellites\n\n[Read more][39]\n[Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems] [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems]\n\n#### Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems\n\nGA-EMS offers a depth of experience and diverse engineering capabilities to deliver the\ntransformational technologies that keep our warriors safe and help them defend the homeland.\n\n[Read more][40]\n[Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems] [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems]\n\n#### Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems\n\nGA-EMS' Electromagnetic Aircraft Launch System (EMALS) and Advanced Arresting Gear (AAG) are\nrevolutionizing naval aviation.\n\n[Read more][41]\nPrevious Next\n1. [Home][42]\n2. [About][43]\n3. Electromagnetic Systems Group\n\n# Electromagnetic Systems Group\n\nGeneral Atomics Electromagnetic Systems (GA\u2011EMS) delivers advanced technologies and integrated\nsystems for missions from undersea to space. Our expertise in electromagnetic systems, energy and\npower technologies, hypersonics, missile defense, and laser weapon systems drives the rapid\ntransition of innovative concepts into operational capabilities.\n\n## Defense Systems\n\n[Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems]\n\n##### [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][44]\n\nTechnologies re-defining engagement in a multi-domain battlespace\n\n[Explore ][45]\n[Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems]\n\n##### [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][46]\n\nThe Electromagnetic Aircraft Launch System (EMALS) and Advanced Arresting Gear (AAG)\n\n[Explore ][47]\n[Space Systems]\n\n##### [Space Systems][48]\n\nFlexible satellite platforms, payloads, and integrated support systems\n\n[Explore ][49]\n[Batteries, Power and Energy Systems]\n\n##### [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][50]\n\nPower conversion, energy storage, and power generation technologies\n\n[Explore ][51]\n[Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction]\n\n##### [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][52]\n\nCryofracture, PERSES, and neutralization systems\n\n[Explore ][53]\n\n## Fission Energy Systems\n\n[Nuclear Technologies and Materials]\n\n##### [Nuclear Technologies and Materials][54]\n\nWhere TRIGA^{\u00ae} Began, Nuclear Innovation Endures\n\n[Explore ][55]\n[Silicon Carbide (SiC) Fuel Rods]\n\n##### [Silicon Carbide (SiC) Fuel Rods][56]\n\nEngineered for Extremes\u2014SiC Composites for Nuclear, Space, and Flight.\n\n[Explore ][57]\n[Advanced Terrestrial Reactors]\n\n##### [Advanced Terrestrial Reactors][58]\n\nProven Designs. Modern Performance. A Safer Energy Future\n\n[Explore ][59]\n[Space Nuclear Power and Propulsion]\n\n##### [Space Nuclear Power and Propulsion][60]\n\nReliable Power. Relentless Propulsion.\n\n[Explore ][61]\n[Materials Acceleration, Innovation and Transition Exchange (MAITrX)]\n\n##### [Materials Acceleration, Innovation and Transition Exchange (MAITrX)][62]\n\n[Explore ][63]\n[TRIGA\u00ae Research Test Reactors]\n\n##### [TRIGA^{\u00ae} Research Test Reactors][64]\n\nTRIGA^{\u00ae}\u2014Advancing Research Through Safe, Proven Reactors\n\n[Explore ][65]\n[Nuclear Engineering Services]\n\n##### [Nuclear Engineering Services][66]\n\nEngineering the Future of Nuclear and Nuclear Waste\n\n[Explore ][67]\n\n## Commercial Products\n\n[Capacitors]\n\n##### [Capacitors][68]\n\nGA-EMS offers innovative capacitor designs\n\n[Explore ][69]\n[Detection and Imaging Products]\n\n##### [Detection and Imaging Products][70]\n\nForensic cameras, imaging, and lighting systems\n\n[Explore ][71]\n[Gulftronic Electrostatic Separator]\n\n##### [Gulftronic Electrostatic Separator][72]\n\nElectrostatic process to polarize, capture and remove all catalyst fines\n\n[Explore ][73]\n[Motors, Generators, Drives]\n\n##### [Motors, Generators, Drives][74]\n\nPower conversion technologies and high speed power generation systems\n\n[Explore ][75]\n[PERSES \u2013 The Solution for PFAS Destruction]\n\n##### [PERSES \u2013 The Solution for PFAS Destruction][76]\n\nPFAS and Waste Destruction Systems\n\n[Explore ][77]\n[Precision Manufacturing]\n\n##### [Precision Manufacturing][78]\n\nManufacturing solutions and services for all applications\n\n[Explore ][79]\n[Radiation Monitoring Systems]\n\n##### [Radiation Monitoring Systems][80]\n\nFlexible site-specific designs for new and retrofited plants\n\n[Explore ][81]\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][82]\n* [Careers][83]\n* [Contact Us][84]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][85]\n* [Newsroom][86]\n* [Visitor Information][87]\n\n### [Popular Links][88]\n* [About Us][89]\n* [Careers][90]\n* [Contact Us][91]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][92]\n* [Newsroom][93]\n* [Visitor Information][94]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][95]\n* [Defense][96]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][97]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][98]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][99]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][100]\n\n### [Categories][101]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][102]\n* [Defense][103]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][104]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][105]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][106]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][107]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][108]\n* [Supplier Information][109]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][110]\n\n### [Procurement][111]\n* [Small Business Program][112]\n* [Supplier Information][113]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][114]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][115]\n\n### [Education][116]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][117]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][118]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][119]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][120]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][121]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][122]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][123]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][124]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][125]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][126]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][127]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][128]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][129]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][130]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][131]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][132]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][133]\n* [Terms and Conditions][134]\n* [Cookie Notice][135]\n* [Privacy Notice][136]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][137]\n* [Accessibility][138]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: /space-systems/\n[40]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[41]: /alre\n[42]: /\n[43]: /about/\n[44]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[45]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[46]: /alre\n[47]: /alre\n[48]: /space-systems/\n[49]: /space-systems/\n[50]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[51]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[52]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[53]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[54]: /fission-energy-systems/nuclear-technologies-materials\n[55]: /fission-energy-systems/nuclear-technologies-materials\n[56]: /fission-energy-systems/fuel-rods-reactor-materials\n[57]: /fission-energy-systems/fuel-rods-reactor-materials\n[58]: /fission-energy-systems/advanced-terrestrial-reactors\n[59]: /fission-energy-systems/advanced-terrestrial-reactors\n[60]: /fission-energy-systems/space-nuclear-power-propulsion\n[61]: /fission-energy-systems/space-nuclear-power-propulsion\n[62]: /fission-energy-systems/materials\n[63]: /fission-energy-systems/materials\n[64]: /fission-energy-systems/triga-research-test-reactors\n[65]: /fission-energy-systems/triga-research-test-reactors\n[66]: /fission-energy-systems/nuclear-engineering-services\n[67]: /fission-energy-systems/nuclear-engineering-services\n[68]: /capacitors/\n[69]: /capacitors/\n[70]: /detection-and-imaging-products/\n[71]: /detection-and-imaging-products/\n[72]: /gulftronic/\n[73]: /gulftronic/\n[74]: /electric-motors-and-drives\n[75]: /electric-motors-and-drives\n[76]: /pfas-waste-destruction-systems\n[77]: /pfas-waste-destruction-systems\n[78]: /ems-manufacturing\n[79]: /ems-manufacturing\n[80]: /radiation-monitoring-systems/\n[81]: /radiation-monitoring-systems/\n[82]: /about\n[83]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[84]: /contact\n[85]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[86]: /press-releases\n[87]: /visitor-information\n[88]: #collapseOne\n[89]: /about\n[90]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[91]: /contact\n[92]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[93]: /press-releases\n[94]: /visitor-information\n[95]: /commercial-products\n[96]: /defense/\n[97]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[98]: /magnetic-fusion\n[99]: /space-systems/\n[100]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[101]: #collapseTwo\n[102]: /commercial-products\n[103]: /defense/\n[104]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[105]: /magnetic-fusion\n[106]: /space-systems/\n[107]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[108]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[109]: /procurement\n[110]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[111]: #collapseThree\n[112]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[113]: /procurement\n[114]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[115]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[116]: #collapseFour\n[117]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[118]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[119]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[120]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[121]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[122]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[123]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[124]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[125]: #collapseFive\n[126]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[127]: https:"
