            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\n[General Atomics Marks Completion of the World's Largest and Most Powerful Pulsed Superconducting\nMagnet for Fusion Energy] [General Atomics Marks Completion of the World's Largest and Most Powerful\nPulsed Superconducting Magnet for Fusion Energy]\n\n#### General Atomics Marks Completion of the World's Largest and Most Powerful Pulsed\n#### Superconducting Magnet for Fusion Energy\n\nCentral Solenoid Project Highlights California's Role as a Global Fusion Research and Technology\nLeader\n\n[Read more][39]\n[General Atomics, UC San Diego Collaborate to Launch Historic Fusion Data Science and Digital\nEngineering Center in San Diego] [General Atomics, UC San Diego Collaborate to Launch Historic\nFusion Data Science and Digital Engineering Center in San Diego]\n\n#### General Atomics, UC San Diego Collaborate to Launch Historic Fusion Data Science and Digital\n#### Engineering Center in San Diego\n\nCollaboration to Strengthen California's Leadership in Fusion Energy Innovation\n\n[Read more][40]\n[General Atomics Inertial Fusion R&D Team Wins Coveted Award] [General Atomics Inertial Fusion R&D\nTeam Wins Coveted Award]\n\n#### General Atomics Inertial Fusion R&D Team Wins Coveted Award\n\nGA team wins R&D 100 Professional Award for developing history-making technologies that support\nfusion ignition\n\n[Read more][41]\n[San Diego Mayor Todd Gloria Tours General Atomics Fusion Facilities] [San Diego Mayor Todd Gloria\nTours General Atomics Fusion Facilities]\n\n#### San Diego Mayor Todd Gloria Tours General Atomics Fusion Facilities\n\nSan Diego Mayor Todd Gloria visited General Atomics (GA) to tour the DIII-D National Fusion Facility\nand GA's inertial fusion laboratories. Mayor Gloria was joined by representatives of the San Diego\nRegional Economic Development Corporation.\n\n[Read more][42]\nPrevious Next\n1. [Home][43]\n2. [About][44]\n3. Energy Group\nDownloads Contact\n\n# Energy Group\n\nSince the dawn of the atomic age, General Atomics innovations have advanced the state of the art\nacross the full spectrum of science and technology \u2013 from nuclear energy and defense to medicine and\nhigh-performance computing. Behind a talented global team of scientists, engineers, and\nprofessionals, GA's unique experience and capabilities continue to deliver safe, sustainable,\neconomical, and innovative solutions to meet growing global demands.\n\nGeneral Atomics Energy Group Overview\nFuture of Fusion Energy: Innovations and Opportunities\n\n## Energy Programs\n\n[DIII-D National Fusion Facility]\n\n##### [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][45]\n\nClean energy by recreating the sun in a San Diego lab\n\n[Explore ][46]\n[Target Fabrication]\n\n##### [Target Fabrication][47]\n\nCustom-built and modified equipment used for target fabrication and target handling\n\n[Explore ][48]\n[ITER Manufacturing]\n\n##### [ITER Manufacturing][49]\n\nThe world's most powerful pulsed superconducting electromagnet\n\n[Explore ][50]\n\n## Centers of Excellence.\n\nTransforming Basic-Research\n\nTransforming basic-research into applications to enable technology advancements.\n\n[Advanced Materials]\n\n##### [Advanced Materials][51]\n\nNanotechnology and smart materials, terahertz, quantum and hydrogen technologies\n\n[Explore ][52]\n[Advanced Computing]\n\n##### [Advanced Computing][53]\n\nHigh Performance Computing, AI, and Quantum Information Technology\n\n[Explore ][54]\n[Advanced Diagnostics]\n\n##### [Advanced Diagnostics][55]\n\nRF, THz, laser, and radiation diagnostics techniques coupled with multi-physics modeling\n\n[Explore ][56]\n\n## Stockpile Responsiveness.\n\nSupporting Research in Inertial Confinement Fusion\n\nHigh energy density physics to achieve a safer, secure, and effective nuclear deterrent without\nunderground testing.\n\n[Additive Manufacturing]\n\n##### [Additive Manufacturing][57]\n\nAbility to create geometries that are difficult to achieve through traditional methods\n\n[Explore ][58]\n[Coatings]\n\n##### [Coatings][59]\n\nAtomic Layer Deposition, Physical Vapor Deposition, evaporative, and sputter coatings\n\n[Explore ][60]\n[Aerogels and Foams]\n\n##### [Aerogels and Foams][61]\n\nExtreme low-density solids, typically formed from gels with the liquid component removed\n\n[Explore ][62]\n[Laser Micromachining]\n\n##### [Laser Micromachining][63]\n\nUltraviolet Nanosecond, Green Nanosecond, and Green Femtosecond laser workstations\n\n[Explore ][64]\n\n## Energy Products and Services.\n\nWorld-Changing Potential Across Key Technologies\n\nGeneral Atomics pioneers advanced technologies with world-changing potential across a comprehensive\narray of key energy technologies.\n\n[Superconducting Magnets]\n\n##### [Superconducting Magnets][65]\n\nState-of-the-art facility for end-to-end design, engineering, and fabrication services for\nsuperconducting magnets\n\n[Explore ][66]\n[GALADRIEL Laser Facility]\n\n##### [GALADRIEL][67]\n\nGeneral Atomics Laboratory for Developing Rep-rated Instrumentation and Experiments with Lasers\n\n[Explore ][68]\n[RF and Microwave Technology]\n\n##### [RF and Microwave Technology][69]\n\nWorld leader in high-power microwave technologies, microwave control and transmission\n\n[Explore ][70]\n[Metrology and Electron Microscopy]\n\n##### [Metrology and Electron Microscopy][71]\n\nThe laboratory is capable of characterizing all key properties of the components it delivers\n\n[Explore ][72]\n[Robotics and Automation]\n\n##### [Robotics and Automation][73]\n\nDeveloping systems for target fabrication, assembly, metrology, and shot diagnostics\n\n[Explore ][74]\n\n##### Downloads\n* [ Energy Group Overview][75]\n* [ History of Energy Research at GA][76]\n\n##### Contact\n\n##### Contact\n* Todd Fields\nSenior Director of Business Development\n[ Todd.Fields@ga.com][77]\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][78]\n* [Careers][79]\n* [Contact Us][80]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][81]\n* [Newsroom][82]\n* [Visitor Information][83]\n\n### [Popular Links][84]\n* [About Us][85]\n* [Careers][86]\n* [Contact Us][87]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][88]\n* [Newsroom][89]\n* [Visitor Information][90]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][91]\n* [Defense][92]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][93]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][94]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][95]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][96]\n\n### [Categories][97]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][98]\n* [Defense][99]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][100]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][101]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][102]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][103]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][104]\n* [Supplier Information][105]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][106]\n\n### [Procurement][107]\n* [Small Business Program][108]\n* [Supplier Information][109]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][110]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][111]\n\n### [Education][112]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][113]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][114]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][115]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][116]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][117]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][118]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][119]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][120]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][121]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][122]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][123]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][124]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][125]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][126]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][127]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][128]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][129]\n* [Terms and Conditions][130]\n* [Cookie Notice][131]\n* [Privacy Notice][132]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][133]\n* [Accessibility][134]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: /ga-marks-completion-of-the-world-s-largest-and-most-powerful-pulsed-superconducting-magnet-fo\nr-fusion-energy\n[40]: /ga-uc-san-diego-collaborate-to-launch-historic-fusion-data-science-and-digital-engineering-ce\nnter-in-san-diego\n[41]: /ga-inertial-fusion-r-d-team-wins-coveted-award\n[42]: /san-diego-mayor-todd-gloria-tours-ga-fusion-facilities\n[43]: /\n[44]: /about/\n[45]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[46]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[47]: /stockpile-responsiveness/fabrication\n[48]: /stockpile-responsiveness/fabrication\n[49]: /magnetic-fusion/iter-manufacturing\n[50]: /magnetic-fusion/iter-manufacturing\n[51]: /center-of-excellence/advanced-materials/strategic-areas-projects\n[52]: /center-of-excellence/advanced-materials/strategic-areas-projects\n[53]: /center-of-excellence/advanced-computing/strategic-areas-projects\n[54]: /center-of-excellence/advanced-computing/strategic-areas-projects\n[55]: /center-of-excellence/advanced-diagnostics/strategic-areas-projects\n[56]: /center-of-excellence/advanced-diagnostics/strategic-areas-projects\n[57]: /stockpile-responsiveness/additive-manufacturing\n[58]: /stockpile-responsiveness/additive-manufacturing\n[59]: /stockpile-responsiveness/coatings\n[60]: /stockpile-responsiveness/coatings\n[61]: /stockpile-responsiveness/aerogels-and-foams\n[62]: /stockpile-responsiveness/aerogels-and-foams\n[63]: /stockpile-responsiveness/laser-micromachining\n[64]: /stockpile-responsiveness/laser-micromachining\n[65]: /superconducting-magnets/\n[66]: /superconducting-magnets/\n[67]: /galadriel\n[68]: /galadriel\n[69]: /rf-systems-particle-accelerators/\n[70]: /rf-systems-particle-accelerators/\n[71]: /sem\n[72]: /sem\n[73]: /robotics-auto"
