            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\n1. [Home][39]\n2. [About][40]\n3. [Energy Group][41]\n4. Energy Group Internships\nDownloads Contact\n\n# Energy Group Internships\n\n[SULI Students and Mentors] SULI Students and Mentors\n\nGeneral Atomics (GA) is proud to offer rewarding undergraduate research opportunities through the\nDepartment of Energy (DOE) Science Undergraduate Laboratory Internship (SULI) and the Community\nCollege Internship (CCI) programs.\n\nSULI/CCI offers selected applicants an opportunity to perform research under the guidance of\nlaboratory staff scientists and engineers with sponsorship by the DOE.\n* Results: Complete a research paper and present a poster\n* Minimum GPA: 2.95\n* Minimum Age: 18 years as of internship start date\n* Citizenship: Must be a U.S. citizen or a Lawful Permanent Resident\n* Location: DIII-D National Fusion Facility or GA's Inertial Fusion Technologies facilities, both in\nSan Diego, CA\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Spring 2025 \u2502Summer 2025 \u2502Fall 2025\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOnline Application Opening Date\u2502July 10, 2024 \u2502October 16, 2024\u2502March 13, 2025\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication Due Date \u2502October 02, 2024\u2502January 08, 2025\u2502May 21, 2025\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nProgram Term Duration \u2502*16 weeks \u250210 weeks \u2502*16 weeks\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nProgram Term Dates \u2502Jan - May \u2502June - Aug \u2502Sept - Dec\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n*CCI Fall/Spring is 400 hours\n\n[SULI Students and Mentors] SULI student adjusts an automated mass spectrometer system as part of\nhis research in the Inertial Fusion Technology division.\n[SULI Students and Mentors] SULI student checks the spatial calibration of a charge exchange\nrecombination spectroscopy system, as part of research into 3-D effects on plasma equilibrium.\n\n**For more information and to apply for an internship see the DOE websites for each program.**\n* [Science Undergraduate Laboratory Internships (SULI)][42]\n* [Community College Internships (CCI)][43]\n\nGA recognizes and appreciates the value and contributions of individuals with diverse backgrounds\nand experiences and welcomes all qualified individuals to consider our many career opportunities by\nvisiting [https://www.ga-careers.com][44].\n\n##### Downloads\n* [ DIII-D Datasheet][45]\n* [ SULI Datasheet][46]\n\n##### Contact\n* [ Robert I. Pinsker][47]\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][48]\n* [Careers][49]\n* [Contact Us][50]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][51]\n* [Newsroom][52]\n* [Visitor Information][53]\n\n### [Popular Links][54]\n* [About Us][55]\n* [Careers][56]\n* [Contact Us][57]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][58]\n* [Newsroom][59]\n* [Visitor Information][60]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][61]\n* [Defense][62]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][63]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][64]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][65]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][66]\n\n### [Categories][67]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][68]\n* [Defense][69]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][70]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][71]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][72]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][73]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][74]\n* [Supplier Information][75]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][76]\n\n### [Procurement][77]\n* [Small Business Program][78]\n* [Supplier Information][79]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][80]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][81]\n\n### [Education][82]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][83]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][84]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][85]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][86]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][87]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][88]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][89]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][90]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][91]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][92]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][93]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][94]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][95]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][96]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][97]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][98]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][99]\n* [Terms and Conditions][100]\n* [Cookie Notice][101]\n* [Privacy Notice][102]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][103]\n* [Accessibility][104]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: /\n[40]: /about/\n[41]: /about/energy-group\n[42]: https://science.osti.gov/wdts/suli\n[43]: https://science.osti.gov/wdts/cci\n[44]: https://www.ga-careers.com/\n[45]: ../images/data-sheets/DIII-D_SunFlare_3101-1022.pdf\n[46]: ../images/data-sheets/SULI_5201_033125_inter.pdf\n[47]: mailto:pinsker@fusion.gat.com\n[48]: /about\n[49]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[50]: /contact\n[51]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[52]: /press-releases\n[53]: /visitor-information\n[54]: #collapseOne\n[55]: /about\n[56]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[57]: /contact\n[58]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[59]: /press-releases\n[60]: /visitor-information\n[61]: /commercial-products\n[62]: /defense/\n[63]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[64]: /magnetic-fusion\n[65]: /space-systems/\n[66]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[67]: #collapseTwo\n[68]: /commercial-products\n[69]: /defense/\n[70]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[71]: /magnetic-fusion\n[72]: /space-systems/\n[73]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[74]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[75]: /procurement\n[76]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[77]: #collapseThree\n[78]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[79]: /procurement\n[80]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[81]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[82]: #collapseFour\n[83]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[84]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[85]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[86]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[87]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[88]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[89]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[90]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[91]: #collapseFive\n[92]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[93]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[94]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[95]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[96]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[97]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[98]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[99]: /legal/privacy-policy\n[100]: /legal/website-terms-and-conditions\n[101]: /legal/cookie-notice\n[102]: /legal/privacy-notice\n[103]: /legal/cp