            "url": "https://www.ga.com/about/neal-blue",
            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\n1. [Home][39]\n2. [About][40]\n3. Neal Blue\n\n# Neal Blue\n\n[Neal Blue]\n\n**NEAL BLUE**\n***Chairman & CEO***\n**General Atomics**\n\nNeal Blue is Chairman and CEO of General Atomics (GA), San Diego. GA is a privately-held defense and\nhigh-technologies company, acquired by the Blue family in 1986. The GA group of companies now\ncomprises over 12,500 employees and operates on five continents.\n\nThe GA group includes General Atomics Aeronautical Systems, of which Blue is founder and Chairman.\nGeneral Atomics Aeronautical Systems produces a series of unmanned aircraft and provides\nelectro-optical, radar, signals intelligence, and automated airborne surveillance systems.\n\nGA\u2019s Electromagnetic Systems Division produces electro-magnetic aircraft launch and recovery systems\nfor the U.S. Navy, satellite surveillance, electro-magnetic rail gun, high-power laser,\nhypervelocity projectiles, and power conversion systems. GA is the principal private sector\nparticipant in thermonuclear fusion research through its internationally recognized DIII-D and\ninertial confinement programs for the U.S. Department of Energy. GA developed the UCSD Supercomputer\nCenter and has constructed 60 TRIGA nuclear research reactors in 22 countries. GA is a leader in\ndevelopment of next generation nuclear fission and high-temperature materials technologies.\n\nThe GA group and its affiliates also include General Atomics Europe in Germany, Heathgate Resources\nin South Australia, General Atomics Uranium Resources, the GA-Honeywell uranium conversion\npartnership.\n\nMr. Blue is co-founder and Chairman of Cordillera Corporation, Denver. Cordillera is a private\ncompany with investments in real estate, agriculture, natural gas distribution, and oil and gas\nproduction, including Harvard International Resources, which produces oil and gas in western\nCanada.\n\nHe is co-founder of the General Atomics Sciences Education Foundation, a Board member of Yale\nUniversity\u2019s Jackson Institute for Global Affairs, and a member of the Center for New American\nSecurity and the Atlantic Council Advisory Boards. He is a recipient of Caltech\u2019s von Karmen award,\nand is a former trustee of the Salk Institute and the University of California San Diego\nFoundation.\n\nMr. Blue graduated from Yale University, is a pilot, and served in the U.S. Air Force. During\ncollege years he was a correspondent for the *Yale Daily News/New York Times *Paris-Calcutta\nExpedition and, later with his brother, was featured in *Life Magazine *for having flown a\nsingle-engine Piper aircraft around South America. Other activities have included development of a\ncocoa and banana plantation in Nicaragua and of real estate in California and Colorado.\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][41]\n* [Careers][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][44]\n* [Newsroom][45]\n* [Visitor Information][46]\n\n### [Popular Links][47]\n* [About Us][48]\n* [Careers][49]\n* [Contact Us][50]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][51]\n* [Newsroom][52]\n* [Visitor Information][53]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][54]\n* [Defense][55]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][56]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][57]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][58]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][59]\n\n### [Categories][60]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][61]\n* [Defense][62]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][63]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][64]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][65]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][66]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][67]\n* [Supplier Information][68]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][69]\n\n### [Procurement][70]\n* [Small Business Program][71]\n* [Supplier Information][72]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][73]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][74]\n\n### [Education][75]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][76]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][77]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][78]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][79]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][80]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][81]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][82]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][83]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][84]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][85]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][86]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][87]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][88]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][89]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][90]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][91]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][92]\n* [Terms and Conditions][93]\n* [Cookie Notice][94]\n* [Privacy Notice][95]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][96]\n* [Accessibility][97]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: /\n[40]: /about/\n[41]: /about\n[42]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[43]: /contact\n[44]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[45]: /press-releases\n[46]: /visitor-information\n[47]: #collapseOne\n[48]: /about\n[49]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[50]: /contact\n[51]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[52]: /press-releases\n[53]: /visitor-information\n[54]: /commercial-products\n[55]: /defense/\n[56]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[57]: /magnetic-fusion\n[58]: /space-systems/\n[59]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[60]: #collapseTwo\n[61]: /commercial-products\n[62]: /defense/\n[63]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[64]: /magnetic-fusion\n[65]: /space-systems/\n[66]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[67]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[68]: /procurement\n[69]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[70]: #collapseThree\n[71]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[72]: /procurement\n[73]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[74]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[75]: #collapseFour\n[76]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[77]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[78]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[79]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[80]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[81]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[82]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[83]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[84]: #collapseFive\n[85]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[86]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[87]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[88]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[89]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[90]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[91]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[92]: /legal/privacy-policy\n[93]: /legal/website-terms-and-conditions\n[94]: /legal/cookie-notice\n[95]: /legal/privacy-notice\n[96]: /legal/cpra-request\n[97]: /legal/accessibility"
