            "url": "https://ga.com/about",
            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\n1. [Home][39]\n2. About\nDownloads\n\n# General Atomics\n\n***Global Progress Through Technology***\n\nGeneral Atomics is a defense and diversified technologies company, founded in 1955 as a Division of\nGeneral Dynamics and acquired by the Blue family in 1986. GA and affiliated companies operate on\nfive continents and include GA Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI).\n\nGA-ASI produces a series of unmanned aircraft and provides electro-optical, radar, signals\nintelligence, and automated airborne surveillance systems. GA\u2019s Electromagnetic Systems Division\nproduces electro-magnetic aircraft launch and recovery systems for the US Navy, satellite\nsurveillance, electro-magnetic rail gun, high power laser, hypervelocity projectile, and power\nconversion systems.\n\nGA is the principal private sector participant in thermonuclear fusion research through its\ninternationally recognized DIII-D and inertial confinement programs for the US Department of Energy.\nGA developed the UCSD Supercomputer Center and has constructed more than 60 TRIGA nuclear research\nreactors in 24 countries. GA is a leader in development of next-generation nuclear fission and\nhigh-temperature materials technologies.\n\nOther GA affiliates include General Atomics Europe GmbH with principal facilities in the German\nStates of Saxony and Brandenburg, Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd (South Australia), GA Uranium\nResources Group, and the GA-Honeywell uranium conversion partnership.\n\nThe company occupies 8+ million square feet of engineering, laboratory and manufacturing facilities\nand comprises over 13,000 employees.\n\n[ Click here to download a PDF][40]\n\nGeneral Atomics Overview\n\n##### Downloads\n* [ About General Atomics][41]\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Careers][43]\n* [Contact Us][44]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][45]\n* [Newsroom][46]\n* [Visitor Information][47]\n\n### [Popular Links][48]\n* [About Us][49]\n* [Careers][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][52]\n* [Newsroom][53]\n* [Visitor Information][54]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][55]\n* [Defense][56]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][57]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][58]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][59]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][60]\n\n### [Categories][61]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][62]\n* [Defense][63]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][64]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][65]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][66]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][67]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][68]\n* [Supplier Information][69]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][70]\n\n### [Procurement][71]\n* [Small Business Program][72]\n* [Supplier Information][73]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][74]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][75]\n\n### [Education][76]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][77]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][78]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][79]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][80]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][81]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][82]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][83]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][84]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][85]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][86]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][87]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][88]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][89]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][90]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][91]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][92]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][93]\n* [Terms and Conditions][94]\n* [Cookie Notice][95]\n* [Privacy Notice][96]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][97]\n* [Accessibility][98]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: /\n[40]: ../docs/About_GA_2024.pdf\n[41]: ../docs/About_GA_2024.pdf\n[42]: /about\n[43]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[44]: /contact\n[45]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[46]: /press-releases\n[47]: /visitor-information\n[48]: #collapseOne\n[49]: /about\n[50]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[51]: /contact\n[52]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[53]: /press-releases\n[54]: /visitor-information\n[55]: /commercial-products\n[56]: /defense/\n[57]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[58]: /magnetic-fusion\n[59]: /space-systems/\n[60]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[61]: #collapseTwo\n[62]: /commercial-products\n[63]: /defense/\n[64]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[65]: /magnetic-fusion\n[66]: /space-systems/\n[67]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[68]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[69]: /procurement\n[70]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[71]: #collapseThree\n[72]: /procurement/small-business-program\n[73]: /procurement\n[74]: /procurement/quality-assurance\n[75]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[76]: #collapseFour\n[77]: https://www.sci-ed-ga.org\n[78]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[79]: https://www.cryotech.com\n[80]: https://www.ga-europe.com/en/home__2/?\n[81]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com\n[82]: https://ga-synopta.ch\n[83]: http://www.heathgate.com.au\n[84]: https://www.ga-si.com\n[85]: #collapseFive\n[86]: https://www.ga-asi.com\n[8