            "text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n\n### General Atomics\n* [About General Atomics][3]\n* [Affiliated Companies][4]\n* [History][5]\n* [Neal Blue][6]\n\n### Energy Group\n* [About Energy Group][7]\n* [Energy Group Internships][8]\n* [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n\n### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n* [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n\n### Uranium Resources\n* [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n\n### Energy\n* [Centers of Excellence][13]\n* [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n* [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n* [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n* [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n\n### Defense\n* [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n* [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n* [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n* [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n* [Space Systems][22]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n\n### Commercial Products and Services\n* [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n\n### Careers\n* [Working at General Atomics][28]\n* [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n* [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n\n### Locations & Divisions\n* [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n* [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n\n### Early Careers\n* [About Early Careers][33]\n* [Energy Group Internships][34]\n* [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n\n### Military and Veterans\n* [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n\nSearch Search\nContact\n\n## Corporate Offices\n\n##### Corporate Address\n\n3550 General Atomics Court\nSan Diego, CA 92121-1122\n(858) 455-3000\n\n##### Mailing Address\n\nGeneral Atomics\nP.O. Box 85608\nSan Diego, CA 92186-5608\n\n##### Shipping & Receiving\n\n3483 Dunhill Street\nSan Diego, CA 92121-1200\n(858) 455-4141\n\n##### Washington Office\n\n3000 K Street, NW, Suite 250\nWashington DC 20007\n(202) 496-8200\n\n## Personnel\n\n###### EEO Statement\n\nGeneral Atomics and affiliated companies is committed to hiring and retaining a diverse workforce.\nWe are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer and will consider all qualified applicants\nfor employment without regard to race, color, religion, religious creed, ancestry, gender,\npregnancy, sex, sexual orientation, transitioning status, gender identity, gender expression,\nnational origin, age, genetic information, military and veteran status, marital status, medical\ncondition, mental disability, physical disability, or any other basis protected by local, state, or\nfederal law. EEO is the law. We also prohibit compensation discrimination under all applicable laws.\nTo learn more [ click here][39]. U.S. Citizenship is required for certain positions.\n\n###### Employment/Jobs\n\nIn order to be considered for a position, please apply online at [ ga.com/careers][40].\n\n###### Career Site Password Resets\n\nTo reset your user login password for GA Career Sites please phone: (858) 455-4000, then select\noption 2; or send an email to:\n[ ITSHelpdesk@ga.com][41].\n\n###### Applicant Accommodation Support\n\nTo request a reasonable accommodation or if you have a physical and/or mental disability and need\nspecial accommodations applying for a job on our website, please use the [ Reasonable Accommodation\nRequest Form][42] or phone: (858) 455-4545.\n\n###### Employment Verification\n\nPlease email authorized employment verification request forms to [ verify@ga.com][43].\n\n###### Emergency Information\n\nDuring times of severe weather or other calamities, affected area employees are encouraged to check\nthe Emergency Information website for facility information and alternate work arrangement guidance.\n\n[ Visit the Emergency Information website][44]\n\n## General\n\n###### General Business and Media Inquiries\n\nContact us for permission to use photos, videos and other copyrighted media items. Or, if you have a\ngeneral question about our company or would like to request more information please use the\nfollowing form or phone: (858) 455-3000.\n\n[ General Business and Media Inquiries Form][45]\n\n###### Become a Supplier\n\nTo find information on conducting business with General Atomics and Affiliated Companies, please\nvisit the GA Procurement pages.\n\n[ Visit the Procurement pages][46]\n\n###### Website Feedback\n\nIf you want to leave a comment, find an error or are experiencing trouble accessing any of the\ncontent on this Internet site, let us know by using our website feedback form.\n\n[ Website Feedback Form][47]\n\n## Individual business unit and affiliate contacts\n\n###### General Atomics Electromagnetic Systems Group (GA-EMS)\n\nCommercial Products Technical Service: (800) 252-1180\n[ ga.com/ems][48]\n\n###### General Atomics Energy Group\n\n3550 General Atomics Ct.\nSan Diego, CA 92121\n[ ga.com/energy-group][49]\n\n###### General Atomics Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)\n\n14200 Kirkham Way\nPoway, CA 92064\nPhone: (858) 312-2810\n[ ga-asi.com/contact][50]\n\n###### General Atomics Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)\n\n10883 Thornmint Rd.\nSan Diego, CA 92127\nPhone: (858) 320-4961\n[ ga-si.com/contact][51]\n\n###### Cryotech Deicing Technology\n\n6103 Orthoway\nFort Madison, IA 52627\nPhone: (800) 346-7237 or (319) 372-6012\n[ cryotech.com/contact][52]\n\n###### General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.\n\n323 2nd St SE\nCharlottesville, VA 22902\nPhone: (434) 977-0600\n[ ga-intelligence.com/contact][53]\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][54]\n* [Careers][55]\n* [Contact Us][56]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][57]\n* [Newsroom][58]\n* [Visitor Information][59]\n\n### [Popular Links][60]\n* [About Us][61]\n* [Careers][62]\n* [Contact Us][63]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][64]\n* [Newsroom][65]\n* [Visitor Information][66]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][67]\n* [Defense][68]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][69]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][70]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][71]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][72]\n\n### [Categories][73]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][74]\n* [Defense][75]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][76]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][77]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][78]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][79]\n\n### Procurement\n* [Small Business Program][80]\n* [Supplier Information][81]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][82]\n\n### [Procurement][83]\n* [Small Business Program][84]\n* [Supplier Information][85]\n* [Supplier Quality Assurance][86]\n\n### Education\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][87]\n\n### [Education][88]\n* [Sciences Education Foundation][89]\n\n### Affiliated Companies\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][90]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][91]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][92]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][93]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][94]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][95]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][96]\n\n### [Affiliated Companies][97]\n* [Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI)][98]\n* [Cryotech Deicing Technology][99]\n* [General Atomics Europe GmbH (GA-Europe)][100]\n* [General Atomics Integrated Intelligence, Inc.][101]\n* [General Atomics Synopta GmbH ][102]\n* [Heathgate Resources Pty Ltd][103]\n* [Systems Integration, LLC (GA-SI)][104]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 General Atomics. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][105]\n* [Terms and Conditions][106]\n* [Cookie Notice][107]\n* [Privacy Notice][108]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][109]\n* [Accessibility][110]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]:\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /about/affiliated-companies\n[5]: /about/history\n[6]: /about/neal-blue\n[7]: /about/energy-group\n[8]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[9]: /about/energy-news-and-updates\n[10]: /about/ems\n[11]: /gaur/\n[12]:\n[13]: /center-of-excellence/\n[14]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[15]: /fission-energy-systems/\n[16]: /magnetic-fusion/\n[17]: /stockpile-responsiveness/\n[18]: /alre\n[19]: /batteries-power-and-energy-systems\n[20]: /demilitarization-and-hazardous-waste-destruction\n[21]: /advanced-weapons-technology/\n[22]: /space-systems/\n[23]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[24]: /commercial-products/\n[25]: /procurement\n[26]: /press-releases\n[27]:\n[28]: /careers/\n[29]: https://businessolver.foleon.com/general-atomics/ga-total-rewards/\n[30]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5313\n[31]: /careers/locations-divisions\n[32]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5757\n[33]: /careers/early-career\n[34]: /about/energy-group-internships\n[35]: https://sjobs.brassring.com/TGNewUI/Search/Home/Home?partnerid=25539&siteid=5310\n[36]: /careers/military\n[37]: /contact\n[38]: /visitor-information\n[39]: images/careers/eeo-notices.pdf\n[40]: https://www.ga.com/careers/\n[41]: mailto:ITSHelpdesk@ga.com\n[42]: careers/reasonable-accommodation-request-form\n[43]: mailto:verify@ga.com\n[44]: https://emergency.ga.com/\n[45]: /general-business-inquiries\n[46]: /procurement\n[47]: /website-feedback-form\n[48]: /ems\n[49]: /energy-group\n[50]: https://www.ga-asi.com/contact\n[51]: https://www.ga-si.com/contact\n[52]: https://www.cryotech.com/contact\n[53]: https://www.ga-intelligence.com/contact/\n[54]: /about\n[55]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[56]: /contact\n[57]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[58]: /press-releases\n[59]: /visitor-information\n[60]: #collapseOne\n[61]: /about\n[62]: https://www.ga-careers.com\n[63]: /contact\n[64]: /magnetic-fusion/diii-d\n[65]: /press-releases\n[66]: /visitor-information\n[67]: /commercial-products\n[68]: /defense/\n[69]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[70]: /magnetic-fusion\n[71]: /space-systems/\n[72]: /unmanned-aircraft-systems-and-sensors\n[73]: #collapseTwo\n[74]: /commercial-products\n[75]: /defense/\n[76]: /energy-systems-and-products\n[77]: /magnetic-fusion\n[78]: /space-systems/\n