            "text": "* ##### Social Connect\n\n##### SPM Laser Machine Manufacturer\n* [Home][1]\n* [Blog][2]\n* [Events][3]\n* [FAQs][4]\n* [Brochure][5]\n\n[[logo]][6]\n* [About][7]\n  * [Milestones][8]\n  * [Careers][9]\n  * [CSR][10]\n* [Scansonic][11]\n  * [Laser Optics][12]\n  * [Brightlight Laser Source][13]\n* [Welding][14]\n  * [Laser Welding Machines][15]\n  * [Laser Welding Optics][16]\n  * [Buyers Guide \u2013 Laser Welding Machine][17]\n* [Cladding][18]\n  * [Laser Cladding Machine][19]\n  * [Buyers Guide \u2013 Laser Cladding Machine][20]\n* [Hardening][21]\n  * [Laser Hardening Machine][22]\n  * [Scansonic RLH \u2013 A][23]\n  * [Buyers Guide \u2013 Laser Hardening Machine][24]\n* [Cutting][25]\n  * [Laser Cutting Machines][26]\n  * [Laser Cutting Optic \u2013 Scut Pro][27]\n  * [Buyers Guide \u2013 Laser Cutting Machine][28]\n* [Contact][29]\n[Get a quote][30]\n[[logo]][31]\n[Get a quote][32]\n[[logo]][33]\n\n#### Contact Info\n* Unit No. 40, Electronic Co-Operative Estate, Pune - Satara Rd, Pune. - 411009\n\n## Laser Brazing\n## Optics\n\n[More Details][34]\n\n## TH6D\n## Laser Seam Tracking\n\n[More Details][35]\n\n## RLH-A\n## Laser Hardening Optic\n\n[More Details][36]\n[Awesome Image]\n\n##### 16+ Years Experienced\n\nAbout Us\n\n## Laser Machine Manufacturer India\n\nLaser Automation Pvt. Ltd. was founded by Sudhir Kulkarni with the vision for developing High Power\nLaser solutions for Automobile and Engineering applications. We provide solutions for Laser\nApplications like Welding, Hardening, Cladding, Cutting, Brazing and Optical Seam Tracking.\n\n### Check Our Portfolio\n\nManufactured with 100% quality\n\n#### Brochure\n\nLaser Special Purpose Manufacturer Pune\n\n[Download][37]\n[[Awesome Image]][38] [[Awesome Image]][39] [[Awesome Image]][40] [[Awesome Image]][41] [[Awesome\nImage]][42]\nLaser Machines\n\n## Manufacturing at its Best\n\nLA\n\n### [Laser Welding Machine][43]\n\nFiber Laser Welding Machine\n\n[More Details][44]\nLA\n\n### [Laser Hardening Machine][45]\n\nDiode Laser Hardening Machine\n\n[More Details][46]\nLA\n\n### [Laser Cladding Machine][47]\n\nLaser Metal Deposition Machine\n\n[More Details][48]\nNumbers\n0+\n\n### Clients\n\nPAN India\n\n0+\n\n### Projects\n\nSuccessful Installations\n\n0+\n\n### Years\n\nYears of Industry Experience\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\n## Customized Turnkey Solutions\n\nWith Our industry experience and team of experts, we study your applications and design an solution\ncustom to your requirement\n\n[More Details][49]\n* deliver on time & on budget\n* A dedicated service\n01\n\n### In House Lab\n\nState of The Art Application Lab\n\n### In House Lab\n\nState of The Art Application Lab\n\n02\n\n### Scansonic Laser Optics\n\nNext Generation Optics for Welding and Cutting\n\n### Scansonic Laser Optics\n\nNext Generation Optics for Welding and Cutting\n\n03\n\n### Customized Solution\n\nCustomized Solution According to Client Requirement\n\n### Customized Solution\n\nCustomized Solution According to Client Requirement\n\n04\n\n### 24/7 Support\n\nPrompt Service Support\n\n### 24/7 Support\n\nPrompt Service Support\n* deliver on time & on budget\n* A dedicated service\n\nproduce the best\n\n## Prompt Service is Our Motto\n\nPlay Your Video Play Your Video\n\nWe provide solutions for Laser Applications like Welding, Hardening, Cladding, Cutting, Brazing,\nMarking and Optical Seam Tracking.\n\n[More Details][50]\nHow We Work\n\n## Manufacturing Processes\n\nStep 01\n\n### Discussing Requirement\n\nDiscussing and understanding the requirement\n\n[Contact Now][51]\nStep 02\n\n### Feasibility Trials\n\nWe have our in house application lab where feasibility trials will be carried out on your samples to\nachieve desirable results\n\n[Contact Now][52]\nStep 03\n\n### Concept Design\n\nOur design team will prepare a concept design of solution based on your requirement\n\n[Contact Now][53]\nStep 04\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nOnce the design is a approved from client side, manufacturing according to the design will begin.\n\n[Contact Now][54]\nStep 05\n\n### Product Testing & Installtion\n\nThe completed machine will be tested and inspected. Once it is approved by the client, it will be\ndispatched from our site and our team will visit your site for installation, and training your\noperators\n\n[Contact Now][55]\n* 01\n  \n  #### Discussing Requirement\n* 02\n  \n  #### Feasibility Trials\n* 03\n  \n  #### Concept Design\n* 04\n  \n  #### Manufacturing\n* 05\n  \n  #### Testing & Installation\nLaser Processes\n\n## Explore Our Laser Applications\n\n##### Laser Applications\n\n### [Laser Cutting][56]\n\n##### Laser Applications\n\n### [Laser Welding][57]\n\n##### Laser Applications\n\n### [Laser Hardening][58]\n\n##### Laser Applications\n\n### [Laser Cladding][59]\n\nNews & Updates\n\n## Latest From Our Blog\n* Laser Blogs\n* Laser Hardening\n* Laser Welding\n* Laser Cladding\n\n[View All Post][60]\n[Blog][61] [Laser Welding Blog][62]\n* June 3, 2026\n* [Laser Automation][63]\n\n### [Hydrogen Fuel Cell Bipolar Plate Laser Welding][64]\n\n[Blog][65] [Laser Hardening Blog][66]\n* May 17, 2022\n* [Laser Automation][67]\n\n### [Conventional / Induction Hardening vs Laser Hardening][68]\n\n[Blog][69] [Laser Welding Blog][70]\n* May 5, 2025\n* [Laser Automation][71]\n\n### [Remote Laser Welding for eMobility][72]\n\n[Blog][73] [Laser Cladding Blog][74]\n* May 4, 2025\n* [Laser Automation][75]\n\n### [Difference Between Powder Cladding & Wire Cladding][76]\n\n[Blog][77] [Laser Hardening Blog][78]\n* April 30, 2026\n* [Laser Automation][79]\n\n### [Laser Hardening Crankshaft & Camshaft: Precision Hardening for Engine OEMs][80]\n\n[Blog][81] [Laser Hardening Blog][82]\n* April 2, 2026\n* [Laser Automation][83]\n\n### [Laser Hardening of Wear Plates][84]\n\n[Blog][85] [Laser Hardening Blog][86]\n* March 18, 2026\n* [Laser Automation][87]\n\n### [Laser Hardening Services for Automotive Dies, Stamping Tools & CNC Components \u2014 Built for\n### High-Volume Manufacturing][88]\n\n[Blog][89] [Laser Welding Blog][90]\n* October 2, 2023\n* [Laser Automation][91]\n\n### [Laser Welding for Vertical Gap Bridging][92]\n\n[Laser welding of industrial tubes]\n[Blog][93] [Laser Welding Blog][94]\n* May 4, 2025\n* [Laser Automation][95]\n\n### [Laser Welding of Tubes][96]\n\n[Blog][97] [Laser Welding Blog][98]\n* May 4, 2025\n* [Laser Automation][99]\n\n### [Laser Welding \u2013 Battery Tray and Battery Box][100]\n\n[Blog][101] [Laser Cladding Blog][102]\n* April 17, 2026\n* [Laser Automation][103]\n\n### [What is Laser ID Cladding?][104]\n\n[Blog][105] [Laser Cladding Blog][106]\n* February 27, 2026\n* [Laser Automation][107]\n\n### [Laser Cladding for Agriculture Tools][108]\n\n[Blog][109] [Laser Cladding Blog][110]\n* July 14, 2025\n* [Laser Automation][111]\n\n### [Laser Cladding for Compressor Housings][112]\n\n# Testimonials\n\n[[Awesome Image]][113] [[Awesome Image]][114] [[Awesome Image]][115] [[Awesome Image]][116]\n[[Awesome Image]][117] [[Awesome Image]][118] [[Awesome Image]][119] [[Awesome Image]][120]\n* ##### Laser Automation Pvt. Ltd.\n  \n  Unit No. 40, Electronic Co-Operative Estate, Pune - Satara Rd, Pune, 411009\n* ##### Phone\n  \n  [+91-99235 93197][121]\n* ##### Email\n  \n  [[email\u00a0protected]][122]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [About Us][123]\n* [Blog][124]\n* [Contact][125]\n* [Milestones][126]\n* [Special Purpose Machine][127]\n* [Brightlight Laser Source][128]\n* [Fast Component Welding][129]\n* [Optical Seam Tracking \u2013 TH6D][130]\n\n### Popular Post\n\n[[Awesome Image]][131]\n\n###### [Blog][132] [Laser Welding Blog][133]\n\n#### [Hydrogen Fuel Cell Bipolar Plate Laser Welding][134]\n\nJune 3, 2026\n[[Awesome Image]][135]\n\n###### [Events][136]\n\n#### [AMTEX EXPO 2026][137]\n\nMay 27, 2026\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2025-26 [Laser Automation Pvt. Ltd.][138] All Rights Reserved. Developed & Maintained By\n[World Wide Web Pune][139]\n* [Privacy Policy][140]\n* [Sitemap][141]\n\n\n\n\n\nSend Message\n\n