      "company_summary": "Navysbir is dedicated to fostering innovation within the defense and aerospace sectors by funding small businesses to develop and commercialize cutting-edge technologies that address the needs of the Navy and Marine Corps. Through programs such as the Navy SBIR Transition Program, Navy Catapult, SBIR Experimentation Cell, and NAVY Launch, the company supports technology developers in transitioning their innovative solutions into practical applications for Navy challenges.",
