      "website": "semquest.com",
      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Semquest specializes in innovative hardware and software solutions for high-energy laser systems, delivering real-time data technology tailored for military defense applications. Their product lineup includes advanced laser target boards, hit detection systems, and custom software, all designed to enhance operational efficiency and accuracy for military and defense organizations. Additionally, Semquest offers engineering services such as design and prototyping, as well as research and development to address complex challenges in the defense and aerospace industries.",
      "operational_presence": "Not stated on website",
