onnect with us using the link below:\n\nLinkedIn\n\nYouTube\n\nSemQuest\n\nHigh energy laser targets made easy\n\nAbout\n\nTeam\nHistory\nCareers\n\nPrivacy\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions\nContact Us\n\nSocial\n\nFacebook\nInstagram\nTwitter/X\n\nDesigned with WordPress [Skip to content][1]\n[[SemQuest]][2]\n\n[SemQuest][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [SQ News][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Targets][7]\n* [ALIEN][8]\n* [BATS][9]\n* [CaMEO][10]\n* [SLIM][11]\n* [SQUID][12]\n* [Learn][13]\n* [SQ Blog][14]\n* [Laser Weapon News][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n\n# Services\n\n# Design and Prototyping Services\n\n## Harness Our Technical Expertise\n\nWhether it is mechanical, software, or electrical, engage with our expert engineering teams.\nSemQuest is ready to assist your project with our design services in the Colorado area or around the\nworld.\n\n[Contact Us][17]\n\n## Mechanical Engineering\n\nAt SemQuest, we\u2019ve solved some highly challenging engineering problems for the DoD. In addition to\nmaking high tech diagnostic equipment for the DoD, we\u2019ve had to tackle the problem of integrating\nour equipment to various flight, ground, and maritime platforms. Our experienced team is ready to\nprovide you comprehensive mechanical engineering solutions tailored to meet your unique needs. From\nconcept development to prototyping and testing, we ensure that every project is executed with\nprecision and efficiency. Whether you require assistance with product design, structural analysis,\nor manufacturing processes, we are here to help you turn your ideas into reality.\n\n## Software & Electrical Engineering\n\nIn today\u2019s digital age, robust software solutions are essential for business success. Our software\ndevelopment team at SemQuest is dedicated to creating custom applications that enhance operational\nefficiency and drive innovation. We offer a full range of services, including software design,\ndevelopment, integration, and maintenance. Our agile approach ensures that we remain responsive to\nyour needs, delivering high-quality software in alignment with your business objectives. Let us help\nyou harness the power of technology to streamline your processes and improve your bottom line.\n\n## Research and Development\n\nInnovation is at the heart of what we do at SemQuest. Our research and development services are\ndesigned to push the boundaries of technology and engineering. We collaborate closely with our\nclients to explore new ideas, conduct feasibility studies, and develop cutting-edge solutions that\naddress complex challenges. Our nimble and multidisci"
