chemical etching for complex metal parts worldwide.\n\nContact Us\n\nISO 9001\nCertificate\n\nChemical Etching Services for\n\nHigh-Precision Metal\n\nComponents\n\nTMNetch delivers cost-effective photochemical etching for burr-free,\nstress-free parts in stainless steel, nickel, Nickel, titanium, and more.\nIdeal for complex designs beyond traditional machining.\n\nExplore More\n\nISO 9001\nCertificate\n\nA Trusted Partner in Precision Chemical Etching\n\nSince 2011, TMNetch has been a leader in photochemical etching with ISO 9001:2015 certification , advanced facilities, and a focused workforce of more than 100 employees. Our cutting-edge factory is equipped with four fully automated 20-meter etching lines and 19 supporting systems for coating, exposure, and development. This allows us to produce precision-etched parts in large quantities.\nTrusted by global clients across medical, aerospace, electronics, and energy industries, we combine fast delivery (often within just 3 days), strict quality assurance, and customized solutions to ensure your designs are reliably and accurately manufactured.\n\nYears of Experience\n\nTeam Members\n\nSuccessful Projects\n\nSatisfied Clients\n\nIndustries Served\n\nAerospace\n\nAutomotive\n\nMedical\n\nElectronics\n\nPrecise engineering\n\nOptical\n\nPCB\n\nArt Deco\n\nComponents\n\nBipolar Plates\n\nMetal Mesh Filters\n\nVapor Chambers\n\nSpeaker Grilles\n\nMetal Engraving\n\nModel Parts\n\nPCB Shielding Tank\n\nLead Frame\n\nShims\n\nEncoder Disk\n\nFlat Springs\n\nMetal Etched Nameplate\n\nEtching ability\n\nPhoto Etching\n\nPhoto Etching\n\nStainless Steel Etching\n\nStainless Steel Etching\n\nAluminium Etching\n\nAluminium Etching\n\nTitanium Etching\n\nTitanium Etching\n\nCopper Etching\n\nCopper Etching\n\nNickel Etching\n\nNickel Etching\n\nBeryllium Etching\n\nBeryllium Etching\n\nMolybdenum Etching\n\nMolybdenum Etching\n\nDelivering Excellence in Every Etched Component\n\nTMNetch provides high-quality photochemical etching services for precision metal components, trusted by clients worldwide. With consistent accuracy and reliable performance, we ensure the best results for every application.\n\nExplore More\n\nAdvanced Photochemical Etching Technologies\n\nFast Prototyping &amp; Large-Scale Manufacturing\n\nVersatile Material Handling\n\nFull-Service Secondary Processing\n\nComplex, Burr-Free, Stress-Free Components\n\nStrict Quality Control &amp; ISO 9001:2015 Certification\n\nComprehensive Support for Every Chemical Etching Project\n\nEmpowering clients with expert guidance and responsive service to keep your project on track.\n\nTimely Technical Assistance\n\nReliable Quality Assurance\n\nOn-Site Process Support\n\nComprehensive Consultation &amp; Training\n\nContinuous Improvement Programs\n\nPartners\n\nWhat Our Clients Say\n\nAfter reviewing samples from several etching factories, we decided to try TMNetch, and the results exceeded expectations. Their chemical etching technology is top-notch.\n\nKittisak Chen\n\nAfter visiting TMN factory by our quality team, l believe my company will establish a long term business relationship with TMNetch. The productsand services that TMNetch provided are appreciated by whole quality team.\n\nDale USA\n\nWe've been partnering with TMN for several years, and our collaboration has consistently been smooth, both in terms of the services provided and our day-to-day interactions.\n\nDANIEL HARRIS\n\nTMNetch team provided exceptional customization and precision for our project. The prototypes were delivered quickly andexceeded our expectations.\n\nJOHN CARTER\n\nAfter our quality team's visit to the TMNetch factory, we are confident in establishing along-term business relationship. The productsand services provided by TMNetch were highly appreciated by the entire team.\n\nEVERGREEN MANUFACTURING\n\nFAQs\n\nWhen can I visit your factory?\n\nYou\u2019re welcome to visit anytime during our working hours. Please email us in advance at lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com or tmnetch@gmail.com, and we\u2019ll arrange to pick you up from Shenzhen, Guangzhou, or Hong Kong airport.\n\nAre you a trading company or manufacturer?\n\nWe are a factory.\n\nWhat is your lead time for production?\n\nIf the goods are in stock, it usually takes 5\u201310 days. If the goods are not in stock, it generally takes 15\u201320 days, depending on the order quantity.\n\nDo you provide samples? Are they free or extra?\n\nYes, we can provide samples free of charge. However, the customer is responsible for the shipping cost.\n\nWhat are your payment terms?\n\nFor orders \u2264 $2,000 USD, full payment in advance is required. For orders \u2265 $2,000 USD, 50% T/T in advance and the balance before shipment.\n\nSend us a message\n\nWe\u2019re here to give you a personalized solution for your project. Kindly fill in the belo Contact TMNetch 24/7 | Metal Photochemical Etching Services [Skip to content][1]\n/* \u9690\u85cf\u6eda\u52a8\u6761\u4f46\u53ef\u6ed1\u52a8 */\n[lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com][2] / [tmnetch@gmail.com][3]\n[+86 136 0305 6883][4]\n* [lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com][5] / [tmnetch@gmail.com][6]\n* +8613603056883\n* Dongguan City, Guangdong Province, China.\n* [Home][7]\n* [Chemical Etching][8]\n* [Photo Etching][9]\n* [Stainless Steel Etching][10]\n* [Aluminium Etching][11]\n* [Titanium Etching][12]\n* [Copper Etching][13]\n* [Nickel Etching][14]\n* [Components][15]\n* [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][16]\n* [Vapor Chamber][17]\n* [Bipolar Plates][18]\n* [Custom Speaker Grills][19]\n* [Custom Metal Engraving][20]\n* [Photo-Etched Model Parts][21]\n* [EMI/RFI Shielding][22]\n* [Custom Lead Frame][23]\n* [Metal Shims & Washers & Spacers][24]\n* [Encoder Disk][25]\n* [Industries][26]\n* [Aerospace][27]\n* [Automotive][28]\n* [Medical][29]\n* [Electronics][30]\n* [Industrial Automation][31]\n* [Optical][32]\n* [Circuitry][33]\n* [Decorative][34]\n* [Secondary Services][35]\n* [Laser Cutting Services][36]\n* [Metal Polishing Services][37]\n* [Metal Plat