s][144]\n* [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][145]\n* [Vapor Chamber][146]\n* [Bipolar Plates][147]\n* [Custom Speaker Grills][148]\n* [Custom Metal Engraving][149]\n* [Photo-Etched Model Parts][150]\n* [EMI/RFI Shielding][151]\n* [Custom Lead Frame][152]\n* [Metal Shims & Washers & Spacers][153]\n* [Encoder Disk][154]\n* [Industries][155]\n* [Aerospace][156]\n* [Automotive][157]\n* [Medical][158]\n* [Electronics][159]\n* [Industrial Automation][160]\n* [Optical][161]\n* [Circuitry][162]\n* [Decorative][163]\n* [Secondary Services][164]\n* [Laser Cutting Services][165]\n* [Metal Polishing Services][166]\n* [Metal Plating Service\u200es][167]\n* [Precision Metal Stamping][168]\n* [Metal Bending Services][169]\n* [Metal Painting Services][170]\n* [Blog][171]\n* [Metal Photochemical Etching][172]\n* [Fuel Cell][173]\n* [Metal Decoratives][174]\n* [Thermal Management Solutions][175]\n* [IC Lead Frame][176]\n* [Metal Filter][177]\n* [About Us][178]\n[ Quote Now ][179]\n[Home][180] > Contact Us\n\n# Contact Us\n\nHave questions or need a quote? Our team is ready to provide fast, reliable support for all your\nchemical etching needs.\n\n## Send us a message\n\nWe\u2019re here to give you a personalized solution for your project. Kindly fill in the below form to\nreach us and get exclusive offers!\n\nName *\nCompany *\nEmail Address *\nPhone Number\nAdditional notes\nWe guarantee 100% privacy. Your information will not be shared. See our Privacy Policy.\nRequest Quote\n\n## Other ways to contact us\n\n##### Email Address\n\nlydia.sales1@tmnetch.com / tmnetch@gmail.com\n\n##### WeChat/WhatsApp\n\n+8613603056883\n\n##### Skype\n\nlydiahu5\n\n##### Office Address\n\n3rd Building, No.11, 1st Road, Sanchong Industrial Park, Dongguan City, Guangdong Province, 523222,\nChina.\n\n[ Linkedin ][181] [ Facebook ][182] [ Youtube ][183] [ X-twitter ][184] [ Pinterest ][185] [\nInstagram ][186] [ Tiktok ][187]\n\n## Why Contact TMNetch?\n\n### Precision at Every Step\n\nTMNetch is all about quality. All the stages are checked by certified engineers and chemicals to\ndeliver the etched components that are highly accurate and reliable.\n\n### Speed Without Compromise\n\nWe make prototypes within less than 6 hours with a stocked warehouse and a rapid tooling apparatus,\nminimizing the lead times without compromising the highest level of precision.\n\n### Global Reach\n\nWe provide services to industries across the globe, from medical to aerospace, with a hassle-free\nclearance of customs, professional documentation, and assured international delivery.\n\n### High Precision & Accuracy\n\nOur high-tech capability will provide close tolerances, finer details, and thin structures so that\nthere will be repeatability even with the most complicated designs.\n\n### Extensive Material Selection\n\nWe stock the widest range of standard and specialist material types, enabling you to choose the\nperfect solution for your specific application.\n\n### Trusted Partnership\n\nTMNetch engages in long-term relationships with international customers by providing certified\nsolutions, transparent service, and reliable performance each time.\n\n## Where to Find Us\n* [About Us][188]\n* [Privacy Policy][189]\n* [Blog][190]\n\n[ Linkedin ][191] [ Youtube ][192] [ Facebook ][193] [ X-twitter ][194] [ Tiktok ][195] [ Instagram\n][196] [ Pinterest ][197]\n\n##### [Products ][198]\n* [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][199]\n* [Bipolar Plates][200]\n* [Custom Lead Frame][201]\n* [Custom Metal Engraving][202]\n* [Custom Speaker Grills][203]\n* [EMI/RFI Shielding][204]\n* [Encoder Disk][205]\n* [Metal Shims & Washers & Spacers][206]\n* [Photo-Etched Model Parts][207]\n* [Vapor Chamber][208]\n\n##### [Chemical Etching][209]\n* [Photo Etching][210]\n* [Stainless Steel Etching][211]\n* [Aluminium Etching][212]\n* [Titanium Etching][213]\n* [Copper Etching][214]\n* [Nickel Etching][215]\n\n##### CONTACT US\n\nlydia.sales1@tmnetch.com tmnetch@gmail.com\n\nWeChat/WhatsApp: +8613603056883\n\nAddress: 3rd Building, No.11, 1st Road, Sanchong Industrial Park, Dongguan City, Guangdong Province,\n523222, China.\n\n\u00a9 2026 Dongguan TMN Electronics Co., Limited. All rights reserved.\n* [Email: lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com][216]\n* [Whatsapp: +8613603056883][217]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: mailto:lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com\n[3]: mailto:tmnetch@gmail.com\n[4]: tel:+8613603056883\n[5]: mailto:lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com\n[6]: mailto:tmnetch@gmail.com\n[7]: https://tmnetch.com/\n[8]: https://tmnetch.com/chemical-etching/\n[9]: https://tmnetch.com/photo-etching/\n[10]: https://tmnetch.com/stainless-steel-etching/\n[11]: https://tmnetch.com/aluminium-etching/\n[12]: https://tmnetch.com/titanium-etching/\n[13]: https://tmnetch.com/copper-etching/\n[14]: https://tmnetch.com/nickel-etching-2/\n[15]: /etched-products/\n[16]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/metal-mesh-filter/\n[17]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/thin-vapor-chambers/\n[18]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/bipolar-plate/\n[19]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/speaker-grilles/\n[20]: https://tmnetch.com/custom-metal-engraving/\n[21]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/photo-etched-model-parts/\n[22]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/emi-rfi-shielding/\n[23]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/lead-frame/\n[24]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/metal-shims-washers-spacers/\n[25]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/encoder-disk/\n[26]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/\n[27]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-aerospace-parts/\n[28]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-automotive-parts/\n[29]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/custom-photo-etching-parts-medical/\n[30]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-electronic-components/\n[31]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/high-precision-engineering/\n[32]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-optical-components/\n[33]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/pcb-etching/\n[34]: https://tmnetch.com/indust