5\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][190]\n\n## [EMI/RFI Shielding][191]\n* Process: [Photochemical etching (][192]PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][193]\n\n## [Photo-Etched Model Parts][194]\n* Process: [Photochemical etching (][195]PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][196]\n\n## [Vapor Chamber][197]\n* Process: [Photochemical etching (][198]PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][199]\n\n## [Bipolar Plates][200]\n* Process: Photochemical etching (PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][201]\n\n## [Custom Lead Frame][202]\n* Process: [Photochemical etching (][203]PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][204]\n\n## [Custom Speaker Grills][205]\n* Process: [Photochemical etching (][206]PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][207]\n\n## [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][208]\n* Process: Photochemical etching (PCE)\n* Industry Standards : ISO 9001: 2015\n* Material: Stainless Steel, Brass, Aluminum, Nearly all metals\n* The thickness of metal: From 0.02mm to 2mm\n* Tolerance: \u00b1 0.03 mm\n* Material Quality: All material with RoHS compliance and certificate available\n\n[ Explore this products ][209]\n[ [coffee machine filter] ][210]\n\n## Send us a message\n\nWe\u2019re here to give you a personalized solution for your project. Kindly fill in the below form to\nreach us and get exclusive offers!\n\nName *\nCompany *\nEmail Address *\nPhone Number\nAdditional notes\nWe guarantee 100% privacy. Your information will not be shared. See our Privacy Policy.\nRequest Quote\n\n## Other Ways to Contact Us\n* Address: 3rd Building, No. 11, 1st Road,Sanchong Industrial Park, Dongguan City,Guangdong\nProvince, 523222, China.\n* WeChat / WhatsApp: +86 136 0305 6883\n* Skype: lydiahu5\n* If you have any further queries, please let us know at\uff1a\n* Email: lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com / tmnetch@gmail.com\n* We're online 24/7 to assist you.\n* [About Us][211]\n* [Privacy Policy][212]\n* [Blog][213]\n\n[ Linkedin ][214] [ Youtube ][215] [ Facebook ][216] [ X-twitter ][217] [ Tiktok ][218] [ Instagram\n][219] [ Pinterest ][220]\n\n##### [Products ][221]\n* [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][222]\n* [Bipolar Plates][223]\n* [Custom Lead Frame][224]\n* [Custom Metal Engraving][225]\n* [Custom Speaker Grills][226]\n* [EMI/RFI Shielding][227]\n* [Encoder Disk][228]\n* [Metal Shims & Washers & Spacers][229]\n* [Photo-Etched Model Parts][230]\n* [Vapor Chamber][231]\n\n##### [Chemical Etching][232]\n* [Photo Etching][233]\n* [Stainless Steel Etching][234]\n* [Aluminium Etching][235]\n* [Titanium Etching][236]\n* [Copper Etching][237]\n* [Nickel Etching][238]\n\n##### CONTACT US\n\nlydia.sales1@tmnetch.com tmnetch@gmail.com\n\nWeChat/WhatsApp: +8613603056883\n\nAddress: 3rd Building, No.11, 1st Road, Sanchong Industrial Park, Dongguan City, Guangdong Province,\n523222, China.\n\n\u00a9 2026 Dongguan TMN Electronics Co., Limited. All rights reserved.\n* [Email: lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com][239]\n* [Whatsapp: +8613603056883][240]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: mailto:lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com\n[3]: mailto:tmnetch@gmail.com\n[4]: tel:+8613603056883\n[5]: mailto:lydia.sales1@tmnetch.com\n[6]: mailto:tmnetch@gmail.com\n[7]: https://tmnetch.com/\n[8]: https://tmnetch.com/chemical-etching/\n[9]: https://tmnetch.com/photo-etching/\n[10]: https://tmnetch.com/stainless-steel-etching/\n[11]: https://tmnetch.com/aluminium-etching/\n[12]: https://tmnetch.com/titanium-etching/\n[13]: https://tmnetch.com/copper-etching/\n[14]: https://tmnetch.com/nickel-etching-2/\n[15]: /etched-products/\n[16]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/metal-mesh-filter/\n[17]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/thin-vapor-chambers/\n[18]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/bipolar-plate/\n[19]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/speaker-grilles/\n[20]: https://tmnetch.com/custom-metal-engraving/\n[21]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/photo-etched-model-parts/\n[22]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/emi-rfi-shielding/\n[23]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/lead-frame/\n[24]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/metal-shims-washers-spacers/\n[25]: https://tmnetch.com/etched-products/encoder-disk/\n[26]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/\n[27]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-aerospace-parts/\n[28]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-automotive-parts/\n[29]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/custom-photo-etching-parts-medical/\n[30]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-electronic-components/\n[31]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/high-precision-engineering/\n[32]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/etched-optical-components/\n[33]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/pcb-etching/\n[34]: https://tmnetch.com/industries-served/decorative-arts-metal-etching/\n[35]: https://tmnetch.com/secondary-services/\n[36]: https://tmnet"
