\n* [Industries][69]\n* [Aerospace][70]\n* [Automotive][71]\n* [Medical][72]\n* [Electronics][73]\n* [Industrial Automation][74]\n* [Optical][75]\n* [Circuitry][76]\n* [Decorative][77]\n* [Secondary Services][78]\n* [Laser Cutting Services][79]\n* [Metal Polishing Services][80]\n* [Metal Plating Service\u200es][81]\n* [Precision Metal Stamping][82]\n* [Metal Bending Services][83]\n* [Metal Painting Services][84]\n* [Blog][85]\n* [Metal Photochemical Etching][86]\n* [Fuel Cell][87]\n* [Metal Decoratives][88]\n* [Thermal Management Solutions][89]\n* [IC Lead Frame][90]\n* [Metal Filter][91]\n* [About Us][92]\n* [Home][93]\n* [Chemical Etching][94]\n* [Photo Etching][95]\n* [Stainless Steel Etching][96]\n* [Aluminium Etching][97]\n* [Titanium Etching][98]\n* [Copper Etching][99]\n* [Nickel Etching][100]\n* [Components][101]\n* [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][102]\n* [Vapor Chamber][103]\n* [Bipolar Plates][104]\n* [Custom Speaker Grills][105]\n* [Custom Metal Engraving][106]\n* [Photo-Etched Model Parts][107]\n* [EMI/RFI Shielding][108]\n* [Custom Lead Frame][109]\n* [Metal Shims & Washers & Spacers][110]\n* [Encoder Disk][111]\n* [Industries][112]\n* [Aerospace][113]\n* [Automotive][114]\n* [Medical][115]\n* [Electronics][116]\n* [Industrial Automation][117]\n* [Optical][118]\n* [Circuitry][119]\n* [Decorative][120]\n* [Secondary Services][121]\n* [Laser Cutting Services][122]\n* [Metal Polishing Services][123]\n* [Metal Plating Service\u200es][124]\n* [Precision Metal Stamping][125]\n* [Metal Bending Services][126]\n* [Metal Painting Services][127]\n* [Blog][128]\n* [Metal Photochemical Etching][129]\n* [Fuel Cell][130]\n* [Metal Decoratives][131]\n* [Thermal Management Solutions][132]\n* [IC Lead Frame][133]\n* [Metal Filter][134]\n* [About Us][135]\n* [Home][136]\n* [Chemical Etching][137]\n* [Photo Etching][138]\n* [Stainless Steel Etching][139]\n* [Aluminium Etching][140]\n* [Titanium Etching][141]\n* [Copper Etching][142]\n* [Nickel Etching][143]\n* [Components][144]\n* [Metal Mesh Filter & Screens][145]\n* [Vapor Chamber][146]\n* [Bipolar Plates][147]\n* [Custom Speaker Grills][148]\n* [Custom Metal Engraving][149]\n* [Photo-Etched Model Parts][150]\n* [EMI/RFI Shielding][151]\n* [Custom Lead Frame][152]\n* [Metal Shims & Washers & Spacers][153]\n* [Encoder Disk][154]\n* [Industries][155]\n* [Aerospace][156]\n* [Automotive][157]\n* [Medical][158]\n* [Electronics][159]\n* [Industrial Automation][160]\n* [Optical][161]\n* [Circuitry][162]\n* [Decorative][163]\n* [Secondary Services][164]\n* [Laser Cutting Services][165]\n* [Metal Polishing Services][166]\n* [Metal Plating Service\u200es][167]\n* [Precision Metal Stamping][168]\n* [Metal Bending Services][169]\n* [Metal Painting Services][170]\n* [Blog][171]\n* [Metal Photochemical Etching][172]\n* [Fuel Cell][173]\n* [Metal Decoratives][174]\n* [Thermal Management Solutions][175]\n* [IC Lead Frame][176]\n* [Metal Filter][177]\n* [About Us][178]\n[ Quote Now ][179]\n[Home][180] > About Us\n\n# About Us\n\nLearn everything you need about TMNetch and our high-quality photochemical etching solutions.\n\n[ Contact Us ][181]\n\n## Accurate, Efficient, Reliable Chemical Etching Service\n\nFounded in 2011, TMNetch Precision Etching Technology Co., Ltd. is a leading photochemical etching\nmanufacturer in China. We have a 4,000-square-meter factory in Dongguan with five fully automated\n39-meter lines, and we supply precise parts to more than 20 countries.\n\nOur 100-plus engineers and chemists provide prototypes within 6 hours, create tight tolerances, and\ninnovate electronics, medical, aerospace, and automotive clients with high reliability.\n\nWe have a mission to achieve a new level of speed, precision, and customer satisfaction.\n\n## Our Story\n\nTMNetch has expanded to become a reliable international brand in quality chemical etching since\n2011, based on creativity, experience, and service.\n2025 2025\n\nWe relocated to a new 8,000 \u33a1 facility and began certification for ISO 14001 and IATF 16949. We\nalso holds an independent wastewater discharge permit.\n\n2024 2024\n\nWe added six fully automated exposure machines with a total investment of USD 2 million. The maximum\netchable metal sheet size expanded to 1.2 m in width and 2.5 m in length, meeting demand for large\nformat metal etching.\n\n2023 2023\n\nWe added two more roll-to-roll continuous exposure machines and two etching machines capable of\nhandling materials up to 1200 mm wide, enabling us to mass-produce products measuring 1200 mm by\n1500 mm.\n\n2022 2022\n\nWe launched the third phase of our R&D and production teams to advance ultra-precision processes and\nscale production. A roll-to-roll exposure machine was added, supporting materials up to 300 mm wide\nwith \u00b10.01 mm section accuracy.\n\n2020 2020\n\nAs a member of the high-end precision etching supply chain, we invest 5% of our turnover in R&D to\noptimize our processes.\n\n2016 2016\n\nAdded automated etching lines that increased accuracy and capability.\n\n2015 2015\n\nAfter the plant audit, we became a qualified vendor for Foxconn, Panasonic, Honeywell, LEM, Huawei,\nVivo, and OPPO.\n\n2013 2013\n\nAccessed the Apple supply chain, creating a trust track with high global brands.\n\n## Equipment Display\n\nAt TMNetch, advanced equipment drives consistent results\u2014from rapid prototypes to high-volume\nproduction.\n\n[automatic coating machine]\n\n### Automatic Coating Machines\n\n2 sets, 200\u00d7300 mm, 500 pcs/hour.\n\n### High-Speed Exposure Machines\n\n5 sets, 200\u00d7300 mm, 500 pcs/hour.\n\n[etching-machines]\n\n### Etching Machines\n\n2 sets with 39-meter processing lines.\n\n### Roll-to-Roll Continuous Exposure Machines\n\n3 sets.\n\n[cleaning developing etching machines]\n\n### Cleaning, developing machines\n\n5 sets, 300 x 400 mm, 500 pcs/hour, full automation.\n\n[inspection & finishing]\n\n### 2.5 Dimensional Testing Archimeter\n\n300x 450x 100 mm, precision 0.001 \u03bcm using probe and infrared.\n\n## Etching customization process\n\nAny project is initiated by design and a high-attention selection of materials. We have the\nprecision, consistency, and repeatability in our process, starting with the first digital blueprint\nto the final inspection. Each phase develops out of the previous, making sure that it is reliable\nevery time.\n\n### Step 1 \u2014 Phototool / CAD design\n\nYour drawings are translated by our engineers into the digital blueprint that constructs all etched\nfeatures in the form of a photographic tool, or CAD file.\n\n### Step 2 \u2014 Metal selection & preparation\n\nWe will choose the best metal for your use and clean and prepare the metal for flawless adhesion of\nthe photoresist.\n\n[automatic coating machine]\n\n### Step 3 \u2014 Photoresist coating\n\nThe patterned protective layer is created by the application of a UV-sensitive photoresist to the\nsurface of the metal in a uniform manner.\n\n### Step 4 \u2014 UV exposure\n\nThe phototool exposes the pattern to the ultraviolet light and imparts the photoresist metal to\nensure that the pattern is transferred with no additional variation or disregarding exposure.\n\n[cleaning developing etching machines]\n\n### Step 5 \u2014 Development\n\nWe then coated the metal so that the unexposed resist is removed, leaving the pattern to be\nchemically etched.\n\n[chemical etching]\n\n### Step 6 \u2014 Chemical etching\n\nThe controlled etchant bath immerses the workpiece, which selectively removes exposed metal to form\nthe designed geometry and feature detail.\n\n### Step 7 \u2014 Photoresist stripping\n\nThe unused photoresist is removed, and the part is thoroughly cleaned to end up with the final\netched surface.\n\n[inspection & finishing]\n\n### Step 8 \u2014 Final inspection & finishing\n\nEvery component is carefully checked in order to ensure perfection and quality; finishing and\npacking are done as demanded, and then it is shipped.\nWhatever the complexity, our engineers produced your designs with precision and repeatability.\n\n## Our Commitment to Quality and Service\n\n### Precision at Every Step\n\nTMNetch is all about quality. All the stages are checked by certified engineers and chemicals to\ndeliver the etched components that are highly accurate and reliable.\n\n### Speed Without Compromise\n\nWe make prototypes within less than 6 hours with a stocked warehouse and a rapid tooling apparatus,\nminimizing the lead times without compromising the highest level of precision.\n\n### Global Reach\n\nWe provide services to industries across the globe, from medical to aerospace, with a hassle-free\nclearance of customs, professional documentation, and assured international delivery.\n\n### High Precision & Accuracy\n\nOur high-tech capability will provide close tolerances, finer details, and thin structures so that\nthere will be repeatability even with the most complicated designs.\n\n### Extensive Material Selection\n\nWe stock the widest range of standard and specialist material types, enabling you to choose the\nperfect solution for your specific application.\n\n### Trusted Partnership\n\nTMNetch engages in long-term relationships with international customers by providing certified\nsolutions, transparent service, and reliable performance each time.\n\n[ Contact Us ][182]\n\n## Why Partner With Us\n\nTMNetch has proudly served its clients throughout the United States, England, Germany, Switzerland,\nAustria, France, Hungary, Israel, Singapore, Vietnam, Malaysia, Thailand, and other countries and\nhas established long-term partnerships with clients based on trust and accuracy.\n\nWe specialize in:\n\u2013 Materials: Stainless steel, brass, Nickel, aluminum, titanium, kovar, and nickel (0.01 mm \u2013 3.0\nmm).\n\u2013 Products: Shims, washers, gaskets, springs, EMI/RF shielding, filter meshes, lead frames, optical\nand shadow masks, encoder discs, surgical knives, fuel cell plates, and model puzzle components.\n\u2013 Merits: Tolerances down to zero point three millimeters, very large and ultra-thin constructions,\nlong export history, and well-validated paperwork for business clearance.\n\nTMNetch remains a global supplier of innovative etched solutions.\n\n## Cooperating client\n\n## What Our Clients Say\n\n\u201cAfter our quality team's visit to the TMNetch factory, we are confident in establishing a long-term\nbusiness relationship. The products and services provided by TMNetch were highly appreciated by the\nentire team.\u201d\n[EVERGREEN MANUFACTURING]\nEVERGREEN MANUFACTURING\n\u201cTMNetch team provided ex"
          },
