        "crawl_text": "Unique Laser ISO 9001:2015 & CE certified India ISO 9001:2015 CE marking In-house R&D, engineering, and manufacturing capabilities Strong India-based field service network Proprietary laser technologies ISO 9001:2015 CE marking 177, Por Industrial Park, Por, Vadodara, Gujarat 391243 India Vadodara, Gujarat Pan-India India [Skip to content][1]\n[Address]177, Por Industrial Park, Por, Vadodara, Gujarat 391243\n[Mail] [info@uniquelaser.co.in][2] [Phone] [+91 9033791601][3]\n[[Unique Laser]][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Products ][6]\n* [Laser Cutting Machine ][7]\n* [Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][8]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][9]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series][10]\n* [Laser Welding Machine ][11]\n* [4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine][12]\n* [Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][13]\n* [Laser Marking Machine ][14]\n* [Fiber Laser Marking Machine][15]\n* [UL Events][16]\n* [Support][17]\n* [Resources][18]\n[Contact Us][19]\n[Open mobile menuClose mobile menu][20]\n\n# Products\n\n[Home][21] \u00bb Products\n\n## Laser Cutting Machines\n\nUnique Laser offers advanced **Laser Cutting Machines** engineered for high-speed, high-precision\nmetal processing. Designed for modern manufacturing environments, our **laser cutting systems**\ndeliver clean edges, minimal heat-affected zones, and superior accuracy across stainless steel,\ncarbon steel, brass, and other industrial metals.\n\nWhether you require **sheet metal cutting** or **pipe and tube processing**, a Unique Laser **Laser\nCutting Machine** helps increase productivity, reduce material waste, and lower operational costs.\nFeaturing advanced **fiber laser technology**, each machine ensures repeatable cutting quality,\nfaster cycle times, and energy-efficient performance\u2014making it the ideal solution for fabrication,\nengineering, automotive, and industrial manufacturing applications.\n\n[[Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine]][22]\n[Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][23]\nHigh-tech Flexibility 3d Axis Cutting\n[View Details][24]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series]][25]\n[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][26]\nHigh-speed, high-precision metal cutting solution\n[View Details][27]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][28]\n[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series][29]\nCost-effective, reliable metal cutting solution\n[View Details][30]\n\n## Laser Welding Machines\n\nUnique Laser provides advanced **Laser Welding Machines** designed for strong, precise, and\nhigh-speed metal joining applications. Powered by modern **fiber laser technology**, our Laser\nWelding Machines deliver deep penetration, clean seams, and minimal heat distortion compared to\ntraditional welding methods. These machines ensure excellent weld strength, smooth finishing, and\nreduced post-processing, making them ideal for demanding industrial production environments.\n\nFrom portable **hand-held Laser Welding Machines** to fully automated **4-axis Laser Welding\nMachines**, our solutions are engineered to meet diverse manufacturing needs. Whether used in sheet\nmetal fabrication, automotive components, machinery production, or stainless-steel applications,\nUnique Laser Welding Machines help improve productivity, reduce operational costs, and maintain\nconsistent welding quality with long-term reliability.\n\n[[Hendhel Fiber Laser Welding Machine]][31]\n[Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][32]\nPortable, fast, and precise laser welding solution.\n[View Details][33]\n[[4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine]][34]\n[4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine][35]\nFast, precise 4-axis fiber laser welding with clean, strong seams.\n[View Details][36]\n\n## Laser Marking Machine\n\nUnique Laser offers advanced **Laser Marking Machine** solutions engineered to deliver permanent,\nhigh-precision marking on a wide range of industrial materials. Using modern **fiber laser\ntechnology**, each **Laser Marking Machine** produces sharp, high-contrast marks with excellent\nclarity and durability. These machines are ideal for marking serial numbers, barcodes, QR codes,\nlogos, batch numbers, and other traceability information required in modern manufacturing.\n\nDesigned for speed, accuracy, and low maintenance, every **Laser Marking Machine** ensures\nconsistent performance even in continuous production environments. With compact designs,\nuser-friendly operation, and long service life, our Laser Marking Machine systems are widely used in\nautomotive, electronics, engineering, medical devices, and industrial component manufacturing.\nUnique Laser helps businesses enhance product identification, regulatory compliance, and branding\nwith reliable and efficient laser marking technology.\n\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][37]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Machine][38]\nHigh-speed, permanent marking for metals.\n[View Details][39]\nGet In Touch\n\n## Contact With Us\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nCustom Captcha Name\nName *\nCompany Name *\nEmail *\nPhone *\nMessage *\nCustom Captcha *\nSubmit\n\n### Spares & Consumables\n\nKeep your operations running smoothly with our extensive range of high-quality laser spares and\nconsumables.\n\n[Arrow Icon]\n[[Unique Laser Footer Logo]][40]\n[Facebook][41][Instagram][42][LinkedIn][43]\n[ISO 9001:2015]\n[CE marking]\nReg. Office and Manufacturing Facility\n\n177, Por Industrial Park, Por,\nVadodara, Gujarat 391243\n\nSales and Support\n\n+91 9033791601\n\n][44][\nEmail Us\n\ninfo@uniquelaser.co.in\n\n][45]\nQuick Links\n* [Home][46]\n* [About Us][47]\n* [Products][48]\n* [UL Events][49]\n* [Support][50]\n* [Spares & Consumables][51]\n* [Resources][52]\n* [FAQs][53]\n* [Contact Us][54]\n* [Blogs][55]\n* [Privacy Policy][56]\n* [Disclaimer][57]\n* [Sitemap][58]\nProducts\n* [Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][59]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][60]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series][61]\n* [Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][62]\n* [4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine][63]\n* [Fiber Laser Marking Machine][64]\nYour Partner In Precision Laser Machine Manufacturing\n\n[Laser Machine Manufacturer in India][65] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in Gujarat][66] | [Laser\nMachine Manufacturer in Vadodara][67] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in Ahmedabad][68] | [Laser\nMachine Manufacturer in Dholera][69] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in Gandhidham][70] | [Laser\nMachine Manufacturer in Gandhinagar][71] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in Halol][72] | [Laser\nMachine Manufacturer in Rajkot][73] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in Savli][74] | [Laser Machine\nManufacturer in Surat][75] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in USA][76] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer\nin Dubai][77] | [Laser Machine Manufacturer in Germany][78]\n\nServing Major Cities and Beyond\n\nAhmedabad | Surat | Vadodara | Rajkot | Bhavnagar | Jamnagar | Junagadh | Gandhinagar | Anand |\nBharuch | Mehsana | Morbi | Vapi | Navsari | Porbandar | Veraval | Palanpur | Patan | Godhra | Dahod\n| Amreli | Botad | Kutch | Bhuj | Mumbai | Pune | Nagpur | Nashik | Aurangabad | Solapur | Kolhapur\n| Sangli | Satara | Jalgaon | Ahmednagar | Nanded | Latur | Akola | Amravati | Chandrapur |\nRatnagiri | Wardha | Yavatmal | Beed | Osmanabad | Parbhani | Hingoli | Bhandara | Gondia | Dhule |\nMalegaon | Navi Mumbai | Thane | Vasai | Virar | Panvel | Delhi | New Delhi | Noida | Greater Noida\n| Ghaziabad | Gurugram | Faridabad | Sonipat | Panipat | Karnal | Ambala | Rohtak | Hisar |\nKurukshetra | Chandigarh | Mohali | Panchkula | Ludhiana | Amritsar | Jalandhar | Patiala | Bathinda\n| Hoshiarpur | Pathankot | Moga | Phagwara | Jaipur | Jodhpur | Udaipur | Kota | Ajmer | Bikaner |\nAlwar | Bharatpur | Sikar | Pali | Bhilwara | Chittorgarh | Sri Ganganagar | Hanumangarh | Jaisalmer\n| Barmer | Tonk | Bundi | Hyderabad | Secunderabad | Warangal | Karimnagar | Nizamabad | Khammam |\nAdilabad | Mahbubnagar | Nalgonda | Siddipet | Medak | Sangareddy | Bengaluru | Mysuru | Hubballi |\nDharwad | Mangaluru | Belagavi | Shivamogga | Tumakuru | Ballari | Vijayapura | Hassan | Mandya |\nRaichur | Bidar | Davanagere | Chennai | Coimbatore | Madurai | Salem | Tiruchirappalli |\nTirunelveli | Erode | Vellore | Thanjavur | Dindigul | Hosur | Kanchipuram | Karur | Namakkal |\nCuddalore | Puducherry | Kochi | Thiruvananthapuram | Kozhikode | Thrissur | Kollam | Kannur |\nAlappuzha | Kottayam | Palakkad | Malappuram | Pathanamthitta | Kasaragod | Kolkata | Howrah |\nDurgapur | Asansol | Siliguri | Kharagpur | Haldia | Mald [Skip to content][1]\n[Address]177, Por Industrial Park, Por, Vadodara, Gujarat 391243\n[Mail] [info@uniquelaser.co.in][2] [Phone] [+91 9033791601][3]\n[[Unique Laser]][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Products ][6]\n* [Laser Cutting Machine ][7]\n* [Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][8]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][9]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series][10]\n* [Laser Welding Machine ][11]\n* [4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine][12]\n* [Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][13]\n* [Laser Marking Machine ][14]\n* [Fiber Laser Marking Machine][15]\n* [UL Events][16]\n* [Support][17]\n* [Resources][18]\n[Contact Us][19]\n[Open mobile menuClose mobile menu][20]\n\n# About Us\n\n[Home][21] \u00bb About Us\n[Unique Laser Logo]\n\n## About Unique Laser\n\n**Unique Laser** is a pioneer in laser technology in India, with over **12 years of extensive\nexperience** in the laser industry, optics, electro-optics, and opto-mechanical equipment\nmanufacturing. Since its establishment in **2013**, the company has been dedicated to designing and\nmanufacturing advanced laser machines that deliver precision, reliability, and performance.\n\nWe are a professionally managed organization that has successfully supplied **laser marking, laser\nengraving, laser cutting, and laser welding solutions** to manufacturers across India, serving a\nwide range of industries. Our consistent growth in international markets reflects the trust and\nappreciation we have earned from our customers worldwide.\n\nHeadquartered in **Vadodara, Gujarat, India**, Unique Laser continues to strengthen its position as\na leading Indian manufacturer of lasers, laser systems, optics, electro-optics, and opto-mechanical\nequipment for industrial and research applications.\n\n## Our Capabilities\n\nWe specialize in the **design and manufacturing of laser machines** for diverse applications,\nincluding:\n\n[LASER CLADDING]\nLASER CLADDING\n[LASER CLEANING]\nLASER CLEANING\n[LASER CUTTING]\nLASER CUTTING\n[LASER ENGRAVING]\nLASER ENGRAVING\n[LASER HARDENING]\nLASER HARDENING\n[LASER MARKING]\nLASER MARKING\n[LASER WELDING]\nLASER WELDING\n[[Contact Us]][22]\n\n## Why Unique Laser?\n\nWe deliver high-performance laser systems engineered for precision, durability, and consistent\noutput in demanding industrial environments. Backed by a strong India-based field service network,\nproprietary laser technologies, and gold-level customer support, Unique Laser ensures long-term\nvalue, minimal downtime, and reliable production for serious manufacturing operations. Our solutions\nare built with a deep understanding of real-world manufacturing challenges.\n* Advanced laser solutions for industrial and research applications\n* Trusted by customers across India and international markets\n* In-house R&D, engineering, and manufacturing capabilities\n* ISO 9001:2015 & CE certified systems\n* High precision, speed, and repeatability for critical operations\n* Scalable solutions for MSMEs to large-scale manufacturing units\n\n[Team - Unique Laser]\n[[Unique Laser Footer Logo]][23]\n[Facebook][24][Instagram][25][LinkedIn][26]\n[ISO 9001:2015]\n[CE marking]\nReg. Office and Manufacturing Facility\n\n177, Por Industrial Park, Por,\nVadodara, Gujarat 391243\n\nSales and Support\n\n+91 9033791601\n\n][27][\nEmail Us\n\ninfo@uniquelaser.co.in\n\n][28]\nQuick Links\n* [Home][29]\n* [About Us][30]\n* [Products][31]\n* [UL Events][32]\n* [Support][33]\n* [Spares & Consumables]