u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Samples\n\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][27]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][28]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][29]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][30]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][31]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series]][32]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is the Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series used for?\n][33]\n\nThe Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series is an industrial fiber laser machine designed for high-speed and\nhigh-precision sheet metal cutting applications.\n\nWhat is the difference between a fiber laser machine and a fiber laser marking machine 30W?\n][34]\n\nA fiber laser machine like the UL 3015 Lite Series is used for metal cutting, while a fiber laser\nmarking machine 30W is designed for engraving and marking logos, barcodes, and serial numbers on\nmetal surfaces.\n\nWhat is the fiber laser marking machine HS code for export?\n][35]\n\nThe fiber laser marking machine HS code is generally classified under 8456, which covers machine\ntools for material processing by laser. Final classification may vary by country customs authority.\n\nWhat applications is a fiber laser machine 100W suitable for?\n][36]\n\nA fiber laser machine 100W is typically used for deep engraving, light cutting of thin metals, and\nhigh-speed industrial marking, offering more power than standard marking machines.\n\nCan a fiber laser marking machine be used alongside the UL 3015 Lite Series?\n][37]\n\nYes. Many manufacturers use a fiber laser marking machine 30W or 100W together with the UL 3015 Lite\nSeries to handle both cutting and permanent part marking within the same production line.\n\n## Download Brochure\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nEmail *\nEmail Phone Name\nPhone *\nCustom Captcha *\nSubmit\n\n## More Laser Cutting Solutions\n\n[[Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine]][38]\n[Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][39]\nHigh-tech Flexibility 3d Axis Cutting\n[View Details][40]\n[[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series]][41]\n[Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][42]\nHigh-speed, high-precision metal cutting solution\n[View Details][43]\nGet In Touch\n\n## Contact With Us\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nCompany Name *\nEmail *\nPhone *\nMessage *\nCaptcha Company Name\nCustom Captcha *\nSubmit\n\n### Spares & Consumables\n\nKeep your operations running smoothly with our extensive range of high-quality laser spares and\nconsumables.\n\n[Arrow Icon]\n[[Unique Laser Footer Logo]][44]\n[Facebook][45][Instagram][46][LinkedIn][47]\n[ISO 9001:2015]\n[CE marking]\nReg. Office and Manufacturing Facility\n\n177, Por Industrial Park, Por,\nVadodara, Gujarat 391243\n\nSales and Support\n\n+91 9033791601\n\n][48][\nEmail Us\n\ninfo@uniquelaser.co.in\n\n][49]\nQuick Links\n* [Home][50]\n* [About Us][51]\n* [Products][52]\n* [UL Events][53]\n* [Support][54]\n* [Spares & Consumables][55]\n* [Resources][56]\n* [FAQs][57]\n* [Contact Us][58]\n* [Blogs][59]\n* [Privacy Policy][60]\n* [Disclaimer][61]\n* [Sitemap][62]\nProducts\n* [Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][63]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][64]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series][65]\n* [Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][66]\n* [4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine][67]\n* [Fiber Laser Marking Machine][68]\nYour Partner In Preci