00\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is a Fiber Laser Welding Machine used for?\n][26]\n\nA Fiber Laser Welding Machine is used for high-precision welding of metals, offering strong weld\nseams, minimal deformation, and high efficiency in industrial manufacturing.\n\nHow does the laser welding process work?\n][27]\n\nThe laser welding process uses a focused laser beam to melt and fuse metals together, providing deep\npenetration, fast welding speed, and clean, precise joints.\n\nWhat is the difference between a handheld fiber laser welding machine and an automatic system?\n][28]\n\nA handheld fiber laser welding machine offers flexibility and portability for on-site or irregular\nwelding tasks, while automatic systems like 4-axis machines are ideal for high-precision, repetitive\nproduction.\n\nIs a fiber laser marking machine 30W suitable for welding?\n][29]\n\nNo. A fiber laser marking machine 30W is designed for engraving and marking, not welding. Welding\napplications require higher power machines such as 1000W or above.\n\nWhat applications is a 1000W handheld fiber laser welding machine suitable for?\n][30]\n\nA 1000W handheld fiber laser welding machine is suitable for thin to medium-thickness metals,\nmaintenance work, fabrication shops, and small-scale production requiring mobility and precision.\n\n## Download Brochure\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nEmail *\nPhone *\nCustom Name Phone\nCustom Captcha *\nSubmit\n\n## More Laser Welding Solutions\n\n[[Hendhel Fiber Laser Welding Machine]][31]\n[Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][32]\nPortable, fast, and precise laser welding solution.\n[View Details][33]\nGet In Touch\n\n## Contact With Us\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to comple