            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[Address]177, Por Industrial Park, Por, Vadodara, Gujarat 391243\n[Mail] [info@uniquelaser.co.in][2] [Phone] [+91 9033791601][3]\n[[Unique Laser]][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Products ][6]\n* [Laser Cutting Machine ][7]\n* [Fiber Laser Pipe Cutting Machine][8]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Pro Series][9]\n* [Fiber Laser UL 3015 Lite Series][10]\n* [Laser Welding Machine ][11]\n* [4 AXIS Fiber Laser Welding Machine][12]\n* [Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][13]\n* [Laser Marking Machine ][14]\n* [Fiber Laser Marking Machine][15]\n* [UL Events][16]\n* [Support][17]\n* [Resources][18]\n[Contact Us][19]\n[Open mobile menuClose mobile menu][20]\n\n# Fiber Laser Marking Machine\n\nHigh-speed, permanent marking for metals.\n[Contact Us][21]\n[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]\n[Key Features][22][Specifications][23][Samples][24][FAQs][25][Brochure][26]\n\n## Key Features\n* Fast speed, high efficiency, stable output power, high reliability.\n* Long life, maintenance-free within 100,000 hours, operated in 24 hours and severe working\ncondition\n* Applicable on materials like metal, non-metal, plastics, etc.,\n* Permanent Marking Processing / Online- Marking Process\n* Minimize damage to the product and enhance the quality\n* High speed marking for mass production\n* It can mark all sorts of precise patterns according to customer requirements\n* With international high-quality fiber laser, it can mark all sorts of precise patterns according\nto customer requirements\n* High electro-optic conversion efficiency, little energy coupling loss, less power consumption with\njust 0.5 KW/Hour\n\n## Specification\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**SPECS/MODEL ** \u2502**FL 10/20/30/50/60/100**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPower \u250220 W to 100 W\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWavelength \u25021064 \u00b13 nm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBeam Quality \u2502 100000Hrs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGuide Laser/Red Aiming Beam\u2502Yes 660nm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Samples\n\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][27]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][28]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][29]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][30]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][31]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][32]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][33]\n[[Fiber Laser Marking Machine]][34]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is a Fiber Laser Marking Machine used for?\n][35]\n\nA Fiber Laser Marking Machine is used for permanent marking and engraving of text, logos, barcodes,\nand designs on metal and selected non-metal materials with high precision and speed.\n\nWhat is the difference between a fiber laser marking engraving machine and a fiber laser engraving\nmachine for metal?\n][36]\n\nA fiber laser marking engraving machine is used for surface marking and light engraving, while a\nfiber laser engraving machine for metal is designed for deeper engraving on materials like stainless\nsteel, aluminum, brass, and copper.\n\nWhat are the advantages of a fiber laser marking machine for metal?\n][37]\n\nA fiber laser marking machine for metal provides high contrast, permanent marks, minimal heat\nimpact, fast processing speed, and excellent accuracy, making it ideal for industrial metal marking\napplications.\n\nWhat is a desktop fiber laser marking machine best suited for?\n][38]\n\nA desktop fiber laser marking machine is compact and ideal for small workshops, laboratories,\njewelry marking, tool engraving, and low-to-medium production environments.\n\nWhat industries use fiber laser engraving machines for metal?\n][39]\n\nIndustries using fiber laser engraving machines for metal include automotive, electronics, medical\ndevices, hardware tools, jewelry, aerospace, and precision manufacturing.\n\nWhat industries use fiber laser engraving machines for metal?\n][40]\n\nIndustries using fiber laser engraving machines for metal include automotive, electronics, medical\ndevices, hardware tools, jewelry, aerospace, and precision manufacturing.\n\n## Download Brochure\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nEmail *\nPhone *\nCustom Captcha *\nPhone Name Captcha\nSubmit\n\n## More Laser Marking Solutions\n\n[[Hendhel Fiber Laser Welding Machine]][41]\n[Fiber Laser Hand-Held Welding Machine][42]\nPortable, fast, and precise laser welding solution.\n[View Details][43]\nGet In Touch\n\n## Contact With Us\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nCompany Name *\nEmail *\nPhone *\nCompany Name Email\nMessage *\nCustom Captcha *\nSubmit\n\n### Spares & Consumables\n\nKeep your operations running smoothly with our extensive range of high-quality laser spares and\nconsumables.\n\n[Arrow Icon]\n[[Unique Laser Footer Logo]][44]\n[Facebook][45][Instagram][46][LinkedIn][47]\n[ISO 9001:2015]\n[CE marking]\nReg. Office and Manufacturing Facility\n\n177, Por Industrial Park, Por,\nVadodara, Gujarat 391243\n\nSales and Support\n\n+91 9033791601\n\n][48][\nEmail Us\n\ninfo@uniquelaser.co.in\n\n][49]\nQuick Links\n* [Home][50]\n* [About Us][51]\n* [Products][52]\n* [UL Events][53]\n* [Support][54]\n* [Spares & Consumables][55]\n* [Resources][56]\n* [FAQs][57]\n* [Contact Us][58]\n* [