      "company_summary": "Unitedspectrum is a specialized provider of advanced scientific and industrial instrumentation, catering to research institutions and high-tech manufacturing across India. The company offers a diverse range of products, including imaging cameras, laser sources, dust and fume extractors, and optical communication test equipment, designed to enhance precision and efficiency in various sectors such as aerospace, automotive, and scientific research. With a commitment to delivering smart, seamless, and scalable solutions, Unitedspectrum empowers its customers to achieve regulatory compliance and operational excellence in their respective industries.",
