            "url": "https://unitedspectrum.in",
            "text": "United Spectrum Instruments | Laser & Photonics India\n\nSkip to main content\n\nSkip to footer\n\nSearch\n\nProducts\n\nImaging Cameras &amp; Wavefront Sensors\nLaser Sources\nDust &amp; Fume Extractors\nIndustrial Laser Systems\nOptical Communication Test &amp; Measurement\nOptical Sensors, IR Emitters &amp; LED's\nOpto-Electronic Packaging Systems\n\nIndustrial Application\nCompany\n\nResources\n\nDownloads\n\nContact Us\n\nEnquire Now\n\nAdvanced Scientific &amp; Industrial Instrumentation \u2013 Engineered For Precision\nDiscover high-performance laser systems, infrared imaging and photonic packaging solutions tailored for Automotive, Aerospace, Defence, Research, and Industry 4.0.\n\nTrusted by manufacturers, researchers, and OEMs\n\nWHO WE ARE\nEmpowering Your Business with Smart, Seamless, and Scalable Solutions\nUnited Spectrum Instruments is your trusted partner for advanced laser micromachining, high-speed imaging, photonic testing, and thermal inspection systems across India. From femtosecond laser machining to wavefront sensing and high-resolution infrared cameras, our solutions enable precision, productivity, and innovation.\n\nVision\nMission\n\nTo be the most trusted partner for advanced scientific and industrial instrumentation, delivering uncompromising precision and reliability while empowering innovation across research and manufacturing ecosystems throughout India.\n\nTo connect global innovation with India\u2019s research and manufacturing ecosystem through advanced, reliable instrumentation and trusted partnerships. We aim to accelerate scientific progress by making world\u2011class technologies accessible and impactful across the country.\n\nWHY CHOOSE US\nYour Partner for Innovation and Precision\n\nAuthorised distributor of global brands\n\nEnd-to-end solution integration &amp; customisation\n\nTrusted by major academic research institutions across India\n\nApplication-focused sales and support\n\nBoth online &amp; offline commissioning and training\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\nReliable Engineering Solutions for Modern Manufacturing\nDelivering cutting-edge technologies and precision systems that enhance productivity, quality, and innovation in today\u2019s manufacturing environments.\n\nImaging Cameras &amp; Wavefront Sensors\nImaging Cameras &amp; Wavefront Sensors provide high-precision visual and measurement data for inspection, alignment, and process monitoring in industrial and scientific applications.\nDiscover More\n\nLaser Sources\nIndustrial and Scientific Laser Sources deliver stable, high-precision laser output for micro-machining, cutting, processing, research, and advanced scientific applications across diverse industrial environments\nDiscover More\n\nDust &amp; Fume Extractors\nA Dust &amp; Fume Extractor removes dust, smoke, and fumes at the source to maintain a clean and safe industrial workspace, ensuring regulatory compliance and operator health\nDiscover More\n\nIndustrial Laser Systems\nIndustrial Laser Systems delivers high-precision, reliable laser performance for marking, cutting, welding, micro-machining, and advanced manufacturing applications across diverse industrial.\nDiscover More\n\nOptical Communication Test &amp; Measurement\nOptical Communication Systems integrate optical transmitters, receivers, lasers, and OSA for signal generation, transmission.\nDiscover More\n\nOptical Sensors, IR Emitters &amp; LED's\nOptical UV Sensors, IR Emitters and LED's provide precise ultraviolet detection and measurement for monitoring, analysis, safety, and scientific applications across industrial and research environments.\nDiscover More\n\nOpto-Electronic Packaging Systems\nOpto-electronic packaging systems enable precise assembly, alignment, and packaging of opto-electronic devices for production.\nDiscover More\n\nINDUSTRY EXPERTISE\nExcellence in Engineering. Trusted Across Industries.\nDelivering innovative solutions that power precision, reliability, and performance across every application.\n\nAerospace & Defence\nManufacturing\n\nAutomotive & EV\nManufacturing\n\nSemiconductor\nPackaging\n\nResearch &\nAcademia\n\nScientific Research &\nLaboratories\n\nEducation & R&D\nInstitutions\n\n& Manufacturing\nAutomation\n\nElectronics & PCB\nManufacturing\n\nMedical Device\nManufacturing\n\nJewellery & Watch\nIndustry\n\nDies & Mould\nIndustry\n\nGold Minting and Bullion\nManufacturing\n\nEnergy & Power\nIndustry\n\nForging & Casting\nIndustry\n\nMachine\nVision\n\nSteel & Manufacturing and\nMetallurgical Explore Industrial Applications\n\nTESTIMONIAL\nWhat Our Clients Say's\n\nThyagaraj Nadar\n4 years ago\nI was searching for suitable Laser Engraving solution to engrave / mark tag plates for equipment's which we supply in our Oil &amp; Gas projects. United Spectrum Team helped, guided and supported me in selecting perfect model for our application. They are the correct company to help with customized solution for all your engraving and marking needs. The engraving machine purchased is working great! Thank you United Spectrum Instruments.\n\nShivaji Chavanke\n4 years ago\nVery supportive and knowledgeable team on the technical front. Understand the requirement carefully and provide appropriate solution.\nWe have carried out various successful VIN marking trials with laser. Thanks Narendra for your help and support\n\nChoudhari Warrish\n3 years ago\nLASIT LASER ETCHING MACHINE\nwe are very satisfied with this machine we get the better result as compare to other machine.\nThank you Narendran for your help and support.\n\nName\nCompany Name\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\n\u201cUnited Spectrum helped us improve imaging accuracy by 50%\u2026\u201d\n\nName\nCompany Name\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\n\u201cUnited Spectrum helped us improve imaging accuracy by 50%\u2026\u201d\n\nName\nCompany Name\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\n\u201cUnited Spectrum helped us improve imaging accuracy by 50%\u2026\u201d\n\nYour Gateway to Industrial Excellence \u2014 Empowering You to Engineer the Future.\nYour trusted source for technical insights, product knowledge, and engineering tools that drive industrial innovation and excellence. Explore Products\n\nSTART TODAY\nWe Provide Reliable Industry Solution\nWe offer trusted and proven solutions engineered to support efficiency, precision, and growth across diverse industrial sectors. Contact Us\n\nWe offer trusted and proven solutions engineered to support efficiency, precision, and growth across diverse industrial sectors.\nGST No. 33ALHPN5688H2ZO\n\nIEC No. 0414019059\n\nMSME No. UDYAM-TN-02-0113376\n\nProduct Categories\nImaging Cameras &amp; Wavefront Sensors\nLaser Sources\nDust &amp; Fume Extractors\nIndustrial Laser Systems\nOptical Communication Test &amp; Measurement\nOptical Sensors, IR Emitters &amp; LED's\nOpto-Electronic Packaging Systems\n\nAbout Us\nApplications\nDownloads\nContact Us\n\nConnect With Us\n\n5/45 Karunaa Conclave, 3rd Floor, AD Block, 1st Street, Anna Nagar, Chennai - 600040, Tamil Nadu, INDIA\n\nsales@unitedspectrum.in\ninfo@unitedspectrum.in\n\n+91 93631 83748\n+91 97899 04948\n\n\u00a9 2026 United Spectrum Instruments all rights reserved. Business Terms and Conditions.\n\nSubmit"
