ansmitters, receivers, lasers, and OSA for signal\ngeneration, transmission.\nDiscover More\n][25]\n[Icon8]\n\n### [Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][26]\n\nOptical UV Sensors, IR Emitters and LED's provide precise ultraviolet detection and measurement for\nmonitoring, analysis, safety, and scientific applications across industrial and research\nenvironments.\nDiscover More\n][27]\n[Icon6]\n\n### [Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][28]\n\nOpto-electronic packaging systems enable precise assembly, alignment, and packaging of\nopto-electronic devices for production.\nDiscover More\n][29]\n\n### GET IN TOUCH WITH US\n\n## Have a Project in Mind ? Let\u2019s Talk\n\nTell us about your project or requirements. Our business team will review your inquiry and contact\nyou at the earliest.\nGET IN TOUCH\n[Icon3]\nAddress\n[5/45 Karunaa Conclave, 3rd Floor, AD Block, 1st Street, Anna Nagar, Chennai - 600040, Tamil Nadu,\nINDIA][30]\n[Icon2]\nEmail Us\n[sales@unitedspectrum.in][31]\n[info@unitedspectrum.in][32]\n[Icon1]\nCall Now\n[+91 93631 83748][33]\n[+91 97899 04948][34]\n\n## Your Gateway to Industrial Excellence \u2014 Empowering You to Engineer the Future.\n\nYour trusted source for technical insights, product knowledge, and engineering tools that drive\nindustrial innovation and excellence.\nExplore more\n[[Whatsapp svgrepo com]][35]\n[[UNITEDSPECTRUM LOGO white]][36]\nWe offer trusted and proven solutions engineered to support efficiency, precision, and growth across\ndiverse industrial sectors.\n[[Pngegg W]][37]\n**GST No.** 33ALHPN5688H2ZO\n**IEC No.** 0414019059\n**MSME No.** UDYAM-TN-02-0113376\n[[In]][38]\n[[Yt]][39]\n[Product Categories][40]\n[Imaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors][41]\n[Laser Sources][42]\n[Dust & Fume Extractors][43]\n[Industrial Laser Systems][44]\n[Optical Communication Test & Measurement][45]\n[Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][46]\n[Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][47]\n[About Us][48]\n[Applications][49]\n[Downloads][50]\n[Contact Us][51]\nConnect With Us\n[Icon9]\n[5/45 Karunaa Conclave, 3rd Floor, AD Block, 1st Street, Anna Nagar, Chennai - 600040, Tamil Nadu,\nINDIA][52]\n[Icon10]\n[sales@unitedspectrum.in][53]\n[info@unitedspectrum.in][54]\n[Icon11]\n[+91 93631 83748][55]\n[+91 97899 04948][56]\n\u00a9 2026 United Spectrum Instruments all rights reserved. Business Terms and Conditions.\nSubmit\n\n[1]: #brx-content\n[2]: #brx-footer\n[3]: /\n[4]: /products/\n[5]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[6]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[7]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[8]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[9]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[10]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[11]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[12]: /industrial-application/\n[13]: /company/\n[14]: /downloads/?category=industrial-laser-systems\n[15]: /contact-us/\n[16]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[17]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[18]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[19]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[20]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[21]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[22]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[23]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[24]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[25]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[26]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[27]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[28]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[29]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[30]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Karuna+Conclave/@13.082914,80.2084837,66m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x\n3a52640734a79851:0x98ac775276ac732a!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1abbcf0!2sKaruna+Co\nnclave!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!10e5!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68!3m5!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1\nabbcf0!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDEyMC4wIKXMDSoASAF\nQAw%3D%3D\n[31]: mailto:sales@unitedspectrum.in\n[32]: mailto:info@unitedspectrum.in\n[33]: tel:+91 93631 83748\n[34]: tel:+91 97899 04948\n[35]: https://wa.me/+919789904948\n[36]: /home/\n[37]: /home/\n[38]: https://linkedin.com/\n[39]: https://youtube.com/\n[40]: /products/\n[41]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[42]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[43]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[44]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[45]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[46]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[47]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[48]: /company/\n[49]: /industrial-application/\n[50]: /downloads/?category=industrial-laser-systems\n[51]: /contact-us/\n[52]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Karuna+Conclave/@13.082914,80.2084837,66m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x\n3a52640734a79851:0x98ac775276ac732a!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1abbcf0!2sKaruna+Co\nnclave!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!10e5!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68!3m5!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1\nabbcf0!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDEyMC4wIKXMDSoASAF\n