            "text": "[Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2]\n[[UNITEDSPECTRUM LOGO]][3]\n* Search\n* [Products][4]\n* [Imaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors][5]\n[Laser Sources][6]\n[Dust & Fume Extractors][7]\n[Industrial Laser Systems][8]\n[Optical Communication Test & Measurement][9]\n[Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][10]\n[Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][11]\n* [Industrial Application][12]\n* [Company][13]\n* Resources\n* [Downloads][14]\n* [Contact Us][15]\n* Enquire Now\n\n## About Us\n\nUnited Spectrum Instruments (USI) is a specialised provider of advanced scientific and industrial\ninstrumentation, serving research institutions, high-tech manufacturing, and industrial customers\nacross India. With a strong focus on precision, reliability, and innovation, we bridge global\ntechnologies with India\u2019s growing research and manufacturing ecosystem. Founded and led by\nprofessionals with deep domain expertise in physics, lasers, and electro-optical engineering, USI\nbrings over a decade of hands-on experience in supplying, integrating, and supporting world-class\ninstrumentation. We work closely with globally recognised technology partners to deliver proven\nsolutions that meet demanding application requirements in India.\n[About us usi]\n\n### NEWS AND EVENTS\n\n## What is happening in our industry current updates\n\n#### News\n\n[Acsys news]\n\n#### Precision Day 2025\n\nA large number of guests from industry, research, and business visited Kornwestheim to explore the\nlatest trends and technological advancements. The event highlighted high\u2011precision applications,\ncutting\u2011edge automation solutions, and impressive live demonstrations of ACSYS\u2019s newest laser\nsystems. One of the key attractions was the series of expert presentations delivered by Eric\nG\u00e4rtner, Max Ernstberger, Dr. Holger Schl\u00fcter, and Paulius Bli\u0161kevi\u010dius, whose deep technical\nknowledge and forward\u2011thinking insights captivated the audience. Lively discussions and extensive\nnetworking throughout the event generated valuable momentum for future projects and collaborations.\n[Lasit news]\n\n#### Remadays 2026\n\nLASIT will participate in Remadays, the international printing and advertising trade fair in Poland,\nwhere we will present our latest laser solutions developed specifically for promotional applications\nand high\u2011quality marking on plastic materials. Throughout the event, our technical team will perform\nreal\u2011time demonstrations on components provided directly by visitors, offering a clear understanding\nof performance, precision, and workflow efficiency. You can find us in Hall F, space 2.36, where we\nwill share a booth with Inkcups, a recognised leader in pad printing and UV inkjet technologies for\nthe promotional and industrial sectors. Two fully operational laser systems will be showcased,\nallowing attendees to observe live marking on a wide range of materials, shapes, and geometries.\n\n#### Events\n\n[Nls]\n\n##### National Laser Symposium 2026\n\nLaser science, laser\u2013matter interaction, industrial & defense lasers\n**Date:** Jan 2026\n**Location:** IIT / DRDO campus (India)\n** Organiser:**\nLaser Society of India\n[Icop]\n\n##### International Conference on Optics and Photonics 2026\n\nOptics, photonics, laser technologies.\n**Date:** 23\u201324 February 2026 (India Edition)\n**Location:** New Delhi, India\n** Organiser:**\nWorld Academy of Science, Engineering & Technology\n[Photonics conference india]\n\n##### Photonics India Conference 2026\n\nPhotonics, lasers, optical communication\n**Date:** April / May 2026\n**Location:** IIT / IISc\n** Organiser:**\nPhotonics Society of India\n[Lwop india]\n\n##### LASER World of PHOTONICS INDIA 2026\n\nIndustrial lasers, photonics systems & components\n**Date:** 10\u201312 September 2026\n**Location:** Bangalore International Exhibition Centre (BIEC), Bengaluru\n**Organiser:** Messe M\u00fcnchen, India\n\n## Work with US\n\nWhen you submit this form, it will not automatically collect your details like name and email\naddress unless you provide it yourself.\nFull Name\nContact Number (10 digit)\nYour Email\nGender\n* Male\n* Female\nDOB (DD/MM/YY)\nGraduation/ PG Degree course\nExperience\n* Yes\n* No\nJob Location (if Fresher, write \"NA\")\nCurrent Designation (if Fresher, write \"NA\")\nCurrent Company (if Fresher, write \"NA\")\nNotice Period (if Fresher, write \"NA\")\nCurrent Salary (if Fresher, write \"NA\")\nExpected Salary\nHow many languages do you speak?\nPosition (Applied For)\nReady for travel\n* Yes\n* No\n* May Be\nSUBMIT\n[[Whatsapp svgrepo com]][16]\n[[UNITEDSPECTRUM LOGO white]][17]\nWe offer trusted and proven solutions engineered to support efficiency, precision, and growth across\ndiverse industrial sectors.\n[[Pngegg W]][18]\n**GST No.** 33ALHPN5688H2ZO\n**IEC No.** 0414019059\n**MSME No.** UDYAM-TN-02-0113376\n[[In]][19]\n[[Yt]][20]\n[Product Categories][21]\n[Imaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors][22]\n[Laser Sources][23]\n[Dust & Fume Extractors][24]\n[Industrial Laser Systems][25]\n[Optical Communication Test & Measurement][26]\n[Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][27]\n[Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][28]\n[About Us][29]\n[Applications][30]\n[Downloads][31]\n[Contact Us][32]\nConnect With Us\n[Icon9]\n[5/45 Karunaa Conclave, 3rd Floor, AD Block, 1st Street, Anna Nagar, Chennai - 600040, Tamil Nadu,\nINDIA][33]\n[Icon10]\n[sales@unitedspectrum.in][34]\n[info@unitedspectrum.in][35]\n[Icon11]\n[+91 93631 83748][36]\n[+91 97899 04948][37]\n\u00a9 2026 United Spectrum Instruments all rights reserved. Business Terms and Conditions.\nSubmit\n\n[1]: #brx-content\n[2]: #brx-footer\n[3]: /\n[4]: /products/\n[5]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[6]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[7]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[8]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[9]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[10]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[11]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[12]: /industrial-application/\n[13]: /company/\n[14]: /downloads/?category=industrial-laser-systems\n[15]: /contact-us/\n[16]: https://wa.me/+919789904948\n[17]: /home/\n[18]: /home/\n[19]: https://linkedin.com/\n[20]: https://youtube.com/\n[21]: /products/\n[22]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[23]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[24]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[25]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[26]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[27]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[28]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[29]: /company/\n[30]: /industrial-application/\n[31]: /downloads/?category=industrial-laser-systems\n[32]: /contact-us/\n[33]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Karuna+Conclave/@13.082914,80.2084837,66m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x\n3a52640734a79851:0x98ac775276ac732a!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1abbcf0!2sKaruna+Co\nnclave!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!10e5!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68!3m5!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1\nabbcf0!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDEyMC4wIKXMDSoASAF\nQAw%3D%3D\n[34]: mailto:sales@unitedspectrum.in\n[35]: mailto:info@unitedspectrum.in\n[36]: tel:+91 93631 83748\n[37]: tel:+91 97899 04948"
