            "url": "https://unitedspectrum.in/contact-us/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2]\n[[UNITEDSPECTRUM LOGO]][3]\n* Search\n* [Products][4]\n* [Imaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors][5]\n[Laser Sources][6]\n[Dust & Fume Extractors][7]\n[Industrial Laser Systems][8]\n[Optical Communication Test & Measurement][9]\n[Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][10]\n[Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][11]\n* [Industrial Application][12]\n* [Company][13]\n* Resources\n* [Downloads][14]\n* [Contact Us][15]\n* Enquire Now\n[United spectrum instruments products]\n\n## Contact Us\n\nPlease select product category * Select product category Imaging Cameras & Sensors Laser Sources\nDust & Fume Extractors Industrial Laser Systems Optical Communication Systems Optical Sensors &\nDetectors Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems\nPlease check the item(s) you are interested in *\n* Please have a representative contact me.\n* I want to know the price.\n* I need a trial unit, contact me.\n* Other\nPlease Enter Your Email Address\n* If you have registered in the past, please enter your registered email address below.\n* If you are not yet registered, please enter your email address below and click \"Continue\" to\ncomplete your registration.\nCompany Name\nBusiness E-mail\nPhone Number\nContinue\n\nWe guarantee 100% privacy \u2013 your information will never be shared.\n[Privacy Statement][16]\n\n**Online Member Benefits**\n* Instant product catalogue and technical guide downloads\n* Seamlessly submit requests for pricing and demonstrations\n* One-time registration, unlimited access\n\n[Icon3]\nAddress\n[5/45 Karunaa Conclave, 3rd Floor, AD Block, 1st Street, Anna Nagar, Chennai - 600040, Tamil Nadu,\nINDIA][17]\n[Icon2]\nEmail Us\n[sales@unitedspectrum.in][18]\n[info@unitedspectrum.in][19]\n[Icon1]\nCall Now\n[+91 93631 83748][20]\n[+91 97899 04948][21]\n\n### WHAT WE OFFER\n\n## Reliable Engineering Solutions for Modern Manufacturing\n\nDelivering cutting-edge technologies and precision systems that enhance productivity, quality, and\ninnovation in today\u2019s manufacturing environments.\n[Icon8]\n\n### [Imaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors][22]\n\nImaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors provide high-precision visual and measurement data for\ninspection, alignment, and process monitoring in industrial and scientific applications.\nDiscover More\n][23]\n[Icon7]\n\n### [Laser Sources][24]\n\nIndustrial and Scientific Laser Sources deliver stable, high-precision laser output for\nmicro-machining, cutting, processing, research, and advanced scientific applications across diverse\nindustrial environments\nDiscover More\n][25]\n[Icon7]\n\n### [Dust & Fume Extractors][26]\n\nA Dust & Fume Extractor removes dust, smoke, and fumes at the source to maintain a clean and safe\nindustrial workspace, ensuring regulatory compliance and operator health\nDiscover More\n][27]\n[Icon6]\n\n### [Industrial Laser Systems][28]\n\nIndustrial Laser Systems delivers high-precision, reliable laser performance for marking, cutting,\nwelding, micro-machining, and advanced manufacturing applications across diverse industrial.\nDiscover More\n][29]\n[Icon9]\n\n### [Optical Communication Test & Measurement][30]\n\nOptical Communication Systems integrate optical transmitters, receivers, lasers, and OSA for signal\ngeneration, transmission.\nDiscover More\n][31]\n[Icon8]\n\n### [Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][32]\n\nOptical UV Sensors, IR Emitters and LED's provide precise ultraviolet detection and measurement for\nmonitoring, analysis, safety, and scientific applications across industrial and research\nenvironments.\nDiscover More\n][33]\n[Icon6]\n\n### [Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][34]\n\nOpto-electronic packaging systems enable precise assembly, alignment, and packaging of\nopto-electronic devices for production.\nDiscover More\n][35]\n[[Whatsapp svgrepo com]][36]\n[[UNITEDSPECTRUM LOGO white]][37]\nWe offer trusted and proven solutions engineered to support efficiency, precision, and growth across\ndiverse industrial sectors.\n[[Pngegg W]][38]\n**GST No.** 33ALHPN5688H2ZO\n**IEC No.** 0414019059\n**MSME No.** UDYAM-TN-02-0113376\n[[In]][39]\n[[Yt]][40]\n[Product Categories][41]\n[Imaging Cameras & Wavefront Sensors][42]\n[Laser Sources][43]\n[Dust & Fume Extractors][44]\n[Industrial Laser Systems][45]\n[Optical Communication Test & Measurement][46]\n[Optical Sensors, IR Emitters & LED's][47]\n[Opto-Electronic Packaging Systems][48]\n[About Us][49]\n[Applications][50]\n[Downloads][51]\n[Contact Us][52]\nConnect With Us\n[Icon9]\n[5/45 Karunaa Conclave, 3rd Floor, AD Block, 1st Street, Anna Nagar, Chennai - 600040, Tamil Nadu,\nINDIA][53]\n[Icon10]\n[sales@unitedspectrum.in][54]\n[info@unitedspectrum.in][55]\n[Icon11]\n[+91 93631 83748][56]\n[+91 97899 04948][57]\n\u00a9 2026 United Spectrum Instruments all rights reserved. Business Terms and Conditions.\nSubmit\n\n[1]: #brx-content\n[2]: #brx-footer\n[3]: /\n[4]: /products/\n[5]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/imaging-cameras-wave-front-sensors/\n[6]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/laser-sources/\n[7]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/dust-fume-extractors/\n[8]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/industrial-laser-systems/\n[9]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-communication-test-measurement-india/\n[10]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/optical-sensors-detectors/\n[11]: https://unitedspectrum.in/product-category/opto-electronic-packaging-systems/\n[12]: /industrial-application/\n[13]: /company/\n[14]: /downloads/?category=industrial-laser-systems\n[15]: /contact-us/\n[16]: #\n[17]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Karuna+Conclave/@13.082914,80.2084837,66m/data=!3m2!1e3!5s0x\n3a52640734a79851:0x98ac775276ac732a!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1abbcf0!2sKaruna+Co\nnclave!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!10e5!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68!3m5!1s0x3a52652e8ce6f3d1:0x2d12d384a1\nabbcf0!8m2!3d13.0830931!4d80.2085478!16s%2Fg%2F11vywf5v68?entry=