chine, your next choice for the future.\n\nVEGA\n\nCoil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Xpro Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Series, Vega model, makes a difference for coil feeding metal cutting in the custom fabrication of aluminum, as well as galvanized and stainless steel.\n\nVIRGO\n\nPrecision Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nMeet your precision cutting needs with our Precision Cutting Virgo Fiber Laser Machine.\n\nXPRO CNC\n20 Years of Experience\n\nSOLARIS\n\nMulti Function Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Xpro Combination Fiber Laser Cutting Series, Solaris. Perfect for sheet metal and pipe cutting in the custom fabrication of steel, galvanized and stainless, and aluminum.\n\nCRATER\n\nOversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nModel Regulus is your all in one solution for laser automation. It has an automation integrated laser cutting solution. It has a fully integrated system for laser table loading, sorting, cutting and unloading.\n\nCRUX\n\nTube Metal Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nCrux is our new model with an optional bundle loading selection that is able to carry out full 5/16\u201d wall thickness carbon steel.\n\nXPRO CNC\nIntelligent Solutions for Woodworking Machines\n\nLYRA\n\nFiber Laser Welding Machine\n\nOur Xpro Fiber Laser Welding Machine, Lyra, makes a difference for thin or thick metal welding. Welding any metal thickness is made possible.\n\nDRACO\n\nClose Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Draco is designed to make working in small areas while maintaining safety, possible. It has a unique cutting edge design which is the result of a long r&amp;d development process.\n\nNATASHA\n\nOpen Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine, Natasha, is designed to make material handling easy for the fiber laser cutting table. It is for fabrication and steel companies that have easy to load items to process.\n\nKnow the Recommended Laser Power\n\nUse our calculation tool to find out the appropriate laser power for a specific material and thickness.\n\nLaser Power Recommendation Tool\n\nSelect Material:\n-- Select Material -- Carbon Steel Stainless Steel Aluminum Brass Copper\n\nEnter Thickness (mm):\n\nRecommend Laser Power\n\nPlease select a material and enter thickness to get a recommendation.\n\nXpro CNC Laser Cutting Parameters by Material Type\nCarbon Steel, Stainless Steel, Aluminium and Brass\n\nCNC Machine\n\nLaser Cutter for Metal\n\nCNC Laser Cutter for Metal Unleash unparalleled accuracy and speed in your metal fabrication process. Unleashed cutting power developed the ...\n\nCNC Router For Aluminum\n\nThe question often arises: can a CNC router, traditionally known for woodworking, effectively machine aluminum? The answer is a resounding ...\n\nCNC Router for Wood\n\nIn the world of modern woodworking, precision, efficiency, and creativity are paramount. Whether you&#8217;re a hobbyist crafting unique art ...\n\nCNC Router For ACM Panels\n\nIn the competitive worlds of architectural fabrication, corporate signage, and retail displays, Aluminum Composite Material (ACM) has become ...\n\nCO2 Laser\n\nCO2 Laser cutting machine for hobbies and industrial CO2 cutters and etch | engraving machines for acrylic, wood, leather, paper, rubber, ...\n\nCNC Router for Doors\n\nIn the competitive world of woodworking and manufacturing, precision and efficiency are paramount. A CNC router for doors is no longer a ...\n\nCNC Router for Acrylic Cutting\n\nFrom vibrant retail displays and intricate signage to precise engineering components, acrylic (often known by trade names like Plexiglas\u00ae or ...\n\nSheet Laser Cutting Machine Andromeda\n\nOur 2025 model Fiber sheet laser cutting machine offers speed, precision, and security all in one Laser cutting Machine prices from CAD 204,000.00\n\nChoose Options:\n-- Please Select --\n48 x 96 inches 3kw\n5&#039; x 10&#039; 3kw\n5&#039; x 12&#039; 3kw\n5&#039; x 14&#039; 3kw\n6&#039; x 12&#039; 3kw\n84 x 168 inches 3kw\n48 x 96 inches 6kw\n5&#039; x 10&#039; 6kw\n5&#039; by 12&#039; 6kw\n5&#039; x 14&#039; 6kw\n6&#039; x 12&#039; 6kw\n84 x 168 inches 6kw\n48 by 96 inches 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n5&#039; x 10&#039; 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n5&#039; x 12&#039; 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n5&#039; x 14&#039; 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n6&#039; x 12&#039; 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n84 x 168 inches 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n48 x 96 inches 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n5&#039; x 10&#039; 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n5&#039; x 12&#039; 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n5&#039; x 14&#039; 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n6&#039; x 12&#039; 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n84 x 168 inches 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n\nEstimated Price:\n\n$0.00\n\nCoil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Vega\n\nXpro Coil fiber laser cutting series Vega model, makes a difference for coil feeding metal cutting for custom fabrication of aluminum , galvanized and stainless steel.\n\nChoose Options:\n-- Please Select --\n5&#039;by 12&#039; 3kw\n5&#039;by 12&#039; 6kw\n\nEstimated Price:\n\n$0.00\n\nSingle Table Fiber Laser Cutter Machine Adhara\n\nXpro single open fiber laser cutter series Adhara ,Sheet metal and pipe cutting for custom fabrication of steel , galvanized, stainless steel and aluminum.\n\nChoose Options:\n-- Please Select --\n4&#039; by 8&#039;\n5&#039; by 10&#039;\n5&#039; by 12&#039;\n5&#039; by 14&#039;\n\nEstimated Price:\n\n$0.00\n\nYears of Experiences\n\nWho We Are\n\nWorking for the Best\n\nA dedicated team committed to creating faster and more reliable machines.\n\nOur Mission\n\nHow We Work\n\nWe are devoted to strengthening local manufacturing through reliable, advanced CNC machine solutions.\n\nWe design and deliver both standard and custom-built CNC routers and laser cutting machines to meet the unique needs of every customer.\n\nConsult Us Now\n\nXpro CNC machines are a game-changer for our shop. Reliable, precise, and built to last. Their customer support is top-notch, always quick to help!\n\nMichael Thompson\n\nWe\u2019ve been using Xpro CNC for two years, and the quality is unmatched. The machines are easy to operate and have boosted our production efficiency!\n\nSarah Leung\n\nXpro CNC delivered beyond expectations. Their machines are robust, and the precision is perfect for our custom projects. Highly recommend!\n\nDavid Patel\n\nAs a small business owner, I needed reliable equipment. Xpro CNC\u2019s machines are user-friendly and durable. Worth every penny!\n\nEmily Carter\n\nXpro CNC machines have transformed our workflow. The precision and speed are incredible, and their team in Canada is always there to support us!\n\nRobert Nguyen\n\nOur Skills\n\nCertified and Skilled Manufacturing\n\nWe have invested in the latest technology and equipment in our new 11,000 sq. ft. facility.\n\nFacility Size\n95%\n\nR&D\n90%\n\nBusiness Plan\n95%\n\nStrategy\n85%\n\nNews &#038; Campaigns\n\nJoin XPRO CNC at CMTS 2025 in Canada!\n\nFree Maintenance for a Year? You Read That Right! XPRO CNC at CMTS 2025\n\nGet a FREE One-Year Consumable Package with our Draco Model at FABTECH Chicago 2025!\n\nPartner Companies\n\nOur Latest blog\n\n31 Jan, 2026\nComprehensive Guide to Buying a Cutter Laser Machine for Your Canadian Business\n\nRead More\n\n28 Jan, 2026\nThe Ultimate Guide to Laser Cutting Machines in Canada: Reviews, Pricing &amp; Business ROI\n\nRead More\n\n26 Jan, 2026\nThe Business Owner\u2019s Guide to Buying a Laser Cutting Machine in Canada\n\nRead More\n\n24 Jan, 2026\nLaser Cutting Machine in Canada: The 2026 Business Buyer\u2019s Guide\n\nRead More\n\n22 Jan, 2026\nThe Ultimate Guide to Laser Etching Machines for Canadian Businesses\n\nRead More\n\n16 Jan, 2026\nThe Ultimate Guide to Buying an Engraving Laser Machine for Your Canadian Business\n\nRead More\n\nWe are here for all your needs\n\nGet in Touch\n\nMessage Now\n\nAt XPRO CNC, we specialize in delivering state-of-the-art sheet laser cutting machines designed for precision, efficiency, and durability.\n11 Gray Rd, Bracebridge, ON P1L 1P8\n\nCNC router\n\nfor wood\n\nfor doors\n\nfor aluminum\n\nfor acrylic cutting\n\nfor ACM panels\n\nCNC machine\n\nsheet fiber laser cutting\n\nsheet &#038; tube fiber laser cutting\n\ncoil fiber laser cutting\n\nCO2 cutting engraving\n\nsteel &#038; pipe fiber laser cutting\n\nPages\n\nAbout us\n\nContact us\n\nBlog\n\nFAQs\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2025 All rights reserved. XPRO CNC\n\n11 Gray Rd, Bracebridge,\nON P1L 1P8\n\nCall Us: +1 647 355 9776\n\nE-Mail: office@xprocnc.com\n\nFind My Machine"
