enuimage xpro CNC machines]\n[ SCORPIUS ][75]\nSheet & Tube Laser Cutting Machine\n\nMeet our Scorpius model featuring the new parallel shuttle exchange which combines plate and pipe\ncutting with an enclosed cutting body.\n\n[atlasmegamenuimage xpro CNC machines]\n[ ATLAS ][76]\nLarge Plate Laser Cutting Machine\n\nAtlas is for fabrication and steel working factories or workshops that have oversized items to\nprocess.\n\n## XPRO CNC\n## Canadian CNC Machine Manufacturer\n\n[Open table Plate fiber laser cutter machine]\n[ ADHARA ][77]\nSingle Table Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Adhara Open Table Plate Fiber Laser Cutting Machine, your next choice for the future.\n\n[Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ VEGA ][78]\nCoil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Xpro Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Series, Vega model, makes a difference for coil feeding metal\ncutting in the custom fabrication of aluminum, as well as galvanized and stainless steel.\n\n[Precision fiber laser cutting machine]\n[ VIRGO ][79]\nPrecision Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nMeet your precision cutting needs with our Precision Cutting Virgo Fiber Laser Machine.\n\n## XPRO CNC\n## 20 Years of Experience\n\n[Multi function fiber laser cutting machine]\n[ SOLARIS ][80]\nMulti Function Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Xpro Combination Fiber Laser Cutting Series, Solaris. Perfect for sheet metal and pipe cutting\nin the custom fabrication of steel, galvanized and stainless, and aluminum.\n\n[Oversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Regulus]\n[ CRATER ][81]\nOversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nModel Regulus is your all in one solution for laser automation. It has an automation integrated\nlaser cutting solution. It has a fully integrated system for laser table loading, sorting, cutting\nand unloading.\n\n[Tube Metal Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ CRUX ][82]\nTube Metal Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nCrux is our new model with an optional bundle loading selection that is able to carry out full 5/16\u201d\nwall thickness carbon steel.\n\n## XPRO CNC\n## Intelligent Solutions for Woodworking Machines\n\n[fiber laser welding machine]\n[ LYRA ][83]\nFiber Laser Welding Machine\n\nOur Xpro Fiber Laser Welding Machine, Lyra, makes a difference for thin or thick metal welding.\nWelding any metal thickness is made possible.\n\n[Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ DRACO ][84]\nClose Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Draco is designed to make working in small areas while\nmaintaining safety, possible. It has a unique cutting edge design which is the result of a long r&d\ndevelopment process.\n\n[Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ NATASHA ][85]\nOpen Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine, Natasha, is designed to make material handling easy for\nthe fiber laser cutting table. It is for fabrication and steel companies that have easy to load\nitems to process.\n\n## Know the Recommended Laser Power\n\nUse our calculation tool to find out the appropriate laser power for a specific material and\nthickness.\n\n## Laser Power Recommendation Tool\n\nSelect Material: -- Select Material --Carbon SteelStainless SteelAluminumBrassCopper\nEnter Thickness (mm):\nRecommend Laser Power\n\nPlease select a material and enter thickness to get a recommendation.\n\n#### Xpro CNC Laser Cutting Parameters by Material Type\n#### Carbon Steel, Stainless Steel, Aluminium and Brass\n\n## CNC Machine\n\n[ [CNC Router for Doors] ][86]\n\n#### [CNC Router for Doors][87]\n\nIn the competitive world of woodworking and manufacturing, precision and efficiency are paramount. A\nCNC router for doors is no longer a ...\n\n[ [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting] ][88]\n\n#### [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting][89]\n\nFrom vibrant retail displays and intricate signage to precise engineering components, acrylic (often\nknown by trade names like Plexiglas\u00ae or ...\n\n[ [CNC Router For ACM Panels] ][90]\n\n#