            "text": "* [Machines by Process][1]\n\n##### [ANDROMEDA][2]\n\n[ [sheet laser cutting machine] ][3]\n\n##### SCORPIUS\n\n##### ATLAS\n\n##### CRUX\n\n##### ADHARA\n\n##### LYRA\n\n[ [fiber laser welding machine] ][4]\n\n##### VEGA\n\n##### REGULUS\n\n[ [Oversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Regulus] ][5]\n\n##### DRACO\n\n[ [Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine] ][6]\n\n##### PETRA\n\n##### NATASHA\n\n[ [Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine] ][7]\n\n##### VIRGO\n\n##### LEO\n\n##### SOLARIS\n\n##### CANIS\n\n##### CARINA\n\n##### CENTAURUS\n\n##### CRATER\n\n[ [Structural steel and pipe fiber laser cutting machine] ][8]\n\n##### [NOVA][9]\n\n[ [Large Open Table With Close Cutting Section Laser Cutting Machine Nova] ][10]\n* [CNC Machine][11]\n\n###### [Laser Cutter for Metal][12]\n\n###### [CO2 Laser][13]\n\n###### [CNC Router for Doors][14]\n\n[ [cnc router for doors] ][15]\n\n###### [CNC Router for Wood][16]\n\n[ [cnc router for wood] ][17]\n\n###### [CNC Router For Aluminum][18]\n\n[ [cnc router for aluminum] ][19]\n\n###### [CNC Router For ACM Panels][20]\n\n[ [cnc router for acm panels] ][21]\n\n[CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting][22]\n\n[ [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting] ][23]\n[ Find My Next Laser ][24]\n* [Machines by Process][25]\n\n##### [ANDROMEDA][26]\n\n[ [sheet laser cutting machine] ][27]\n\n##### SCORPIUS\n\n##### ATLAS\n\n##### CRUX\n\n##### ADHARA\n\n##### LYRA\n\n[ [fiber laser welding machine] ][28]\n\n##### VEGA\n\n##### REGULUS\n\n[ [Oversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Regulus] ][29]\n\n##### DRACO\n\n[ [Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine] ][30]\n\n##### PETRA\n\n##### NATASHA\n\n[ [Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine] ][31]\n\n##### VIRGO\n\n##### LEO\n\n##### SOLARIS\n\n##### CANIS\n\n##### CARINA\n\n##### CENTAURUS\n\n##### CRATER\n\n[ [Structural steel and pipe fiber laser cutting machine] ][32]\n\n##### [NOVA][33]\n\n[ [Large Open Table With Close Cutting Section Laser Cutting Machine Nova] ][34]\n* [CNC Machine][35]\n\n###### [Laser Cutter for Metal][36]\n\n###### [CO2 Laser][37]\n\n###### [CNC Router for Doors][38]\n\n[ [cnc router for doors] ][39]\n\n###### [CNC Router for Wood][40]\n\n[ [cnc router for wood] ][41]\n\n###### [CNC Router For Aluminum][42]\n\n[ [cnc router for aluminum] ][43]\n\n###### [CNC Router For ACM Panels][44]\n\n[ [cnc router for acm panels] ][45]\n\n[CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting][46]\n\n[ [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting] ][47]\n[ Find My Next Laser ][48]\n[[XPRO CNC]][49] [[XPRO CNC]][50]\n* [Machines by Process][51]\n\n##### [ANDROMEDA][52]\n\n[ [sheet laser cutting machine] ][53]\n\n##### SCORPIUS\n\n##### ATLAS\n\n##### CRUX\n\n##### ADHARA\n\n##### LYRA\n\n[ [fiber laser welding machine] ][54]\n\n##### VEGA\n\n##### REGULUS\n\n[ [Oversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Regulus] ][55]\n\n##### DRACO\n\n[ [Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine] ][56]\n\n##### PETRA\n\n##### NATASHA\n\n[ [Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine] ][57]\n\n##### VIRGO\n\n##### LEO\n\n##### SOLARIS\n\n##### CANIS\n\n##### CARINA\n\n##### CENTAURUS\n\n##### CRATER\n\n[ [Structural steel and pipe fiber laser cutting machine] ][58]\n\n##### [NOVA][59]\n\n[ [Large Open Table With Close Cutting Section Laser Cutting Machine Nova] ][60]\n* [CNC Machine][61]\n\n###### [Laser Cutter for Metal][62]\n\n###### [CO2 Laser][63]\n\n###### [CNC Router for Doors][64]\n\n[ [cnc router for doors] ][65]\n\n###### [CNC Router for Wood][66]\n\n[ [cnc router for wood] ][67]\n\n###### [CNC Router For Aluminum][68]\n\n[ [cnc router for aluminum] ][69]\n\n###### [CNC Router For ACM Panels][70]\n\n[ [cnc router for acm panels] ][71]\n\n[CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting][72]\n\n[ [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting] ][73]\n\n## Canadian CNC Machine Manufacturer - Xpro CNC\n\n[sheet laser cutting machine]\n[ ANDROMEDA ][74]\nSheet Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur 2025 Andromeda model Fiber Laser Cutting Machine offers speed, precision and security, all in\none!\n\n[scorpiusmegamenuimage xpro CNC machines]\n[ SCORPIUS ][75]\nSheet & Tube Laser Cutting Machine\n\nMeet our Scorpius model featuring the new parallel shuttle exchange which combines plate and pipe\ncutting with an enclosed cutting body.\n\n[atlasmegamenuimage xpro CNC machines]\n[ ATLAS ][76]\nLarge Plate Laser Cutting Machine\n\nAtlas is for fabrication and steel working factories or workshops that have oversized items to\nprocess.\n\n## XPRO CNC\n## Canadian CNC Machine Manufacturer\n\n[Open table Plate fiber laser cutter machine]\n[ ADHARA ][77]\nSingle Table Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Adhara Open Table Plate Fiber Laser Cutting Machine, your next choice for the future.\n\n[Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ VEGA ][78]\nCoil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Xpro Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Series, Vega model, makes a difference for coil feeding metal\ncutting in the custom fabrication of aluminum, as well as galvanized and stainless steel.\n\n[Precision fiber laser cutting machine]\n[ VIRGO ][79]\nPrecision Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nMeet your precision cutting needs with our Precision Cutting Virgo Fiber Laser Machine.\n\n## XPRO CNC\n## 20 Years of Experience\n\n[Multi function fiber laser cutting machine]\n[ SOLARIS ][80]\nMulti Function Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nThe Xpro Combination Fiber Laser Cutting Series, Solaris. Perfect for sheet metal and pipe cutting\nin the custom fabrication of steel, galvanized and stainless, and aluminum.\n\n[Oversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Regulus]\n[ CRATER ][81]\nOversize Automated Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nModel Regulus is your all in one solution for laser automation. It has an automation integrated\nlaser cutting solution. It has a fully integrated system for laser table loading, sorting, cutting\nand unloading.\n\n[Tube Metal Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ CRUX ][82]\nTube Metal Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nCrux is our new model with an optional bundle loading selection that is able to carry out full 5/16\u201d\nwall thickness carbon steel.\n\n## XPRO CNC\n## Intelligent Solutions for Woodworking Machines\n\n[fiber laser welding machine]\n[ LYRA ][83]\nFiber Laser Welding Machine\n\nOur Xpro Fiber Laser Welding Machine, Lyra, makes a difference for thin or thick metal welding.\nWelding any metal thickness is made possible.\n\n[Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ DRACO ][84]\nClose Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur Close Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Draco is designed to make working in small areas while\nmaintaining safety, possible. It has a unique cutting edge design which is the result of a long r&d\ndevelopment process.\n\n[Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine]\n[ NATASHA ][85]\nOpen Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine\n\nOur Open Table Fiber Laser Cutting Machine, Natasha, is designed to make material handling easy for\nthe fiber laser cutting table. It is for fabrication and steel companies that have easy to load\nitems to process.\n\n## Know the Recommended Laser Power\n\nUse our calculation tool to find out the appropriate laser power for a specific material and\nthickness.\n\n## Laser Power Recommendation Tool\n\nSelect Material: -- Select Material --Carbon SteelStainless SteelAluminumBrassCopper\nEnter Thickness (mm):\nRecommend Laser Power\n\nPlease select a material and enter thickness to get a recommendation.\n\n#### Xpro CNC Laser Cutting Parameters by Material Type\n#### Carbon Steel, Stainless Steel, Aluminium and Brass\n\n## CNC Machine\n\n[ [CNC Router for Doors] ][86]\n\n#### [CNC Router for Doors][87]\n\nIn the competitive world of woodworking and manufacturing, precision and efficiency are paramount. A\nCNC router for doors is no longer a ...\n\n[ [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting] ][88]\n\n#### [CNC Router for Acrylic Cutting][89]\n\nFrom vibrant retail displays and intricate signage to precise engineering components, acrylic (often\nknown by trade names like Plexiglas\u00ae or ...\n\n[ [Laser Cutter for Metal] ][90]\n\n#### [Laser Cutter for Metal][91]\n\nCNC Laser Cutter for Metal Unleash unparalleled accuracy and speed in your metal fabrication\nprocess. Unleashed cutting power developed the ...\n\n[ [CNC Router For ACM Panels] ][92]\n\n#### [CNC Router For ACM Panels][93]\n\nIn the competitive worlds of architectural fabrication, corporate signage, and retail displays,\nAluminum Composite Material (ACM) has become ...\n\n[ [CNC Router for Wood] ][94]\n\n#### [CNC Router for Wood][95]\n\nIn the world of modern woodworking, precision, efficiency, and creativity are paramount. Whether\nyou\u2019re a hobbyist crafting unique art ...\n\n[ [CNC Router For Aluminum] ][96]\n\n#### [CNC Router For Aluminum][97]\n\nThe question often arises: can a CNC router, traditionally known for woodworking, effectively\nmachine aluminum? The answer is a resounding ...\n\n[ [CO2 Laser] ][98]\n\n#### [CO2 Laser][99]\n\nCO2 Laser cutting machine for hobbies and industrial CO2 cutters and etch | engraving machines for\nacrylic, wood, leather, paper, rubber, ...\n\n[Sheet Laser Cutting Machine Andromeda]\n\n## Sheet Laser Cutting Machine Andromeda\n\nOur 2025 model Fiber sheet laser cutting machine offers speed, precision, and security all in one\nLaser cutting Machine **prices from CAD 204,000.00**\n\nChoose Options: -- Please Select -- 48 x 96 inches 3kw 5' x 10' 3kw 5' x 12' 3kw 5' x 14' 3kw 6' x\n12' 3kw 84 x 168 inches 3kw 48 x 96 inches 6kw 5' x 10' 6kw 5' by 12' 6kw 5' x 14' 6kw 6' x 12' 6kw\n84 x 168 inches 6kw 48 by 96 inches 9kw with Precitec procutter head 5' x 10' 9kw with Precitec\nprocutter head 5' x 12' 9kw with Precitec procutter head 5' x 14' 9kw with Precitec procutter head\n6' x 12' 9kw with Precitec procutter head 84 x 168 inches 9kw with Precitec procutter head 48 x 96\ninches 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA 5' x 10' 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA 5' x\n12' 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA 5' x 14' 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA 6' x 12'\n12kw with IPG laser source made in USA 84 x 168 inches 12kw with IPG laser source made in USA\n\nEstimated Price:\n\n$0.00\n\n[Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Vega]\n\n## Coil Fiber Laser Cutting Machine Vega\n\nXpro Coil fiber laser cutting series Vega model, makes a difference for coil feeding metal cutting\nfor custom fabrication of aluminum , galvanized and stainless steel.\n\nChoose Options: -- Please Select -- 5'by 12' 3kw 5'by 12' 6kw\n\nEstimated Price:\n\n$0.00\n\n[Single Table Fiber Laser Cutter Machine Adhara]\n\n## Single Table Fiber Laser Cutter Machine Adhara\n\nXpro single open fiber laser cutter series Adhara ,Sheet metal and pipe cutting for custom\nfabrication of steel , galvanized, stainless steel and aluminum.\n\nChoose Options: -- Please Select -- 4' by 8' 5' by 10' 5' by 12' 5' by 14'\n\nEstimated Price:\n\n$0.00\n\n[xpro CNC machines]\n[xpro CNC machines]\nYears of Experiences\nWho We Are\n\n## Working for the Best\n\nA dedicated team committed to creating faster and more reliable machines.\n\nOur Mission How We Work\n\nWe are devoted to strengthening local manufacturing through reliable, advanced CNC machine\nsolutions.\n\nWe design and deliver both standard and custom-built CNC routers and laser cutting machines to meet\nthe unique needs of every customer.\n\n[ Consult Us Now ][100]\nXpro CNC machines are a game-changer for our shop. Reliable, precise, and built to last. Their\ncustomer support is top-notch, always quick to help!\n[MichaelThompsonxprocnccr]\n\n##### Michael Thompson\n\nWe\u2019ve been using Xpro CNC for two years, and the quality is unmatched. The machines are easy to\noperate and have boosted our production efficiency!\n[SarahLeungxprocnccr]\n\n##### Sarah Leung\n\nXpro CNC delivered beyond expectations. Their machines are robust, and the precision is perfect for\nour custom projects. Highly recommend!\n[DavidPatelxprocnccr]\n\n##### David Patel\n\nAs a small business owner, I needed reliable equipment. Xpro CNC\u2019s machines are user-friendly and\ndurable. Worth every penny!\n[EmilyCarterxprocnccr]\n\n##### Emily Carter\n\nXpro CNC machines have transformed our workflow. The precision and speed are incredible, and their\nteam in Canada is always there to support us!\n[RobertNguyenxprocnccr]\n\n##### Robert Nguyen\n\nOur Skills\n\n## Certified and Skilled Manufacturing\n\n[canadian cnc machine manufacturer Xpro Cnc]\n[banner3xprocnc]\n\nWe have invested in the latest technology and equipment in our new 11,000 sq. ft. facility.\n\nFacility Size\n95%\nR&D\n90%\nBusiness Plan\n95%\nStrate"
