            "text": "[Webshop][1]\n* [Products][2]\n* [News][3]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][4]\n* * [International][5]\n    * [Great Britain][6]\n    * [Magyar][7]\n    * [Rom\u00e2n\u0103][8]\n    * [Az\u0259rbaycan][9]\n    * [\u0431\u044a\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0441\u043a\u0438][10]\n    * [\u0395\u03bb\u03bb\u03b7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ac][11]\n    * [Hrvatski][12]\n    * [Cyprus][13]\n    * [\u0421\u0440\u043f\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0458\u0435\u0437\u0438\u043a][14]\n    * [Sloven\u010dina][15]\n    * [\u0423\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0457\u043d\u0441\u044c\u043a\u0430][16]\n    * [\u010ce\u0161tina][17]\n    * [T\u00fcrk\u00e7e][18]\n    * [Sloven\u0161\u010dina][19]\n    * [Bosanski][20]\n    * [Malta][21]\n    * [Deutsch][22]\n    * [India][23]\n    * [Italiano][24]\n    * [\u4e2d\u6587 (\u4e2d\u56fd)][25]\n    * [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][26]\n\n# Products\n\nWith top-quality ingredients, no preservatives, fortified with 5 vitamins\u2026 What else do you need?\nClick and get familiar with our product portfolio!\n\n[Products][27]\nAluminium\n\n## Our cans have eternal life\n\nOur aluminium beverage packaging recycles forever\n\n[Find out more][28]\nNews\n\n### [Summer like you\u2019ve never tasted before: the HELL Carnival Edition is here!][29]\n\n### [HELL\u2019s anniversary limited edition can was created with the collaboration of Michele\n### Morrone][30]\n\n### [Led by Michele Morrone, HELL CITY has arrived][31]\n\n### [HELL ENERGY 20 years \u2013 anniversary film made about the brand\u2019s history][32]\n\n### [Introducing your new sugar-free HELL favorite: ZERO GREEN APPLE is here!][33]\n\n### [HELL Sparkler is back!][34]\n\n### [The stars of the festive season have arrived! The HELL Apple Pie and HELL Candy Cane flavoured\n### energy drinks are here.][35]\n\n### [Morrone shows his loyal companions in his daily life][36]\n\n### [This is what it\u2019s like when a dream comes true: an evening in the company of Michele Morrone,\n### exclusively for the winners of HELL][37]\n\n