      "company_summary": "Inertia is a pioneering company in the commercial fusion energy sector, dedicated to harnessing the power of proven fusion science to create limitless energy. The company specializes in the production of mass-produced Fusion Fuel Targets, designed for efficient fusion energy generation, with a production rate of 10 targets per second at a cost of less than $1 each. Targeting energy companies and utilities, Inertia is committed to advancing clean technology and nuclear energy solutions for a sustainable future.",
