      "company_summary": "Lumenis is a global leader in the development and commercialization of energy-based solutions for the aesthetic and vision markets, offering innovative technologies for skin, body, and eye care treatments. Their diverse product portfolio includes advanced systems for hair loss treatment, facial muscle stimulation, laser hair removal, and skin rejuvenation, targeting both individual consumers and healthcare professionals such as dermatologists and aesthetic practitioners. With a commitment to delivering safe and effective solutions, Lumenis serves a wide range of customers in the healthcare, aesthetics, and vision care industries.",
