            "text": "[[60 Years Pushing Boundaries.][60 Years Pushing Boundaries.]][1]\n* [Aesthetics][2]\n* * * [TREATMENTS][3]\n* * [Facial Muscle Stimulation][4]\n* [Hair Removal][5]\n* [Body][6]\n* [Hair Loss][7]\n* [Skin][8]\n* [Photofabulous][9]\n* [SmoothGlo\u2122][10]\n* [Pigmentation][11]\n* [Scars][12]\n* [Tattoo Removal][13]\n* [Vascular Lesions][14]\n* [Women\u2019s Health][15]\n* * [PRODUCTS][16]\n* * [FoLix][17]\n* [triLift][18]\n* [Stellar M22][19]\n* [SPLENDOR X][20]\n* [ULTRApulse Alpha][21]\n* [Legend Pro+][22]\n* [Legend Pro][23]\n* [LightSheer QUATTRO][24]\n* [NuEra Tight US][25]\n* [NuEra Tight][26]\n* [AcuPulse][27]\n* [M22][28]\n* [FemTouch][29]\n* * [TECHNOLOGIES][30]\n* * [Ablative Lasers CO2][31]\n* [IPL (Intense Pulsed Light)][32]\n* [Long Pulsed Nd:YAG][33]\n* [Fractional Non Ablative][34]\n* [Q-Switched Nd:YAG][35]\n* [Diode Lasers][36]\n* [Radio-Frequency (RF)][37]\n* [RF Micro-Needling][38]\n* [BLEND X^{\u00ae} Alex YAG][39]\n* * [RESOURCES][40]\n* * [The HUB][41]\n* [News][42]\n* [Events][43]\n* [Webinars][44]\n* [Blog][45]\n* [Patients][46]\n* [Pollogen][47]\n* [Customer Login][48]\n* [Customer Login][49]\n* * * [\nAESTHETIC TECH SOLUTIONS\n][50]\n* [Vision][51]\n* * * [DRY EYE][52]\n* * [OptiLIGHT][53]\n* [OptiLIFT][54]\n* [OptiPLUS][55]\n* [IPL for Dry Eye][56]\n* [Antares][57]\n* [OPT Shields][58]\n* [Optima IPL][59]\n* [Dry Eye Practices][60]\n* [Celebrity Testimonials][61]\n* * [GLAUCOMA (SLT/YAG)][62]\n* * [Digital Duet][63]\n* [Digital Trio][64]\n* [Selecta Duet][65]\n* [Selecta Trio][66]\n* * [PHOTOCOAGULATORS][67]\n* * [Smart532][68]\n* [Vision One][69]\n* [Array LaserLink\u2122][70]\n* [Accessories][71]\n* * [RESOURCES][72]\n* * [Press Publications][73]\n* [Clinical Studies][74]\n* [Webinars][75]\n* [News][76]\n* [Blog Posts][77]\n* [Customer Login][78]\n* * * [\nEYE CARE SOLUTIONS\n][79]\n* Resources\n* [Aesthetics][80]\n* [E-books][81]\n* [Tutorials][82]\n* [Webinars][83]\n* [News][84]\n* [Upcoming Events][85]\n* [Blog][86]\n* [Vision][87]\n* [Press Publications][88]\n* [Clinical Studies][89]\n* [Webinars][90]\n* [News][91]\n* [Blog Posts][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [Careers][94]\n* [Careers][95]\n* [Company Overview][96]\n* [Lumenis Leadership][97]\n* [Social Responsibility][98]\n* [Support][99]\n* [Service Overview][100]\n* [Service Locations][101]\n* [Lumenis App][102]\n* [Contact][103]\n[Patients][104]\n\n* Global, English United States, English *\n* [Global, \u4e2d\u6587][105]\n* [Global, \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439][106]\n* [Australia, English][107]\n* [France, Fran\u00e7ais][108]\n* [Germany, Deutsch][109]\n* [Italy, italiano][110]\n* [Japan, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][111]\n* [UK, English][112]\n1. [Home][113]\n2. [About][114]\n3. [Careers][115]\n\n# WELCOME TO\n# LUMENIS\n# CAREER PAGE\n\n[Lumenis careers - Glass chess pieces background][Lumenis careers - Glass chess pieces background]\n[Lumenis vision and innovation - Stylized glass binoculars illustration][Lumenis vision and\ninnovation - Stylized glass binoculars illustration]\n\n## WHAT WE DO\n\nLumenis develops life-changing, minimally invasive solutions for the Aesthetic and Vision markets.\nWe create and commercialize innovative energy-based technologies that enable a variety of skin,\nbody, and eye care treatments.\n\nHeadquartered in Israel and with offices on four continents, Lumenis is an international\norganization with sales in over 100 countries and a team of nearly 1,500 professionals worldwide.\n\n**Working at Lumenis is a unique experience, shaped by a set of values and key behaviors that drive\nus as a company.**\n\nWE INVITE YOU TO APPLY TO JOIN US!\n\n[OPEN POSITIONS ][116]\n\n## WE EMPOWER PEOPLE\n\nWe are passionate about our people. We are a diverse, talented group who care about their work and\nstrive to make a difference. We are committed to creating a work environment that fosters learning\nand improvement. When we grow, we grow together.\n\n### LOVE WHAT YOU DO.\n\nPURPOSE-DRIVEN WORK. COLLABORATIVE SUCCESS. PERSONAL & GLOBAL IMPACT.\n\n### UNIQUELY LUMENIS\n\nWHEN LEGACY MEETS INNOVATION: LET\u2019S BUILD THE FUTURE FACE OF BEAUTY TOGETHER!\n\n### JOIN. GROW. SHINE.\n\nWHERE SOLID FOUNDATION UNLEASHES BOLD INNOVATION.\n\nOpen Positions\n\n### EXPLORE OUR LATEST JOB OPENINGS\n\n### Clinical\n* [\nClinical Manager\nLumenis HQ - Yokneam \u00b7 Full-time \u00b7 Senior\n][117]\n\n### Engineering\n* [\nProject Engineer\nLumenis HQ - Yokneam \u00b7 Full-time\n][118]\n\n### Finance\n* [\nAssistant Controller- EMEA\nLumenis HQ - Yokneam \u00b7 Full-time \u00b7 Intermediate\n][119]\n\n### Service\n* [\nService Product Expert\nLumenis HQ - Yokneam \u00b7 Full-time\n][120]\n\nBy submitting my CV for a position in Lumenis, I agree for my personal data to be processed by\nLumenis to determine my suitability for the position, and for future communication, internal\nrecord-keeping and other purposes outlined in the Job Applicant Privacy\nNotice available [HERE][121].\n\nPB-00094670\n\n[Lumenis Logo][Lumenis Logo]\n* [\nAbout Lumenis\n][122]\n* [\nLumenis Leadership\n][123]\n* [\nCareers\n][124]\n* [\nCareers\n][125]\n* [\nLumenis App\n][126]\n* [\nLumenis Partner Zone\n][127]\n* [\nPollogen\n][128]\nAesthetics\n* [\nFacial Muscle Stimulation\n][129]\n* [\nHair Removal\n][130]\n* [\nBody\n][131]\n* [\nHair Loss\n][132]\n* [\nSkin\n][133]\n* [\nPhotofabulous\n][134]\n* [\nSmoothGlo\u2122\n][135]\n* [\nPigmentation\n][136]\n* [\nScars\n][137]\n* [\nTattoo Removal\n][138]\n* [\nVascular Lesions\n][139]\n* [\nWomen\u2019s Health\n][140]\nVision\n* [\n\ufeff\ufeffDry Eye\n][141]\n* [\nGlaucoma\n][142]\n* [\nRetina\n][143]\nPatients\n][144]\n* [\ntriLift\n][145]\n* [\nTreatMyDryEye\n][146]\n* [\nAesthetipedia\n][147]\n* [\nLightSheer Hair Removal\n][148]\n* [\nSmoothGlo\n][149]\n* [\nHopeForScars\n][150]\n* [\nFemTouch\n][151]\n][152][\n][153][\n][154][\n][155][\n][156]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2010- Lumenis Be Ltd. All Rights Reserved\n* [\nPrivacy Statement\n][157]\n* [\nTerms of