.\n* **Interactive Content** -- Quizzes, games, and interactive features that make learning about\ndefense topics fun.\n\n## Our Team\n\n### James Holloway\n\nMilitary Logistics & Sustainment Analyst\n\n][22][\n\n### Michael Trent\n\nDefense Systems Analyst\n\n][23][\n\n### Daniel Mercer\n\nMilitary History Editor\n\n][24][\n\n### Alex Carter\n\nModern Warfare & Defense Technology Contributor\n\n][25][\n\n### Ryan Caldwell\n\nDefense Analysis Editor\n\n][26][\n\n### Marcus Webb\n\nMilitary Vehicles & Ground Systems Contributor\n\n][27][\n\n### Charles Bash\n\nMilitary Culture & Global Defense Writer\n\n][28][\n\n### Nathan Cole\n\nNaval Warfare & Maritime Systems Analyst\n\n][29][\n\n### David Kowalski\n\nMissile Systems & Air Defense Contributor\n\n][30][\n\n### Jake Morrison\n\nGear & Equipment Editor\n\n][31]\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nHave a question, tip, or feedback? We would love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact Us][32]\n\n### Watch Military Machine on YouTube\n\nAircraft breakdowns, dogfight history, weapon-system explainers. New videos weekly.\n\n[Subscribe Free][33]\n[[Military Machine]][34]\n\nYour source for in-depth military analysis, defense technology, and military history.\n* [Shop Military Machine][35]\n* [About Us][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n\n#### Topics\n* [Aircraft][38]\n* [Armor & Tanks][39]\n* [Drones & Autonomous Systems][40]\n* [Cyber & Electronic Warfare][41]\n* [Missiles & Precision Weapons][42]\n* [Logistics & Sustainment][43]\n\n#### Eras\n* [World War II][44]\n* [Cold War][45]\n* [Vietnam War][46]\n* [Modern Era][47]\n\n#### Formats\n* [Analysis][48]\n* [Military History][49]\n* [Case Studies][50]\n* [Fun & Surprising][51]\n* [Gear Guides][52]\n* [Interactive][53]\n\n#### More\n* [All Quizzes][54]\n* [Tank Game][55]\n* [WW2 Aircraft][56]\n* [Watch Videos][57]\n* [Advertise][58]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Military Machine. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][59][Terms of Service][60]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /military-history\n[4]: /technology\n[