            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Military Machine]][2][History][3][Technology][4][Strategy][5][Gear][6][Shop][7]Domains\n[Aircraft][8][Tanks][9][Naval][10][Air Combat][11][Ground Combat][12][Air & Space][13][Land\nWarfare][14][Drones & Autonomous][15]\nInteractive\n[All Quizzes][16][Tank Game][17][WW2 Aircraft][18][Watch][19]\n[May 6:May 6, This Day in Military History:Fall of Corregidor: America's Last Philippine Stronghold\nSurrenders84yr ago][20]\n1. [Home][21]\n2. About\n\n# About Military Machine\n\nMilitary Machine is a United States-based defense publication covering military news, history, and\ntechnology. Our editorial team works out of the U.S. and draws on direct access to Department of\nDefense imagery, public military records, and domestic defense industry sources. We are dedicated to\nbringing you the most comprehensive coverage of military affairs, with a focus on U.S. armed forces,\nNATO allies, and the platforms and systems that define modern warfare.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nWe believe that understanding military history, technology, and strategy is essential for informed\ncivic engagement. Our goal is to make complex defense topics accessible and engaging for everyone --\nfrom casual readers to dedicated military enthusiasts.\n\n## What We Cover\n* **Military History** -- From World War II to modern conflicts, we explore the battles, campaigns,\nand decisions that shaped the world.\n* **Defense Technology** -- Fighter jets, tanks, naval vessels, drones, and the engineering behind\nthem.\n* **Strategy & Analysis** -- In-depth analysis of military doctrine, decision-making, and lessons\nlearned.\n* **Interactive Content** -- Quizzes, games, and interactive features that make learning about\ndefense topics fun.\n\n## Our Team\n\n### James Holloway\n\nMilitary Logistics & Sustainment Analyst\n\n][22][\n\n### Michael Trent\n\nDefense Systems Analyst\n\n][23][\n\n### Daniel Mercer\n\nMilitary History Editor\n\n][24][\n\n### Alex Carter\n\nModern Warfare & Defense Technology Contributor\n\n][25][\n\n### Ryan Caldwell\n\nDefense Analysis Editor\n\n][26][\n\n### Marcus Webb\n\nMilitary Vehicles & Ground Systems Contributor\n\n][27][\n\n### Charles Bash\n\nMilitary Culture & Global Defense Writer\n\n][28][\n\n### Nathan Cole\n\nNaval Warfare & Maritime Systems Analyst\n\n][29][\n\n### David Kowalski\n\nMissile Systems & Air Defense Contributor\n\n][30][\n\n### Jake Morrison\n\nGear & Equipment Editor\n\n][31]\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nHave a question, tip, or feedback? We would love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact Us][32]\n\n### Watch Military Machine on YouTube\n\nAircraft breakdowns, dogfight history, weapon-system explainers. New videos weekly.\n\n[Subscribe Free][33]\n[[Military Machine]][34]\n\nYour source for in-depth military analysis, defense technology, and military history.\n* [Shop Military Machine][35]\n* [About Us][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n\n#### Topics\n* [Aircraft][38]\n* [Armor & Tanks][39]\n* [Drones & Autonomous Systems][40]\n* [Cyber & Electronic Warfare][41]\n* [Missiles & Precision Weapons][42]\n* [Logistics & Sustainment][43]\n\n#### Eras\n* [World War II][44]\n* [Cold War][45]\n* [Vietnam War][46]\n* [Modern Era][47]\n\n#### Formats\n* [Analysis][48]\n* [Military History][49]\n* [Case Studies][50]\n* [Fun & Surprising][51]\n* [Gear Guides][52]\n* [Interactive][53]\n\n#### More\n* [All Quizzes][54]\n* [Tank Game][55]\n* [WW2 Aircraft][56]\n* [Watch Videos][57]\n* [Advertise][58]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Military Machine. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][59][Terms of Service][60]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /military-history\n[4]: /technology\n[5]: /strategy\n[6]: /gear\n[7]: /shop\n[8]: /aircraft\n[9]: /tanks\n[10]: /naval\n[11]: /air-combat\n[12]: /ground-combat\n[13]: /air-space\n[14]: /land-warfare\n[15]: /drones-autonomous\n[16]: /quizzes\n[17]: /tank-game\n[18]: /ww2-aircraft\n[19]: /watch\n[20]: /this-day-in-military-history/may-6\n[21]: /\n[22]: /author/james-holloway\n[23]: /author/m