lity-growth\n[90]: /company/gitlab/teams/sales-customer-success\n[91]: /jobs?companyId=68759\n[92]: /companies\n[93]: /jobs\n[94]: /auth/login?destination=/?application-tracker#application-tracker\n[95]: /tech-topics\n[96]: /auth/signup?destination=%2fcompany%2fgitlab\n[97]: /auth/login?destination=%2fcompany%2fgitlab\n[98]: /jobs\n[99]: /companies\n[100]: /tech-topics\n[101]: /jobs/remote\n[102]: https://builtin.com/awards/us/2026/best-places-to-work\n[103]: /tech-hubs\n[104]: https://employers.builtin.com/membership?utm_medium=BIReferral&utm_source=fo"
