            "url": "https://builtin.com/company/braze",
            "text": "[[Built In Logo] [Built In Logo]][1][Companies][2][Jobs][3][Articles][4]\n[View All Jobs][5]\n[ Join ][6]\n[ Log In ][7]\n[ For Employers ][8]\n[ Companies ][9] [ Braze ][10]\n\n# Braze\n\nSave Saved\nNew York\nTotal Offices: **15**\n2,000 Total Employees\nYear Founded: 2011\n[View Website][11]\nWe're Hiring!\n[ Sales **93** ][12] [ Customer Success & Experience **35** ][13] [ Engineering **22** ][14] [ AI &\nMachine Learning **18** ][15] [ Operations & Support **13** ][16] [ HR & Recruiting **8** ][17] [\nProduct Management **8** ][18] [ Design **7** ][19] [ Marketing **7** ][20] [ Cybersecurity **5**\n][21] [ Data & Analytics **5** ][22] [ Finance **4** ][23] [ Consulting **3** ][24] [ Program &\nProject Management **1** ][25]\n[View all jobs][26]\n* Overview\n* Jobs 230\n* Offices\n* Culture\n* Articles\n* Company Insights\n* [ Working at Braze ][27]\n* [ Culture & Values ][28]\n* [ Inclusion & Diversity ][29]\n* [ Career Growth & Development ][30]\n* [ Compensation & Benefits ][31]\n* [ Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing ][32]\n* [ Innovation, Technology & Agility ][33]\n* [ Mission, Purpose & Impact ][34]\n* [ Stability & Growth ][35]\nMarketing Tech\n][36] [\nMobile\n][37] [\nSoftware\n][38]\nFind your people. Make real impact.\nAt Braze, we believe in the passion of our people. We seek to ignite that passion by setting high\nstandards, championing teamwork, and creating work-life harmony. We thrive when people add their\nunique perspectives to our ever-growing teams\u2014and we strive to empower you to make an impact that\nfuels both you, and our business.\n[thumbnail]\n[gallery]\nView Gallery\n\n## Recently Posted Jobs at Braze\n\n[View All ][39]\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][40]\n\n### [Incident Manager][41]\n\nHybrid\nS\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][42]\n\n### [Senior Incident Manager][43]\n\nHybrid\nS\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][44]\n\n### [Lead Solutions Consultant][45]\n\nHybrid\nLondon, Greater London, England, GBR\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][46]\n\n### [Network Engineer][47]\n\nHybrid\nS\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][48]\n\n### [Manager, Technical Support][49]\n\nHybrid\nDKI Jakarta, IDN\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][50]\n\n### [Customer Success Manager II, Retail][51]\n\nHybrid\nS\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][52]\n\n### [Senior Marketing Manager, Localization][53]\n\nHybrid\nS\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][54]\n\n### [Senior Account Executive, Scale][55]\n\nHybrid\nChicago, IL, USA\n\n## [Braze Logo] Braze\n\n][56]\n\n### [Solutions Consultant][57]\n\nHybrid\nTokyo, JPN\nView all jobs\n][58]\n\n## Braze Offices\n\n[Learn More ][59]\n\nHybrid Workspace\n\nEmployees engage in a combination of remote and on-site work.\n\nTypical time on-site: Flexible\n[Company Office]\nHQNew York\n[Company Office]\nAustin\nBerlin\n[Company Office]\nBucharest, Bucure\u0219ti, ROU\n[Company Office]\nChicago\nDKI Jakarta, DKI Jakarta, IDN\nIndonesia\nDubai, Dubai, ARE\n[Company Office]\nLondon\nParis\n[Company Office]\nSan Francisco\n[Company Office]\nS\u00e3o Paulo, S\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\n[Company Office]\nSingapore\n[Company Office]\nSydney\n[Company Office]\nTokyo\nLearn more\n][60]\nInside Our\nCompany Culture\nLearn More\n[Pranay Jain]\nPranay Jain\nSenior Director, Market & Competitive Strategy\n][61][\n[Mel Windley]\nMel Windley\nDirector of Global Inclusion and Opportunity\n][62]\n\n## Insider Video\n\n[Thumbnail]\nWhy These Employees Love Working at Braze\n\n## Articles We're In\n\n[View All ][63]\n[[Photo: Braze]][64]\n[Olivia McClure] Olivia McClure\nPublished on June 26, 2026\n\n## How Braze Business Development Leader Del Patara Builds High-Performing Teams\n\n][65]\n\nVP and Global Head of Business Development Del Patara explains her leadership philosophy, how Braze\nhelps team members grow their careers and how the Business Development team supports customer growth\nand revenue.\n\n[Olivia McClure] Olivia McClure\nUpdated on June 12, 2026\n\n## How These High-Performing Sales Teams Are Prioritizing Well-Being\n\n][66]\n\nSales leaders from Celonis, Braze, Dynatrace and other companies share how their employers build\nsuccessful teams while avoiding burnout.\n\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][67]\n[Brand Studio Logo]\n[Olivia McClure] Olivia McClure\nUpdated on April 22, 2026\n\n## Companies Investing in Cutting-Edge Tech and Big Ideas\n\n][68]\n\nLearn how Braze, Altana, Playground and other fast-growing companies stay ahead of emerging tech\ntrends while scaling fast.\n\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][69]\n[Brand Studio Logo]\n[View all articles][70]\n\n## Awards\n\n[award][award][award][award]\n[award][award][award][award][award][award][award]\n\n## Technology We Use\n* [ENGINEERING][71]\n* [PRODUCT][72]\n* [SALES & MARKETING][73]\n\n[Java]\nJava\nLANGUAGES\n[JavaScript]\nJavaScript\nLANGUAGES\n[MongoDB]\nMongoDB\nDATABASES\n[Node.js]\nNode.js\nFRAMEWORKS\n[PostgreSQL]\nPostgreSQL\nDATABASES\n[Python]\nPython\nLANGUAGES\n[React]\nReact\nLIBRARIES\n[Redis]\nRedis\nDATABASES\n[Ruby]\nRuby\nLANGUAGES\n[Ruby on Rails]\nRuby on Rails\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Swift]\nSwift\nLANGUAGES\n[Asana]\nAsana\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Confluence]\nConfluence\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Google Analytics]\nGoogle Analytics\nANALYTICS\n[Illustrator]\nIllustrator\nDESIGN\n[JIRA]\nJIRA\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Optimizely]\nOptimizely\nANALYTICS\n[Photoshop]\nPhotoshop\nDESIGN\n[Figma]\nFigma\nDESIGN\n[AfterEffects]\nAfterEffects\nDESIGN\n[Marketo]\nMarketo\nLEAD GEN\n\n## Braze FAQs\n\n[What's It Like to Work at Braze?][74]\n[What's the Company Culture Like at Braze?][75]\n[Braze Inclusion & Diversity][76]\n[Braze Career Growth & Development][77]\n[Braze Compensation & Benefits][78]\n[What's the Work-Life Balance Like at Braze?][79]\n[Braze Innovation & Technology Culture][80]\n[Braze Mission, Purpose & Impact][81]\n[Braze Company Growth, Stability & Outlook][82]\n[View All Jobs at Braze][83]\n* [\nCompanies\n][84]\n* [\nJobs\n]