            "text": "[[Built In Logo] [Built In Logo]][1][Companies][2][Jobs][3][Articles][4]\n[View All Jobs][5]\n[ Join ][6]\n[ Log In ][7]\n[ For Employers ][8]\n[Advertisement]\n[ Companies ][9] [ ServiceNow ][10]\n[ServiceNow logo on gradient background]\n\n# ServiceNow\n\nSave Saved\nSanta Clara\nTotal Offices: **75**\n29,000 Total Employees\nYear Founded: 2004\n[View Website][11]\n[ServiceNow logo on gradient background]\nWe're Hiring!\n[ Sales **99+** ][12] [ Engineering **71** ][13] [ Consulting **60** ][14] [ Customer Success &\nExperience **58** ][15] [ AI & Machine Learning **46** ][16] [ Cybersecurity **23** ][17] [\nMarketing **16** ][18] [ Program & Project Management **16** ][19] [ Product Management **13** ][20]\n[ Operations & Support **9** ][21] [ Design **7** ][22] [ Finance **6** ][23] [ HR & Recruiting\n**6** ][24] [ Data & Analytics **2** ][25]\n[View all jobs][26]\n* Overview\n* Jobs 491\n* Offices\n* Articles\n* Company Insights\n* [ Working at ServiceNow ][27]\n* [ Culture & Values ][28]\n* [ Career Growth & Development ][29]\n* [ Compensation & Benefits ][30]\n* [ Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing ][31]\n* [ Leadership & Management ][32]\n* [ Innovation, Technology & Agility ][33]\n* [ Mission, Purpose & Impact ][34]\n* [ Stability & Growth ][35]\nArtificial Intelligence\n][36] [\nCloud\n][37] [\nHR Tech\n][38] [\nInformation Technology\n][39] [\nProductivity\n][40] [\nSoftware\n][41] [\nAutomation\n][42]\nWe're putting AI to work for people.\nAs the AI platform for business transformation, we're putting AI to work across organizations \u2014\nfreeing people for work that matters. Making old tech work with new tech. Reaching across\ndepartments, from the front office to the back office and every office in between. Our ambition? To\nbecome the AI defining enterprise software company of the 21st century (or \"AI DESCO21C,\" as we like\nto call it). With more than 8,400+ customers, we serve approximately 90% of the Fortune 500\u00ae, and\nwe're proud to be a Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For\u00ae and World's Most Admired Companies\u2122.\nExplore your future career with us, visit www.careers.servicenow.com From Fortune. \u00a92026 Fortune\nMedia IP Limited. All rights reserved. Used under license.\n[thumbnail]\n[gallery]\nView Gallery\n\n## Recently Posted Jobs at ServiceNow\n\n[View All ][43]\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][44]\n\n### [Senior Tax Analyst - US Indirect Tax][45]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nHyderabad, Telangana, IND\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][46]\n\n### [Customer Success Executive, Public Sector][47]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nD\u00fcsseldorf, Nordrhein-Westfalen, DEU\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][48]\n\n### [Senior Staff Inbound Product Manager - RaptorDB][49]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nSan Diego, CA, USA\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][50]\n\n### [Principal Customer Success Executive - Financial Services][51]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nStaines, Surrey, England, GBR\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][52]\n\n### [Customer Success Executive - Public Sector][53]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nStaines, Surrey, England, GBR\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][54]\n\n### [Senior Staff Inbound Product Manager - RaptorDB][55]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nSanta Clara, CA, USA\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][56]\n\n### [Senior Principal Technology Consultant][57]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nChicago, IL, USA\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][58]\n\n### [Solution Architect][59]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nOrlando, FL, USA\n\n## [ServiceNow Logo] ServiceNow\n\n][60]\n\n### [Solution Architect][61]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nAtlanta, GA, USA\nView all jobs\n][62]\n\n## ServiceNow Offices\n\n[Learn More ][63]\n\nHybrid Workspace\n\nEmployees engage in a combination of remote and on-site work.\n\nAt ServiceNow, we lead with flexibility and trust. For some, home is the primary workplace. For\nthose who come into a ServiceNow workplace, you are empowered to make team-guided and individual-led\ndecisions on how and when you use the workplace.\n\nTypical time on-site: Flexible\n[Company Office]\nHQSanta Clara, California, USA\nHeredia, CRI\nCiudad De M\u00e9xico, MEX\nDistrict of Columbia, USA\nOsaka, JPN\nAarhus, Midtjylland, DNK\nAarhus, Midtjylland, DNK\n[Company Office]\nAddison, Texas, USA\nAmsterdam, Noord-Holland, NLD\nAtlanta, Georgia, USA\nAuckland, Auckland, NZL\nBangkok, Bangkok, THA\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IND\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IND\nBerlin, Berlin, DEU\nBras\u00edlia, Distrito Federal, BRA\nBrisbane, Queensland, AUS\nBrussels, Brussels, BEL\nCairo, Cairo, EGY\nCanberra, Australian Capital Territory, AUS\nCharlottesville, Virginia, USA\n[Company Office]\nChicago, Illinois, USA\nDeerfield, Illinois, USA\n[Company Office]\nDenver, Colorado, USA\nDubai, Dubai, ARE\nDublin, Leinster, IRL\nD\u00fcsseldorf, Nordrhein-Westfalen, DEU\nFrankfurt am Main, Hessen, DEU\nGoteborg, V\u00e4stra G\u00f6taland, SWE\nGurugram, Haryana, IND\nHamburg, Hamburg, DEU\nHanyang, Seoul, KOR\nHelsinki, Etel\u00e4-Suomen Aluehallintovirasto, FIN\nHong Kong, Hong Kong Island, HKG\nHouston, Texas, USA\nHyderabad, Telangana, IND\nIssy-les-Moulineaux, \u00cele-de-France, FRA\nJohannesburg, Gauteng, ZAF\nKirkland, Washington, USA\nLausanne, Vaud, CHE\nLille, Hauts-de-France, FRA\nLondon, England\nLondon, England\nMadrid, Comunidad de Madrid, ESP\nMelbourne, Victoria, AUS\nMilano, Lombardia, ITA\nMilwaukee, Wisconsin, USA\n[Company Office]\nMontr\u00e9al, Qu\u00e9bec, CAN\nMumbai, Maharashtra, IND\nMunich, Bayern, DEU\n[Company Office]\nNew York, New York, USA\nOpfikon, Z\u00fcrich, CHE\nOrlando, Florida, USA\nOslo, Oslo, NOR\nPerth, Western Australia, AUS\nPetah Tikva, Mahoz Merkaz, ISR\n[Company Office]\nPleasanton, California, USA\nRiyadh, Riyadh Province, SAU\nRome, Latium, ITA\n[Company Office]\nSan Diego, California, USA\nSan Francisco, Heredia, CRI\n[Company Office]\nSan Francisco, California, USA\nS\u00e3o Paulo, S\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\nSingapore, Singapore, SGP\nSolna, Stockholms l\u00e4n, SWE\nSydney, New South Wales, AUS\nTokyo, Tokyo, JPN\nToronto, Ontario, CAN\nVancouver, British Columbia, CAN\n[Company Office]\nVienna, Virginia, USA\nVienna, Vienna, AUT\n[Company Office]\nWaltham, Massachusetts, USA\nWashington, District of Columbia, USA\nWellington, Wellington, NZL\nWest Palm Beach, Florida, USA\nLearn more\n][64]\n\n## Articles We're In\n\n[View All ][65]\n[[Photo: ServiceNow]][66]\n[Olivia McClure] Olivia McClure\nPublished on January 08, 2026\n\n## How ServiceNow\u2019s AI Teams Are Building the Future of Work \u2014 and Creating Big Career Opportunities\n## in the Process\n\n][67]\n\nThree ServiceNow technologists share how they\u2019re reinventing enterprise workflows with AI, and why\nit\u2019s a powerful place to grow your career.\n\n[Taylor Rose ] Taylor Rose\nUpdated on November 11, 2025\n\n## A Launchpad for Talent: Inside ServiceNow India\u2019s Customer Success Team\n\n][68]\n\nServiceNow India\u2019s Principle Customer Success Executive Raghuveer Moorthy shares how his team is\ndriving innovation and how he fosters their career growth.\n\n[[Credit: ServiceNow]][69]\n[Rose Velazquez] Rose Velazquez\nUpdated on April 14, 2025\n\n## ServiceNow Acquires Moveworks to Further Agentic AI Strategy, Innovation\n\n][70]\n\nServiceNow expects the strategic move will help to drive enterprise AI adoption.\n\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][71]\n[View all articles][72]\n\n## Awards\n\n[award][award][award][award]\n[award][award][award][award][award][award][award][award]\n\n## Technology We Use\n* [ENGINEERING][73]\n\n[Java]\nJava\nLANGUAGES\n[JavaScript]\nJavaScript\nLANGUAGES\n[MariaDB]\nMariaDB\nDATABASES\n[MongoDB]\nMongoDB\nDATABASES\n[MySQL]\nMySQL\nDATABASES\n[Node.js]\nNode.js\nFRAMEWORKS\n[PostgreSQL]\nPostgreSQL\nDATABASES\n[React]\nReact\nLIBRARIES\n\n## ServiceNow FAQs\n\n[What's It Like to Work at ServiceNow?][74]\n[What's the Company Culture Like at ServiceNow?][75]\n[ServiceNow Inclusion & Diversity][76]\n[ServiceNow Career Growt