            "text": "[[Built In Logo] [Built In Logo]][1][Companies][2][Jobs][3][Articles][4]\n[View All Jobs][5]\n[ Join ][6]\n[ Log In ][7]\n[ For Employers ][8]\n[ Companies ][9] [ Datadog ][10]\n\n# Datadog\n\nSave Saved\nNew York\nTotal Offices: **16**\n6,500 Total Employees\nYear Founded: 2010\n[View Website][11]\nWe're Hiring!\n[ Sales **99+** ][12] [ Customer Success & Experience **64** ][13] [ Engineering **55** ][14] [\nProduct Management **25** ][15] [ Cybersecurity **19** ][16] [ AI & Machine Learning **19** ][17] [\nOperations & Support **16** ][18] [ Marketing **15** ][19] [ HR & Recruiting **13** ][20] [ Finance\n**9** ][21] [ Design **5** ][22] [ Program & Project Management **5** ][23] [ Consulting **1** ][24]\n[ Data & Analytics **1** ][25] [ Legal **1** ][26]\n[View all jobs][27]\n* Overview\n* Jobs 417\n* Offices\n* Articles\n* Company Insights\n* [ Working at Datadog ][28]\n* [ Culture & Values ][29]\n* [ Inclusion & Diversity ][30]\n* [ Career Growth & Development ][31]\n* [ Compensation & Benefits ][32]\n* [ Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing ][33]\n* [ Leadership & Management ][34]\n* [ Innovation, Technology & Agility ][35]\n* [ Stability & Growth ][36]\nArtificial Intelligence\n][37] [\nCloud\n][38] [\nSecurity\n][39] [\nSoftware\n][40] [\nCybersecurity\n][41]\nWe are building the monitoring and security platform for developers, IT ops teams and business users\nin the cloud age.\nDatadog (NASDAQ: DDOG) is a global SaaS business, delivering a rare combination of growth and\nprofitability. We are on a mission to break down silos and solve complexity in the cloud age by\nenabling digital transformation, cloud migration, and infrastructure monitoring of our customers'\nentire technology stacks. Built by engineers, for engineers, Datadog is used by organizations of all\nsizes across a wide range of industries. Together, we champion professional development, diversity\nof thought, innovation, and work excellence to empower continuous growth. Join the pack and become\npart of a collaborative, pragmatic, and thoughtful people-first community where we solve tough\nproblems, take smart risks, and celebrate one another.\n[thumbnail]\n[gallery]\nView Gallery\n\n## Recently Posted Jobs at Datadog\n\n[View All ][42]\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][43]\n\n### [Strategic Account Executive][44]\n\nHybrid\nNew York, NY, USA\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][45]\n\n### [Strategic Account Executive][46]\n\nHybrid\nMexico City, Cuauht\u00e9moc, Mexico City, MEX\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][47]\n\n### [Strategic Account Executive][48]\n\nHybrid\nSeoul, KOR\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][49]\n\n### [Senior People Business Partner - NYC][50]\n\nHybrid\nNew York, NY, USA\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][51]\n\n### [Strategic Account Executive (SLED)][52]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\n3 Locations\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][53]\n\n### [Strategic Account Executive][54]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nChile\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][55]\n\n### [Customer Success Associate - Commercial Accounts][56]\n\nHybrid\nSydney, New South Wales, AUS\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][57]\n\n### [Manager I, Engineering - Applied AI - Natural Language & Conversational Interfaces][58]\n\nHybrid\nNew York, NY, USA\n\n## [Datadog Logo] Datadog\n\n][59]\n\n### [Enterprise Sales Executive][60]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nCanada\nView all jobs\n][61]\n\n## Datadog Offices\n\n[Learn More ][62]\n\nHybrid Workspace\n\nEmployees engage in a combination of remote and on-site work.\n\nWe operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best\nfits them and their team.\n\nTypical time on-site: 3 days a week\nHQNew York, New York, USA\nNew South Wales, AUS\n[Company Office]\nCiudad De M\u00e9xico, MEX\nAmsterdam, Noord-Holland, NLD\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IND\n[Company Office]\nBoston, Massachusetts, USA\nDenver, Colorado, USA\nDublin, Dublin, IRL\nHanyang, Seoul, KOR\nLisbon, Lisbon, PRT\nUnited Kingdom\nMadrid, Comunidad de Madrid, ESP\n[Company Office]\nParis Office\nSan Francisco, California, USA\nSingapore Office\nTokyo, Tokyo, JPN\nLearn more\n][63]\n\n## Articles We're In\n\n[View All ][64]\n[[Bits AI Is Datadog\u2019s New DevOps Copilot]][65]\n[Mia Goulart] Mia Goulart\nPublished on September 25, 2025\n\n## Bits AI Is Datadog\u2019s New DevOps Copilot\n\n][66]\n\nSoftware Engineer Aurora Dai explains her role in building Datadog\u2019s AI-powered observability\nproduct and the impact it will have on customers.\n\nBrand Studio\n][67]\n[Olivia McClure] Olivia McClure\nUpdated on November 25, 2025\n\n## Datadog Engineering Team Career Growth: Director of Engineering on Building AI Agents Teams\n\n][68]\n\nDiamond, Director of Engineering for AI at Datadog, is building high-agency, hands-on teams that\nbuild task specific Agents as well as tools for Agents that might themselves use Datadog.\n\n[[Datadog]][69]\nAuthor Unknown\nUpdated on November 25, 2025\n\n## Datadog Sales Team Growth: How This Leader Taps into Her Nordic Roots to Help Drive the Company\u2019s\n## Expansion\n\n][70]\n\nFor Finland-born Regional Vice President of Enterprise Sales Anu Lepp\u00e4nen, every workday is a new\nopportunity to harness her \u201chighly collaborative\u201d nature for the greater good.\n\nSales\n][71]\n[[Shutterstock]][72]\n[View all articles][73]\n\n## Awards\n\n[award][award][award][award]\n[award][award]\n\n## Technology We Use\n* [ENGINEERING][74]\n* [PRODUCT][75]\n* [SALES & MARKETING][76]\n* [PEOPLE OPERATIONS][77]\n\n[Angular]\nAngular\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Angular.js]\nAngular.js\nFRAMEWORKS\n[BigQuery]\nBigQuery\nDATABASES\n[C#]\nLANGUAGES\n[C++]\nC++\nLANGUAGES\n[Cassandra]\nCassandra\nDATABASES\n[CircleCI]\nCircleCI\nFRAMEWORKS\n[CSS]\nCSS\nLANGUAGES\n[D3JS]\nD3JS\nLIBRARIES\n[Django]\nDjango\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Docker]\nDocker\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Elasticsearch]\nElasticsearch\nDATABASES\n[Flask]\nFlask\nFRAMEWORKS\n[GitHub]\nGitHub\nSERVICES\n[Golang]\nGolang\nLANGUAGES\n[gRPC]\ngRPC\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Hado