humbnail]\n[gallery]\nView Gallery\n\n## Recently Posted Jobs at General Motors\n\n[View All ][44]\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][45]\n\n### [Senior Global Commodity Manager][46]\n\nHybrid\nWarren, MI, USA\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][47]\n\n### [Plant Finance Supervisor][48]\n\nHybrid\nWyoming, MI, USA\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][49]\n\n### [Senior Manufacturing Engineer][50]\n\nHybrid\nWarren, MI, USA\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][51]\n\n### [Staff Technical Manager, Cloud & Vehicle Access Connectivity][52]\n\nHybrid\nWarren, MI, USA\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][53]\n\n### [Software Developer - Simulation Platform (Galileo)][54]\n\nHybrid\n2 Locations\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][55]\n\n### [Lead Occupant Positioning System Calibration and Test Engineer][56]\n\nHybrid\nWarren, MI, USA\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][57]\n\n### [Staff Software Engineer - Secondary Driving System][58]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nSunnyvale, CA, USA\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][59]\n\n### [Staff Software Engineer - Machine Learning][60]\n\nRemote or Hybrid\nUnited States\n\n## [General Motors Logo] General Motors\n\n][61]\n\n### [Senior HIL Core Engineer][62]\n\nHybrid\nMilford, MI, USA\nView all jobs\n][63]\n\n## General Motors Offices\n\n[Learn More ][64]\n\nHybrid Workspace\n\nEmployees engage in a combination of remote and on-site work.\n\nRoles that are categorized as Hybrid mean that the successful candidate is expected to report onsite\nto the designated facility at least three times per week or other frequency as dictated by the\nbusiness.\n\nTypical time on-site: 3 days a week\n[Company Office]\nHQHudson's Detroit building Global HQ\nCiudad De M\u00e9xico, MEX\nMetropolitana de Santiago, CHL\n[Company Office]\nTel Aviv District, ISR\nAlvear, Santa Fe, ARG\n[Company Office]\nAustin IT Innovation Center\n[Company Office]\nBengaluru, Karnataka, IND\nBogot\u00e1, Distrito Capital, COL\n[Company Office]\nCharlotte Technical Center\nIndaiatuba, S\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\nLangley, British Columbia, CAN\n[Company Office]\nIreland IT Innovation Center\nLos Angeles, California, USA\n[Company Office]\nMarkham, Ontario, CAN\nMelbourne, Victoria, AUS\n[Company Office]\nMilford, Michigan, USA\n[Company Office]\nMountain View Tech Center\nM\u00fcnster, Nordrhein-Westfalen, DEU\n[Company Office]\nOshawa, Ontario, CAN\n[Company Office]\nAdvanced Design and Innovation Campus\n[Company Office]\nPontiac Engineering Center\nRamos Arizpe, Coahuila De Zaragoza, MEX\nS\u00e3o Caetano do Sul, S\u00e3o Paulo, BRA\nSilao, Guanajuato, MEX\n[Company Office]\nGlobal Technical Center\nLearn more\n][65]\n\n## Articles We're In\n\n[View All ][66]\n[[Photo: General Motors]][67]\n[Olivia McClure] Olivia McClure\nPublished on November 26, 2025\n\n## General Motors Leadership: How the Company is Steering a \u2018Transformative Period\u2019 for the\n## Automotive Industry\n\n][68]\n\nRelying on a \u201cone-team attitude\u201d toward product development and a suite of tools and practices, GM\u2019s\ntechnologists delivered a solution that will redefine the driver experience.\n\n[Mia Goulart] Mia Goulart\nUpdated on March 25, 2024\n\n## A Partner in Progress: How AI Enables Deeper, More Meaningful Work\n\n][69]\n\nEight tech professionals share how they\u2019re using AI to their advantage.\n\nBrand Studio\n][70]\n[[Shutterstock]][71]\n[Brand Studio Logo]\n[Alyssa Schroer] Alyssa Schroer\nUpdated on October 27, 2025\n\n## AI in Cars: 25 Examples of Automotive AI\n\n][72]\n\nArtificial intelligence has improved various aspects of vehicles, from powering sensor technology to\naccelerating the manufacturing process. These companies are at the forefront of bringing AI to the\nautomotive industry.\n\nArtificial Intelligence\n][73][\nAutomotive\n][74][\nTransportation Tech\n][75]\n[[Image: Shutterstock / Built In]][76]\n[View all articles][77]\n\n## A