            "text": "[[Built In Logo] [Built In Logo]][1][Companies][2][Jobs][3][Articles][4]\n[View All Jobs][5]\n[ Join ][6]\n[ Log In ][7]\n[ For Employers ][8]\n[ Companies ][9] [ Pfizer ][10]\n\n# Pfizer\n\nSave Saved\nNew York\nTotal Offices: **16**\n121,990 Total Employees\nYear Founded: 1848\n[View Website][11]\nWe're Hiring!\n[ Sales **30** ][12] [ AI & Machine Learning **17** ][13] [ Engineering **17** ][14] [ Operations &\nSupport **14** ][15] [ Marketing **11** ][16] [ Data & Analytics **7** ][17] [ HR & Recruiting **7**\n][18] [ Finance **6** ][19] [ Customer Success & Experience **3** ][20] [ Cybersecurity **3** ][21]\n[ Supply Chain & Procurement **3** ][22] [ Legal **1** ][23] [ Program & Project Management **1**\n][24]\n[View all jobs][25]\n* Overview\n* Jobs 282\n* Offices\n* Articles\n* Company Insights\n* [ Working at Pfizer ][26]\n* [ Culture & Values ][27]\n* [ Career Growth & Development ][28]\n* [ Compensation & Benefits ][29]\n* [ Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing ][30]\n* [ Leadership & Management ][31]\n* [ Innovation, Technology & Agility ][32]\n* [ Mission, Purpose & Impact ][33]\n* [ Stability & Growth ][34]\nArtificial Intelligence\n][35] [\nHealthtech\n][36] [\nMachine Learning\n][37] [\nNatural Language Processing\n][38] [\nBiotech\n][39] [\nPharmaceutical\n][40]\nWe\u2019re in relentless pursuit of breakthroughs that change patients\u2019 lives.\nOur purpose ensures that patients remain at the center of all we do. We live our purpose by sourcing\nthe best science in the world; partnering with others in the healthcare system to improve access to\nour medicines; using digital technologies to enhance our drug discovery and development, as well as\npatient outcomes; and leading the conversation to advocate for pro-innovation/pro-patient policies.\n[thumbnail]\n[gallery]\nView Gallery\n\n## Recently Posted Jobs at Pfizer\n\n[View All ][41]\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][42]\n\n### [Health Representative - \u5317\u5340/\u75ab\u82d7\u7522\u54c1][43]\n\nHybrid\nTaipei City, TWN\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][44]\n\n### [[MA] Lung Cancer MAS team, ONC Field MAS [Manager/Staff]][45]\n\nHybrid\nTokyo, JPN\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][46]\n\n### [Pfizer Brand Marketing Director][47]\n\nHybrid\nNew York City, NY, USA\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][48]\n\n### [Associate Manager - Indirect Taxation][49]\n\nHybrid\nChennai, Tamil Nadu, IND\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][50]\n\n### [[JDSU] \u533b\u85ac\u54c1\u5b89\u5168\u6027\u7d71\u62ec\u90e8 \u30b1\u30fc\u30b9\u30de\u30cd\u30b8\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\uff08\u4e00\u822c\u793e\u54e1\uff09 \uff08Staff, Case Management, Japan\n### Drug Safety Unit\uff09][51]\n\nHybrid\nTokyo, JPN\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][52]\n\n### [Automation/MI Engineer (PCP) 15 months training programme][53]\n\nHybrid\nSingapore, SGP\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][54]\n\n### [[A&V] RWE \u90e8\u9577][55]\n\nHybrid\nTokyo, JPN\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][56]\n\n### [Operational Effectiveness Specialist (PCP) 15 months training programme][57]\n\nHybrid\nSingapore, SGP\n\n## [Pfizer Logo] Pfizer\n\n][58]\n\n### [Quality Manager][59]\n\nHybrid\nSeoul, KOR\nView all jobs\n][60]\n\n## Pfizer Offices\n\n[Learn More ][61]\n\nHybrid Workspace\n\nEmployees engage in a combination of remote and on-site work.\n\nTypical time on-site: 2.5 days a week\n[Company Office]\nHQHudson Yards\nProvincia de Buenos Aires, ARG\nAndover, Massachusetts, USA\nAthens, Attica, GRC\nChennai, Tamil Nadu, IND\nCollegeville, Pennsylvania, USA\nDurham, North Carolina, USA\nGroton, Connecticut, USA\nMadison, New Jersey, USA\nMadrid, Comunidad de Madrid, ESP\nMumbai, Maharashtra, IND\nRochester, Michigan, USA\nSan Diego, California, USA\nSeattle, Washington, USA\n[Company Office]\nTampa, FL\nCenter for Digital Innovation\nLearn more\n][62]\n\n## Articles We're In\n\n[View All ][63]\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][64]\n[Ashley Bowden] Ashley Bowden\nPublished on May 22, 2026\n\n## 10 Top Employers for Healthcare Professionals\n\n][65]\n\nHealthcare professionals are needed in a variety of areas, from biopharmaceutical labs to retirement\ncommunities.\n\n[Built In Staff, With AI] Built In Staff, With AI\nUpdated on April 23, 2026\n\n## 20 Biggest Healthcare Companies\n\n][66]\n\nFrom global pharmaceutical leaders to insurance giants and medical technology pioneers, these are\nthe top healthcare companies shaping the future of patient care.\n\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][67]\n[Built In Staff, With AI] Built In Staff, With AI\nUpdated on March 26, 2026\n\n## Which Fortune 500 Companies Are Investing in AI Right Now?\n\n][68]\n\nFrom massive infrastructure spenders to heritage brands automating the assembly line, these\ncompanies are defining how the Fortune 500 operate in the age of artificial intelligence.\n\n[[Image: Shutterstock]][69]\n[View all articles][70]\n\n## Awards\n\n[award][award][award][award]\n[award][award][award][award][award][award]\n\n## Technology We Use\n* [ENGINEERING][71]\n* [PRODUCT][72]\n* [PEOPLE OPERATIONS][73]\n\n[Angular]\nAngular\nFRAMEWORKS\n[AWS (Amazon Web Services)]\nAWS (Amazon Web Services)\nSERVICES\n[GitHub]\nGitHub\nSERVICES\n[GitLab]\nGitLab\nSERVICES\n[Ionic]\nIonic\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Java]\nJava\nLANGUAGES\n[Kotlin]\nKotlin\nLANGUAGES\n[Laravel]\nLaravel\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Node.js]\nNode.js\nFRAMEWORKS\n[PostgreSQL]\nPostgreSQL\nDATABASES\n[Python]\nPython\nLANGUAGES\n[Swift]\nSwift\nLANGUAGES\n[TypeScript]\nTypeScript\nLANGUAGES\n[Vue.js]\nVue.js\nFRAMEWORKS\n[Airtable]\nAirtable\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Canva]\nCanva\nDESIGN\n[Figma]\nFigma\nDESIGN\n[Microsoft Project]\nMicrosoft Project\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Microsoft Teams]\nMicrosoft Teams\nCOLLABORATION\n[Monday.com]\nMonday.com\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Airtable]\nAirtable\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n\n## Pfizer FAQs\n\n[What's It Like to Work at Pfizer?][74]\n[What's the Company Culture Like at Pfizer?][75]\n[Pfizer Inclusion & Diversity][76]\n[Pfizer Career Growth & Development][77]\n[Pfizer Compensatio