            "text": "[[Built In Logo] [Built In Logo]][1][Companies][2][Jobs][3][Articles][4]\n[View All Jobs][5]\n[ Join ][6]\n[ Log In ][7]\n[ For Employers ][8]\n[ Companies ][9] [ PNC Bank ][10]\n[Be part of something brilliant.]\n[PNC Powerlink]\n\n# PNC Bank\n\nSave Saved\nPittsburgh\nTotal Offices: **6**\n55,000 Total Employees\nYear Founded: 1865\n[View Website][11]\n[PNC Powerlink]\nWe're Hiring!\n[ Engineering **99+** ][12] [ Product Management **30** ][13] [ Program & Project Management **23**\n][14] [ Cybersecurity **18** ][15] [ Data & Analytics **14** ][16] [ Consulting **13** ][17] [ AI &\nMachine Learning **13** ][18] [ Design **5** ][19] [ Operations & Support **4** ][20] [ Finance\n**1** ][21] [ HR & Recruiting **1** ][22] [ Sales **1** ][23]\n[View all jobs][24]\n[Be part of something brilliant.]\n* Overview\n* Jobs 296\n* Offices\n* Teams\n* Articles\n* Company Insights\n* [ Working at PNC Bank ][25]\n* [ Culture & Values ][26]\n* [ Inclusion & Diversity ][27]\n* [ Career Growth & Development ][28]\n* [ Compensation & Benefits ][29]\n* [ Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing ][30]\n* [ Leadership & Management ][31]\n* [ Innovation, Technology & Agility ][32]\n* [ Mission, Purpose & Impact ][33]\n* [ Stability & Growth ][34]\nMachine Learning\n][35] [\nPayments\n][36] [\nSecurity\n][37] [\nSoftware\n][38] [\nFinancial Services\n][39]\nCome have a brilliant career.\nPNC Bank is part of one of the largest diversified financial services institutions in the United\nStates. With a coast-to-coast presence, PNC is organized around its customers and communities for\nstrong relationships and local delivery of retail and business banking including a full range of\nlending products; specialized services for corporations and government entities, including corporate\nbanking, real estate finance and asset-based lending; wealth management and asset management.\n[thumbnail]\n[gallery]\nView Gallery\n\n## Recently Posted Jobs at PNC Bank\n\n[View All ][40]\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][41]\n\n### [Software Engineer Lead (Java Full Stack Development)][42]\n\nHybrid\nPittsburgh, PA, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][43]\n\n### [Software Engineer Sr (Mainframe Developer)][44]\n\nHybrid\nPittsburgh, PA, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][45]\n\n### [Technology Engineer Sr (Java Full Stack Developer)][46]\n\nHybrid\nBirmingham, AL, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][47]\n\n### [Product Manager II- Business Credit Cards][48]\n\nHybrid\nPittsburgh, PA, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][49]\n\n### [Software Engineer Senior (JAVA/Spring Boot/Angular)][50]\n\nHybrid\nFarmers Branch, TX, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][51]\n\n### [Product Owner III - C&amp;IB Business Technology Originations][52]\n\nHybrid\nPittsburgh, PA, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][53]\n\n### [Senior Data Scientist - Marketing &amp; Customer Analytics][54]\n\nHybrid\nPittsburgh, PA, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][55]\n\n### [Agile Coach - Workforce Technologies][56]\n\nHybrid\nPittsburgh, PA, USA\n\n## [PNC Bank Logo] PNC Bank\n\n][57]\n\n### [Product Manager II - Investment Office][58]\n\nHybrid\nPhiladelphia, PA, USA\nView all jobs\n][59]\n\n## PNC Bank Offices\n\n[Learn More ][60]\n\nHybrid Workspace\n\nEmployees engage in a combination of remote and on-site work.\n\nTypical time on-site: Not Specified\n[Company Office]\nHQPittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA\nBirmingham, Alabama, USA\nFarmers Branch, Texas, USA\nPhiladelphia, Pennsylvania, USA\nPhoenix, Arizona, USA\nStrongsville, Ohio, USA\nLearn more\n][61]\n\n## PNC Bank Teams\n\n[Learn More ][62]\n[Team]\nProduct & Tech\n[Team]\nPNC's Westward Expansion\n[Team]\nPNC's Approach to AI Exploration\n[Team]\nQA & Test Engineering\nAbout our Teams\n][63]\n\n## Articles We're In\n\n[View All ][64]\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][65]\n[Built In Staff] Built In Staff\nPublished on February 24, 2026\n\n## PNC\u2019s Quality Assurance Engineers Help Get the Bugs Out\n\n][66]\n\nLearn how the firm's QA engineers ensure quality is never an afterthought, empowered by a culture\nrooted in growth and support.\n\n[Built In Staff] Built In Staff\nUpdated on November 26, 2025\n\n## Come Play in Our Sandbox!\n\n][67]\n\nPNC Offers Opportunities to Explore, Learn and Work Creatively with AI\n\n[[Photo: Shutterstock]][68]\n[Brand Studio Logo]\n[Built In Staff] Built In Staff\nUpdated on December 02, 2025\n\n## PNC Watch Tower Team Culture: On the Look for Lookouts!\n\n][69]\n\nPNC\u2019s Watch Tower Team Offers the Chance to Defend and Protect\n\n[[Photo: The PNC Financial Services Group]][70]\n[Brand Studio Logo]\n[View all articles][71]\n\n## Awards\n\n[award][award]\n\n## Technology We Use\n* [ENGINEERING][72]\n* [PRODUCT][73]\n* [PEOPLE OPERATIONS][74]\n\n[AWS (Amazon Web Services)]\nAWS (Amazon Web Services)\nSERVICES\n[Microsoft Azure]\nMicrosoft Azure\nSERVICES\n[JIRA]\nJIRA\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT\n[Tableau]\nTableau\nANALYTICS\n[Microsoft Teams]\nMicrosoft Teams\nCOLLABORATION\n\n## PNC Bank FAQs\n\n[What's It Like to Work at PNC Bank?][75]\n[What's the Company Culture Like at PNC Bank?][76]\n[PNC Bank Inclusion & Diversity][77]\n[PNC Bank Career Growth & Development][78]\n[PNC Bank Compensation & Benefits][79]\n[What's the Work-Life Balance Like at PNC Bank?][80]\n[PNC Bank Leadership & Management][81]\n[PNC Bank Innovation & Technology Culture][82]\n[PNC Bank Mission, Purpose & Impact][83]\n[PNC Bank Company Growth, Stability & Outlook][84]\n\n## PNC Bank's Teams\n\n[Product & Tech][85]\n[PNC's Westward Expansion][86]\n[PNC's Approach to AI Exploration][87]\n[QA & Test Engineering][88]\n[View All Jobs at PNC Bank][89]\n* [\nCompanies\n][90]\n* [\nJobs\n][91]\n* [\nTracker\n][92]\n* [\nArticles\n][93]\n* More\n[Built In]\n[ Join ][94]\n[ Log In ][95]\n* [\nTech Jobs\n][96]\n* [\nCompanies\n][97]\n* [\nArticles\n][98]\n* [\nRemote\n][99]\n* [\nBest Places To Work\n][100]\n* [\nTech Hubs\n][101]\n[ Post Job ][102]\n[[BuiltIn]][103]\n\u00a9 2026 Built I