            "url": "https://builtin.com/company/blackrock/faq/workplace-perception",
            "text": "[[Built In Logo] [Built In Logo]][1][Companies][2][Jobs][3][Articles][4]\n[View All Jobs][5]\n[ Join ][6]\n[ Log In ][7]\n[ For Employers ][8]\n[ Companies ][9] [ BlackRock ][10]\n\n## BlackRock\n\nSave Saved\nNew York\nTotal Offices: **30**\n25,000 Total Employees\nYear Founded: 1988\n[View Website][11]\nWe're Hiring!\n[ Finance **98** ][12] [ Engineering **60** ][13] [ Data & Analytics **39** ][14] [ Sales **24**\n][15] [ Operations & Support **23** ][16] [ Product Management **20** ][17] [ AI & Machine Learning\n**16** ][18] [ Customer Success & Experience **12** ][19] [ Legal **8** ][20] [ Consulting **6**\n][21] [ Cybersecurity **5** ][22] [ Marketing **4** ][23] [ HR & Recruiting **2** ][24] [ Program &\nProject Management **2** ][25] [ Design **1** ][26]\n[View all jobs][27]\n* Overview\n* Jobs 321\n* Offices\n* Teams\n* Culture\n* Articles\n* Company Insights\n* [ Working at BlackRock ][28]\n* [ Culture & Values ][29]\n* [ Career Growth & Development ][30]\n* [ Compensation & Benefits ][31]\n* [ Work-Life Balance & Wellbeing ][32]\n* [ Leadership & Management ][33]\n* [ Innovation, Technology & Agility ][34]\n* [ Stability & Growth ][35]\n\n# What's It Like to Work at BlackRock?\n\n## BlackRock Employee Perspectives\n\nThere is a mindset at BlackRock that you should be like a student \u2014 always learning and improving.\nThe hackathon is quite representative of the company, and how we always try to find new ways to do\nthings.\n\n[Mael Pidjou]\nMael Pidjou,\nFrom the article: [How BlackRock\u2019s Hackathon Empowers Employees to Be Innovative][36]\n\nThe most rewarding thing for me is knowing that I am able to make an impact on a large scale. Given\nthe size of BlackRock, I know that, by doing my job well (helping to keep safe the technology and\ndata the company uses to deliver for our clients), I am playing a small part to positively impact\nthe financial future of millions of people and financial markets globally.\n\n[Brandon Berry]\nBrandon Berry,\nFrom the article: [A Conversation With Atlantans Who Are Building Our iHub in Atlanta ][37]\n\nEvery person I met through the recruitment process embodied the One BlackRock principle. It was\nclear BlackRock is a firm that values cooperation and teamwork, and where people genuinely care\nabout and root for each other\u2019s success.\n\n[Simona Paravani-Mellinghoff]\nSimona Paravani-Mellinghoff,\nFrom the article: [Meet our London-based Chief Investment Officer, Simona Paravani-Mellinghoff][38]\n\n**In one memorable line, how would you describe day-to-day satisfaction on your team?**\n\nI love working on my team because I\u2019m constantly learning new things, trusted with meaningful work\nand supported by people who care about both results and each other.\n\n**Would you recommend working here \u2014 and what proof backs that up?**\n\nAbsolutely. I genuinely value the culture at BlackRock. There is a clear and consistent commitment\nto the work we do, the relationships we build with clients and colleagues, and the standards that\nguide how that work is carried out. On a personal level, I\u2019ve also experienced BlackRock\u2019s\nintentional approach to professional development through structured feedback, growth opportunities\nand meaningful responsibility, which has made me feel supported and confident in continuing to build\nmy career here.\n\n**How are you perceived externally right now, and what signals support that?**\n\nBlackRock is perceived as a firm that is persistent and deeply committed to excellence. This is\nreinforced by my experience here. There is a strong culture of accountability and high standards\nthat genuinely motivates you to do your best work. This perception is also reflected in external\nrecognition, including BlackRock being named a two-time winner of the Handshake Early Talent Awards,\nhighlighting the firm\u2019s continued investment in developing and supporting early\u2011career talent.\n\n[Osato Agbonayinma]\nOsato Agbonayinma, Compensation Analyst\nFrom the article: [Why Employees Bet Their Careers at BlackRock, Agentio and firsthand ][39]\n\nBlackRock doesn\u2019t feel like a traditional finance company; it feels inclusive and more like a tech\nfirm.\n\n[Waqar-un-nisa Nabi]\nWaqar-un-nisa Nabi,\nFrom the article: [From Innovative Tech to Inclusive Teams: Technologist Explains Why She's Thriving\nat BlackRock][40]\n\n## What People Are Saying About BlackRock\n* Mission & Purpose: The firm\u2019s fiduciary mission\u2014helping more people experience financial\nwell\u2011being\u2014is prominently emphasized and gives many roles a clear sense of impact. The scale of\nclients and assets connects day\u2011to\u2011day work to outcomes at global reach.\n* Learning & Development: Structured programs like BlackRock Academies, leadership training,\nmentorship, certifications, and returnships provide defined pathways to build skills. Internal\nmobility across investments, ETFs, client coverage, and technology is actively supported to\nbroaden experience.\n* Market Position & Stability: A well\u2011known brand, diversified businesses, and industry scale create\nperceived stability and broad career optionality. Exposure to large platforms and complex clients\nexpands opportunities to contribute and grow.\n\n## BlackRock's Awards\n\n[award][award][award]\n\n## BlackRock's Benefits\n\n### Employee Satisfaction & Recognition\n\nEstablished employee awards to honor work and contributions\n\n### Promotion Policies\n\nPromote from within\n\nProvides customized development tracks\n\n### Work Environment\n\nImplements team-based strategic planning\n\n## BlackRock FAQs\n\n[What's the Company Culture Like at BlackRock?][41]\n[BlackRock Inclusion & Diversity][42]\n[BlackRock Career Growth & Development][43]\n[BlackRock Compensation & Benefits][44]\n[What's the Work-Life Balance Like at BlackRock?][45]\n[BlackRock Leadership & Management][46]\n[BlackRock Innovation & Technology Culture][47]\n[BlackRock Mission, Purpose & Impact][48]\n[BlackRock Company Growth, Stability & Outlook][49]\n* [\nCompanies\n][50]\n* [\nJobs\n][51]\n* [\nTracker\n][52]\n* [\nArticles\n][53]\n* More\n[Built In]\n[ Join ][54]\n[ Log In ][55]\n* [\nTech Jobs\n][56]\n* [\nCompanies\n][57]\n* [\nArticles\n][58]\n* [\nRemote\n][59]\n* [\nBest Places To Work\n][60]\n* [\nTech Hubs\n][61]\n[ Post Job ][62]\n[[BuiltIn]][63]\n\u00a9 2026 Built In. All rights reserved.\nAbout\n[ Our Story ][64]\n[ Careers ][65]\n[ Our Staff Writers ][66]\n[ Content Descriptions ][67]\nGet Involved\n[ Recruit With Built In ][68]\n[ Become an Expert Contributor ][69]\nResources\n[ Customer Support ][70]\n[ Share Feedback ][71]\n[ Report a Bug ][72]\n[ Tech Job Tools + Career Resources ][73]\n[ Browse Jobs ][74]\n[ Tech A-Z ][75]\nTech Hubs\n[Our Sites][76]\n\u00a9 2026 Built In. All rights reserved.\n[ Learning Lab User Agreement ][77] [ Accessibility Statement ][78] [ Copyright Policy ][79] [\nPrivacy Policy ][80] [ Terms of Use ][81] [ Your Privacy Choices/Cookie Settings ][82] [ CA Notice\nof Collection ][83]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /companies\n[3]: /jobs\n[4]: /tech-topics\n[5]: /jobs\n[6]: /auth/signup?destination=%2fcompany%2fblackrock%2ffaq%2fworkplace-perception\n[7]: /auth/login?destination=%2fcompany%2fblackrock%2ffaq%2fworkplace-perception\n[8]: https://employers.builtin.com?utm_medium=BIReferral&utm_source=foremployers\n[9]: /companies\n[10]: /company/blackrock\n[11]: http://www.blackrock.com?utm_source=BuiltIn&utm_medium=BuiltIn&utm_campaign=BuiltIn\n[12]: /jobs/finance?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[13]: /jobs/engineering?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[14]: /jobs/data-analytics?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[15]: /jobs/sales?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[16]: /jobs/operations-support?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[17]: /jobs/product-management?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[18]: /jobs/ai-machine-learning?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[19]: /jobs/customer-success-experience?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[20]: /jobs/legal?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[21]: /jobs/consultant?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[22]: /jobs/cyber-security?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[23]: /jobs/marketing?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[24]: /jobs/hr-recruiting?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[25]: /jobs/program-project-management?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[26]: /jobs/designer?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[27]: /jobs?companyId=82933&allLocations=true\n[28]: /company/blackrock/faq/workplace-perception\n[29]: /company/blackrock/faq/culture-values\n[30]: /company/blackrock/faq/career-growth-development\n[31]: /company/blackrock/faq/compensation-benefits\n[32]: /company/blackrock/faq/work-life-balance-wellbeing\n[33]: /company/blackrock/faq/leadership-management\n[34]: /company/blackrock/faq/innovation-technology-agility\n[35]: /company/blackrock/faq/stability-growth\n[36]: https://careers.blackrock.com/blog-how-blackrock-hackathon-empowers-employees-innovative\n[37]: https://careers.blackrock.com/a-conversation-with-atlantans-who-are-building-our-ihub\n[38]: https://careers.blackrock.com/blog-meet-our-london-based-chief-investment-officer\n[39]: https://builtin.com/articles/more-just-job-why-employees-bet-their-careers-blackrock-agentio-a\nnd-firsthand\n[40]: https://careers.blackrock.com/blog\n[41]: /company/blackrock/faq/culture-values\n[42]: /company/blackrock/faq/inclusion-diversity\n[43]: /company/blackrock/faq/career-growth-development\n[44]: /company/blackrock/faq/compensation-benefits\n[45]: /company/blackrock/faq/work-life-balance-wellbeing\n[46]: /company/blackrock/faq/leadership-management\n[47]: /company/blackrock/faq/innovation-technology-agility\n[48]: /company/blackrock/faq/mission-purpose-impact\n[49]: /company/blackrock/faq/stability-growth\n[50]: /companies\n[51]: /jobs\n[52]: /auth/login?destination=/?application-tracker#application-tracker\n[53]: /tech-topics\n[54]: /auth/signup?destination=%2fcompany%2fblackrock%2ffaq%2fworkplace-perception\n[55]: /auth/login?destination=%2fcompany%2fblackrock%2ffaq%2fworkplace-perception\n[56]: /jobs\n[57]: /companies\n[58]: /tech-topics\n[59]: /jobs/remote\n[60]: https://builtin.com/awards/us/2026/best-places-to-work\n[61]: /tech-hubs\n[62]: https://employers.builtin.com/membership?utm_medium=BIReferral&utm_source=foremployers\n[63]: /\n[64]: https://builtin.com/our-story\n[65]: https://employers.builtin.com/careers/\n[66]: https://builtin.com/our-staff\n[67]: https://builtin.com/content-descriptions\n[68]: https://employers.builtin.com/membership?utm_medium=BIReferral&utm_source=foremployers\n[69]: https://builtin.com/expert-contributors\n[70]: https://knowledgebase.builtin.com/s/\n[71]: https://form.jotform.com/223044927257054\n[72]: https://knowledgebase.builtin.com/s/contactsupport\n[73]: https://builtin.com/articles/grow-your-career\n[74]: https://builtin.com/browse-jobs\n[75]: https://builtin.com/tech-dictionary\n[76]: https://builtin.com/our-sites\n[77]: https://builtin.com/learning-lab-user-agreement\n[78]: https://builtin.com/accessibility-statement\n[79]: https://builtin.com/copyright-policy\n[80]: https://builtin.com/privacy-policy\n[81]: https://builtin.com/community-terms-of-use\n[82]: https://builtin.com/california-do-not-sell-my-information\n[83]: https://builtin.com/ca-notice-collection"
