        "crawl_text": "US Job Services, LLC Over 337K monthly job seekers use JOBSwithDOD 43K+ defense jobs listed every month Rated defense industry career platform in the U.S. based on G2 satisfaction ratings as of March 1, 2025. Defense Industry Jobs, Cleared Careers &amp; DoD Contractor Hiring | JOBSwithDOD\n\nSkip to content\n\nOpen main menu\n\nJob Seekers\n\nSearch Jobs\nBrowse Jobs\nBrowse Employers\n\nEmployers\n\nHow it Works\nPost Jobs\n\nEmployer Support\nContact Us\n\nDefense Career News\n\nSearch Jobs\n\nLogin\n\nJob Seekers\n\nSearch Jobs\nBrowse Jobs\nBrowse Employers\n\nEmployers\n\nHow it Works\nPost Jobs\nEmployer Support\nContact Us\n\nDefense Career News\n\nSearch\n\nExplore Defense Industry Careers\n\nDefense Companies Now Hiring\n\nDoD Civilian Employers Now Hiring\n\nOver 337K\n\nmonthly job seekers use JOBSwithDOD\n\n43K+\n\ndefense jobs listed every month\n\nrated defense industry career platform in the U.S.\n\nBased on G2 satisfaction ratings as of March 1, 2025.\n\nContinue\n\nDefense Industry\nNews | Insights\n\nDefense Industry News\n\nInside DroneShield Careers: Your Guide to Joining a Defense Tech Leader\n\nWhat Sets DroneShield Apart in the Defense Industry DroneShield operates with an Industrial Designer as Chief Product Officer. This embeds design thinking at the executive level instead of treating it as a technical afterthought. User needs and design principles get representation in all strategic conversations through this leadership structure. The approach has let the company &hellip; Continued\n\nDefense Industry Career Articles\n\n2026 Defense Industry Security Clearance Guide: What You Need To Know\n\nUnderstanding Security Clearance Levels in the Defense Industry The Department of Defense and most federal agencies issue three formal security clearance levels: Confidential, Secret, and Top Secret. Each requires progressively deeper background investigations and grants access to increasingly sensitive national security information. Confidential Clearance: Entry-Level Access Confidential represents the entry-level clearance and authorizes access to &hellip; Continued\n\nDepartment of Defense Analysis\n\nPentagon Drone Dominance Program: How Selected Drone Company USA Picks Are Creating Jobs\n\nOverview of the Pentagon Drone Dominance Program Secretary of War Pete Hegseth launched the Drone Dominance Program in December 2025 with a clear mandate to accelerate the manufacturing and fielding of American-made attack drones. The program allocates $1.10 billion across four competitive phases, with plans to purchase more than 300,000 platforms by 2028. This acquisition &hellip; Continued\n\nDiscover More\n\nFooter\n\nWe've Got Your Six\n\nWe provide highly talented job seekers a unified market to access defense career opportunities across both DoD Civilian Employers and Defense Companies. One industry, one network: JOBSwithDOD | We've Got Your Six\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nLinkedIn\n\nJob Seekers\n\nSearch Jobs\n\nAI Resume Optimizer\n\nBrowse Jobs\n\nBrowse Employers\n\nCreate Account\n\nDefense Career News\n\nNewsletter: Subscribe\n\nJob Seeker Login\n\nEmployers\n\nPost Jobs\n\nEnterprise Solutions\n\nGovernment Partnerships\n\nEmployer Resources\n\nEmployer Login\n\nContact Sales\n\nCompany\n\nWho We Are\n\nFAQs\n\nContact Us\n\nCareers\n\nGet the app\n\n&copy; 2026 US Job Services, LLC. All rights reserved. Disclaimer | Privacy Policy | CCPA [ Skip to content ][1]\nOpen main menu\n[ [Jobs with DoD] ][2]\nJob Seekers\n[Search Jobs][3] [Browse Jobs][4] [Browse Employers][5]\nEmployers\n[How it Works][6] [Post Jobs][7] [Employer Support][8] [Contact Us][9]\n[Defense Career News][10]\n[ Search Jobs ][11] [Login][12]\nJob Seekers\n[Search Jobs][13] [Browse Jobs][14] [Browse Employers][15]\nEmployers\n[How it Works][16] [Post Jobs][17] [Employer Support][18] [Contact Us][19]\n[Defense Career News][20]\n\n## Who We Are\n\n# We actively connect defense professionals with their next great opportunity.\n\nWhat began as a way to help emerging defense companies find top candidates has grown into the\nlargest defense industry careers marketplace. JOBSwithDOD provides a unified ecosystem of career\nopportunities across both private sector defense companies of all sizes and DoD civilian employers:\none industry, one network.\n\n## Core Values\n\nAt JOBSwithDOD our purpose unites us. The core values that animate everything we do are based upon\nintegrity, service, and excellence. This commitment to our mission, and a focus on delivering the\nhighest quality solutions for the defense industry means we are ever striving for continuous\nimprovement and growth.\n\n## Shadow Board: Leveraging staff insights to drive business improvement.\n\nIn 2023, JOBSwithDOD formed a shadow board consisting of employees from across our offices and\ndepartments. The aim of our shadow board was and remains, to offer an employee perspective on issues\nof group-wide significance to executive leadership, and to develop future leaders.\n\n## Success Stories\n\nThe shadow board is proud to have completed several recent strategic initiatives including\nestablishing a mentorship program to foster career growth and expanding our impact to support\nveteran serving non-profits.\n\nDefense Industry\nNews | Insights\n[Defense Industry News][21]\n\n### [ Inside DroneShield Careers: Your Guide to Joining a Defense Tech Leader ][22]\n\nWhat Sets DroneShield Apart in the Defense Industry DroneShield operates with an Industrial Designer\nas Chief Product Officer. This embeds design thinking at the executive level instead of treating it\nas a technical afterthought. User needs and design principles get representation in all strategic\nconversations through this leadership structure. The approach has let the company \u2026 [Continued][23]\n\n[Defense Industry Career Articles][24]\n\n### [ 2026 Defense Industry Security Clearance Guide: What You Need To Know ][25]\n\nUnderstanding Security Clearance Levels in the Defense Industry The Department of Defense and most\nfederal agencies issue three formal security clearance levels: Confidential, Secret, and Top Secret.\nEach requires progressively deeper background investigations and grants access to increasingly\nsensitive national security information. Confidential Clearance: Entry-Level Access Confidential\nrepresents the entry-level clearance and authorizes access to \u2026 [Continued][26]\n\n[Department of Defense Analysis][27]\n\n### [ Pentagon Drone Dominance Program: How Selected Drone Company USA Picks Are Creating Jobs ][28]\n\nOverview of the Pentagon Drone Dominance Program Secretary of War Pete Hegseth launched the Drone\nDominance Program in December 2025 with a clear mandate to accelerate the manufacturing and fielding\nof American-made attack drones. The program allocates $1.10 billion across four competitive phases,\nwith plans to purchase more than 300,000 platforms by 2028. This acquisition \u2026 [Continued][29]\n\n[Discover More][30]\n\n## Footer\n\n[ [Jobs with DHS] ][31]\n\nWe've Got Your Six\n\nWe provide highly talented job seekers a unified market to access defense career opportunities\nacross both DoD Civilian Employers and Defense Companies. One industry, one network: JOBSwithDOD |\nWe've Got Your Six\n\n[ Facebook ][32] [ Twitter ][33] [ LinkedIn ][34]\n\n### Job Seekers\n* [Search Jobs][35]\n* [AI Resume Optimizer][36]\n* [Browse Jobs][37]\n* [Browse Employers][38]\n* [Create Account][39]\n* [Defense Career News][40]\n* [Newsletter: Subscribe][41]\n* [Job Seeker Login][42]\n\n### Employers\n* [Post Jobs][43]\n* [Enterprise Solutions][44]\n* [Government Partnerships][45]\n* [Employer Resources][46]\n* [Employer Login][47]\n* [Contact Sales][48]\n\n### Company\n* [Who We Are][49]\n* [FAQs][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [Careers][52]\n\nGet the app\n\n\u00a9 2026 US Job Services, LLC. All rights reserved. [Disclaimer][53] | [Privacy Policy][54] |\n[CCPA][55]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://jobswithdod.com\n[3]: /search-jobs/\n[4]: /browse-jobs/\n[5]: /defense-companies/\n[6]: /employer-recruiter-resources/\n[7]: /post-jobs/\n[8]: /support/faqs/#employer\n[9]: /employer-recruiter-resources/contact-sales/\n[10]: /news-insights\n[11]: /search-jobs\n[12]: /login-signup\n[13]: /search-jobs/\n[14]: /browse-jobs/\n[15]: /defense-companies/\n[16]: /employer-recruiter-resources/\n[17]: /post-jobs/\n[18]: /support/faqs/#employer\n[19]: /employer-recruiter-resources/contact-sales/\n[20]: /news-insights\n[21]: https://jobswithdod.com/news-insights/defense-industry-news/\n[22]: https://jobswithdod.com/defense-industry-news/inside-droneshield-careers-your-guide-to-joining\n-a-defense-tech-leader/\n[23]: https://jobswithdod.com/defense-industry-news/inside-droneshield-careers-your-guide-to-joining\n-a-defense-tech-leader/\n[24]: https://jobswithdod.com/news-insights/defense-industry-career-articles/\n[25]: https://jobswithdod.com/defense-industry-career-articles/2026-defense-industry-security-cleara\nnce-guide-what-you-need-to-know/\n[26]: https://jobswithdod.com/defense-industry-career-articles/2026-defense-industry-security-cleara\nnce-guide-what-you-need-to-know/\n[27]: https://jobswithdod.com/news-insights/department-of-defense-analysis/\n[28]: https://jobswithdod.com/department-of-defense-analysis/pentagon-drone-dominance-program-how-se\nlected-drone-company-usa-picks-are-creating-jobs/\n[29]: https://jobswithdod.com/department-of-defense-analysis/pentagon-drone-dominance-program-how-se\nlected-drone-company-usa-picks-are-creating-jobs/\n[30]: /news-insights/\n[31]: /\n[32]: https://www.facebook.com/jobswithdod\n[33]: https://twitter.com/JOBSwithDOD\n[34]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/jobswithdod\n[35]: /search-jobs\n[36]: /ai-resume-optimizer\n[37]: /browse-jobs\n[38]: /defense-companies/\n[39]: /sign-up/\n[40]: /news-insights\n[41]: /news-insights/#usjs-newsletter-subscribe\n[42]: /login-signup\n[43]: /post-jobs\n[44]: /post-jobs/enterprise-solutions\n[45]: /government