      "polished_summary": "Jobswithdod is the largest careers marketplace in the defense industry, dedicated to connecting defense professionals with job opportunities in both private sector defense companies and DoD civilian employers. The company offers comprehensive job posting services for employers and tailored career services for job seekers, effectively serving the needs of the defense sector and its workforce.",
