odels for AI spatial reasoning using 2 billion+ gameplay video clips as training data.\n\n][83][\nSarvam AIAgentic AI\n\nBuilding Sovereign AI for India with full-stack generative AI models understanding Indian culture\nand diversity.\n\n][84][\nMistral AIFrontier AI Lab\n\nMistral AI provides frontier AI models, assistants, and agents with compute infrastructure and\nservices.\n\n][85][\nRemedyHealthcare\n\nAI Agents for Pharmacies\n\n][86][\nJedifyAgentic AI\n\nJedify provides a context graph for AI workflows, enabling reasoning, decision-making, and action.\n\n][87][\nAryon SecurityCybersecurity\n\nEnterprise cybersecurity platform focused on proactive threat detection and automated response.\n\n][88]\n\nAlways fresh\n\n## Agentic intelligence layer\n\nOur agents read funding news, hiring signals, product launches, and filings around the clock, so\nevery profile stays current without anyone touching a spreadsheet. Then the **Lighthouse Engine**\ntraces a faint signal to a fully formed company profile: Palantir-grade identity resolution and\ngraph-network technology that follows a bare domain to the live site, the company behind it, and the\nreal people running it, every link independently verified. It's how we surface stealth startups\nbefore they ever announce.\n\n[See how it works][89]\nReverse lookup\nOSINT signals\nDeep-web search\nIdentity resolution\nIdentity graph\nscanning registries\nWatchlist alerts Live\n* Raised a new round\n  Persona AI\n  Series B \u00b7 $40M\n* Added 12 engineers\n  Atom Foundry\n  Headcount +9%\n* Released from stealth\n  General Intuition\n  Now public\n* Shipped a new product\n  Sarvam AI\n  Launch detected\n* Mentioned in the news\n  Mistral AI\n  3 articles today\n* Opened a new office\n  Remedy\n  Now hiring\n* Acquired a competitor\n  Jedify\n  M&A detected\n* Changed pricing\n  Aryon Security\n  New tier added\n* Raised a new round\n  Persona AI\n  Series B \u00b7 $40M\n* Added 12 engineers\n  Atom Foundry\n  Headcount +9%\n* Released from stealth\n  General Intuition\n  Now public\n* Shipped a new product\n  Sarvam AI\n  Launch detected\n* Mentioned in the news\n  Mistral AI\n  3 articles today\n* Opened a new office\n  Remedy\n  Now hiring\n* Acquired a competitor\n  Jedify\n  M&A detected\n* Changed pricing\n  Aryon Security\n  New tier added\n\nNever miss a move\n\n## Track competitors, get alerted\n\nAdd any startup, investor, or founder to your watchlist and we'll email you the moment something\nchanges \u2014 new funding, team growth, launches, or news. Compare any two companies side by side.\n\n[Start tracking ][90]\n[\n\n### Search & filters\n\nFilter the whole ecosystem by sector, stage, funding, location, and tech stack.\n\n][91]\n[\n\n### Email finder\n\nFind and verify founder & exec emails in real time, with a confidence score.\n\n][92]\n[\n\n### Market Map Maker\n\nGenerate a competitive landscape from one prompt, then export it anywhere.\n\n][93]\n[\n\n### Agent readiness\n\nScore any company on how ready it is for the agentic web \u2014 free to run.\n\n][94]\n[\n\n### Tech Stack Checker\n\nSee the tools and infrastructure any company is built on.\n\n][95]\n[\n\n### Find Matches\n\nGet matched with the right investors or startups \u2014 with the reasoning.\n\n][96]\n[\n\n### Visual TL;DR\n\nTurn any article into a clean, shareable visual summary.\n\n][97]\n[\n\n### YouTube \u2192 Article\n\nTurn any video into a polished, publish-ready article.\n\n][98]\n[\n\n### Logo API\n\nFetch any company's logo by domain \u2014 fast, clean, free.\n\n][99]\n[\n\n### Developer API\n\nQuery the directory programmatically \u2014 startups, investors, rounds.\n\n][100]\n[\n\n### Search & filters\n\nFilter the whole ecosystem by sector, stage, funding, location, and tech stack.\n\n][101]\n[\n\n### Email finder\n\nFind and verify founder & exec emails in real time, with a confidence score.\n\n][102]\n[\n\n### Market Map Maker\n\nGenerate a competitive landscape from one prompt, then export it anywhere.\n\n][103]\n[\n\n### Agent readiness\n\nScore any company on how ready it is for the agentic web \u2014 free to run.\n\n][104]\n[\n\n### Tech Stack Checker\n\nSee the tools and infrastructure any company is built on.\n\n][105]\n[\n\n### Find Matches\n\nGet matched with the right investors or startups \u2014 with the reasoning.\n\n][106]\n[\n\n### Visual TL;DR\n\nTurn any article into a clean, shareable visual summary.\n\n][107]\n[\n\n### YouTube \u2192 Article\n\nTurn any video into a polished, publish-ready article.\n\n][108]\n[\n\n### Logo API\n\nFetch any company's logo by domain \u2014 fast, clean, free.\n\n][109]\n[\n\n### Developer API\n\nQuery the directory programmatically \u2014 startups, investors, rounds.\n\n][110]\n[\n\n### Search & filters\n\nFilter the whole ecosystem by sector, stage, funding, location, and tech stack.\n\n][111]\n[\n\n### Email finder\n\nFind and verify founder & exec emails in real time, with a confidence score.\n\n][112]\n[\n\n### Market Map Maker\n\nGenerate a competitive landscape from one prompt, then export it anywhere.\n\n][113]\n[\n\n### Agent readiness\n\nScore any company on how ready it is for the agentic web \u2014 free to run.\n\n][114]\n[\n\n### Tech Stack Checker\n\nSee the tools and infrastructure any company is built on.\n\n][115]\n[\n\n### Find Matches\n\nGet matched with the right investors or startups \u2014 with the reasoning.\n\n][116]\n[\n\n### Visual TL;DR\n\nTurn any article into a clean, shareable visual summary.\n\n][117]\n[\n\n### YouTube \u2192 Article\n\nTurn any video into a polished, publish-ready article.\n\n][118]\n[\n\n### Logo API\n\nFetch any company's logo by domain \u2014 fast, clean, free.\n\n][119]\n[\n\n### Developer API\n\nQuery the directory programmatically \u2014 startups, investors, rounds.\n\n][120]\n\nBuilt for builders\n\n## A toolkit for the whole AI ecosystem\n\nBeyond the directory \u2014 every tool founders, investors, and operators reach for, from email finding\nand market maps to agent-readiness scoring and the developer API.\n\n[Explore the database ][121]\n\nIntegrations\n\n## Plug StartupHub into your existing stack\n\nSync signals straight into the tools you already use \u2014 from Slack and Notion to Salesforce, HubSpot,\nAffinity, monday.com, and Google Sheets \u2014 so your pipeline always stays up to date.\n\n[Explore integrations ][122]\n[StartupHub.ai]\n\nSolutions by role\n\n## Explore how every\n## team uses StartupHub\n\nThe same directory and live signals power very different workflows \u2014 pick the one that matches your\njob.\n\n[See all solutions][123]\n[\nInvestors\n\nVenture Capital & PE\n\n### Source before the market\n\nCatch new and stealth-mode companies the morning they appear, monitor your portfolio, and pull\ndiligence inputs in minutes.\n\nExplore\n][124][\nFounders\n\nFounders & operators\n\n### Get listed, ranked & cited\n\nPut your startup where Google ranks it and ChatGPT, Claude & Perplexity cite it \u2014 indexed in under\n24 hours.\n\nExplore\n][125][\nSales\n\nSales & GTM\n\n### Reach accounts on the signal\n\nFunding rounds, hiring surges and tech-stack changes land as CRM tasks, so reps reach out the same\nday.\n\nExplore\n][126][\nCompete\n\nCompetitive intelligence\n\n### Never miss a rival move\n\nPricing, tech-stack, jobs and news diffs pushed to Slack so product marketing can respond the same\nday.\n\nExplore\n][127][\nTalent\n\nRecruiting & talent\n\n### Find talent as it frees up\n\nHeadcount deltas and job postings flag available talent and competitors scaling a function.\n\nExplore\n][128][\nCorp Dev\n\nCorp Dev / M&A\n\n### Track targets early\n\nFunding, exits and new subsidiary domains surface acquisition targets before they are common\nknowledge.\n\nExplore\n][129]\n\nBrowse\n\n## Jump straight to what you're tracking\n\nThe same filters as our search \u2014 pick a value and it opens the live directory with that filter\napplied.\n\nSectors\nCity\nCountry\nFunding Stage\nOperating Status\nM&A Activity\nCDN\nHosting\nPayments\nEmail Provider\nCompliance\nHiring Platform\nEmail Marketing\nBooking Tool\nStatus Page\nCookie Consent\nAI Customer Support\nVisitor tracking\n[Stealth Mode][130]\n\nExplore by sector\n\n## Every corner of the AI ecosystem\n\nFrom agentic AI and neoclouds to defense, robotics, fintech, and biotech \u2014 browse curated startups\nacross hundreds of sectors, each enriched and ranked.\n\n[Browse all sectors ][131]\n[\n\n### Agentic AI\n\nAutonomous AI agents that plan, reason, and execute complex tasks independently\n\n450+\n][132]\n[\n\n### NeoLab\n\nElite AI research labs founded by top researchers, raising at unicorn+ valuations\n\n50+\n][133]\n[\n\n### Neocloud\n\nGPU cloud providers powering AI training and inference at scale\n\n120+\n][134]\n[\n\n### AI Infrastructure\n\nGPUs, inference engines,"
