com/author/team-tbh/\n[38]: https://thebrandhopper.com/brand/loreal-because-we-are-all-worth-it/\n[39]: https://thebrandhopper.com/brand/kfc-its-not-good-its-finger-lickin-good/\n[40]: https://thebrandhopper.com/brand/\n[41]: https://thebrandhopper.com/brand/swatch-x-audemars-piguet-royal-pop-the-wildest-watch-release-\nof-the-year/\n[42]: https://thebrandhopper.com/author/team-tbh/\n[43]: https://thebrandhopper.com/brand/swatch-x-audemars-piguet-royal-pop-the-wildest-watch-release-\nof-the-year/\n[44]: https://thebrandhopper.com/brand/\n[4"
