es to unlock rival and Aussie\nqualifier eliminates retiring star] ][255]\n[\n][256]\n[ The Roar ][257]\n[\n][258]\n[ The Roar ][259]\n\n### [ Round 1 Predicted Teams: Roosters - Robinson hoping history repeats with DCE firing up\n### new-look Chooks ][260]\n\nAs part of a series profiling the expected Round 1 sides for all 17 NRL clubs in 2026, it\u2019s time to\nsee how the\u2026\n\n[\nLeague\n][261]\n[\n978\n][262]\nJan\n[ [Round 1 Predicted Teams: Roosters - Robinson hoping history repeats with DCE firing up new-look\nChooks] ][263]\n\n## Latest\n\n[View All][264]\n[\n][265]\n[ The Roar ][266]\n\n### [ A-League tipping Round 14: Sacking coach after coach won't help Wanderers, Big Blue looking\n### juicy on Australia Day ][267]\n\n[\nFootball\n][268]\n[\n321\n][269]\nJan\n[ [A-League tipping Round 14: Sacking coach after coach won't help Wanderers, Big Blue looking juicy\non Australia Day] ][270]\n[\n][271]\n[ Julius2934 ][272] new author\nRoar Rookie\n\n### [ Is Australia ready for biggest World Cup ever with Wallabies well and truly stuck in second\n### tier of teams ][273]\n\n[\nRugby\n][274]\n[\n57\n][275]\nJan\n[ [Is Australia ready for biggest World Cup ever with Wallabies well and truly stuck in second tier\nof teams] ][276]\n[\n][277]\n[ Choppy Dwarshuis ][278]\nRoar Rookie\n\n### [ Acknowledging the shared birthday of Travis Boon - a day to celebrate hirsute cult heroes\n### ][279]\n\n[\nCricket\n][280]\n[\n1570\n][281]\nJan\n[ [Acknowledging the shared birthday of Travis Boon - a day to celebrate hirsute cult heroes] ][282]\n[\n][283]\n[ The Roar ][284]\n\n### [ NRL Round 1 Predicted Teams: North Queensland Cowboys - Make or break for Payten with serial\n### under-performers ][285]\n\n[\nLeague\n][286]\n[\n20\n][287]\nJan\n[ [NRL Round 1 Predicted Teams: North Queensland Cowboys - Make or break for Payten with serial\nunder-performers] ][288]\n[\n][289]\n[ The Roar ][290]\n\n### [ Hobart Hurricanes vs Melbourne Stars: BBL15 Knockout final live scores ][