      "company_summary": "Warcosts is a data-driven platform dedicated to documenting the financial, human, and societal costs of American military engagements since 1776. It offers a range of services, including data visualization dashboards, comprehensive analyses of military spending, and repositories of historical conflicts, all aimed at researchers, journalists, educators, policymakers, and veterans. By making the costs of military power visible and measurable, Warcosts empowers its users to engage in informed discussions about the implications of military actions.",
      "operational_presence": "Markets mentioned on website: Switzerland, Germany, Israel, Taiwan, Russia, Spain, UAE",
