            "text": "\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0fCEASEFIRE: Iran War Day 40 \u2014 2-Week Pause Announced \u2014[Live Tracker \u2192][1]\n[WarCosts][2]\n[\ud83d\udd34 IRAN WAR][3][Modern Wars][4][War Clock][5][Timeline][6][\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f War Map][7]\nExplore \u25be\nMoney \u25be\nTools \u25be\nEmpire \u25be\nAnalysis \u25be\nAbout \u25be\n[Home][8]/Contact\n\n# Contact Us\n\nWarCosts is a project of [TheDataProject.ai][9]. We welcome corrections, suggestions, and inquiries.\n\n## \ud83d\udcf0 Press Inquiries\n\nMedia requests, interview scheduling, and press resources.\n\n[Email Us \u2192][10]\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 Data Corrections\n\nFound an error? Help us keep our data accurate. Include the page URL and the correction needed.\n\n[Email Us \u2192][11]\n\n## \ud83d\udcac General Feedback\n\nQuestions, suggestions, partnership proposals, or just want to say hello.\n\n[Email Us \u2192][12]\n\nGeneral email: [info@thedataproject.ai][13]\n\nWe typically respond within 48 hours.\n\n### Explore\n* [All Wars][14]\n* [Military Spending][15]\n* [Overseas Bases][16]\n* [Timeline][17]\n* [Casualty Data][18]\n* [Modern Wars][19]\n* [War Clock][20]\n\n### \ud83d\udd34 Iran 2026\n* [Live Tracker][21]\n* [Day-by-Day][22]\n* [Cost Tracker][23]\n* [Casualties][24]\n* [Destruction][25]\n* [Global Reactions][26]\n* [Analysis][27]\n* [$28K/Second][28]\n\n### Analysis\n* [All Analysis][29]\n* [War Profiteers][30]\n* [Cost Per Kill][31]\n* [The Receipt][32]\n* [Military-Industrial Complex][33]\n* [The Human Cost][34]\n* [Forever Wars][35]\n* [Blowback][36]\n\n### Tools\n* [Tax Receipt][37]\n* [Budget Simulator][38]\n* [Draft Simulator][39]\n* [Inflation Calculator][40]\n* [War Quiz][41]\n* [State Impact][42]\n* [Cost Calculator][43]\n* [Opportunity Cost][44]\n\n### Data\n* [Defense Contractors][45]\n* [Weapons Exposed][46]\n* [War Calendar][47]\n* [Arms Sales][48]\n* [Foreign Aid][49]\n* [Pentagon Audit][50]\n* [Troop Deployments][51]\n* [Downloads][52]\n\n### Perspectives\n* [Veterans\u2019 Voices][53]\n* [The Other Side][54]\n* [Allied Costs][55]\n* [Contractors\u2019 War][56]\n* [Media Coverage][57]\n* [Military Families][58]\n\n### About\n* [Methodology][59]\n* [Sources][60]\n* [FAQ][61]\n* [Glossary][62]\n* [Contact][63]\n* [Search][64]\n* [Privacy][65]\n\nA TheDataProject.ai Network\n\n[OpenLobby][66][OpenImmigration][67][OpenMedicaid][68][OpenMedicare][69][OpenSpending][70][OpenFeds]\n[71][VaccineWatch][72][OpenCrime][73][OpenPrescriber][74][TheDataProject][75][TariffTax][76][SPACGra\nveyard][77][AI Exposure][78][The AI Lobby][79][AutoPilotWatch][80][ShelterScope][81][GiveScope][82]\n\n### Explore More Data\n\n[GiveScope \u2014 Search 1.9M nonprofits & their finances][83][How Is America \u2014 Census data on AI, food,\nhousing & trust][84][ShelterScope \u2014 Housing & shelter data across the U.S.][85]\n\n2,300+ pages of data \u00b7 Last updated: March 2026\n\n\u201cOf all the enemies to public liberty, war is perhaps the most to be dreaded.\u201d \u2014 James Madison\n\nContact: [info@thedataproject.ai][86] \u00b7 A [TheDataProject.ai][87] platform \u00b7 \u00a9 2026\n\n[1]: /iran-war-2026\n[2]: /\n[3]: /iran-war-2026\n[4]: /modern-wars\n[5]: /war-clock\n[6]: /timeline\n[7]: /war-map\n[8]: /\n[9]: https://thedataproject.ai\n[10]: mailto:info@thedataproject.ai?subject=Press%20Inquiry%20%E2%80%94%20WarCosts\n[11]: mailto:info@thedataproject.ai?subject=Data%20Correction%20%E2%80%94%20WarCosts\n[12]: mailto:info@thedataproject.ai?subject=Feedback%20%E2%80%94%20WarCosts\n[13]: mailto:info@thedataproject.ai\n[14]: /conflicts\n[15]: /spending\n[16]: /bases\n[17]: /timeline\n[18]: /casualties\n[19]: /modern-wars\n[20]: /war-clock\n[21]: /iran-war-2026\n[22]: /iran-war-day-by-day\n[23]: /iran-war-2026/cost\n[24]: /iran-war-2026/casualties\n[25]: /iran-destruction\n[26]: /global-reactions\n[27]: /analysis/iran-2026\n[28]: /analysis/iran-cost-per-second\n[29]: /analysis\n[30]: /war-profiteers\n[31]: /cost-per-kill\n[32]: /the-receipt\n[33]: /analysis/military-industrial-complex\n[34]: /analysis/human-cost\n[35]: /analysis/forever-wars\n[36]: /analysis/blowback\n[37]: /tools/tax-receipt\n[38]: /tools/budget-simulator\n[39]: /tools/draft-simulator\n[40]: /tools/inflation-calculator\n[41]: /tools/war-quiz-hard\n[42]: /tools/state-impact\n[43]: /tools/cost-calculator\n[44]: /opportunity-cost\n[45]: /contractors\n[46]: /weapons-exposed\n[47]: /war-calendar\n[48]: /arms-sales\n[49]: /foreign-aid\n[50]: /pentagon-audit\n[51]: /deployments\n[52]: /downloads\n[53]: /veterans-voices\n[54]: /the-other-side\n[55]: /allied-costs\n[56]: /private-war\n[57]: /media-coverage\n[58]: /military-families-impact\n[59]: /methodology\n[60]: /sources\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /glossary\n[63]: /contact\n[64]: /search\n[65]: /privacy\n[66]: https://www.openlobby.us\n[67]: https://www.openimmigration.us\n[68]: https://www.openmedicaid.org\n[69]: https://www.openmedicare.us\n[70]: https://www.openspending.us\n[71]: https://www.openfeds.org\n[72]: https://www.vaccinewatch.org\n[73]: https://www.opencrime.us\n[74]: https://www.openprescriber.org\n[75]: https://thedataproject.ai\n[76]: https://www.tarifftax.org\n[77]: https://www.spacgraveyard.com\n[78]: https://www.aiexposure.org\n[79]: https://www.theailobby.com\n[80]: https://www.autopilotwatch.com\n[81]: https://www.shelterscope.com\n[82]: https://www.givescope.com\n[83]: https://www.givescope.com\n[84]: https://www.howisamerica.com\n[85]: https://www.shelterscope.com\n[86]: mailto:info@thedataproject.ai\n[87]: https://thedataproject.ai"
