      "polished_summary": "Directindustry is a leading B2B marketplace specializing in industrial equipment, offering a diverse range of products across various sectors, including detection and measurement, robotics, power transmission, and food processing. With a robust catalog featuring over 550,000 industrial products and attracting 2.7 million visitors monthly, the platform connects manufacturers and buyers, facilitating the sourcing and sale of essential industrial solutions.",
