ampaigns][242]\n* [2015 Awarded Campaigns][243]\n* [2014 Awarded Campaigns][244]\n* [NIF User Group][245]\n* [Bylaws][246]\n* [Executive Board][247]\n* [NIF Calendar][248]\n* [Target Shot Metrics][249]\n* [Conflict of Interest Policy][250]\n* [Jupiter Laser Facility][251]\n* [Multimedia][252]\n* [Photo Gallery][253]\n* [Playing Cards][254]\n* [Poster Gallery][255]\n* [Video Gallery][256]\n* [Education][257]\n* [How Lasers Work][258]\n* [How to Make a Star][259]\n* [Outreach][260]\n* [Laser Roadshow][261]\n* [Summer Scholar Internship Program][262]\n* [Seminars][263]\n* [Student Spotlight][264]\n* [Scholar Tours][265]\n* [Glossary][266]\n* [External Resources][267]\n* [News][268]\n* [The Age of Ignition][269]\n* [In the News][270]\n* [NIF in the News: Video][271]\n* [Programs][272]\n* [Advanced Photon Technologies][273]\n* [Facilities][274]\n* [Publications][275]\n* [People][276]\n* [Job Postings][277]\n* [Directed Energy Technology Programs][278]\n* [Directed Energy Technology Programs][279]\n* [Contact][280]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://www.llnl.gov/purpose\n[3]: https://www.llnl.gov/science-technology\n[4]: https://www.llnl.gov/join-our-team\n[5]: https://www.llnl.gov/partner\n[6]: https://www.llnl.gov/news\n[7]: https://www.llnl.gov/community-education\n[8]: https://www.llnl.gov/about\n[9]: https://www.llnl.gov\n[10]: https://lasers.llnl.gov/\n[11]: /about\n[12]: /about/what-is-nif\n[13]: /about/seven-wonders\n[14]: /about/seven-wonders/laser-glass\n[15]: /about/seven-wonders/optical-switch\n[16]: /about/seven-wonders/preamplifier-modules\n[17]: /about/seven-wonders/deformable-mirror\n[18]: /about/seven-wonders/rapid-growth-crystals\n[19]: /about/seven-wonders/computer-control-system\n[20]: /about/seven-wonders/target-fabrication\n[21]: /about/how-nif-works\n[22]: /about/how-nif-works/anatomy-nif-shot\n[23]: /about/how-nif-works/power-conditioning-system\n[24]: /about/how-nif-works/injection-laser-system\n[25]: /about/how-nif-works/amplifiers\n[26]: /about