ut][125]\n* [What Is NIF?][126]\n* [The Seven Wonders of NIF][127]\n* [How NIF Works][128]\n* [Keys to Our Success][129]\n* [Who Works for NIF][130]\n* [People Profiles][131]\n* [Management][132]\n* [Developing the Workforce][133]\n* [Who Partners With NIF][134]\n* [Careers][135]\n* [FAQs][136]\n* [Visit Us][137]\n* [Science][138]\n* [NIF Users][139]\n* [Multimedia][140]\n* [Education][141]\n* [News][142]\n* [Programs][143]\n* [Contact][144]\n\n##### LLNL Menu\n* [Missions][145]\n* [Research][146]\n* [Doing Business][147]\n* [News][148]\n* [About][149]\n* [Careers][150]\n* [Community][151]\n\n## Secondary Menu\n\n[About][152]\n* [What Is NIF?][153]\n* [The Seven Wonders of NIF][154]\n* [How NIF Works][155]\n* [Keys to Our Success][156]\n* [Who Works for NIF][157]\n* [People Profiles][158]\n* [Management][159]\n* [Developing the Workforce][160]\n* [Who Partners With NIF][161]\n* [Careers][162]\n* [FAQs][163]\n* [Visit Us][164]\n1. [Home][165]\n2. [About][166]\n3. Who Works for NIF & PS?\n\n# Who Works for NIF & PS?\n\n[diversity]\n\nThe talented and committed people of NIF & Photon Science represent a wide variety of expertise,\nexperience, backgrounds and interests. The directorate benefits every day from the work of some of\nthe world\u2019s most creative and visionary scientists, engineers, and technicians, supported by a [\nteam][167] of technicians, analysts, designers, transport & handling workers, health and safety\nexperts, computer programmers, accountants, and administrators, among others\u2014known collectively as\n[the Eighth Wonder of NIF][168].\n\nCome back to these pages often to learn more about the people who make the directorate\u2019s\naccomplishments possible. [Read a profile][169] of Kelli Humbird, who applies machine learning tools\nto analyze NIF inertial confinement fusion implosions and modeling for COVID-19 projects. And watch\nthis video to get a sense of the importance\u2014and the excitement\u2014of working with the world\u2019s\nhighest-energy laser system:\n\n[Becky Butlin]\n][170]\n[The People of NIF&PS][171]\nStories about the lives and work of members of the NIF & Photon Science Team\n[management.jpg]\n][172]\n[NIF&PS Management][173]\nProfiles of the men and women who support the directorate\u2019s key missions\n[workforce]\n][174]\n[Developing the Workforce][175]\nWorking at NIF & Photon Science trains future generations of science stars\n[women of NIF]\n][176]\n[Women of NIF\u20142020][177]\nProfiles of women who help ensure national security and scientific leadership\n[[LLNL]][178]\nLawrence Livermore National Laboratory\n| 7000 East Avenue \u2022 Livermore, CA 94550 | LLNL-WEB-642493\nOperated by the Lawrence Livermore National Security, LLC for the Department of Energy's National\nNuclear Security Administration Learn about the Department of Energy's [Vulnerability Disclosure\nProgram][179]\n[[LLNS]][180] [[U.S. DOE]][181] [[NNSA]][182]\n[Home][183] [Disclaimer][184] [Privacy Notice][185]\n* [About][186]\n* [What Is NIF?][187]\n* [The Seven Wonders of NIF][188]\n* [Laser Glass][189]\n* [Optical Switch][190]\n* [Preamplifier Modules][191]\n* [Deformable Mirror][192]\n* [Rapid-Growth Crystals][193]\n* [Computer Control System][194]\n* [Target Fabrication][195]\n* [How NIF Works][196]\n* [Anatomy of a NIF Shot][197]\n* [Power Conditioning System][198]\n* [Injection Laser System][199]\n* [Amplifiers][200]\n* [Beam Transport][201]\n* [Final Optics][202]\n* [Target Chamber][203]\n* [Keys to Our Success][204]\n* [Facility Operations][205]\n* [Power and Energy][206]\n* [Control Systems][207]\n* [Optics][208]\n* [Targets][209]\n* [Diagnostics][210]\n* [Efficiency Improvements][211]\n* [A Legacy of Lasers][212]\n* [Key Steps on the Path to NIF][213]\n* [50 Years of Laser Leadership][214]\n* [Building NIF][215]\n* [Who Works for NIF][216]\n* [People Profiles][217]\n* [Management][218]\n* [Developing the Workforce][219]\n* [Who Partners With NIF][220]\n* [Enduring Partnerships][221]\n* [Technology Tr