ut][125]\n* [What Is NIF?][126]\n* [The Seven Wonders of NIF][127]\n* [How NIF Works][128]\n* [Keys to Our Success][129]\n* [Who Works for NIF][130]\n* [People Profiles][131]\n* [Management][132]\n* [Developing the Workforce][133]\n* [Who Partners With NIF][134]\n* [Careers][135]\n* [FAQs][136]\n* [Visit Us][137]\n* [Science][138]\n* [NIF Users][139]\n* [Multimedia][140]\n* [Education][141]\n* [News][142]\n* [Programs][143]\n* [Contact][144]\n\n##### LLNL Menu\n* [Missions][145]\n* [Research][146]\n* [Doing Business][147]\n* [News][148]\n* [About][149]\n* [Careers][150]\n* [Community][151]\n\n## Secondary Menu\n\n[About][152]\n* [What Is NIF?][153]\n* [The Seven Wonders of NIF][154]\n* [How NIF Works][155]\n* [Keys to Our Success][156]\n* [Who Works for NIF][157]\n* [People Profiles][158]\n* [Management][159]\n* [Developing the Workforce][160]\n* [Who Partners With NIF][161]\n* [Careers][162]\n* [FAQs][163]\n* [Visit Us][164]\nManagement\n* [Benita Bass][165]\n* [Gordon Brunton][166]\n* [Jeff Bude][167]\n* [Lydia Camara][168]\n* [Jean-Michel Di Nicola][169]\n* [Dayne Fratanduono][170]\n* [Jeff Horner][171]\n* [Dan Kalantar][172]\n* [Krista Ladner][173]\n* [Zhi Liao][174]\n* [Thomas Lynch][175]\n* [Tammy Ma][176]\n* [Andrew MacKinnon][177]\n* [Christopher Marshall][178]\n* [Dan Mason][179]\n* [Jim McCarrick][180]\n* [Abbas Nikroo][181]\n* [Staci Riggs][182]\n* [Tom Spinka][183]\n* [Michael Stadermann ][184]\n* [Tayyab Suratwala][185]\n* [Vincent Tang][186]\n* [Bruno Van Wonterghem][187]\n\n1. [Home][188]\n2. [About][189]\n3. [Who Works for NIF & PS?][190]\n4. Management\n\n# Management\n\nThe management team for the NIF & Photon Science Principal Directorate supports the directorate\u2019s\nkey mission areas: Stockpile Stewardship, national security applications, NIF Discovery Science,\nlaser-based directed energy and related laser and optical technologies, and advanced photon\ntechnologies.\n* [**Directorate**][191]\n* [**Programs**][192]\n\n[Vincent Tang]\n[**Vincent Tang**][193]\n\nNIF&PS Principal Associate Director\n\n[Jeff Bude]\n[**Jeff Bude**][194]\n\nPrincipal Deputy Principal Associate Director\n\n[Lydia Camara]\n[**Lydia Camara**][195]\n\nDeputy Principal Associate Director for Operations\n\n[Zhi Liao portrait photo]\n[**Zhi Liao**][196]\n\nPrincipal Associate Directorate Workforce Manager\n\n[Jeff Horner portrait photo]\n[**Jeff Horner**][197]\n\nPrincipal Associate Directorate Chief Engineer\n\n[Thomas Lynch]\n[**Thomas Lynch**][198]\n\nPrincipal Associate Directorate Communications Director\n\n[Staci Riggs]\n[**Staci Riggs**][199]\n\nPrincipal Associate Directorate Business Manager\n\n[Benita Bass portrait photo]\n[**Benita Bass**][200]\n\nPrincipal Associate Directorate Resource Manager\n\n[Krista Ladner portrait photo]\n[**Krista Ladner**][201]\n\nPrincipal Associate Directorate Administrator\n\n### NIF\n\n[Gordon Brunton]\n[**Gordon Brunton**][202]\n\nNIF Director\n\n[Bruno Van Wonterghem]\n[**Bruno Van Wonterghem**][203]\n\nNIF Operations Manager\n\n[Michael Stadermann]\n[**Michael Stadermann**][204]\n\nProgram Manager, Target Fabrication\n\n[Jeff Bude]\n[**Jeff Bude**][205]\n\nCo-Program Director, Laser S&T and Systems Engineering\n\n[Dan Kalantar]\n**[Dan Kalantar][206]**\n\nChief Systems Engineer for Experimental Systems\n\n[Abbas Nikroo]\n[**Abbas Nikroo**][207]\n\nNIF Deputy Director for Physics Integration\n\n[Tayyab Suratwala]\n[**Tayyab Suratwala**][208]\n\nProgram Director, Optics and Materials Science & Technology\n\n[Jean-Michel Di Nicola]\n[**Jean-Michel Di Nicola**][209]\n\nChief Systems Engineer for Laser Systems\nCo-Program Director, Laser Science and Systems Engineering\n\n[Andrew MacKinnon]\n[**Andrew MacKinnon**][210]\n\nNational Diagnostics Program Leader\n\n[Dayne Fratanduono]\n[**Dayne Fratanduono **][211]\n\nDeputy Director for Capabilities\n\n### DE Technology Programs\n\n[Christopher Marshall]\n[**Christopher Marshall**][212]\n\nProgram Director for Directed Energy Technology Programs\n