ime, and protecting your investment.][27]\n\nCompany\n[ About Us ][28] Open\n* [ Leadership ][29]\n* [ Environmental ][30]\n* [ Social ][31]\n* [ Governance ][32]\n[ Newsroom ][33] Open\n* [ Blog ][34]\n* [ Press Releases ][35]\n* [ Success Stories ][36]\n* [ Glossary ][37]\n[ Investor Relations ][38] Open\n* [ Financial Releases ][39]\n* [ Financial Webcasts ][40]\n* [ Investor Presentations ][41]\n* [ Annual Filings ][42]\n* [ SEC Filings ][43]\n* [ ESG ][44]\n[ Company ][45] Open\n* [ Careers ][46]\n* [ Coherent Labs ][47]\n* [ Locations ][48]\n* [ Events ][49]\n* [ Legal ][50]\n* [ ISO Certificates ][51]\n* [ Contact Us ][52]\n\n# DRIVING EVEN FASTER DATACOM\n\nSee why the rapid growth in AI/ML is driving a demand for faster datacom enabled by innovative\nCoherent solutions.\n\n[ Read the Blog ][53]\n\n# 1.6T-DR8 TRANSCEIVER\n\nSilicon photonics-based 1.6T-DR8 transceiver module using a Marvell\u00ae Ara 3 nm optical digital signal\nprocessor (DSP), featuring 200 Gbps electrical and optical interfaces.\n\n[ Learn More ][54]\n\n# OPTICAL CIRCUIT SWITCH\n\nThe OCS optimizes data center networks by minimizing electrical switches and\noptical-electrical-optical (OEO) conversions, resulting in significant cost savings, reduced power\nconsumption, and improved latency for GPU connections.\n\n[ Learn More ][55]\n\n# PRECISION MANUFACTURING\n\nWeld metals and heat thermoplastic composites with efficiency, high throughput, and reduced costs.\n\n[ Learn More ][56]\n\n# SEMI CAP EQUIPMENT\n\nBuild equipment that maximizes throughput and yield using cutting-edge optics, lasers, and composite\nmaterials.\n\n[ Learn More ][57]\n\n# DISPLAY MANUFACTURING\n\nDeliver laser solutions that drive innovations in display manufacturing and performance, especially\nfor mobile devices.\n\n[ Learn More ][58]\n\n# NVIDIA and Coherent\n\nAnnounce Strategic Partnership to Develop Optics Technology to Scale Next-Generation Data Center\nArchitecture\n\n[ Learn More ][59]\n\n# Building the Infrastructure for the AI Era\n\nAnnounced the modernization and expansion of our Sherman facility, supported by a proposed $50\nmillion CHIPS Act award.\n\n[ Learn More ][60]\n\n## WE HARNESS PHOTONS TO DRIVE INNOVATION\n\nThe photon is the fundamental building block of our universe. See how we use it to generate,\nmodulate, amplify, direct, and detect for the datacenter, communications, and industrial markets.\n\n## Markets\n\n### Datacenter and Communications\n\n### Datacenter\n\nEnable ultra-high-speed data transmission and optimized power efficie"
