Investor Relations ][81]\n* [ Career ][82]\n  * [ back ][83]\n  * [ Career ][84]\n  * [ Starting work at Jenoptik ][85]\n  * [ Jenoptik as an employer ][86]\n  * [ Partners ][87]\n  * [ Job offers ][88]\n  * [ Events ][89]\n* Search\n  search [ Close ][90]\n\nFinancial statements for 2025\n\nDiscover facts and figures for the 2025 fiscal year in our annual report.\n\nNew CEO for Jenoptik\n\nDr. Dominic Dorfner was appointed to become the new CEO of JENOPTIK AG and\u00a0 assume the position no\nlater than October 1, 2026.\n* [\n  \n  ## Meet our experts and discover our photonic products and solutions!\n  \n  \n  \n  learn more\n  \n  ][91]\n* [\n  \n  ## High-tech fab in Dresden, Germany\n  \n  Manufacturing micro-optics for the semiconductor equipment industry\n  \n  discover more\n  \n  ][92]\n* [\n  \n  ## Speed enforcement for more safety\n  \n  When it comes to protecting communities, choosing the right partner is invaluable. Learn how to\n  enhance safety in work zones, school zones, and accident hotspots.\n  \n  more\n  \n  ][93]\nPrev Next\n\n# About Jenoptik\n\nWe are a global technology group operating in the photonics market. Our growth areas include\nsemiconductors, medical technology, metrology, and smart mobility. Almost 4,500 employees work\nworldwide in the Jenoptik Group, which is headquartered in Jena (Germany). JENOPTIK AG is listed on\nthe German Stock Exchange in Frankfurt.\n\n[ Read more ][94]\n\n## Locations worldwide\n\n[][95]\n\n[ Our locations ][96]\n\n## News\n\n[ [Brian Soller]\n11 June 2026\n\n### Brian Soller named President of JENOPTIK Optical Systems, LLC\n\nHe will be responsible for the efficient operation, strategic development and sustainable growth of\nJenoptik\u2019s U.S. optics and photonics business. read more\n\n][97] [ [Flags More Light]\n10 June 2026\n\n### Daniela Mattheus re-elected as Chair of the Supervisory Board of JENOPTIK AG\n\nAt its meeting on June 9, 2026, held following the Annual General Meeting, the Supervisory Board of\nJENOPTIK AG, Jena, unanimously re-elected Daniela Mattheus as Chair of the Supervisory Board. read\nmore\n\n][98] [ [Kein Alt Text hinterlegt.]\n09 June 2026\n\n### JENOPTIK AG\u2019s Annual General Meeting approves a higher dividend and the election/re-election of\n### three Supervisory Board members\n\nAround 300 Jenoptik shareholders, representing just under 60 percent of the share capital, attended\nthe shareholder meeting of JENOPTIK AG held on June 9, 2026, at the Volkshaus in Jena. All items on\nthe agenda were approved by a clear majority. read more\n\n][99] [ [Portrait of Dr. Dominic Dorfner]\n09 June 2026\n\n### New CEO of JENOPTIK AG Dr. Dominic Dorfner to start in early August 2026\n\nHe will introduce himself to shareholders and employees on June 9, 2026, as a guest at the JENOPTIK\nAG Annual General Meeting in Jena. read more\n\n][100]\n\n## Enabling the Amazing\n\n[Video]\n\n## Blog\n\n[\n\n**A true asset in PIC testing**\n\nHow to test electrical and optical functions on chips efficiently and simultaneously\n\n][101] [ [Car with lights]\n\n**The power of light in car design**\n\nLearn how our laser machines contribute to individual patterns and designs for more safety, brand\nvisualization and well-being in the automotive future.\n\n][102] [ [Mars Mission Rover]\n\n**Cutting edge lens assemblies for Mars mission**\n\nA journey into space requires unique demands. Discover what our engineers developed for the Mars\n2020 mission!\n\n][103] [ [fluorescence]\n\n**Competitive advantage in digital cell imaging**\n\nHere\u2019s how to successfully cater to the market of life science and in vitro diagnostics.\n\n][104]\n\n[To the Blog][105]\n\n## Enabling brighter futures with the power of light \u2013 and excellent career opportunities for you\n\nWe set ourselves the highest technological standards, working in dynamic teams and providing\nexcellent and innovative products.\n\nWhether it be for training, employment, job placement or for a dissertation: You\u2019ll find the right\njob with us.\n\n[ To the Job Offers ][106]\n\n[Career at Jenoptik]\n\n## 4,500\n\nemployees worldwide\n\n[ [Products and Solutions]\n\n**Products and Solutions**\n\n][107] [ [investors]\n\n**Investors**\n\n][108] [ [markets]\n\n**Markets**\n\n][109]\n[ ][110]\n* [ Legal Notice ][111]\n* [ GTC ][112]\n* [ Data protection information ][113]\n* [ Newsletter ][114]\n* [ Tracking preferences ][115]\n\n[ click here for the youtube channel ][116] [ click here for the youtube channel ][117] [ click here\nfor the LinkedIn channel ][118]\n\n## Color Scheme Options\n\nPlease choose your prefered color scheme option.\n\nAutomatic color change\nChoose color theme\n[ [Jenoptik Colorray Green-Yellow] ][119] [ [Jenoptik Colorray Nightblue-Skyblue] ][120] [ [Je"
