        "crawl_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n* EN\n* [IT][2]\n[ [Home] ][3]\n[ Prima industrie ][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Business][6]\n* [News][7]\n* [About us][8] [About us][9]\n  * [About us][10]\n    * [Our Values][11]\n    * [Our history][12]\n    * [Careers][13]\n* [Contacts][14]\n\n## LEADERS IN TECHNOLOGY\n\nALWAYS AT THE CUTTING EDGE OF TECHNOLOGY IN SHEET METAL MANUFACTURING MACHINERY\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Read it][15]\n01.\u00a0Prima Industrie\nPrevious Next\n\n## PRIMA\u00a0means\u00a0\n## PROGRESS IN\n## MANUFACTURING\n## AUTOMATION\n\nThe Group operates in sheet metal working technologies through the Prima Power brand.\nA global player providing solutions to businesses of all industries, **Prima Power** offers a\ncomplete range of machinery and integrated solutions, from laser processing to punching and bending,\nto flexible manufacturing systems.\n\u00a0\n\n[The company][16]\n\n[Prima_POWER.png]\n\n## 01.Prima Power\n\nPrima Power provides businesses of all sizes with targeted dynamic technologies that enhance\nprofitability in sheet metal working.\n\nWe create integrated automated solutions designed to meet our clients' challenges and open to their\nfuture growth.\n\nWe offer high-performance machines that deliver flexible and precise execution.\n\nOur product range is one of the widest in the industry, covering all stages of the sheet metal\nworking process: 2D and 3D laser machines, punching and combined punch/laser and punch/shear\nmachines, press brakes, panel benders, Flexible Manufacturing Systems, and automation.\n\n[Read more][17]\n\n~1700\n\nPeople\n\n~500\n\nMio \u20ac revenues\n\n6\n\nPlants and R&D centers\n\n15K+\n\nInstallations\u00a0\n\n[Prima]\n\n##### Menu del pi\u00e8 di pagina\n* [Business][18]\n* [News ][19]\n* [Terms and conditions][20]\n* [Privacy][21]\n* [Cookie policy ][22]\n* [Whistleblowing][23]\n* [Environmental Policy][24]\n\n\u00a9 PRIMA INDUSTRIE S.p.A., single-member company | Via Torino-Pianezza, 36 - 10093 COLLEGNO (TO)\nITALIA | Capitale Sociale \u20ac26.208.185 | VAT 03736080015 - C.C.I.A.A. Torino 582421 | Reg. Impr.\nTorino n. 03736080015\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /it/node/1\n[3]: /en\n[4]: /en\n[5]: /en\n[6]: /en/business\n[7]: /en/news-0\n[8]: /en/about-us\n[9]: /en/about-us\n[10]: /en/about-us\n[11]: /en/about-us/about-us/our-values\n[12]: /en/about-us/about-us/our-history\n[13]: /en/about-us/about-us/careers\n[14]: /en/contacts\n[15]: /en/business\n[16]: /en/business-units\n[17]: /en/business\n[18]: /en/business\n[19]: /en/news-0\n[20]: /en/terms-and-conditions\n[21]: /en/privacy\n[22]: /en/cookie-policy\n[23]: /en/whistleblowing-policy\n[24]: /en/environmental-policy [ Skip to main content ][1]\n* EN\n* [IT][2]\n[ [Home] ][3]\n[ Prima industrie ][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Business][6]\n* [News][7]\n* [About us][8] [About us][9]\n  * [About us][10]\n    * [Our Values][11]\n    * [Our history][12]\n    * [Careers][13]\n* [Contacts][14]\n\n## LEADERS IN TECHNOLOGY\n\nALWAYS AT THE CUTTING EDGE OF TECHNOLOGY IN SHEET METAL MANUFACTURING MACHINERY\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Read it][15]\n01.\u00a0Prima Industrie\nPrevious Next\n\n## PRIMA\u00a0means\u00a0\n## PROGRESS IN\n## MANUFACTURING\n## AUTOMATION\n\nThe Group operates in sheet metal working technologies through the Prima Power brand.\nA global player providing solutions to businesses of all industries, **Prima Power** offers a\ncomplete range of machinery and integrated solutions, from laser processing to punching and bending,\nto flexible manufacturing systems.\n\u00a0\n\n[The company][16]\n\n[Prima_POWER.png]\n\n## 01.Prima Power\n\nPrima Power provides businesses of all sizes with targeted dynamic technologies that enhance\nprofitability in sheet metal working.\n\nWe create integrated automated solutions designed to meet our clients' challenges and open to their\nfuture growth.\n\nWe offer high-performance machines that deliver flexible and precise execution.\n\nOur product range is one of the widest in the industry, covering all stages of the sheet metal\nworking process: 2D and 3D laser machines, punching and combined punch/laser and punch/shear\nmachines, press brakes, panel benders, Flexible Manufacturing Systems, and automation.\n\n[Read more][17]\n\n~1700\n\nPeople\n\n~500\n\nMio \u20ac revenues\n\n6\n\nPlants and R&D centers\n\n15K+\n\nInstallations\u00a0\n\n[Prima]\n\n##### Menu del pi\u00e8 di pagina\n* [Business][18]\n* [News ][19]\n* [Terms and conditions][20]\n* [Privacy][21]\n* [Cookie policy ][22]\n* [Whistleblowing][23]\n* [Environmental Policy][24]\n\n\u00a9 PRIMA INDUSTRIE S.p.A., single-member company | Via Torino-Pianezza, 36 - 10093 COLLEGNO (TO)\nITALIA | Capitale Sociale \u20ac26.208.185 | VAT 03736080015 - C.C.I.A.A. Torino 582421 | Reg. Impr.\nTorino n. 03736080015\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /it/node/1\n[3]: /en\n[4]: /en\n[5]: /en\n[6]: /en/business\n[7]: /en/news-0\n[8]: /en/about-us\n[9]: /en/about-us\n[10]: /en/about-us\n[11]: /en/about-us/about-us/our-values\n[12]: /en/about-us/about-us/our-history\n[13]: /en/about-us/about-us/careers\n[14]: /en/contacts\n[15]: /en/business\n[16]: /en/business-units\n[17]: /en/business\n[18]: /en/business\n[19]: /en/news-0\n[20]: /en/terms-and-conditions\n[21]: /en/privacy\n[22]: /en/cookie-policy\n[23]: /en/whistleblowing-policy\n[24]: /en/environmental-policy primaindustrie.com [ Skip to main content ][1]\n* EN\n* [IT][2]\n[ [Home] ][3]\n[ Prima industrie ][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Business][6]\n* [News][7]\n* [About us][8] [About us][9]\n  * [About us][10]\n    * [Our Values][11]\n    * [Our history][12]\n    * [Careers][13]\n* [Contacts][14]\n\n## LEADERS IN TECHNOLOGY\n\nALWAYS AT THE CUTTING EDGE OF TECHNOLOGY IN SHEET METAL MANUFACTURING MACHINERY\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Read it][15]\n01.\u00a0Prima Industrie\nPrevious Next\n\n## PRIMA\u00a0means\u00a0\n## PROGRESS IN\n## MANUFACTURING\n## AUTOMATION\n\nThe Group operates in sheet metal working technologies through the Prima Power brand.\nA global player providing solutions t