!\n\nNews\n\n## Rafael &\u00a0SpearUAV\u00a0Introduce IRON WASP C-UAS Capability at Eurosatory 2026\n\n17.06.2026\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL\u00a0At Eurosatory 2026\n\nRAFAEL to Showcase Layered Air Defense & Counter-UAS Capabilities at Eurosatory 2026\n\n15.06.2026\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL ADVANCED DEFENSE SYSTEMS TO EXHIBIT AT ILA BERLIN 2026\n\n09.06.2026\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL AT ILA BERLIN 2026\n\nBuilding A Resilient Partnership Together\n\n02.06.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL at Eurosatory 2026\n\nSEE THE FUTURE OF DEFENSE IN ACTION\n\n01.06.26\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL REPORTS ANOTHER RECORD YEAR\n\nRafael Announces its financial results for 2025\n\n29.03.2026\n\nPodcast\n\n## Layered protection: How air defence is adapting to rising drone and missile threats\n\n20.04.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RECCELITE\u00ae Wide Area Aerial Scanning System-of-Systems for Real-Time ISR\n\nExposing the Needles in Your Haystack\n\n22.03.26\n\nBlog\n\n## Ensure Your Airborne Superiority\u00a0with LITENING\n\nA Powerful Force Multiplier for Today\u2019s Most Complex Operational Arenas\n\n16.03.26\n\nPodcast\n\n## Beyond Survivability: How Active Protection Systems Are Empowering Commanders\n\nAs threats diversify and intensify, APS are proving essential not just for vehicle protection but\nalso for enhancing operational freedom, effectiveness and mission success in contested environments.\n\n09.12.25\n\nBlog\n\n## Bending Light Back into Shape: Adaptive Optics for High-Energy Lasers\n\n28.02.26\n\nNews\n\n## DAVID'S SLING Air Defense System Successfully Completes Complex Test Series as Part of Future\n## Threat Readiness Upgrade\n\n11.02.2026\n\nPodcast\n\n## Energy evolution: How laser defense systems are powering the next phase of air defense\n\nLaser-based air defense is moving from promise to deployment as global threats evolve.\n\n12.06.25\n\nNews\n\n## Kratos & RAFAEL USA Establish \u201cPrometheus, Propulsion & Explosive Systems\u201d\n\n19.02.2026\n\nBlog\n\n## Lighting the Future of Defense: The Practical Path to High-Power Lasers\n\n23.02.26\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL to Showcase a Broad Array of Capabilities at Singapore Air Show 2026\n\nBlog\n\n## From Archimedes\u2019 Mirrors to Modern Directed Energy Defense\n\n27.01.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL at the Singapore Airshow 2026\n\nSMART AND TO THE POINT\n\n19.01.26\n\nNews\n\n## TROPHY APS has been selected by Four NATO countries for their Leopard 2 A8 Fleets\n\n19.01.2026\n\nNews\n\n## Rafael Delivers 1st Operational High-Power Laser System - Iron Beam to the IDF\n\n28.12.2025\n\nBlog\n\n## Season\u2019s Greetings and Happy New Year 2026\n\n18.12.25\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL Marks Roll-Out of First Leopard 2 A8 Tanks Equipped with TROPHY Active Protection System\n\n26.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## R2S Opens New Manufacturing Facility in East Camden, Arkansas\n\n23.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## Israel MOD Signs Multi-Billion Dollar Contract with Rafael to Expand Serial Production of Iron\n## Dome System\n\n21.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL INTRODUCES L-SPIKE 1x \u2013 A Tactical Loitering Munition\n\n19.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## Rafael to Unveil L-SPIKE 4X Launched Effect at AUSA 2025\n\n09.10.2025\n\nNews\n\n## Breakthrough Tactical Communications Technology, Localiztion and Sovereign European Production:\n## BNET Users\u2019 Club Debuts in Germany\n\n21.09.2025\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL & Israel MOD: IRON BEAM 450 Development Completed [Skip to main content][1]\n[ Rafael ][2]\n* Domains\n  Domains\n  * [Air & Missile Defense][3]\n  * [Air & Space][4]\n  * [Land Warfare][5]\n  * [Naval Warfare][6]\n  * [Intelligence & Cyber][7]\n  * [Multi-Domain][8]\n* [Systems & Solutions][9]\n* [Technologies][10]\n* [Global Footprint][11]\n* [Our Story][12]\n* [Newsroom][13]\n* [Global Suppliers][14]\n* [ Contact Us ][15]\nAI Chat\n\n## Close hamburger menu\n* Domains\n  * [Air & Missile Defense][16]\n  * [Air & Space][17]\n  * [Land Warfare][18]\n  * [Naval Warfare][19]\n  * [Intelligence & Cyber][20]\n  * [Multi-Domain][21]\n* [Systems & Solutions][22]\n* [Techno