026\n\nPodcast\n\n## Layered protection: How air defence is adapting to rising drone and missile threats\n\n20.04.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RECCELITE\u00ae Wide Area Aerial Scanning System-of-Systems for Real-Time ISR\n\nExposing the Needles in Your Haystack\n\n22.03.26\n\nBlog\n\n## Ensure Your Airborne Superiority\u00a0with LITENING\n\nA Powerful Force Multiplier for Today\u2019s Most Complex Operational Arenas\n\n16.03.26\n\nPodcast\n\n## Beyond Survivability: How Active Protection Systems Are Empowering Commanders\n\nAs threats diversify and intensify, APS are proving essential not just for vehicle protection but\nalso for enhancing operational freedom, effectiveness and mission success in contested environments.\n\n09.12.25\n\nBlog\n\n## Bending Light Back into Shape: Adaptive Optics for High-Energy Lasers\n\n28.02.26\n\nNews\n\n## DAVID'S SLING Air Defense System Successfully Completes Complex Test Series as Part of Future\n## Threat Readiness Upgrade\n\n11.02.2026\n\nPodcast\n\n## Energy evolution: How laser defense systems are powering the next phase of air defense\n\nLaser-based air defense is moving from promise to deployment as global threats evolve.\n\n12.06.25\n\nNews\n\n## Kratos & RAFAEL USA Establish \u201cPrometheus, Propulsion & Explosive Systems\u201d\n\n19.02.2026\n\nBlog\n\n## Lighting the Future of Defense: The Practical Path to High-Power Lasers\n\n23.02.26\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL to Showcase a Broad Array of Capabilities at Singapore Air Show 2026\n\nBlog\n\n## From Archimedes\u2019 Mirrors to Modern Directed Energy Defense\n\n27.01.26\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL at the Singapore Airshow 2026\n\nSMART AND TO THE POINT\n\n19.01.26\n\nNews\n\n## TROPHY APS has been selected by Four NATO countries for their Leopard 2 A8 Fleets\n\n19.01.2026\n\nNews\n\n## Rafael Delivers 1st Operational High-Power Laser System - Iron Beam to the IDF\n\n28.12.2025\n\nBlog\n\n## Season\u2019s Greetings and Happy New Year 2026\n\n18.12.25\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL Marks Roll-Out of First Leopard 2 A8 Tanks Equipped with TROPHY Active Protection System\n\n26.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## R2S Opens New Manufacturing Facility in East Camden, Arkansas\n\n23.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## Israel MOD Signs Multi-Billion Dollar Contract with Rafael to Expand Serial Production of Iron\n## Dome System\n\n21.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL INTRODUCES L-SPIKE 1x \u2013 A Tactical Loitering Munition\n\n19.11.2025\n\nNews\n\n## Rafael to Unveil L-SPIKE 4X Launched Effect at AUSA 2025\n\n09.10.2025\n\nNews\n\n## Breakthrough Tactical Communications Technology, Localiztion and Sovereign European Production:\n## BNET Users\u2019 Club Debuts in Germany\n\n21.09.2025\n\nNews\n\n## RAFAEL & Israel MOD: IRON BEAM 450 Development Completed, Delivery to IDF Soon\n\n17.09.2025\n\nBlog\n\n## RAFAEL at Indo Pacific 2025\n\nCapability Now: Precision, Lethality and Strategic Partnership\n\n02.11.25\n\nEvent\n\n## SEOUL ADEX\n* 17.10 - 21.11.2025\n* Seoul, Korea\n\nBlog\n\n## Layered defence: how new technologies are enhancing armoured vehicle survivability and\n## manoeuvrability\n\nCreated by SHEPHARD STUDIO for RAFAEL\n\n30.10.24\n\n## Systems & Solutions\n\nCombat-proven, open architecture-based, and interoperable\n\n[ Discover All ][40]\nSystem\n\n### IRON BEAM\u2122\n\nHigh Energy Laser Weapon System\n\nSystem\n\n### TROPHY\u00ae APS\n\nThe World\u2019s Only Operational Active Protection System\n\nSystem\n\n### IRON DOME\u00ae Family\n\nShort-to-Medium Range Multi-Mission Air Defense Systems\n\nSystem\n\n### SPIKE\u00ae NLOS\n\n6th Gen Non-Line-of-Sight Stand-Off Game Changer (Up to 50 km)\n\nSystem\n\n### ICE BREAKER\u2122\n\nAdvanced, Long-Range Cruise Missile\n\n## Global Footprint\n\n## Global Footprint\n\nRAFAEL is committed to the expansion of its global Industrial Cooperation programs which foster\nstrong, long-term partnerships, technology transfer, manufacturing localization, and highly valued\ncustomer independence.\n\nOur customers, including 20 NATO countries, are supported by 30 subsidiaries and numerous joint\nventures and teaming agreements around the world.\n\n[ Partner with Us ][41] [ RAFAEL Group ][42]\n\n### Israel\n\n### Usa\n\n### Brazil\n\n### Australia\n\n### UK\n\n### Germany\n\n### UAE\n\n### India\n\n### Far East\n\n### Thiland\n\n## Contact Us\n\nFull Name\nOrganization\nEmail\nPhone Number\nYour Message\nI\u2019d like to receive personalized emails about RAFAEL\u2019s products and services.\nSend\n\n## We appreciate you reaching out\n\nWe have received your message and will respond shortly. In the meantime, tune into RAFAEL's latest\nreleases, news, and updates here\n\n[ News ][43]\n\n## Subscribe to Our Newsletter\n\nStay up to date with RAFAEL's latest news, highlights and events\n\nEmail\n\n## Thank you for signing up :)\n\nFor now, get a first look at RAFAEL's latest news, highlights and events\n\n[ Blog ][44]\n[ Rafael ][45]\n* "
