        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n  * [Client Success Stories][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Laser Cutting Machines][6]\n  * [Automation][7]\n  * [Software][8]\n  * [Components][9]\n  * [Options][10]\n* [Technology][11]\n* [Press Room][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n  * [Client Success Stories][15]\n* [Products][16]\n  * [Laser Cutting Machines][17]\n  * [Automation][18]\n  * [Software][19]\n  * [Components][20]\n  * [Options][21]\n* [Technology][22]\n* [Press Room][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n\n### [ Products ][25]\n\nOur products take you to a new level by enhancing cutting speed, quality, and process efficiency.\n\n### [ Technology ][26]\n\nA powerful machine can produce more in less time, with less energy consumption.\n\n### [ Press Room ][27]\n\nAt Eagle, something note-worthy is always happening, and we want to keep you in the know.\n\n## Eagle is rewriting success in the metal industry for clients worldwide\n\nClients are at the heart of our mission, fueling our drive for innovation with their success. Eagle\ncustomers have harnessed the power of fiber laser technology to transform their operations and set\nnew standards for productivity. Their achievements are a testament to our dedication and shared\nvision for growth.\n[ Watch our Client Success Stories ][28]\n\n## Don\u2019t Take It From Us,\n## Hear It From Our Clients\n\nDiscover how Eagle is redefining success for manufacturers in the U.S.\n\n[ [eagle-lasers-client-3] ][29]\n[ [eagle-lasers-client-2] ][30]\n[ [eagle-lasers-client-1] ][31]\n\n## About Eagle Lasers\n\nEagle Lasers is a high-tech R&D company specializing in advanced fiber laser systems and automation\nsolutions for sheet metal processing. Our machines are built to empower manufacturers across the\nglobe through peak-level precision, speed, and reliability with minimal maintenance requirements.\nWith innovation at the core of our DNA, world-class engineering made in Europe and a solid service\nnetwork in the United States, we\u2019re here to fuel your productivity.\n[ About Us ][32]\n\n## A Solution For Every Production Need\n\nEagle Fiber Laser Cutting Systems operate at a superior level of precision and performance. Designed\nto meet the demands of today\u2019s fast-paced manufacturing environment, our advanced fiber laser\ntechnology delivers unparalleled cutting speed, accuracy, and efficiency for both thick and thin\nmaterials. All our machine series ensure superior edge quality, reduced maintenance and operational\ncosts, and increased productivity.\n\n## iNspire 2.0\n\nThe iNspire are state-of-the-art fiber laser cutting machines with powers ranging from 4kW to 40kW,\nacceleration of up to 6G and cutting speeds up to 150 m/min. Their unique construction with linear\nmotors on all axes, the eVa cutting head and carbon fiber traverse, achieve unparalleled\nperformance, making them the fastest laser cutters on the market.\n\n## FlowIN\n\nFlowIN is a breakthrough fiber laser system that sorts at the same speed it cuts, freeing the part\nfrom the skeleton and managing waste without compromising efficiency. It features Eagle distinctive\ncomponents such as the eVa cutting head and linear motors, and boasts powers up to 40kW,\nacceleration up to 6G and 400m/min positioning speed. FlowIN has no limitations regarding sheet\nlength and is coil-cutting ready.\n\n## FlowinCO\n\nFlowINCO offers the same functionalities and cutting parameters as FlowIN, but is specifically\nengineered for coil-fed sheet metal. By enabling continuous cutting with a steady material feed,\nFlowINCO eliminates the downtime resulting in uninterrupted production, scrap-free parts and reduced\nmaterial waste.\n\n## eSmart\n\nThe eSmart series is designed for trouble-free, reliable production, delivering great results in\nlittle floor space. These sturdy yet compact machines, offer a power range up to 10kW, acceleration\nup to 2G and cutting speed up to 100 m/min. They\u2019re the most cost-effective Eagle fiber laser\ncutting machines, providing you with efficiency and value.\n\n## eVision\n\nThe eVision series is designed for for all-round versatile efficiency, providing optimum results\n24/7 whether you run small or large batches, thick or thin sheets. Offering powers from up to 30kW,\nacceleration up to 3G, and cutting speeds up to 150 m/min, their great performance and flexibility\nmakes them the ideal choice for those upgrading from older cutting technologies and looking to to\ntake their production to the next level.\n\n## Boost Efficiency with Sheet Metal Automation Solutions\n\nLaser cutting automation systems reduce downtime, increase throughput, and optimize your machine\u2019s\nperformance while providing a safer environment for operators. Eagle Automation delivers intelligent\nsolutions that adapt to your production needs\u2014whether you\u2019re scaling up, cutting costs, aiming for\n24/7 productivity or all three.\n\n[ Learn More ][33]\nLaser Machines\n\nFor the fastest and most accurate metal cutting\n\n[ Learn More ][34]\nAutomation\n\nFor 24/7 uninterrupted manufacturing\n\n[ Learn More ][35]\nOptions\n\nNot all companies have th [Skip to content][1]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n  * [Client Success Stories][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Laser Cutting Machines][6]\n  * [Automation][7]\n  * [Software][8]\n  * [Components][9]\n  * [Options][10]\n* [Technology][11]\n* [Press Room][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n  * [Client Success Stories][15]\n* [Products][16]\n  * [Laser Cutting Machines][17]\n  * [Automation][18]\n  * [Software][19]\n  * [Components][20]\n  * [Options][21]\n* [Technology][22]\n* [Press Room][23]\n* [Contact][24]\n\n### [ Products ][25]\n\nOur products take you to a new level by enhancing cutting speed, quality, and process efficiency.\n\n### [ Technology ][26]\n\nA powerful machine can produce more in less time, with less energy consumption.\n\n### [ Press Room ][27]\n\nAt Eagle, something note-worthy is always happening, and we want to keep you in the know.\n\n## Eagle is rewriting success in the metal industry for clients worldwide\n\nClients are at the heart of our mission, fueling our drive for innovation with their success. Eagle\ncustomers have harnessed the power of fiber laser technology to transform their operations and set\nnew standards for productivity. Their achievements are a testament to our dedication and shared\nvision for growth.\n[ Watch our Client Success Stories ][28]\n\n## Don\u2019t Take It From Us,\n## Hear It From Our Clients\n\nDiscover how Eagle is redefining success for manufacturers in the U.S.\n\n[ [eagle-lasers-client-3] ][29]\n[ [eagle-lasers-client-2] ][30]\n[ [eagle-lasers-client-1] ][31]\n\n## About Eagle Lasers\n\nEagle Lasers is a high-tech R&D company specializing in advanced fiber laser systems and automation\nsolutions for sheet metal processing. Our machines are built to empower manufacturers across the\nglobe through peak-level precision, speed, and reliability with minimal maintenance requirements.\nWith innovation at the core of our DNA, world-class engineering made in Europe and a solid service\nnetwork in the United States, we\u2019re here to fuel your productivity.\n[ About Us ][32]\n\n## A Solution For Every Production Need\n\nEagle Fiber Laser Cutting Systems operate at a superior level of precision and performance. Designed\nto meet the demands of today\u2019s fast-paced manufacturing environment, our advanced fiber laser\ntechnology delivers unparalleled cutting speed, accuracy, and efficiency for both thick and thin\nmaterials. All our machine series ensure superior edge quality, reduced maintenance and operational\ncosts, and increased productivity.\n\n## iNspire 2.0\n\nThe iNspire are state-of-the-art fiber laser cutting machines with powers ranging from 4kW to 40kW,\nacceleration of up to 6G and cutting speeds up to 150 m/min. Their unique construction with linear\nmotors on all axes, the eVa cutting head and carbon fiber traverse, achieve unparalleled\nperformance, making them the fastest laser cutters on the market.\n\n## FlowIN\n\nFlowIN is a breakthrough fiber laser system that sorts at the same speed it cuts, freeing the part\nfrom the skeleton and managing waste without compromising efficiency. It features Eagle distinctive\ncomponents such as the eVa cutting head and linear motors, and boasts powers up to 40kW,\nacceleration up to 6G and 400m/min positioning speed. FlowIN has no limitations regarding sheet\nlength and is coil-cutting ready.\n\n## FlowinCO\n\nFlowINCO offers the same functionalities and cutting parameters as FlowIN, but is specifically\nengineered for coil-fed sheet metal. By enabling continuous cutting with a steady material feed,\nFlowINCO eliminates the downtime resulting in uninterrupted production, scrap-free parts and reduced\nmaterial waste.\n\n## eSmart\n\nThe eSmart series is designed for trouble-free, reliable production, delivering great results in\nlittle floor space. These sturdy yet compact machines, offer a power range up to 10kW, acceleration\nup to 2G and cutting speed up to 100 m/min. They\u2019re the most cost-effective Eagle fiber laser\ncutting machines, providing you with efficiency and value.\n\n## eVision\n\nThe eVision series is designed for for all-round versatile efficiency, providing optimum results\n24/7 whether you run small or large batches, thick or thin sheets. Offering powers from up to 30kW,\nacceleration up to 3G, and cutting speeds up to 150 m/min, their great performance and flexibility\nmakes them the ideal choice for those upgrading from older cutting technologies and looking to to\ntake their production to the next level.\n\n## Boost Efficiency with Sheet Metal Automation Solutions\n\nLaser cutting automation systems reduce downtime, increase throughput, and optimize your machine\u2019s\nperformance while providing a safer environment for operators. Eagle Automation delivers intelligent\nsolutions that adapt to your production needs\u2014whether you\u2019re scaling up, cutting costs, aiming for\n24/7 productivity or all three.\n\n[ Learn More ][33]\nLaser Machines\n\nFor the fastest and most accurate metal cutting\n\n[ Learn More ][34]\nAutomation\n\nFor 24/7 uninterrupted manufacturing\n\n[ Learn More ][35]\nOptions\n\nNot all companies have the same manufacturing needs\n\n[ Learn More ][36]\nSoftware\n\nFor remote monitoring and enhanced efficiency\n\n[ Learn More ][37]\nComponents\n\nFor maximum quality and durability\n\n[ Learn More ][38]\nSupport\n\nFor technical and financial peace of mind\n\n[ Learn More ][39]\n\n## eVa cutting head for the highest fiber laser performance\n\nThe cutting head is the most important component of a laser cutting machine since it has to\nwithstand extreme conditions and be able to control ultra-high powers while maintaining top\nprecision. Our patented eVa cutting head was built after thorough research to deliver five times\nless contamination, with automatic beam centering and minimal service requirements, among other\nunique features. The eVa is a state-of-the-art piece of engineering capable of unmatched\nperformance.\n\n[ Discover our eVa cutting head ][40]\n\n## The New Eagle Americas Team and our Global CEO\n\nTalk directly with our Eagle Americas leadership team about products, local network expansion,\nservice, and support:\n\n**Chad Jackson \u2013 CEO, Eagle Americas**\n**Dan Cortez \u2013 Executive Vice President & COO**\n\nThey\u2019ll be glad to welcome you, answer your questions, and help you discover the right solution to\nmaximize productivity and profitability in your company.\n\n## subscibe to our newsletter\n\n#### For the latest sheet metal cutting and fiber laser technology.\n\n[ subscribe ][41]\n\n## News & Events\n\nStay up to date with the latest developments in the laser cutting industry, our company news, and\nupcoming events.\n[ More news ][42]\n[[Eagle Lasers]][43]\n\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/\n[3]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/about-eagle/\n[4]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/client-success-stories/\n[5]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/products/\n[6]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/laser-cutting-machines/\n[7]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/automation/\n[8]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/software/\n[9]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/components/\n[10]: https://eaglelasersusa.com/options/\n[11]: https:"
      }
