led light]][101]\n\n#### [Industrial Laser][102]\n\n[[iFalconHM mounted on a helmet]][103]\n\n#### [iFalcon Thermal Camera][104]\n\n#### [Laser Marking & Cleaning Kit][105]\n\n[[Femtoseconds laser]][106]\n\n#### [R&D Laser & Optics][107]\n\n[[Long Range Night Vision ARGC-750]][108]\n\n#### [Long Range Night Vision][109]\n\n#### [Laser Cutting & Welding Kit][110]\n\n### Exhibitions\n\nDiscover the exhibitions we have participated in.\u00a0\n\n\n[Read more][111]\n\n[[black chair lot]][112]\n\n### Events\n\nSee the events we have attended.\n\n\n[Read more][113]\n\n\nNews\n\nOur activity\n\n[Exhibitions we have participated in]\n\n### Exhibitions\n\nDiscover the exhibitions we have participated in.\u00a0\n\n\n[Read more][114]\n\n[Portable Marking Laser - 20W 30W\ufeff\ufeff]\n\n#### [New Portable Marking Laser -\u00a0 20W 30W][115]\n\nThis laser supports both marking and cleaning. It offers portability, precision, and versatility,\nenabling non-contact, high-speed, and durable marking on a wide range of materials.\n\n[[Femtosecond laser - High Power 40W \ufeff\ufeff]][116]\n\n#### [New Femtosecond laser - High Power 40W\u00a0][117]\n\nThe product adopts an integrated optical and electrical design. Pulse width less than 300 fs, single\npulse energy up to 400 \u03bcJ, and burst mode support.\n\nNews\n\nOur activity\n\n[orange chairs in white room]\n\n### Events\n\nSee the events we have attended.\n\n\n[Read more][118]\n\n[Nano Fiber Laser 20M - 100M\ufeff]\n\n#### [New Nano Fiber Laser\u00a0\n#### 20M - 100M][119]\n\nThis fiber laser adopts a Q-switch main oscillator and a high-power fiber amplifier structure. It's\na laser with high electro-optical conversion efficiency, good beam quality, and is maintenance-free.\n\n[Fiber Laser Welder A150]\n\n#### [New\u00a0Fiber Laser Welder A150][120]\n\nThis product can be used in fine cutting, metal welding, surface treatment, and 3D printing due to\nits high average power, anti-high reflection, high beam quality, and high efficiency.\n\n[Energy Laser - About us]\n\n### About us\u00a0\n\nEnergy Laser Srl develops, creates, and provides innovative products and offers value-added services\nto its clients.\u00a0\n\n\n[Learn more][121]\n\n[Careers - Energy Laser]\n\n### Careers\u00a0\n\nDiscover open job opportunities in our company and join our team!\n\n\n\n[Learn more][122]\n\n[Press Center - Energy Laser]\n\n### Press Center\u00a0\n\nStay up-to-date with new product announcements and our activity schedule.\n\n\n\n[Learn more][123]\n\n#### Corporate area\n\n\n\n## Keep in touch with us\n\nSubscribe to our newsletter to stay informed about innovations and technology.\n\nThanks for registering!\n\n[Subscribe][124]\n[Energy Laser - Contact us]\n\n## Get in touch with\u00a0us\n\nEnergy Laser Srl\nVia Noto, 10\n20141 Milan (Italy)\n\n\n\n+39 02 76392431\n[info@energylaser.com][125]\n\n\n[Open Contact Form][126]\n\n[Legal\n][127]\n\nATTENTION: PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU READ THESE TERMS CAREFULLY BEFORE USING THIS WEBSITE. USING THIS\nWEBSITE INDICATES THAT YOU ACCEPT THESE TERMS. IF YOU DO NOT ACCEPT THESE TERMS (\"TERMS\"), DO NOT\nUSE THIS WEBSITE.\n\n\n\nThe following rules and regulations apply to all users of this Web Site. By accessing this Web Site,\nyou acknowledge acceptance of these terms and conditions. Energy Laser reserves the right to change\nthese rules and regulations from time to time at its sole discretion. In the case of any violation\nof these rules and regulations, Energy Laser reserves the right to seek all remedies available by\nlaw and in equity for such violations. These rules and regulations apply to all visits to the Energy\nLaser Web Site, both now and in the future.\n\n\n\nThe materials on this Web site are Copyright \u00a9 2024 ENERGY LASER S.R.L. All rights reserved. You are\nauthorized to view, copy, print and distribute these materials subject to the following conditions:\n\n1. The materials may be used for internal informational purposes only.\n\n2. Any copy of these materials or any portion thereof must include the above copyright notice.\n\n3. ENERGY LASER may revoke or modify any of the foregoing rights at any time.\n\nPlease note that any product, process or technology described in these materials may be the subject\nof other intellectual property rights reserved by ENERGY LASER and not licensed hereunder.\n\n\n\nENERGY LASER S.R.L. and the ENERGY LASER S.R.L. logo are registered trademarks of ENERGY LASER\nS.R.L.\n\nThe trademarks, logos, and service marks (\"Marks\") displayed on this Web Site are the property of\nEnergy Laser or other third parties. Users are not permitted to use these Marks without the prior\nwritten consent of Energy Laser or such third party which may own the Mark. \"Energy Laser\" is a\nregistered trademark of Energy Laser Company.\n\n\n\nEnergy Laser S.r.l. reserves the right to make product changes from time to time without notice or\nobligation. We make reasonable ef"
