 worldwide. Excelitas is at the forefront of addressing many of the relevant megatrends\nimpacting the world today, including precision medicine, industrial automation, artificial\nintelligence, connected devices (IoT), and military modernization.\n\nWatch Now\nhttps://www.excelitas.com/#featured-story-44647\n\n## CEO Message\n\n## Meet Our CEO\n\nOur CEO shares his excitement for the tremendous opportunities that lie ahead for Excelit"
