        "crawl_text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n  [Lisa lasers]\n  \n  ### Laser Technologies\n  \n  Cutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n  \n  [View All][13]\n  \n  [Lidar Systems][14]\n  \n  We offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\n  and support expertise.\n  \n  [Optical Communication Systems][15]\n  \n  Fibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\n  scalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n  \n  ### Engineering Services\n  \n  End-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\n  services to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n  \n  [View All][17]\n  \n  **[Program Management][18]**\n  \n  Comprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n  \n  **[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n  \n  Cutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\n  technologies.\n  \n  **[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n  \n  Multidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\n  operations.\n  \n  **[Budgetary Support][21]**\n  \n  Reliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\n  requirements.\n  \n  **[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n  \n  Rigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n  \n  **[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n  \n  End-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n  \n  **[Facilities Management][24]**\n  \n  Secure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\n  logistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# Advancing the mission with laser technologies and engineering services\n\nOur R&D division develops custom, cutting-edge laser, lidar, and optical communications hardware\nsolutions to enable mission-critical space and airborne capabilities.\n\n[Laser Technologies][29]\n\nOur Engineering Services division provides expert technical staff to enhance scientific research,\ntesting, logistics, program management, and more for DoD and NASA.\n\n[Engineering Services][30]\n\nLaser TechnologIES\n\n## Engineered to enable tomorrow\u2019s missions\n\nWidely recognized as a leader in laser technologies, we utilize a customer- and mission-driven\ncollaborative design approach to develop cost-effective, high-performance hardware for high-stakes\nmissions.\n\n### Advanced Lasers\n\nHigh-power, high-energy lasers that enable first-of-kind mission capabilities spanning precision\ntargeting and tracking, long-distance ranging, and planetary sensing.\n\n### Lidar Systems\n\nPrecision lidar systems for terrestrial and planetary mapping, navigation, and low-size, weight, and\npower applications, powered by incorporating the latest laser technology, advanced electronics, and\nnovel sensing schemes and processing algorithms.\n\n### Optical Communication Terminals\n\nGround and space domain capabilities for long-range, high-bandwidth communications links are enabled\nby Fibertek\u2019s low-size, weight, and power laser communications terminals engineered for\nhigh-reliability beyond low Earth orbit missions.\n\n### Advanced Technologies and Components\n\nSolving tomorrow\u2019s challenges through the development of disruptive technologies in quantum\ncommunications, supercontinuum sources, photonic integrated circuits, laser power beaming, and\nadvanced electronics for active electro-optic sensing.\n\n[Find Out More][31]\n\nEngineering Services\n\n## Partners for expert engineering services\n\nA core part of Fibertek\u2019s business since 1996, the Engineering Services division provides Army and\nNASA customers with world-class researchers and engineers\n* Program Management\n* Scientific Research and Analysis\n* Budgetary Support\n* Logistics Management and Field Service\n* Test and Evaluation Support\n* Facilities and Warehouse Operations\n\n[Find Out More][32]\n\nWhy Fibertek\n\n## A world-class resource for mission-focused organizations\n\n[Learn More][33]\n\n### Unmatched expertise in laser technologies\n\nOur industry-leading number of successful NASA space missions set our foundation for the rapid\ndevelopment dual use laser systems in support of space exploration as well as national security\nmissions.\n\n### An agile, customer-driven, collaborative approach\n\nFibertek demonstrates integrity, streamlined decision making, and a can-do attitude to meet customer\nneeds swiftly and effectively.\n\n### Solutions for the most demanding missions\n\nWe\u2019re solutioning tomorrow\u2019s missions, from space and airborne missile defense to operation through\nthe extreme cold of lunar perm [Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Website Logo]\n\nGo To Homepage\n\n][2] [[Fibertek, Inc.]][3]\n[[Fibertek, Inc.]][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [Laser Technologies][6]\n* [Engineering Services][7]\n* [About Us][8]\n* [Case Studies][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Get Started][11]\n* [Laser Technologies][12]\n  [Lisa lasers]\n  \n  ### Laser Technologies\n  \n  Cutting-edge laser technology systems revolutionizing space & defense.\n  \n  [View All][13]\n  \n  [Lidar Systems][14]\n  \n  We offer both full lidar solutions and subsystem solutions, as well as mission planning, modeling,\n  and support expertise.\n  \n  [Optical Communication Systems][15]\n  \n  Fibertek\u2019s free-space optical (FSO) communications systems are engineered for resilience,\n  scalability, and deep-space readiness.\n* [Engineering Services][16]\n  \n  ### Engineering Services\n  \n  End-to-end engineering support across program management, R&D, logistics, testing, AI, and budget\n  services to drive mission success for defense and space customers.\n  \n  [View All][17]\n  \n  **[Program Management][18]**\n  \n  Comprehensive support for program execution across defense and space initiatives.\n  \n  **[Scientific Research and Analysis][19]**\n  \n  Cutting-edge research in sensors, energy, EW, and biotechnology to advance mission-critical\n  technologies.\n  \n  **[Artificial Intelligence][20]**\n  \n  Multidisciplinary expertise to integrate AI tools and prototypes into Army platforms and\n  operations.\n  \n  **[Budgetary Support][21]**\n  \n  Reliable fiscal planning, tracking, and execution support aligned with DoD and civilian agency\n  requirements.\n  \n  **[Test and Evaluation Support][22]**\n  \n  Rigorous testing and analysis to ensure system reliability, safety, and mission performance.\n  \n  **[Logistics Management and FSR Support][23]**\n  \n  End-to-end logistics and field service ensuring equipment readiness and operational continuity.\n  \n  **[Facilities Management][24]**\n  \n  Secure, certified support for facility operations, inventory control, and global shipping\n  logistics.\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Case Studies][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n* [Get Started][28]\n\n# Advancing the mission with laser technologies and engineering services\n\nOur R&D division develops custom, cutting-edge laser, lidar, and optical communications hardware\nsolutions to enable mission-critical space and airborne capabilities.\n\n[Laser Technologies][29]\n\nOur Engineering Services division provides expert technical staff to enhance scientific research,\ntesting, logistics, program management, and more for DoD and NASA.\n\n[Engineering Services][30]\n\nLaser TechnologIES\n\n## Engineered to enable tomorrow\u2019s missions\n\nWidely recognized as a leader in laser technologies, we utilize a customer- and mission-driven\ncollaborative design approach to develop cost-effective, high-performance hardware for high-stakes\nmissions.\n\n### Advanced Lasers\n\nHigh-power, high-energy lasers that enable first-of-kind mission capabilities spanning precision\ntargeting and tracking, long-distance ranging, and planetary sensing.\n\n### Lidar Systems\n\nPrecision lidar systems for terrestrial and planetary mapping, navigation, and low-size, weight, and\npower applications, powered by incorporating the latest laser technology, advanced electronics, and\nnovel sensing schemes and processing algorithms.\n\n### Optical Communication Terminals\n\nGround and space domain capabilities for long-range, high-bandwidth communications links are enabled\nby Fibertek\u2019s low-size, weight, and power laser communications terminals engineered for\nhigh-reliability beyond low Earth orbit missions.\n\n### Advanced Technologies and Components\n\nSolving tomorrow\u2019s challenges through the development of disruptive technologies in quantum\ncommunications, supercontinuum sources, photonic integrated circuits, laser power beaming, and\nadvanced electronics for active electro-optic sensing.\n\n[Find Out More][31]\n\nEngineering Services\n\n## Partners for expert engineering services\n\nA core part of Fibertek\u2019s business since 1996, the Engineering Services division provides Army and\nNASA customers with world-class researchers and engineers\n* Program Management\n* Scientific Research and Analysis\n* Budgetary Support\n* Logistics Management and Field Service\n* Test and Evaluation Support\n* Facilities and Warehouse Operations\n\n[Find Out More][32]\n\nWhy Fibertek\n\n## A world-class resource for mission-focused organizations\n\n[Learn More][33]\n\n### Unmatched expertise in laser technologies\n\nOur industry-leading number of successful NASA space missions set our foundation for the rapid\ndevelopment dual use laser systems in support of space exploration as well as national security\nmissions.\n\n### An agile, customer-driven, collaborative approach\n\nFibertek demonstrates integrity, streamlined decision making, and a can-do attitude to meet customer\nneeds swiftly and effectively.\n\n### Solutions for the most demanding missions\n\nWe\u2019re solutioning tomorrow\u2019s missions, from space and airborne missile defense to operation through\nthe extreme cold of lunar permanently shadowed regions and radiation on Mars.\n\n### Excellence in high-stakes environments\n\nWe\u2019re a trusted, reliable resource when and where it matters. Whether developing laser technology\nfor NASA Class A missions or deploying internationally for humanitarian demining, you can depend on\nFibertek.\n\nCareers\n\n## Work on challenging technical problems with a team of like-minded people\n\nAt Fibertek, you can make a difference by applying your talents to solve complex problems. As an\nindependent company, we offer exciting work in support of critical missions. We support you with\nuncapped professional growth opportunities, generous pay and benefits, and an attractive\nsmall-business culture that is distinctive among aerospace and defense contractors.\n\n[Open Positions][34]\n\n## See how Fibertek can advance your mission\n\n[Get Started][35]\n\n### Location\n\n[13605 Dulles Technology Dr.\nHerndon VA 20171][36]\n[(703) 471-7671][37]\n\n### Company\n* [Home][38]\n* [Laser Technologies][39]\n* [Engineering Services][40]\n* [About Us][41]\n\n### Contact Us\n* [Contact][42]\n\n\u00a9 2026\n* [Site Credits][43]\n* [Privacy Policy][44]\n* [Accessibility Policy][45]\n* [Sitemap][46]\n* [LinkedIn][47]\n\n[1]: #site-substance\n[2]: https://www.fibertek.com\n[3]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[4]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[5]: https://www.fibertek.com/\n[6]: https://www.fibertek.com/technologies/\n[7]: https://www.fibertek.com/services/\n[8]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[10]: https://www.fibertek.com/career-opportunities/\n[11]: https://www.fibertek.com/contact/\n[12]: #\n[13]: /technologies/\n[14]: /technologies/lidar/\n[15]: /technologies/optical-communication/\n[16]: #\n[17]: /services/\n[18]: /services/program-management/\n[19]: /services/research/\n[20]: /services/ai/\n[21]: /services/budgetary/\n[22]: /services/testing/\n[23]: /services/logistics-field-service/\n[24]: /services/facilities/\n[25]: https://www.fibertek.com/about/\n[26]: https://www.fibertek.com/case-studies/\n[27]: https:"
