# Core Fleet\n\nBuilding and delivering the global standard for naval power.\n\n[Unmanned Systems]\n\n### Unmanned Systems\n\nIntelligent autonomous platforms to extend operational reach.\n\n[All-Domain Mission Technologies]\n\n### All-Domain Mission Technologies\n\nIntegrated tech and systems to ensure tactical superiority across all warfighting domains.\n\n## Latest News\n\n[View Newsroom][45]\n[[HII Leads Successful DefenseTech LIVE Event, Advancing Speed, Integration, and Mission Driven\nInnovation]][46]\n\nJune 15, 2026\n\nNews\n\n[\n\nHII Leads Successful DefenseTech LIVE Event, Advancing Speed, Integration, and Mission Driven\nInnovation\n\n][47][Read More][48]\n[[HII\u2019s ROMULUS USV Advances to U.S. Navy Medium Unmanned Surface Vessel At-Sea Testing Phase]][49]\n\nJune 1, 2026\n\nNews\n\n[\n\nHII\u2019s ROMULUS USV Advances to U.S. Navy Medium Unmanned Surface Vessel At-Sea Testing Phase\n\n][50][Read More][51]\n[[Flight III Destroyer Ted Stevens (DDG 128) Sails Away from HII\u2019s Ingalls Shipbuilding]][52]\n\nMay 8, 2026\n\nNews\n\n[\n\nFlight III Destroyer Ted Stevens (DDG 128) Sails Away from HII\u2019s Ingalls Shipbuilding\n\n][53][Read More][54]\n\n## Capability, Delivered At Scale\n\nOne force, three execution teams delivering mission-critical capability.\n\n## Ingalls Shipbuilding\n\nThe largest manufacturing employer in Mississippi, HII's Ingalls Shipbuilding division has designed,\nbuilt and maintained amphibious ships, destroyers, and cutters for the U.S. Navy and the U.S. Coast\nGuard.\n\n[Learn More][55]\n[[Ingalls Shipbuilding]][56]\n\n## Newport News Shipbuilding\n\nFor more than 140 years, HII's Newport News Shipbuilding has built ships that have served the nation\nin peace and war, in times of adversity and in times of abundance.\n\n[Learn More][57]\n[[Newport News Shipbuilding]][58]\n\n## Mission Technologies\n\nHII's Mission Technologies division develops integrated products and solutions to enable today's\nconnected, all-domain force.\n\n[Learn More][59]\n[[Mission Technologies]][60]\n\n## Join HII and Build Something Big\n\nIn service of the nation, each other and you.\n\n[Explore Careers][61]\n\n## Discover HII as an Investor\n\nDriven by disciplined execution and long-horizon demand.\n\n[Learn More][62]\n\n$12.5B\n\nFY25 Revenue\n\n44K\n\nEmployees\n\n140+\n\nYear History\n\n800+\n\nShips Delivered\n\n70+\n\nActive Programs\n\n8,000+\n\nVeterans Employed\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /company-overview\n[4]: /history\n[5]: /culture-engagement\n[6]: /sustainability\n[7]: /leadership\n[8]: /ingalls-shipbuilding\n[9]: /mission-technologies\n[10]: /newport-news-shipbuilding\n[11]: /hii-australia\n[12]: /capabilities\n[13]: /products\n[14]: /suppliers\n[15]: /hii-australia/partner-registration\n[16]: /careers\n[17]: /careers/ingalls-shipbuilding\n[18]: /careers/mission-technologies\n[19]: /careers/newport-news-shipbuilding\n[20]: /careers/corporate\n[21]: /newsroom\n[22]: /events\n[23]: https://ir.hii.com/ir-home/default.aspx\n[24]: /contact\n[25]: /company-overview\n[26]: /history\n[27]: /culture-engagement\n[28]: /sustainability\n[29]: /leadership\n[30]: /ingalls-shipbuilding\n[31]: /newport-news-shipbuilding\n[32]: /mission-technologies\n[33]: /hii-australia\n[34]: /newsroom\n[35]: /events\n[36]: /capabilities\n[37]: /products [[HII Logo]][1]\n[HII Logo]\n* [Home][2]\n* About\n  * [Company Overview][3]\n  * [Our History][4]\n  * [Culture & Engagement][5]\n  * [Sustainability][6]\n  * [Leadership][7]\n* Our Business\n  * [Ingalls Shipbuilding][8]\n  * [Mission Technologies][9]\n  * [Newport News Shipbuilding][10]\n  * [HII Australia][11]\n* [Capabilities][12]\n* [Products][13]\n* Suppliers\n  * [Suppliers Overview][14]\n  * [Become A Partner HII Australia][15]\n* Careers\n  * [Careers Home][16]\n  * [Ingalls Shipbuilding Careers][17]\n  * [Mission Technologies Careers][18]\n  * [Newport News Shipbuilding Careers][19]\n  * [Corporate Careers][20]\n* News & Events\n  * [Newsroom][21]\n  * [Events Hub][22