        "crawl_text": "No Hallucination Guarantee now live\u2014[Learn more][1]\n[Skip to main content][2]\n[[Hudson Labs]][3]\n[Product][4]\n[Solutions][5]\n[Pricing][6]\n[Company][7]\n[Blog][8]\n[Sign In][9]\nStart Free Trial\n\n# AI that gets the\n\nnumbers right\n\nInstitutional AI for public markets research\n\nStart Free Trial[Explore platform][10]\nTrusted by\n$600B+AUM\nFortune100\nTop5Law Firms\n[Bloomberg]\n[Wall Street Journal]\n[Forbes]\n[CNBC]\n[Financial Times]\n[CFO Brew]\n[Institutional Investor]\n[Bloomberg]\n[Wall Street Journal]\n[Forbes]\n[CNBC]\n[Financial Times]\n[CFO Brew]\n[Institutional Investor]\n\nDeep AI Expertise\n\n### Anyone can say they're an expert. But only one of us wrote the textbook.\n\nHudson Labs is AI-native, not AI-adjacent. In 2021, we launched the world's first financial software\nfully powered by LLMs.\n\nOur CTO and co-founder Suhas Pai authored *Designing Large Language Model Applications*, published\nby O'Reilly Media in March, 2025 \u2014 translated into over 10 languages and used by AI engineers around\nthe world.\n\n[Suhas Pai, CTO and Co-Founder of Hudson Labs]\n\nSuhas Pai\n\nCTO & Co-Founder, Hudson Labs\n\n[Designing Large Language Model Applications - O'Reilly book by Suhas Pai]\n\nPlatform\n\n## Artificial Intelligence Built for Financial Precision\n\nProprietary AI systems, since 2019\n\n[\n[The Co-Analyst]\n\n10x\n\nFaster research\n\nIn-house AI\n\n### The Co-Analyst\n\nConverts unstructured data into actionable alpha. Consolidates insights from disparate sources with\nsourced answers and citations.\n\nExplore\n][11]\n[\n[Market Intelligence]\n\n10K+\n\nCompanies covered\n\nProprietary Retrieval\n\n### Market Intelligence\n\nCombine comprehensive fundamental metrics with high-precision AI for unique idea generation,\naccelerated discovery and custom sector primers.\n\nExplore\n][12]\n[\n[Forensic Risk]\n\n3x\n\nLawsuit Risk\n\nQuantified Risk\n\n### Forensic Risk\n\nSecurities class action prediction, risk monitoring and accounting fraud assessment\n\nExplore\n][13]\n\nBy the numbers\n\n## Scale that speaks\n## for itself\n\n$0B+\n\nClient AUM\n\n0+\n\nCompanies Covered\n\n0%\n\nFinancial Accuracy\n\n0M+\n\nSources\n\nTestimonials\n\n## Trusted by the\n## best in the industry\n\nI use Hudson Labs to take what was a two or three hour process down to a 20-minute process.\n\n[Brett Caughran]\n\nBrett Caughran\n\nFounder at Fundamental Edge\n\nIt\u2019s easy to see the efficiency gains. Hudson Labs handles high-precision financial tasks where\nerrors can be very costly.\n\n[Buyside AI Reviews]\n\nBuyside AI Reviews\n\nIndependent Reviewer at Buyside AI Reviews\n\nIt\u2019s the best I\u2019ve seen.\n\n[Tripp Blumm]\n\nTripp Blumm\n\nPartner at Princeton Value Partners\n\nI\u2019m blown away by what you\u2019ve built.\n\n[Ken Taylor]\n\nKen Taylor\n\nFounder at Telos Research\n\nI use Hudson Labs to take what was a two or three hour process down to a 20-minute process.\n\n[Brett Caughran]\n\nBrett Caughran\n\nFounder at Fundamental Edge\n\nIt\u2019s easy to see the efficiency gains. Hudson Labs handles high-precision financial tasks where\nerrors can be very costly.\n\n[Buyside AI Reviews]\n\nBuyside AI Reviews\n\nIndependent Reviewer at Buyside AI Reviews\n\nIt\u2019s the best I\u2019ve seen.\n\n[Tripp Blumm]\n\nTripp Blumm\n\nPartner at Princeton Value Partners\n\nI\u2019m blown away by what you\u2019ve built.\n\n[Ken Taylor]\n\nKen Taylor\n\nFounder at Telos Research\n\nThese tools are spot on. They quickly get me up to speed and make me sound very smart.\n\n[Will Henderson]\n\nWill Henderson\n\nAnalyst at Wolfpack Research\n\nThanks for building such an excellent tool for investors.\n\n[Adam Parmer]\n\nAdam Parmer\n\nManaging Partner at Enhancing Capital\n\nA significant process improvement for identifying securities fraud.\n\n[Tom Elrod]\n\nTom Elrod\n\nPartner at Kirby McInerney LLP\n\nThese tools are spot on. They quickly get me up to speed and make me sound very smart.\n\n[Will Henderson]\n\nWill Henderson\n\nAnalyst at Wolfpack Research\n\nThanks for building such an excellent tool for investors.\n\n[Adam Parmer]\n\nAdam Parmer\n\nManaging Partner at Enhancing Capital\n\nA significant process improvement for identifying securities fraud.\n\n[Tom Elrod]\n\nTom Elrod\n\nPartner at Kirby McInerney LLP\n\nGet started today\n\n## The only AI with a\n## no hallucination guarantee\n\nJoin hundreds of institutional investors who trust Hudson Labs for research and risk assessment.\n\nStart Free Trial\nJD\nKT\nAB\nML\nPrecisionScaleFrontier AIVelocityRigorAlphaPrecisionScaleFrontier AIVelocityRigorAlpha\n[[Hudson Labs]][14]\n\nInstitutional-grade intelligence for public markets. Find what matters.\n\nProduct\n* [The Co-Analyst][15]\n* [Market Intelligence][16]\n* [Forensic Risk Assessment][17]\n* [Agents][18]\n* [Coverage Universe][19]\n* [Pricing][20]\n\nSolutions\n* [Institutional Investing][21]\n* [Corporate Strategy][22]\n* [Securities Law][23]\n* [Brokerage & Banking][24]\n* [Public D&O Insurance][25]\n* [Investor Relations][26]\n\nCompany\n* [About][27]\n* [Technology][28]\n* [Research][29]\n* [In the Media][30]\n* [Blog][31]\n* [Careers][32]\n* [Security][33]\n\nLegal\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Hudson Labs. All rights reserved.\n\n[Terms of Service][36][Privacy Policy][37]\n\n[1]: /blog/no-ha No Hallucination Guarantee now live\u2014[Learn more][1]\n[Skip to main content][2]\n[[Hudson Labs]][3]\n[Product][4]\n[Solutions][5]\n[Pricing][6]\n[Company][7]\n[Blog][8]\n[Sign In][9]\nStart Free Trial\n\n# AI that gets the\n\nnumbers right\n\nInstitutional AI for public markets research\n\nStart Free Trial[Explore platform][10]\nTrusted by\n$600B+AUM\nFortune100\nTop5Law Firms\n[Bloomberg]\n[Wall Street Journal]\n[Forbes]\n[CNBC]\n[Financial Times]\n[CFO Brew]\n[Institutional Investor]\n[Bloomberg]\n[Wall Street Journal]\n[Forbes]\n[CNBC]\n[Financial Times]\n[CFO Brew]\n[Institutional Investor]\n\nDe