        "crawl_text": "[Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden Rossendorf][1]\nToggle navigation\n* [LinkedIn][2]\n* [Instagram][3]\n* [Bluesky][4]\n* [Mastodon][5]\n* [YouTube][6]\n* [Deutsch][7]\n* [Login/-out][8]\n* [LinkedIn][9]\n* [Instagram][10]\n* [Bluesky][11]\n* [Mastodon][12]\n* [YouTube][13]\n* [HZDR][14]\n  * [Startpage][15]\n  * [Mission Statement][16]\n  * [Facts & Data][17]\n  * [Organization][18]\n  * [How to Find the Main Campus][19]\n  * [Sponsors' Association of the Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf (HZDR) e. V.][20]\n  * [DeltaX Student Laboratory][21]\n  * [Visitor Service][22]\n  * [HZDR Awards][23]\n  * [Sustainability][24]\n  * [Procurement][25]\n  * [Code of Conduct][26]\n  * [Whistleblower System][27]\n* [Research][28]\n  * [Startpage][29]\n  * [Research Fields][30]\n  * [Research Infrastructures][31]\n  * [Research Sites][32]\n  * [Projects for the Future][33]\n  * [Artificial Intelligence][34]\n  * [Strategic Partnerships and Collaborations][35]\n  * [International collaboration and Research Funding][36]\n  * [Publication Database][37]\n* [Institutes][38]\n  * [Startpage][39]\n  * [Dresden High Magnetic Field Laboratory][40]\n  * [Fluid Dynamics][41]\n  * [Ion Beam Physics and Material\u00ads Research][42]\n  * [Radiation Physics][43]\n  * [Radiooncology - OncoRay][44]\n  * [Radio\u00adpharma\u00adceutical Cancer Research][45]\n  * [Resource Ecology][46]\n  * [Helmholtz Institute Freiberg for Resource Technology][47]\n  * [CASUS - Cen\u00adter for Advanced Systems Understanding][48]\n  * [Institute of Theoretical Physics][49]\n  * [Department of Research Technology][50]\n  * [Department of Information Services and Computing][51]\n* [Press & News][52]\n  * [Startpage][53]\n  * [Press Releases][54]\n  * [Contact to Communications][55]\n  * [Media Cen\u00adter][56]\n  * [Publications][57]\n  * [Workshops & Congresses][58]\n  * [Public Events][59]\n  * [Events Calendar][60]\n  * [Visitor Service][61]\n  * [In the Media][62]\n* [Career][63]\n  * [Startpage][64]\n  * [HZDR as Employer][65]\n  * [Jobs][66]\n  * [International Office][67]\n  * [Career Cen\u00adter for Doctoral Researchers and Postdocs][68]\n  * [Summer Student Program][69]\n  * [Students & Graduates][70]\n  * [Doctoral Researchers][71]\n  * [Junior Research Groups][72]\n  * [High Potential Program][73]\n  * [Education and Training][74]\n  * [Alumni Engagement][75]\n* [Technology Transfer][76]\n  * [Startpage][77]\n  * [Contact][78]\n  * [HZDR Innovation Campus][79]\n  * [HZDR Innovation Contest][80]\n  * [Helmholtz Innovation Labs at HZDR][81]\n  * [Technology Services][82]\n  * [Funding Opportunities][83]\n  * [Transfer Highlights & Spin-Offs][84]\n  * [OSPO - Open Source Support][85]\n  * [HZDR Innovators School][86]\n  * [Transfer Projects][87]\n  * [Equipment use][88]\n  * [ Transfer Strategy and Guideline][89]\n  * [HZDR Spin-off initiative][90]\nSearch [Custom search][91]\n\n## Cutting edge research in energy, health and matter\u00a0\n\n[\n\n### Energy\n\n][92] [\n\n### Health\n\n][93] [\n\n### Matter\n\n][94]\n[\n\n#### Our Mission\n\n][95]\n\nThe HZDR conducts cutting edge research with a long term focus in the fields of energy, health and\nmatter. We deliver solutions to the great challenges of our time, providing knowledge and technology\nfor future generations.\n\n[\n\n#### Our Guidelines\n\n][96]\n\nDiversity is our strength. As a large scale research center with a wide range of topics and\ndisciplines, it forms the foundation for conducting excellent and sustainable research in the long\nterm. Shared values and principles guide our work.\n\n[\n\n#### Our User Facilities\n\n][97]\n[\n\nCenter for High-Power Radiation Sources (ELBE)\n\n][98] [\n\nIon Beam Center (IBC)\n\n][99] [\n\nDresden High Magnetic Field Laboratory (HLD)\n\n][100] [\n\nHigh-Power Laser User Labs\n\n][101] [\n\nRossendorf Beamline at ESRF (ROBL)\n\n][102] [\n\nHelmholtz International Beamline for Extreme Fields (HIBEF)\n\n][103]\n[\n\n#### Knowledge and Technology Transfer\n\n][104]\n[\n\nQualification\n\n][105] [\n\nHZDR Innovation Labs\n\n][106] [\n\nHi-Acts Innovation Platform\n\n][107] [\n\nTechnology offerings\n\n][108] [\n\nNukliD Radiopharmacy Cluster\n\n][109] [\n\nCOSMO Science Forum\n\n][110]\n\n### No space for discrimination\u00a0\n\n[Hands putting together a puzzle in different colors] [Hands putting together a puzzle in different\ncolors]\n\nDiversity, equal opportunities and inclusion \u2013 these values are more than just words for us. They\nform the core of what we do at the HZDR. Our commitment to these values is unwavering: Diverse\nperspectives lead to better ideas to solve the complex challenges of an ever-evolving world.\n\n[\n\nRead more\n\n][111]\n[Hands putting together a puzzle in different colors] [Hands putting together a puzzle in different\ncolors]\n[\n\n#### Future projects\n\n][112]\n[Dresden Advanced Light Infrastructure]\n\nDALI \u2013 Dresden Advanced Light Infrastructure\n\nDALI brings light into darkness: Harnessing terahertz light, microscopic processes can be precisely\ntriggered and entirely new states of matter can emerge \u2013 laying the groundwork for next-generation\nmaterials and breakthroughs in quantum technology.\n\n[\n\nRead more\n\n][113]\n[\n\n#### Research Sites\n\n][114]\n[\n\n#### Dates & Events [Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden Rossendorf][1]\nToggle navigation\n* [LinkedIn][2]\n* [Instagram][3]\n* [Bluesky][4]\n* [Mastodon][5]\n* [YouTube][6]\n* [Deutsch][7]\n* [Login/-out][8]\n* [LinkedIn][9]\n* [Instagram][10]\n* [Bluesky][11]\n* [Mastodon][12]\n* [YouTube][13]\n* [HZDR][14]\n  * [Startpage][15]\n  * [Mission Statement][16]\n  * [Facts & Data][17]\n  * [Organization][18]\n  * [How to Find the Main Campus][19]\n  * [Sponsors' Association of the Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf (HZDR) e. V.][20]\n  * [DeltaX Student Laboratory][21]\n  * [Visitor Service][22]\n  * [HZDR Awards][23]\n  * [Sustainability][24]\n  * [Procurement][25]\n  * [Code of Conduct][26]\n  * [Whistleblower System][27]\n* [Research][28]\n  * [Startpage][29]\n  * [Research Fields][30]\n  * [Research Infrastructures][31]\n  * [Research Sites][32]\n  * [Projects for the Future][33]\n  * [Artificial Intelligence][34]\n  * [Strategic Partnerships and Collaborations][35]\n  * [International collaboration and Research Funding][36]\n  * [Publication Database][37]\n* [Institutes][38]\n  * [Startpage][39]\n  * [Dresden High Magnetic Field Laboratory][40]\n  * [Fluid Dynamics][41]\n  * [Ion Beam Physics and Material\u00ads Research][42]\n  * [Radiation Physics][43]\n  * [Radiooncology - OncoRay][44]\n  * [Radio\u00adpharma\u00adceutical Cancer Research][45]\n  * [Resource Ecology][46]\n  * [Helmholtz Institute Freiberg for Resource Technology][47]\n  * [CASUS - Cen\u00adter for Advanced Systems Understanding][48]\n  * [Institute of Theoretical Physics][49]\n  * [Department of Research Technology][50]\n  * [Department of Information Services and Computing][51]\n* [Press & News][52]\n  * [Startpage][53]\n  * [Press Releases][54]\n  * [Contact to Communications][55]\n  * [Media Cen\u00adter][56]\n  * [Publications][57]\n  * [Workshops & Congresses][58]\n  * [Public Events][59]\n  * [Events Calendar][60]\n  * [Visitor Service][61]\n  * [In the Media][62]\n* [Career][63]\n  * [Startpage][64]\n  * [HZDR as Employer][65]\n  * [Jobs][66]\n  * [International Office][67]\n  * [Career Cen\u00adter for Doctoral Researchers and Postdocs][68]\n  * [Summer Student Program][69]\n  * [Students & Graduates][70]\n  * [Doctoral Researchers][71]\n  * [Junior Research Groups][72]\n  * [High Potential Program][73]\n  * [Education and Training][74]\n  * [Alumni Engagement][75]\n* [Technology Transfer][76]\n  * [Startpage][77]\n  * [Contact][78]\n  * [HZDR Innovation Campus][79]\n  * [HZDR Innovation Contest][80]\n  * [Helmholtz Innovation Labs at HZDR][81]\n  * [Technology Services][82]\n  * [Funding Opportunities][83]\n  * [Transfer Highlights & Spin-Offs][84]\n  * [OSPO - Open Source Support][85]\n  * [HZDR Innovators School][86]\n  * [Transfer Projects][87]\n  * [Equipment use][88]\n  * [ Transfer Strategy and Guideline][89]\n  * [HZDR Spin-off initiative][90]\nSearch [Custom search][91]\n\n## Cutting edge research in energy, health and matter\u00a0\n\n[\n\n### Energy\n\n][92] [\n\n### Health\n\n][93] [\n\n### Matter\n\n][94]\n[\n\n#### Our Mission\n\n][95]\n\nThe HZDR conducts cutting edge research with a long term focus in the fields of energy, health and\nmatter. We deliver solutions to the great challenges of our time, providing knowledge and technology\nfor future generations.\n\n[\n\n#### Our Guidelines\n\n][96]\n\nDiversity is our strength. As a large scale research center with a wide range of topics and\ndisciplines, it forms the foundation for conducting excellent and sustainable research in the long\nterm. Shared values and principles guide our work.\n\n[\n\n#### Our User Facilities\n\n][97]\n[\n\nCenter for High-Power Radiation Sources (ELBE)\n\n][98] [\n\nIon Beam Center (IBC)\n\n][99] [\n\nDresden High Magnetic Field Laboratory (HLD)\n\n][100] [\n\nHigh-Power Laser User Labs\n\n][101] [\n\nRossendorf Beamline at ESRF (ROBL)\n\n][102] [\n\nHelmholtz International Beamline for Extreme Fields (HIBEF)\n\n][103]\n[\n\n#### Knowledge and Technology Transfer\n\n][104]\n[\n\nQualification\n\n][105] [\n\nHZDR Innovation Labs\n\n][106] [\n\nHi-Acts Innovation Platform\n\n][107] [\n\nTechnology offerings\n\n][108] [\n\nNukliD Radiopharmacy Cluster\n\n][109] [\n\nCOSMO Science Forum\n\n][110]\n\n### No space for discrimination\u00a0\n\n[Hands putting together a puzzle in different colors] [Hands putting together a puzzle in different\ncolors]\n\nDiversity, equal opportunities and inclusion \u2013 these values are more than just words for us. They\nform the core of what we do at the HZDR. Our commitment to these values is unwavering: Diverse\nperspectives lead to better ideas to solve the complex challenges of an ever-evolving world.\n\n[\n\nRead more\n\n][111]\n[Hands putting together a puzzle in different colors] [Hands putting together a puzzle in different\ncolors]\n[\n\n#### Future projects\n\n][112]\n[Dresden Advanced Light Infrastructure]\n\nDALI \u2013 Dresden Advanced Light Infrastructure\n\nDALI brings light into darkness: Harnessing terahertz light, microscopic processes can be precisely\ntriggered and entirely new states of matter can emerge \u2013 laying the groundwork for next-generation\nmaterials and breakthroughs in quantum technology.\n\n[\n\nRead more\n\n][113]\n[\n\n#### Research Sites\n\n][114]\n[\n\n#### Dates & Events\n\n][115]\n[\n\n### 26\n\nJUN\n\n26.06.2026\n\nDresden Science Night\n\nExperience research up close\n\n][116] [\n\n### 06\n\nJUL\n\n06.07.2026\n\nDeltaX: Summer of Science\n\nWorkshops und Kurse w\u00e4hrend der Sommerferien (6.7. - 14.8.2026)\n\n][117] [\n\n### 09\n\nSEP\n\n09.09.2026\n\nBuilding Bridges\n\nInternational conference on energy research\n\n][118]\n[\n\nSee all\n\n][119]\n[\n\n#### Latest publications\n\n][120]\n[\nBerthold, J.; Nenoff, L.; Bertschi, S. et al. Physics and Imaging in Radiation Oncology (2026)\n\nFeasibility of in-vivo 4D prompt-gamma treatment verification in proton therapy for pancreatic\ncancer\n\n][121] [\nVallinayagam, M.; Kumar, A.; Tejaswini, G. et al. ACS Applied Energy Materials 9(2026), 7301-7314\n\nTheoretical Insights on Thermoelectric Properties of SbXY (X = Se, Te; Y = Br, I) Janus Layers\n\n][122]\n[\n\n#### Cooperations\n\n][123]\n[\n\nEuropean Magnetic Field Laboratory\n\n][124] [\n\nLeague of European Accelerator-based Photon Sources\n\n][125] [\n\nLaserlab-Europe\n\n][126] [\n\nHydrogen Europe Research\n\n][127] [\n\nEIT RawMaterials\n\n][128]\n[\n\nFurther associations\n\n][129]\n[\n\n#### Media Center\n\n][130]\n\n##### The HZDR is institutionally funded by:\n\n[Federal Ministry of Research, Technology and Space] [Sachsen Wappen]\n\n##### European Funding:\n\n[Europ\u00e4ischer Fonds f\u00fcr regionale Entwicklung]\n[Mitglied der Helmholtz-Gemeinschaft][131] [Mitglied von DRESDEN-concept][132]\n* [Imprint][133]\n* [Privacy policy][134]\n\nBautzner Landstra\u00dfe 400, 01328 Dresden - Germany\nPhone: +49 351 260 - 0\nEmail: [kontakt@hzdr.de][135]\n\n[ [Zertifikat audit berufundfamilie seit 2008] ][136]\n\n[How to find us][137]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/hzdr/\n[3]: https://www.instagram.com/helmholtz_hzdr/\n[4]: https://bsky.app/profile/hzdr.bsky.social\n[5]: https://helmholtz.social/@hzdr\n[6]: https://www.youtube.com/user/FZDresden?feature=mhee\n[7]: ContMan.Options.SetLangRedirect?pLang=de&pRedirect=Cms%3FpNid%3D0\n[8]: https://www.hzdr.de/db/!FzrTools.AuthLoginPage?pNid=0\n[9]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/hzdr/\n[10]: https://www.in"
