ential Clearance: Entry-Level Access Confidential\nrepresents the entry-level clearance and authorizes access to \u2026 [Continued][120]\n\n[Department of Defense Analysis][121]\n\n### [ Pentagon Drone Dominance Program: How Selected Drone Company USA Picks Are Creating Jobs\n### ][122]\n\nOverview of the Pentagon Drone Dominance Program Secretary of War Pete Hegseth launched the Drone\nDominance Program in December 2025 with a clear mandate to accelerate the manufacturing and fielding\nof American-made attack drones. The program allocates $1.10 billion across four competitive phases,\nwith plans to purchase more than 300,000 platforms by 2028. This acquisition \u2026 [Continued][123]\n\n[Discover More][124]\n\n## Footer\n\n[ [Jobs with DHS] ][125]\n\nWe've Got Your Six\n\nWe provide highly talented job seekers a unified market to access defense career opportunities\nacross both DoD Civilian Employers and Defense Companies. One industry, one network: JOBSwithDOD |\nWe've Got Your Six\n\n[ Facebook ][126] [ Twitter ][127] [ LinkedIn ][128]\n\n### Job Seekers\n* [Search Jobs][129]\n* [AI Resume Optimizer][130]\n* [Browse Jobs][131]\n* [Browse Employers][132]\n* [Create Account][133]\n* [Defense Career Ne [ Skip to content ][1]\nOpen main menu\n[ [Jobs with DoD] ][2]\nJob Seekers\n[Search Jobs][3] [Browse Jobs][4] [Browse Employers][5]\nEmployers\n[How it Works][6] [Post Jobs][7] [Employer Support][8] [Contact Us][9]\n[Defense Career News][10]\n[ Search Jobs ][11] [Login][12]\nJob Seekers\n[Search Jobs][13] [Browse Jobs][14] [Browse Employers][15]\nEmployers\n[How it Works][16] [Post Jobs][17] [Employer Support][18] [Contact Us][19]\n[Defense Career News][20]\n\n\nSearch\n\n## Explore Defense Industry Careers\n\n## Defense Companies Now Hiring\n\n[ [Accenture] ][21]\n[ [AeroVironment] ][22]\n[ [Allen Control Systems] ][23]\n[ [Amentum] ][24]\n[ [Anduril] ][25]\n[ [BAE Systems] ][26]\n[ [Bechtel] ][27]\n[ [Blue Origin] ][28]\n[ [Boeing] ][29]\n[ [CACI] ][30]\n[ [Casteli