        "crawl_text": "# General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n  \n  ### General Atomics\n  * [About General Atomics][3]\n  * [Affiliated Companies][4]\n  * [History][5]\n  * [Neal Blue][6]\n  \n  ### Energy Group\n  * [About Energy Group][7]\n  * [Energy Group Internships][8]\n  * [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n  \n  ### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n  * [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n  \n  ### Uranium Resources\n  * [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n  \n  ### Energy\n  * [Centers of Excellence][13]\n  * [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n  * [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n  * [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n  * [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n  \n  ### Defense\n  * [Aircraft Launch and Recovery Systems][18]\n  * [Batteries, Power and Energy Systems][19]\n  * [Demilitarization and Hazardous Waste Destruction][20]\n  * [Missile Defense and Advanced Weapon Systems][21]\n  * [Space Systems][22]\n  * [Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors][23]\n  \n  ### Commercial Products and Services\n  * [Explore All Commercial Products and Services][24]\n* [Procurement][25]\n* [News & Media][26]\n* [Careers][27]\n  \n  ### Careers\n  * [Working at General Atomics][28]\n  * [GA Total Rewards ][29]\n  * [Search all US Jobs ][30]\n  \n  ### Locations & Divisions\n  * [Explore Locations & Divisions][31]\n  * [Search Internaltional Jobs ][32]\n  \n  ### Early Careers\n  * [About Early Careers][33]\n  * [Energy Group Internships][34]\n  * [Search Summer Internships ][35]\n  \n  ### Military and Veterans\n  * [DoD SkillBridge Program][36]\n* [Contact][37]\n* [Visitor Information][38]\n* \u00a0\n  \n  Search Search\n[ [General Atomics Energy Group]\nEnergy\n][39]\n[ [General Atomics Defense]\nDefense\n][40]\n[ [General Atomics Unmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors]\nUnmanned Aircraft Systems & Sensors\n][41]\n[ [General Atomics Commercial Products]\nCommercial Products\n][42]\n[ [General Atomics Educational Outreach Programs]\nEducational Outreach Programs\n][43]\n\n## Trending News\n\n[\nPacific Fusion and GA Team Up to Deliver Breakthroughs in Inertial Fusion Energy\nExpanding Collaboration Accelerates Path to Clean, Sustainable Fusion Energy\n][44]\n[\nU.S Air Force Awards GA-ASI Production Contract for FQ-42A CCA\nGeneral Atomics Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI) has received a production contract from the U.S.\nAir Force (USAF) for the FQ-42A Collaborative Combat Aircraft (CCA).\n][45]\n[\nGA Partners with Rafael to Build Precision-Guided Missile for U.S. Defense Customers\nGA-EMS's Bullseye\u2122 missile will meet U.S. military specifications and will provide multi-platform\nlaunch capabilities\n][46]\n* [[Post Thumbnail]][47]\n  \n  ## [GA-ASI Adapts Ground Control Station To Fly MQ-9B][48]\n  \n  General Atomics Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI) is working to adapt its Block 30 Ground\n  Control Stations (GCS) to fly the company\u2019s newer model MQ-9B SkyGuardian^{\u00ae} and SeaGuardian^{\u00ae}\n  Remotely Piloted Aircraft.\u00a0\n  \n  ga-asi Jun 25, 2026\n* [[Post Thumbnail]][49]\n  \n  ## [General Atomics Receives $20 Million Tax Credit to Advance Fusion Energy Development][50]\n  \n  (June 22, 2026) \u2014 General Atomics (GA) announced today it has been awarded a $20 million\n  California Competes Tax Credit from the state of California through the Governor\u2019s Office of\n  Business and Economic Development (GO-Biz). The award will support the company\u2019s proposal to\n  design and develop a Blanket Component Test Facility (BCTF) in San Diego.\n  \n  energy Jun 23, 2026\n* [[Post Thumbnail]][51]\n  \n  ## [General Atomics, Rheinmetall Explore Transatlantic Co-Production of Vektrex\u2122 for Allied\n  ## Artillery Modernization][52]\n  \n  General Atomics Electromagnetic Systems (GA-EMS) and Rheinmetall announced today the signing of a\n  Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) at Eurosatory 2026 to explore cooperative production\n  opportunities for Vektrex\u2122, a maneuvering 155 mm precision-guided munition.\n  \n  ga-ems Jun 18, 2026\n* [[Post Thumbnail]][53]\n  \n  ## [U.S Air Force Awards GA-ASI Production Contract for FQ-42A CCA][54]\n  \n  General Atomics Aeronautical Systems, Inc. (GA-ASI) has received a production contract from the\n  U.S. Air Force (USAF) for the FQ-42A Collaborative Combat Aircraft (CCA).\n  \n  ga-asi Jun 17, 2026\n[MORE NEWS ][55]\n\n##### General Atomics Events\n\n## GA Footer\n\n### Popular Links\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Careers][57]\n* [Contact Us][58]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][59]\n* [Newsroom][60]\n* [Visitor Information][61]\n\n### [Popular Links][62]\n* [About Us][63]\n* [Careers][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n* [DIII-D National Fusion Facility][66]\n* [Newsroom][67]\n* [Visitor Information][68]\n\n### Categories\n* [Commercial Products and Services][69]\n* [Defense][70]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][71]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][72]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][73]\n* [Unmanned Aircraft Systems and Sensors][74]\n\n### [Categories][75]\n* [Commercial Products and Services][76]\n* [Defense][77]\n* [Energy Systems and Products][78]\n* [Fusion Power and Technologies][79]\n* [Satellite and Space Systems][80]\n* [Unmanned Aircraf # General Atomics\n\n[[General Atomics]][1]\nSearch Search\n* [About][2]\n  \n  ### General Atomics\n  * [About General Atomics][3]\n  * [Affiliated Companies][4]\n  * [History][5]\n  * [Neal Blue][6]\n  \n  ### Energy Group\n  * [About Energy Group][7]\n  * [Energy Group Internships][8]\n  * [Energy Group News & Updates][9]\n  \n  ### Electromagnetic Systems Group\n  * [About Electromagnetic Systems Group][10]\n  \n  ### Uranium Resources\n  * [About Uranium Resources][11]\n* [Products & Technology][12]\n  \n  ### Energy\n  * [Centers of Excellence][13]\n  * [Energy Technologies and Services][14]\n  * [Fission Energy Systems][15]\n  * [Fusion Energy Systems][16]\n  * [Stockpile Responsiveness][17]\n  \n  ### Defense\n  * [Aircraft Launch a