fusion ignition.\nSince making history in 2022, each repeat deepens our understanding of high energy density and\nfusion science.\nExplore how NIF brings star power to Earth in service of U.S. national security.\n\n[Achieving Fusion Ignition][140]\u00a0\u00a0 [How NIF Works][141]\n\nNNSA and LLNL Advance NIF Laser Upgrade\n\nThe Department of Energy and National Nuclear Security Administration have approved a path forward\nfor a project that will increase the laser energy available to NIF at LLNL. The Enhanced Yield\nCapability project will enable more pertinent assessments and modernization efforts for the nation\u2019s\nnuclear stockpile.\n\n[Read More][142]\n\n[[NIF Cross Section] ][143]\nClick to Enlarge\n\n### NIF Milestones\n\n#### [FIRST IGNITION][144]\n\nDecember 2022\n\nMore fusion energy out than laser energy in\n\n#### [RECORD FUSION YIELD][145]\n\nApril 2025\n\n8.6 MJ of fusion energy, target gain >4\n\n#### [SECURING THE STOCKPILE][146]\n\nOctober 2025\n\nMilestone survivability results for NNSA\n\n#### [UPGRADING THE LASER][147]\n\nMarch 2026\n\nEmbarking on the NIF Enhanced Yield Capability\n\n## NIF and Photon Science News\n\n\u00a0\n\n[[Laser Optics] ][148] May 26, 2026\n\n### [LLNL, Las Positas College Offer Laser Optics Workshop][149]\n\n[[FODI at work inspecting an optic between experiments at NIF] ][150] May 20, 2026\n\n### [Meet the Machines That Matter: The Optics Inspector][151]\n\n[[LLNL's Dan Casey speaks with US IFE conference attendees] ][152] May 7, 2026\n\n### [LLNL Experts Help Advance Inertial Fusion Energy at U.S. IFE Conference][153]\n\n[[NIF&PS Igniters Ann Provost, Arsenia Rendon, Raspberry Simpson, and John Jett with NIF&PS PAD\nVincent Tang] ][154] May 4, 2026\n\n### [Igniter Awards Honor NIF&PS Culture Builders][155]\n\n[[Colorized image of a NIF \u201cBig Foot\u201d deuterium-tritium (DT) implosion] ][156] April 15, 2026\n\n### [Target Breakthrough Enabled Fusion Record at NIF][157]\n\n[[LLNL and Inertia Logos] ][158] April 14, 2026\n\n### [LLNL Partners with Inertia to Develop Fusion Energy Technology][159]\n\n### [More News\u00a0>>][160]\n\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 [NIF&PS NEWSLETTER][161]\n\n[[LLNL]][162]\nLawrence Livermore National Laboratory\n\u00a0| 7000 East Avenue \u2022 Livermore, CA 94550 | LLNL-WEB-2017968\nOperated by the Lawrence Livermore National Security, LLC for the Department of Energy's National\nNuclear Security Administration Learn about the Department of Energy's [Vulnerability Disclosure\nProgram][163]\n[[LLNS]][164] [[U.S. DOE]][165] [[NNSA]][166]\n[Home][167] "
