cal][77]\n    * [Aesthetic][78]\n    * [Surgical][79]\n  * [Materials Processing][80]\n    * [ Automated Fiber Placement][81]\n    * [Additive Manufacturing][82]\n    * [Food Packaging][83]\n    * [Thermal Annealing][84]\n  * [Scientific][85]\n    * [MegaWatt][86]\n    * [UKRI][87]\n* [About][88]\n  * [About Us][89]\n    * [Our Commitment][90]\n    * [Careers][91]\n    * [Management][92]\n    * [News & Events][93]\n* [Resources][94]\n  * [All Resources][95]\n    * [Whitepapers][96]\n    * [Datasheets][97]\n    * [Supplier Resources][98]\n    * [Blog][99]\n* [Contact][100]\n[\n][101]\n[\n][102]\n[Vulcano Rotating Banner Image]\n\n## Vulcano 155mm Guided Ammunition Selected by U.S. Army for Extended Range Artillery Projectile\n## (ERAP) Program\n\n[[Read More]][103]\n[Golden Globe PR_Banner]\n\n## Leonardo Electronics US Inc. Selected for MDA SHIELD IDIQ Contract\n\n[[Read More]][104]\n[U.S. Navy Orders LDO UK BriteCloud F-35 Fighter Jet 1]\n\n## U.S. Approves Purchase of Leonardo\u2019s BriteCloud for Navy F\u201135s\n\n[[Read More]][105]\n[QUAD A Web Graphics_v1]\n\n## Rapid Response Solutions for Multi-Domain Operations: Supporting Your Mission's Success\n\n[[Learn More]][106]\n[Five Driver Will Shape the Future of HPLD Technologies_PS]\n\n## Five Drivers Will Shape the Future of High-Power Laser Diode Technologies\n\n[[Read our news in Photonics Spectra]][107]\n[BriteStorm 2024]\n\n## BriteStorm Stand-in-Jammer Payload\n\nDiscover world-class stand-in jamming capabilities for mission-success against enemy air defenses\nwith** the new BriteStorm Stand-in-Jamming payload.\u00a0**\n\n[[Read More]][108]\n[LDO_UK25_01269 Laser World of Photonics - 1440x480]\n\n## Enabling World-Changing Research\n\n[[Learn More]][109]\n\n## Leonardo Electronics US Capabilities\n\nLeonardo Electronics US Inc., a subsidiary of Leonardo\u2014an international leader in aerospace,\ndefense, and security\u2014delivers cutting-edge high-power lasers and advanced sensor\u00a0technologies built\nfor the world\u2019s most demanding environments.\n\nWe drive innovation across Defense, Industrial, Medical, and Scientific/Green Energy sectors,\nempowering mission success through precision and reliability * [Careers][1]\n* [Blog][2]\n* [Global][3]\n[ Close ][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Laser Diodes][6]\n    * [High-Power Laser Diodes][7]\n    * [High-Power Fiber Amplifier][8]\n    * [Pointers][9]\n    * [High-Power Illumination][10]\n    * [Laser Diode Systems][11]\n  * [Sensors][12]\n    * [Radar][13]\n    * [Infrared Systems][14]\n    * [Electronic Warfare][15]\n    * [Avionics][16]\n    * [Defense Systems][17]\n    * [Advanced Targeting Systems][18]\n* [Applications][19]\n  * [Defense][20]\n    * [Advanced Targeting][21]\n    * [Avionics][22]\n    * [Defense Systems][23]\n    * [Directed Energy][24]\n    * [Electronic Warfare][25]\n    * [Infrared Systems][26]\n    * [Radar][27]\n  * [Medical][28]\n    * [Aesthetic][29]\n    * [Surgical][30]\n  * [Materials Processing][31]\n    * [ Automated Fiber Placement][32]\n    * [Additive Manufacturing][33]\n    * [Food Packaging][34]\n    * [Thermal Annealing][35]\n  * [Scientific][36]\n    * [MegaWatt][37]\n    * [UKRI][38]\n* [About][39]\n  * [About Us][40]\n    * [Our Commitment][41]\n    * [Careers][42]\n    * [Management][43]\n    * [News & Events][44]\n* [Resources][45]\n  * [All Resources][46]\n    * [Whitepapers][47]\n    * [Datasheets][48]\n    * [Supplier Resources][49]\n    * [Blog][50]\n* [Contact][51]\n[\nSEARCH ][52]\n[[Leonardo-Logo-Colour-SOLID-1]][53]\n* [Products][54]\n  * [Laser Diodes][55]\n    * [High-Power Laser Diodes][56]\n    * [High-Power Fiber Amplifier][57]\n    * [Pointers][58]\n    * [High-Power Illumination][59]\n    * [Laser Diode Systems][60]\n  * [Sensors][61]\n    * [Radar][62]\n    * [Infrared Systems][63]\n    * [Electronic Warfare][64]\n    * [Avionics][65]\n    * [Defense Systems][66]\n    * [Advanced Targeting Systems][67]\n* [Applications][68]\n  * [Defense][69]\n    * [Advance