US Inc., a subsidiary of Leonardo\u2014an international leader in aerospace,\ndefense, and security\u2014delivers cutting-edge high-power lasers and advanced sensor\u00a0technologies built\nfor the world\u2019s most demanding environments.\n\nWe drive innovation across Defense, Industrial, Medical, and Scientific/Green Energy sectors,\nempowering mission success through precision and reliability. Our multi-domain solutions\u2014spanning\nair, land, sea, space, and cyber\u2014reinforce security at home and abroad.\n\nAs a trusted technology partner in major international strategic programs, we support governments,\ndefense agencies, institutions, and commercial enterprises with proven expertise and global reach.\n\n[\nDefense\nDefenseLearn More\n][110][\nMedical\nMedicalLearn More\n][111][\nMaterials Processing\nMaterials ProcessingLearn More\n][112][\nScientific/Green Energy\nScientific/Green EnergyLearn More\n][113]\n\n[[\"When we received the first delivery, it was immediately clear the product was superior.\"]][114]\n\nLeonardo Electronics US Customer Laser Solutions\n\n##### \"[Leonardo Electronics US] helps us achieve and maintain our high-end capabilities in the\n##### market. Their innovation allows us to continually be on the edge of leading technology.\"\n\nLeonardo Electronics US Customer Laser Solutions\n\n## Get Industry Updates\n\nStay up to date on new advancements in defense and commercial applications as well as exciting\ncompany news.\n[\n\n### Leonardo\u2019s Vulcano 155mm Selected for U.S. Army\u2019s Extended Range Artillery Projectile (ERAP)\n### Program\n\nStart Reading\n][115] [\n\n### Leonardo Electronics US Inc. Selected for MDA SHIELD IDIQ Contract\n\nStart Reading\n][116] [\n\n### NAVAIR Awards Leonardo UK Sole\u2011Source BriteCloud Contract for F\u201135 Fleet\n\nStart Reading\n][117]\n\n### Partner with Leonardo Electronics US\n\nOvercome application challenges with a customized solution.\n[Contact Us][118]\n\nLeonardo Electronics US Inc. is a subsidiary of Leonardo. Copyright 2026. All rights reserved.\n\n**[Privacy Policy & Cookies Page][119]**\n\n**[This link][120] **leads to the machine-readable files that are made available in response to the\nfederal Transparency in Coverage Rule\n\n[][121]\n* [Products][122]\n  * [Laser Diodes][123]\n  * [Sensors][124]\n* [Applications][125]\n  * [Defense][126]\n  * [Medical][127]\n  * [Materials Processing][128]\n  * [Scientific][129]\n* [About][130]\n  * [About Us][131]\n* [Resources][132]\n  * [All Resources][133]\n* [Contact][134]\n\n[ ][135]\n\n[1]: https://www.leonardo.us/careers\n[2]: https://www.leonardo.us/blog\n[3]: https://www.leonardo.com/en/home\n[4]: #\n[5]: javascript:;\n[6]: https://www.leonardo.us/lasers\n[7]: https://www.leonardo.us/high-power-laser-diodes\n[8]: https://www.leonardo.us/high-power-fiber-amplifier\n[9]: https://www.leonardo.us/pointers\n[10]: https://www.leonardo.us/high-power-illumination\n[11]: https://www.leonardo.us/laser-diode-systems\n[12]: https://www.leonardo.us/sensors\n[13]: https://www.leonardo.us/radar\n[14]: https://www.leonardo.us/ir-systems\n[15]: https://www.leonardo.us/electronic-warfare\n[16]: https://www.leonardo.us/avionics\n[17]: https://www.leonardo.us/defense-systems\n[18]: https://www.leonardo.us/advanced-targeting-systems\n[19]: https://www.leonardo.us/applications\n[20]: https://www.leonardo.us/defense\n[21]: https://www.leonardo.us/advanced-targeting-application\n[22]: https://www.leonardo.us/avionics-application\n[23]: https://www.leonardo.us/leonardo-electronics-us-defense-systems-application\n[24]: https://www.leonardo.us/directed-energy-application\n[25]: https://www.leonardo.us/electronic-warfare-application\n[26]: https://www.leonardo.us/infrared-systems-application\n[27]: https://www.leonardo.us/leonardo-electronics-us.-radar-application\n[28]: https://www.leonardo.us/medical-application\n[29]: https://www.leonardo.us/medical-application\n[30]: https://www.leonardo.us/medical-application\n[3