        "crawl_text": "[CONTACT SALES][1]\n\n+44(0)1788 574444\n* [Home][2]\n* [Products][3]\n  * [Product Range][4]\n  * [Compact Lasers][5]\n  * [High Energy Compact Lasers][6]\n  * [High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J][7]\n  * [Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J][8]\n  * [DPSS Pulsed Lasers][9]\n  * [CW High Repetition Rate Lasers][10]\n  * [Lasers For PIV][11]\n  * [Tunable Pulsed Lasers][12]\n  * [Custom Laser Systems][13]\n* [Applications][14]\n  * [Application Areas][15]\n  * [PIV & Visualisation][16]\n  * [Spectroscopy & LIBS][17]\n  * [Remote Sensing & LiDAR][18]\n  * [Scientific Research][19]\n  * [LCD & Semiconductor][20]\n  * [Laser Pump Source][21]\n  * [Photoacoustic Imaging][22]\n  * [Surface Processing & Ablation][23]\n  * [Technical Notes][24]\n* [Company][25]\n  * [About][26]\n  * [Distributors][27]\n  * [Events][28]\n  * [Careers][29]\n  * [Customer Login][30]\n  * [Find Us][31]\n* [Service][32]\n  * [Service Centers][33]\n  * [Spares & Consumables][34]\n  * [RMA Form][35]\n  * [RMA & Shipping Policy][36]\n* [News][37]\n* [Contact][38]\n\n# DESIGNED FOR RESEARCH ENGINEERED FOR INDUSTRY\n\n[CONTACT US][39]\n[ 7 ][40]\n\nWe are specialists in the design and manufacture of pulsed Nd:YAG lasers, PIV Nd:YAG lasers, DPSS\nNd:YAG, CW Nd:YLF lasers and true TEM00 lasers.\u00a0\n\n\u2013 Lasers designed for research, engineered for industry.\n\n## DIODE PUMPED LASERS\n\n[][41]\n\n#### [PLASMA and PLASMA +][42]\n\nThe Plasma Series high energy are diode pumped, pulsed, high repetition, Q-switched Nd:YAG lasers.\nThese systems use the very latest in high efficiency fully diode pumped oscillator and amplifier\ntechnology to replace traditional flashlamp pumping.\n\n[][43]\n\n#### [COMPACT][44]\n\nLitron\u2019s extremely versatile and successful compact lasers are stable, robust and rugged. True\nflexibility and advanced automated control features allow you to concentrate on your application and\nnot operating the laser, making them perfect for industrial use.\n\n[][45]\n\n#### [CW HIGH REPETITION RATE][46]\n\nLitron produces a range of high frequency, CW and Q-switched CW diode pumped lasers for a variety of\napplications. These are based around both Nd:YAG and Nd:YLF.\n\n[][47]\n\n#### [TUNABLE][48]\n\nLitron\u2019s Aurora laser systems are fully motorised, Type II BBO OPOs pumped by our DPSS Nd:YAG lasers\navailable in fully integrated or removable modules.\n\n## FLASHLAMP PUMPED LASERS\n\n[][49]\n\n#### [HIGH REPETITION RATE][50]\n\nThe LPY series of high repetition pulsed lasers have been designed to suit almost any industrial or\nresearch application. Based around a fully self-supporting invar rail, the LPY series exhibit both\nexceptional mechanical and thermal stability.\n\n[][51]\n\n#### [ULTRA HIGH ENERGY][52]\n\nUltra-high energy pulsed Q-switched Nd:YAG Lasers can provide energies up to 10J at 1064nm. These\nrugged, Invar stabilised, pulsed Nd:YAG lasers offer wide capabilities for industrial and scientific\napplications.\n\n[][53]\n\n#### [COMPACT][54]\n\nThe flashlamp compact lasers are suited to a multitude of applications\u00a0including LIBS, LIDAR, PIV\nand spectroscopy. Sealed against\u00a0the ingress of moisture and dust, they provide unrivalled\nflexibility both in laboratory research\u00a0and for industrial applications.\n\n[][55]\n\n#### [TUNABLE][56]\n\nLitron\u2019s Aurora laser systems are fully motorised, Type II BBO OPOs pumped by our flashlamp Nd:YAG\nlasers available in fully integrated or removable modules.\n\n## CUSTOM SYSTEMS\n\nLitron\u2019s flexible approach and expertise in laser design\nmeans custom lasers are a natural part of our production.\nCustom lasers can be either built based on standard modules or,\nwhere necessary,\u00a0Litron can offer a complete design to fit your needs.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[READ MORE][57]\n\n## APPLICATIONS\n\n## PIV & Visualisation\n\nLitron Lasers is the acknowledged leader in supplying lasers for PIV applications, ranging from lamp\npumped Nd:YAG lasers in the 15 to 200Hz repetition rates range up to diode pumped Nd:YLF and Nd:YAG\nlasers giving kHz repetition rates for high speed applications.\n\n[Details][58]\n\n## Spectroscopy & LIBS\n\nWe offer the widest range of laser systems to fit your spectroscopy needs. Our laser systems\u2019 narrow\nlinewidth enables precise wavelength resolution to be achieved while the high peak powers from\nQ-switched lasers enable nonlinear optical phenomena to be investigated.\n\n[Details][59]\n\n## Remote Sensing & LIDAR\n\nLitron\u2019s Q-switched solid-state Nd:YAG lasers provide the necessary high peak powers and repetition\nrates.\nThese are used to obtain meaningful data for applications such as LIDAR, Environmental Monitoring or\nAtmospheric Research.\n\n[Details][60]\n\n## Scientific Research\n\nWith over 3,000 units working in 33 countries, Litron\u2019s expertise in supporting leading edge science\nis second to none. We can deliver systems providing ultra-high energy, high power peaks, wide tuning\nrange, injection seeding or any combination of features for your research.\n\n[Details][61]\n\n## LCD & Semiconductor\n\nLitron\u2019s Nd:YAG lasers have been widely used for LCD & Semiconductor applications, including LCD\nRepair, Cleaning or Silicon Annealing. Ou [CONTACT SALES][1]\n\n+44(0)1788 574444\n* [Home][2]\n* [Products][3]\n  * [Product Range][4]\n  * [Compact Lasers][5]\n  * [High Energy Compact Lasers][6]\n  * [High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 5J][7]\n  * [Ultra High Energy Lasers \u2013 up to 10J][8]\n  * [DPSS Pulsed Lasers][9]\n  * [CW High Repetition Rate Lasers][10]\n  * [Lasers For PIV][11]\n  * [Tunable Pulsed Lasers][12]\n  * [Custom Laser Systems][13]\n* [Applications][14]\n  * [Application Areas][15]\n  * [PIV & Visualisation][16]\n  * [Spectroscopy & LIBS][17]\n  * [Remote Sensing & LiDAR][18]\n  * [Scientific Research][19]\n  * [LCD & Semiconductor][20]\n  * [Laser Pump Source][21]\n  * [Photoacoustic Imaging][22]\n  * [Surface Processing & Ablation][23]\n  * [Technical Notes][24]\n* [Company][25]\n  * [About][26]\n  * [Distributors][27]\n  * [Events][28]\n  * [Careers][29]\n  * [Customer Login][30]\n  * [Find Us][31]\n* [Service][32]\n  * [Service Centers][33]\n  * [Spares & Consumables][34]\n  * [RMA Form][35]\n  * [RMA & Shipping Policy][36]\n* [News][37]\n* [Contact][38]\n\n# DESIGNED FOR RESEARCH ENGINEERED FOR INDUSTRY\n\n[CONTACT US][39]\n[ 7 ][40]\n\nWe are specialists in the design and manufacture of pulsed Nd:YAG lasers, PIV Nd:YAG lasers, DPSS\nNd:YAG, CW Nd:YLF lasers and true TEM00 lasers.\u00a0\n\n\u2013 Lasers designed for research, engineered for industry.\n\n## DIODE PUMPED LASERS\n\n[][41]\n\n#### [PLASMA and PLASMA +][42]\n\nThe Plasma Series high energy are diode pumped, pulsed, high repetition, Q-switched Nd:YAG lasers.\nThese systems use the very latest in high efficiency fully diode pumped oscillator and amplifier\ntechnology to replace traditional flashlamp pumping.\n\n[][43]\n\n#### [COMPACT][44]\n\nLitron\u2019s extremely versatile and successful compact lasers are stable, robust and rugged. True\nflexibility and advanced automated control features allow you to concentrate on your application and\nnot operating the laser, making them perfect for industrial use.\n\n[][45]\n\n#### [CW HIGH REPETITION RATE][46]\n\nLitron produces a range of high frequency, CW and Q-switched CW diode pumped lasers for a variety of\napplications. These are based around both Nd:YAG and Nd:YLF.\n\n[][47]\n\n#### [TUNABLE][48]\n\nLitron\u2019s Aurora laser systems are fully motorised, Type II BBO OPOs pumped by our DPSS Nd:YAG lasers\navailable in fully integrated or removable modules.\n\n## FLASHLAMP PUMPED LASERS\n\n[][49]\n\n#### [HIGH REPETITION RATE][50]\n\nThe LPY series of high repetition pulsed lasers have been designed to suit almost any industrial or\nresearch application. Based around a fully self-supporting invar rail, the LPY series exhibit both\nexceptional mechanical and thermal stability.\n\n[][51]\n\n#### [ULTRA HIGH ENERGY][52]\n\nUltra-high energy pulsed Q-switched Nd:YAG Lasers can provide energies up to 10J at 1064nm. These\nrugged, Invar stabilised, pulsed Nd:YAG lasers offer wide capabilities for industrial and scientific\napplications.\n\n[][53]\n\n#### [COMPACT][54]\n\nThe flashlamp compact lasers are suited to a multitude of applications\u00a0including LIBS, LIDAR, PIV\nand spectroscopy. Sealed against\u00a0the ingress of moisture and dust, they provide unrivalled\nflexibility both in laboratory research\u00a0and for industrial applications.\n\n[][55]\n\n#### [TUNABLE][56]\n\nLitron\u2019s Aurora laser systems are fully motorised, Type II BBO OPOs pumped by our flashlamp Nd:YAG\nlasers available in fully integrated or removable modules.\n\n## CUSTOM SYSTEMS\n\nLitron\u2019s flexible approach and expertise in laser design\nmeans custom lasers are a natural part of our production.\nCustom lasers can be either built based on standard modules or,\nwhere necessary,\u00a0Litron can offer a complete design to fit your needs.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[READ MORE][57]\n\n## APPLICATIONS\n\n## PIV & Visualisation\n\nLitron Lasers is the acknowledged leader in supplying lasers for PIV applications, ranging from lamp\npumped Nd:YAG lasers in the 15 to 200Hz repetition rates range up to diode pumped Nd:YLF and Nd:YAG\nlasers giving kHz repetition rates for high speed applications.\n\n[Details][58]\n\n## Spectroscopy & LIBS\n\nWe offer the widest range of laser systems to fit your spectroscopy needs. Our laser systems\u2019 narrow\nlinewidth enables precise wavelength resolution to be achieved while the high peak powers from\nQ-switched lasers enable nonlinear optical phenomena to be investigated.\n\n[Details][59]\n\n## Remote Sensing & LIDAR\n\nLitron\u2019s Q-switched solid-state Nd:YAG lasers provide the necessary high peak powers and repetition\nrates.\nThese are used to obtain meaningful data for applications such as LIDAR, Environmental Monitoring or\nAtmospheric Research.\n\n[Details][60]\n\n## Scientific Research\n\nWith over 3,000 units working in 33 countries, Litron\u2019s expertise in supporting leading edge science\nis second to none. We can deliver systems providing ultra-high energy, high power peaks, wide tuning\nrange, injection seeding or any combination of features for your research.\n\n[Details][61]\n\n## LCD & Semiconductor\n\nLitron\u2019s Nd:YAG lasers have been widely used for LCD & Semiconductor applications, including LCD\nRepair, Cleaning or Silicon Annealing. Our pulsed Nd:YAG flashlamp lasers can provide high energy\noutputs while ensuring high performance and repeatability over time.\n\n[Details][62]\n\n## Laser Pump Source\n\nLitron Lasers developed a range of tunable pulsed Nd:YAG lasers for applications such as OPO\nPumping, Ti:Sapphire Pumping or Dye Laser Pumping. Whether your application requires an integrated,\nInvar-built system or a module, we can provide the right type of tunable laser system.\n\n[Details][63]\n\n## Photoacoustic Imaging\n\nLitron Lasers utilise their expertise to support emerging techniques such as photoacoustic imaging.\nOur Q-switched, pulsed Nd:YAG lasers are tunable and can provide the right frequency and output\nenergy to achieve optimal results for this application.\n\n[Details][64]\n\n## Surface Processing & Ablation\n\nLitron\u2019s pulsed Nd:YAG lasers are used in a wide variety of material processing applications. From\ncutting and welding to laser marking, laser peening and laser deposition, our Q-switched, rugged\nsystems provide outstanding results for industrial processes.\n\n[Details][65]\n\n# Contact Us\n\nName\n\nEmail Address\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit Request\n\n[LEGAL NOTICE][66]\n\n[PRIVACY NOTICE][67]\n\n[COOKIE NOTICE][68]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright Litron Lasers 2026 All Rights Reserved | ISO 9001:2015 Certified Web Site by [ Mulberry\nDesign][69]\nLitron Lasers only uses anonymous analytical/performance cookies on this site. If you are unhappy\nwith this use of cookies, you can disable their use in your browser settings. See our cookie policy\nfor more information.OkPrivacy policy\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@litron.co.uk\n[2]: https://www.litronlasers.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/\n[5]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/compact-lasers/\n[6]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-compact-lasers/\n[7]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/high-energy-lasers/\n[8]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/ultra-high-energy-lasers/\n[9]: https://www.litronlasers.com/product-range/dpss-pulsed-l"
      }
