ced Glass and Fiber Materials for Next Generation Fiber\nLasers and Amplifiers][50]\n\n\u00a0\n\n2025, January 22 / June 18\n\n[NP Photonics Highlights its OEM Winning Fiber Lasers and Amplifiers at PHOTONICS WEST / LASERS\nMUNICH][51]\n\n\n2024, September 24 (PRESS RELEASE)\n\n[NP Photonics and University of Arizona demonstrate compact and portable optical clock.][52]\n\n\u00a0\n\n2024, January 25\u00a0 \u00a0 (PRESS RELEASE)\n\n[NP Photonics Highlights its OEM Winning Fiber Lasers and Amplifiers at SPIE PHOTONICS WEST\n2024][53]\n\n\u00a0\n\n2019, January 21\u00a0\n\n[NP Photonics to Introduce METEOR ROCK][54]\n\n\n2019, January 21\n\n[NP Photonics to Introduce Amplifier Gain Block][55]\n\n\n2018, April 10\n\n[NP highlighted at Navy conference][56]\n\n\n2016, October\u00a0\n\n[NP recognized as a global photonic sensor and detector market leader][57]\n\n# Upcoming Events\n\nJanuary 20-22, 2026\n\nPhotonics West 2026\n\nPhotonics West Exhibition,\u00a0Booth: 563\n\nThe Moscone Center\n\nSan Francisco, California\n\n\nJune 24-27, 2025\n\nLaser World Of Photonics: Munich, Germany\u00a0\n\nBooth: A2.303\n\n\n[Visit us at Photonics West ][58]\n[[NP-Photonics-Logo-C5.png]][59]\n* [[LinkedIn - White Circle]][60]\n[\n][61]\n[\n][62]\n\n9030 S Rita Ranch Rd #120\n\nTucson, AZ 85747\n\n[520-799-7400][63]\n\n[info@npphotonics.com][64]\n\n[\n][65]\nContact Us\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.npphotonics.com\n[2]: https://www.npphotonics.com\n[3]: https://www.npphotonics.com/products\n[4]: https://www.npphotonics.com/single-frequency-lasers\n[5]: https://www.npphotonics.com/high-power-cw-lasers\n[6]: https://www.npphotonics.com/high-energy-lasers\n[7]: https://www.npphotonics.com/multi-channel-laser-systems\n[8]: https://www.npphotonics.com/short-length-fiber-amplifiers\n[9]: https://www.npphotonics.com/seeder\n[10]: https://www.npphotonics.com/ase-sources\n[11]: https://www.npphotonics.com/mid-ir-fibers-sources\n[12]: https://www.npphotonics.com/applications\n[13]: https://