        "crawl_text": "500\n0\n[\n0\n][1]\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n[ [Owler] ][3]\nProducts\n[ Owler Pro ][4]\n[ Owler Community ][5]\n[ Owler API ][6]\n[ Owler Max ][7]\n[Chrome Extension][8]\nSolutions\n[ New - Owler AI ][9]\n[ For Prospecting ][10]\n[ For Research ][11]\n[ For Building Relationships ][12]\nResources\n[ Owler Blog ][13]\n[ Case Studies ][14]\n[Knowledge Base][15]\n[ Integrations ][16]\n[Pricing][17]\n[Login][18]\n[See All Plans][19]\n[ Contact Sales ][20]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[ [Owler] ][21]\nProducts\n[ Owler Pro ][22]\n[ Owler Community ][23]\n[ Owler API ][24]\n[ Owler Max ][25]\n[Chrome Extension][26]\nSolutions\n[ New - Owler AI ][27]\n[ For Prospecting ][28]\n[ For Research ][29]\n[ For Building Relationships ][30]\nResources\n[ Owler Blog ][31]\n[ Case Studies ][32]\n[Knowledge Base][33]\n[ Integrations ][34]\n[Pricing][35]\n[Login][36]\n[See All Plans][37]\n[ Contact Sales ][38]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[\nFolder: Products\n][39]\n[ Back ][40]\n[\nOwler Pro\n][41]\n[\nOwler Community\n][42]\n[\nOwler API\n][43]\n[\nOwler Max\n][44]\n[Chrome Extension][45]\n[\nFolder: Solutions\n][46]\n[ Back ][47]\n[\nNew - Owler AI\n][48]\n[\nFor Prospecting\n][49]\n[\nFor Research\n][50]\n[\nFor Building Relationships\n][51]\n[\nFolder: Resources\n][52]\n[ Back ][53]\n[\nOwler Blog\n][54]\n[\nCase Studies\n][55]\n[Knowledge Base][56]\n[\nIntegrations\n][57]\n[Pricing][58]\n[Login][59]\n[See All Plans][60]\n[ Contact Sales ][61]\n\n# **Follow companies that matter to you \u2014 and make smarter business decisions**\n\nOwler's exclusive company and industry insights make it easy to find competitors, leads, and\nup-to-date news \u2013 so you can optimize your prospecting and sales results.\n\n[ Get Started ][62]\n\n**Recently Acquired Companies**\n\n**Recently Funded Companies**\n\n### 20M+\n### Company\n### Profiles\n\n### 150M+\n### verified\n### Contacts\n\n### 45M+\n### Competitive\n### Relationships\n\n### 500K\n### Monthly\n### Contributions\n\n## For business professionals who want a serious competitive advantage\n\nOwler Pro gives you access to premium features that keep your business in the loop about relevant\ncompany, competitor, and industry news \u2013 so you can find qualified leads, improve your outreach, and\nbuild better relationships with your customers.\n\n**Follow an unlimited amount of companies relevant to your business needs**\n\n**Discover new accounts, industry trends, and more**\n\n**Get the latest news updates to stay ahead**\n\n[ Learn about Owler Pro ][63]\n\nI start my day on Owler looking for nuggets that would be worth mentioning to my target accounts.\nThey're always very insightful\n\nKodak M\nAccount Executive\n\n## For people who want an easier way to follow up to 5 companies that matter to them\n\nJoin Owler\u2019s active community of 5 million+ business professionals and get exclusive insights about\ncompetitors, prospects, and market updates that are only available to Owler users \u2013 so you can\nensure you stay ahead of the competition.\n\n**Find detailed company information**\n\n**Discover your closest competitors**\n\n**Get real-time alerts and daily emails about relevant company and market news**\n\n[ Learn about Owler Community ][64]\n\n## What makes Owler different?\n\nDiscover your direct and indirect competitors with Owler's exclusive competitor graph.\n\nSearch accurate private and public company data for over 20 million companies.\n\nCreate targeted lists to get daily, personalized emails and alerts about news and companies that\nmatter to you.\n\nAccess detailed company data, including revenue, employee count, funding history, acquisitions,\nnews, and more.\n\nFilter Owler\u2019s entire database by revenue, sector, location, employee count, and public/private\ncompany status.\n\n## Join leading brands getting better business insights with Owler\n\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy6.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy5.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy4.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy3.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy2.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy1.png]\n[trust-bar-logos@2x copy.png]\n\n## Discover the different ways Owler can help your business grow\n\n[ Get Started ][65]\n\n## Get a guided tour of Owler for your team\n\n[ Contact Sales ][66]\n\n**\u00a0Top Company Profiles on Owler**\n\n**Public **\n\n[Boeing][67]\n\n[JP Morgan Chase][68]\n\n[McDonalds][69]\n\n[Beyond Meat][70]\n\n[Gartner][71]\n\n[3M][72]\n\n[Microsoft][73]\n\n[Facebook][74]\n\n[Apple][75]\n\n[Starbucks][76]\n\n**Retail**\n\n[Amazon][77]\n\n[Walmart][78]\n\n[Lululemon][79]\n\n[Zara][80]\n\n[ASOS][81]\n\n[Macy\u2019s][82]\n\n[Etsy][83]\n\n[Primark][84]\n\n[Best Buy][85]\n\n[Home Depot][86]\n\n**Private **\n\n[Bloomberg][87]\n\n[Cargill][88]\n\n[Stripe][89]\n\n[TaskRabbit][90]\n\n[Indeed][91]\n\n[Zipcar][92]\n\n[Chick-fil-A][93]\n\n[GLG][94]\n\n[Turo][95]\n\n[McKinsey][96]\n\n**Software **\n\n[Uber][97]\n\n[Shopify][98]\n\n[Splunk][99]\n\n[ServiceNow][100]\n\n[Twilio][101]\n\n[YouTube][102]\n\n[HubSpot][103]\n\n[MuleSoft][104]\n\n[Zoom][105]\n\n[LinkedIn][106]\n\n**International**\n\n[Nestle][107]\n\n[Schneider Electric][108]\n\n[Siemens][109]\n\n[Ryanair][110]\n\n[Maersk][111]\n\n[Nintendo][112]\n\n[Marriott][113]\n\n[OYO Rooms][114]\n\n[Paytm][115]\n\n[BP][116]\n\n[**\u00a0Top Company Profiles by Industry**][117]\n\n[Pharmaceutical][118] 500\n0\n[\n0\n][1]\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n[ [Owler] ][3]\nProducts\n[ Owler Pro ][4]\n[ Owler Community ][5]\n[ Owler API ][6]\n[ Owler Max ][7]\n[Chrome Extension][8]\nSolutions\n[ New - Owler AI ][9]\n[ For Prospecting ][10]\n[ For Research ][11]\n[ For Building Relationships ][12]\nResources\n[ Owler Blog ][13]\n[ Case Studies ][14]\n[Knowledge Base][15]\n[ Integrations ][16]\n[Pricing][17]\n[Login][18]\n[See All Plans][19]\n[ Contact Sales ][20]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[ [Owler] ][21]\nProducts\n[ Owler Pro ][22]\n[ Owler Community ][23]\n[ Owler API ][24]\n[ Owler Max ][25]\n[Chrome Extension][26]\nSolution