        "crawl_text": "[[ResearchGate]][1]\n[Log in][2][Join for free][3]\n\n# Discover scientific knowledge and stay connected to the world of science\n\n[\nJoin for free\n][4]\n\n## Discover research\n\nAccess over 160 million publication pages and stay up to date with what's happening in your field.\n\n## Connect with your scientific community\n\nShare your research, collaborate with your peers, and get the support you need to advance your\ncareer.\n\n### Visit Topic Pages\n\n[Engineering][5]\n[Mathematics][6]\n[Biology][7]\n[Computer Science][8]\n[Climate Change][9]\n[Medicine][10]\n[Physics][11]\n[Social Science][12]\n[Astrophysics][13]\n[Chemistry][14]\n\n## Measure your impact\n\nGet in-depth stats on who's been reading your work and keep track of your citations.\n\n## Advance your research and join a community of 25+ million scientists\n\n[\nJoin for free\n][15]\n\n## ResearchGate Business Solutions\n\n[\n[Hire professionals]\n\n### Scientific Recruitment\n\nHire qualified researchers and build the best teams in science.\nFind out more\n][16][\n[Advertise to scientific community]\n\n### Marketing Solutions\n\nGrow your brand's impact in the scientific community with the world's leading network for\nscientists.\nFind out more\n][17]\n[About us][18]\n[News][19]\n[Careers][20]\n[Help Center][21]\n[Terms][22]\n[Privacy][23]\n[Copyright][24]\n[Imprint][25]\nConsent preferences\n[Researchers][26]\n[Q&A][27]\n[Publications][28]\n[Jobs][29]\n[Advertising][30]\n[Recruiting][31]\n\u00a9 2008-2026 ResearchGate GmbH. All rights reserved.\n**For full functionality of ResearchGate it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the [\ninstructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser][32].**\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: login?_sg=5gFFZIpm-zq9FMbrdxBbsdRxe7PMmWsxe_MoH3Q-urZNTHwNSIXmnPUBu1Zfah59uLKSpkV-HdSxex4SPXVIl\nw\n[3]: signup.SignUp.html?ev=su_chnl_index&_sg=YrKgFG8J3bYJdf3pE-6Fwbi88oT1EuMJn4VTWbHncZaG3hV0otR4h4Z\nL8DI2iaw0TjNc3otb3uxvuTumPLLt-o4\n[4]: signup.SignUp.html?ev