p into finals\n### and Maroons win Origin ][236]\n\nWith the NRL season kicking off at the end of next month, it\u2019s time to dust off the crystal Steeden\nto predict who will\u2026\n\n[\nLeague\n][237]\n[\n48\n][238]\nJan\n[ [NRL random predictions: Panthers bite back, Bellamy finally retires, Dolphins leap into finals\nand Maroons win Origin] ][239]\n[\n][240]\n[ The Roar ][241]\n[\n][242]\n[ The Roar ][243]\n\n### [ Stajcic sacked as heads roll at Wanderers over dismal start to season ][244]\n\nWestern Sydney Wanderers have reacted to the club's terrible start to the A-League season by sacking\ncoach Alen Stajcic."
